window.VERSE_DATA = {"records":[{"key":"LV:130601002","id":"130601002","collection":"LV","title":"Ūdens-māte","text":"Še atstāstu, ko man kāds 85 g. v. tēvs stāstīja — viņš to atkal dzirdējis savās jaunības dienās no veciem cilvēkiem. Kāpuru kalna ezera ziemeļa stūŗa galā reiz atradusies pirmā Jaun-Piebalgas draudzes baznīca, Mārijas baznīca. Šo baznīcu ļaudis turējuši par ļoti svētu. Tai arī bijis tāds brīnuma spēks: ja kāds solījies un taisījies nākošā svētdienā iet uz baznīcu, bet neaizgājis, tad palicis slims un ātrāk netapis vesels, kamēr izpildījis savu solījumu. Baznīcu nodedzinājuši kareivji krievu-zviedru kaŗā. Par šādu nedarbu kaŗa vīri tūlīt nosodīti: viņi visi saskrējuši ar savām kaŗa lietām ezerā: Daži lietas esot redzējuši ezera dibenā.\n\nNo tā brīža, kamēr baznīcas nav, mūsu apgabalā vairs neesot tik lielu lopu kā senāk. Tomēr ik gadus Mārijas uzņ. dienā ļaudis sapulcējušies pie Kāpuru kalna ezera. Vēl priekš 40 gadiem sanākuši ļaudis tūkstošiem, bet pēdējā laikā sapulcējušies jo gadu, jo mazāk. Taču pat vēl mūsu dienās Skrāģu krogā, kas tikai pusversti tālu no vecās sapulces vietas, sanāk Mārijas uzņ. dienas vakarā apkārtējie kaimiņi un pavada kopā to vakaru jautri. Ja vaicā, kādēļ nākot, tad atbild: \"Tas jau tēvu tēvu ieradums.\"","source":"N. O. Jaunpiebalgā. \"Balsī\", 1887., 43. LP, VII, I, 363, 2.","category":"Ūdens-māte","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-001-E01","start":602,"end":642,"span":"Daži lietas esot redzējuši ezera dibenā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ezera dibenā","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Hearsay transmission and illness without specified sensation excluded.","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.177044,"lon":26.03367,"label":"place-0165","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:130601008","id":"130601008","collection":"LV","title":"Ūdens-māte","text":"Tumšā birzī, Ilmjervas muižas robežās — Ancenes draudzē, izceļas avots, kas plūdina savus ūdeņus pa Vēandas upi tālāk. Jau senatnē ļaudis esot turējuši šo upi par svētu un neviena roka nedrīkstējusi aizkart ošus upes krastos, nedz noplūkt kādu lapiņu, ja negribēja iekaitināt dievus. Svētās upes slava bija pārgājusi no igauņiem arī uz latviešiem. Igauņi sauc šo upi par Piihajögi un latvieši par Svēto upi. Ļaudis ticēja, ka upē mājojot dievs, kas varot uzsūtīt sausu un slapju laiku, dot auglīgus un bada gadus, vai arī uzlaist ļaudim gŗūtas sērgas, kālab nedrīkstot iekaitināt šo upes garu — tas jāuzturot ar upuŗiem pie laba prāta. Ja ļaudis gribēja, lai lietus lītu, tad upes dievam ziedoja, iemezdami upē dažas dāvānas; bet ja gribēja sausu laiku, tad upi un avotu vajadzēja iztīrīt no dūņām un gružiem. Kas upmalē no svētājiem kokiem nolauza zaru, tas nomira.","source":"R. P. \"Balss\" 1884, 7. LP, VII, I, 361, 2.","category":"Ūdens-māte","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Environmental description, beliefs and prohibitions; no enacted sensory event.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:130701004","id":"130701004","collection":"LV","title":"Meža-māte","text":"Viens puisis gribējis iemācīties ermoņikas spēlēt. Sadomāja, aizgāja pie meža gara. Mežā iznāca pretim vecs vecītis. Viņš vecītim prasīja, lai iemāca ermoņikas spēlēt. Vecītis atbildēja: \"Labi. Bet tu visu mūžu nevarēsi citu darīt, kā tikai ermoņikas spēlēt.\" Pēc divām stundām, jau samācījies krietni vien spēlēt. Nu viņš gribējis no vecīša projām iet, bet vecītis viņu saucis atpakaļ. \"Ko tu man dosi par mācīšanu? Tu jau nu par divām stundām iemācījies spēlēt.\"\n\n\"Ko tu prasi?\"\n\n\"Kad es notupšos četrrāpus, tad sper man ar lielu spēku celi pakaļā!\" Vecītis notupstas četrrāpus zemē. Spēlnieks tik tikko pieduras vecītim ar celi. Par to vecītis sadusmojas: \"Es tev iemācīju tik ātri spēlēt, bet tu man nevari ne pakaļā iespert.\"\n\nNu spēlnieks spēra no visa spēka, ka vecītis uz vietas pārvērtās par akmeni. Spēlmaņa kāja tik stipri atsitās pret akmeni, ka palika stīva. Nu viņam visu mūžu bija jāstaigā apkārt ermoņikas spēlējot, jo cita darba vairs nespēja strādāt.","source":"E. Krastiņš Varenbrokā. Folkloras krātuvē.","category":"Meža-māte","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-003-E01","start":586,"end":631,"span":"Spēlnieks tik tikko pieduras vecītim ar celi.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact; felt quality unspecified; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-003-E02","start":809,"end":871,"span":"Spēlmaņa kāja tik stipri atsitās pret akmeni, ka palika stīva.","modalities":["touch","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Impact and stiffness; pain not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Mežā","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.415,"lon":25.546918,"label":"place-0515","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:130801007","id":"130801007","collection":"LV","title":"Baltā mātīte","text":"Reiz vecā Eķeline nesusi savam vīram pļavā pusdienu. Viņa gājusi pāri Mežamuižas tiltam. Pārgājusi pāri tiltam, viņa redzējusi, ka tieva, gaŗa, balta sieva iet un lec viņai pa priekšu. Eķeline dikti nobijusies, bet kad paskatījusies uz priekšu, tad sievas vairs nebijis.","source":"Skolnieks Andrejs Ritenis no 50 g. v. Annas Drulles Nīcā.","category":"Baltā mātīte","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-004-E01","start":112,"end":184,"span":"viņa redzējusi, ka tieva, gaŗa, balta sieva iet un lec viņai pa priekšu.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-004-E02","start":215,"end":270,"span":"kad paskatījusies uz priekšu, tad sievas vairs nebijis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"tad sievas vairs nebijis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Disappearance at a renewed look; supernatural identity not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Mežamuižas tiltam","environment":"bridge","time":"","movement":"Viņa gājusi pāri Mežamuižas tiltam."},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"Once old Eķeline was carrying dinner to her husband in the meadow. She was walking across the Mežamuiža bridge. Having crossed over the bridge, she saw that a slender, tall, white woman was walking and leaping ahead of her. Eķeline was terribly frightened, but when she looked ahead, the woman was no longer there.","translationNotes":["Kept the literal description 'balta sieva' distinct from speculative interpretations."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.346498,"lon":21.065493,"label":"place-0318","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"LV-004-E01","start":144,"end":223,"span":"she saw that a slender, tall, white woman was walking and leaping ahead of her.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"viņa redzējusi, ka tieva, gaŗa, balta sieva iet un lec viņai pa priekšu.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-004-E02","start":261,"end":314,"span":"when she looked ahead, the woman was no longer there.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"tad sievas vairs nebijis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Disappearance at a renewed look; supernatural identity not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"kad paskatījusies uz priekšu, tad sievas vairs nebijis.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"LV:130901001","id":"130901001","collection":"LV","title":"Uguns-māte","text":"Ļaudis teiksmo, ka naudižnieku Skaparu mežsarga mežā vietu vietām esot ugunsceļi. Pēc saules norietēšanas varot zināt, kur tāds ceļš atrodoties, jo tad tajā vietā karsta versme nākot pretim. Uguns ceļš arī atrodoties pie Naudižnieku Dēļu ezera. Uz ugunsceļa cilvēks nevarot ne gulēt, nedz ēku celt. Pie Maz-Braņķu rijas arī esot ugunsceļš: tur, nezin, cik gadu atpakaļ cēluši jaunu riju. Vecs ubags, gaŗām iedams, teicis uz strādniekiem: \"Velti jūsu pūles! šī vietiņa pieder Uguns māmiņai!\" Un tā arī bijis: tikko pirmo seru iesēruši un krāsni aizkūruši, te rija uz reizi viscauri sākusi degt un nodegusi līdz pamatam.\n\nMūsu veči tic vēl tagad, ka ugunsceļā nevarot celt ēkas, jo tur tās nodegot; arī gulēt tur nevarot pieguļā, jo tad cilvēku samocot un samaitājot.","source":"Naudižnieks Naudītē, \"Balsī\", 1888. g. nr. 40. LP, VII, I, 333, 12.","category":"Uguns-māte","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-005-E01","start":145,"end":190,"span":"jo tad tajā vietā karsta versme nākot pretim.","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic reported experience.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Skaparu mežsarga mežā","environment":"forest","time":"Pēc saules norietēšanas","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.534635,"lon":23.195994,"label":"place-0311","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001002","id":"131001002","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"13. maijā 1836. g. es uzņēmu Ērģemes draudzē krusta kaŗu pret \"mājas kungiem\". Citā mājā mums saimnieks bija akmenim līdzīgi jāapstrādā: vecais grēcinieks liedzās un liedzās, kamēr pēdīgi pēc ilgas pārrunas mūs veda gan pie ziedojamās vietas dārzā. Še atradās dievekļa mājoklis ne vis koka mājā, bet zem akmeņiem. Kad bijām akmeņus ar bomjiem uzcēluši, tad no zemes nāca riebīga smaka ārā — smaka no sapuvušām olām, gaļas gabaliem u. t. pr., kas še ar laiku bija saradušies; sarkanas vilnas dzija, veci un jauni naudas gabali arī bija šeitan mājas kungiem pasniegtas dāvanas.","source":"P. Karlbloms Ērģemē, \"Inland\" nr. 39, 1836. g. Skat. Zariņu Kārļa Rakstu kr. LP, VII, I, 359, 19.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-006-E01","start":353,"end":440,"span":"tad no zemes nāca riebīga smaka ārā — smaka no sapuvušām olām, gaļas gabaliem u. t. pr.","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ziedojamās vietas dārzā","environment":"garden","time":"13. maijā 1836. g.","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["smell"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.807376,"lon":25.821953,"label":"place-0582","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001024","id":"131001024","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"Mežmalā bīš vienc tāds akminc, pie kura agrāki veci cilvēki nēsāši ziedus. Reiz nu gani ēduši uz akmina, svieduši kaulus un grimzas zemē un sācīši, ka šie pēc gada akal nākšot pie akmina ēst. Bet otru gadu vis gani vais nenākuši pie akmina un nu šiem bīsi tāda sprunga, ka vais nekur dēties, šos dīda un krata tikmē, kamē dabūši tādu cilvēku, kas mācēš palaist vaļā.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 76 g. v. J. Ābeles Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-007-E01","start":243,"end":366,"span":"nu šiem bīsi tāda sprunga, ka vais nekur dēties, šos dīda un krata tikmē, kamē dabūši tādu cilvēku, kas mācēš palaist vaļā.","modalities":["bodily sensation","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Dialect sprunga needs review; involuntary shaking explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001042","id":"131001042","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"Pie Katriņas Danderu mājas atrodas sirms ozols. Daudzina, ka šās mājas vecie iedzīvotāji katru svētku priekšvakarā, pirms paši ko baudījuši, nonesuši pie ozola dieviem ēdienus un dzērienus, lai tie spirdzinātos un ziedotājiem piedotu grēkus. Vēlākie ienācēji, gribējuši šo koku iznīcināt, bet tas neesot izdevies, jo strādnieki, kam koks bijis jāgāž, nolauzuši pieci cirvjus, vienu zāģi un tomēr tālāk nelikuši, kā līdz gremzdiem. Nu noskārtuši, ka koks svēts un neaiztiekams. Tā ozols uzturējies un zaļo līdz šai baltai dienai.","source":"Ērgļu dr. Katriņā. Balss, 1887. g. nr. 6. LP, VII, I, 338, 1.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Tree description and tool breakage do not specify perception.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.973497,"lon":25.554829,"label":"place-0195","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001071","id":"131001071","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"Vijciema pagasta Skripstu mājas tūlumā bijusi agrāk liela liepa, ko saukuši par Upuru liepu un pie kuras veci ļaudis ziedus nesuši.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenes pag.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.451421,"lon":25.864327,"label":"place-0442","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001072","id":"131001072","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"Pie Kalnadzirkaļa rijas bīsi veca liepa un tur ar Dievīnam nesuši ziedus. Reiz uznācis pērkonc un liepu nospēris un tā pati turpat uz vietas sadegusi. Ka pērkonc to liepu nospēris, visi sacīši, ka pērkonc jau tādus vecus pesteļus neuzsliecoties.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 84 g. v. Jāņa Liepiņa Bilskas pag.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Lightning strike narrated; hearing thunder not independently stated.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001075","id":"131001075","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"Rindas pilī zviedru kaŗam nākot, esot sakŗautas visas dārgas mantas: nauda, zelta, sudraba lietas — lielā šķirstā un šķirsts nogremdēts Zvinguļa upes dzelmē, pie tā ceļa, kas no Egļu mājām uz Ventspili ved, pa labai rokai. Pēc tam ļaudis paši gājuši pie svētās liepas dievus lūgt, lai atgrieztu ienaidnieku. (Šī liepa atradusies pa kreisi roki netāli no tā ceļa, kas uz Virpi ved. Stāsta arī, ka liepa vēl tagad zaļojot. Arī manam tēvam šī liepa esot reiz rādīta.) Lūguši ilgi un ļoti sirsnīgi dievus un metuši zarus upē. Zari peldējuši pret straumi. No tam ļaudis vērojuši, ka lūgums paklausīts. (Pie liepas arī jaunākā laikā atrasti dažādi ziedojumi: prievietes un kas nekas cits vēl.) Bet zviedri tomēr Rindas pili nopostījuši un vēl nākuši taisni uz to vietu šurp, kur šķirsts gremdēts. Atnākuši līdz Asins valkam, bet tad notikuši brīnumi: visi zviedri piepēši apstulbuši un tādēļ griezušies atpakaļ.","source":"K. Bankers no sava 55 g. v. tēva Dundagas Cepellejās. LP, VII, I, 349, 1.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-011-E01","start":845,"end":905,"span":"visi zviedri piepēši apstulbuši un tādēļ griezušies atpakaļ.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disorientation or astonishment","evidence":"piepēši apstulbuši","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Apstulbt may mean become dazed or bewildered; do not infer literal blindness; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Asins valkam","environment":"watercourse","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.507633,"lon":22.351967,"label":"place-0103","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131001110","id":"131001110","collection":"LV","title":"Mājas-kungs","text":"Vijciema Lielskripstam liepā bijis Cēlis, kuŗu viņš tur baŗojis. To dabūjis zināt Trikātas mācītājs Zirnis, atbraucis uz Skripstu, ņēmis pirmais cirvi rokā un pavēlējis liepu nocirst.","source":"K. Jansons Plāņos.","category":"Mājas-kungs","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.53774,"lon":25.865279,"label":"place-0353","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131101003","id":"131101003","collection":"LV","title":"Vilce","text":"Agrāk viens saimnieks Rīgā nopircis vilci. Vilces pārdevējs saimniekam piekodinājis, ka tam jāsakot uz savu sievu, kad mājā pārbraukšot: \"Velns tavā sirdī, velns manā sirdī.\" Tad vilce naudu nesīšot.\n\nKad saimnieks braucis uz māju, tad visādi pārdomājis. Beidzot nospriedis ar velnu nesatīties un nometis vilci pie kārklu krūma ganību malā.\n\nPēc kādām dienām saimnieks gājis gar kārklu krūmu un ieraudzījis pie tā veselu kaudzi naudas. Saimnieks naudu salasījis un aiznesis uz māju. Bet otrā rītā, agri vien, vilce bijusi klāt un aiz durvim prasījusi: \"Kur nu bērs?\"\n\nNo tās dienas vilce saimniekam sākusi naudu nest. Tad vilce saimniekam teikusi, lai viņai nes ēst to, ko mājā pirmo reiz vāra, un viņa tagad dzīvošot staļļa jumta galā. Bet saimnieks reti kad vilcei ko aiznesis. Viņa atkal teikusi: \"Tu mani nebaro!\"\n\nSaimnieks negriezis vērību uz vilces izteicienu. Viņš tai nenesis ēdienu. Vienu nakti vilce nodedzinājusi visu māju.","source":"H. Skujiņa Aumeisteŗu pag.","category":"Vilce","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-013-E01","start":395,"end":435,"span":"ieraudzījis pie tā veselu kaudzi naudas.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pie kārklu krūma","environment":"scrub","time":"Pēc kādām dienām","movement":"saimnieks gājis gar kārklu krūmu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0032","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131101012","id":"131101012","collection":"LV","title":"Vilce","text":"Ka vilce ir pilla, ta viņa skrien pavisam zemu un izskatās pavisam tāda zilgana, bet ka ir tukša, ta skrien augstu un ta ir pavisam sarkana, un matā kā uguns.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 93 g. v. Līzes Balodes Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Vilce","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-014-E01","start":0,"end":79,"span":"Ka vilce ir pilla, ta viņa skrien pavisam zemu un izskatās pavisam tāda zilgana","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic appearance; no identified observer; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-014-E02","start":81,"end":158,"span":"bet ka ir tukša, ta skrien augstu un ta ir pavisam sarkana, un matā kā uguns.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic contrasted appearance; dialect matā retained; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131101023","id":"131101023","collection":"LV","title":"Vilce","text":"Reiz pār tīrumu skrējusi vilce. Viens vecis zinājis vārdus un tas vilci apturējis. Viņš izbēris no vilces divi pūri pupu un tad palaidis tukšā, lai skrien projām.","source":"H. Skujiņa Aumeisteŗu pag.","category":"Vilce","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Movement and handling are narrated; sensory perception not specified.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0032","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131201001","id":"131201001","collection":"LV","title":"Gausu māte","text":"Viena saimniece cepa baltmaizi vienā sviestā un kreimā, bet saime tikai maz no viņas varējusi ēst, jo tā bija ļoti sātīga. Saimniece arvienu prata maizi tā izcept, ka saime to neredzēja. Reiz puisis ielīdis saimnieces cepamā istabā un, kur nebūt paslēpies, redz, ko saimniece maizei dara. Saimniece izvilkusi maizi no krāsns, nolika to uz grīdu un sauca: \"Gaus' māmiņa, Gaus' māmiņa! apgaus' manu baltmaizīti!\" Te izlīda liels krupis no grīdas apakšas, pārrāpos pār visiem kukulīšiem un ielīda atkal pagrīdē. To redzēdams, puisis zobus vien griež un, tikko saimniece bija izgājusi, tad uzplēš grīdu un nosit krupi. Otrreiz saimniece, maizi izcepusi, sauca atkal savu Gaus' māmiņu, bet velns no aizkrāsnes atbildēja \"Gaus' māmiņa jau sen auksta.\" No tās reizes maize bija arvienu laba.","source":"Jēkabs Kalniņš Ozolniekos pie Jelgavas. Jkr. 1896, V, 148, 19, LP, VII, I, 321, 4.","category":"Gausu māte","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-016-E01","start":60,"end":122,"span":"saime tikai maz no viņas varējusi ēst, jo tā bija ļoti sātīga.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Satiety attributed to bread; collective experiencer; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-016-E02","start":123,"end":186,"span":"Saimniece arvienu prata maizi tā izcept, ka saime to neredzēja.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic non-seeing; absence does not alone establish uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-016-E03","start":236,"end":288,"span":"kur nebūt paslēpies, redz, ko saimniece maizei dara.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"cepamā istabā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.688534,"lon":23.777469,"label":"place-0336","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131201008","id":"131201008","collection":"LV","title":"Gausu māte","text":"Viena saimniece reiz taisījusies maizi cept. Viņa iznesusi sataisītos kukulīšus namā, krāsnī laist, un saukusi: \"Gariņ, nāc, gariņ, nāc! Apsvētī manas karašiņas!\" Līdz kā to izteikusi, tūliņ no pagrīdes izlīdis liels, raibs krupis un vilcies maizei pāri. Pēc brītiņa ienākusi meita vēl ar maizes kukulīšiem. Viņa ieraudzījusi krupi uz maizes un nogrūdusi to zemē. Par to saimniece tā sadusmojusies, ka padzinusi meitu no mājas.","source":"Skolnieks Jānis Eglītis 1921. g., Jaungulbenē.","category":"Gausu māte","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-017-E01","start":308,"end":363,"span":"Viņa ieraudzījusi krupi uz maizes un nogrūdusi to zemē.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"namā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.063187,"lon":26.597362,"label":"place-0159","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131301005","id":"131301005","collection":"LV","title":"Rūķīši","text":"Reiz vienam saimniekam katru nakti zirgi vesti no staļļa ārā un nostrādāti gluži slapji. Gribējis zināt, kas to dara, un gājis sargāt. Labi. Kā nākusi pusnakts, pienācis pilns stallis mazu cilvēciņu, veduši zirgus 1aukā, sajūguši arklos un sākuši itin visi pagalmā art. Saimnieks nedrīkstējis nekā darīt: bijis bail, ko ar tik daudziem iesākšot. Tad nu aruši, aruši mazie cilvēciņi, izplēsdami visu pagalmu. Beidzot ieveduši slapji noartos zirgus stallī atpakaļ un paši turpat izputējuši. Rītā saimnieks redzētos brīnumus izstāstījis citiem. Tad viens cilvēks pamācījis, lai aizsitot staļļa durvim pulka mazu krustiņu priekšā, tad cilvēciņi nenākšot vairs ne lūdzami. Darījis arī tā un patiesi zirgus vairs neviens pats nenostrādinājis.","source":"Jēkabs Egle un Kanaviņš Gulbenē. Rīg. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VII, I, 1155, 2.","category":"Rūķīši","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-018-E01","start":141,"end":269,"span":"Kā nākusi pusnakts, pienācis pilns stallis mazu cilvēciņu, veduši zirgus 1aukā, sajūguši arklos un sākuši itin visi pagalmā art.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Retrospectively licensed by redzētos brīnumus; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-018-E02","start":408,"end":488,"span":"Beidzot ieveduši slapji noartos zirgus stallī atpakaļ un paši turpat izputējuši.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"paši turpat izputējuši","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Observation licensed retrospectively; apparent vanishing versus narrated departure uncertain; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pagalmā","environment":"farmstead","time":"pusnakts","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.171482,"lon":26.752254,"label":"place-0142","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131301010","id":"131301010","collection":"LV","title":"Rūķīši","text":"Viens saimnieks cēlis jaunu stalli un nav varējis tai gadā pabeigt: — grīda trūkusi, kas nekas. Un tur tai vecajā stallī no sen dienām mituši pagrīdē vai citur mazie vīriņi un tad zirgi bijuši treknu treknie; bet tagad pavisam miesā bijuši iznīkuši. Saimnieks nevarējis saprast, kāpēc.\n\nTe vienu dienu pie saimnieka ienāk mazais vīriņš, sacīdams: \"Noplēs vienai vistai spārnu, tad nākamu nakti ieliksim stallī grīdu — pabeigsim un zirgi baŗosies tāpat kā agrāk; bet tagad mums nāk sutrais virsū — vai tā var būt?\"\n\nLabi, saimnieks nokāvis cāli staļļa priekšu un vakarā gājis gulēt pus ticēdams, pus neticēdams. Bet — kas ir — rītā skatīsies: grīda patiesi ielikta.\n\nNo tā laika zirgi baŗojušies acim redzot.","source":"J. Bergmanis Dobeles apg. A. Bīlenšteina kr. LP, VI, 132, 7, 6.","category":"Rūķīši","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-019-E01","start":626,"end":664,"span":"rītā skatīsies: grīda patiesi ielikta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier doubt concerns a promise, not this perception.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"stallī","environment":"stable","time":"rītā","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.673622,"lon":23.25593,"label":"place-0094","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131401008","id":"131401008","collection":"LV","title":"Svētās meitas","text":"Reiz puisis noskatījies, ka vecenīte iebāzusi kāda bērna krekliņā gružus, nolikusi guļā un pajēmusi sievas kuslo bērniņu sev līdz. Ienākusi māte, bet iemainītais bērniņš tik bļaujot un bļaujot. Pēdīgi puisis teicis, lai iedodot šito bērniņu viņam. Pajēmis un gribējis krekliņu izkratīt uz uguni. Te pienākusi tā pati vecenīte un atdevusi labo bērniņu atpakaļ.","source":"K. Pētersons Raņķos. Jkr. 1901, VI, 34. LP, VII, I, 163, 17.","category":"Svētās meitas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-020-E01","start":0,"end":130,"span":"Reiz puisis noskatījies, ka vecenīte iebāzusi kāda bērna krekliņā gružus, nolikusi guļā un pajēmusi sievas kuslo bērniņu sev līdz.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-020-E02","start":150,"end":193,"span":"iemainītais bērniņš tik bļaujot un bļaujot.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sound production explicit; listener not separately named; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.780835,"lon":21.993553,"label":"place-0377","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131401014","id":"131401014","collection":"LV","title":"Svētās meitas","text":"Viena māte iemīto nīkuļa bērnu ņēmusi trīs piektvakarus krietni velējusi. Te atskrējusi svētā meita un atdevusi pajemto bērniņu atpakaļ, teikdama: \"Es tavu bērniņu tik mīļi turu, bet tu manu tā velē!\" Iemītais bērns jāpeŗot trīs piektvakarus uz istabas sliekšņa, tad svētā meita atnesot pajemto atpakaļ. Vecajai Madei L. mājās bijis tāds iemīts bērns: galva kā piena spannis, resnām lūpām, platām acim. Tāds bērns esot arī K. saimnieces meita, kas izskatoties gluži vecīga — tāda dzīslaina, krokaina — lai gan tai neesot vairāk par 20 gadiem.","source":"K. Pētersons. Jkr. 1901, VI, 34. LP, VII, I, 162, 13.","category":"Svētās meitas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-021-E01","start":444,"end":499,"span":"kas izskatoties gluži vecīga — tāda dzīslaina, krokaina","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Appearance statement; observer unspecified; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:131501001","id":"131501001","collection":"LV","title":"Laima","text":"Laimes, kā veci ļaudis stāsta, esot trīs. Pirmā laime vēlot cilvēkam tikai to labāko, otra labu un trešā tikai sliktu, un ko šās laimes sakot, tas uz mata notiekot. Vecos laikos, kad vēl dievi pa zemes virsu staigājuši, varējis ikkatrs, kuŗš tikai gribējis, zināt savu vai arī cita likteni, tik vajadzējis noklausīties, ko dievi savā starpā runājuši.","source":"Celmiņu Kārlis Lubānas Nagliņos. M. Celmiņa kr.","category":"Laima","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-022-E01","start":291,"end":350,"span":"tik vajadzējis noklausīties, ko dievi savā starpā runājuši.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic conditional listening rather than singular event.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"Vecos laikos","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899927,"lon":26.719879,"label":"place-0266","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131501010","id":"131501010","collection":"LV","title":"Laima","text":"Vienai meitiņai dzimstot Laima nolēmusi ilgu, pagrūtu mūžu un vecuma galā pie tīnes osas pakārties. Tā arī bijis: sasniegusi lielu lielu vecumu, bet cauru mūžu nekādas prieka dienas nebija piedzīvojusi. Reiz sirmā žēlojusies Dievam: kādēļ viņai tāds mūžs? Dievs atteicis: \"Nevaru palīdzēt, prasi Laimai!\" Nogājusi pie Laimas, Laima atbildējusi: \"Kas lemts, tas lemts!\" Ne ilgi pēc tam vecenīte gājusi klētī; te aizķēries diegu gabals (tītavās netīts gabals) aiz tīnes osas un šī nespēkā tur mudžinājusies, mudžinājusies, kamēr samudžinājusies pavisam un pakārusies.","source":"K. Blaus Ērgļos. LP, V, 82, 17, 2.","category":"Laima","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Weakness and entanglement narrated without an explicit sensory quality; ordinary dialogue excluded.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899228,"lon":25.640242,"label":"place-0581","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131601014","id":"131601014","collection":"LV","title":"Ūsiņš","text":"Kad pavasarī pirmo reizi laida zirgus jeb arī lopus laukā, tad paklāja sarkanu drānu kūts padurē, lai ļaunums nepiesitas. Kad zirgi jeb arī lopi no kūts izlaisti, tad nes vistas olu trīsreiz ap zirgu, lopu pūli riņķī un atslēgas arī. Pēc tam olu ņem atslēgām 3 reiz apkārt un atdod tik olu, tik atslēgas ganam. Gans olu paglabā visu dienu kārklu krūmā, atslēgas visu dienu nēsā līdz. Vakarā olu un atslēgas noliek uz galda. Ola dara to labumu, ka tad zirgi, lopi ir apaļi kā ola, un atslēgas to labumu, ka zirgi, lopi ganībās neklīst. Nu vakarā ēda maltīti. Kamēr ēda, uzsēja zirgiem galvas pie mieta tik augstu, cik vien varēja, lai zirgi būtu stalti un galvu nēsātu augstu. Kad gani vakarā mājā pārnāca, tos aplēja ar ūdeni, lai ganos nesnaustu. Ja gani izsargājās no aplējuma, tad pie galda atkal tos aplēja ar ūdeni. Tādu liešanos sauca par rumelēšanos.","source":"J. Kalniņš Garkalnē. Brīvzemnieka kr. LP, VII, I, 318, 17.","category":"Ūsiņš","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-024-E01","start":676,"end":747,"span":"Kad gani vakarā mājā pārnāca, tos aplēja ar ūdeni, lai ganos nesnaustu.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit bodily contact; sensation not described; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-024-E02","start":748,"end":820,"span":"Ja gani izsargājās no aplējuma, tad pie galda atkal tos aplēja ar ūdeni.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Conditional repeated contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"mājā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"vakarā","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.045849,"lon":24.418654,"label":"place-0123","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131601020","id":"131601020","collection":"LV","title":"Ūsiņš","text":"Reiz gadījies tā. Vienam saimniekam tai pašā svētdienā iegadījušās bēres un kāzas. Viņam nomirusi māsa. Bet nu izcēlusies ķilda — saimnieks negribējis iet savu māsu pavadīt, ne arī ļāvis no bēŗu cepuma Ūsiņam ziedot. Galu galā saimnieks tad braucis uz kāzām ar jaunāko ķēvi un saimniece uz bērēm ar vecāko ķēvi. Tomēr bērinieki ar kāziniekiem ceļā sastapušies un abas ķēves sazviegušas. Tiklīdz sazviegušās, bērinieki tūdaļ teikuši: \"Labi nebūs!\" Jā, patiesi: otrā dienā ķēve palikusi vāja un nosprāgusi; bet pats saimnieks apkrauts augoņiem — pusgadu savārdzis.","source":"J. Balodis Lizuma Gūžīlu m. LP, VII, I, 353, 6.","category":"Ūsiņš","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-025-E01","start":363,"end":386,"span":"abas ķēves sazviegušas.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Animal sound explicit; audience linked by immediate reaction.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ceļā","environment":"road","time":"tai pašā svētdienā","movement":"bērinieki ar kāziniekiem ceļā sastapušies"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.188033,"lon":26.370253,"label":"place-0262","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131701003","id":"131701003","collection":"LV","title":"Govu-Māŗa","text":"Pa ziemas svētkiem nesa uz kūtim un staļļiem divi veģus. Ziemas svētku vakarā arī apklāja galdu, nolika maizi, sviestu, alu, brandvīnu, aizdedzināja sveci un pameta cauru nakti tā. Svētku rītā sagrieza šo maizi smalki, aplēja ar to alu, kas pa nakti uz galda stāvējis, un tad atdeva zirgiem apēst. Cūkām turpretim deva apēst čamaragu (Nieswurzel) ar miežiem sajauktu. Bez tam purināja ābeles, lai āboli augtu, un vārīja pupas un zirņus, lai pulka to būtu.","source":"Ētmanis Kazdangā. Brīvzemnieka kr. LP, VII, I, 304, 1.","category":"Govu-Māra","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.732629,"lon":21.732806,"label":"place-0200","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131801002","id":"131801002","collection":"LV","title":"Jumis","text":"Pļaušanas laikā daudzreiz gadījies tā, ka Jumis bīš tīrumā. Šis nu bēdzis no pļāvējiem un tikmēr bēdzis, kamē vais nebīš nekur ko bēgt un tā nu pēdīgā kopīnā ar Jumis ieslēpies. To pēdīgo kopīnu nu ar visu Jumi nesuši istabā un aizsprauduši aiz vārceles. Ka nu tāda kopīna ar visu Jumi bīsi istabā, ta saimniekam nākusi laime pa logim un pa durim iekšā.","source":"H. Skujiņa no P. Āboltiņas Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Jumis","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131901021","id":"131901021","collection":"LV","title":"Slimības","text":"Viens drudža slimnieks noredzējis sapnī, lai viņš izģērbjoties pliks un izlienot caur ūdeni upei pa dibenu uz otru krastu, tad drudzis to atstāšot. Šis nu paņēmis citas drēbes, pārsviedis upes otrā krastā, izlīdis caur ūdeni un otrā pusē apģērbies. Pie atstātām drēbēm nu piegājis kāds smalks kungs un sacījis: \"Tagad man pats labais sējas laiks, bet zirga vairs nav, āda vien palikusi.\"","source":"J. Rubenis Ērgļos.","category":"Slimības","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-028-E01","start":0,"end":147,"span":"Viens drudža slimnieks noredzējis sapnī, lai viņš izģērbjoties pliks un izlienot caur ūdeni upei pa dibenu uz otru krastu, tad drudzis to atstāšot.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Dream instruction; modality unspecified; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-028-E02","start":206,"end":224,"span":"izlīdis caur ūdeni","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Water contact explicit; felt quality unstated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"upei pa dibenu","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","other"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899228,"lon":25.640242,"label":"place-0581","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:131901023","id":"131901023","collection":"LV","title":"Slimības","text":"Reiz drudža kungs ieraudzījis vīru bullītī, bridis šim pakaļ. Iebridis līdz smakram, tālāk nevarējis, bijis dziļš. Nu skatījies, skatījies tādu brītiņu, te otrpus ezera ganu meita pašu laiku iedziedājusies. Tūliņ drudzis bridis no ezera ārā, teikdams: \"Parauj piķis zirgu, iešu pie ķēves — gan tā arī būs laba.\"\n\nVīrs redzējis: drudzis aiziet — ko vairs nu gaidīt — braucis ar bullīti malā. Kā izbraucis — drudzis klāt un nu kratījis vēl negantāki kā agrāk. Neko darīt; vēl vienas zāles zinājis. Aizgājis uz krogu un licis saliet deviņādas šņabus kopā. Kā to tad iedzēris — drudzis nogājis.","source":"Audzis Jērkules un Lodes apk. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VI, 149, 10, 4.","category":"Slimības","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-029-E01","start":5,"end":42,"span":"drudža kungs ieraudzījis vīru bullītī","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer explicitly drudža kungs; nonhuman narrative agent.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-029-E02","start":115,"end":151,"span":"Nu skatījies, skatījies tādu brītiņu","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-029-E03","start":156,"end":206,"span":"otrpus ezera ganu meita pašu laiku iedziedājusies.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-029-E04","start":313,"end":342,"span":"Vīrs redzējis: drudzis aiziet","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-029-E05","start":422,"end":457,"span":"nu kratījis vēl negantāki kā agrāk.","modalities":["bodily sensation","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ezera","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:131901030","id":"131901030","collection":"LV","title":"Slimības","text":"Pavasarī kungam bija nosprādzis zirgs un puiši to bija aizveduši uz Kaļķu kalnu, izgāzuši lapsām. Saimniece aizbraukusi reiz uz Benkāciešiem rados un, mājā pārbraukusi, ņēmusies stāstīt, ka drudzis atstājoties it drīzi, ja kaut ko riebīgu darot, vai arī ēdot jeb dzeŗot ko riebīgu iekšā. Tāpat stāstījusi, ka tur kāds puisis, gulēdams maitas vēderā, aizdzinis drudzi. Mājas kalps, drudža mocīts, ilgāki neapdomādamies — uz Kaļķu kalnu prom, kunga Bešķa vēderā iekšā un tur starp ribām paslēpies. Te uz reizi šis, skaidri nomodā būdams, redz, ka pie viņa pienāk kāds kungs ar spieķīti rokā un pat reizi šim it stipri iesit pa dibenu; bet ne viņš, ne arī kungs ko runājis. Pēdīgi, kad kungs aizgājis, drudzis ņēmies šo it stipri kratīt, ka vai visas Bešķa ribas klaudzējušas. Tomēr šim gulēšana neko nav līdzējusi — drudzis kratījis to vēl skaudīgāki.","source":"J. Kriķis Startos. Etn. III, 1893. LP, VII, I, 1251, 1.","category":"Slimības","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-030-E01","start":508,"end":631,"span":"šis, skaidri nomodā būdams, redz, ka pie viņa pienāk kāds kungs ar spieķīti rokā un pat reizi šim it stipri iesit pa dibenu","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit waking state retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-030-E02","start":699,"end":773,"span":"drudzis ņēmies šo it stipri kratīt, ka vai visas Bešķa ribas klaudzējušas.","modalities":["bodily sensation","movement sensation","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Acoustic comparison ka vai is qualified; secondary auditory medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uz Kaļķu kalnu","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.409967,"lon":25.524702,"label":"place-0446","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132001003","id":"132001003","collection":"LV","title":"Nāve","text":"Viens lauku skolotājs novērojis, ka nakti viņa dārzā vienā ābelē šūpojas tumši ģērbusies sieviete. To viņš redzējis vairāk reizes un sācis par to baidīties. Viņš nu licis kādu dienu diviem skolniekiem to ābeli nozāģēt. Skolnieki gan nozāģējuši ābeli, bet pēc tam abi nomiruši. Nu skolotājs sapratis, ka melni ģērbusies sieviete bijusi pati Nāve.","source":"P. Šmits no P. Zeltiņas Rīgā.","category":"Nāve","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-031-E01","start":0,"end":98,"span":"Viens lauku skolotājs novērojis, ka nakti viņa dārzā vienā ābelē šūpojas tumši ģērbusies sieviete.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated observation explicitly stated in next sentence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"viņa dārzā","environment":"garden","time":"nakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.949649,"lon":24.105186,"label":"place-0403","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132101030","id":"132101030","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķa iegūšana un darbība","text":"Saimnieks braucis uz Rīgu pēc pūķa. Viņš iegājis pie pūķu pārdevēja. Tas prasījis, kā vajagot. \"Nu tā paša sūda pūķa!\" Rīgas kungs saimniekam iedevis mazu kastīti un piekodinājis, lai pa ceļu vaļā netaisa un mājā aizbraucis uz sievu lai sakot: \"Velns tavā sirdī, velns manā sirdī!\" — tad pūķis naudu nesīšot.\n\nSaimnieks visu ceļu uz māju domājis, kā lai dara. Beidzot viņš nospriedis ar velnu nesasieties. Kad viņš ticis mājā, tad uz savu sievu sacījis: \"Velns tavā pakaļā, velns manā pakaļā!\"\n\nKad saimnieks attaisījis kastīti, tad tajā bijis zirga pinekļa gals. Saimnieks domājis, ka Rīgas kungi to piešmaukuši, un pinekla galu izmetis aiz durvim. Kad saimnieks otrā rītā uzcēlies un gājis zirgus baŗot, tad nevarējis pa sūdiem vien pabrist. Istabas priekša bijusi sūdu pilna. Tas bijis pūķa darbs.","source":"H. Skujiņa Aumeisteŗu pag.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-032-E01","start":710,"end":743,"span":"nevarējis pa sūdiem vien pabrist.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Bodily obstruction explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Istabas priekša","environment":"farmstead","time":"otrā rītā","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0032","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132101043","id":"132101043","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķa iegūšana un darbība","text":"Viens saimnieks Rīgā iebraucis, iegājis tai bodē, kur pūķus pārdod, un prasījis naudas pūķi. Bodnieks viņam iedevis papīra vīkstolu sacīdams, ka tur jau esot ietīts. Zemnieks vajadzīgo naudu nodevis, braucis priecīgs uz māju. Uz ceļa būdams, viņš paņēmis paciņu un gribējis jauno pūķi apskatīt. Bet paciņu vaļā attaisījis, ieraudzījis tik zirga sūdus. Par tādu piemānīšanu apskaities, viņš visu vīkstolu iesviedis mežā. Otrā gadā, tam pašam mežam gaŗām braucot, saimnieks iedomājis pērno notikumu un gājis skatīties, vai vēl vīkstols būs tai pašā vietā. Meklējamo gan vairs nav atradis, bet gan labu blāķīti naudas, ko pūķis bija savilcis, bet pūķa vairs nevarējis dabūt, lai gan rūpīgi pēc tā skatījies. Saimnieks gan naudu paņēmis, bet tomēr nebijis vis tik priecīgs, tādēļ ka paša pūķa nevarējis dabūt.","source":"Grāvendāliešos. Drachen-Mythus, 19, 25. LP, VI, 72, 29.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-033-E01","start":299,"end":351,"span":"paciņu vaļā attaisījis, ieraudzījis tik zirga sūdus.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-033-E02","start":500,"end":614,"span":"gājis skatīties, vai vēl vīkstols būs tai pašā vietā. Meklējamo gan vairs nav atradis, bet gan labu blāķīti naudas","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second event in forest, Otrā gadā; spatial context differs from first.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-033-E03","start":644,"end":704,"span":"pūķa vairs nevarējis dabūt, lai gan rūpīgi pēc tā skatījies.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed visual search","evidence":"pūķa vairs nevarējis dabūt, lai gan rūpīgi pēc tā skatījies","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Failure to locate; forest, following year.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Uz ceļa","environment":"road","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.485706,"lon":24.034977,"label":"place-0140","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132101062","id":"132101062","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķa iegūšana un darbība","text":"Viens saimnieks tikām, tikām līdzis Rīgā vienu pūķi, kamēr par lielu naudu salīdzis. Nu pārdevējs viņam pūķi iedod un saka: \"Pielūko, ka pārbrauc mājā ne ar vienu ne vārdiņa nerunājis; bet uz savu saimnieci vispirms saki, ja rīta laikā satieci: \"Labrīt! sieva — velns tavā sirdī!\" ja vakarā: \"Labvakar! sieva — velns tavā sirdī!\"\n\nNu viņš pārbrauc ar pūķi mājā un domā: \"Kā lai tik briesmīgus vārdus uz savu sievu teikšu?\" Viņam palika žēl sievas. \"Ne,\" viņš nodomāja, \"labāk teikšu: labrīt! jeb labvakar! sieva — Dievs tavā sirdī.\"\n\nLabi. Bet tikko bija izteicis tos vārdus — pūķis pazuda aizbēdzis. Ko nu darīt? Lielu naudu aizmaksājis — pūķa nav.\n\nNu braucis atkal uz Rīgu un sūdzējies pie pārdevēja: \"Kam tu man pārdevi tādu pūķi, kas aizbēg?\" Pārdevējs vaicā: \"Diezin, vai tad būsi darījis visu pareizi, kā mācīju: vai sveicināji savu sievu tā, kā teicu?\"\n\n\"Ne, neteicu vis — man palikās žēl sievas un es sveicināju: \"Labrīt! sieva — Dievs tavā sirdī!\"\n\n\" Ja tas tā, tad pats esi vainīgs, ka pūķis aizbēdzis, un nevis es.\"","source":"J. Sroģis Koknesē. Brīvzemnieka Sborņik, 101, 71, 3. LP, VI, 99, 22.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Departure is narrated without a perceptual predicate.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.649065,"lon":25.431094,"label":"place-0202","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132101068","id":"132101068","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķa iegūšana un darbība","text":"Vienam saimniekam pūķis nesis naudu. Naktim saimnieks gulējis pie loga uz sēdekļa un pūķis devis tikai šim pa logu iekšā.\n\nBet māju puisis to apmānījis un vienreiz nogulies pats saimnieka vietā. Labi. Gulējis, gulējis — te ap pusnakti dzird: viens saucot ārpus loga: \"Attaisi, attaisi!\"\n\nPuisis attaisījis logu. Kā attaisījis, tā saucis atkal: \"Turi ķepuri, turi ķepuri!\"\n\nPuisis turējis un šis nu piebeŗot pilnu cepuri naudas. Bet nezin kā taču apskatījies, ka nav vis saimnieks, bet puisis, un tā tūliņ izņēmis visu naudu no cepures atkal ārā. No rīta puisis atradis savu cepuri pilnu zirgu renguļu.","source":"A. Lerchis-Puškaitis Džūkstē LP, VI, 48, 5, 1.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-035-E01","start":220,"end":286,"span":"te ap pusnakti dzird: viens saucot ārpus loga: \"Attaisi, attaisi!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-035-E02","start":428,"end":491,"span":"Bet nezin kā taču apskatījies, ka nav vis saimnieks, bet puisis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"corrected identity","evidence":"nav vis saimnieks, bet puisis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer is the visiting agent; nezin kā concerns narrator knowledge.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ārpus loga","environment":"domestic threshold","time":"ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.78922,"lon":23.247195,"label":"place-0110","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132102001","id":"132102001","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķis apvainots","text":"Viens saimnieks bija nopircis gaļas pūķi. Pūķis nu paģērējis no saimnieka, lai viņam rādot savu saimi, cik liela tā esot, lai varētu zināt, cik gaļas viņam jāpārnes. Vakarā nu visa saime bija sapulcināta saimnieka kambarī, tā kā pūķis to varēja redzēt. Tikai viens puisis bija ielīdies aiz krāsns; to pūķis neieraudzīja.\n\nNu pūķis sāca nest gaļu un lika visiem priekšā. Visi dabūja gaļu, tik(ai) tas puisis, ko pūķis nebija redzējis, dabūja maitu. Saimnieks nu pūķam prasīja, kam tā esot darījis. Pūķis atbildējis: caur to esot nācis, ka to puisi nebija redzējis; viņam vajagot visus redzēt, kam grib gaļu dot.\n\nPūķi gavēņa naktīs, vai arī jaungada naktī var dabūt satikt. Tad viņš saticēju ir uzrunājot, kādu darbu lūgdamies. Ja nu minot tādu darbu, ko pūķis iespēj veikt, tad atbildot, ka tas jau padarīts, lai dodot citu. Ja darba devējs tad apjūkot, nevarēdams citu darbu atminēties, tad viņa dienas skaitītas: pūķis viņam uzbrūkot un aprijot. Tikai vienā gabalā jaunus darbus uzdodams, vari no viņa atkratīties, bet pavisam aizdabūt projām tad, ja attopot viņam pilnīgi neiespējamu darbu uzdot — piemēram ja liek no smiltim valgus vīt, tad tūliņ viņš atkāpjoties.\n\nViens saimnieks Rīgā nopērk no viena kunga pūķi. Kungs viņam piekodina, lai pāriedams savu sievu sveicinot tiem vārdiem: \"Vel(n)s tavā sirdī!\"\n\nBet viņš tomēr sveicinājis: \"Dievs tavā sirdī!\"\n\nBet kas nu ir? Tā tūliņ visa istaba paliek tik pilna netīrumu, lai berž, lai tīrī, cik grib — tīrības nav un nav.\n\nNu saimnieks nobēdājies iet atpakaļ pie tā paša Rīgas kunga un tad bijis atkal viss kārtībā.","source":"Skolotājs Karlsons. Drachen-Mythus, 47, 76. LP, VI, 85.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-036-E01","start":176,"end":252,"span":"visa saime bija sapulcināta saimnieka kambarī, tā kā pūķis to varēja redzēt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer explicitly pūķis.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-036-E02","start":253,"end":320,"span":"Tikai viens puisis bija ielīdies aiz krāsns; to pūķis neieraudzīja.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Occlusion/omitted person; uncertainty not explicitly experienced.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"saimnieka kambarī","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Vakarā","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:132102013","id":"132102013","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķis apvainots","text":"Vienam pavāram bijis pūķis mēslu čupā. Tas arvien šo to nometis pūķam par barību, teicot: \"Še, gaŗā ķēve, gaŗās nastas nesēja, tev arī sava daļa!\" Bet kad kādu laiku to piemirsis darīt, tad pats palicis slims. Vienā naktī tam pūķis rādījies sapnī un teicis uz to: \"Tev tādēļ jāguļ slimam, ka piemirsi man savu daļu dot; neaizmirsti sava pienākuma, būsi vesels, kā es sava neaizmirstu.\"\n\nPavārs sāka pūķam atkal barību dot, izveseļojās un nekad vairs nepalicis slims.","source":"P. Blūms Jaun-Rozē. LP, VI, 111, 15.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-037-E01","start":222,"end":246,"span":"tam pūķis rādījies sapnī","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"Vienā naktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.547738,"lon":26.714124,"label":"place-0167","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132102035","id":"132102035","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķis apvainots","text":"A. tēva pūķi reiz saticis sēbru saimnieks savā piedarbā. Viņš gājis ar laterni, piedarbā redz susātevi, ēnu, sienmalā, ņem to sist, ēna skrien pie sienas augšup, lejup, bet viņš to tik sukā. A. tēvs nu otrā rītā palicis slims.","source":"Celmiņu Kārlis Lubānas Nagliņos.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-038-E01","start":80,"end":117,"span":"piedarbā redz susātevi, ēnu, sienmalā","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"ambiguous referent","evidence":"susātevi, ēnu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Dialect susātevi uncertain; light source explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"savā piedarbā","environment":"threshing barn","time":"","movement":"Viņš gājis ar laterni"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899927,"lon":26.719879,"label":"place-0266","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132102036","id":"132102036","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķis apvainots","text":"Saimnieks riju izkūlis un aizsūtījis vīrus projām, bet aizmirsis metienam krustu uzvilkt. Pats palicis krāsni kurt un kurdams dzirdējis skaitām: \"Te man viens pūrs!\" Pēc brīža: \"Te man divi pūri!\" Saimnieks skrējis skatīties. Metienā bijis ērmots putns. Ar knābi tas ņēmis graudu un metis pakaļā, teikdams: \"Te man trīs pūri!\" Cik graudu metis, tik pūru. Saimnieks tam uzkrita ar slotas kātu un kāvis, kamēr izbirusi liela čupa graudu un putns aizmucis.","source":"Kārlis Birznieks Zemītniekos. Drachen-Mythus, 53, 90. LP, VI, 88, 75.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-039-E01","start":118,"end":196,"span":"kurdams dzirdējis skaitām: \"Te man viens pūrs!\" Pēc brīža: \"Te man divi pūri!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-039-E02","start":197,"end":253,"span":"Saimnieks skrējis skatīties. Metienā bijis ērmots putns.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Visual inspection stated; object in next clause.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"riju","environment":"threshing barn","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.928616,"lon":22.791403,"label":"place-0566","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132103007","id":"132103007","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķi ēdina ar mēsliem","text":"Vecos laikos vienam saimniekam bijis pūķis, ko saimnieks glabājis uz klēts augšas. Turpat saimnieks pūķim nesis ēdienu mālu bļodiņā, vairāk ceptu gaļu ar sausiem kartupeļiem.\n\nMājā dzīvojis arī dienesta puisis. Tas reiz noskatījies, ka saimnieks aiznes pūķim ceptu gaļu un noliek klētsaugšā.\n\nBijis ap pusdienas laiku. Saimnieks aizgājis dienvidū. Pagalms palicis tukšs. Puisis uzkāpis uz klēts augšas, izēdis pūķam nesto gaļu un bļodiņu piedirsis.\n\nBet tavu nelaimi! Tiklīdz puisis nokāpis no klēts augšas, iekšās sajutis tādas graizes, ka nokritis zemē un palicis gluži zils un melns kā poda dibens.\n\nNebūtu gadījusies nāburgos gudra vecene, puisis tā i nonīktu. Bet tā atnākusi un atlaidusi puisi no nelaimes.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenes pag.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-040-E01","start":211,"end":291,"span":"Tas reiz noskatījies, ka saimnieks aiznes pūķim ceptu gaļu un noliek klētsaugšā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-040-E02","start":508,"end":601,"span":"iekšās sajutis tādas graizes, ka nokritis zemē un palicis gluži zils un melns kā poda dibens.","modalities":["pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"klēts augšas","environment":"storehouse","time":"ap pusdienas laiku","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.451421,"lon":25.864327,"label":"place-0442","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132106001","id":"132106001","collection":"LV","title":"Pūķa saimnieka nāve","text":"Dzīvājis viens saimnieks, kas turējis pūķi mājā. Tas saimnieks bijis bagāts un viņam nekā netrūcis, bet laimīgs viņš tomēr nejuties. Tādēļ arī viņa dēli dikti baidījušies no pūķa. Mirstot tēvam nu bijis pūķis jāatstāj kādam citam, bet neviens dēls negribējis pieņemt pūķi. Tēvs nu dikti ilgi mocījies, kamēr nomiris. Arī zārkā viņam nebijis miera, jo viņš tur vēl grozījies no vienas puses uz otru pusi. Kad veduši zārku uz kapsētu, tad divi zirgi bijuši nobraukti putās, kamēr smagro zārku aizvilkuši līdz kapsētai.","source":"P. Šmits no sava tēva-tēva Raunā.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-041-E01","start":273,"end":316,"span":"Tēvs nu dikti ilgi mocījies, kamēr nomiris.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Suffering during dying; exact sensation unspecified; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.331693,"lon":25.610034,"label":"place-0373","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132107002","id":"132107002","collection":"LV","title":"Rudzu-ruņģis","text":"Viens saimnieks ik nakts licis puisim sieku rudzu samalt. Bet puisis, lai gan jau pirmajos gaiļos sākdams, nevarējis līdz gaismai sieku ne pusē nomalt; tomēr dzirnas bijušas pilnas miltu. Jāmaļ bijis puisim arvienu pa tumsu, jo saimnieks noteicis: dzirnu kambarī nav brīv uguni dedzināt. Kad tā ilgāku laiku malis, bet sieku nenomalis, tad sapratis, ka saimniekam ir pūķis, kas pa tumsu siekā labību iebeŗ. Puisis tādēļ iegādājies pīlādža bozi, uzgriezis tai trijdeviņus krustus, iededzis uguni un malis tad. Malis, malis — ieraudzījis milnas galā lielu, melnu runci. Nositis runci ar bozi, iebāzis padzirnē, peļu alā. Malis atkal, bet tagad līdz gaismai viegli jo viegli sieku izmalis tukšu. Saimnieks ar saimniece, sieku tukšu padzirdējuši, sāks brīnīties un tūliņ saimniece skrien dzirnu kambarī raudzīt. Ieskrējusi un atradusi nosisto runci, ienākusi istabā un teikusi saimniekam: \"Mūsu rudzu ruņģītis nosists un iebāzts peļu ķurmā!\" No tā laika puisis varējis ik nakts sieku izmalt tukšu.","source":"Jansonu Jānis Liel-Platonē. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VII, I, 727, 2.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-042-E01","start":524,"end":567,"span":"ieraudzījis milnas galā lielu, melnu runci.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Fire lit immediately beforehand; time still night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"dzirnu kambarī","environment":"mill interior","time":"pa tumsu","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.449185,"lon":23.657849,"label":"place-0240","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:132107007","id":"132107007","collection":"LV","title":"Rudzu-ruņģis","text":"Viens puisis malis labību. Bet jo malis, jo vairāk miltu ticis: turpretī labības nemaz mazāk. Turpat netālu uz žubura čirkstinājis mazs zvirbulīts. Te gājusi gaŗām viena māmiņa — tai bijusi ragana un staigājusi skauzdama — un prasīja puišam: \"Ko tu tur dari?\" Puisis atbildējis: \"Te jau nu visu rītu malu, bet nevaru vien samalt.\" Māmiņa atteikusi: \"Ek tur tas zvirbulis, kas tur tai mieta galā tup, tas tev velk klāt. Ņem, nosit viņu, tad tev vairāk nebūs jāmaļ.\" Tā puisis paņēmis koku un nositis zvirbuli. Kad zvirbuli nositis, tad labības pietrūcis. Nākusi nu saimniece, ieraudzījusi nu zvirbuli nosistu, tīri nobijusies izsaukusi: \"Nu mūsu rudzu runduliņš pagalam! Ko tad nu ēdīsim!\" Tas mazais zvirbulīts ir bijis pūķis.","source":"R. Auniņš Cesvainē. Drachen-Mythus, 9, 5. LP, VI, 67, 9.","category":"Pūķis","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-043-E01","start":94,"end":147,"span":"Turpat netālu uz žubura čirkstinājis mazs zvirbulīts.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-043-E02","start":575,"end":634,"span":"ieraudzījusi nu zvirbuli nosistu, tīri nobijusies izsaukusi","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer saimniece, individual.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"visu rītu","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.965144,"lon":26.311047,"label":"place-0077","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140102022","id":"140102022","collection":"LV","title":"Velnu dzīves vietas","text":"Agrāk velns dzīvoja mežā. Viņam bija daudz radinieku. Reiz pie velna atbrauca ciemoties no Vāczemes viņa māsas dēls, viens kungs. Kungam tā iepatikusies velna muiža, ka viņš lūdzis, lai velns atdod savu muižu viņam. Vecais velns arī ar mieru, tikai lai viņam dod mūžīgo naudas bagātību. Kungs ar mieru. Tā nu vecais velns aiziet ar visu mūžīgo naudas bagātību uz purvu. No tā arī vēl šo baltu dienu saka, ka velnam piederot mūžīgais naudas pūrs.","source":"N. Ašmane Nītaures pag. J. A. Jansona kr.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.070027,"lon":25.224321,"label":"place-0325","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140103024","id":"140103024","collection":"LV","title":"Velni nēsā akmeņus","text":"Viņos laikos saderējuši kādi kungi uz seši sieki naudas Abavu aizdambēt. Kungs dambējis, dambējis, bet nekā. Kur tev Dieviņ! ko pa dienu aizdambējis, tas nakti prom. Kungs domājis: \"Ko nu darīt? Tik pulka naudas paspēlēt negribētu ne par ko.\" Redzēdams, ka nekā nedarīs, sācis savu pretinieku lādēt. Te kur gadījies, kur ne — velns klāt un teicis, ja šis viņam donot (dodot) vienu cilvēka dvēseli, tad viņš upi aizdambēšot. Nākamu nakti nu, nabags, sācis dambēt: grābis klēpjiem zemes no krasta un metis upē. Bet kudī! Dieviņš sūtījis lietu un ūdens uzplūzdams atkal aizskalojis visas zemes prom. Velns redzējis, ka ar zemēm netiks galā, laidis uz leišiem pēc akmeņiem. Bet bijusi jau arī pusnakts klāt. Kad bijis šīpus Zemītes, tad tikai pamanījis, ka nevarēs vairs galā tikt, sācis jau lielākos akmeņus sviest nost. Te nejauši iedziedājies gailis. Nu nabags laidis visus akmeņus prom un pats aizskrējis un nerādījis vairs ne acu.","source":"K. Strēlerts Kandavā. Jkr. II. LP, VII, I, 1315, 12.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-045-E01","start":818,"end":849,"span":"Te nejauši iedziedājies gailis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"šīpus Zemītes","environment":"other named place","time":"pusnakts","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.033151,"lon":22.77679,"label":"place-0190","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140106003","id":"140106003","collection":"LV","title":"Velni mantas nesēji","text":"Priekules muižā (Kurzemē, Grobiņas apr.) dzīvoja vecs rijkuris. Tas vienreiz guļ savā rijā un tā ap pulksten desmitiem vakarā atnāks pie viņa velns, sacīdams: \"Celies, saņem visus maisus un sēdi man jātniski mugurā, jāsim uz Rēveli pie igauņiem un izzagsim tur Rēveles velnam naudu!\" Rijkuris uzcēlās, saraudzīja labu tiesu maisu un kāpa velnam mugurā. Velns aizšāvās kā vējš un rijkuris tikai šim mugurā. Nonāca abi Rēvelē, sagrābās naudas vai cik un skrēja atpakaļ. Te velns ieteiksies rijniekam: \"Mums dzenas Rēveles velns pakaļ; ja viņš mūs panāktu un mēs abi sāktum kauties, tad nestāvi dīkā, bet palīdzi man, ņem sērmūkšļa bozi un mizo to, jo sērmūkšļa boze ir tikpat sāpīga. kā nokarsēta dzelzs.\" Un patiesi Rēveles velns panāca priekuļniekus — abi velni sāka kauties. Rēveles velns tik tik jau nepārspēja priekuļnieku, te rijkuris sāka rēvelnieku mocīt ar sērmūkšļa bozi. Rēvelnieks neizcieta un nogāzās gar zemi. Bet priekuļnieki pakampa naudas maisus un projām uz mājām. Aiz liela ātruma viens maiss ceļā viņiem izkrita. Tas gadījās taisni grenčenieku pagastā. Šo maisu grenčenieki pacēla un par to naudu uzcēla daktera namu un skolu. Bet velns, pārskrējis savā miteklī Priekulē, atmeta arī rijkurim, savam palīdzētājam, sieku naudas.","source":"F. Reķis Rendā. Brīvzemnieka \"Sborņik\", 75, 61. LP, VII, I, 483, 3.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-046-E01","start":649,"end":702,"span":"sērmūkšļa boze ir tikpat sāpīga. kā nokarsēta dzelzs.","modalities":["pain","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Quoted generic comparison; heat is comparative, not actual contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-046-E02","start":880,"end":921,"span":"Rēvelnieks neizcieta un nogāzās gar zemi.","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Pain licensed by preceding painful-beating context; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.066978,"lon":22.288959,"label":"place-0381","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140106019","id":"140106019","collection":"LV","title":"Velni mantas nesēji","text":"Reiz dzīvoja viens mežsargs vārdā Brencis. Jau ilgus gadus viņš bija šai amatā. Vienumēr viņš gāja uz mežu un ņēma bisi līdz, ar ko nošaut kādu zaķi jeb citu kādu dzīvnieku.\n\nVienu rītu, kā jau parasts, viņš paņēma bisi un aizgāja uz mežu. Te uzreiz viņš ierauga pāri kalniņam zaķi skrejam. Viņš izšauj, bet zaķis pārmet kūleni un skrien atkal tālāk. Arī nākošu rītu mežsargs redz zaķi, šauj uz to un tas atkal aizskrien. Tā tas gāja veselu nedēļu. Nu bija vecais Brencis par daudz noskaities. Mājās viņam dzīvoja kāds vecs vecītis, kas pamācīja Brencim, lai ieliekot dzīvsudrabu bisē, tad varēšot zaķi nošaut, jo tas jau laikam esot pats nelabais. Brencis otrā rītā arī tā izdara. Un patiešām, tikko viņš izšauj, tā zaķis palecas uz augšu, pārmet kūleņus un tūliņ viņam izaug ragi un aste. Nu Brencis zina, ar ko tam darīšana. Bet zaķis sāk mežsargu lūgties un sola tam veselu gadu katru rītu atdzīt pa vienam zaķim. Tā nu zaķis izpildīja savu solījumu trīssimtsešdesmit četras dienas. Taisni trīssimtssešdesmit piektā dienā viņš nevarēja nevienu zaķi sadabūt, bet Brencis bez zaķa nav apmierināms. Nu zaķis, ar asti un ragiem, lūdzās mežsarga, lai nedusmo, ka viņš iedos tam pilnu zaķādu ar zeltu. Dabūjis zeltu mežsargs Brencis atstāja zaķi mierā.","source":"L. Ozola Sērpilī. A. Bērzkalnes krājumā.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-047-E01","start":250,"end":290,"span":"viņš ierauga pāri kalniņam zaķi skrejam.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-047-E02","start":351,"end":385,"span":"Arī nākošu rītu mežsargs redz zaķi","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated over a week.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-047-E03","start":717,"end":790,"span":"zaķis palecas uz augšu, pārmet kūleņus un tūliņ viņam izaug ragi un aste.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"changed appearance","evidence":"izaug ragi un aste","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Narrated transformation within observed encounter; perception inferred from context; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"mežu","environment":"forest","time":"Vienu rītu","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.587447,"lon":25.657696,"label":"place-0464","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140107006","id":"140107006","collection":"LV","title":"Velns palīdz medniekiem","text":"Gadu 40 atpakaļ — tā Kupfers raksta — viņš bijis ar vienu vecu saimnieku, ko ļaudis dēvējuši par burvi, medņus medīt un tad pie ugunskura šis pats viņam esot pastāstījis sekošo.\n\nReiz viens mežsarga palīgs Pēteris ieguvis pie kunga aplam ievērību tādēļ it īpaši, ka bijis pārākais šāvējs no visiem mežsargiem. Kungs tad viņam arī apsolījis reiz vecā mežsarga mājas atdot, tā mežsarga, pie kā viņš par palīgu bijis. Pēterim tas brīnum bijis pa prātam, jo bijis iemīlējis vecā mežsarga vienīgo meitu. Arī vecajam mežsargam tur nekas pretim nebijis Pēterim mājas atdot un par iegātni pieņemt.\n\nBet tiklīdz labi Pēteris ar Ģedrūti saderinājušies, te atkūlies mežsarga mājās klibais skrodelis, pazīstamais burvis, un apbūris Pēterim plinti tik briesmīgi, ka ne piesietu zaķi vairs nejaudājis nošaut. Šim skrodelim bijusi bērza tāss tabakas šņaucamā doze un ar šo dozi viņš lielījies, ka Pēteris to nebūšot sašaut, ja gaisā sviedīšot.\n\nPēteris pasmējies par tādām blēņām, jo nekad nemēdzis pūdelēt, un licis skrodelim, lai met dozi gaisā. Metis, šāvis nesašāvis. Un no tā šāviena Pēteris bijis apburts: lai šauj, ko šaudams, nekā vairs nošaut. Gan nabadziņš izmazgājis plinti vairākkārt, gan izracis no ziemas migas čūsku, to ielādēdams plintē un izšaudams čūsku gaisā, lai plinti atburtu, bet kā nekā, tā nekā. Te pašu laiku pārbraucis kungs no Vāczemes un drīzi pēc tam sarīkojis vilku medības. Medībās kungs Pēteri, par labāko šāvēju pazīdams, nolicis tūliņ pirmā vietā aiz sevis. Te sprucis no masta liels vilks taisni kungam virsū. Kungs gan sašāvis vilku pirmā šāvienā, bet tā kā otrs stobrs nesprādzis, tad nu vajadzējis Pēterim šaut. Sašautais vilks lēnām, lēnām, soļu, vilcies Pēterim gaŗām un šis arī šāvis, bet kā arvienu gaŗām, tā arī tagad. Vilks pazudis biezumos. Bet kungs tā nieka labad tik briesmīgi sapiktojies uz Pēteri, ka uz tādām pasludinājis: viņš vecā mežsarga mājas vairs nedabūšot. Tas Pēterim bez gala grauzis; it īpaši Ģedrūtes labad sirds raizējusies. Te gadījies izpalīdzētājs, viens vīrs, Pupavs vārdā. Tas teicis: \"Pēteri, es klibā skrodeļa apbūrumu atburšu, ja paklausīsi mani un visu darīsi, ko tev likšu. Ej nākamu svētdienu pie dievgalda un nerij vis dabūto dievmaizīti dibinā, bet pagrūd ar mēli starp žokli un vaigu. Pēc tam, cik ātri vien iespējams, manies no baznīcas laukā, izņem maizīti no mutes, ietin papīrī un pusstundu priekš pusnakts sašauj to ar savu bisi pie Zilā kalna. Tu vari arī, pie Zilā kalna noiedams, apsēsties gravas malā uz vecā satrenējušā baļķa, kam jāsapūst tālabad uz vietas, ka priekš gadiem zirgu nositis, un tur mani pagaidīt. Tikai nesaki pie šā baļķa: \"\"Sci, sci!\" citādi dabūsi ko redzēt un ar to savu lietu samaitāsi. Citi ļaudis gan, pa naktim tai vietai gaŗām iedami, aiz ziņkārības to \"sci, sci!\" saka un dabū ko arī pieredzēt; bet tu to nedari nekādā ziņā.\"\n\nLabi, Pēteris tā izdarījis un jau nākamā svētdienas naktī gaidījis noteiktā vietā Pupavu. Pupavs atnācis, paņēmis maizīti, piedūris pļavā pie ozola stumbra ar adatu un teicis: \"Pēteri, šauj nu! ja šausi, tad, tici droši, būsi atburts: katru putnu, vienalga, vai tas tek, vai skrien, vai peld, vai lien, tu varēsi trāpīt un nošaut no šā brīža.\"\n\nPēteris pacēlis gan bisi, bet vēl apdomājies un teicis: būšot liels grēks. Tad Pupavs viņu pārrājis un skubinājis par jaunu, lai šaujot. Nu Pēteris pacēlis bisi pie vaiga un gribējis patlaban gaili paspiest, te — kas tas — itin piepēši atkal nolaidis bisi pie zemes.\n\n\"Kam nešāvi, ko niekojies?\" Pupavs uzsaucis, bet Pēteris itin bāls atteicis: \"Vai tu nemaz neredzi, kas tur bija? Tiklīdz gribēju gaili piespiest, tā aizstājās balts cilvēks maizītei priekšā un cilvēku jau neiešu šaut.\"\n\n\"Ej, ko tu niekojies! Vai vēl tas cilvēks tev acīs?\"\n\n\"Nē, vairāk nav! Tiklīdz bisi nolaidu — pazuda. Es raudzīšu vēl — redzēs, kas nu būs.\"\n\nAtkal Pēteris pacēlis bisi, bet tūliņ nolaidis atkal atpakaļ: vēl tur esot tas cilvēks. Tad Pupavs sacījis: \"Arī es šoreiz tā kā baltu ēnu noblendu, kā cilvēka ēnu, un man liekas, tevi nebūs vis klibais skrodelis nobūris, bet laikam kāds cits cilvēks, kas nule pat būs nomiris un tādēļ vēl par spoku (ķēmu) tam jāstaigā apkārt. Šis ķēms tad tīšām stājas maizītei priekšā, lai tu netiktu no apbūruma vaļā. Es tavā vietā tādu burvi — pat arī, ja tas ir dzīvs būtu — kā suni nošautu, ne vēl mirušu. Bet tu jau tāds bailīgs pakula zaķis esi: ieraudzījis naidīga neģēla ēnu vien, jau drebi. Saņemies, ģļēvais, atriebies tam! Dod tai spoka ēnai virsū, lai izput kā migla!\"\n\nPēteris tiešām saņēmies un pacēlis bisi pa trešam lāgam. Patlaban gribējis spiest, te ieraudzījis skaidri, gaiši, ka baltais cilvēks sāpīgā vaigā uz viņtu skatījies tik žēlīgi, tik žēlīgi; bet rokas, uz augšu paceldams, tas izplētis tā uz katru pusi, jādomā: tīri vai pēc krusta viss tas stāvs līdzinājās. Tagad Pēteris ilgāki vairs nekautrējies, nosviedis bisi un laidis ļekas vaļā. Bet Pupavs pakaļ, ko māk, noķeŗ Pēteri aiz apkakles, velk atpakaļ. Te tai pašā brīdī arī baltais cilvēks piegadījies un satvēris Pupavu aiz matiem, viegli jo viegli lielā paņēmienā aizsviedis to pa koku galiem nezin kur. Tikai iedzelteni dūmi ar sēra smaku nostiepušies Pupavam nopakaļus. No tās reizes Pupavu neviens nav vairs redzējis. Pēteri turpretim pestītājs bija izglābis no velna nagiem.","source":"Viktors Kupfers Dundadzniekos, Magazin d. Lettisch-Literär. Ges. XVII. B. II. St. \"Die Geschichte vom Puppau.\" LP, VII, I, 241, 6.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-048-E01","start":3554,"end":3630,"span":"Tiklīdz gribēju gaili piespiest, tā aizstājās balts cilvēks maizītei priekšā","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E02","start":3732,"end":3762,"span":"Tiklīdz bisi nolaidu — pazuda.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"Tiklīdz bisi nolaidu — pazuda","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E03","start":3803,"end":3890,"span":"Atkal Pēteris pacēlis bisi, bet tūliņ nolaidis atkal atpakaļ: vēl tur esot tas cilvēks.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"reappearance","evidence":"vēl tur esot tas cilvēks","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E04","start":3912,"end":3966,"span":"Arī es šoreiz tā kā baltu ēnu noblendu, kā cilvēka ēnu","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate appearance","evidence":"tā kā baltu ēnu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Different experiencer: Pupavs. Dialect noblendu = glimpsed; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E05","start":4557,"end":4658,"span":"ieraudzījis skaidri, gaiši, ka baltais cilvēks sāpīgā vaigā uz viņtu skatījies tik žēlīgi, tik žēlīgi","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Clear perception explicitly asserted; facial pain not experiencer pain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E06","start":4881,"end":4921,"span":"noķeŗ Pēteri aiz apkakles, velk atpakaļ.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact and forced displacement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E07","start":5076,"end":5143,"span":"Tikai iedzelteni dūmi ar sēra smaku nostiepušies Pupavam nopakaļus.","modalities":["visual","smell"],"groups":["vision","smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Atmospheric qualities explicit; observer contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-048-E08","start":5144,"end":5192,"span":"No tās reizes Pupavu neviens nav vairs redzējis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic subsequent non-seeing, not a new witnessed disappearance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pie Zilā kalna","environment":"hill","time":"nākamā svētdienas naktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","smell","vision"],"translation":"About forty years ago – so Kupfers writes – he had been hunting capercaillies with an old farmer whom people called a sorcerer, and then by the campfire this same man had told him the following.\n\nOnce a forester's assistant, Pēteris, had gained extraordinary favor with the master, especially because he was the best shot of all the foresters. The master then also promised him that he would eventually give him the old forester's homestead – that of the forester whose assistant he was. This was wonderfully to Pēteris's liking, because he had fallen in love with the old forester's only daughter. Nor did the old forester have any objections to giving the homestead to Pēteris and taking him in as a son-in-law.\n\nBut as soon as Pēteris and Ģedrūte had become engaged, the limping tailor – the well-known sorcerer – dragged himself to the forester's house and cast a spell on Pēteris's gun so terribly that he could no longer shoot down even a tied-up hare. This tailor had a birch-bark snuffbox, and with this box he boasted that Pēteris would not be able to shoot it if he threw it into the air.\n\nPēteris laughed at such nonsense, since he was never used to missing, and told the tailor to throw the box into the air. He threw it; [Pēteris] shot and failed to hit it. And from that shot Pēteris was bewitched: shoot whatever he might, he could no longer shoot anything.\n\nThe poor fellow washed the gun repeatedly, and even dug a snake out of its winter den, loaded it into the gun and shot the snake into the air to break the spell on the gun, but to no avail whatsoever. Right at that time, the master returned from Germany and soon afterward organized a wolf hunt. At the hunt, knowing Pēteris to be the best shot, the master placed him immediately in the first spot behind himself. Then a large wolf broke out of the drive straight toward the master. The master indeed shot the wolf on the first shot, but since the second barrel did not go off, Pēteris had to shoot. The wounded wolf slowly, slowly, step by step, dragged itself past Pēteris, and he too shot, but as always missing, so now as well. The wolf disappeared into the thickets.\n\nBut the master was so terribly angered with Pēteris over that trifle that he declared right then and there: he would no longer get the old forester's house. That gnawed at Pēteris without end; his heart was worried, especially for Ģedrūte's sake. Then a helper happened to appear, a man named Pupavs. He said: \"Pēteris, I will break the limping tailor's spell if you listen to me and do everything I tell you. Go to Holy Communion next Sunday and do not swallow the communion wafer you receive all the way down, but push it with your tongue between your jaw and cheek. After that, as quickly as possible, get yourself out of church, take the wafer out of your mouth, wrap it in paper, and half an hour before midnight shoot it with your rifle at Zilais kalns (Blue Hill).\n\nYou can also, when going to Zilais kalns, sit down on the edge of the ravine on the old rotted log, which has to rot right there on the spot because years ago it struck a horse dead, and wait for me there. Only do not say \"Sci, sci!\" at this log, otherwise you will get to see something and ruin your affair with it. Other people indeed, passing by that place at night, out of curiosity say that \"sci, sci!\" and also get to experience something; but you do not do that under any circumstances.\"\n\nWell, Pēteris did so and already on the following Sunday night waited for Pupavs at the appointed place. Pupavs came, took the wafer, pinned it in the meadow to an oak trunk with a needle and said: \"Pēteris, shoot now!\n\nIf you shoot, then, believe me firmly, the spell on you will be broken: every bird, no matter whether it runs, flies, swims, or crawls, you will be able to hit and shoot down from this moment on.\"\n\nPēteris did raise his rifle, but then hesitated and said: it would be a great sin. Then Pupavs scolded him and urged him anew to shoot. Now Pēteris raised the rifle to his cheek and was just about to pull the trigger, when – what is this – quite suddenly he lowered the rifle to the ground again.\n\n\"Why didn't you shoot, what are you messing around for?\" Pupavs cried out, but Pēteris, quite pale, replied: \"Don't you see at all what was there? As soon as I wanted to press the trigger, a white person stepped in front of the wafer, and I am certainly not going to shoot a person.\"\n\n\"Come on, what are you fooling around for! Can you still see that person?\"\n\n\"No, not anymore! As soon as I lowered the rifle – it disappeared. I will try again – we'll see what happens now.\"\n\nAgain Pēteris raised the rifle, but immediately lowered it back down: the person was still there. Then Pupavs said: \"I too this time glimpsed something like a white shadow, like a person's shadow, and it seems to me that you were not bewitched by the limping tailor at all, but likely by some other person who has just recently died and therefore must wander about as a ghost (apparition). This apparition then purposely stands in front of the wafer so that you won't get rid of the spell. In your place, such a sorcerer – even if he were alive – I would shoot like a dog, let alone a dead one.\n\nBut you are such a coward: having seen only the shadow of a hostile scoundrel, you are already trembling. Pull yourself together, coward, take revenge on it! Give it to that ghost's shadow, let it scatter like fog!\"\n\nPēteris truly pulled himself together and raised the rifle for the third time. Just as he wanted to press [the trigger], he saw quite clearly that the white person with a pained expression was looking at him so piteously, so piteously; but raising his arms upwards, he spread them out to each side, you might think: the whole figure resembled a cross indeed. Now Pēteris hesitated no longer, threw down the rifle and took to his heels. But Pupavs after him as best he can, catches Pēteris by the collar, pulls him back.\n\nRight at that same moment the white person also arrived and seized Pupavs by the hair, and very easily with a grand sweep hurled him over the treetops who knows where. Only yellowish smoke with a smell of sulfur trailed behind Pupavs. From that time on no one has seen Pupavs anymore. Pēteris, on the other hand, had been saved from the devil's claws by the savior.","translationNotes":["\"iegātnis\" is a historical term for a son-in-law who joins his wife's household/farm.","\"skrodelis\" means tailor. \"doze\" refers to a snuffbox. \"pūdelēt\" means to miss a shot.","\"masts\" in hunting context refers to the drive/line of beaters.","\"dievmaizīti dibinā\" translates to swallowing the communion wafer all the way down.","'Sci, sci!' is retained as an exclamation; its effect is described by this narrative, not independently established.","Firearm wording is rendered by its function as pulling the trigger. 'Skrien' in the list of birds' movements is rendered as flying.","\"ķēmu\" is explicitly glossed in the original text as \"spoku\" (ghost/apparition).","'Pakula zaķis' is an insult for a coward; 'skaidri, gaiši' means clearly, not additional perceived brightness.","\"pestītājs\" means savior."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.507633,"lon":22.351967,"label":"place-0103","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"LV-048-E01","start":4279,"end":4365,"span":"As soon as I wanted to press the trigger, a white person stepped in front of the wafer","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Tiklīdz gribēju gaili piespiest, tā aizstājās balts cilvēks maizītei priekšā","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E02","start":4511,"end":4559,"span":"As soon as I lowered the rifle – it disappeared.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"Tiklīdz bisi nolaidu — pazuda","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Tiklīdz bisi nolaidu — pazuda.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E03","start":4609,"end":4706,"span":"Again Pēteris raised the rifle, but immediately lowered it back down: the person was still there.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"reappearance","evidence":"vēl tur esot tas cilvēks","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Atkal Pēteris pacēlis bisi, bet tūliņ nolaidis atkal atpakaļ: vēl tur esot tas cilvēks.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E04","start":4726,"end":4804,"span":"I too this time glimpsed something like a white shadow, like a person's shadow","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate appearance","evidence":"tā kā baltu ēnu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Different experiencer: Pupavs. Dialect noblendu = glimpsed; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Arī es šoreiz tā kā baltu ēnu noblendu, kā cilvēka ēnu","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E05","start":5543,"end":5656,"span":"he saw quite clearly that the white person with a pained expression was looking at him so piteously, so piteously","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Clear perception explicitly asserted; facial pain not experiencer pain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"ieraudzījis skaidri, gaiši, ka baltais cilvēks sāpīgā vaigā uz viņtu skatījies tik žēlīgi, tik žēlīgi","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E06","start":5895,"end":5941,"span":"catches Pēteris by the collar, pulls him back.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact and forced displacement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"noķeŗ Pēteri aiz apkakles, velk atpakaļ.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E07","start":6111,"end":6177,"span":"Only yellowish smoke with a smell of sulfur trailed behind Pupavs.","modalities":["visual","smell"],"groups":["vision","smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Atmospheric qualities explicit; observer contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Tikai iedzelteni dūmi ar sēra smaku nostiepušies Pupavam nopakaļus.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-048-E08","start":6178,"end":6227,"span":"From that time on no one has seen Pupavs anymore.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic subsequent non-seeing, not a new witnessed disappearance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"No tās reizes Pupavu neviens nav vairs redzējis.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"LV:140108004","id":"140108004","collection":"LV","title":"Velni maina bērnus","text":"Vienu vakaru sēdēja vecenīte istabā vērpdama. Piepēži pie durvim klaudzina un tūliņ arī ienāk vecenīte ar govs kājām, veļu māte. Šī prasa: \"Vai negribas ēst?\" Vecenīte atbild, ka negriboties. Nu veļu māte aizgājusi uz kapiem, ar kājām izkasījusi kādu bērnu, atnesusi pie vecenītes un nosviedusi pie kājām, ka noklaudzējis vien.","source":"N. Ozoliņš Grazdonā. Etn. I, 1891. LP, VII, I, 161, 7.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-049-E01","start":46,"end":74,"span":"Piepēži pie durvim klaudzina","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-049-E02","start":284,"end":327,"span":"nosviedusi pie kājām, ka noklaudzējis vien.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"istabā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Vienu vakaru","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.967854,"lon":24.12303,"label":"place-0132","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140109013","id":"140109013","collection":"LV","title":"Velni nerro cilvēkus","text":"Vecs vīrs gājis pa ceļu, viņam pumpa (kuprs) liela bijusi mugurā. Iegājis vienā krogā pārgulēt, tur visas istabas bijušas pilnas; viena istaba gan vēl bijusi, bet tur neviens nevarējis, gulēt: velni nelikuši mierā. Bet viņš tomēr tur gulējis, kas ir ir. Gulējis, gulējis — ap pusnakti velns — kur gadījies, kur ne sagrābis kupri un sitis drīzi pret griestiem, drīzi pret grīdu; beidzot iesviedis gultā atpakaļ, lai guļ. Rītā piecēlies, visi kauli sāpējuši sasisti, bet mugura viegla. Apskatījies — kā nebūs viegla? Pumpa (kuprs) palikusi pie griestiem: kā sitis, tā tur pielipusi. Nu bijis dikti priecīgs un stāstījis savu laimi pa puspasauli.\n\nOtrs kupris, to padzirdējis un domājis: \"Tu vien vari! es arī varu aiziet savu muguru izdziedināt!\" Aizgājis un tīšām gulējis tai velna istabā un gaidīt gaidījis, lai tikai nu velns nāktu šo pret griestiem sist.\n\nAp pusnakti nācis arī velns; bet kā triecis veča pumpas muguru pret griestiem, tā pielipusi tā otra pumpa lai vēl klāt. Nu bijušas divi pumpas mugurā. Neko darīt — rītā gājis projām un dziedājis:\n\n\"Mana vecā sievas māte\n\nSeptiņ' gadi ellē bij;\n\nNu no elles iznākusi —\n\nSeptiņ' pumpi mugurā.\"","source":"Jānis Ābels Vekšos, Valkas apkaimē, 1864. g. A. Bīlenšteina kr. LP, VI, 614, 91. M. Böhm, Lettische Schwänke, nr. 38.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-050-E01","start":314,"end":376,"span":"sagrābis kupri un sitis drīzi pret griestiem, drīzi pret grīdu","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit repeated impact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-050-E02","start":420,"end":483,"span":"Rītā piecēlies, visi kauli sāpējuši sasisti, bet mugura viegla.","modalities":["pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Time is Rītā, overriding encounter time.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-050-E03","start":484,"end":551,"span":"Apskatījies — kā nebūs viegla? Pumpa (kuprs) palikusi pie griestiem","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-050-E04","start":891,"end":977,"span":"kā triecis veča pumpas muguru pret griestiem, tā pielipusi tā otra pumpa lai vēl klāt.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Second individual; explicit impact, felt quality not stated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-050-E05","start":1022,"end":1052,"span":"rītā gājis projām un dziedājis","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sound production; second man; morning.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"vienā krogā","environment":"inn","time":"ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.691201,"lon":26.053682,"label":"place-0529","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140110007","id":"140110007","collection":"LV","title":"Velni ievilina cilvēkus svešā klētī","text":"Senos laikos, kad zemnieki gāja kunga klaušās, tad viņiem vajadzēja darīt visādus darbus. Kādu nakti viens zemnieks kunga rijā kurinājis krāsni un kaltējis labību. Nabadziņš novārdzis un izsalcis, meklējis ķešās tabaku ko pīpēt, bet nekā neatradis. Te viņš uz reizi ierauga stāvam lepnu kungu, melnās drēbēs. Kungs viņam prasot: vai neesot tabakas, ko iedot iepīpēt? Bet zemnieks atbildis: kur nu nabags lai ņemot? Te kungs paņēmis lielas durvis, uzsēdies virsū un liek arī zemniekam sēdēt. Tiklīdz zemnieks uzsēdies virsū uz durvim, tā vējš vien tik nošņācis un zemnieks sajutis, ka viņi laižas pa gaisu. Un kad durvis apstājušās, tad viņi atradušies lielā tabakas noliktavā. Tagad melnais kungs ņems tabakas pakas klēpjiem vien un kraus tik uz durvim. Zemniekam palika bail, un tas izsaucies: Diezgan jau būšot! Te melnais kungs uz reizi pazudis un viņš atradies vecajā rijā pie krāsns sēdot, kā agrāk. Tagad tik zemnieks zināja, ka melnais kungs bij velns, bet pieminot vārdu Dievs, tas pazudis.","source":"P. Reinfelds Krustpils pag. Latvju kultūras kr.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-051-E01","start":164,"end":195,"span":"Nabadziņš novārdzis un izsalcis","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Fatigue and hunger explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-051-E02","start":252,"end":308,"span":"viņš uz reizi ierauga stāvam lepnu kungu, melnās drēbēs.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-051-E03","start":537,"end":605,"span":"vējš vien tik nošņācis un zemnieks sajutis, ka viņi laižas pa gaisu.","modalities":["auditory","movement sensation"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"In transit, not inside barn.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-051-E04","start":817,"end":904,"span":"melnais kungs uz reizi pazudis un viņš atradies vecajā rijā pie krāsns sēdot, kā agrāk.","modalities":["orientation","visual"],"groups":["orientation","vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"abrupt location change","evidence":"viņš atradies vecajā rijā pie krāsns sēdot, kā agrāk","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"No explicit bewilderment; contextual perception; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kunga rijā","environment":"threshing barn","time":"Kādu nakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.563214,"lon":25.833703,"label":"place-0213","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140112004","id":"140112004","collection":"LV","title":"Velni aicina cilvēkus lauzties","text":"Agrākos laikos, kad rijās kūla arī naktīs, viens puišelis nesa krūzē tēvam uz riju ēst. Vēl pirmie gaiļi nebij dziedājuši, jo bijis vēl ļoti agrs. Auces upē, pār kuŗu puikam bijis jāiet, slīkuši daudz cilvēki, kuŗu dvēseles bieži spokojušās. Arī velnu varēja pie upes sastapt dažādos veidos. Puika nebijis tālu no upes, kad — nezi kur gadījies, kur ne — priekšā nostājies svešs puika un vedinājis spēkoties. Mūsu puika nolicis krūželi pie malas, drošs būdams, sācis ar svešo lauzties. Jutis, ka svešais bijis spalvains un ass. Nu tikai sapratis, ka tas ir pats nelabais. Velns vilcis puiku uz upes pusi, bet tas tik saucis: \"Puika, neapgāz krūželi!\" un attālinājies no upes. Spalvainais sācis ņemt pār puiku pārsvaru, te iedziedājies gailis un melnais ieskrējis upē, ka nobrākšējis vien. Puika nodrebinājies un paķēris savu nesamo skriešus devies pie tēva.","source":"T. Ķenga Jelgavas apr. Auces muižā.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-052-E01","start":485,"end":526,"span":"Jutis, ka svešais bijis spalvains un ass.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"corrected identity","evidence":"Nu tikai sapratis, ka tas ir pats nelabais","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-052-E02","start":571,"end":602,"span":"Velns vilcis puiku uz upes pusi","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Forced displacement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-052-E03","start":718,"end":787,"span":"te iedziedājies gailis un melnais ieskrējis upē, ka nobrākšējis vien.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Auces upē","environment":"waterside","time":"Vēl pirmie gaiļi nebij dziedājuši","movement":"nesa krūzē tēvam uz riju ēst"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.479891,"lon":22.973649,"label":"place-0027","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140113003","id":"140113003","collection":"LV","title":"Velni nes cilvēkus pa gaisu","text":"Aumeisteŗu muižā dzīvāja vienc tāds dārznieks, neatminos gan vais, kā viņu sauca un bī jau labi vecs vīrs un tas šito gabalu stāstīja, kā patiesīgu gabalu, jo šā paša tēvam tā gadījies. Dārznieka tēvs bīš jau varēn vecs vīrs un sestdienas vakarā nācis no pirtīnas. Toreiz viņč dzīvāš kādā tur aumeisteriešu mājā. Istaba bīsi kalnīnā un pirtīna palejā. Dārznieka tēvs kāpis no pirtīnas kalnā un varēn apkusis. Šis nu pats pie sevis tā nosacīš: \"Kau nu būtu šo kāds aiznesis!\"\n\nKā dārznieka tēvs tā nosacīš, tā tūlī vienc šo sagrābis pie kakla, uzsviedis sev uz muguras un nesis tik ātri, ka vējš vie dārznieka tēvam gar ausim dzīvāš. Nesāš bīš pats vellc. Vellc spēris tikai trīs soļi un ta uzsviedis dārznieka tēvu uz Lizītes rijas jumta. (Lizītes māja ir Liepas pagastā.) Dārznieka tēvs no iesākuma nemaz nevarēš apķert, kur nu šo nes. Ta dārznieka tēvs rausies no jumta zemē un gāš mājā iekšā un prasīš, kas tā par māju esot. Šim nu stāstīši, kā tā esot Lizītes māja. Dārznieka tēvs gāš trīs dienas, kamē atkūlies mājā.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 59 g. v. Augusta Kārkliņa Mēŗu pag.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-053-E01","start":394,"end":408,"span":"varēn apkusis.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-053-E02","start":520,"end":632,"span":"šo sagrābis pie kakla, uzsviedis sev uz muguras un nesis tik ātri, ka vējš vie dārznieka tēvam gar ausim dzīvāš.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Wind at ears; acoustic/tactile boundary; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-053-E03","start":773,"end":836,"span":"Dārznieka tēvs no iesākuma nemaz nevarēš apķert, kur nu šo nes.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unknown location/direction","evidence":"nemaz nevarēš apķert, kur nu šo nes","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kalnā","environment":"hill","time":"sestdienas vakarā","movement":"kāpis no pirtīnas kalnā"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.444902,"lon":26.092646,"label":"place-0306","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140114003","id":"140114003","collection":"LV","title":"Velni moka cilvēkus","text":"Tas gadījies vecam Spilvam, kas toreiz Luturu muižā dzīvāš. Viņč man pats to stāstīja jau labi sen apakaļ. Nezinu, vai vecais Spilva vairs ir pie dzīvajim, jo toreiz jau bī pavisam vecs un sakāmējis. Laikam gan vais šā pie dzīvim nebūs.\n\nTas, lūk, bīš štā. Vecais Spilva vienu nakti gāš no Gruncalas uz Gaujienu. Kā šis iegāš Liepīnas silā (Aumeisteŗu pagastā), tā dzirdēš, ka no pakaļas vienc ātri brauc. Spilva nogāš malīnā, lei pagrieztu ceļu. Bet kā braucēš ticis pret Spilvu, tā apturēš un nu tik Spilva redzēš, ka dabraucis varēn lepnis mellc kungs varēn lepnā karītē un priekšā četverka (4 zirgi). Kungs sacīš Spilvam, lei kāpot iekšā karītē, šis izvedīšot cau silu. Spilva tūļājies, ko tūļājies un pēdīgi ar kāpis karītē iekšā. Nu sākuši braukt. Kungs izvilcis cigāru un iedevis Spilvam, lei uztaisot dūmu. Spilva paņēmis cigāru, bet nebīš spičku. Nu kungs mācīš Spilvu, kā šis varēšot pie ugunc tikt, lei raunot vie sev pirstu gar zobim, ta pirsts aizdegšoties un lei pats tik netrūkstoties vie, ka pirsts aizdegšoties. Nu Spilva ar darīš tā, kā kungs vēlēš, un kā norāvis sev pirstu gar zobim, tā šis ar tūlī aizdedzies ar zilām ugunim. Vai, nu Spilva nodomāš, ka laikam būšot gan ar pašu vellu saticies, jo kas gan cits tādus stiķus zinātu? Bet Spilva nekā vis nesacīš, lei gan pašam bīš skaudīgi bailes.\n\nNu kungs rādīš Spilvam savus zirgus un prasīš vai šis zinot ar, kas šim tie tādi par zirgim esot? Nē, ko nu Spilva varēš zināt, kas svešam kungam par zirgim! Ta nu kungs rādīš un stāstīš, ka tas zirgs esot vecais Gaujienas lielckungs Štāls, tas zirgs akal esot Gaujienas muižas stārasts, un tie abi zirgi esot vē div lielkungi, kas savā laikā esot savus cilvēkus situši un kāruši. Tā nu, lūk, šie visi, tie niknie lielkungi tagad šim esot par zirgim.\n\nNu jau abi div bīš izbraukuši silam cauri un pašreiz bīši pret Lesīnu Truci, ka uzreiz dziedāš gailis. Kungs ar visim zirgim uzreiz pazudis un vecais Spilva palicis kājās stāvam uz ceļa vida. Ka nu pēc Spilva apskatīš to cigāru, ko šim kungs devis, ta redzēš, ka tas vis nav cigārs, bet varēn resna gaiļa kāja.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 52 g. v. J. Gaiļa Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-054-E01","start":365,"end":405,"span":"dzirdēš, ka no pakaļas vienc ātri brauc.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-054-E02","start":495,"end":604,"span":"nu tik Spilva redzēš, ka dabraucis varēn lepnis mellc kungs varēn lepnā karītē un priekšā četverka (4 zirgi).","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-054-E03","start":1071,"end":1146,"span":"kā norāvis sev pirstu gar zobim, tā šis ar tūlī aizdedzies ar zilām ugunim.","modalities":["touch","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact explicit; blue flame contextual appearance, no pain inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-054-E04","start":1849,"end":1871,"span":"uzreiz dziedāš gailis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-054-E05","start":1872,"end":1960,"span":"Kungs ar visim zirgim uzreiz pazudis un vecais Spilva palicis kājās stāvam uz ceļa vida.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"abrupt disappearance/location change","evidence":"Kungs ar visim zirgim uzreiz pazudis","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Perception contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-054-E06","start":2018,"end":2079,"span":"ta redzēš, ka tas vis nav cigārs, bet varēn resna gaiļa kāja.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"corrected identity","evidence":"tas vis nav cigārs, bet varēn resna gaiļa kāja","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Liepīnas silā","environment":"forest","time":"vienu nakti","movement":"gāš no Gruncalas uz Gaujienu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140114009","id":"140114009","collection":"LV","title":"Velni moka cilvēkus","text":"Netālu no Bērzmuižas ir Līvu-Bērze, kuŗu to laiku ļaudis saukuši par lielo Līvi. Tur dzīvojis briesmīgs kungs, ko par melno Līvenu saukuši. Otrs tāds pats nikns kungs dzīvojis Melnajā muižā, ko tagad Upes muižu sauc. Niknie kungi tolaik vareni spokojuši. Tā pie Velna bedres sanākuši vācieši sarkanām kājām, ķēdēs saķēdēti, ka žvakšķējis vien, saiedami Velna bedrē iekšā, un tad atkal nākuši ārā pie uguns sildīties. Lielākais ceļš viņiem bijis no Velna bedres uz lauka šķūni; tur tie gājuši trumpot un dzīvojuši dumpēdamies, kaudamies cits aiz cita. Bet kad gailis sācis dziedāt, tad visi nelabie gari pazuduši. Pa dienu gan neviena velna nevarējuši redzēt, bet kas uz velnu ceļa apstājies, tas tapis samaitāts.","source":"Treimaņu Jānis Bērznieku Dzeņos. Jkr. II. LP, VII, I, 966, 8.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-055-E01","start":308,"end":342,"span":"ķēdēs saķēdēti, ka žvakšķējis vien","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-055-E02","start":559,"end":579,"span":"gailis sācis dziedāt","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-055-E03","start":613,"end":657,"span":"Pa dienu gan neviena velna nevarējuši redzēt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit daytime non-seeing; generic.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Velna bedres","environment":"pit","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140115003","id":"140115003","collection":"LV","title":"Velni nogalina cilvēkus","text":"Pie Skujenes agrāk pats velns mājojis tā sauktajā Velna pagrabā, Velna alā. Un viens vīrs tolaik ar šo velnu brīnum draudzējies; tam bijusi arvienu naudas, vai cik, kauču ne to mazāko darbu nestrādājis.\n\nReiz krogā šis velna draugs atkal plītējis. Viņa kaimiņš noskatījies brīnodamies un sācis apvaicāties: \"Kur tu ņem tik daudz naudas? Pelnīt tu nepelni un katru dienu dzīvo tādā izšķērdībā.\"\n\nKur ņemu? Šonakt iešu atkal pēc naudas; ja patīk — nāc līdz, gan jau tad redzēsi.\"\n\nLabi, nogaidījuši pusnakti un gājis līdz. Aizgājuši pie Velna alas — izšķērdējs lien tur iekšā un aicina šo arī. Iegājuši alā — ala pilna ar čūskām, kaupiņiem, kādiem nekādiem rāpuļiem un pie galda, kā kungs, sēdējis pats velns. Bet ieraudzījis šovakar divus ienākam, prasījis izšķērdējam: ko to otru te vedis?\n\nTā un tā — viņš arī gribot naudu. \"Labi!\" velns atteicis un tūliņ licis klātpienācējam labās rokas mazajā pirkstiņā iegriezt brūci un ierakstīt ar asinim savu vārdu velna grāmatā, kas turpat uz galda gulējusi. Bet šis vīrs tik ātri gan nu neklausījis — atteicis: viņš vienā vietā esot pierakstīts jau ar Jēzus Kristus asinim un citā grāmatā viņam vairs netiktos rakstīties.\n\nUn tiklīdz to bija izteicis, alā sacēlies briesmīgs viesulis un izsviedis gudrenieku pa durvim laukā. Pārgājis mājā un stāstījis piedzīvojumu citiem. Norunājuši otrā rītā pa visiem kopā Velna pagrabu izmeklēt. Labi. Sagājuši iekšā — ko nu atraduši? Atraduši izšķērdēju, labo velna draugu, beigtu: galva bijusi apgriezta otrādi, ģīmis uz muguru, pakausis uz krūtim.\n\nSarunājuši velna draugu turpat pagrabā atstāt un pagraba tukšumu piebērt ar zemēm, tad jau būšot viņam kaps labu labais. Un tā tad arī noticis.\n\nBet pēc kāda laika vienam svešniekam pašā pusnaktī vajadzējis velna drauga kapam gaŗām braukt un neticis gaŗām: viens apturējis zirgu un aicinājis, lai panākot tepat pie tā kapa nogrābt Dieva tēva vārdā trīs saujas zemes, būšot labi aizmaksāt. Neko darīt — gājis arī un padarījis to mazumiņu. Bet kad atnācis pie zirga atpakaļ, tad aicinātājs iedevis par to labumu zelta gabalus un teicis, ka nu varot braukt.\n\nĻaudis otrā dienā atraduši velna drauga kapu atraktu un mironi izņemtu. Un no tā laika velnu šinī vidū nemanījuši.","source":"Kleķeŗu Kārlis Ķēčos. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VI, 61, 5, 16.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-056-E01","start":248,"end":284,"span":"Viņa kaimiņš noskatījies brīnodamies","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier event in krogā, unspecified time.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-056-E02","start":712,"end":745,"span":"ieraudzījis šovakar divus ienākam","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer explicitly velns.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-056-E03","start":1195,"end":1267,"span":"alā sacēlies briesmīgs viesulis un izsviedis gudrenieku pa durvim laukā.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Forced displacement explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-056-E04","start":2163,"end":2202,"span":"no tā laika velnu šinī vidū nemanījuši.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Generic absence of noticing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Velna alas","environment":"cave","time":"pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","other","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.109094,"lon":25.3138,"label":"place-0593","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140115021","id":"140115021","collection":"LV","title":"Velni nogalina cilvēkus","text":"Sen-senejūs laikūs dzeivuoja uz pasauļa vīns kungs. Kungam nabeja ni muotes, ni tāva; jis beja naprecēts. Vīnu reizi jis sadūmuoja īt uz mežu medībuos. Pajēmja kungs blisi un aizguoja uz mežu. Mežs beja cīši lels. Kungs, staiguodams pa mežu, aizzamaldīja un navar nikai tikt uz ceļa. Skrīn začs. Kungs pajēmja blisi un īvainuoja zači. Začīts suoka prasīt kungu atstuot jū dzeivu un soka: \"Es tev kad nabejis lobu izdarīšu!\" Kungs verās uz zača un runoj: \"Kū tu man loba vari izdarīt? Izvest uz ceļa tu manis navari!\" Kungs nūsyta pavysam zači, lyka sev uz placim un aizguoja tuoļuok. Īt jis un redz, ka preti jam skrīn lopsa. Kungs pajēmja blisi un gribēja nūsist lopsu, bet lopsa suoka praseit kungu, kab jis juos nasystu, bet atstuotu dzeivu un soka: \"Es tev lobu izdarīšu!\" Kungs paklausīja lopsas un soka jai: \"Paruod man ceļu, es aizamaldīju un nazynu, kai tikt uz sovu pili!\" Lopsa paruodīja kungam ceļu. Kad kungs izguoja uz ceļa, jis nūsyta lopsu, lyka uz placim un guoja pa ceļu uz sātu. Verās: īt jam preti nazkaids zvērs. Kungs pajēmja nu placim blisi un suoka šaut, bet zvēram napatyka. Zvērs tvēŗa kungu uz muguras un aiznesja. Kungs, kaut izzynuoja, ka itys zvērs beja pats valns, bet nikai nu juo navarēja sprukt vaļā. Tai valns kungu aiznesja uz sovu elni, kur jis tagad dzeivoj.","source":"V. Zacharska no St. Žeigura Balvu pag.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-057-E01","start":242,"end":283,"span":"aizzamaldīja un navar nikai tikt uz ceļa.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"lost/unable to reach route","evidence":"aizzamaldīja un navar nikai tikt uz ceļa","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-057-E02","start":424,"end":443,"span":"Kungs verās uz zača","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-057-E03","start":594,"end":625,"span":"redz, ka preti jam skrīn lopsa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-057-E04","start":997,"end":1032,"span":"Verās: īt jam preti nazkaids zvērs.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified perceived entity","evidence":"nazkaids zvērs","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-057-E05","start":1099,"end":1140,"span":"Zvērs tvēŗa kungu uz muguras un aiznesja.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit bodily seizure; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pa mežu","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":"staiguodams pa mežu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.090403,"lon":27.238356,"label":"place-0039","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140118006","id":"140118006","collection":"LV","title":"Velni ēd cilvēkus","text":"Gar Tirzas kapiem bieži braucis gaŗām pa tumsu pie radiem vietējais kungs. Katru reizi, iznākuši no kapsētas uz ceļa divi melni kungi un saukuši kungu, lai nāk līdzi šiem kapos. Kučiers uzšāvis zirgiem un ātri aizbraucis. Kungs sarīkojis viesības. Viesībās kungs teicis citiem kungiem, ka gar tiem Tirzas kapiem esot nejauka braukšana, un stāstījis par tiem diviem melniem kungiem. Citi kungi neticējuši: nelabas asinis vien tās esot. Bet kungs nav mierā, ka citi netic. Sader ar citiem neticīgajiem kungiem uz lielu naudas zumu. Kungs noraksta vēstuli radiem un iedod vienam no neticīgajiem kungiem, kuŗš brauks gar kapiem, pārliecināties par stāstīto, un vēstuli aizvedīs radiem. Bet līdz ko tiekot pret kapsētu, tā divi melni kungi klāt: viens tur zirgu pie galvas, otrs ved no kamanām kungu kapos. Kapos saceļas liels viesulis, izgrūž kādu kapu un norauj zārkam vāku. Zārkā guļ mironis, uz krūtim kastīte. Melnais kungs sūta lielkungu, lai paņem no miroņa krūtim kastīti. Lielkungs ne un ne! \"Nebīsties, ļauns nekas nenotiks, ņem droši kastīti!\" saka melnais kungs. Pēdīgi lielkungs arī paņem kastīti. Šinī mirklī melnais kungs ar atvērto kapu pazūd. Lielkungs noved vēstuli un brauc rītā atpakaļ. Citi kungi prasa, kā labi izbraukājis. — Nelabi. Kas par vainu? Tā un tā. Un vēl tik daudz tūkstošu naudas jāzaudē! Bet neko darīt! Kungi jūtoties ļoti pārsteigti un nobaidījušies. Visi brīnoties par kastīti, kuŗu kungs no kapiem paņēmis līdzi. Neviens nedrīkstot taisīt vaļā. Atsaucot mācītāju. Mācītājs attaisot. Kastītē bijušas septiņas dievmaizītes. Mācītājs paņemot baznīcas grāmatu un lasot. Viens jauneklis bijis septiņas reizes pie Dievgalda, bet neesot maizītes apēdis, — noglabājis tās kapos. Mirdams lūdzis, lai ieliekot zārkā tam maizītes līdz. Velns jaunekļa miesu kā derīgu būtu apēdis, bet nedrīkstējis, jo miroņam uz krūtim bijušas dievmaizītes.","source":"A. Vaskis Tukumā.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-058-E01","start":1106,"end":1154,"span":"Šinī mirklī melnais kungs ar atvērto kapu pazūd.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"melnais kungs ar atvērto kapu pazūd","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual witnessed disappearance; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Tirzas kapiem","environment":"cemetery","time":"pa tumsu","movement":"bieži braucis gaŗām"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.969664,"lon":23.15319,"label":"place-0487","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140119003","id":"140119003","collection":"LV","title":"Velni tiek piemānīti","text":"Viens tēvs izdalījis dēliem mantu, bet jaunākajam nedevis nekā. Jaunākais bēdīgs staigājis pa mežu un apmaldījies. Maldījies labu laiku; beidzot iesaucies: \"Kaut pats velns man palīdzētu!\"\n\nTe velns klāt: ko gribot? \"Tā un tā — tēvs citiem brāļiem atdeva mantu, man nekā, un nu vēl apmaldījos.\"\n\n\"Nekas!\" velns mierinājis, \"dari, kā es vēlos, tev klāsies labi. Es izvedīšu tevi no meža un dāvināšu dzirnavas, bet tev jāliek saviem puišiem katru dienu malējus apzagt.\"\n\n\"Jā, jā!\" jaunākais pa gaŗu laiku apsolījies.\n\nVelns nu izvedis viņu no meža un iedevis varenas dzirnavas, īsā laikā palicis bagāts, bet zagt neļāvis saviem puišiem, lai kas. Te otrā gadā velns klāt: \"Kādēļ nezagi? Nu es tevi iznīcināšu!\"\n\nTo sacījis, velns iegāzies ezerā un sācis ūdeni arvienu augstāk celt, arvienu augstāk — gandrīz jau plūdis krastiem pāri. \"Ko nu?\" jaunais melderis domājis, \"labi vairs nav.\"\n\nBet ātrumā viņam ienācis labs padoms prātā, sasitis (rokas) plaukstis un iedziedājies kā gailis. Tā tūliņ velns no ezera ārā un prom. Nu melderis dzīvojis laimīgi.","source":"LP, V, 159, 46, 48.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-059-E01","start":64,"end":135,"span":"Jaunākais bēdīgs staigājis pa mežu un apmaldījies. Maldījies labu laiku","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"lost","evidence":"apmaldījies. Maldījies labu laiku","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-059-E02","start":929,"end":981,"span":"sasitis (rokas) plaukstis un iedziedājies kā gailis.","modalities":["auditory","touch"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later at lake; deliberate sound imitation, hand contact.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pa mežu","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140119005","id":"140119005","collection":"LV","title":"Velni tiek piemānīti","text":"Reiz mazs puisēns ganīja lopus. Dagāja pie viņa svešs vīrs un vedināja zēnu sev līdzi iet, nemaz nestāstīdams, kur jāiet un kas pats tāds ir. Zēns negāja. Mājā pārnācis, viņš to pastāstīja savai mātei. Māte atteica: \"Kad vēl kādu reizi danāk tas pats vīrs un vedina tevi līdzi iet, tad vari arī iet.\" Pēc pāra dienām zēns atkal ganīja avis. Pienāk tas pats vīrs un lūgdams vedina līdzi iet uz kādu laiku — gan atkal atlaidīšot. Zēns, avis uz mājas pusi patrencis, aizgāja svešajam līdzi. Labu gabalu gājuši, tie nonāca pie ļoti liela akmeņa. Svešais sita pa akmeni spēcīgi ar dūri — durvis atvērās, viņi iegāja iekšā. (Svešais esot bijis pats vells). Nu viņš tam rādīja savu bagātību, no kuŗas zēnam acis mānīt apmānījās — tik lielu dārgumu viņš vēl nekad nebija redzējis. Svešais viņam solījās daudz bagātības un arī labu slavu dot, ja paklausīgs būšot — rādīja arī pie sienas pakarinātu stabulīti, bet to nesacīja, kas ar stabulīti darāms. Zēnam klājās labi. Kādu dienu, kamēr vells, no lauka pārnācis, piekusis apgulās, zēns paņēma stabuli no sienas un sāka stabulēt. Te visi vella palīgi klāt — tie kliedza un brēca uz savu virsnieku, prasīdami, kas jādara. Bet virsnieks tos raidīja projām, teikdams, ka mazais zēns nezinādams esot pastabulējis. Visi vella palīgi, kas izskatījās kā siseņi, atkal aizgāja — pats viņš mierīgi apgulās. Nu zēns paņēma stabuli un itin klusi izgāja no akmeņa un steidzās uz māju. Mājā tam uzstāja, lai stāstot, kur bijis. Zēns atbildēja: \"Biju paša vella mājā un šī ir tā stabule ar kuŗu vellam visu spēku (palīgas) atņēmu; tikai skataities nu, kā vella kalpi manā priekšā dancos.\" Zēns stabulēja un nu vella kalpi kā siseņi dancoja viņa priekšā. Pēc brītiņa zēns stabulēdams tos sūtīja atpakaļ uz savām vietām. Vells atmodies atrada, ka mazais zēns to piekrāpis: stabule nebija vairs uzietama. Ilgu laiku zēns ar stabuli vellu vārdzināja, kamēr tad vells atkal stabuli zēnam nozaga un savu spēku atdabūja.","source":"Jānis Matisons Liezeres Raudotos. Brīvzemnieka k r. LP, VII, I, 30, 2.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-060-E01","start":685,"end":772,"span":"no kuŗas zēnam acis mānīt apmānījās — tik lielu dārgumu viņš vēl nekad nebija redzējis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"visual overwhelm","evidence":"acis mānīt apmānījās","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Idiom can mean dazzled rather than deceived; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-060-E02","start":1056,"end":1070,"span":"sāka stabulēt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-060-E03","start":1099,"end":1137,"span":"tie kliedza un brēca uz savu virsnieku","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-060-E04","start":1270,"end":1294,"span":"kas izskatījās kā siseņi","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Appearance simile, not identity claim; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-060-E05","start":1616,"end":1680,"span":"Zēns stabulēja un nu vella kalpi kā siseņi dancoja viņa priekšā.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Later mājā; visual contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"no akmeņa","environment":"rock interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.018123,"lon":26.059641,"label":"place-0253","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140120007","id":"140120007","collection":"LV","title":"Velni tiek sisti","text":"Vienas mājas rijā dzīvājis velns. Rija nodegusi un velns pārgājis uz pirti un dzīvājis uz pirts krāsns augšas. Kad cilvēki pirtī mazgājušies, velns pārvērties cilvēka izskatā un arī nācis pie pirtniekiem. Viņš visus pierakstījis, kas pirtī bļaustījušies vai svilpojuši.\n\nBet mājas cilvēki nodomājuši velnu pārmācīt. Tie nolikuši pirtī ķipi, pilnu ar vārošu ūdeni, un gaidījuši velnu. Kad kāds iebļāvies, velns bijis tūliņ klāt. Kad velns pagriezies, viens vīrs paķēris ķipi ar verdošo ūdeni un uzlējis to velnam uz muguras. Velns nelabi iebļāvies un acumirklī no cilvēka pārvērties par velnu ar gaŗu asti un no pirts ārā!\n\nNo tās reizes velns neticis vairs pirtī manīts.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenes pag.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-061-E01","start":230,"end":269,"span":"kas pirtī bļaustījušies vai svilpojuši.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic vocal activity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-061-E02","start":384,"end":427,"span":"Kad kāds iebļāvies, velns bijis tūliņ klāt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-061-E03","start":450,"end":523,"span":"viens vīrs paķēris ķipi ar verdošo ūdeni un uzlējis to velnam uz muguras.","modalities":["touch","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Thermal contact explicit; experiencer velns; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-061-E04","start":524,"end":546,"span":"Velns nelabi iebļāvies","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-061-E05","start":623,"end":670,"span":"No tās reizes velns neticis vairs pirtī manīts.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Subsequent non-detection; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pirtī","environment":"bathhouse","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","other"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.451421,"lon":25.864327,"label":"place-0442","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140121011","id":"140121011","collection":"LV","title":"Pērkons vajā velnus","text":"Viens vīrs reiz gājis uz mežu malkas cirst. Te samākusies debess un viņš baidīdamies no lietus, nostājies zem viena kupla ozola. Viņam tur stāvot atskrien viens velnēns, pieskrien pie vienas lielas alas turpat ozolam blakus un sauc: \"Vectēv, padod man manu cepuri!\" Cepuri dabūjis, viņš paceļas gaisā un aizskrien. Tāpat dara arī citi velnēni, kuŗus vīrs saskaita pavisam divpadsmit. Kad nu neviens velnēns vairs nenāk, tad arī viņš pats pieiet pie alas un saka: \"Vectēv, padod man manu cepuri!\" No alas viņam atbild: \"Tavas cepures vairs še nav, laikam kāds velnēns būs divas paķēris. Bet še tev velna vectēva cepure!\" Vīrs apskata to cepuri, un izrādās, ka tā ir taisīta no cilvēka roku un kāju nagiem. Bet līdz ko viņš uzliek cepuri galvā, arī viņš nu paceļas gaisā un top aiznests pie citiem velnēniem. Tur nu viņš novēro, kādu ļaunumu tie dara cilvēkiem. Cits dzīvo krogā un skubina ļaudis uz dzeršanu un plēšanos. Cits ieiet mājā un kurina ienaidu starp vīru un sievu, saimnieku un kalpiem. Cits attura ļaudis no baznīcas un māca tos uz zādzībām un slepkavībām. Vīrs griežas atkal atpakaļ pie ozola un nomet velna cepuri zemē. Te uzreiz nāk stiprs pērkona spēriens, kas saspeŗ un sadedzina velna alu ar visu nosviesto cepuri.","source":"P. Šmits no P. Zeltiņas Ikšķilē.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-062-E01","start":344,"end":383,"span":"kuŗus vīrs saskaita pavisam divpadsmit.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Counting visible agents; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-062-E02","start":620,"end":704,"span":"Vīrs apskata to cepuri, un izrādās, ka tā ir taisīta no cilvēka roku un kāju nagiem.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-062-E03","start":807,"end":859,"span":"Tur nu viņš novēro, kādu ļaunumu tie dara cilvēkiem.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Several subsequent locations; observation stated without a particular modality; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-062-E04","start":1133,"end":1170,"span":"Te uzreiz nāk stiprs pērkona spēriens","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Thunderclap acoustic reading; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"zem viena kupla ozola","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.833558,"lon":24.49544,"label":"place-0146","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140121014","id":"140121014","collection":"LV","title":"Pērkons vajā velnus","text":"Seces pagastā, Kampānu ciemā, mazā mājiņā dzīvojis skroderis ar savu sievu. Reic sācis stipri lietus līt. Skroderiene bijusi viena pati mājā. Viņai bijušas izvelētās drēbes žāvējamas. Nodomājusi to uz klēts augšas sakārt. Domāts, darīts. Uzkāpusi uz klēts augšas un sākusi vešu kārt. Lietus gāzis kā ar spaiņiem un pērkons graudis briesmīgi. Palicis ļoti tumšs. Dzirdot piepēži, ka kāds pa trepēm kāpjot, ka čīkstot vien. Domājusi, ka tas jau būšot vīrs. Piepēži tāds spalvains uzklupis, sācis mocīt un žņaugt. Zibenis krustām viem šķēlis apkārt. Sieviņa nāves bailēs izsauksies: \"Ak, Dievs!\" Tikko šos vārdus izteikusi, spalvainais kā kūlenis pa trepēm novēlies, — nobrikšķējis — vien. Velns vēlies un aizvēlies uz tuvējo kaimiņu riju un nozudis. Pēkšņi briesmīgi nodārdējis. Pērkons iespēris rijā un rija nodegusi.\n\nNo Kampānu ciema netālīt ir purvs. Purva vidū liels, liels apsūnojis akmenis. Uz tā akmens bieži vien pa dienvidiem redzēta meita sēžot un matus sukājot. No tās reizes, kad pērkons rijā iespēris, tā vairs neesot redzēta.","source":"Arv. Porietis Secē. Latvju kultūras kr.","category":"Velni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-063-E01","start":315,"end":341,"span":"pērkons graudis briesmīgi.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E02","start":342,"end":361,"span":"Palicis ļoti tumšs.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Ambient light explicitly described, observer contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E03","start":362,"end":421,"span":"Dzirdot piepēži, ka kāds pa trepēm kāpjot, ka čīkstot vien.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"mistaken source identity","evidence":"Domājusi, ka tas jau būšot vīrs","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E04","start":455,"end":510,"span":"Piepēži tāds spalvains uzklupis, sācis mocīt un žņaugt.","modalities":["touch","pressure","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E05","start":511,"end":546,"span":"Zibenis krustām viem šķēlis apkārt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Ambient visual phenomenon, observer contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E06","start":621,"end":686,"span":"spalvainais kā kūlenis pa trepēm novēlies, — nobrikšķējis — vien.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E07","start":748,"end":776,"span":"Pēkšņi briesmīgi nodārdējis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E08","start":896,"end":971,"span":"Uz tā akmens bieži vien pa dienvidiem redzēta meita sēžot un matus sukājot.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Separate episode at purvs; time pa dienvidiem; unspecified observers.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-063-E09","start":1014,"end":1038,"span":"tā vairs neesot redzēta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Subsequent generic non-seeing at bog.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uz klēts augšas","environment":"storehouse","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.559895,"lon":25.3972,"label":"place-0423","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140201012","id":"140201012","collection":"LV","title":"Cilvēka mirstamais laiks ir nolemts","text":"Viena kundze pavadījusi vecu gadu un gaidījusi jaunu. Kad bijusi pašu reizi pusnakts, tad uzsaukusi kalponei, lai iet un skatās krāsnī. Kalpone iet, bet satrūkusies iekliedzas. Kundze prasa: kāpēc tā esot kliegusi? Meita dusmodamās atbild, kāpēc kundze viņu esot pievīlusi, jo pats kungs pliks esot ielīdis krāsnī. Kundze to pašu gadu nomirusi; bet kungs nu apprecējis kalponi.","source":"Skolotājs J. Kalniņš Garkalnē. Brīvzemnieka kr. LP, VII, I, 527, 5.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-064-E01","start":136,"end":176,"span":"Kalpone iet, bet satrūkusies iekliedzas.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Her own scream.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-064-E02","start":274,"end":314,"span":"jo pats kungs pliks esot ielīdis krāsnī.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"apparent identity","evidence":"jo pats kungs pliks esot ielīdis krāsnī","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual report of what she saw; no textual disproof of identity; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"krāsnī","environment":"domestic interior","time":"pusnakts","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.045849,"lon":24.418654,"label":"place-0123","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140202009","id":"140202009","collection":"LV","title":"Cilvēka miršana","text":"Reiz nomiris viens saimnieks mūsu pagastā un nolikts klētī. Pusdienā viņš izgājis no klēts un saucis puisi, kas ratos gulējis, lai nākot viņam līdzi. Puisim bijis jāiet. Apstaigājuši visus laukus un, pārnākuši mājās, saimnieks atkal zārkā nogulies. Puisis tūliņ pierādījis, ka saimnieks viņu vedis — palags arī bijis slapjš; bet drīzī pēc tam puisis no bailēm nomiris.","source":"Emīlija Jurkovska Ūziņos. Jkr. IV. LP, VII, I, 32, 4.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Calling and following narrated; ordinary communication excluded; wet sheet is evidence asserted, no separate perception predicate.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.479051,"lon":23.566532,"label":"place-0605","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140207003","id":"140207003","collection":"LV","title":"Melnā grāmata","text":"Vecā Laidzes skola bijusi uztaisīta uz veciem kapiem, tādēļ tur pa naktim spokojies. Kad bērni jau visi apgulušies, tad pa grīdu viens sācis laist vilciņus. Reiz zēni sarunājuši laist savus vilciņus arī barā. Bet tad izcēlies liels troksnis, skolotājs iznācis un sabāris zēnus, kāpēc neļauj vilciņiem dejot. Citu reizi zēni nejauši uzgājuši skolotāja burvības grāmatu. Ka sākuši to lasīt; pieradusies pilna klase miroņu. Tad par laimi uznācis skolotājs Viņš izsējis klasē linsēklas ko mironiem salasīt, kamēr pats paguvis grāmatā uziet atlaižamos vārdus.","source":"J. A. Jansons Vandzenē.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-066-E01","start":209,"end":240,"span":"Bet tad izcēlies liels troksnis","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Vecā Laidzes skola","environment":"school","time":"pa naktim","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.307962,"lon":22.76919,"label":"place-0511","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140208019","id":"140208019","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi māžojas","text":"Šis gadījums esot noticis priekš kādiem četradesmit gadiem. To man stāstīja Tamsona kundze, jo viss tas esot tad noticis, kad viņa bijusi vēl maza meitenīte. Viņas vecāki dzīvojuši tai pašā namā, ko līdz šim dēvē par Tamsona namu. Viņi esot dzīvojuši otrā galā, ne tur, kur tagadējie Tamsoni. Tas noticis no veca gada vakara ieejot jaunā gadā.\n\nTalsos tolaik dzīvojis viens nabags, kas bijis jau labi pavecs. Vienu reizi viņš iedomājies ienākt un aplūkot, ko visi šai pieminētā namā darot un kā viņiem klājoties. Ienācis un apsēdies pie krāsns, bet bijis tāds novārdzis un savāds, nav neko runājis, kādu laiciņu pasēdējies, tad cēlies augšā un gribējis iet projām. Paņēmis vēl savu nastiņu un sācis celties augšā, te piepēži viņš nokritis gar zemi, un nav vairs cēlies augšā. Mājas ļaudis redzējuši, ka viņš vairs augšā neceļas, gājuši klāt raudzīt, kas viņam noticis, bet šis jau bijis nomiris. Pēc tam aizgājuši viņu uz kapsētu un apglabājuši.\n\nBez pašiem saimniekiem mājās dzīvojuši pie viņiem vēl piemītnieki. Šie piemītnieki veca gada vakarā aizgājuši no mājām projām, un citu ļaužu mājās vairs nav bijis kā tikai viena namniece. Viņa bijusi apgulusies. Te pēc kāda laiciņa viņa dzird sarunu un ienāk no āra pa durvim tā kā divi cilvēki. Viņa gan nodomā, ka piemītnieki ienākuši, tomēr nevar saprast, kā viņi tikuši iekšā, jo durvis viņa no iekšpuses aiztaisījusi. Tā viņa domājusi gulēt tālāk, bet te viņa dzird, it kā klusu bubināšanu, pēc tam viens saka: \"Nez cik būs pulkstens, jāpaskatās!\" Bet namniece redz pēc kāda laiciņa, ka otrā istabā viens uzrauj spičku, paskatās pulkstenī un nosaka: \"Pulkstens ir viens.\" Pēc tam viss paliek klusu, ka nekas vairs nav dzirdams. No rīta viņa pamodusies un apskatījusies, ka mājā nav neviena cilvēka. Viņa nav varējusi saprast, kur piemītnieki palikuši. Pēc kāda laiciņa viņa dzird, ka pie loga klapē, iet laist iekšā un redz, kā iemītnieki tikai tagad pārnāk mājās. Viņa tūliņ šiem uzprasa: \"Vai tad jūs nakti nebijāt mājā?\" Viņi atteikuši, ka nav bijuši. Pēc tam namniece izstāstījusi, ko viņa nakti dzirdējusi, bet šie tikai brīnījušies un nav varējuši izprast, kas tur par lietu.\n\nBet nu ceļas liels jautājums, kas tad nu ir bijis naktī istabā, kad durvis no iekšpuses ir bijušas aiztaisītas. Sākuši domāt, ka nabags būšot nācis apskatīt savu vietu, kur viņš miris, un paņēmis arī savu draugu līdz tam parādīt. Tad mājnieki iedzinuši tai vietā naglu, kur viņš miris, no tā laika nav vairs nekas spokojies.","source":"Skolniece Tomsone Talsos. T. Dzintarkalna krājumā.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-067-E01","start":776,"end":827,"span":"Mājas ļaudis redzējuši, ka viņš vairs augšā neceļas","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier episode; group experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E02","start":1179,"end":1242,"span":"viņa dzird sarunu un ienāk no āra pa durvim tā kā divi cilvēki.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"source identity/access","evidence":"tomēr nevar saprast, kā viņi tikuši iekšā","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual component contextual, tā kā qualified; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E03","start":1407,"end":1441,"span":"viņa dzird, it kā klusu bubināšanu","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate sound","evidence":"it kā klusu bubināšanu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E04","start":1504,"end":1590,"span":"namniece redz pēc kāda laiciņa, ka otrā istabā viens uzrauj spičku, paskatās pulkstenī","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E05","start":1632,"end":1679,"span":"viss paliek klusu, ka nekas vairs nav dzirdams.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E06","start":1680,"end":1750,"span":"No rīta viņa pamodusies un apskatījusies, ka mājā nav neviena cilvēka.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"missing expected people","evidence":"Viņa nav varējusi saprast, kur piemītnieki palikuši","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Time No rīta.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E07","start":1821,"end":1850,"span":"viņa dzird, ka pie loga klapē","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-067-E08","start":1871,"end":1916,"span":"redz, kā iemītnieki tikai tagad pārnāk mājās.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"retrospective source mismatch","evidence":"Vai tad jūs nakti nebijāt mājā?","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning; question tests prior identification.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Tamsona namu","environment":"domestic interior","time":"no veca gada vakara ieejot jaunā gadā","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.248041,"lon":22.587386,"label":"place-0470","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140208029","id":"140208029","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi māžojas","text":"Viens jauns saimnieks pavedis savu dienastmeitu. Pēdīgi viņš saskaities un padzinis to meitu. Tā aizgājusi mežā, dzemdējusi tur bērnu, tad nožņaugusi to un pati pakārusies. Ļaudis gan šo un to par to runājuši, bet pēdīgi valodas apklusušas.\n\nPēc tam saimnieks apprecējies, dzīvojis kārtīgi, bet nekad negribējis braukt pa to mežu, kur tā meita pakārusies. Pēc septiņiem gadiem saimniece gribējusi apmeklēt savus vecākus un pierunājusi arī saimnieku aizbraukt ar viņu kopā uz vecāku māju. Taisns ceļš gājis caur minēto mežu, bet saimnieks tur negribējis braukt. Saimniece brīnījusies, kādēļ šis domājot braukt ar līkumu. Saimnieks arī negribējis nekā stāstīt un braucis taisni caur mežu. Braucot viņi dzirdējuši mežā kādu bērnu raudam, par ko saimnieks ļoti sabijies, bet nekā nesacījis. Tas pats atkal noticis atpakaļ braucot. Saimniece brīnīdamies prasījusi: \"Kas tur varētu raudāt?\" Vīrs nu vairs nevarējis nociesties un izstāstījis sievai visu savu noziegumu. Saimniece par to ļoti saskaitusies, atstājusi savu vīru un izstāstījusi visu gadījumu tiesai. Saimniekam nu beidzot bijis jāstājas tiesas priekšā.","source":"P. Šmits no P. Zeltiņas Vidzemes Katrīnas draudzē.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-068-E01","start":695,"end":733,"span":"viņi dzirdējuši mežā kādu bērnu raudam","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-068-E02","start":787,"end":826,"span":"Tas pats atkal noticis atpakaļ braucot.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"source identity","evidence":"Kas tur varētu raudāt?","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Anaphoric repeat supported by preceding explicit hearing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"mežā","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":"Braucot"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.957882,"lon":24.249131,"label":"place-0541","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140208032","id":"140208032","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi māžojas","text":"Plades kroga pirtī (Skultes draudzē) reiz puisis pakāries. Un vienu svētvakaru, tā ap pulksten 11, tai pašā pirtī trīs žīdi pērušies. Tikām pērušies, uz vienu reizi izdzirdējuši uz pirts griestiem troksni, itkā ratu rībienu, tādu. Pēc trokšņa ātri jo ātri pirts griesti atvērušies un viena kāja slīdējusi uz zemi. Žīdi pirmā brīdī briesmīgi pārbijušies, bet trešais, vecākais, bijis drusku drošāks: tas aizdedzinājis skalu un laidis kājai uguni klāt. Kā pielaidis uguni, tā — joki nebūs — kāja itin piepēži izstiepusies līdz grīdai un žīdi pliki izsprukuši ārā, saukdami ļaudis palīgā. Atskrējuši ļaudis, tie jau zinājuši, kas darāms, saukuši: \"Jāni, Jāni, ko tu gribi?\" (Jānis bijis puisim vārdā, kas pirtī nokāries). Tad viena balss atbildējusi: \"Es tikai gribēju to žīdu, kas manu kājas pirkstu sadedzināja.\" Rītā gājuši pirtī skatīties, atraduši pirts krāsni saspārdītu un žīdiem palikušās drānas lupatu lēveros saplosītas. Velns neļāvis Jānim dusēt.","source":"Dāvids Vilks Mangaļos. LP, VII, I, 96, 9.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-069-E01","start":165,"end":230,"span":"izdzirdējuši uz pirts griestiem troksni, itkā ratu rībienu, tādu.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate sound/source","evidence":"itkā ratu rībienu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-069-E02","start":256,"end":313,"span":"pirts griesti atvērušies un viena kāja slīdējusi uz zemi.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Perception contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-069-E03","start":489,"end":531,"span":"kāja itin piepēži izstiepusies līdz grīdai","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unstable appearance","evidence":"kāja itin piepēži izstiepusies līdz grīdai","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual perception; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-069-E04","start":719,"end":811,"span":"Tad viena balss atbildējusi: \"Es tikai gribēju to žīdu, kas manu kājas pirkstu sadedzināja.\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Voice explicitly singled out; reported burn not independently experienced by listeners.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Plades kroga pirtī","environment":"bathhouse","time":"svētvakaru, tā ap pulksten 11","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140208058","id":"140208058","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi māžojas","text":"Vasaras dienā viens baldzietis brauc gar Krusta kalnu. Pie kapsētas vārtiem piebraucis, viņš ieraudzījis uz ceļa melnu dzijas kamolu. Ātri pacēlis kamolu un braucis tālāku. Bet tavu brīnumu! — kamols arvienu lielāks un lielāks tapis, kamēr pēdīgi visi rati tā pārpildīti, ka pašam baldzietim bijis jakāpj no ratiem ārā. Viņš gribējis izgrūst kamolu no ratiem, bet nav varējis, jo tas bijis ļoti smags, tā ka pēc pat zirgs vairs nav varējis pavilkt un apstājies kādu ceturtdaļversti no kapsētas. Zirgam apstājoties, kamols pārvērties par melnu putnu un aizskrējis uz kapsētu, kliegdams: \"Pie citiem, pie citiem! ko es viens\". Baldzietis nu priecīgs braucis atkal tālāk uz Skujeni.","source":"Bērziņš Piebalgā. \"Baltijas Vēstneša\" piel. 1894. LP, VII, I, 124, 1.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-070-E01","start":88,"end":133,"span":"viņš ieraudzījis uz ceļa melnu dzijas kamolu.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-070-E02","start":320,"end":400,"span":"Viņš gribējis izgrūst kamolu no ratiem, bet nav varējis, jo tas bijis ļoti smags","modalities":["pressure","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Weight encountered through effort; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-070-E03","start":515,"end":624,"span":"kamols pārvērties par melnu putnu un aizskrējis uz kapsētu, kliegdams: \"Pie citiem, pie citiem! ko es viens\".","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"changed appearance","evidence":"kamols pārvērties par melnu putnu","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual perception contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Pie kapsētas vārtiem","environment":"cemetery threshold","time":"Vasaras dienā","movement":"brauc gar Krusta kalnu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.151391,"lon":25.992021,"label":"place-0345","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140208074","id":"140208074","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi māžojas","text":"Jaun-Gulbenes Skubiņu silā ir pazīstāmi trīs kalniņi: Darvas, Kapu un Vēžu kalniņš. Jaukākais no tiem ir Vēžu kalniņš. Agrāk Liedes upē bijis daudz vēžu. Vēžotāji, kas braukuši no diezgan plašas apkārtnes, bieži uz kalniņa vārījuši vēžus.\n\nBet ievērojamākais ar saviem nostāstiem ir Kapu kalniņš. Šai kalniņā esot aprakts nekristīts bērns. Ja agrāk naktī divpadsmitos gadījies braukt caur Skubiņu silu, tad zirgs neesot gājis Kapu kalniņam pāri. Reiz viens saimnieks braucis no Liedes kroga uz māju. Klausoties, kalniņā tā kā bērns raudot. Tiekot pie kalniņa, zirgs vairs tālāk neejot. Viņš uzsitis ar pātagu, bet zirgs neiet un neiet. Nu saimnieks iedomājies ļaužu nostāstus par Kapu kalniņu. Viņš izkāpis no ratiem un teicis: \"Ja puisēns, tad viņa vārds ir Ancītis; ja meitene, tad Grietiņa.\" Tūliņ raudāšana apklususi, un zirgs mierīgi gājis pāri kalniņam. No tās reizes neesot vairs nekas dzirdēts Kapu kalniņā.","source":"Marta Lorence Jaun-Gulbenē.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-071-E01","start":500,"end":539,"span":"Klausoties, kalniņā tā kā bērns raudot.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate sound/source","evidence":"tā kā bērns raudot","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-071-E02","start":795,"end":820,"span":"Tūliņ raudāšana apklususi","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-071-E03","start":860,"end":915,"span":"No tās reizes neesot vairs nekas dzirdēts Kapu kalniņā.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Subsequent generic absence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kapu kalniņā","environment":"hill","time":"naktī divpadsmitos","movement":"braucis no Liedes kroga uz māju"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.063187,"lon":26.597362,"label":"place-0159","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140209013","id":"140209013","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi prasa, lai aprok","text":"Caur Bilskas pagasta Pārkalņu mežu naktīs braucot, ceļiniekus pavadot sieviete ar diviem raudošiem bērniem uz rokām. Veci ļaudis stāsta, ka sieviete ar bērniem vecos laikos tur esot nogalināta un mežā kaut kur aprakta. Ja viņas kaulus atrastu un noraktu svētītā zemē, tad tā vairs nestaigātu.","source":"Kārlis Skujiņa Bilskas pag.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-072-E01","start":70,"end":116,"span":"sieviete ar diviem raudošiem bērniem uz rokām.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic encounter; explicit crying, no named perceiver; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Pārkalņu mežu","environment":"forest","time":"naktīs","movement":"braucot"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140209031","id":"140209031","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi prasa, lai aprok","text":"Nurmuižu Jaunmuižā vienmēr spokojās: melns mučkulis izveļas no bēniņiem uz kukņu, tad tālāk uz klēti. Daudzi to redzējuši. Reizēm atkal pulksten divpadsmitos dzird kādu troksni. Viens kalps stāstījis, ka viņam rādījies sapnī jauns cilvēks pelēkās drēbēs. Tas teicis: \"Izdari 1abu darbu un aiznes mani uz kapiem, man laiks mirt. Tu esi tāds pats mātes bērns kā es: tev nav tēva un man arī ne. Uzej bēniņos un uzmeklē no skursteņa trešo dēli, to paceļ uz augšu, tur ir mani kauli.\" Kalps pastāsta to vagāram. Un tiešām atrod zem trešā dēļa bērna kauliņus. Visus kauliņus saņēma un paglabāja tīruma kapos. Pēc tam vairs spoks nav rādījies.","source":"M. Mālmeistere Nurmuižā.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-073-E01","start":37,"end":122,"span":"melns mučkulis izveļas no bēniņiem uz kukņu, tad tālāk uz klēti. Daudzi to redzējuši.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate form","evidence":"melns mučkulis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Mučkulis retains local shape wording; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-073-E02","start":123,"end":177,"span":"Reizēm atkal pulksten divpadsmitos dzird kādu troksni.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit time pulksten divpadsmitos; do not assume midnight.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-073-E03","start":204,"end":254,"span":"viņam rādījies sapnī jauns cilvēks pelēkās drēbēs.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual experiencer kalps.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Nurmuižu Jaunmuižā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.226405,"lon":22.762069,"label":"place-0316","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140211024","id":"140211024","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi prasa savas mantas","text":"Nomirusi veca saimniece. Viņa dzīva būdama bijusi ātras dabas. Pēc bērēm saimniece naktīs nākusi uz savu kambari un staigājusi tur, ka klaudzējis vien, vai arī bīdījusi krēslus, vai ko meklējusi, ka laukšējis vien. Visi mājinieki, pa naktim, dzirdējuši savādo troksni nomirušās saimnieces kambarī un neviens tur nedrīkstējis gulēt. Tā tas gājis ilgi. Saimniece ik naktis nākusi uz savu kambari. Mājinieki no ļaunuma nekā netikuši vaļā.\n\nReiz ienākusi veca ubadze, kas tur palikusi pa nakti. Nabadze dzirdējusi, kā saimniece pa savu kambari naktī darbojas. Viņa izmācījusi jauno saimnieci, kā lai dara, un tad būšot no jaunuma vaļā. Jaunā saimniece arī tā izdarījusi. Viņa sestdienas vakara krēslā aizgājusi uz kapsētu, ietinusi dziesmu grāmatas lapā sidraba naudas gabalu un to iekasījusi nomirušās saimnieces kapa kopiņā. No tās reizes nomirusī saimniece uz savu kambari pa naktim vairs nenākusi. Saimniece pēc nāves staigājusi tādēļ, ka pakaļpalicēji laikam neesot kādu viņas vēlēšanos izpildījuši, vai arī nedevuši tai zārkā līdzi kādu lietu, ko viņa mirstot novēlējusi.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenes pag.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-074-E01","start":215,"end":296,"span":"Visi mājinieki, pa naktim, dzirdējuši savādo troksni nomirušās saimnieces kambarī","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Walking/furniture sounds consolidated as repeated episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-074-E02","start":491,"end":555,"span":"Nabadze dzirdējusi, kā saimniece pa savu kambari naktī darbojas.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"New individual experiencer, later night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"saimnieces kambarī","environment":"domestic interior","time":"pa naktim","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.451421,"lon":25.864327,"label":"place-0442","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140213008","id":"140213008","collection":"LV","title":"Sulainis ar mirušo kungu","text":"Reiz dzīvojis precējies kungs. Un tas dzīvojis ar velnu uz vienu roku. Bet viņam bijis kučieris, stalts puika vārdā Ansis.\n\nUn tā nu dzīvojuši, dzīvojuši pēdīgi kungs nomiris, bet Ansis ielūkojis sava kunga atraikni. Šī arī gājēja bijusi, tikai to teikusi: \"Labi! bet tad tu ej pagrabā, kur mans nelaiķa kungs dus, un izgulies trīs naktis no vietas viņa zārkam blakus. Ja to izpildīsi, tad apņemšu tevi un iecelšu par kungu.\" Labi. Ansis tūliņ licis varkalim uzkalt skārdes kreklu, uzvilcis mugurā un novakarā aizgājis uz pagrabu, nolicies nelaiķa kungam blakus zārkā. Gulējis, gulējis — te ap pusnakti kungs celsies tikai augšā. Ko Ansis darīs? Cēlies arī augšā.\n\n\"Ko, vai tu, Ansi, arī esi nomiris?\" kungs vaicājis.\n\n\"Jā, esmu arī miris!\" Ansis atbild.\n\n\"Nu, kad tikai tu nemelo vien?\"\n\n\"Ja jūs, kungs, neticat, aptaustait manu miesu!\"\n\nKungs aptaustījis skārdes kreklu un atradis, ka Anša miesa patiesi auksta, un nu ticējis gan.\n\n\"Kur nu iesim?\" runājuši.\n\nNoprātojuši iet kunga pilī. Un abi iegājuši pilī, izdzīvojušies pa visām istabām, izmētājuši visu, salauzuši visu, ko tikai nogrābuši, un tad aizgājuši atpakaļ uz pagrabu. Bet iegājuši pagrabā, kungs saka Ansim: \"Liecies tu, Ansi, pirmais zārkā!\" Ansis atkratījies: \"Nē, kungs, tā es dzīvs būdams esmu sekojis jums, tā miris sekošu!\" Neko darīt — licies kungs pirmais zārkā un tad Ansis.\n\nOtrā naktī tāpat: kungs izceļas no zārka, Ansis arī. Un tagad norunājuši abi divi izstaigāties pa laukiem. Apstaigājuši, nopostījuši visus laukus un atkal atgriezušies pagrabā atpakaļ. Pārnākuši un sākuši atkal tiepties, kam piekrīt pirmajam apgulties. Bet Ansis palicis pie tam, kā dzīvē sekojis, tā arī te sekošot kungam.\n\nTrešā naktī gluži tāpat: kungs izkāpis no zārka. Ansis izkāpis. Šoreiz viņi noprātojuši lopus apstaigāt laidarā, zirgus zirgu stallī. Turp iedami, kungs ieteicies: \"Kas to bija domājis, ka apakš zirgu staļļa sliekšņa tik daudz naudas un tik viegli vēl iegujama?\"\n\nNu nogājuši laidarā, zirgu stallī, apslānījuši lielu pulku lopu un zirgu un aizgājuši atpakaļ uz pagrabu.\n\nPagrabā kungs sacījis: \"Ja dzīvs cilvēks pieklauvētu ar celi pie mana zārka un sacītu: \"Dievs Tēvs, Dievs Dēls — dusi mierā!\" tad es nespētu vairs celties. Un to naudu, kas apakš sliekšņa, tad tas cilvēks varētu iegūt. Bet labi, ka mēs abi esam miruši — neviens to nedabūs zināt.\"\n\nTad abi atkal tiepušies, kam pirmajam jāiet zārkā: bet Ansis arvienu tikai turējies: kā viņš dzīvs būdams kungam esot sekojis, tā arī tagad gribot kalpot tam. (Ansis bijies, ka kungs viņu nenomāc.) Tiepušies, tiepušies tikām, kamēr gails iedziedājies. Gaiļa dziesmu padzirdējis, kungs tūliņ klupis zārkā; bet Ansis ātri pielēcis zārkam klāt, pieklauvējis ar celi, sacīdams: \"Dievs Tēvs, Dievs Dēls — dusi mierā!\" Un nu vairs kungs nespējis piecelties, tikai to vien ātrumā iesaucies: \"Bij man to zināt, ka tu dzīvs, es tevi pīšļos būtu saberzis!\"\n\nPēc tam Ansis pārgājis mājā, apņēmis kunga atraikni, izrausis naudu no zirgu staļļa sliekšņa apakšas un dzīvojis kā kungs.","source":"J. Simenovs Dolē. Brīvzemnieka \"Sborņik\", 136, 94. LP, VII, I, 174, 2.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-075-E01","start":839,"end":912,"span":"Kungs aptaustījis skārdes kreklu un atradis, ka Anša miesa patiesi auksta","modalities":["touch","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified material","evidence":"aptaustījis skārdes kreklu un atradis, ka Anša miesa patiesi auksta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer kungs mistakes metal for body; interpretation explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-075-E02","start":2580,"end":2631,"span":"Gaiļa dziesmu padzirdējis, kungs tūliņ klupis zārkā","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Third night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-075-E03","start":2670,"end":2690,"span":"pieklauvējis ar celi","modalities":["touch","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact and knocking; actor Ansis; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pagrabā","environment":"cellar","time":"ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"Once upon a time there lived a married master. And he lived hand in glove with the devil. But he had a coachman, a stately lad named Ansis.\n\nAnd so they lived and lived, until finally the master died, but Ansis cast his eye on his master's widow. She was also willing, but said this: \"Fine! But then you go down to the cellar where my late master sleeps, and sleep three nights in a row right beside his coffin. If you fulfill that, then I will take you as my husband and appoint you as the master.\" Fine. Ansis immediately had a tinsmith forge a sheet-metal shirt, put it on his back and in the evening went down to the cellar, lying down in the coffin beside the late master. He slept and slept – then around midnight the master is about to get up. What will Ansis do?\n\nHe got up too.\n\n\"What, are you dead too, Ansis?\" the master asked.\n\n\"Yes, I'm dead too!\" Ansis replies.\n\n\"Well, if only you aren't lying!\"\n\n\"If you, master, don't believe it, feel my body!\"\n\nThe master felt the sheet-metal shirt and found that Ansis's body was truly cold, and now he believed it indeed.\n\n\"Where shall we go now?\" they talked.\n\nThey decided to go to the master's manor. And both entered the manor, roamed through all the rooms, threw everything around, broke everything they could lay their hands on, and then went back down to the cellar.\n\nBut having entered the cellar, the master says to Ansis: \"Lie down in the coffin first, Ansis!\" Ansis refused: \"No, master, just as I followed you while alive, so shall I follow you dead!\" Nothing to be done – the master lay down in the coffin first and then Ansis.\n\nOn the second night the same: the master rises from the coffin, Ansis too. And now the two of them agreed to walk around the fields. They walked around, devastated all the fields and returned to the cellar again. Having come back, they began arguing again over whose turn it is to lie down first. But Ansis stuck to this: just as he followed the master in life, so he would follow him here too.\n\nOn the third night precisely the same: the master climbed out of the coffin. Ansis climbed out.\n\nThis time they decided to inspect the livestock in the animal yard and the horses in the horse stable. Walking thither, the master mentioned: \"Who would have thought that under the threshold of the horse stable there is so much money and still so easily obtainable?\"\n\nNow they went to the animal yard and the horse stable, slaughtered a large number of livestock and horses, and went back to the cellar.\n\nIn the cellar the master said: \"If a living person were to knock with a knee on my coffin and say: \"God the Father, God the Son – rest in peace!\" then I would no longer be able to rise. And that money which is under the threshold, then that person could acquire. But it's good that we are both dead – no one will ever find out.\"\n\nThen the two argued again over who had to go into the coffin first: but Ansis always stuck to this: just as he had served the master while alive, so now too he wanted to serve him. (Ansis was afraid that the master might crush him.) They argued and argued until the rooster began to crow. Hearing the rooster's song, the master immediately plunged into the coffin; but Ansis quickly leaped up to the coffin, knocked with his knee, saying: \"God the Father, God the Son – rest in peace!\" Now the master was no longer able to get up, only crying out in haste: \"Had I known that you were alive, I would have ground you to dust!\"\n\nAfterwards Ansis went home, married the master's widow, pulled the money out from under the horse stable's threshold, and lived like a master.","translationNotes":["'Uz vienu roku' means in league with. 'Varkalis' is a metalworker/coppersmith; 'skārdes krekls' is a sheet-metal shirt. The text first specifies sleeping beside the coffin and later says in the coffin; that source variation is retained.","\"noprātojuši\" means decided or reasoned.","\"atkratījies\" means refused/declined. \"tiepties\" means to argue or bicker.","Historical 'apslānīt' can mean to slaughter or kill many. Source: Mīlenbahs–Endzelīns dictionary, https://mev.tezaurs.lv/_/search/%C4%81n . The earlier suggestion that death was necessarily an overtranslation is withdrawn.","\"nenomāc\" means might crush or oppress him."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.856174,"lon":24.275452,"label":"place-0095","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"LV-075-E01","start":963,"end":1043,"span":"The master felt the sheet-metal shirt and found that Ansis's body was truly cold","modalities":["touch","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified material","evidence":"aptaustījis skārdes kreklu un atradis, ka Anša miesa patiesi auksta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer kungs mistakes metal for body; interpretation explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Kungs aptaustījis skārdes kreklu un atradis, ka Anša miesa patiesi auksta","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-075-E02","start":3113,"end":3187,"span":"Hearing the rooster's song, the master immediately plunged into the coffin","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Third night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Gaiļa dziesmu padzirdējis, kungs tūliņ klupis zārkā","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-075-E03","start":3232,"end":3253,"span":"knocked with his knee","modalities":["touch","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact and knocking; actor Ansis; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"pieklauvējis ar celi","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"LV:140213016","id":"140213016","collection":"LV","title":"Sulainis ar mirušo kungu","text":"Ka vecu vecais Aumeisteŗu lielckungs bīš jau nomiris, ta viņč vē nācis no kapa laukā un pa naktim mocīš lielmāti un dauzījies pa pili apkārt. Lielmāte vais nevarēsi nekur no šā paglābties un izsolīsi sulaiņam lielu naudu, jā šis tā padarot, ka lielckungs nekad vais apakaļ uz pili nenākot. Nu sulainis ar tā apņēmies izdarīt un vaktēš, ka lielckungs nāks no kapa akal laukā.\n\nNu, bīš jau tā ap pusnakti, ka lielckungs akal iznācis no kapa un aizlicies uz muižu. Bet nu sulainis apvilcis ap kapu ar savu zobinu trīs riņķus apkārt, iegūlies lielkunga zārkā un nu gaidīš, kas tagadītās notiks, ka lielckungs nāks apakaļis un gribēs gulties zārkā iekšā.\n\nPagāš labs lugs un ta tik vē lielckungs nācis apakaļ. Bet nu šis līdz tiem trim riņķiem vie ticis un tālāku ne. Gan nu no iesākuma lielckungs sācis ar naidu un vēlēš, lei sulainis kāpot no zārka ārā un laižot šo iekšā, bet tas nekā nelīdzēš un sulainis nekāpis un nelaidis šā iekšā. Nu lielckungs sācis ar labu, lei tak laižot šo iekšā. Bet sulainis vē neklausīš. Nu lielckungs sācis sulaiņam visādīgus labumus solīt un ka nu tā, ta sulainis prasīš trīs sieki naudas, ta šis šo laidīšot iekšā. No iesākuma gan lielckungs negribēš sulaiņam tikdau naudas dot, bet ka sulainis neatlaidies, ta skrēš pēc naudas un ar reizi visu atnesis. Nu sulainis izrausies no zārka un lielckungs tūlītās zārkā iekšā. Kaps pats no sevis aizbiris cie, un sulainis ar zobinu uzsitis uz kapa trīsdeviņi krusti. Ka sulainis sitis uz kapa krustus, ta lielckungs apukšā nelabi iebļāvies.\n\nNo tās reizas vais lielckungs nekad uz pili nenācis, jo viņč vais neticis no kapa laukā. Lielmāte sulaiņam ar skaudīgi samaksāsi un sulainis nu dzīvāš kā ķeneris, jo nu šim naudas bīš pa pillam.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 73. gadi vecās Marijas Āboliņas Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-076-E01","start":1478,"end":1513,"span":"lielckungs apukšā nelabi iebļāvies.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uz kapa","environment":"cemetery","time":"ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140216001","id":"140216001","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi nogalina cilvēkus","text":"Vienā pirtī, tiklīdz nakts iestājusies, gājuši miroņi. Reiz ceļinieks apņēmis nakts māju šinī pirtī, zināms, no ķēmiem nekā nezinādams. Līdz ko satumsis, atgājuši trīs miroņi: lai laižot iekšā! Ceļinieks, neko ļaunu nedomādams, arī ielaidis. Bet miroņi tūdaļ jautājuši: kā tas drīkstējis viņu pirtī ieiet? Aizbildinājies, ka esot ceļinieks, neko nezinot, kam pirts piederot, gribot izgulēties. Tad miroņi atteikuši: \"Tu šeit esi ienācis pēc savas nelaimes, bet mūsu laimes — tagad tev jāmirst, lai mums te vairs nebūtu jāstaiguļo. Dzīvodami mēs trīs vienreiz nepatiesi pazvērējām un tāpēc velns izsprieda agrāki mūs nelikt mierā, kamēr katrs būsim pa vienai cilvēka dvēselei rokā dabūjuši. Divi dvēseles mums jau ir un tava būs trešā.\" Otrā rītā nepazīstamo ceļinieku atraduši pirtī nedzīvu un no tā laika pirtī vairs neviens nebaidījis.","source":"Kārlis Mačulāns no Kr. Bērtulāna Lašos. LP, VII, I, 44, 23.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":55.959555,"lon":26.117402,"label":"place-0230","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140216003","id":"140216003","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi nogalina cilvēkus","text":"Mežinieku Rengās nomirusi sieva. Nolikuši rijā. Te vēlā vakarā ienāk ceļa gājēji un lūdz kaut kur pārgulēt. Sūtījuši uz riju, bet par mironi neko neteikuši. Labi. Ceļa gājēji apgulušies — kas ir — ap pusnakti redz: balta sieva — kur gadījusies, kur ne — iziet pa rijas durvim un vēlāk ienāk pa tām pašām durvim; bet kur iet, kur paliek, to nedabū noredzēt. Rītā ceļa gājēji uzceļas, apskatās pie dienas gaismas — ierauga mironi šķirstā un nu noprot, kas tas baltais bijis. Bet tā esot laime bijusi, ka ceļa gājēji nezinājuši, ka mironis turpat rijā, citādi apkārtstaigule būtu ķibelējusi tos, jo viņa bijusi velna pilna — gājusi dzīvos galināt.","source":"Eduards Ēķis Džūkstē. LP, VII, I, 34, 6.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-078-E01","start":197,"end":356,"span":"ap pusnakti redz: balta sieva — kur gadījusies, kur ne — iziet pa rijas durvim un vēlāk ienāk pa tām pašām durvim; bet kur iet, kur paliek, to nedabū noredzēt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"limited visibility/unknown destination","evidence":"bet kur iet, kur paliek, to nedabū noredzēt","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-078-E02","start":357,"end":472,"span":"Rītā ceļa gājēji uzceļas, apskatās pie dienas gaismas — ierauga mironi šķirstā un nu noprot, kas tas baltais bijis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"retrospective identification","evidence":"nu noprot, kas tas baltais bijis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning and daylight explicitly stated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"rijā","environment":"threshing barn","time":"ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.78922,"lon":23.247195,"label":"place-0110","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140216012","id":"140216012","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi nogalina cilvēkus","text":"Aiz Lubānas atrodas kanava, ko sauc par Milgrāvi, Patmaļgrāvi, Dzirnavgrāvi, kā nu kuŗais. Šie trīs nosaukumi ir parastākie, visvairāk lieto Patmaļgrāvi. — Senāk, tur, kur ir tagad tilts, bijušas dzirnavas. Stāsta, ka dzirnavnieks nosities. Pēc tam, kaŗa gados, arī citi cilvēki tur nositušies. Ļaudis runāja, ka dzirnavnieks tos tur esot ievilinājis.","source":"E. Poriete Lubānā, A. Aizsila kr.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899927,"lon":26.719879,"label":"place-0266","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140218003","id":"140218003","collection":"LV","title":"Pērkons nospeŗ veli","text":"Audzes pagastā īpaši piemin 1821. g. bargo vasaru, kuŗā pērkons kā šautin šāvās. Viens saimnieks, meklēdams patversmi pērkona laikā, palīdis zem apgāztas laivas. Te uz reizi sarkans kamols ieritinājies laivas otrā gala un saimnieku bargi skubinājis atstāt laivu, jo viņu, sarkano kamolu, tūliņ speršot. Tikko saimnieks paguvis izķeparāties no laivas, te arī šī bijusi lupatās sasperta. Še klāt vecīši vēl piemin, ka tādi uguns kamoli esot nomākto dvēseles, kuŗām neesot ne miera, nedz vietas, un no pērkona topot briesmīgi vajātas.","source":"Audzenieks Audzes pag. \"Balss\" 1887. g. nr. 21. LP, VII, I, 498, 9.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-080-E01","start":56,"end":80,"span":"pērkons kā šautin šāvās.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Thunder described through comparison; generic seasonal framing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"zem apgāztas laivas","environment":"shelter","time":"1821. g. bargo vasaru","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.452942,"lon":25.187653,"label":"place-0029","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140220002","id":"140220002","collection":"LV","title":"Veļu dzīve viņā saulē","text":"Reiz dzīvoja skops puisis, kas bija sakrājis daudz naudas, bet tomēr mērdējās badā un arī nabagiem nekā neatmeta. Viņš reiz nomiris un aizgājis viņā dzīvē un izsaucies: \"Kur mans naudas pods!\" Viņš aizgāja pēc tā. Tie kas tur bija, ielika naudu sietā, no kuŗa izkrita tikai viens vērdiņš, ko no pārskatīšanās viņš bija kādam nabagam iedevis.","source":"A. Miglava Rīgā, A. Bērzkalnes krājumā.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.949649,"lon":24.105186,"label":"place-0403","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140220004","id":"140220004","collection":"LV","title":"Veļu dzīve viņā saulē","text":"Reiz bīš vienc tāds saimnieks un tas ne Dievam ticēš, ne ar baznīcā gāš. Bet nu vienu svētdienas rītu saimnieks atkritis atmiegā un pa sapinim šis nu bīš ellē un tur nu tā redzēš. Tur nu ellē bīš dau cilvēku un visi tādi bēdīgi vie staigāši un tie, kas Dievam neticēši, tie staigāši ar mellām mutēm, un tās meitas, kas savus bērnus nomušīšas, tās akal bērnus nesušas zobos un tā staigāšas riņķī. Ka nu saimnieks pamodies, ta bīš varēn nobijies un tūlī jūdzis zirgu un braucis uz baznīcu. No tās reizas saimnieks sācis Dievam ticēt un katru svētdienu braucis uz baznīcu.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenē.","category":"Veļi","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-082-E01","start":132,"end":395,"span":"pa sapinim šis nu bīš ellē un tur nu tā redzēš. Tur nu ellē bīš dau cilvēku un visi tādi bēdīgi vie staigāši un tie, kas Dievam neticēši, tie staigāši ar mellām mutēm, un tās meitas, kas savus bērnus nomušīšas, tās akal bērnus nesušas zobos un tā staigāšas riņķī.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ellē","environment":"named otherworld setting","time":"vienu svētdienas rītu","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.423063,"lon":25.900378,"label":"place-0441","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140301034","id":"140301034","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni māžojas","text":"Vizulis gājis pa Skaras mežu uz mājām. Mežā ieejot, viņam nācis līdzi gar ceļa otru malu kāds cilvēks, kas bijis ar vieniem lupatiem ģērbies. Kad viņš bijis atnācis pie Penkoku kapiem, tad tūliņ noplīsušais cilvēks pazudis. Vizulis redzējis: tikko noplīsušais pārlēcis pār kapa žogu, tā tūliņ pazudis. Viņam palicis bail un viņš taisījies, kā tiek no kapiem prom.\n\nReiz Reķis braucis vilnu kārst. Viņš braucis pa Cukura mežu pie Gēderta. Viņš dzirdējis, ka viņa priekšā kaut kas skanējis, un redzējis, ka ugunis metušās. Pats Reķis dzīvoja Paipas ciemā. Visi ciema iedzīvotāji sakot, ka tur spokojot.","source":"J. Vīksne no K. Kalnes Nīcā.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-083-E01","start":224,"end":301,"span":"Vizulis redzējis: tikko noplīsušais pārlēcis pār kapa žogu, tā tūliņ pazudis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"tā tūliņ pazudis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-083-E02","start":438,"end":520,"span":"Viņš dzirdējis, ka viņa priekšā kaut kas skanējis, un redzējis, ka ugunis metušās.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified sound source","evidence":"kaut kas skanējis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Different experiencer Reķis, Cukura mežu, travelling.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.346498,"lon":21.065493,"label":"place-0318","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140301035","id":"140301035","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni māžojas","text":"Pa pašu dienvidu meita gāsi no Smiltenes uz māju. Kā šī iegāsi Bilckas priedēs, tā no vecām grants bedrēm, kas pašā ceļa malā, iznācis mellc cilvēks un šim uz rokas bīš pavisam pliks bērnc un šis varēn vēkšis. Mellais cilvēks gāš pa vienu ceļmalu un meita akal gāsi uz otru un mellais cilvēks meitai līdzās vie turējies. Mellais cilvēks pagāš gabalīnu, ta sviedis bērnu sev pār plecu, turēš aiz kājām cie un bērnam galva karāsies pār muguru. Kā mellais cilvēks ticis pie Kluča tilta (Bilskas pagastā), tā uzreiz pazudis. Meita varēn pārbīsies un kā tikusi mājā, tā uz vietas likusies vietā un sagulēsi ilgi slima.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 58 g. v. Marijas Pujiņas Smiltenē.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-084-E01","start":152,"end":209,"span":"šim uz rokas bīš pavisam pliks bērnc un šis varēn vēkšis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Explicit crying, observer contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-084-E02","start":502,"end":520,"span":"tā uzreiz pazudis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"uzreiz pazudis","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual witnessed vanishing at bridge; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Bilckas priedēs","environment":"forest","time":"Pa pašu dienvidu","movement":"meita gāsi no Smiltenes uz māju"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.423063,"lon":25.900378,"label":"place-0441","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140301070","id":"140301070","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni māžojas","text":"Tilti, saukti par tālajiem, pēc vecu ļaužu nostāstiem, bijuši uz Rīgu braucot, kādas 30-40 verstis no pašas Rīgas pilsētas. Vienam ceļa vīram, tālajos tiltos braucot, piepēži zirgs apstājies, negājis tālāk, un mazs puika kur gadījies, kur ne — skrējis līdzi un raudājis. Braucējam sameties bailes un tas nezinājis, ko darīt. Beidzot sācis skaitīt lūgšanu. Jā, tiklīdz noskaitījis lūgšanu, tā puika pazudis un zirgs atkal solojis uz priekšu.","source":"V. Akmentiņš no 73 g. v. A. Akmentiņas.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-085-E01","start":210,"end":270,"span":"mazs puika kur gadījies, kur ne — skrējis līdzi un raudājis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-085-E02","start":389,"end":405,"span":"tā puika pazudis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"puika pazudis","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual perception; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"tālajos tiltos","environment":"bridge","time":"","movement":"braucot"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140301073","id":"140301073","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni māžojas","text":"Uz Īcēna kalna (Aumeisteru pagastā) aug tāda zemzaraina priede un zem tās raudot raudātāš. Ja nu kādam gadoties iet gar kalnu vai nu pa pašu pusnakti, vai dienas vidu, ta viemē raudātāju dzirdot.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 76 g. v. J. Ābeles Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-086-E01","start":168,"end":195,"span":"ta viemē raudātāju dzirdot.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic encounter; exact temporal alternatives retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Uz Īcēna kalna","environment":"hill","time":"pa pašu pusnakti, vai dienas vidu","movement":"iet gar kalnu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140303009","id":"140303009","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni dzīvnieku izskatā","text":"Vienam vīram iznācis nakti iet gar Lielvircavas kapsētu. Baznīcas zvans trīs reizas ieskanējies un no kapsētas izskrējis melns suns un skrējis vīram pa priekšu līdz pašai mājai. Pie mājas suns pazudis.","source":"Kārlis Skujiņa Lielvircavas pagastā.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-087-E01","start":57,"end":95,"span":"Baznīcas zvans trīs reizas ieskanējies","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-087-E02","start":178,"end":201,"span":"Pie mājas suns pazudis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"suns pazudis","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual perception; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gar Lielvircavas kapsētu","environment":"cemetery","time":"nakti","movement":"iet gar Lielvircavas kapsētu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.518213,"lon":23.740016,"label":"place-0244","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140303012","id":"140303012","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni dzīvnieku izskatā","text":"Viens dūrēnietis stāstīja šādas vella rēgas. Viņš — pats pagasta vecākais — Kazainis, braucis rudens naktī no dzirnavām uz māju. Mēness spoži spīdējis, bijusi pusnakts. Te gar Lejas draudzes (Aahof) kapsētu braukdams, ierauga: no kapsētas izskrien tāds melns kustonis kā vilks un, lielu līkumu mezdams, dodas uz ceļu braucējam virsū. Šis arī nemaz nebaidījies, lai skrien! Bet melnais zvērs palicis arvienu mazāks: jau kā suns. Beidzot pietecējis tā 2-3 asis zirga priekšā un palicis kaķa lielumā. Te tikai vien šis savādais kaķis nogulsies uz ceļa, lai nu brauc pāri, ja patīk. Kazainis domājis: \"Kur nu tādam virsū braukt! \"labāk krāvis ķēma kaķim ar kreiso roku pa muguru. Tas līdzējis: nebēdnis, zibens ātrumā veldamies, aizdiedzies uz kapsētas birzes pusi. Un tik ko ieskrējis mežā, viss mežs iešņācies, iekrācies, itkā pa aukas laiku — pēc atkal piepēži apklusis.","source":"K. Bika Dūrēniešos Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VII, I, 126, 9.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-088-E01","start":218,"end":276,"span":"ierauga: no kapsētas izskrien tāds melns kustonis kā vilks","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"approximate form","evidence":"tāds melns kustonis kā vilks","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Comparison need not mean uncertainty; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-088-E02","start":377,"end":497,"span":"melnais zvērs palicis arvienu mazāks: jau kā suns. Beidzot pietecējis tā 2-3 asis zirga priekšā un palicis kaķa lielumā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable size","evidence":"palicis arvienu mazāks","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit changing size in sustained observed encounter.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-088-E03","start":632,"end":675,"span":"krāvis ķēma kaķim ar kreiso roku pa muguru.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact action, felt quality not stated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-088-E04","start":788,"end":869,"span":"viss mežs iešņācies, iekrācies, itkā pa aukas laiku — pēc atkal piepēži apklusis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"sound analogy","evidence":"itkā pa aukas laiku","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Acoustic comparison; actual storm not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gar Lejas draudzes (Aahof) kapsētu","environment":"cemetery","time":"rudens naktī","movement":"braucis rudens naktī no dzirnavām uz māju"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140303020","id":"140303020","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni dzīvnieku izskatā","text":"Reiz Grauzdes muižā iebraukušas divi vareni lepnas karītes, aizjūgtas melniem zirgiem. Pats kungs nebijis mājā. Svešie kungi, melnos mēteļos tērpušies, vaicājuši sulaiņiem pēc muižkunga jeb junkura. Junkurs iegājis pie svešniekiem, tie pavēlējuši viņam tūlīt sūtīt darbinieku uz Alksnāju stigu izcirst. Darbinieki to drīzi padarījuši. Svešie kungi iegājuši Alksnājā un divi no tiem šāvušies. Junkurs, gribēdams redzēt, ko melnie kungi Alksnājā darīs, paslēpies biezoknī un redzējis, ka viens kungs kritis pēc šāviena. Citi to paņēmuši un aizbraukuši. Kas šie melnie kungi bijuši, neviens nezinājis, bet Alksnājā no tā laika spokojoties. Pieguļnieki pusnaktīs redzējuši, ka tur divi āži badoties un, ka balta freilene raudādama, rokas lauzīdama, tur ēnojoties.","source":"Naudīšnieks Grauzdeniekos. \"Balss\" 1889., nr. 21. LP, VII, I, 987, 3.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-089-E01","start":451,"end":517,"span":"paslēpies biezoknī un redzējis, ka viens kungs kritis pēc šāviena.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified agents","evidence":"Kas šie melnie kungi bijuši, neviens nezinājis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-089-E02","start":637,"end":759,"span":"Pieguļnieki pusnaktīs redzējuši, ka tur divi āži badoties un, ka balta freilene raudādama, rokas lauzīdama, tur ēnojoties.","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later repeated group experience; crying may be visually observed, secondary auditory medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Alksnājā","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.794986,"lon":23.326683,"label":"place-0131","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140303023","id":"140303023","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni dzīvnieku izskatā","text":"Zaļās ceturtdienas naktī viens vīrs izgājis uz stirnu medībām. Ieraudzījis arī divi stirnāžus uz lauka ēdam. Bet tikko pielicis bisi uz šaušanu, te ieraudzījis priekšā pestītāja tēlu. Vīrs tā nobijies, ka tik tik varējis mājās pāriet.","source":"J. A. Jansons Vandzenē.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-090-E01","start":63,"end":108,"span":"Ieraudzījis arī divi stirnāžus uz lauka ēdam.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-090-E02","start":148,"end":183,"span":"ieraudzījis priekšā pestītāja tēlu.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uz lauka","environment":"field","time":"Zaļās ceturtdienas naktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.307962,"lon":22.76919,"label":"place-0511","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140305007","id":"140305007","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni dažādos veidos","text":"Stūreniekos viena vecsaimniece bijusi ar vellu labos prātos. Un šī pati ar savu kaimiņieni nevarējusi nemaz satikt — ķircinājusi to uz postu: tad viņa apbūrusi kaimiņienei lopus, ka neēd, tad, ka maz piena dod; jeb arī uzsūtījusi (citiem kaimiņu ļaudim lai) vella garus, kas baida. Tā vienreiz Galeņu māju meita gājusi govis slaukt. Iegājusi kūtī — redz: melns kamols veļas no vienas govs tesmeņa pie otras; beidzot pārveļas slieksnim pāri un aizripo uz gatves galu. Nu meita tecējusi pakaļ noskatīties, kur īsti melnais vēlējies aizvelsies. Aiztecējusi gatvē — ierauga, ka no kamola radusies vecā nelaiķa Melgrāviene. Tirpuļi vien nogājuši meitai pa kauliem un tā, ko vien māk — atpakaļ uz istabu. Citām reizēm vella gari atkal esot braukuši ar žagaru vezumiem gar logiem, ka žagari rūtēs dūrušies. Izejot ārā skatīties: neesot nekā.\n\nTā atkal vienu vakaru esot viens plēsies pa skursteni. Domājuši, ka visu skursteni sagāzīs. Ejot skatīties — ieraugot trīs naglas — pamatīgas naglas bijušas iesistas — tas viss; paši trokšņotāji, kur palikuši, kur ne.\n\nAtkal citā reizē redzēta maza uguntiņa no Galeņu ābeļu dārza uz Melgrāvju pusi lidinājamies.","source":"Fricis Pinnis Stūreniekos. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VII, I, 125, 7.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-091-E01","start":333,"end":406,"span":"Iegājusi kūtī — redz: melns kamols veļas no vienas govs tesmeņa pie otras","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-091-E02","start":562,"end":618,"span":"ierauga, ka no kamola radusies vecā nelaiķa Melgrāviene.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"changed perceived identity","evidence":"no kamola radusies vecā nelaiķa Melgrāviene","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-091-E03","start":619,"end":658,"span":"Tirpuļi vien nogājuši meitai pa kauliem","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-091-E04","start":800,"end":834,"span":"Izejot ārā skatīties: neesot nekā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroboration","evidence":"neesot nekā","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Subsequent repeated episode, observers unspecified.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-091-E05","start":845,"end":890,"span":"vienu vakaru esot viens plēsies pa skursteni.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unlocated agent","evidence":"paši trokšņotāji, kur palikuši, kur ne","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Sound licensed by trokšņotāji; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-091-E06","start":928,"end":1012,"span":"Ejot skatīties — ieraugot trīs naglas — pamatīgas naglas bijušas iesistas — tas viss","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed source corroboration","evidence":"paši trokšņotāji, kur palikuši, kur ne","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-091-E07","start":1072,"end":1147,"span":"redzēta maza uguntiņa no Galeņu ābeļu dārza uz Melgrāvju pusi lidinājamies.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Separate episode; garden.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140305039","id":"140305039","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni dažādos veidos","text":"Netālu no Rušūnas pa ceļam uz Katigradi ceļmalā ir veca mājiņa. Tagad to neviens neapdzīvo. Tur arvien vēl rādoties spoki. Reiz gaŗām gājis Rušūnas stacijas priekšnieks, arī tam sākuši pretī skriet ķieģeļi, akmeņi un citas drumslas. Tomēr mājiņā neko neatraduši. Tagad visi no šīs mājiņas izvairas, jo tur nelabais mājojot.","source":"A. Aizsils Rušūnā.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"veca mājiņa","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.211883,"lon":26.896576,"label":"place-0398","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140307014","id":"140307014","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni trokšņo","text":"Aumeisteŗu pils neesot gluži tīra no ermiem. Pa naktim, bieži vien, klaudzot durvis, smejoties un dažreiz arī dziedot. Kad gailis dziedot, tad pilī viss esot atkal klusu un mierīgi.","source":"H. Skujiņa Aumeisteŗu pag.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-093-E01","start":68,"end":118,"span":"klaudzot durvis, smejoties un dažreiz arī dziedot.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated acoustic cluster, no distinct episodes recoverable.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-093-E02","start":119,"end":181,"span":"Kad gailis dziedot, tad pilī viss esot atkal klusu un mierīgi.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Aumeisteŗu pils","environment":"manor interior","time":"Pa naktim","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0032","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140307016","id":"140307016","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni trokšņo","text":"Par tām vecām Smiltenes rijām gan stāstīja, ka tur špoki rādoties. Tur, re', stāstīja tā, ka vecais Bandava uz balta zirga pašā pusnaktī jājot uz riju un ta akal uzreizi pazūdot. Nu ta sākoties tāda kā suņu riešana un kaķu ņaudēšana un trāpījies ar, ka vīrs izrauts no piedarba laukā, gabalīnu panests un nosviests zemē.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 84 g. v. Jāņa Liepiņa, saukta Kambura Jāņa, Bilskas pag. Lejasūsīnās.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-094-E01","start":194,"end":232,"span":"tāda kā suņu riešana un kaķu ņaudēšana","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate sound","evidence":"tāda kā suņu riešana un kaķu ņaudēšana","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-094-E02","start":253,"end":320,"span":"vīrs izrauts no piedarba laukā, gabalīnu panests un nosviests zemē.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Individual; forced displacement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Smiltenes rijām","environment":"threshing barn","time":"pašā pusnaktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140307019","id":"140307019","collection":"LV","title":"Ēni trokšņo","text":"Nogales Krūkļu mājās ērbēģis uzbūvēts uz veciem kapiem. Sveši cilvēki tur nevar dzīvot un gulēt, tad vienmēr redz kādas parādības — visbiežāk divi meitenes, kas ienāk pa durvim, aizdejo līdz logam un tad pazūd.","source":"J. A. Jansons Nogalē.","category":"Ēni jeb māži","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-095-E01","start":101,"end":210,"span":"vienmēr redz kādas parādības — visbiežāk divi meitenes, kas ienāk pa durvim, aizdejo līdz logam un tad pazūd.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"tad pazūd","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic recurring sequence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Nogales Krūkļu mājās ērbēģis","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.369123,"lon":22.729198,"label":"place-0315","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140401013","id":"140401013","collection":"LV","title":"Vadātājs neredzams jeb nenoteiktā veidā","text":"Man reiz pašam bī tā. Nāču no Aumeisterim uz māju vēlu vakarā un kā tiku Vecpodes silīnā, tā sāku neganti maldīties. Toreiz bī pats sniega gurums. Maldījos maldījos un cik vie gāju, tik akal apakaļ vie atnāču pie vienas pašas priedes. Pēdīgi nodomāju: \"Uz kuru pusi nu lei iemu, sak', tā kā tā apakaļ vie atnācīšu.\" Nu, nosēžos pie priedes un uzpīpēju. Ka nu akal sāku iet, ta tik vē pamanīju un atskārtos, ka ir jau pavisam pazīstama vieta, netālu no Pakalnieša (māja Aumeisteŗu pagastā) robežas. Ka tiku mājā, ta pulkstinc bī pāri pusnaktij. Nu, vadātāš vie jau mani to nakti muldināja!\n\nRītīnā tik dabūju zināt, ka pagāšo nakti Podes upē (Vijā) noslīcis vienc aumeisteriešu saimnieks. Nu, man jau ar laikam gadījās ap to pašu lugu nākt cau Vecpodes silīnu, ka saimnieks slīka. Sazini nu, bet vadatāš vie jau bī!","source":"H. Skujiņa no 66 g. v. J. Birģeļa Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Vadātāji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-096-E01","start":93,"end":234,"span":"sāku neganti maldīties. Toreiz bī pats sniega gurums. Maldījos maldījos un cik vie gāju, tik akal apakaļ vie atnāču pie vienas pašas priedes.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"circling/lost","evidence":"cik vie gāju, tik akal apakaļ vie atnāču pie vienas pašas priedes","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-096-E02","start":384,"end":462,"span":"pamanīju un atskārtos, ka ir jau pavisam pazīstama vieta, netālu no Pakalnieša","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"orientation restored","evidence":"atskārtos, ka ir jau pavisam pazīstama vieta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Vecpodes silīnā","environment":"forest","time":"vēlu vakarā","movement":"Nāču no Aumeisterim uz māju"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation"],"translation":"Once it happened to me myself like this. I was walking home from Aumeisteri late in the evening and as soon as I reached the Vecpodes pine wood, I began to lose my way terribly. It was the time of “sniega gurums” [snow condition unclear]. I wandered and wandered and however much I walked, I kept coming right back to the very same pine tree. Finally I thought: \"Which way should I go now, I said, I'll end up coming back anyway.\" Well, I sat down by the pine tree and smoked a pipe. When I started walking again, only then did I notice and realize that it was already a completely familiar place, not far from the border of Pakalnietis (a homestead in Aumeisteri parish). When I got home, the clock was past midnight. Well, the vadātājs had really been leading me astray that night!\n\nOnly in the morning did I find out that last night a farmer from Aumeisteri had drowned in the Podes river (the Vija). Well, I too probably happened to be walking through the Vecpodes pine wood around that same time while the farmer was drowning. Who knows, but it really was the vadātājs!","translationNotes":["REVIEW REQUIRED: 'sniega gurums' is retained rather than guessing a snow condition. 'Silīns' is rendered as pine wood. Pakalnietis is the inferred nominative of the inflected homestead name Pakalnieša; verify against local place-name records if an authoritative form is needed. Dialect and the narrator's attribution to the vadātājs are preserved.","Vija is retained as the river name. 'Silīns' is rendered as pine wood. The probable coincidence in time with the drowning remains qualified; the original does not say the drowned man appeared."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"LV-096-E01","start":145,"end":342,"span":"I began to lose my way terribly. It was the time of “sniega gurums” [snow condition unclear]. I wandered and wandered and however much I walked, I kept coming right back to the very same pine tree.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"circling/lost","evidence":"cik vie gāju, tik akal apakaļ vie atnāču pie vienas pašas priedes","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"sāku neganti maldīties. Toreiz bī pats sniega gurums. Maldījos maldījos un cik vie gāju, tik akal apakaļ vie atnāču pie vienas pašas priedes.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-096-E02","start":530,"end":636,"span":"notice and realize that it was already a completely familiar place, not far from the border of Pakalnietis","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"orientation restored","evidence":"atskārtos, ka ir jau pavisam pazīstama vieta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"pamanīju un atskārtos, ka ir jau pavisam pazīstama vieta, netālu no Pakalnieša","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"LV:140402001","id":"140402001","collection":"LV","title":"Vadātājs cilvēka izskatā","text":"Vīrs aŗ tīrumā. Ardams tas ierauga, ka vagā guļ čūska. Ātri viņš tai uzcērt ar pātagu. Čūska pazūd un vīrs tai vietā redz kaudzi sudraba naudas. Viņš naudu ar steigšanos beŗ kabatās. Te pienāk kāds kungs un uzsauc: \"Nāc līdz! Gan vīrs negrib iet, bet neredzama vara to spiež, viņam jāiet.\n\nSieva gaida vīru mājā, bet nesagaida. Iet uz tīrumu raudzīt, atrod zirgu stāvam, bet vīra nav. Iet uz kaimiņiem, prasa, meklē, bet no vīra ne vēsts.\n\nPaiet divi gadi. Sieva vēl arvien gaida. Paiet septiņi gadi, un nu visi tic, ka vīrs vai nu noslīcis, vai vilka apēsts. Astotā gadā kaimiņi brauc ar brandvīnu uz Pliskavu. Netāl no Pliskavas uz kāda tilta, tie atrod zemē gulošu cilvēku, ko pazīst par to, kas priekš astoņiem gadiem nozudis. Bet kāds viņš izskatās? Noplīsis, izdēdējis, rokas un kājas izkaltušas kā skali. Ceļa vīri par viņu apžēlojas un aizved uz Pliskavu, kur šis pamazām atspirga. Tagad tas arī izstāsta, kā tam pa šo laiku klājies. Vadātājs to bez mitēšanas vadājis pa pasauli apkārt. Tā viņi gājuši pa kalniem un lejām, pa ezeriem un jūŗām. Vadātājs gājis ūdeņiem pa virsu, bet viņam bijis jālien pa apakšu. Viņš redzējis daudz zemes un valstis un viņu bagātību, līdz beigās nonākuši pie Pliskavas tilta. Te svešais teicis: \"Dieva suns rej — man jāiet. Ilgāk vairs nevaru tevi apkārt vadāt.\" To izteicis vadātājs nozudis un šis bez spēka nokritis zemē.\n\nVīram nu bija naudas diezgan, bet viņš nedabūja ilgi par savu bagātību priecāties, jo viņš jau pēc gada laika nomira.","source":"Krēsliņu Jānis Malienā. \"Latv. teikas\", II, 13.","category":"Vadātāji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-097-E01","start":16,"end":54,"span":"Ardams tas ierauga, ka vagā guļ čūska.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-097-E02","start":87,"end":144,"span":"Čūska pazūd un vīrs tai vietā redz kaudzi sudraba naudas.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"changed perceived object","evidence":"Čūska pazūd un vīrs tai vietā redz kaudzi sudraba naudas","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-097-E03","start":251,"end":288,"span":"neredzama vara to spiež, viņam jāiet.","modalities":["pressure","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen force","evidence":"neredzama vara","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Force may be idiomatic coercion; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-097-E04","start":755,"end":811,"span":"Noplīsis, izdēdējis, rokas un kājas izkaltušas kā skali.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later group observation supported by kāds viņš izskatās; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-097-E05","start":1119,"end":1172,"span":"Viņš redzējis daudz zemes un valstis un viņu bagātību","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported prolonged travel.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-097-E06","start":1236,"end":1250,"span":"Dieva suns rej","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Quoted sonic report; no independent identification of sound source.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.35365,"lon":27.17867,"label":"place-0281","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140402018","id":"140402018","collection":"LV","title":"Vadātājs cilvēka izskatā","text":"Kaupiņu māju saimnieks Verlums gājis vienreiz naktī mājās no kroga un bijis ļoti noguris. Viņš pie sevis pārdomājis: \"Kaut mani kāds pavestu!\" Te uzreiz viņš dzird zvaniņus skanam un kādu braucēju tuvojamies. Kad braucējs bijis piebraucis pie Verluma, viņš uzsaucis: \"Verlum, sēdi nu manos ratos!\"\n\nVerlums iesēdies ratos un abi braukuši. Te — kur gadās, kur ne — Verlums ar otru braucēju upē iekšā, bet braucējs pazudis. Verlums samircis izrāpies no upes un gājis atkal tālāk. Verlums dzird atkal pulkstenīti skanam un kādu braucēju tuvojamies. Kad braucējs piebraucis pie Verluma, viņš uzsaucis: \"Verlum, sēdi nu manos ratos!\"\n\nVerlums iesēdies ratos un abi braukuši, bet atkal kādā upē iekšā un braucējs nozūd. Verlums izrāpies cauri gluži slapjš no upes un gājis kājām uz māju pusi.\n\nTā Verlums mocījies līdz rītam. Tikai kad uzaususi gaisma, viņš aizgājis mājās.","source":"Juris Kasparovics no 75 g. v. Anša Landzberga, 1931.g. Skrundas pagastā.","category":"Vadātāji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-098-E01","start":70,"end":89,"span":"bijis ļoti noguris.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-098-E02","start":153,"end":208,"span":"viņš dzird zvaniņus skanam un kādu braucēju tuvojamies.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-098-E03","start":422,"end":455,"span":"Verlums samircis izrāpies no upes","modalities":["touch","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Water contact; felt wetness not separately stated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-098-E04","start":478,"end":545,"span":"Verlums dzird atkal pulkstenīti skanam un kādu braucēju tuvojamies.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-098-E05","start":714,"end":757,"span":"Verlums izrāpies cauri gluži slapjš no upes","modalities":["touch","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Repeated water contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"vienreiz naktī","movement":"gājis vienreiz naktī mājās no kroga"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.674534,"lon":22.004971,"label":"place-0432","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140403012","id":"140403012","collection":"LV","title":"Vadātājs dzīvnieka izskatā","text":"Opeltienas dūkstī ( 2 ½ verstes no baznīcas, Rīgas lielceļa malā) pusnaktīs dziedot zeltīts putns un mānot gaŗāmgājējus, lai šo ķer. Līdz ko sākot ķert, putns virzoties uz priekšu un iemānot dūkstes bezdibinā. Reiz šai dūkstī esot noslīcis pastinieks ar trim zirgiem.\n\nTāpat Āriņa kalnā, turpat pie dūkstes, viens vīrs redzējis ceļa malā divi vīrus pie uguns. Piegājis klāt — ne vīru, ne uguns vairs. Cits atkal redzējis turpat priedēs pie uguns lielu pulku laužu. Tie visi dziedājuši. Piegājis klāt, noķēris vienu vēl pie rokas — kas ir — visi nozuduši un šim atradies priedes: zars rokā.","source":"Briedis, Piperu Augusts, Ērgļu Piperos. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VI, 185, 5.","category":"Vadātāji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-099-E01","start":66,"end":97,"span":"pusnaktīs dziedot zeltīts putns","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic; Opeltienas dūkstī; unspecified perceiver.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-099-E02","start":308,"end":400,"span":"viens vīrs redzējis ceļa malā divi vīrus pie uguns. Piegājis klāt — ne vīru, ne uguns vairs.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance on approach","evidence":"Piegājis klāt — ne vīru, ne uguns vairs","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-099-E03","start":401,"end":485,"span":"Cits atkal redzējis turpat priedēs pie uguns lielu pulku laužu. Tie visi dziedājuši.","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-099-E04","start":501,"end":589,"span":"noķēris vienu vēl pie rokas — kas ir — visi nozuduši un šim atradies priedes: zars rokā.","modalities":["touch","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"cross-modal identity mismatch","evidence":"šim atradies priedes: zars rokā","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899228,"lon":25.640242,"label":"place-0581","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140404003","id":"140404003","collection":"LV","title":"Velns par vadātāju","text":"Auduļu saimnieks bijis Strēdelēs kristībās. Vakarā vēlu uz māju ejot Dzegužu līcī, kur agrāki esot dzīvojis velns, vadātājs, viens šim pārmaucis kā maisu pār galvu, tikai varējis iet uz māju pa zināšanai. Ticis pretim mājai, bet nevarējis ceļu uztrāpīt, bijis aizgājis jau gaŗām. Nu jau gan domājis, ka labi nebūšot, griezies uz mājas pusi un kliedzis, lai jau citi sadzirdot. Sadzirdējuši arī mājas kā arī kaimiņu suņi un skrējuši riedami uz šo. Pašu suns pazīdams ķēries ap kaklu; tad atkal kā maiss nokritis no galvas un aizvēlies uz Ruģenēm. Bijis tikai kādus desmit solus atstatu no ezera purvā, kādu pusversti jau mājai gaŗām. Nebūtu suņi dzirdējuši, tad būtot ievedis velns ezerā.","source":"Raudaviete Bērzaunē. Etn. III, 1893. LP, VII, I, 949, 2.","category":"Vadātāji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-100-E01","start":125,"end":204,"span":"viens šim pārmaucis kā maisu pār galvu, tikai varējis iet uz māju pa zināšanai.","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"occlusion","evidence":"kā maisu pār galvu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Bag simile; literal object not assumed; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-100-E02","start":205,"end":279,"span":"Ticis pretim mājai, bet nevarējis ceļu uztrāpīt, bijis aizgājis jau gaŗām.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"lost route","evidence":"nevarējis ceļu uztrāpīt","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-100-E03","start":377,"end":446,"span":"Sadzirdējuši arī mājas kā arī kaimiņu suņi un skrējuši riedami uz šo.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Animal experiencers; group.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-100-E04","start":447,"end":520,"span":"Pašu suns pazīdams ķēries ap kaklu; tad atkal kā maiss nokritis no galvas","modalities":["touch","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"occlusion lifted","evidence":"kā maiss nokritis no galvas","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Restoration through contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Dzegužu līcī","environment":"waterside","time":"Vakarā vēlu","movement":"uz māju ejot"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"The master of Auduļi had been at a christening in Strēdeles. Walking home late in the evening in Dzegužu līcis, where the devil, the vadātājs, used to live earlier, someone pulled something over his head like a sack, and he was only able to walk toward home by memory. He reached opposite his house, but couldn't find the road, having already walked past it. Now he indeed thought that things wouldn't go well, turned toward the house and shouted so that others would hear him. The household dogs as well as the neighbors' dogs heard him too and ran barking toward him. His own dog recognized him and jumped up around his neck; then it was again as though a sack fell off his head and rolled away towards Ruģenes. He was only about ten paces away from the lake in the swamp, about half a verst past his house already.\n\nHad the dogs not heard [him], the devil would have led him into the lake.","translationNotes":["The dog recognises its owner. The sack wording remains a comparison. 'Vadātājs' is retained as the narrative's designation; a verst is a historical distance unit."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.808758,"lon":26.036931,"label":"place-0071","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"LV-100-E01","start":165,"end":268,"span":"someone pulled something over his head like a sack, and he was only able to walk toward home by memory.","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"occlusion","evidence":"kā maisu pār galvu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Bag simile; literal object not assumed; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"viens šim pārmaucis kā maisu pār galvu, tikai varējis iet uz māju pa zināšanai.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-100-E02","start":269,"end":358,"span":"He reached opposite his house, but couldn't find the road, having already walked past it.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"lost route","evidence":"nevarējis ceļu uztrāpīt","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Ticis pretim mājai, bet nevarējis ceļu uztrāpīt, bijis aizgājis jau gaŗām.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-100-E03","start":478,"end":569,"span":"The household dogs as well as the neighbors' dogs heard him too and ran barking toward him.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Animal experiencers; group.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Sadzirdējuši arī mājas kā arī kaimiņu suņi un skrējuši riedami uz šo.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"LV-100-E04","start":570,"end":680,"span":"His own dog recognized him and jumped up around his neck; then it was again as though a sack fell off his head","modalities":["touch","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"occlusion lifted","evidence":"kā maiss nokritis no galvas","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Restoration through contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Pašu suns pazīdams ķēries ap kaklu; tad atkal kā maiss nokritis no galvas","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"LV:140404011","id":"140404011","collection":"LV","title":"Velns par vadātāju","text":"Viens vecītis braucis pa lielceļu. Uz reizi viņam aizgulstas šķērsu uz lielceļa liels cilvēks, sacīdams: lai pāri nebraucot! Ja braukšot, tad tūliņ beigts būšot. Nebraucis — griezis no ceļa nost, grāvim pāri. Bet nu lielais cilvēks aizsteidzies zirgam priekšā un vadājis braucēju cauru nakti. Vecīšam izrādījies itkā pa brangāko lielceļu būtu braucis; bet rītā gaismiņā vecītis atradies pie mārkas, un kad nu apskatījies pēdas, redzējis, ka pa purvu un grāvi vien bija braucis. Tas, kas viņu vadājis bijis velns.","source":"Kanaviņš Gulbenē. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VII, I, 965, 7.","category":"Vadātāji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-101-E01","start":293,"end":350,"span":"Vecīšam izrādījies itkā pa brangāko lielceļu būtu braucis","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misperceived route","evidence":"itkā pa brangāko lielceļu būtu braucis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-101-E02","start":402,"end":477,"span":"kad nu apskatījies pēdas, redzējis, ka pa purvu un grāvi vien bija braucis.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"orientation corrected","evidence":"pa purvu un grāvi vien bija braucis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning at mārkas; route evidence, not contemporaneous bog experience.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pa lielceļu","environment":"road","time":"cauru nakti","movement":"braucis pa lielceļu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.171482,"lon":26.752254,"label":"place-0142","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140501002","id":"140501002","collection":"LV","title":"Lietuvēns nenoteiktā veidā","text":"Jauna meita mežā (kur vecs mājas pamats atrodas) pļauj sienu un diensvidū sapņo: mazs bērns sēž purvā starp cīnīšiem un gauži raud. Meitai paliek žēl, tā uzliek bērnu pa pleciem un nesīs ārā. Bet bērns paliek ļoti smags, nevar vairs panest, sajūt lielu nogurumu un kājas grimst dūņās. Nu grib nosviest bērnu — nevar. Dūņās jau iegrimusi šī līdz pusei. Gan grib kliegt pēc palīga — nevar. Jau bērns palicis kalna smagumā. Meita, nāvi paredzēdama, arvienu vairāk trako, kliedz — tad atmostas. Bet pēc tam kādu nedēļu savārgusi.","source":"M. E. Bērziņš Umurgā. LP, VII, I, 427, 5.","category":"Lietuvēni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-102-E01","start":74,"end":131,"span":"sapņo: mazs bērns sēž purvā starp cīnīšiem un gauži raud.","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-102-E02","start":196,"end":284,"span":"bērns paliek ļoti smags, nevar vairs panest, sajūt lielu nogurumu un kājas grimst dūņās.","modalities":["pressure","bodily sensation","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-102-E03","start":285,"end":316,"span":"Nu grib nosviest bērnu — nevar.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Inability to release load.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-102-E04","start":352,"end":387,"span":"Gan grib kliegt pēc palīga — nevar.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Failed vocalisation, not heard silence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-102-E05","start":421,"end":490,"span":"Meita, nāvi paredzēdama, arvienu vairāk trako, kliedz — tad atmostas.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Transition from dream to waking.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"purvā starp cīnīšiem","environment":"wetland","time":"diensvidū","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.519392,"lon":24.807236,"label":"place-0492","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140504003","id":"140504003","collection":"LV","title":"Velis par lietuvēnu","text":"Lauku sargam, nelaiķa linotājam, zvanītājam guļot pie vecā lauku šķūņa, pienākuši divi mazi bērni un lūguši, lai viņu kauliņus aprokot kapsētā, tad viņiem būšot miers. \"Kas jūs tādi esat?\" lauku sargs prasījis. \"Mēs esam nomocīti bērni un mums jāiet deviņi gadi pa pasauli par lietuvēniem; tad pērkons mūs nospers.\" \"Kur tad ir jūsu kauliņi?\" lauku sargs tālāk prasījis. \"Velna bedrē!\" atbildējuši bērniņi. Lauku sargs atmodies, gājis uz Velna bedri raudzīt un tiešām atradis divi muskuļus niedrēs, vecās lupatās ietītus mazus bērnus, kuriem jau bijuši kauliņi iziruši. Viņš paņēmis bērniņus, aiznesis uz kapsētu un apracis kapos.","source":"Treimaņu Jānis Bērznieku Dzeņos, Kurzemē. Jkr. IV. LP, VII, I, 454.","category":"Lietuvēni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-103-E01","start":44,"end":142,"span":"guļot pie vecā lauku šķūņa, pienākuši divi mazi bērni un lūguši, lai viņu kauliņus aprokot kapsētā","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"identity query","evidence":"Kas jūs tādi esat?","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Dream inferred from guļot and atmodies; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-103-E02","start":429,"end":533,"span":"gājis uz Velna bedri raudzīt un tiešām atradis divi muskuļus niedrēs, vecās lupatās ietītus mazus bērnus","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Waking inspection at Velna bedri; dialect muskuļus requires review.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pie vecā lauku šķūņa","environment":"barn","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["other","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140505001","id":"140505001","collection":"LV","title":"Velns par lietuvēnu","text":"Reiz gājis viens vīrs pie baznīcas naudu rakt. Būtu jau gandrīz izracis, ja ceļinieks gaŗāmbraukdams nebūtu viņu izbiedējis. Nu pārnācis mājā ļoti nobijies un apgulies stāģinē (šķūnī) gultā. Citreiz bijušas pieslietas pie lauka durvim no iekšpuses tādas pusdures. Vakarā viņa sieva redzējusi, ka pa šīm pusdurēm pārlēcis sarkans suns. Viņa to turējusi par mājas suni, bet tas bijis velns, kas meklējis pēc vīra. Viņa iegājusi pie vīra un likusies gulēt, bet aizmigt nevarējusi, jo vīrs neganti krācis. Pienākusi pusnakts. Te izdzirdējusi, ka stāģinē ejot: \"Suk, suk, suk!\" Uz vienu reizi suns piegājis pie vīra gultas un bāzies ar joni virsū, tā ka vīrs stenējis: \"Ui, ui, ui!\" Netālu kūts augšā gulējuši zaldāti. Šie izdzirdējuši sievu saucam un vīru stenam, noskrējuši no kūts un gandrīz nodūruši suni ar bagnītēm. Vīrs nu gan ticis svabads, bet mute bijusi apgriezta pakausī. Pēcāk gan attecējis, bet mute palikusi uz sānu pusi, pareizi nekad vairs nesagriezusies.","source":"F. Fišers Krūtē, Lejas-Kurzemē LP, VII, I, 432, 2.","category":"Lietuvēni","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-104-E01","start":264,"end":334,"span":"Vakarā viņa sieva redzējusi, ka pa šīm pusdurēm pārlēcis sarkans suns.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentification","evidence":"Viņa to turējusi par mājas suni, bet tas bijis velns","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-104-E02","start":458,"end":501,"span":"aizmigt nevarējusi, jo vīrs neganti krācis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-104-E03","start":522,"end":572,"span":"Te izdzirdējusi, ka stāģinē ejot: \"Suk, suk, suk!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Pusnakts; onomatopoeia retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-104-E04","start":588,"end":677,"span":"suns piegājis pie vīra gultas un bāzies ar joni virsū, tā ka vīrs stenējis: \"Ui, ui, ui!\"","modalities":["pressure","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Husband bodily experiencer, wife acoustic witness.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-104-E05","start":714,"end":758,"span":"Šie izdzirdējuši sievu saucam un vīru stenam","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group experiencer zaldāti; kūts augšā.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"stāģinē","environment":"barn","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.379002,"lon":21.425377,"label":"place-0214","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140602013","id":"140602013","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas apracējs prasa cilvēku dzīvību par naudu","text":"Kāds vanderzellis gājis pa ceļu. Ceļā viņam uznāca tumsa. Viņš iegājis kādā rijā, uzkāpis uz ārdiem un tur aplicies gulēt. Pa nakti ienāk viens cilvēks, izrok pie pašas krāsns bedri, sabeŗ lielu daudzumu naudas un aprok. Apracis viņš teic: \" Kas te noliks septiņas cilvēku galvas, tas to naudu dabūs.\"  Vanderzellis no ārdiem sauc: \" Septiņas zvirbuļu galvas!\"  Pēc trīskārtīgas strīdēšanās naudas apracējs sauc: \" Kungs, lai paliek tava griba!\"  Vanderzellis sameklējis septiņas zvirbuļu galvas, izņēmis naudu un dzīvojis laimīgi.","source":"Skolnieks Andrejs Ritenis no 40 g. v. Miķēļa Dunika, Nīcā.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Overheard exchange is ordinary dialogue without an explicit perception predicate; retained as a boundary exclusion.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.346498,"lon":21.065493,"label":"place-0318","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140603004","id":"140603004","collection":"LV","title":"Paslēpta nauda ar dažādām prasībām","text":"Tāpat akal saimnieka tēvs gāš uz mežu un gribēš aprakt naudu. Bet saimnieks jutis, uz ko tēvs taisās, aizgāš papriekšu uz mežu un uzkāpis kokā. Drīz vie saimnieka tēvs ar bīš klā un apukš koka apracis naudu un novēlēš tā: \"Kas ar nodīrātu zirgu ars, tas dabūs naudu rokā!\" Saimnieks, kokā sēdēdams, visu dzirdēš un redzēš. Šis nu domāš un gūdrēš, kā lei nu dabū naudu rokā. Pēdīgi šim iešāvies labs padoms prātā un šis no koka kliedzis: \"Kas ar pliku zirgu ars, tas dabūs naudu rokā!\" Saimnieka tēvs domāš, ka Dievīc vie runā, un piekritis ar un sacīš: \"Lei jau, Dievī', paliek pēc tava prāta!\"\n\nKa nu saimnieka tēvs nomiris un šo nobērēši, ta saimnieks licis saimnīcai, lei noģērbas pavisam plika, iejūdzis šo arklā un pārdzinis pār to vietu, kur saimnieka tēvs naudu apracis, trīs vagas. Nu nauda tūlī devusies rokā.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 72 g. vecā J. Baltiņa Bilskas pag.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-106-E01","start":273,"end":322,"span":"Saimnieks, kokā sēdēdams, visu dzirdēš un redzēš.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-106-E02","start":485,"end":525,"span":"Saimnieka tēvs domāš, ka Dievīc vie runā","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified speaker","evidence":"domāš, ka Dievīc vie runā","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Father is experiencer; auditory inference licensed by shouted response; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uz mežu","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140604023","id":"140604023","collection":"LV","title":"Velni sargā naudu","text":"Nauda arī sapņos rādījusies, noteikusi vietu, arī līdzekļus, kā viņa dabūnama. Kas noteikumu uz mata izpildījis, tas naudu dabūjis. Tā viens vīrs naktsvidū gulējis pie egles. Viņš sapņojis, ka tanī un tanī vietā esot nauda, bet dabūtājam vajagot upurēt tanī vietā septiņus garus. Vīrs pamodies un būtu varējis tapt bagāts, bet kur lai ņem septiņus garus? Mājā gan bijušas septiņas aitas, bet tām taču neesot gari. Tā nauda palikusi tanī pašā vietā.","source":"A. Skara. \"Austrums\", 1894. g. nr. 2. LP, VII, I, 1124, 4.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-107-E01","start":175,"end":279,"span":"Viņš sapņojis, ka tanī un tanī vietā esot nauda, bet dabūtājam vajagot upurēt tanī vietā septiņus garus.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Sensory modality unspecified; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pie egles","environment":"tree","time":"naktsvidū","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["other"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140604037","id":"140604037","collection":"LV","title":"Velni sargā naudu","text":"Bija reizi nāvīgs dzērājs, tas nodzēra visu naudu un tad gāja uz tuvējo kalnu naudu atkal iedabūt. Nogāja tur pie vecā ozola — redz: viens kungs turpat stāv, bet gluži melns. Dzērājs lūdzas: \"Aizdod man naudu!\" Melnais atbild: \"Tu esi briesmīgs dzērājs — tikpat visu naudu atstāsi krogā — nedomu!\" Citā reizē gar to pašu ozolu iegadās nabaga moderniekam gaŗām iet. Tad melnais kungs atkal iznāca no ozola un pats piedāvājās naudu aizdot. Modernieks atbildēja: \"Nevaru naudu aizņemties, es jau nemaz nezinu, vai spēju atdot jeb ne.\" Melnais kungs atsacīja: \"Nekas! atdod pa kapeikai, pa divi kapeikām, kā nu redzēdams. Tad — ar naudu te atnākdams — ieteicies tikai: \"Mārtiņ, no ezera! Atnesu naudu!\" tad tūliņ gadīšos un naudu saņemšu!\" Modernieks sacīja: \"Nu, tad dod arī!\" Tūliņ melnais kungs iegāja gravā, iznesa naudas īsti krietnu maisu un atdeva to moderniekam. Modernieks tagad bija bagāts vīrs. Bet no nelaimes baidīdamies, viņš, tikko, kautcik bija naudu sapelnījies, tūliņ nesa pie vecā ozola, saukdams: \"Mārtiņ, no ezera!\" Bet melnais kungs nerādījās vairs, atnāca tikai tāds puika un pasacīja: \"No jūras atlaidās lielais dunduris, nosita Mārtiņu; lai nauda paliek tev.\" Nu modernieks dzīvoja labi jo labi.","source":"J. Simenovs Dolē. Brīvzemnieka \"Sborņik\". LP, VII, I, 1150, 2.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-108-E01","start":127,"end":174,"span":"redz: viens kungs turpat stāv, bet gluži melns.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pie vecā ozola","environment":"tree","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.856174,"lon":24.275452,"label":"place-0095","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140605006","id":"140605006","collection":"LV","title":"Veļi sargā naudu","text":"Vienreiz dzīvojis tāds nabags strādnieks. Viņš caurām dienām strādāja nosvīdis, bet kā nabags, tā nabags. Vienu vakaru viņš nāk mājā no darba un dikti līst lietus. Viņš, nākdams mājā, ieraugst ceļmalā vienu riju. Viņš domājis: pieiešu pie tās rijas un bišķi nogaidīšu, kamēr lietus pāriet. Viņš pieiet pie tās rijas un stāv pažobelē. Te iznāk no tās rijas viens vīrs un sāk vākt viņu, lai nu nākot iekšā. Nu tas strādnieks neko sliktu nedomā un iet arī līdz. Kā jau pa vecam, toreiz rijās strādāja, kādēļ viņš domāja, ka tas ir kāds no tiem rijas ļaudim. Nu viņi abi ieiet tai rijā: viss ir kluss un tumšs. Tam strādniekam gan paliek tā bailīgi, bet neko nevar darīt, kas nu būs, būs. Nu tas vīrs iznācis, novedis to strādnieku vienā rijas stūrī un liek, lai viņš tur kaš augšā zemi. Šim nu paliek pavisam bailes, bet saņem dūšu un domā, kas ir, ir — un ņem kast. Šis kaš un kaš un uz vienu reizi izkaš lielu naudas podu. Nu strādnieks viņu izceļ no tā dumbēŗa. Un tas svešais vīrs nu saka viņam: \"To naudu tu vari nest mājā un tā pieder tev, jo man viņa bija jāvaktē katru nakti un es neviena cilvēka nevarēju atrast, kam es to naudu būtu varējis atdot, jo katrs baidījās un muka prom, cik vien varēja. Un tagad nes savu naudu mājā un ar labu nakti.\" To sacījis viņš pazudis. Strādnieks ņēma naudas podu pa pleciem un nesa mājā un dzīvoja ar atrasto naudu priecīgs un laimīgs līdz mūža beigām.","source":"Skolnieks A. Jurķis. K. Lielozola kr.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-109-E01","start":184,"end":212,"span":"ieraugst ceļmalā vienu riju.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-109-E02","start":583,"end":606,"span":"viss ir kluss un tumšs.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Ambient silence and darkness within encounter; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-109-E03","start":1252,"end":1276,"span":"To sacījis viņš pazudis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"viņš pazudis","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual observation; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"riju","environment":"threshing barn","time":"Vienu vakaru","movement":"nāk mājā no darba"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:140607011","id":"140607011","collection":"LV","title":"Nauda parādās par cilvēku","text":"Vīrs gājis novakarā pa mežu un saticis skaistu meiteni. Šī nu ņēmusies vīru lūgties, lai tas tai uzsitot — ja ne vairāk, tad lai taču ar pirkstu aizkaŗot. Bet vīrs nelicies ne dzirdot, rāvies nadzīgi uz priekšu, tā kā sviedri pa matu galiem pilējuši. Meitene pazudusi, vīrs nodzirdējis tikai naudu nožvakstam un meitenes vārdus: \"Tūkstoš gadu esmu gulējusi — vēl tūkstoš jāguļ.\"","source":"Kalniņu Jēkabs Ozolnieku Līčos. Jkr. IV. LP, VII, 1, 1071, 12.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-110-E01","start":269,"end":327,"span":"vīrs nodzirdējis tikai naudu nožvakstam un meitenes vārdus","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Preceding nelicies ne dzirdot is intentional disregard, not non-hearing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pa mežu","environment":"forest","time":"novakarā","movement":"Vīrs gājis novakarā pa mežu"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.688534,"lon":23.777469,"label":"place-0336","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140607012","id":"140607012","collection":"LV","title":"Nauda parādās par cilvēku","text":"Liezeres Ozolmuižas pagastā, netālu no viena ezeriņa, atrodas grava, ko par Velna gravu sauc. Agrāki minētās gravas vietā bijis līdzenums, bet velns, še gulēdams un savu mantu tuvējā ezeriņā sargādams, izgulējis šo gravu, tādēļ viņa dabūjusi nosaukumu: Velna grava. Gar ezeriņu agrāk ceļš gājis gaŗām, pa ko reiz ceļinieks pusnaktī braucis. Šis ieraudzījis no ezeriņa puses jaunu meitu nākot. Meita aizstājusies ceļā un lūgusi, lai viņš tai ar pātagu iesitot jeb citādi kā to aizkaŗot. Kad ceļinieks to neuzdrošinājies un meitas lūgumu atraidījis, tad viņa teikusi: \"Es esmu naudas muca un piederu velnam. Ja tu mani būtu aizticis, tad es tev piederētu, bet tagad man vēl simtu gadu jāguļ ezera dibinā; pēc simtu gadiem tika i varēšu atkal cilvēkiem rādīties.\" Šos vārdus izteikusi, tā palikusi par naudas mucu un žvārkstēdama ieripojusi ezera dibinā.","source":"Deļļu Hugons, Salncietis, Liezerē. Jkr. IV. LP, VII, I, 1071, 13.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-111-E01","start":341,"end":392,"span":"Šis ieraudzījis no ezeriņa puses jaunu meitu nākot.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-111-E02","start":783,"end":851,"span":"tā palikusi par naudas mucu un žvārkstēdama ieripojusi ezera dibinā.","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"changed appearance","evidence":"palikusi par naudas mucu","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual observation contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"no ezeriņa puses","environment":"waterside","time":"pusnaktī","movement":"ceļinieks pusnaktī braucis"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.018123,"lon":26.059641,"label":"place-0253","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140607017","id":"140607017","collection":"LV","title":"Nauda parādās par cilvēku","text":"Netālu no Mizaiņu mājām atronas mazs mežiņš, kas senākos laikos bijis izdaudzināts par lielu mokšu vietu, tā ka pat dienas laikā neviens neiedrīkstējies tam tovoties, jo tur arvienu balta vecene bijusi redzama uz ciņa ceļa malā sēžam. Reiz vienam saimniekam vecene sapnī parādījusies un sacījusi: \"Tagad man laiks iet projām, jo kad jūs bijāt tik muļķi, tad paliekat arī tādi līdz pastara dienai. Ja viens būtu sacījis uz mani \"Labdien!\", tad es tūliņ būtu pārvērtusies par naudu.\" Vecene pazudusi un nekad vairs nebijusi redzama.","source":"Lejaslauka Pumpurs Kosē. \"Baltijas Vēstneša\" piel. 1893. g. nr. 68. LP, VII, I, 1073, 20.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-112-E01","start":170,"end":234,"span":"tur arvienu balta vecene bijusi redzama uz ciņa ceļa malā sēžam.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-112-E02","start":240,"end":283,"span":"vienam saimniekam vecene sapnī parādījusies","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-112-E03","start":501,"end":530,"span":"nekad vairs nebijusi redzama.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic subsequent non-seeing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"mazs mežiņš","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.092101,"lon":25.421152,"label":"place-0206","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140607024","id":"140607024","collection":"LV","title":"Nauda parādās par cilvēku","text":"Stepiņa kalns atrodas no L. muižas vienu versti. Tur bijis ļoti liels mežs, kur agrāki ļaudis mantu esot paglabājuši, no nikniem kaŗiem bīdamies. Kalnā redzējuši arvienu naudas uguntiņu degam un mēģinājuši naudu izrakt, bet nekā nedabūjuši. Tad reiz vienam baznīcēnam, pār kalnu ejot, piestājušās divas jaunekles: viena rūsainā apģērbā, otra baltā, un lūgušas vecītim (baznīcēnam): \"Pieliec mums savu pirkstu, tad tu tapsi bagāts; bet ja negribi mums aiztikt, tad tevi apbērs ar mūžīgu kalnu.\" Vecīšam labprāt bagātība patikusi, pagrūdis rūsaino jaunekli. Tā uz reizi sabrukusi par kapara naudas mucu. Nu grābis pilnas kules, nemaz neievērodams, ka baltā jaunekle vēl uz pagrūdienu gaidīt gaida. Izgaidījusies, nevarējusi sagaidīt, sapiktojusies un sabirzusi par sudraba naudu tādā bezdibiņa dobē. Vecītis sudrabu ieraudzījis, atstājis vaŗa naudu dobes malā un devies dobē pēc sudraba Bet tik ko dobē ticis, sacēlies liels viesulis un apbēris vecīti, apbēris vaŗa un sudraba naudu ar lielu smilšu kalnu. Vēl šodien vecītis tur dus un kalnu sauc apbērtā vecīša vārdā par Stepiņa kalnu.","source":"J. Balodis Velēnā. Brīvzemnieka kr. LP, VII, I, 1076, 28.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-113-E01","start":146,"end":191,"span":"Kalnā redzējuši arvienu naudas uguntiņu degam","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic group observation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-113-E02","start":529,"end":555,"span":"pagrūdis rūsaino jaunekli.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-113-E03","start":798,"end":825,"span":"Vecītis sudrabu ieraudzījis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Stepiņa kalns","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.240755,"lon":26.400587,"label":"place-0530","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:140608001","id":"140608001","collection":"LV","title":"Nauda parādās par kustoni","text":"Aumeisteŗu pagastā Pakuļu mājas robežās ir mazs avotiņš, ko sauc par Naudas avotiņu, jo viņā esot nogrimusi naudas muca. Reiz vakara krēslā, ganu māte gājusi uz avotiņu pēc ūdens. Kad viņa bijusi jau turpat pie avotiņa klāt, tad uzreiz sākusi zeme dimdēt un baurodams drāzies tai no pakaļas brūns vērsis. Ganu māte iekliegusies un bēgusi uz māju. Ūdens vien nošļakstējis, ka vērsis ieskrējis avotiņā un uzreiz pazudis.","source":"H. Skujiņa Aumeisteŗu pag.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-114-E01","start":229,"end":304,"span":"uzreiz sākusi zeme dimdēt un baurodams drāzies tai no pakaļas brūns vērsis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-114-E02","start":347,"end":370,"span":"Ūdens vien nošļakstējis","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Naudas avotiņu","environment":"spring","time":"vakara krēslā","movement":"gājusi uz avotiņu pēc ūdens"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0032","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150110041","id":"150110041","collection":"LV","title":"Naudai vēl jāguļ 100 gadu zemē","text":"Kādu versti no Paugas un Velna kalna uz ziemeļiem atronas L. muižas ataugās lielas dziļas bedres. Tās bedres esot izrakuši četri skrodeŗi, naudu rakdami. Tam vienam skroderim esot parādījies sapnī mazs vecītis: lai eimot L. muižas ataugās pie tādas un tādas egles, vienu asi dziļumā, naudas kasti rakt; bet lai ņemot vēl trīs biedrus līdz, jo kasti viens neizcelšot. Bet rakdami lai nerunājot ne vārda un atpakaļ arī lai neskatoties.\n\nLabi, skroderis paņēmis vēl trīs skrodeŗus un nākamā vakarā sākuši rakt. Un patiesi! Uzrakuši lielu, lielu naudas kasti. Bet nu — kur bijuši, kur nebijuši — no malu malām saskrējuši visuvisādi ķēmi: suņi riedami, kaķi ņaudēdami, melni kungi ar spīdošām pogām, melnas karietes ar 12 zirgiem priekšā un kas ne kas. Un ķēmi tik briesmīgi trokšņojuši, ka racējiem vai ausis aizkritušas. Tomēr skroderi trokšņotājus maz ievērojuši, cēluši tikai savu kasti laukā. Bet tikko kasti beiguši celt no bedres, skroderi domājuši: \"Nu viņa pieder mums!\" un sākuši cits gavilēt, cits ar rungu suņus, kaķus velēt, kas turpat vai pie kājām klupuši. Kamēr tur velējuši, naudas kaste atkal dārdēdama, skanēdama iebrukusi zemē, nokliegdama: \"Simtu gadu te gulēju, simtu atkal jāguļ\"\n\nCits atkal stāsta, ka citam, kas pēc vecīša pavēles visu izdarījis pareizi — esot izdevies tai pašā vietā naudas podu pilnu ar zelta un sudraba dukātiem izrakt. Vēl cits stāsta, ka drusku tālāk no bedrēm, zem liela, nosūnējuša akmeņa tā naudas kaste atronoties. Tā reiz ganu puika, govis ganīdams sēdējis uz cintiņas pie šī lielā akmeņa un dziedājis. Te uz reizi lielais akmens apvēlies uz sāniem un no apakšas izjājis melns kungs šo naudas kasti, ka nodārdējis vien, un tiecies pēc tuklākā vērša, sacīdams: \"Ja tu, ganu puika, atdosi man šo vērsi, tad dabūsi šito naudas kasti.\" Iesākumā puika gandrīz jau bijis mierā atdot arī prasīto vērsi. Bet kad melnais kungs nokāpis no naudas kastes un vērsi pie ragiem jau vilcis uz akmeņa pusi, tad puika apdomājies un sācis melno rīdīt ar suņiem. Tūliņ melnais jātniski nosēdies atkal uz savu kasti un pajājis zem akmeņa, kliegdams: \"Simtu gadu še gulēju, simtu atkal jāguļ!\"\n\nVēl cits stāsta, ka turpat kādā purviņā reiz vecai Ilzei parādījušās, ap pulksten divpadsmitiem, divas jaunas sievietes, lai Ilze, vai nu aizkaŗot viņas ar pirkstu, vai arī, vismazākais sviežot ar kādu žagariņu. Bet Ilze to nedarījusi. Tad jaunās iesākušas raudāt un ielīdušas zemē, dziedādamas: \"Simtu gadu gulējām, simtu jāguļ!\" Būtot Ilze viņas aizkārusi, tad viņas būtot pārvērtušās viena par podu, otra par naudu.","source":"Brencēns Madaliņas dr. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VI, 233, 30, 29.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-115-E01","start":154,"end":209,"span":"Tam vienam skroderim esot parādījies sapnī mazs vecītis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual dream.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E02","start":634,"end":662,"span":"suņi riedami, kaķi ņaudēdami","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E03","start":751,"end":817,"span":"ķēmi tik briesmīgi trokšņojuši, ka racējiem vai ausis aizkritušas.","modalities":["auditory","bodily sensation"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Hearing overload qualified by vai; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E04","start":978,"end":997,"span":"sākuši cits gavilēt","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E05","start":1087,"end":1197,"span":"naudas kaste atkal dārdēdama, skanēdama iebrukusi zemē, nokliegdama: \"Simtu gadu te gulēju, simtu atkal jāguļ\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E06","start":1469,"end":1549,"span":"ganu puika, govis ganīdams sēdējis uz cintiņas pie šī lielā akmeņa un dziedājis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Separate episode, individual.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E07","start":1610,"end":1665,"span":"izjājis melns kungs šo naudas kasti, ka nodārdējis vien","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Same herdboy episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E08","start":2045,"end":2118,"span":"pajājis zem akmeņa, kliegdams: \"Simtu gadu še gulēju, simtu atkal jāguļ!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E09","start":2147,"end":2239,"span":"kādā purviņā reiz vecai Ilzei parādījušās, ap pulksten divpadsmitiem, divas jaunas sievietes","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Separate episode, individual, wetland; noon/midnight unspecified.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-115-E10","start":2360,"end":2414,"span":"jaunās iesākušas raudāt un ielīdušas zemē, dziedādamas","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Ilze episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.217955,"lon":26.236989,"label":"place-0278","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111002","id":"150111002","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Vecos laikos ļaudis Jāņu naktīs un ziemas svētku naktīs redzējuši arvien uz Ādammuižas Naudas kalna uguntiņu kuramies. Reiz viens zīlnieks pamācījis diviem vīriem, lai ejot uz Naudas kalnu naudu rakt. Tur gan nākšot visādi ķēmi, vilki, lāči viņus aizkavēt, bet lai tik neskatoties atpakaļ un nebaidoties! Un ja beidzot liels melns vērsis nāktu, tam lai katrs ķeŗoties pie ragiem un lai to vilktu atpakaļ. Vīri aiziet un rok. Te nāk sirms vilks kaukdams — šie neliekas ne redzot; nāk plušķains lācis ŗūkdams — šie neliekas ne redzot; nāk visādi ķēmi lēkādami — šie neliekas ne redzot; sāk vilkties riebīgas ķidas pār kalnu — šie neliekas ne redzot; beidzot nāk liels melns vērsis badīt — šie ieķeras katrs pie ragiem un velk to atpakaļ. Tā velkot, stumjot vienam vīram pasprūk rokas no raga vaļā. Vīrs mazuliet satrūkstas, bet tai pašā acumirklī naudas tīnis vārīdamies noveļas no kalna taisni purvā iekšā. Ļaudis šodien sauc vēl šo purvu par Naudas purvu.","source":"A. Lerchis-Puškaitis Džūkstē-Pienavā. LP, I, 181, 182.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-116-E01","start":20,"end":118,"span":"Jāņu naktīs un ziemas svētku naktīs redzējuši arvien uz Ādammuižas Naudas kalna uguntiņu kuramies.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-116-E02","start":428,"end":452,"span":"nāk sirms vilks kaukdams","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-116-E03","start":479,"end":506,"span":"nāk plušķains lācis ŗūkdams","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-116-E04","start":687,"end":735,"span":"šie ieķeras katrs pie ragiem un velk to atpakaļ.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit resisted contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-116-E05","start":755,"end":795,"span":"vienam vīram pasprūk rokas no raga vaļā.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ādammuižas Naudas kalna","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.78922,"lon":23.247195,"label":"place-0111","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111005","id":"150111005","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Netālu no Stendes Smildzēju mājām bijis viens ozols un pie šī ozola esot aprakta nauda. Viens vecis gājis minēto naudu rakt. Uzgājis arī naudas podu, bet uz poda sēdējis virsū āpsis. Vecais gribējis āpsi nosist, bet tas nogrimis ar visu podu. Ozols tagad ir nocirsts, bet pie celma ir vēl redzama veča raktā bedre.","source":"E. Smildziņa Stendē, P. Kundziņa krājumā.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-117-E01","start":282,"end":314,"span":"ir vēl redzama veča raktā bedre.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Present generic visibility of material trace.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pie celma","environment":"tree","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.141246,"lon":22.536656,"label":"place-0448","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111022","id":"150111022","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Reiz nakti cetri dušigi puiši gajuši naudas podu rakt, kas esot zem svetozola saknem aprakts. Bijusi tumša nakts. Sakuši rakt. Nebijuši ilgi rakuši, kad palicis gaišs ka diena, lai gan bijis ap pusnakti. Bet tas nebijis viss. Driz vien ieraudzijuši, ka pa upes krastu brauc bazniceni svetdienas drebes, un celš gajis taisni par to vietu, kur puiši rakuši un kur cela nekad nav bijis. Naudas poda raceji, no sakuma, nepiegriezuši nekadu veribu braucejiem. Kad pirmais pajugs piebraucis pie racejiem, braucejs apturejis zirgu un padevis dievpaligu. Puiši atnemuši dievpaligu un rakuši tik talak. Tad braucejs, kas bijis vel pajauns un tados savados vecmodigos svarkos gerbies, teicis: \"Ko tad nu-jus svetdienas rita stradajat? Brauksim labak uz baznicu.\" Puiši atteikuši, ka nav svetdiena, bet gan trešdiena, kas ari patiesiba bijusi. Svešais braucejs uzstavejis uz savu un meginajis puišus no darba atrunat. Puiši tik rakuši talak un svešinieks aizbraucis. Puiši pec maza laicina sadzirduši tadu savadu dardonu, paceluši galvas un no brinumiem palikuši vai memi. Uz viniem drazies putna atruma pajugs, kam priekša bijis skaists melns erzelis, un tas skrejis tik atri, ka tam kajas tikko pie zemes metušas. Aiz melna erzela braukusi vel vesela rinda pajugu. Pajugos sedejuši gan virieši, gan sievietes. Daziem bijušas dziesmu gramatas rokas. Melnais erzelis drazies taisni uz racejiem. Raceji pavirzijušies sanis, bet erzelis ar visu pajugu tiem pakal. Pajuga sedejis virietis ar garu dzeltanu bardu un smaididams teicis. \"Nu, brauksim uz baznicu!\" Puiši manijuši, ka nebus labi, un sakuši begt. Nebijuši necik talu paskrejuši, kad viss palicis klusu un atkal tumšs, ka vai aci dur, jo bijusi rudens nakts. Iet atpakal un turpinat rakšanu puiši nav vairs uzdrošinajušies.","source":"H. Skujina Rauza.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-118-E01","start":153,"end":203,"span":"palicis gaišs ka diena, lai gan bijis ap pusnakti.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"light/time mismatch","evidence":"gaišs ka diena, lai gan bijis ap pusnakti","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-118-E02","start":236,"end":383,"span":"ieraudzijuši, ka pa upes krastu brauc bazniceni svetdienas drebes, un celš gajis taisni par to vietu, kur puiši rakuši un kur cela nekad nav bijis.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unexpected route","evidence":"kur cela nekad nav bijis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-118-E03","start":956,"end":1009,"span":"Puiši pec maza laicina sadzirduši tadu savadu dardonu","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-118-E04","start":1062,"end":1140,"span":"Uz viniem drazies putna atruma pajugs, kam priekša bijis skaists melns erzelis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Observation licensed by preceding raised heads; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-118-E05","start":1630,"end":1704,"span":"viss palicis klusu un atkal tumšs, ka vai aci dur, jo bijusi rudens nakts.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"abrupt perceptual change","evidence":"atkal tumšs","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pa upes krastu","environment":"waterside","time":"ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.407235,"lon":26.115982,"label":"place-0375","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111035","id":"150111035","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Saukas pagasta divas verstes no Ekengraves muizas atrodas Kulinu majas un lidz ar vinam Kulinu kalninš, ne visai augsts, bet tomer tik liels, ka varetu pili uz ta uzcelt. Ta laudis stasta, ka tur ari senos laikos pils bijusi, bet launi gari to noburuši un pils nogrimusi zeme ar visiem saviem zeltiem un sudrabiem, tik palicis pari šis kalninš, kas apslepis nogrimušo pili. Ta vina gulejusi ilgu laiku un neviens nezinajis, kas gul zem ši kalnina. Pec: kada laika, vienam puisim paradijies sapni kads vecitis, un sacijis, lai ejot uz šo kalninu un rokot, tad klušot bagats, jo zem ši kalnina esot veca pils. Puisis panem lapstu un iet rakt. Bet bagatam ari gribas klut. Tas pasauc pašu saimnieku un vel kadu puisi un iet meklet laimi. Un ka tad! Rok, rok — sak jau grabet. Visi vai no prieka palecas gaisa. Skatas un ierauga pils jumtu, parok vel un atrod logu. ielien iekša un nu nemas sviedros dargas mantas siet dekos un nest lauka. Iznesuši labu kaudzi. jau sak apkust un viens ierunajas: \"Vai nebus diezgan?\" Visi bija ar mieru, aizbera bedri, izdalija mantu un gaja majas priecigu pratu. Bet Dievs bij sadusmojies, tapec ka puisis viens pats nebij racis, un atvelejis pili launiem gariem, un pils nu nogrimusi vel dzilak. Puišiem un saimniekam ari viss pazudis, ka ne vests nav palikusi. Pusnakti uz ši kalnina aizdegoties maza uguntina. Un kad veciem laudim prasa, kapec vina tur deg, tad atbild: \"'Tur zelta nauda kaltejas!\" Pec vinas esot daudz tiekušies. Rokot, rokot — tulit bušot klat, bet noskanot vien un nauda noejot dzilak zeme. Tas esot vel šo baltu dienu, ka pusnakts laika Kulinu kalna aizdegoties uguntina un jauni gari tur kaltejot sapelejušo zelta naudu.","source":"Lindemanis Saukā. Latvju kultūras kr.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-119-E01","start":465,"end":508,"span":"vienam puisim paradijies sapni kads vecitis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-119-E02","start":746,"end":772,"span":"Rok, rok — sak jau grabet.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-119-E03","start":807,"end":835,"span":"Skatas un ierauga pils jumtu","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-119-E04","start":958,"end":972,"span":"jau sak apkust","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-119-E05","start":1502,"end":1544,"span":"noskanot vien un nauda noejot dzilak zeme.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later generic digging episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kulinu kalninš","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.275234,"lon":25.481709,"label":"place-0419","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111039","id":"150111039","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Senos laikos dzīvojis vecs meža sargs, kad bijis apkārtnē izdaudzināts par naudas podu racēju. Nevienu vien naudas podu tas esot savā mežā izracis. Aizgājis naktī uz Kūjiņu kalnu un sācis rakt. Bijis jau labi dziļu bedri izracis, kad gribējis drusku elpu atraut un uzpīpēt. Apsēdies uz bedres malas, kājas atstājis tāpat bedrē un uzpīpējis. Te dzird: tālumā sāk smagi mežs šalkt. Šalkoņa nākusi uz Kūjiņu kalna pusi. Koki lūzuši, zari brīkšķējuši un viesulis griezies. Izbrīnējies raudzījies meža sargs apkārt. Te redz: pa ceļu, kas ved no Smiltenes uz Mēŗu muižu, brauc lepna karīte. Kučērs uz bukas, iekšā sēd divi melni spīdīgi kungi, karītei priekšā divi melni zirgi un zirgiem acis spīd kā ogles un no nāsim šaujas kā ugunis, kā dūmi. Karīte braukusi pa kokiem un krūmiem, nekur nav ķērusies, bet ātri tuvojusies Kūjiņu kalnam. Nebijusi karīte tālu no Kūjiņu kalna, ka tik meža sargs ieraudzījis, ka tai pa priekšu skrien melns liels suns ar izkārtu mēli un ugunīgām acim. Suņam mēle bijusi tik sarkana, kā degoša pagale, un tik gaŗa, ka vilkusies gandrīz pa zemi. Suns drāzies taisni uz bedri, ko nupat meža sargs izracis, un uz kuŗas malas pats sēdējis. Meža sargs izmeties no bedres. Tikko meža sargam kājas bijušas no bedres ārā, viņā iegāzies viss pajūgs, suns un braucēji. Nebijis meža sargs ne desmit soļu paskrējis, kad vētra jau bijusi apklususi un koki stāvējuši gluži mierīgi un klusu.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenē.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-120-E01","start":341,"end":468,"span":"Te dzird: tālumā sāk smagi mežs šalkt. Šalkoņa nākusi uz Kūjiņu kalna pusi. Koki lūzuši, zari brīkšķējuši un viesulis griezies.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-120-E02","start":511,"end":584,"span":"Te redz: pa ceļu, kas ved no Smiltenes uz Mēŗu muižu, brauc lepna karīte.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-120-E03","start":878,"end":977,"span":"meža sargs ieraudzījis, ka tai pa priekšu skrien melns liels suns ar izkārtu mēli un ugunīgām acim.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-120-E04","start":1333,"end":1401,"span":"vētra jau bijusi apklususi un koki stāvējuši gluži mierīgi un klusu.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kūjiņu kalnu","environment":"hill","time":"naktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.423063,"lon":25.900378,"label":"place-0441","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111045","id":"150111045","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Trikātas ezerā, tajā pie pilskalna, guļot nogrimusi liela dzelzs kaste ar zelta naudu. Reiz kungs licis kalpiem viņu izvilkt. Velk kalpi un nevar saprast, kāpēc rokas un kājas tūkst. Kaste parādījusies jau ūdens virsū, uzreiz skrien vēsts no muižas lai nevelk, jo kungs pārsprādzis.","source":"Elza Gaile Trikātā.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-121-E01","start":126,"end":182,"span":"Velk kalpi un nevar saprast, kāpēc rokas un kājas tūkst.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unexplained bodily change","evidence":"nevar saprast, kāpēc rokas un kājas tūkst","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Swelling explicit; felt versus visible not differentiated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Trikātas ezerā","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.54396,"lon":25.709581,"label":"place-0483","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150111052","id":"150111052","collection":"LV","title":"Naudas racēji iztraucēti","text":"Gaujēniešos vienc vecis uzgāš naudas šķirstu un ar kājām sācis dauzīt šķirstam dzelzs vāku un pēdīgi vāks atgāš vaļā. Nu vecis skrēš uz māju un citim stāstīš, kāda šim laime gadīsies, bet ka nācis apakaļ, ta no šķirsta vais ne vēsts.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 72 g. v. Jēkaba Baltiņa Bilskas pag.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-122-E01","start":48,"end":90,"span":"ar kājām sācis dauzīt šķirstam dzelzs vāku","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150112009","id":"150112009","collection":"LV","title":"Naudu saņem tas, kam tā nolemta","text":"Vienam Salniekam trīs reizas sapnī parādījies vecs vīriņš: lai eimot Pils kalnā tai un tai vietā naudas podu rakt. Labi, izracis arī. Bet otrā naktī pie racēja atkūlies lācis un gribējis, lai atdodot visus savus zirgus. Salnieks paķēris plinti un šāvis lāci, bet šāviens ķēris pašu meitu, pie krāsns otrā pusē.\n\nTas pats arī noticis citam salniekam: tas racis naudu pie Bala ezera un, lāci šaudams, nošāvis savu dēlu. Kāds mazsaimnieks Salniekos atkal atradis naudu zirgu pēdā, ganībās. Nu dzīvojis veselu gadu līksmi jo līksmi; bet otrā gadā nomiris un ko domāt — sirds bijusi izrauta — pazudusi.","source":"Plaudu Jānis Jaun-Dubultos. Zin. Kom. kr. LP, VI, 228, 30, 20.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-123-E01","start":17,"end":57,"span":"trīs reizas sapnī parādījies vecs vīriņš","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated dream consolidated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.961074,"lon":23.757757,"label":"place-0158","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150112021","id":"150112021","collection":"LV","title":"Naudu saņem tas, kam tā nolemta","text":"Vīnu reiz Juoņa dīnos naktī treis puiši sasarunuoja īt naudas maklātu. Trešais beja gudruoks, un kad pi juo atguoja un vajadzēja īt naudas roktu, soka: \"Es naīšu, ejit jyus divi!\" Tī divi puiši pajēmja luopstas un aizguoja, bet par nagaru laiciņu ari trešais guoja pakaļ. Naudas maklātuoji pīguoja pi daudzynuotuo akmeņa, ka zam tuo akmeņa Juoņa dīnas naktī varūt atrast naudu, atvēļa akmeņi un suoka rakt. Jau ruoduos: te pat nauda byus, bet izrakt navar. Trešais puiss stuovēja par gobolu un redzēja, kai ap racējim doncuoja apkuort uozis un kad racēji roka, vvs lyka prīškā sovus rogus. Tys uozis beja valns, kuram vajadzēja naudu sorguot. Roka, roka puiši un, nūsaspļuovuši, aizguoja uz daudzynuotū bārzu, ka zam tuo saknem asūt nauda. Puiši guoja uz bārzu, bet uozis, ap jīm lumstīdamīs, guoja leidza, bet puiši tuo naredzēja. Trešais puiss pīguoja pi akmeņa, drusku ar rūkom pakosa un izjēmja katliņu ar zalta naudu. Racēji pīguoja pi bārza un otkon suoka rakt, bet uozis vys gryudja luopstom prīškā rogus. Jau, ruoduos, nauda te pat skaņ ap luopstom, bet izrakt navar. Nūsaspļuovja racēji un aizguoja uz daudzynuotū ūzulu. Trešais puiss, kur stuovēja par gabaliņu nu bārza, redzēja uoža viltību un pīguojis pi jau paroktuos dūbītes zam bārza saknem, izjēmja ūtru katliņu ar zalta naudu. Racēji aizguoja pi ūzula un suoka rakt, bet uozis ar sovim rogim vys maisīja rakt. Puiši nūsaspļuovja un guoja uz sātu. Ari uozis prīcīgs lumstījuos ap jīm, ka izsorguoja naudu, bet trešais puiss pīguoja pi ūzula, izjēmja trešū katliņu ar zalta naudu un prīcīgs aizguoja uz sātu. Pēc nailga laika jis iztaisīja lobas muojas, apsaprecēja un dzeivoj ar sīvu, bet nikam nasoka par naudas atrasšonu. Jau puiss ar sīvu puordzeivuoja divpadsmit godu, bet nivīns cyts, kai tik jis, nazynuoja nu kuo puiss palyka boguots. Vīnu reizi sīva soka veiram: \"Veiriņ, jau divpadsmit godu es ar tevi nūdzeivuoju, bet tu man naesi pasacījis, nu kuo tu palyki boguots. Ļauds runoj šai un tai, bet pasoki tu man vysu taisnību!\" Veirs izstuostīja sīvai nu gola leidz golam, kai jis palyka boguots un apmuonēja divējus racējus un valnu. Kai tik veirs izstuostīja, aiz lūga nazkas najaukā bolsā aizaklīdzja: \"Atdūd mums katliņus! Mani jau divpadsmit godu šausta ar dzelža reikstem par naudas nanūsorgošuonu!\" Veirs pajēmja tukšus katliņus, izsvīdja pa durovom uorā un valns, katliņus pagyvis, prīcīgs aizskrēja uz elni, bet veirs ar sīvu leidz myuža golam nūdzeivuoja laimīgi.","source":"M. Garkolne no 76 g. v. I. Stalaidzānes Atašienē. Latvju kultūras kr.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-124-E01","start":494,"end":540,"span":"redzēja, kai ap racējim doncuoja apkuort uozis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-124-E02","start":811,"end":831,"span":"puiši tuo naredzēja.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unequal perceptual access","evidence":"puiši tuo naredzēja","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group non-seeing contrasted with third observer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-124-E03","start":1027,"end":1056,"span":"nauda te pat skaņ ap luopstom","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group digging episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-124-E04","start":1181,"end":1201,"span":"redzēja uoža viltību","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later watching at birch.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-124-E05","start":2136,"end":2177,"span":"aiz lūga nazkas najaukā bolsā aizaklīdzja","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified voice source","evidence":"nazkas najaukā bolsā","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Twelve years later at domestic window.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"Juoņa dīnos naktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.545765,"lon":26.398883,"label":"place-0026","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150112022","id":"150112022","collection":"LV","title":"Naudu saņem tas, kam tā nolemta","text":"Milgrāvī, aiz tagadējiem kapiem, ne visai tālu no Vecāķiem rnežā, ceļa malā, stāv pīlādzis. Zem šī pīlādža esot bijusi naudas kaste. Viens vīrs ļoti gribējis naudas kasti dabūt. Viņš saaicinājis biedrus un vienu nakti ap pulksten 12 paņēmuši 1āpstas un apbruņojušies ar plintēm, gājuši naudu rakt. Rakuši, rakuši un tiešām uzrakuši naudas kasti. Tā bijusi liela, ar dzelzi apkalta. Bet tikko gribējuši kasti izcelt, tā grimusi dziļāk, un — nez kur gadījies, kur ne — viens āzis arī klāt un sācis viņus traucēt. Nolēmuši āzi nošaut, bet tikko gribējuši āzi šaut, tā viens biedrs stāv plintes galā. Kā nu tu šausi biedram virsū? Tā āzi arī nevarējuši nošaut. Pīts jau bijis klāt, aizbēruši bedri un gājuši mājās. Bet te vienu nakti sapnī tam pašam vīram paziņots, ka, ja viņš gribot kasti ar naudu dabūt, tad lai aiznesot zem pīlādža baltu vistu ar septiņiem cāļiem. (Vīram bijusi sieva un septiņi bērni.) Nākošā naktī vīrs arī aiznesis vistu ar cāļiem, bet gājis šoreiz viens pats. Tiešām, viņš arī kasti dabūjis. Kastē bijusi dažāda nauda, pat no zviedru laikiem. Par dabūto naudu viņš uzcēlis Milgrāvī divas mājas un krogu. Bet nepagājis ilgs laiks, kad nomirusi sieva, un arī bērni, ar dažādām slimībām. Kad vīrs nomiris, tad viņa īpašumi pārgājuši citu īpašnieku rokās.","source":"G. Pūliņa no K. Riekstiņa Mīlgrāvi.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-125-E01","start":536,"end":596,"span":"tikko gribējuši āzi šaut, tā viens biedrs stāv plintes galā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unstable target identity","evidence":"viens biedrs stāv plintes galā","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual targeting perception, no explicit transformation; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-125-E02","start":718,"end":760,"span":"vienu nakti sapnī tam pašam vīram paziņots","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Individual; modality unstated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"rnežā, ceļa malā","environment":"forest","time":"vienu nakti ap pulksten 12","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["other","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.029162,"lon":24.144084,"label":"place-0309","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150112045","id":"150112045","collection":"LV","title":"Naudu saņem tas, kam tā nolemta","text":"Rijnieks sēdējis Vec-Sērpils rijā bedres malā, pretim kurošai krāsnij, pīdams vīzes. Te ienācis viens kungs: vai nevarot dabūt skalus? Atbildējis: varot gan, bet tikai par naudu. Kungs atteicis: labi, lai tad paņemot vienu kūli skalu un lai nākot uz Sērpils pili, tur dabūšot naudas, vai cik. Gājis arī. Aizgājuši pie Daugavas, kungs pamācījis: lai ejot no Daugavas krasta mises pils pagrabos. Bet rijnieks — zinādams, ka pagrabos daudz durvju, ka var viegli apmaldīties — sadabūjis virvi, piestiprinājis vienu galu pakrastē, otru paņēmis rokā un tad gājis. Iegājis, aizdedzinājis skalu sauju, atradis dibina pagrabā melnu dzelzs zārku un uz zārka mazu melnu sunīti. Spēris ar kāju sunītim viņam bijušas koka stupeles kājā — un kā spēris, iegrūdis stupeli sunītim mutē. Tas bijis atplētis muti, kā kost jeb riet patlaban.\n\nSunītis no spēriena aizkritis gar sienu aiz zārka. Nu rijnieks atvēris zārku, sagrābies pulka zelta naudas un steidzies ārā. Pašu laiku kāpis pa Daugavas krastu uz augšu, te kāds saķēris to pie kājas un nelaidis. Laime bijusi tikai tā, ka ķērējs nesatvēris taisni kāju, bet koka stupeli vien. Rijnieks pametis stupeli tam, uzskrējis krastā un ar vienu stupeli vien pārnesis naudu mājā.","source":"P. Lodziņš Jaun-Sērpilī. LP, VII, I, 1036, 7.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-126-E01","start":667,"end":689,"span":"Spēris ar kāju sunītim","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Cellar; explicit contact action, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-126-E02","start":997,"end":1115,"span":"kāds saķēris to pie kājas un nelaidis. Laime bijusi tikai tā, ka ķērējs nesatvēris taisni kāju, bet koka stupeli vien.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified restraining agent","evidence":"kāds saķēris","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"At Daugavas krastu; contact with shoe corrected in next sentence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.507938,"lon":25.646235,"label":"place-0170","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150113017","id":"150113017","collection":"LV","title":"Dažādas teikas par naudu","text":"Reiz zviedru ķēniņš paņēmis Rīgas Domas baznīcas šķesteŗa tēvu tēvu cepuri. Pēc kāda laika šķesteris atprasījis cepuri. Tad ķēniņš teicis: \"Es došu tev lielu naudu, bet atstāj man savu tēvu tēvu cepuri.\" Labi. Nu ķēniņš paņēmis Domas baznīcas atslēgas, ievedis šķesteri baznīcā, aizsējis tam acis, atslēdzis atkal vienas durvis un nu vadājis to pa alu alām. Drīzi bijis jākāpj uz augšu, drīzi uz zemi, beidzot nonākuši tādā vietā, kur vairs nevarēja elpu atvilkt. Tad ķēniņš atrāvis vienu aizšaujamo, tūliņ elpot itin viegli vedies. Pagājuši vēl tādu gabalu, nu bijuši naudas istabā klāt, ķēniņš atraisījis aizsietās acis, lai apskatoties redzamos brīnumus. Bijis arī ko redzēt: trīs apcirkši pilni ar naudu: viens ar zelta, otrs sudraba, trešs kapara un vienu kapara karīti. Šķesteris novilcis mēteli, piegrābis pilnu ar zelta naudu. Nu ievedis vēl otrā istabā, tur bijuši plaukti pilni ar grāmatām un viena liela, liela grāmata bijusi sakalta ar resnām ķēdēm. Ķēniņš teicis: \"Tā grāmata man vairāk vajadzīga, kā nezin kas!\" Tad aizsējis atkal šķesterim acis un izvedis pa tām pašām tekām ārā.","source":"Maksims ar skolotāju Pelēku Araišos. LP, VII, I, 1084, 6.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-127-E01","start":279,"end":296,"span":"aizsējis tam acis","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"imposed occlusion","evidence":"aizsējis tam acis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-127-E02","start":431,"end":463,"span":"kur vairs nevarēja elpu atvilkt.","modalities":["bodily sensation","pressure"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-127-E03","start":501,"end":532,"span":"tūliņ elpot itin viegli vedies.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-127-E04","start":589,"end":707,"span":"ķēniņš atraisījis aizsietās acis, lai apskatoties redzamos brīnumus. Bijis arī ko redzēt: trīs apcirkši pilni ar naudu","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"visibility restored","evidence":"atraisījis aizsietās acis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-127-E05","start":1026,"end":1094,"span":"Tad aizsējis atkal šķesterim acis un izvedis pa tām pašām tekām ārā.","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"imposed occlusion","evidence":"aizsējis atkal šķesterim acis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.253127,"lon":25.279156,"label":"place-0578","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150113018","id":"150113018","collection":"LV","title":"Dažādas teikas par naudu","text":"Viens šķesteris slauka baznīcu. Pieronas svešs kungs, aizsien ar sarkanu drānu tam acis un nu vadā pa gaņģu gaņģiem arvienu uz leju. Beidzot atraisījis acis, lai nu grābjot naudas, cik gribot! Sagrābies arī. Tagad vedis atkal šķesteri aizsietām acim laukā. Pēc brīža šķesteris manījis, it kā smags mūris aizkrītot cieti. Atrāvis acis vaļā un atradies baznīcas vidū viens pats — svešais nezin kur palicis, kur ne. Gan nu izskatījies, vai baznīcā nebūtu kāda ieeja, kāds slepens caurums kaut kur atronāms, bet nekur neieraudzījis.","source":"Pēteris Ozoliņš Gulbenē. LP, VII, I, 1082, 7.","category":"Nauda","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-128-E01","start":54,"end":132,"span":"aizsien ar sarkanu drānu tam acis un nu vadā pa gaņģu gaņģiem arvienu uz leju.","modalities":["visual","touch","orientation"],"groups":["vision","body","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"imposed occlusion","evidence":"aizsien ar sarkanu drānu tam acis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-128-E02","start":133,"end":156,"span":"Beidzot atraisījis acis","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"visibility restored","evidence":"atraisījis acis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-128-E03","start":214,"end":256,"span":"vedis atkal šķesteri aizsietām acim laukā.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"imposed occlusion","evidence":"aizsietām acim","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-128-E04","start":267,"end":320,"span":"šķesteris manījis, it kā smags mūris aizkrītot cieti.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate perception","evidence":"it kā smags mūris aizkrītot cieti","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Modality not supplied by manījis; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-128-E05","start":321,"end":412,"span":"Atrāvis acis vaļā un atradies baznīcas vidū viens pats — svešais nezin kur palicis, kur ne.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"missing guide","evidence":"svešais nezin kur palicis, kur ne","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-128-E06","start":413,"end":528,"span":"Gan nu izskatījies, vai baznīcā nebūtu kāda ieeja, kāds slepens caurums kaut kur atronāms, bet nekur neieraudzījis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed visual search","evidence":"bet nekur neieraudzījis","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"baznīcu","environment":"church","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation","other","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.171482,"lon":26.752254,"label":"place-0142","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150201022","id":"150201022","collection":"LV","title":"Cilvēks labprāt pārvēršas par vilkatu","text":"Par vilkačiem es esu dau dzirdēš. Reiz tā gadījies. Dēls pirtī uz lāvas pēris tēvu. Pēris, pēris un uzreiz — tēvam izšaunas vilka aste. Dēls pārbijies un kliegdams brēkdams no pirts laukā. Vienc akal tā darījies. Aizgāš uz mežu, izlīdis pa celma apukšu un uzreiz palicis par vilku.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 65 g. v. K. Mežuļa Bilskas pag.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-129-E01","start":52,"end":83,"span":"Dēls pirtī uz lāvas pēris tēvu.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit beating contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-129-E02","start":136,"end":188,"span":"Dēls pārbijies un kliegdams brēkdams no pirts laukā.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Scream is explicit, tail perception only contextual.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pirtī uz lāvas","environment":"bathhouse","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150201044","id":"150201044","collection":"LV","title":"Cilvēks labprāt pārvēršas par vilkatu","text":"Meita ar māti dzīvojušas mazā mājiņā. Reiz meita saslimusi un iekārojusi gaļu; bet mātei gaļas nebijis. Te — kas ir? Piepēži māte nozūd un tikai pret vakaru pārronas, bet nu ir gaļas, nu ir gaļas slimniecei, jāsaka, mēnešiem ko ēst. Tā nu paliek. Vēlāk meita izveseļojas un nu brīnās: mātei visas klētis pilnas ar gaļu! Kur to ņemot? Bet šī neko. Te vienu dienu meita ies gar kaņepu dārzu un redz: māte ģērbjas plika, paliek par vilku un aizskrien. Meita, nabadzīte, tīri sajūk; viņa paņem mātes drānas un domīga nosēžas klēts priekšā. Necik ilgi nāk vilks atpakaļ ar nokostu jēru mutē, bet ieraudzījis meitu, izlaiž jēru no mutes un aizbēg mežā. No tā laika māte vairs nepārnāca; tikai pelēka vilku māte arvienu tekāja gar mājiņu.","source":"Kreicberģis Dzirciemā. LP, V, 127, 44, 12.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-130-E01","start":392,"end":448,"span":"redz: māte ģērbjas plika, paliek par vilku un aizskrien.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"changing perceived identity","evidence":"māte ģērbjas plika, paliek par vilku","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-130-E02","start":591,"end":646,"span":"ieraudzījis meitu, izlaiž jēru no mutes un aizbēg mežā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Wolf/mother is experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gar kaņepu dārzu","environment":"garden","time":"vienu dienu","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.956112,"lon":24.062006,"label":"place-0106","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150201049","id":"150201049","collection":"LV","title":"Cilvēks labprāt pārvēršas par vilkatu","text":"Vienā apgabalā vilki reiz aplasījuši visus kumeļus. Pieguļnieki vairs nevarējuši citādi glābties: samējuši ap ugunskuru mietus un sējuši zirgus turpat, tā sākot pie deguna. Te naktī atlienot atkal divi vilki un glūnot un glūnot, vai tikai pieguļnieki aizmiguši; šie tīšām arī likušies aizmiguši. Un tā vilki sākuši mietus ārā vilkt. Izvilkuši vienu mietu, otru, trešo, bet nemācējuši, vai nevarējuši, saitēm mezglus atraisīt. Neko darīt — paņēmuši vienu mietu katrs galā un veduši kumeļu tāpat piesietu prom. Bet pieguļnieki salēkuši kājup un nosituši abus vilkus. No tā laika neviens kumeļš vairs nezudis.","source":"D. Ozoliņš Jaun-Rozē. LP, V, 126, 44, 9.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-131-E01","start":211,"end":260,"span":"glūnot un glūnot, vai tikai pieguļnieki aizmiguši","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"uncertain observed state","evidence":"vai tikai pieguļnieki aizmiguši","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencers wolves; humans feign sleep.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ap ugunskuru","environment":"outdoor camp","time":"naktī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.547738,"lon":26.714124,"label":"place-0167","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150203015","id":"150203015","collection":"LV","title":"Burvis pārvērš cilvēku par vilkatu","text":"Reiz dzīvojusi vienā smilteniešu mājā jauna meita un saukuši viņu par Mārietu. Reiz viņa aizgājusi lopus ganīt. Ganījusi Mārieta lopus mājas tuvumā mežā un pamanījusi, ka kas no augšas sviež vilkiem kukulīšus. Tas bijis tais laikos, kad vilki no augšas baŗoti. Mārieta to redzējusi, paķērusi vienu kukulīti un mazu, mazu gabaliņu no viņa noēdusi. Aiz krūma bijis vilks, tas palicis bez kukulīša un žēli, žēli gaudojis no izsalkuma. Sadzinusi Mārieta lopus laidarā un bijusi pavisam jocīga, uz meža pusi vien skatījusies. Dažas dienas vēlāk velējušās ar saimnieci. Te saimniece mana, ka Mārieta paliek tāda nevaļīga. Kamēr saimniece nogriezusies, tikmēr Mārieta mežā iekšā! Pēc pusstundas mājnieki dzirdējuši nāburgos kliedzienus: \"Vilks! Vilks! Vilks aitās!\" Drīz vien arī pārnākusi Mārieta ar aitu. Pēc kādām dienām Mārieta atlabusi un stāstījusi savus darbus tālāk. No sākuma gan bijusi tāda kaunīga un bailīga. Mājas lopus Mārieta, kad tā pārvērtusies par vilkatu, neesot aiztikusi.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenē.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-132-E01","start":156,"end":209,"span":"pamanījusi, ka kas no augšas sviež vilkiem kukulīšus.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified source","evidence":"kas no augšas sviež","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual licensed by Mārieta to redzējusi.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-132-E02","start":398,"end":431,"span":"žēli, žēli gaudojis no izsalkuma.","modalities":["auditory","bodily sensation"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Wolf hunger explicitly stated, not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-132-E03","start":490,"end":520,"span":"uz meža pusi vien skatījusies.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-132-E04","start":567,"end":615,"span":"saimniece mana, ka Mārieta paliek tāda nevaļīga.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Observer saimniece; behavioural noticing, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-132-E05","start":688,"end":758,"span":"mājnieki dzirdējuši nāburgos kliedzienus: \"Vilks! Vilks! Vilks aitās!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","other","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.423063,"lon":25.900378,"label":"place-0441","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150203017","id":"150203017","collection":"LV","title":"Burvis pārvērš cilvēku par vilkatu","text":"Vienā zemnieku māju pirtiņā dzīvojis ubags, kas bijis izdaudzināts arī par lielu burvi, vārdotāju un zīlētāju. Šim ubagam bijusi ļoti skaista rneita, ko kungs reiz ieraudzījis un tūliņ iekārojis. Lai savu nolūku panāktu, viņš ubagu licis pavēstīt uz muižu un tam sacījis, ka viņš tā meitu izvēlējis par savu istabmeitu un tādēļ meitai rītu pat jānākot uz muižu un jāiestājoties dienestā. \"Kad cienīgs kungs to vēlas un pavēlē, tad manai meitai tikai jāpaklausa,\" vecais atbildējis un itin labi nopratis, kāda nolūka dēļ kungs viņa meitu vēlas par kalponi. Kungs brīnījies par to, ka šis tēvs nemaz nemēģinājis lūgt, lai viņa meitu neieceļ muižas kalpones godā, kā to citi tēvi mēguši darīt.\n\nKad tēvs izstāstījis meitai, ko kungs pavēlējis, tad tā sākusi raudāt un vaimanāt, bet tēvs to mierinājis ar šādiem vārdiem: \"Neraizējies, bērns, un neaizmirsti, ka tev ir tēvs, kas iespēj tev glābt. Ej vien droši uz muižu un paļaujies uz manu palīdzību.\" Viņš savai meitai devis padomu, kā viņai jāizturas pret kunga laipnām vilināšanām un pierunāšanām. Kungs savu jauno istabmeitu sevišķi laipni saņēmis, kad viņa gājusi pieteikties, ka esot atnākusi iestāties savā dienestā, un pats viņai izstāstījis viņas uzdevumus, parādījis viņai, kā šie uzdevumi izpildāmi, un gultu viņai ierādījis atsevišķā istabiņā, savam dzīvoklim blakus. Vakarā, kad jaunā kalpone gājusi gulēt, arī kungs drīz vien ienācis viņas guļamā istabiņā un sācis runāt viņai laipnus uzmācīgus vārdus. Bet kad viņa skarbi atbildējusi, lai tūliņ iet prom un vairs nekad viņai netuvojas ar tādu ļaunu nolūku, tad kungs tikai pasmīnējis. Kad nu kungs nemaz netaisījies projām iet, tad spēcīgā meita tam devusi tādu pļauku pa ģīmi, ka kungam uguns šķīdusi gar acim. \"Par tādu pārdrošību tu dabūsi bargu sodu!\" kungs izsaucies un izgājis no istabmeitas guļamās istabas.\n\nOtrā rītā viņš saviem ļaudim pavēlējis meitu ieslēgt ķēdēs un ieslodzīt pagrabā. Tad viņš muižas pagalmā licis ierakt kāķa stabu, licis saaicināt visus ļaudis skatīties, kā tāds cilvēks top sodīts, kas iedrošinājas sist savam dzimtskungam. Pie staba divi vīri stāvējuši ar rīkstēm. Tad kungs pavēlējis izvest noziedznieci, un kad tas bija noticis, tad viņš kā apsūdzētājs un kā tiesnesis vienā personā ziņojis šā: \"Šī meita vakar vakarā gribēja zagt manu naudu, un kad viņu pieķēru pie šā nozieguma, tad viņa man iesita pa ģīmi, tā ka mans vaigs vēl tagad ir uzpampis.\" — \"To viņš melo, ka es gribējusi zagt viņa naudu, bet viņš gan varmācīgi gribēja man godu laupīt, un tad es atgaiņādamies iesitu viņam pa ģīmi,\" sodamā droši runājusi starpā. Kungs izturējies tā, it kā viņas pretrunu nebūtu nemaz dzirdējis un tikai turpinājis: \"Tādēļ, ka tas ir liels noziegums, ka dzimtscilvēks iedrošinājas sist savam kungam, nospriežu: noziedzniece piesienama pie šā staba un viņas mugura jāatģērbj plika un viņa jāšauš ar simtu rīkšķu cirtieniem. Sods tūliņ jāizpilda!\" Kad tā notiesātā pievesta pie staba un atslēgta no ķēdēm, tad viņas tēvs, kas arī bijis skatītāju pulkā, tai pamirkšķinājis ar acim. Tad uzreiz sodāmā piepēži pazudusi un viņas vietā radies nikns vilks, no kuŗa sodītāji ar izbailēm aizbēguši. Sodāmā meita ar sava tēva burvības spēku bija pārvērtusies par vilkaci, kas ātri pieskrējis pie kunga un tam labajā rokā nokodis divus pirkstus. Pēc tam vilkace izskrējusi no muižas un iemukusi mežā, iekām iztrūkušies ļaudis paguvuši sākt to gūstīt.","source":"Lapas Mārtiņš, \"Pasakas un nostāsti\", 1902, 108, 22.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-133-E01","start":150,"end":195,"span":"ko kungs reiz ieraudzījis un tūliņ iekārojis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-133-E02","start":745,"end":773,"span":"tā sākusi raudāt un vaimanāt","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-133-E03","start":1661,"end":1722,"span":"devusi tādu pļauku pa ģīmi, ka kungam uguns šķīdusi gar acim.","modalities":["touch","visual","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Impact-induced flashes expressed idiomatically; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-133-E04","start":2993,"end":3019,"span":"tai pamirkšķinājis ar acim","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Gesture perceived only contextually; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-133-E05","start":3032,"end":3089,"span":"sodāmā piepēži pazudusi un viņas vietā radies nikns vilks","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"changed appearance","evidence":"viņas vietā radies nikns vilks","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group witness context; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-133-E06","start":3236,"end":3275,"span":"tam labajā rokā nokodis divus pirkstus.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Injury/contact explicit; pain not inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:150204018","id":"150204018","collection":"LV","title":"Vilkats atsvabināts","text":"Seņuok Atašīnē vīna meita bejuse pataisīta par vylkati. Sīnu pļuovja vīns cylvāks pūra pļovuos, nūstruodoj jis vysu dīnu, vokorā atīt uz budku, budka jam bejuse saslīta nu egļu zorim. Atguojis uz budku, sakur guni, pavuorej putras un suoc vakariņuot. Verās: aiz budkas tup vylkate un tai gauži verās uz juo: jai osoras kai pupas tai i veļās par purnu. Vylkate tup un smiļkst, jam palīk vvlkates žāļ, jis atgrīž maizes kancīti un, pasvīž viņai. Maizes kancīti kuorīgi apāduse vylkate nūmat uodu un cylvāka prīškā nūstuoja skaista meita. Meita nu prīcas sumynuoja jam rūkas un beja cīši laimīga, ka spruka valā nu vylka uodas. Jei pastuostīja, ka vīna būrinīca pataisīja jū par vylkati, kam naguoja pi juos bruoļa par sīvu. Prīcīgs beja i sīna pļuovējs, ka izgluobja sīvīti nu taidas nalaimes, sēdēja obeji pi gunskura un par šū tū runuoja. Puišam patyka bejušuo vylkate un jis suoka tū svuotuot, jei beja ar mīru īt pi taida cylvāka, kurs izgluobja jū nu medinīka lūdes, voi nu kaida plēsīga zvēra, kurs meža varēja tū satikt. Es pate vēļ tū meitu redzēju, juos veiru pazeistu.","source":"A. Gari-Juone no 60 g. v. Putnu Broņislava Kokorevas pag.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-134-E01","start":251,"end":351,"span":"Verās: aiz budkas tup vylkate un tai gauži verās uz juo: jai osoras kai pupas tai i veļās par purnu.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-134-E02","start":352,"end":374,"span":"Vylkate tup un smiļkst","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-134-E03","start":536,"end":571,"span":"Meita nu prīcas sumynuoja jam rūkas","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Latgalian wording for affectionate hand contact requires review; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-134-E04","start":1026,"end":1076,"span":"Es pate vēļ tū meitu redzēju, juos veiru pazeistu.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Narrator's later corroborative observation, different time/place.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uz budku","environment":"outdoor shelter","time":"vokorā","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.88933,"lon":27.366864,"label":"place-0204","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150205001","id":"150205001","collection":"LV","title":"Vilkata miršana","text":"Žibu Kriša, lielais vilkacis, mirstot tapis piedzīts zili melns un beidzamā naktī bļāvis briesmīgā balsī: lai glābjot — nupat šo žņaudzot melnais kungs! Kad bijis nomiris un iezārkots mironim uz krūtim gulējusi saritinājusies liela melna čūska un šņākusi tik nikni, ka nemaz zārku vaļā taisīt. Svētdienā, kad miris, sacēlies trakisks negaiss: pērkons rūcis, lietus, krusa nākusi ar briesmīgāko vētru, ūdens Baišlejā šņācis, krācis un mežs kaucis tādā gaudotāja balsī, kā izsalkušo vilku bars saltajā ziemā. Tik briesmīgā vīzē beidzies Baišlejas vilkacis, Žibu Kriša. Ļaudis vēl redzējuši, ka gultas galā stāvējis liels melns kungs, ar deviņzaru dakšām rokā.","source":"Gustavs Pociemā. Etn. I, 1891. LP, VII, I, 924, 2.","category":"Vilkati","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-135-E01","start":67,"end":152,"span":"beidzamā naktī bļāvis briesmīgā balsī: lai glābjot — nupat šo žņaudzot melnais kungs!","modalities":["auditory","pressure"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Pressure is quoted first-person report; agent label retained as narrative wording.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-135-E02","start":247,"end":293,"span":"šņākusi tik nikni, ka nemaz zārku vaļā taisīt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-135-E03","start":343,"end":466,"span":"pērkons rūcis, lietus, krusa nākusi ar briesmīgāko vētru, ūdens Baišlejā šņācis, krācis un mežs kaucis tādā gaudotāja balsī","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Ambient sound cluster, Svētdienā, kad miris.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-135-E04","start":567,"end":657,"span":"Ļaudis vēl redzējuši, ka gultas galā stāvējis liels melns kungs, ar deviņzaru dakšām rokā.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.596003,"lon":24.850608,"label":"place-0355","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150301006","id":"150301006","collection":"LV","title":"Kā burvji rodas","text":"Pienavniekos senāk bija tāds burvis: kad tikai redzējis dūmus kūpam un zinājis, tur un tur alu brūvē, tūliņ uz pēdām nobūris alu: vai nu nemaz netecējis, vai nerūdzis, jeb arī pa mucu dibeniem, strēķu starpām sūcies laukā. Reiz burvja paša sieva aiziet uz Stūrīšiem un pārnākdama stāsta citiem mājiniekiem: \"Tā tad šodien sadzēros garda alus!\" Burvis, to padzirdējis, tūliņ: \"Kur tu dzēri?\" — \"Stūrīšos!\" — \"Ak tu nekrietnā sieva! Kam tev to bija man teikt? Stūrītis man labs draugs, bet nu es nevaru vairs.\" Un kas ir? Tai pašā brīdī iet alus Stūrīšos gan pa mucu dibiniem, gan strēķu starpām, ka nekur un nekur valdīt, kamēr viss laukā.\n\nAre, burvjiem jābuŗ, ja darbs gadījies, vai grib, vai negrib — brāli arī tie netaupa.","source":"Jānis Rūtentāls Džūkstē. LP, VI, 16, 2, 16.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-136-E01","start":47,"end":67,"span":"redzējis dūmus kūpam","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic repeated observation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-136-E02","start":308,"end":342,"span":"Tā tad šodien sadzēros garda alus!","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported palatability, explicitly experienced by wife.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-136-E03","start":344,"end":366,"span":"Burvis, to padzirdējis","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","taste","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.78922,"lon":23.247195,"label":"place-0110","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150301010","id":"150301010","collection":"LV","title":"Kā burvji rodas","text":"Apšupes muižkungam Šerpentīnam bijusi melnā grāmata. Reiz viņš braucis uz Jelgavu, bet melno grāmatu aizmirsis vaļā uz galda. Istabas meita Anna Zilberte, istabu uzpošot, ieraudzījusi grāmatu un sākusi to lasīt. Kā izlasījusi tur zināmus burvības vārdus, tā visa istaba piepildas ar miroņiem, gariem. Tie prasa darbu, bet meita neprot viņus ne aizraidīt, ne arī var tiem darbu dot. Kungs, nobraucis līdz Lāmas krogam, liek kučierim griezt zirgus atpakaļ, jo jūt. ka mājās nav vairs labi. Pārbrauc mājā; kā tad — istaba pilna garu. Viņš ar zināmiem burvības vārdiem tos aizraida un iesit meitai pa ausi sacīdams: \"Ko tu nu būtu darījusi, ja es nebūtu pārbraucis?\" Bet meita no sitiena palikusi dulna, jo kungām bijis velns saujā, un viņš to iesitis meitai galvā. Tā kā meita dikti trakojusi, tad braukuši uz Džūksti pēc mācītāja Vilpērta. Kad mācītājs atbraucis līdz Kazupes mežam, meita mājās saka: \"Nu jau melnais ir pie Kazupes meža,\" jo viņa to skaidri zinājusi. Mācītājs atbraucis, uzlicis meitai bībeli uz galvas un licis trīs reiz noskaitīt tēvreizi. Meita skaita arī, bet tikai līdz tai vietai: \"- Un atpestī mūs no ļauna\". Tos vārdus nav varējusi izteikt. Izmocījusies, izmocījusies, bet kā nekā, tā nekā. Sākusi atkal no gala, bet tālāk par to vietu nav tikusi un tā visas trīs reizes. Pēc tam meita sagulējusi slima divi dienas un divi naktis, un tad atveseļojusies pamazām, bet drusku dumja no kunga niknā sitiena palikusi visu mūžu.","source":"Teicēja Grase Pienavas pag.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-137-E01","start":171,"end":211,"span":"ieraudzījusi grāmatu un sākusi to lasīt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-137-E03","start":581,"end":601,"span":"iesit meitai pa ausi","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-137-E04","start":1131,"end":1213,"span":"Tos vārdus nav varējusi izteikt. Izmocījusies, izmocījusies, bet kā nekā, tā nekā.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Failed vocalisation; embodied constraint, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"istabu","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.740851,"lon":23.253574,"label":"place-0347","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150303023","id":"150303023","collection":"LV","title":"Burvji vajā cilvēkus","text":"Jurģa dienas rītā gaismai svīstot, kliedzēji kāpuši kokos un klieguši. Kas to kliegšanu dzirdējis tukšā sirdī (neēdis) jeb arī neatkliedzies pretī, tam bijis kāds ļaunums gaidāms. Talcēniešu Ķelšēnu saimnieks sūrojies, ka viņš esot no Ērgļu Mūrnieku mājas ticis aizkliegts. Jurģa rītā agri Ķelšēnu saimnieks gājis zirgu baŗot, kad dzirdējis kliegšanu. Kad nu gājis otrreiz stallī, tad viņa jaunā ķēve bijusi norāvusies, izskrējusi no staļļa ārā un lēkusi par zediņu sētu, kur pārdūrusi vēderu un bijusi pagalam. Mūrnieku saimnieks atkal dzirdējis, ka Jurģa rītā talcēniešos kāds kliedzis: \"Deviņi arāji un Mūrnieks desmitais ecētājs!\" Mūrnieks atkliedzis: \"Vai es viens varu deviņus aizecēt?\" Tā viņš ticis no ķezas vaļā.","source":"J. Rubenis Ērgļos.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-138-E01","start":35,"end":70,"span":"kliedzēji kāpuši kokos un klieguši.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic collective sound production.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-138-E02","start":290,"end":351,"span":"Ķelšēnu saimnieks gājis zirgu baŗot, kad dzirdējis kliegšanu.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-138-E03","start":512,"end":587,"span":"Mūrnieku saimnieks atkal dzirdējis, ka Jurģa rītā talcēniešos kāds kliedzis","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"Jurģa dienas rītā gaismai svīstot","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.899228,"lon":25.640242,"label":"place-0581","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150303028","id":"150303028","collection":"LV","title":"Burvji vajā cilvēkus","text":"Dzīvoja vecos laikos sakritušā būdā meža vidū, liela ceļa malā vecs buris, no kā apkārtējie ļautiņi baidījušies. Bijis apkārtnē tāds paradums: kad kāds miris, vai dzimis, vai precējies, buram nesuši kukuļus. Reiz braukuši kāznieki no baznīcas. Kāznieki uz baznīcu braucot buram nekā nedevuši, jo brūte un brūtgāns priekšlaikus nolēmuši buram nekā nedot. Kad kāznieki braukuši gar bura būdu no mājas uz baznīcu, buris izbāzis pa būdas logu galvu un ilgi noraudzījies braucējiem pakaļ. Arī uz māju braucot, buram neviens nekā nedevis. Kāznieki braukuši vien mierīgi tālāk. Bet mežā uz krusta ceļiem netālu no bura būdas bijis krustā sistā tēls, pie kuŗa arī ceļa braucēji apturējuši zirgus un pa vecam paradumam noskaitījuši lūgšanas, kā arī izlūgušies laimes un laimīgu ceļu, glābšanu no laupītājiem un nelaimēm. Kad pēdējais kāznieks noskaitījis lūgšanu un noskūpstījis Dieva dēla kājas, tad tik pamanījuši, ka visi pielūguši un skūpstījuši brūtes pliko pakaļu. Brūte bijusi izģērbusies gluži plika un nostājusies otrpus ceļa, pretim Kristus tēlam. Tagad tik kāznieki sapratuši, cik liela vara bijusi buram, un priecājušies, ka tik viegli no viņa vaļā tikuši.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenē.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-139-E01","start":448,"end":483,"span":"ilgi noraudzījies braucējiem pakaļ.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier observer buris at hut window.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-139-E02","start":888,"end":961,"span":"tad tik pamanījuši, ka visi pielūguši un skūpstījuši brūtes pliko pakaļu.","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified object of contact","evidence":"skūpstījuši brūtes pliko pakaļu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier believed to kiss Dieva dēla kājas.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"mežā uz krusta ceļiem","environment":"crossroads","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.423063,"lon":25.900378,"label":"place-0441","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150305006","id":"150305006","collection":"LV","title":"Burvji moka lopus","text":"Buris reiz vienam saimniekam tā noķēzīš govi, ka pienam bīsi sūdu garša, bet gruntīgi tāda garša. Nu, ko nu? Viss pienc jāgāž cūkām silē. Gan saimnieks izmāžojies šā un tā, bet nekā. Pēdīgi saimnieks aizgāš pie vienas tādas vecenes, kas zināsi vaļā laist, un tā ar palaidusi vaļā. Re', nu kā! Trīs reizas govij norīvēsi krustus ar sālsūdeni un govs akal kārtībā.","source":"H. Skujiņa no K. Veinberga Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-140-E01","start":49,"end":97,"span":"pienam bīsi sūdu garša, bet gruntīgi tāda garša.","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Taste comparison; material faecal contamination not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["taste"],"translation":"A sorcerer once so fouled a farmer's cow that the milk tasted of shit — really tasted like it. Well, what now? All the milk has to be poured into the pigs' trough. The farmer tried doctoring it this way and that, but to no avail. Finally the farmer went to an old woman who would know how to undo it, and she did undo it. Look, now how! She rubbed the cow's rump three times with salt water, and the cow was all right again.","translationNotes":["The coarse taste description is retained. The final action is narrated as performed by the woman, not presented as an instruction. 'Krusti' denotes the rump/lower-back area, not a harness crupper."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"LV-140-E01","start":46,"end":94,"span":"the milk tasted of shit — really tasted like it.","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Taste comparison; material faecal contamination not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"pienam bīsi sūdu garša, bet gruntīgi tāda garša.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"LV:150305012","id":"150305012","collection":"LV","title":"Burvji moka lopus","text":"Saimniekam buris pa naktim piepesteļoš kūti. Bet ko saimnieks? Nu, vaktēšot buri, jāču šo novaktēšot. Kā ta, vienu vakaru saimnieks ielīdis zirga redelēs, aizsedzies ar sienu un gaidīš, ka nu buris nāks. Ap pusnakti ienācis buris, apcirpis aitas un ta sacīš: «Tas aunīc, kas redelēs, ar jānocērp!»\n\nTa nu buris dagāš pie saimnieka, izķēzīš šim bārdu un galvu (matus) un aizgāš. Bet saimnieks bīš tā pārņemts, ka nemaz spēka, un buram ar nekā nevar izdarīt.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 72 g. v. J. Baltiņa Bilskas pag.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-141-E02","start":382,"end":456,"span":"saimnieks bīš tā pārņemts, ka nemaz spēka, un buram ar nekā nevar izdarīt.","modalities":["bodily sensation","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Loss of power to act; psychological/physical boundary; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kūti","environment":"stable","time":"Ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.465147,"lon":26.077438,"label":"place-0052","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150307008","id":"150307008","collection":"LV","title":"Burvju traucēšana","text":"Lesteniekos vecais Strautiņš bijis liels burvis. Reiz gans ganījis govis; tas ar Strautiņu jau sendienām bijis labs paziņa. Un tā nu šis ganījis - te, kur gadās, kur ne - Strautiņš zils, melns vaigā kā zeme, tāds atskrien pie gana un nu burs. Bet gans būrējam gāzis ar pātagu pa ģīmi - uzcirtis asinis. Kā uzcirtis asinis - tūdaļ Strautiņa melnais vaigs noskaidrojies: buŗamā griba pārgājusi.","source":"A. Lerchis-Puškaitis no J. Sējas Lestenē. LP, VII, I, 695, 18.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-142-E01","start":247,"end":302,"span":"gans būrējam gāzis ar pātagu pa ģīmi - uzcirtis asinis.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact/injury explicit; no pain inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.77394,"lon":23.146236,"label":"place-0237","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150310013","id":"150310013","collection":"LV","title":"Burvju nāve","text":"Vienā mājā dzīvojis ļoti nikns saimnieks. Kad viņš nomiris, tad to nomazgājuši, aiznesuši uz piedarbu un pa nakti taisījušies iet vāķēt. Pa dienu izcepuši plāceņus un aiznesuši toveri ar rūgušu pienu, lai būtu vāķētājiem ko ēst. Kad nu tie nonākuši piedarbā, aizdedzinājuši sveces un sasēdušies ap līķi, no rijas atskanējis savāds troksnis. No sākuma vāķētāji to neievērojuši, bet kad troksnis palicis arvien lielāks, vāķētāji sabijušies, atstājuši līķi un aizbēguši. Kad nu no rīta mājinieki gājuši riju apraudzīt, tad atraduši mirušo saimnieku sēdam piedarba stūrī. Bārda un krūtis viņam bijušas aplietas ar rūgušu pienu. Plāceņi bijuši apēsti un arī piena toveris iztukšots. Mājinieki nu atkal sabijušies un aizgājuši pasaukt mācītāju. Mācītājs arī atnācis, aizdedzinājis priekš līķa sveces un sācis lūgt Dievu. Bet te ļaudim izlicies, ka līķis sāk kustēties, un tie tūliņ sākuši bēgt. Skriedami paņēmuši arī mācītāju līdz, kas satinies savās drēbēs un pakritis. Ļaudis vairs negribējuši pie līķa iet klāt un ataicinājuši tuvumā apmetušos zaldātus, kas tad to aprakuši.","source":"P. Šmits no P. Zeltiņas Ikšķilē.","category":"Burvji","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-143-E01","start":304,"end":340,"span":"no rijas atskanējis savāds troksnis.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-143-E02","start":385,"end":416,"span":"troksnis palicis arvien lielāks","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-143-E03","start":822,"end":861,"span":"ļaudim izlicies, ka līķis sāk kustēties","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"qualified apparent movement","evidence":"izlicies, ka līķis sāk kustēties","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later daylight episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"piedarbā","environment":"threshing barn","time":"pa nakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.833558,"lon":24.49544,"label":"place-0146","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150401002","id":"150401002","collection":"LV","title":"Raganu īpašības","text":"Vienes mājēs būis tād vec siev, ko vis' mājs ļouds tureš pa ragan un viņam e i būis plouksts biezam krejams us pien. Vien rīt ager viens vīrs no tiem mājām, gar kapsēt iedam, ieroug, ka tas vecsiev tur gul mourē. Viš pieiet klatnes un kustan viņ, bet nevar un nevar atmodant. Viš kustandam to vecsiev apgriež otrād: kur bi tie kājs, tur pagriež gāl un skates, kas te nu būs. Ja, pa maz brīsniņ atskrej maz' putniš, skraid gar tiem kājām, grib tur kur ielīst, bet nevar un āskrej projnes. Tas vīrs nu jem un atgriež viņ akal apakļes: gāl tē vietē, kur būis — un nu paslepen skates, ko viš nu dars. Jā, pa tād brīsniņ atskrej akal tas putniš, pieskrej pī to gāl klāt un mutē iekšē. Un, rov, vecsiev sāk kustantes — ceļes ougšes, nospurnes, isžāgstes un sāk iet us mājām. Nu tie ļouds teic, ka pa to laik, kamērt tie siev miess tur guleš, tes dvēsel skrējs ragnes, cit sievs gojam pien slaukt un zagt.","source":"E. Dünsbergs Dundagā. LP, VII, I, 535, 2.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-144-E01","start":175,"end":212,"span":"ieroug, ka tas vecsiev tur gul mourē.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-144-E02","start":235,"end":275,"span":"kustan viņ, bet nevar un nevar atmodant.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Testing responsiveness; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-144-E03","start":561,"end":596,"span":"nu paslepen skates, ko viš nu dars.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Observation sequence includes bird entering mouth and woman waking.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gar kapsēt","environment":"cemetery","time":"Vien rīt ager","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.507633,"lon":22.351967,"label":"place-0103","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150402003","id":"150402003","collection":"LV","title":"Lādēšana līdzīga buršanai","text":"Kādu versti no Obravas muižas, starp lielceļu un Ušuru ezeru atrodas priežu puduris, ko sauc par Žīguru priedēm. Priedes ir vecas. No apakšas viņām zari jau nokaltuši un skujas nobirušas. Tur, kur tagad atrodas priedes, agrāk bijusi Žīguru māja, kur dzīvojuši tikai divi cilvēki: vīrs ar sievu. Sieva bijusi liela burve. Reiz vīrs saskaities ar sievu un dzinis to prom no mājas. Sieva lūgusies, lai atļaujot vēl vienu dienu palikt mājā. Vīrs tai atļāvis. Naktī plkst. 12. sieva izgājusi ārā un saukusi: «Lai Žīguru māja nogrimst! Lai Žīguru māja nogrimst!» Māja tūlīt nogrimusi un no zemes izcēlušās priedes.","source":"Anna Miķīte. Z. Lancmaņa kr.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Spoken formula and narrated change; no explicit sensory reception.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"LV:150403002","id":"150403002","collection":"LV","title":"Raganas vajā cilvēkus","text":"Tas akal bīš iekš Polijas. Zaldāts nācis uz māju. Danācis vakars un zaldāts iegāš vienā mājā naktsmāju prasīt. Mājas cilvēki gan naktsmājas nelieguši, bet bīši visi traki bēdīgi un stāstīši zaldātam, ka šiem viena ragana pavēstīsi, ka šonakt visim no vietas būšot jāmirst. Nu, zaldāts nekā nesacīš. Viņč nopircis piecas sveces un vakarā katrā istabas kaktā aizdedzināš vienu sveci, ta pats uzrausies uz krāsaugšas un aizdedzināš piekto sveci un gaidīš, kas ta te īsti būs. Visi jau bīš apgūlušies ciešā miegā, bet zaldāts negulēš. Ap pusnakti istabā ienākusi liela mella cūka, dagāsi pie vienas sveces un nodzēsusi, ta pie otras, trešās un ceturtās un visas nodzēsusi. Tik tā svece vie vais palikusi, kas bīsi zaldātam uz krāsaugšas. Bet nu cūka raususies uz krāsaugšas augšā un gribēsi to ar nopūst. Bet kā nu šī uzraususies uz krāsaugšas, tā zaldāts šai ar zobinu — žvirkst! vienu priekšas kāju no! Nu cūka kviekdama, rūkdama prom un no istabas laukā. Ta nu zaldāts ar licies pats uz auss un nogulēš līdz gaismīnai. Gaismīnā nu visi cēlušies augšā un brīnēšies, ka vē esot dzīvi gan. Bet zaldāts nu šiem stāstīš, kā viss bīš, un pēdīgi nosprieduši, ka jāmeklējot ragana rokā. Nu gāši no mājas uz māju un pēdīgi dagāši pie vienas mājas un saimnieks sacīs, ka saimnīca esot slima. Zaldāts sacīš saimniekam, lei vedot pie saimnīcas. Ka nu saimnieks ievedis, ta tik redzēši, ka saimnīcai ir viena roka nocirsta. Tā pati bīsi tā ragana. Ko nu ar šo izdarīši, to gan es vais nezinu.","source":"H. Skujiņa no 76 g. v. J. Ābeles Aumeisteŗos.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-146-E01","start":901,"end":953,"span":"Nu cūka kviekdama, rūkdama prom un no istabas laukā.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-146-E02","start":1357,"end":1409,"span":"ta tik redzēši, ka saimnīcai ir viena roka nocirsta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later morning, group at another house.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"istabā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Ap pusnakti","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.522915,"lon":26.203548,"label":"place-0031","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150403011","id":"150403011","collection":"LV","title":"Raganas vajā cilvēkus","text":"Reiz dzīvojusi viena burve. Vienu dienu viņa gājusi kādai saimnieka mājai gaŗām, iegājusi tur iekšā un gribējusi tā kā no sava ceļa atpūsties. Mājā atradusies tikai pati saimniece un visi ļaudis strādājuši laukā. Viešņa nu stāstījusi saimniecei, ka viņa nopirkusi biezpienu, un lūgusi, lai saimniece arī pasmeķējot, vai esot labs nopircies. Saimniece baidījusies no sveša ņemt pienu un ēst, atvainodamies ar nevaļu izgājusi ārā. Pēc brītiņa ienākot, viešņa atkal piedāvājusi savu pienu, bet saimniece tāpat izvairījusies. Beidzot saimniece arī gribējusi smeķēt, bet, labi apskatot, redzējusi, ka biezpienā ieskrienot ķirzaka. Saimniece to rāda viešņai un saka: «Vai, kas jums tur tai pienā ir!» Viešņa arī brīnījusies un stāstījusi, ka viņa bijusi atsēdusies mežmalā un tur laikam ķirzaka būšot ielīdusi. Viņa nu izmet ķirzaku un saka: «Tādēļ jau nevar visu pienu zemē mest.» Viešņa nu gājusi ar visu pienu projām. Pēc neilga laika saimniekam saslimis un novārdzis suns. Neviens nezinājis, kas sunim par vainu, tikai runājuši, ka viņš ko nelabu būšot ieēdis. Te ganu puika atminējis, ka viņš redzējis, ka suns ēdis aiz mājas biezpienu, kas tur bijis ceļmalā nomests. Izrādījies, ka biezpiens atradies uz tā paša ceļa, kur nesenā viešņa aizgājusi. Nu saimniece arī sapratusi, tā ir bijusi burve, kas gribējusi to ar biezpienu ieēdināt un noburt.","source":"P. Šmits no P. Zeltiņas Ikšķilē.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-147-E01","start":567,"end":625,"span":"labi apskatot, redzējusi, ka biezpienā ieskrienot ķirzaka.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-147-E02","start":1087,"end":1134,"span":"viņš redzējis, ka suns ēdis aiz mājas biezpienu","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later recalled observation by herdboy; behind house. Tasting invitation not counted as actual taste.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Mājā","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Vienu dienu","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.833558,"lon":24.49544,"label":"place-0146","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150404002","id":"150404002","collection":"LV","title":"Raganas bojā labību","text":"Vienam saimniekam noticis šāds joks. Ir bijis rudzu pļaujamais laiks. Visos gabalos rudzi bijuši stāvus, tikai vienā kā mīdīt samīdīti, visi pie zemes. Saimnieks, nekā ļauna nedomādams, pļāvis nost arī tos. Bet nebijis vēl necik nopļāvis, ka palicis tik slims, ka nekur skriet. Par laimi gadījies turpat tuvumā viens gudrs večuks. Tas saslējis nopļautos rudzus tāpat, kā tie bijuši iepriekš. Tad paņēmis plinti un šāvis pār rudzu gabalu. Slimais uzreizi palicis vesels. Te, nav necik ilgi, atnāk kunkstēdama un vaidēdama kaimiņu vecene: lai dodot šai dzert. Nevarējuši noskatīties, kā cilvēks mokās, un iedevuši ar. Vecene padzērusies un smiedamās aizgājusi.","source":"A. Zibens Rugāju pag. J. A. Jansona kr.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-148-E01","start":490,"end":535,"span":"atnāk kunkstēdama un vaidēdama kaimiņu vecene","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-148-E02","start":558,"end":598,"span":"Nevarējuši noskatīties, kā cilvēks mokās","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"May be idiomatic inability to bear witnessing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-148-E03","start":616,"end":658,"span":"Vecene padzērusies un smiedamās aizgājusi.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"rudzu gabalu","environment":"field","time":"rudzu pļaujamais laiks","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.035193,"lon":27.109556,"label":"place-0395","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150406011","id":"150406011","collection":"LV","title":"Raganas ceļo","text":"Pie viena saimnieka dzīvojis puisis, vārdā Pēteris. Šis bija ļoti nonīcis, novārdzis. Vienu dienu uz lauka strādājot, pienāca ciemiņa puisis pie viņa un, Pēteri tādu novārgušu redzēdams, ieteicās: «Vai, kāds tu ļoti novārdzis un nogājis izskaties! Vai tev saimnieks nemaz nedod ēst jeb tev pārlieku gŗūti darbi? Saki man, kas tev īsti par nelaimi ir. Tevi nemaz nevar saukt par Pēteri, bet par Vārgu Pēterīti.»\n\n«Kā nebūšu novārdzis - saimnieka māte ik naktis jāj mani. Tikko esmu iemidzis, te viņa klusi pienāk pie manis, uzmauc man iemauktus galvā un es tūliņ topu par melnu zirgu. Tad viņa man sēžas mugurā un jāj pa pasauli. Un tā viņa mani jāda ik naktis.»\n\n«Neesi jel muļķis! Vai zini ko? Man tevis gaužam žēl mitosim vietas! Nāc tu pie mana saimnieka, es iešu pie tava. Gribu redzēt, vai vecā ragana ar mani arī tā varēs jokoties: tāpat jādelēt kā tevi?»\n\nLabi - viņi tanī pašā dienā samitojās. Tūliņ pirmā naktī saimnieka māte pienāca itin klusu pie puiša gultas un uzmauca iemauktus viņam galvā. Puisis arī ļāvās un likās cieti aizmidzis. Tiklīdz kā vecene iemauktus bija uzmaukusi, te tūliņ puisis palika par skaistu, melnu zirgu. Vecene nu sēdās melnelim mugurā un aizjāja no mājām projām. Viņa aizjāja pie kādas tumšas, zemē iegrimušas pils. Vecene piesēja savu melno pie. koka, kur jau daudz tādu zirgu atradās piesieti, un iegāja pilī. Bet ko melnais dara? Šim paliek gaŗš laiks pie koka piesietam gaidot. Viņš nomaucās un gāja pie pils loga skatīties, ko vecene iekšā dara. Viņš redzēja pa logu lielu pulku velnu pilī, kas visādi iekšā trakoja un ērmojās; starp šiem arī redzēja savu jājēju, saimnieka māti. Piepēži viens velns uzsauca: «Bērniņi, līksmojieties, bet apskatait arī savus zirgus!» Puisis, to izdzirdis, tūliņ skrēja atpakaļ pie minētā koka un iebāza galvu iemauktos. Velni tur pilī trakoja un maisījās līdz pat pusnaktij. Tiklīdz gailis padziedāja, te visi bija atkal zirgos un katrs aizjāja uz savām mājām. Otru nakti vecene tāpat klusinām pienāca pie puiša gultas un mauca viņam iemauktus galvā, bet puisis neļāvās uzmaukties, saķēra iemauktus un uzmauca tos vecenei pašai galvā. Vecene tūliņ palika par skaistu, melnu ķēvi. Puisis sēdās ķēvei mugurā un nojāja pie kalēja. Viņš lika kalējam piesist savai ķēvei podu gŗūtus pakavus, itin sarkanus nodedzinātus. Kalējs nodedzināja pakavus itin sarkanus kā uguni un tad lika ķēvei pie kājām. Kas ķēvei par lielām sāpēm! Ķēve gan sprauslāja, spārdījās, bet tas nekā nelīdzēja. Kad ķēve bija apkalta, tad puisis vēl labi izjājās un tad laida uz mājām. Tūliņ arī gailis padziedāja - ķēve krita savā gultā - palika atkal par veceni, visas četras izstiepa un bija pagalam.","source":"J. Dīcmanis Lieģos, Lejas Kurzemē. \"Pasaku vācelīte\". LP, VII, I, 656, 5.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-149-E01","start":154,"end":185,"span":"Pēteri tādu novārgušu redzēdams","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E02","start":435,"end":469,"span":"saimnieka māte ik naktis jāj mani.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported repeated bodily burden; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E03","start":974,"end":1004,"span":"uzmauca iemauktus viņam galvā.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Second man; explicit bodily contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E04","start":1489,"end":1622,"span":"Viņš redzēja pa logu lielu pulku velnu pilī, kas visādi iekšā trakoja un ērmojās; starp šiem arī redzēja savu jājēju, saimnieka māti.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E05","start":1710,"end":1768,"span":"Puisis, to izdzirdis, tūliņ skrēja atpakaļ pie minētā koka","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E06","start":1851,"end":1876,"span":"Tiklīdz gailis padziedāja","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E07","start":2291,"end":2428,"span":"Kalējs nodedzināja pakavus itin sarkanus kā uguni un tad lika ķēvei pie kājām. Kas ķēvei par lielām sāpēm! Ķēve gan sprauslāja, spārdījās","modalities":["touch","temperature","pain","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Mare/woman experiencer, explicit thermal pain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"LV-149-E08","start":2528,"end":2555,"span":"Tūliņ arī gailis padziedāja","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.579268,"lon":21.336228,"label":"place-0255","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"LV:150407007","id":"150407007","collection":"LV","title":"Raganas vēmekļi","text":"Vienam saimniekam nīkuļojuši lopi. Kūtī saimnieks uzgājis vairāk reizes baltus vēmeklus. Bijis skaidrs kā diena, ka uz kūti nāk raganas lopus slaukt. Saimniekam arī viens gudrinieks izmācījis, kā lai dara, ja vēmeklus atrod. Gavēnī atkal bijusi pievemta kūts. Aitu aizgaldas vārtiņi bijuši novemti gluži balti. Saimnieks paķēris cirvi, sacirtis vārtiņus un ugunī iekšā! Te - kur nākusi, kur ne - plesku pleskām skrējusi nejauka vecene un lūgusi dzert. Bet saimnieks jau tos niķus zinājis un zvēlis vecenei ar mietu pa sāniem. Sadevis vecenei labi pa muguru un iztriecis no mājas. No tās reizes nelabums bijis no mājas laukā.","source":"H. Skujiņa Smiltenes pag.","category":"Raganas","place":"","events":[{"id":"LV-150-E01","start":491,"end":556,"span":"zvēlis vecenei ar mietu pa sāniem. Sadevis vecenei labi pa muguru","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact, pain not inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kūtī","environment":"stable","time":"Gavēnī","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.451421,"lon":25.864327,"label":"place-0442","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied LV latitude_original / longitude_original; precision not verified"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1039","id":"SIN1039","collection":"NO","title":"Svartedauden.","text":"Svartedauden.\nNyss før svartedauden herja so fælt i Norig, var det einstads her nord, at ei finska mødte to born, ein gut og ei gjenta, attmed ei elv. Dei vilde ha henne til å bera seg; men ho laut akta seg for å gå der det fanst grofte og kvannrot. Gjorde ho det dei bad om, so sku ho sleppa undan svartedauden. Ho tok dei då på ryggen og bar dei fram til neraste gard. Dit var det nokso lang veg, og finska var reint utmasa, då ho nådde fram. Dei fekk hus på garden natte over. Folka på garden koka graut tilkvelds, og dei åt or same fatet. Då dei sku til å eta fekk gardsfolket ved eit høve høyra at borna snakka seg imillom, at vilde det eine legja seg i fotbreidden til kjerringe, so sku det andre legja seg i fotbreidden til mannen. Då mann og kona høyrde det skyna dei kva gjester dei ha, og dei vart so skremd, at dei sette eld på husa. Då stua brann fekk dei høyra det vart slik barnegråt. Men dei to husbondsfolka var nere på å svelta ihel, då dei ikkje turde eta. Det eine barnet finnska bar ha ein soplime, det andre ha ei riva. Og ho høyrde dei sa seg imillom, at den eine sku raka føre og den andre sopa etter, so reint sku dei gjera det. Folk trudde dei to borna var svartedauden sjølv.","source":"NFS Knut Strompdal 2, 1 nr. 7","category":"ml7080","place":"Helgeland","events":[{"id":"NO-151-E01","start":402,"end":444,"span":"finska var reint utmasa, då ho nådde fram.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual carrier exhausted after journey.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-151-E02","start":569,"end":627,"span":"gardsfolket ved eit høve høyra at borna snakka seg imillom","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-151-E03","start":845,"end":898,"span":"Då stua brann fekk dei høyra det vart slik barnegråt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-151-E04","start":903,"end":949,"span":"dei to husbondsfolka var nere på å svelta ihel","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Near-starvation explicitly stated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-151-E05","start":1044,"end":1072,"span":"ho høyrde dei sa seg imillom","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual carrier, retrospectively narrated earlier episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.92584,"lon":13.40033,"label":"Helgeland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN104","id":"SIN104","collection":"NO","title":"Smaagjenta som vart trollkjerring","text":"Smaagjenta som vart trollkjerring.\nPaa ein gard innanfor (paa Heidmarka) kom det eit tater-\nfylgje og vilde faa laana husa ein kveld; men mannen paa\ngarden vilde ikkje vita noko taa deim, og sa dei skulde dra seg.\nDaa gjorde dei ein diger ring millom husa ute paa garden, og\ninn i den ringen mana dei ein heil brote med orm. Fekk dei\nso vera um natta, skulde dei mana burt all denne ormen fraa\ngarden. Ja daa fekk dei vera. Men mannen tykte det var slike\ndet var best ein sat uppe og saag etter deim. Daa det leid over\nmidnatta, stod stotaren upp og hadde upp døra. \"Putt, Putt,\naat kjellaren!\" sa han, og so flaug det ein svart fugl ut gjenom\ndøra. So la stotaren seg att\nUm morgonen var det stole i kjellaren, og mannen sende\nbod paa lensmannen. Han kom og sette fast fantane. No\nhadde dei nok fare med mykje vondt dessa folka, for dei vart\ndømde fraa livet og aarlata i hel. Men so hadde dei ei smaa-\ngjente etter seg, og ho kom aat prestgarden og vart der.\nEin gong fylgde ho presten ut paa gjordet, der karane\ndreiv og køyrde, det var 7 hestar i arbeid.\n\"Trur du eg skal faa alle hestane til aa staa fast, so ingen\ntaa karane kann faa deim i vegen att?\" sa ho aat presten. Ja\ndet vilde han sjaa. Daa gjekk ho sta og tok litt taa ein flog-\nrogn (rogn som har vakse gjenom eit tre) og sette i selepin-\nnane. Daa fekk dei ikkje flutt hestane, fyrr ho tok att flog-\nrognen.\n\"Kanskje du kann meir og du?\" sa presten.\n\"Eg kann faa grindstolpen til aa mjølka og eg, um eg vil\"\nsa gjenta.\n\"Ja gjer det!\"\nHo rende etter ei kakker og ei bytte, bora eit hol i grind-\nstolpen med kniven og dreiv ein pinne i holet. Sette so kakkera\nunder og mjølka pinnen til kakkera vart full, tømde so i bytta\nog mjølka i kakkeri att. Men daa slutta ho so braatt.\n\"No lyt det vera slutt!\" sa ho.\n\"Mjølk meir!\" sa presten.\n\"Ho mjølkar blod kua daa.\"\n\"Lat meg sjaa,\" sa presten.\nOg gjenta mjølka paa att, til det kom berre blod. Daa\nslutta ho.\n\"Tek eg no meir, stuper kua.\"\n\"Mjølk meir!\" sa presten.\nHo til aa mjølka att; men so vart det slutt.\n\"No er kua daud,\" sa ho.\nOg same eftanen fann dei kua aat ein taa husmennene\ndaud. Han fekk att ei ku taa presten; men gjenta tok dei og\naarlata i hel.","source":"NFL 11, s 164f","category":"ml3035","place":"Åmot","events":[],"context":{"place":"garden","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Demonstration requests not automatically counted as performed perceptions.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.58,"lon":11.63,"label":"Åmot","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1045","id":"SIN1045","collection":"NO","title":"Sagn om kirkeklokkene i Leksvik.","text":"Sagn om kirkeklokkene i Leksvik.\nGeneralveimester Krogh bodde på gården Kystad på Byåsen, han eiet Munkvold og eiet også Leksvik jordegods. Han og fruen forærte Leksvik kirke dens storklokke, navnet og årstallet står på klokken. Folkesagnet sier det var to klokker som veimester Krog og fruen forærte kirken; men så skulde de selges til Eidsvolds kirke; for det var [for] god klang i disse kirkeklokker til at de skulde brukes i utkanten av landet. Da kirkeklokkene skulde flyttes sørover så kjørte mann igjennem isen på Mjøsen og mistet både hesten og den ene kirkeklokken, den annen klokke som mann kom frem til Eidsvold med, var blitt så tung at det nyttet ikke for hester å dra den fra Mjøsen til Eidsvolds kirke, og så blev denne klokke fraktet tilbake til Leksvik. Her i Leksvik blev den kjørt op de bratte bakker fra sjøen til kirken med en temming (Tvoåring). Når der ringes her i Leksvik kirke med denne storklokke, så sier den:\nMin søster ligger i Mjøsen!\nKling klang! Kling klang!\nJeg sørger dagen lang!\nKling klang! Kling klang!!","source":"NFS Edvard Kruken 8, s. 33","category":"ml7070","place":"Leksvik","events":[{"id":"NO-153-E01","start":358,"end":402,"span":"det var [for] god klang i disse kirkeklokker","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic attributed acoustic quality.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-153-E02","start":868,"end":1041,"span":"Når der ringes her i Leksvik kirke med denne storklokke, så sier den:\nMin søster ligger i Mjøsen!\nKling klang! Kling klang!\nJeg sørger dagen lang!\nKling klang! Kling klang!!","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic bell sound with attributed words; no human literal voice inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Leksvik kirke","environment":"church","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.67,"lon":10.62,"label":"Leksvik","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1057","id":"SIN1057","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1057","text":"Dæ va' ein kristen mann, som gjore Forlik mæ ein Tusse, at kunne'n gjera ei kyrkje, som han ville hava, saa sille 'n skaffa'n sol å måne, men dersom han kunna få vita, hot tussen het, sille 'n kje betala dæ grand. Tussen gjore kjyrkja. Så blei kristenmannen forfælt. Så gjekk 'en innmæ eitt fjøll å gret. Så hørde'n, at tussekjeringji kva i bergje:\nTig no still, du lite kind!\nimorgo kjem Anfinn, fa'i din\nmæ sol å mæ måne\nte leikur fyr båne.\nSå blei 'en gla å kom tebakars. Då va' kyrkja færig. Så ropa 'n dæ te tussen: \"Anfinn, set krossen bet i aust aa vest!\" Så blei tussen så ille, at han datt ne av kyrkjetorne å slo seg i mange stykkje.","source":"NFS Sophus Bugge 4, s. 54f","category":"ml7065","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-154-E01","start":267,"end":304,"span":"Så gjekk 'en innmæ eitt fjøll å gret.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-154-E02","start":305,"end":347,"span":"Så hørde'n, at tussekjeringji kva i bergje","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"innmæ eitt fjøll","environment":"mountain","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1068","id":"SIN1068","collection":"NO","title":"Vardøyhus.","text":"Vardøyhus.\nI lange og harde tider var Vardøyhus festning ei folketrøyst for heile Finnmarka. I vinterkveldane fortalde dei gamle om dei tjukke murane, dei djupe kjellarane og dei store kanonane som festninga hadde. Om ein kanon gjekk det eit vers som ofte vart herma i heimane:\nLange Maren er mitt namn,\nfire fjerdingar er min visse gang.\nSpar meg ikkje krut, så ber eg fem\nfjerdingar fram.\nEtter ei slik utsegn kjende mang ei redd sjel seg tryggja og trøysta. Det var karelane som mest herja i den tid. Dei budde aust med Kola, og hadde no trengt seg ned til sjøen der. I lang tid kom dei både sjøvegen og landevegen og herja på Finnmarka. Stod nordmennene i mot, så vart dei ihelslegne, og sette dei seg ikkje til motverje, så var det mesta like gale det og. Røvarane herja og rana alt dei kunde føra eller få med seg.\nHer skal de høyra [ ] om korleis Vardøy vart berga frå karelane på ein forunderleg måte. [ ]\nDet var eit år, seint om hausten, at det kom to russeskip seglande opp på hamnen i Kiberg. Kiberg ligg på fastlandet ikkje rett langt i frå Vardøy. Det var myrkt, så ingen på Vardøyhus, korkje vakta eller dei andre, hadde lagt noko merke til skipa. Og sidan det var så myrkt, så greidde karelane å stela seg i land i ei lita vik som låg i løynd av Kibergneset. Her i denne vika, budde det ein gamal einbu. Han livde av dei små gåvene som folket gav han. Elles dyrka han sin Gud og hjelpte folket i sjukdom og naud. Einbuen låg og sov om natta, då karelane kom og skræmde han. Han skulde syna dei vegen til Svartnes, sa dei. Svartnes er ein stad beint i mot Vardøyhus festning. Då det gjekk opp for einbuen kva det var som heldt på å henda, riste han berre på hovudet og sa: «Nei.» Men karelhovdingen eller atamanen, som dei kallar han, gav seg ikkje med saka så lett prøvd. Han tok opp nokre gullrublar og baud einbuen. «Dei har eg ikkje bruk for; eg er rik nok,» svara han berre. «Då kan det henda du får lite bruk for andre ting og,» sa atamanen. «No gjer du som vi seier! Du skal gå med oss!» Einbuen skyna at her var berre ein veg å velja. Han laut gå med deim. - For å koma fram til Svartnes, laut dei gå over det høge fjellet Domen. Det er ikkje komande frammed sjøen, for Domen går stupbratt ned i havet. Einbuen gjekk fyre. Han bar ein kveikt kyndel i handa. Då han gjekk framover fjellet, tenkte han på denne ferda. Kva var det som vilde henda? «Nei, eg svik ikkje folket mitt,» sa han med seg sjølv. «Eg er gamal og utlivd snart. No får alt stå til.» - Så snudde han seg mot karelane og sa: «Ja, no vert det bratt å gå ned her; men de ser no kyndelen min.» Det var myrkt som i ein belg. Han gjekk nærare frampå stupet, heldt kyndelen godt ut ifrå seg, og kasta han roleg utfyre. Så svinga han seg til side, men fall nedover eit flåg og nokre steinar. Karelane, som ikkje var kjende, hadde berre kyndelen å retta seg etter. Dei gjekk alle utfyre stupet. Der fann folket deim seinare, knuste og krasa nede i urdane. Einbuen drog seg så vidt til folk. Der anda han ut. Han hadde slege seg så stygt at det var ikkje meir att av livet hans. Men Vardøy by kunde sova ei natt tryggare.","source":"NFL 53, s. 69f","category":"ml8000","place":"Finnmark","events":[{"id":"NO-155-E01","start":1062,"end":1162,"span":"Det var myrkt, så ingen på Vardøyhus, korkje vakta eller dei andre, hadde lagt noko merke til skipa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"low visibility/non-detection","evidence":"Det var myrkt","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier at fortress/harbour.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-155-E02","start":2775,"end":2846,"span":"Karelane, som ikkje var kjende, hadde berre kyndelen å retta seg etter.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"limited route knowledge/deceptive guide","evidence":"som ikkje var kjende, hadde berre kyndelen å retta seg etter","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"fjellet Domen","environment":"mountain","time":"seint om hausten","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":70.2,"lon":25.5,"label":"Finnmark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1070","id":"SIN1070","collection":"NO","title":"Pængkjel_x0092_n _x0096_ ryttar_x0092_n aa kjærringja.","text":"Pængkjel'n – ryttar'n aa kjærringja.\nUtafær Raakksta ligg de ei øy vi kalla Kje-øya. Der vart de ein gaang negraavve ein kjel, aa hann skull varra full taa pæng.\nSaa va de ein dag dæmm slo se sammen naakaa ungdomma paa Raakksta aa skull e væg aa le't ette kjela. Dæmm ha me se græv aa spa'a, aa saa rodd dæmm bortaaver. Dæmm lavva ut de se-myllaa at dæmm skull ikkje talla (\"snakk\") me dæmm grov. Talla dæm, saa trudd dæmm at dæmm fann ikkje naa.\nDa dæmm kom paa den sta'n, der kjel'n skull varra, saa tok dæmm te aa grava. Da dæmm ha graavve ei stynn da, saa fikk dæmm sjaa at de kom ein mann riann framme dæmm paa ein svart hæst. Men dæmm saa grov saag ikkje opp ein gaang. Dæmm klæmt bærre paa aa grov.\nDa de lei om ei lita stynn saa kom de ei gammel kjærring paa ei krykkje. Da ha dæmm graavve mykkkje da. Aa saa spor 'aa dæmm, om dæmm trudd ho naadd snart att ryttar'n.\nAa da va de ein taa karraa saa tok te aa flir. Aa da rau de att haalle fær dæmm. Aa saa vart dæmm redd, aa saa slutta dæmm aa rodd heim.-\nEin naar aar ette att saa va de aa naakkaa karra saa skull prøv aa grava att. Aa dæmm \"bestæmt\" se paa at dæmm skull faa fatt e kjela ja.\nDæmm rest dit aa byynt aa grava. Da dæmm va kaam'n saa langt ne at dæmm saag ti kjel'n, saa kom ein ofærvarannes te aa sjaa opp lite grann. Aa da fikk 'n sjaa at Raakkstagar'n sto e lys lauvva. Da hyva dæmm alt fær aa res heim aa sløykkje. Aa saa vart de ikkje meir me dæmm hell.\nSia he ikkje naa'nn prøva aa graavve ette pængkjela paa Kje-øy'n.","source":"NFS Edvard Langset 7, s. 97ff","category":"ml8010","place":"Edøy","events":[{"id":"NO-156-E01","start":560,"end":631,"span":"fikk dæmm sjaa at de kom ein mann riann framme dæmm paa ein svart hæst.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-156-E02","start":887,"end":921,"span":"ein taa karraa saa tok te aa flir.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Laughter; individual.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-156-E03","start":1218,"end":1237,"span":"dæmm saag ti kjel'n","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second excavation years later.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-156-E04","start":1297,"end":1344,"span":"fikk 'n sjaa at Raakkstagar'n sto e lys lauvva.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"apparent distant fire","evidence":"sto e lys lauvva","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Fire not disproved in text; individual, later episode; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kje-øya","environment":"island","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.07,"lon":7.82,"label":"Edøy","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1076","id":"SIN1076","collection":"NO","title":"Skattegravara.","text":"Skattegravara.\nDet va sagn om at det skull vera nedgreve skattar ut i Korsan.\nEit par kalla skull grav ei natt. Dei grov te dem såg i skatten. So kom det ein ryttar riand forbi. Han sprang forbi i gallop, men sa vist itj nokka.\nDei tok so te å grav att, men so kom det ei kjering som kom i eitt traug. Ho spord om dem hadd sett ein rytter fare forbi. Men dem svara itj for dem mått itj snakk.\n\"Å e får vel tak i 'n lell!\" sa ho.\nDa flirt dem og sa: \"Å du grei itj ta 'n du slik som du fær!\"\nDa sokk skatten.","source":"NFS Ola Ryssdal 3, s. 69f","category":"ml8010","place":"Sør-Frøya","events":[{"id":"NO-157-E01","start":112,"end":142,"span":"Dei grov te dem såg i skatten.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-157-E02","start":429,"end":441,"span":"Da flirt dem","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ut i Korsan","environment":"other named place","time":"ei natt","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.68,"lon":8.7,"label":"Sør-Frøya","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1079","id":"SIN1079","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1079","text":"Ved Kinnestad paa Setskogen ligger \"Ringshaugen\", som indeholder en stor Skat. En Torsdagskvæld prøvde non aa faa Tak i Skatten. Men i slike Tilfælde maa ikke mæles et eneste Ord. Sier en et eneste Ord, er Saken tapt for dengang. Det gik bra og de var paa god Vei, men saa kom ei Skrei Trolpak forbi og bakerst, langt efter de andre, kom ei gammel Trollkjærring kjørende med ei Purke for et Traug. Ho kjørte smaaere end andre, men skreik i et: \"Je tar dek nok at, - je tar dek nok at!\" \"Neiom du gjær\", sa en af graverne, og Grava vælva igjen. Der skal være forsøkt flere Gange, men altid kommer no iveien fra Troldpakket.","source":"NFS August Krogh 5, s. 15","category":"ml8010","place":"Søndre Høland","events":[{"id":"NO-158-E01","start":431,"end":485,"span":"skreik i et: \"Je tar dek nok at, - je tar dek nok at!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ringshaugen","environment":"hill","time":"En Torsdagskvæld","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.71741,"lon":11.44874,"label":"Søndre Høland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1081","id":"SIN1081","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1081","text":"Nissen bodde mest på hver gård. Det var best å være godvenner med den. Var nissen lei for noe gjorde den mange streker. Den dro maten bort fra kyrne den ikke likte og gav den til andre kyr han var glad i. På Spjær så man i måneskinnet at Østgårdnissen og Vestgårdnissen sloss ved Stordiket så høiet føk om dem. Men det var ikke et høistrå å se om morgenen.","source":"NFS Ruth Hult 3, s. 94","category":"ml7000","place":"Hvaler","events":[{"id":"NO-159-E01","start":214,"end":310,"span":"så man i måneskinnet at Østgårdnissen og Vestgårdnissen sloss ved Stordiket så høiet føk om dem.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-159-E02","start":311,"end":356,"span":"Men det var ikke et høistrå å se om morgenen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"absent corroborating trace","evidence":"ikke et høistrå å se om morgenen","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning non-corroboration; uncertainty operational not narrator doubt.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ved Stordiket","environment":"ditch","time":"i måneskinnet","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.07,"lon":10.98,"label":"Hvaler","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1095","id":"SIN1095","collection":"NO","title":"Tomtekadl.","text":"Tomtekadl.\nPå garden Idsal i Strand var det kje fritt for det var utrutt i fjoset i gamle dar. Folk grubla på ka det konne koma av og rådførte seg med kloge koner om dette. Dei fant då ud at det måtte vara ein tomtekadl som av ein eller annan gronn hadde vorte sinna og nå heldt dette levenet i fjoset.\nVerst var det om kveldadne, når gjentedne sko molka. Det var mest uråd å få mjølk or kydne. Dei spente og stanga og bar seg som den vonde sjøl reid dei.\nMannen spekulerte lengje på ka han sko gjera. Det var nok inkje spøg å få tomtekadl imod seg, så mykje (møgje) skyna han nå. Den karen konne hebna seg så det svei. Det hadde han haurt frå gamal tid, det fekk han nå erfara. Men noge måtte gjerast. Han fekk prøva med krut og kula. Så ladde han flintabørså og skaut tvers øve heile buskapen i fjoset ein sein kveld.\nMorgonen ettepå fant dei adle kydne daue.","source":"NFS Tor Skiftun 8, s. 99f","category":"ml7010","place":"Strand","events":[{"id":"NO-160-E01","start":273,"end":302,"span":"heldt dette levenet i fjoset.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unexplained disturbance","evidence":"Folk grubla på ka det konne koma av","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Leven may encompass noise and disorder; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"fjoset","environment":"stable","time":"om kveldadne","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.07,"lon":6.03,"label":"Strand","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1099","id":"SIN1099","collection":"NO","title":"Tereli Tove.","text":"Tereli Tove.\nEldjernbu i Folldalen har gjennem lange tider været en kvileplass for folk som for på veiding og ellers rak i fjellene der inne. Og en gang for mange hundrede år bodde det nogen røvere på Eldjernbu. De for om i alle fjelldaler på plyndring. En gang kom de til en sæter og sæterjenten tok luren sin, sprang ut på en berghammer og blåste i luren. Slik synger gamle folk på Nordmør sæterjentens låt:\nTereli, Tereli Tove\nTolv mann i skogen,\ntolv kara va dei,\ntolv boga bar dei\nBjøllkua batt dei,\nstoroksen stakk dei\nBuhunden hengt dei,\ngjetlesvein' dengt dei\nog småfea sprengt dei.\nOg me vilde dei lokka\nlangt ut av land\nog eg åtte korkje håsså\nhell' sko på mine fotå.","source":"NFS Maurits Fugelsøy 3, s. 20","category":"ml8025","place":"Halsa","events":[{"id":"NO-161-E01","start":312,"end":357,"span":"sprang ut på en berghammer og blåste i luren.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"en sæter","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.08,"lon":8.28,"label":"Halsa","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1100","id":"SIN1100","collection":"NO","title":"Vilke frå Eikeland.","text":"Vilke frå Eikeland.\nTere, lere love\n12 mann i skoge\nute aue, sund æ kne'e\na æ armen i ålbog le'en,\nfatig stakkars liten hjuring\nVilke på Hove, høyre du det?\nVilke på Hove høyre du det?\nEi hjuringgjenta frå Eikeland gjætte i skogen og so kom røvarane. Då bles ho denne sullen på hornet sitt.\nVilke var ei svær kjempa, han tok avstad med same, det var bare nokre få stig for han. Han tok røvarane og hengde dei upp på Haugarholmen i Kjilefjorden. Holmen heiter so den dag i dag.","source":"NFS Jon Løyland 2, s. 33","category":"ml8025","place":"Hægeland","events":[{"id":"NO-162-E01","start":251,"end":290,"span":"Då bles ho denne sullen på hornet sitt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.35,"lon":7.72,"label":"Hægeland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1106","id":"SIN1106","collection":"NO","title":"Gimsan.","text":"Gimsan.\nUt på hausten reist det to ungdomar te Gimsan for å driv fiskeri. Det låg fler båta der. Da det lei te jul reist båtlagja hem og desse gutan va dei sist som drog.\nNo vild gutan ha samma veikj, og da dem hadd lasta båten skulde den yngst av dei hent' nokka i bua som dem hadd glømt, men da han kom ut hadd' den anneren sett fra land og lot den yngsten stå igjen. Han trudd at han som blei att mått svelt ihel, og så fekk han ha veikja for seg sjølv.\nMen han som va att stellt seg te ein pilbogje og piler som han satte nålspissar i, og skaut med dei fuglar som for langs med stranna og plukka, vi kalla dem strannalker, og med dette fresta han livet dei dagar som var att te jul.\nAnnendag jul va det fint veir og da fekk 'n sjå tre svære farkoster som kom segland te Gimsan. Den eine skuld tilhør Halvar Båhaue, den andre Klakksøykjerringa som hadd dottra med. Den trije var fra Storfosna, det er eit skjær der kor det skal bu busekalla, e' hugsa itj namnet på det. Dem tørna for Gimsan, og så bar det til å få ilann kister og kasser og øltynner, og da dem begynt å bær det opp åt bua og vild ha det inn, vist guten itj råd kor han skuld gjør tå seg. Han tok da å krøp opp i ein tå dei øvst briskan og opp gjenom eit firkanta hol i lemmen og gjemt seg der og hadd godt oversyn. - I stua va langbord og der blei det indbragt alt det dei kund rømm av kaker og alt som er brukelig av fine folk. Midt på bore vart presentert ein stor svær gammeldags bolle med øl. Øltynna ble rulla opp te burveggen, og lagt slik at dem kunn sett' ei bøtt under kranen for å tapp øl i ho. Bøtta bar dem in i bua og øst ølet opp i bollen med ei svær kopparøs. Rundt på borde vart sett sølvstaup og disse staupa fyllt dei fra bollen med ei lita aus' i bollen.\nDette låg guten og såg på. Det svei å ligg å sjå på all denne goe mat og drikke, og han spekulert korleis han skuld erobre seg noke julemat. Han tenkt som så: Galt stod det til kva han gjor, det va liv og daue det stod om so han mått prøv lukka. Han tok da bøssa og ei pil med stålspiss fram, og da den eine frua gjekk te døra og bad dem kom in å gå te bords, så tok han nøiagtig sigte på ølbollen, han hadd hørt at stål tok magta fra slikt folk. Han skaut og pila vart sittjand i ølbollen, og da dem fekk sjå det tok dem sølvstaupan og for på dør; men mat og drikk blei ståand igjen på bordet.\n\"Dette ha eg kjendt på meg heile tia\", sa den eine kjeringa, \"eg logta Kristifolk da eg kom in døra\".\nGuten levd så av maten og drikke og var i beste velgåand da folk sist på januari kom ut te vinterfiske. Nokke øl skuld han enda ha att fortelst det. Kjæresten vart han derimot snytt for.","source":"NFS Ola Ryssdal 3, s. 107ff","category":"ml6015A","place":"Nord-Frøya","events":[{"id":"NO-163-E01","start":723,"end":781,"span":"fekk 'n sjå tre svære farkoster som kom segland te Gimsan.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-163-E02","start":1744,"end":1770,"span":"Dette låg guten og såg på.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Anaphoric observation of food/drink preparation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-163-E03","start":2238,"end":2291,"span":"da dem fekk sjå det tok dem sølvstaupan og for på dør","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group visitors perceive arrow.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-163-E04","start":2401,"end":2438,"span":"eg logta Kristifolk da eg kom in døra","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported smell by one visitor; local label retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Gimsan","environment":"island settlement","time":"Annendag jul","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["smell","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.77,"lon":8.6,"label":"Nord-Frøya","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1111","id":"SIN1111","collection":"NO","title":"Nykken.","text":"Nykken.\nNo er det ingen som ser nykken lenger. Unge folk veit mest ikkje taa han ein gong; men gamalt attende for dei nok og saag han. Det er no mykje over 100 aar sidan han var fram paa ute i Heradsbygda. Det var tri smaagutar som dreiv og leikte seg utmed elva. Der kom det ein graa hest upp tur vatnet og la seg paa bakken millom deim. No veit du hossen smaaguten er, han skal finna paa so mangt han, og so for dei ikkje lenge fyrr dei to eldste hadde kome seg upp paa ryggen aat hesten. Daa kom den yngste:\n«Je skulde ha nykke meg oppaa je eu!» sa han.\nMen daa kasta hesten seg upp med dei to han hadde, og sette paa elva med deim so vass-spruten stod.\nDaa var det nykken som hadde skapa seg um til hest. Han hadde nok meint aa faa med seg alle tri gutane; men daa han fekk høyra namnet sitt, laut han røma.","source":"NFL 11, s. 44","category":"ml4095","place":"Elverum","events":[{"id":"NO-164-E01","start":8,"end":46,"span":"No er det ingen som ser nykken lenger.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic present absence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-164-E02","start":95,"end":134,"span":"gamalt attende for dei nok og saag han.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic former observation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-164-E03","start":765,"end":811,"span":"daa han fekk høyra namnet sitt, laut han røma.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer nykken explicitly named.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"utmed elva","environment":"waterside","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.88,"lon":11.57,"label":"Elverum","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1117","id":"SIN1117","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1117","text":"Der var en Mand, siger Sagnet, som var saa plaget af Nissen, at han ikke havde Fred hverken Dag eller Nat; thi den fulgte ham, hvor han gik. Han blev kjed af dette og besluttede derfor med sin Kone og Børns Samtykke at sælge Gaarden for derved at blive Nissen kvit. Dette gjorde han. En Dag, da han skulde flytte, havde han med sig noget af sit Værktøi, som han bar i en Kurv paa Ryggen. Paa Veien traf han en Mand, som spurgte: «Hvor langt skal du idag?» «Aah, vi flytte,» svarede Nissen bag i Kurven. Manden blev da rent forbauset, da han hørte at han bar Nissen med sig. Han vendte om igjen, da han saa at det ikke kunde nytte at fly, tog Gaarden i Besiddelse igjen og havde som før altid Ufred med Nissen.","source":"NFL 47, s. 58f","category":"ml7020","place":"Vest-Agder","events":[{"id":"NO-165-E01","start":503,"end":573,"span":"Manden blev da rent forbauset, da han hørte at han bar Nissen med sig.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Paa Veien","environment":"road","time":"","movement":"skulde flytte"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.15124,"lon":7.99467,"label":"Vest-Agder","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1121","id":"SIN1121","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1121","text":"Ein gong fekk folk høyra slikt eit leven burti Væringa, ein furuskog millom Øygarden og Nerstorhov. Dei drog dit, og der fekk dei sjaa tvo nissar i slagsmaal. Det var Øygardsnissen og Nerstorhovs-nissen.\nØygarden var god korngard; men det var likare med grønavlinga paa Nerstorhov. So hadde desse to nissane drege aat kvar sin gard. Øygard-nissen kom med grønfor fraa Nerstorhov, og Nerstorhovs-nissen kom med korn fraa Øygarden. No hadde dei møtt kvarandre i Væringa, og so bar det i hop med deim so fortappane for høgt til vers. Sist paa vart det so Øygards-nissen rauk, og sidan gjekk det ut med Øygardsfolket og.","source":"NFL 11, s. 41f","category":"ml7000","place":"Elverum","events":[{"id":"NO-166-E01","start":14,"end":54,"span":"folk høyra slikt eit leven burti Væringa","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-166-E02","start":117,"end":158,"span":"der fekk dei sjaa tvo nissar i slagsmaal.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Væringa, ein furuskog","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.88,"lon":11.57,"label":"Elverum","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1123","id":"SIN1123","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1123","text":"Vonde-Lavrans livde i seinste luten av det 18de hundradaare og budde paa Meaas i Selgjord. [ ]\nEin dag er Lavrans nede i Meaasdalen, daa bli 'n vare ein tussegut som krek og krabbar uppyvi til løda med eit einaste konnaks paa ryggen, og han stunde og teva liksom det var so gruveleg tung byrd han hadde.\n«Hot æ dæ du pustar aa pæsar saa fe daa?» ropa Lavrans; «du hev naa kje saa tong byri!»\n«Skaa eg bera saa mykji ifraa deg som eg hev bore te deg, saa skaa du a bli vare at byri æ tong nok!» svara tussen, og so snudde han med byrdi og tok yvi til grannegarden, Bakken. Daa Lavrans stirde etter 'n, so fekk 'n fysst sjaa at det var ei uryggjeleg stor konnbyrd tussen slæpa paa.\nFørr hadde tussen bore fraa Bakken baade fôr og mat, so der var berre naud og armod. Men no drog han fraa Meaas til Bakken att, so der vart stor vælstand; men paa Meaas vilde ingin ting lukkas etter denna tid, Lavrans fekk ein udaude, og folki hans gjekk det ut med.","source":"NFL 21, s. 43","category":"ml7005","place":"Sigdal","events":[{"id":"NO-167-E01","start":137,"end":232,"span":"bli 'n vare ein tussegut som krek og krabbar uppyvi til løda med eit einaste konnaks paa ryggen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-167-E02","start":237,"end":303,"span":"han stunde og teva liksom det var so gruveleg tung byrd han hadde.","modalities":["auditory","bodily sensation"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Groaning and panting explicit; load simile; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-167-E03","start":572,"end":679,"span":"Daa Lavrans stirde etter 'n, so fekk 'n fysst sjaa at det var ei uryggjeleg stor konnbyrd tussen slæpa paa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised size perception","evidence":"fekk 'n fysst sjaa at det var ei uryggjeleg stor konnbyrd","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Meaasdalen","environment":"valley","time":"Ein dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"Vonde-Lavrans [Evil Lavrans] lived in the latter part of the 18th century and resided at Meaas in Selgjord. [ ]\nOne day Lavrans is down in the Meaas valley, then he becomes aware of a tussa-boy [subterranean/troll boy] who is creeping and crawling upwards to the barn with a single ear of grain on his back, and he was panting and puffing as if it were a terribly heavy burden he had.\n'What is it you are blowing and wheezing so for then?' shouted Lavrans; 'you surely don't have such a heavy burden!'\n'If I were to carry as much away from you as I have carried to you, then you would soon notice that the burden is heavy enough!' answered the tussa, and then he turned with the load and headed over to the neighboring farm, Bakken.\n\nWhen Lavrans stared after him, only then did he see that it was an unimaginably large grain-burden the tussa was dragging along.\nPreviously, the tussa had carried both fodder and food away from Bakken, so there was only need and poverty. But now he dragged from Meaas to Bakken again, so that there was great prosperity; but at Meaas nothing would succeed after this time, Lavrans met an untimely death, and things went badly for his family.","translationNotes":["'Konnaks' is one ear of grain: https://ordbokene.no/bm/106646 . The source place spelling Selgjord is retained. 'Tussegut/tussen' designates a supernatural being in the narrative.","'Fysst' marks only then seeing the large burden. The closing phrase describes the family's decline without specifying that every family member died."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.05,"lon":9.6,"label":"Sigdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"NO-167-E01","start":162,"end":306,"span":"he becomes aware of a tussa-boy [subterranean/troll boy] who is creeping and crawling upwards to the barn with a single ear of grain on his back","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"bli 'n vare ein tussegut som krek og krabbar uppyvi til løda med eit einaste konnaks paa ryggen","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-167-E02","start":312,"end":384,"span":"he was panting and puffing as if it were a terribly heavy burden he had.","modalities":["auditory","bodily sensation"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Groaning and panting explicit; load simile; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"han stunde og teva liksom det var so gruveleg tung byrd han hadde.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-167-E03","start":734,"end":862,"span":"When Lavrans stared after him, only then did he see that it was an unimaginably large grain-burden the tussa was dragging along.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised size perception","evidence":"fekk 'n fysst sjaa at det var ei uryggjeleg stor konnbyrd","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Daa Lavrans stirde etter 'n, so fekk 'n fysst sjaa at det var ei uryggjeleg stor konnbyrd tussen slæpa paa.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1126","id":"SIN1126","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1126","text":"Da pesta kom til Rødenes, sto 'o på Klemmetsby og ropte over til Gåseby for å bli rodd over. Andre sier 'o sto ved Kåtorp og ropte over til Klund for å bli rodd over til østsida av sjøn. Mannen som sku sett 'a over, ble ulykkelig da han så hvem det var, og så lovte Pesta å spare ham og hans. Hu brukte rive i Rø'nes, så der var'e noen igjen, men i Ømærk brukt'a lime, så der var det helt rødda. Det heter seg at etter Svartedauen var'e tre rykanes piper igjen i Rødenes og inga i Ømærk.","source":"NFS Elin Holter Frøyset og Helge Frøyset 3, s. 34","category":"ml7085","place":"Rødenes","events":[{"id":"NO-168-E01","start":216,"end":252,"span":"ble ulykkelig da han så hvem det var","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Identity recognised, no perceptual doubt expressed.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Rødenes","environment":"other named place","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.6,"lon":11.68,"label":"Rødenes","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1130","id":"SIN1130","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1130","text":"Det var to høggerer som lå ute ved en nying en nat sør på Langås. Mot høgstnattes fik de høre to grove bikjer som tok til å jage i Asurdalen borte ved de to Gråbengropene. Losen gikk op i Teien og kom så op nor på Langås.\nDe syntes det låt så rart og uhyggelig og undrest på hva det var for bikjer som jog nå svarte natta. De slengte mer på varmen å ble liggende å lye på det rare grove måle på bikjene som kom nermere og nermere. Da kom det en barbent jente med utslått hår springende for livet like forbi varmen deres og ble borte sørover ned mot myra som ligger sørpå åsen. Hun hadde hvit serk å kort grøn stakk. Før de fik sukk for sig kom to store svarte bikjer halsene efter på sporet hennes og losen drog sig sørover mot Kloppa, så op mot Oksrudveien å mot Delet, men der smallt det et skudd og så ble det stilt.\nDe ble fælne å frisket på varmen igjen og undres på hva dette var for jagt, men da knakk det i no kvist borte i skauen og litt efter kom en svær kar med stort svart skjegg gående forbi, de så ham vel i lysskjæret. Han hadde de to bikjene i kobbel og bar en svær muskedunder på skuldern, men på ryggen hans hang jenten som en annen skutt hare efter de sammenbunne bena som var tredd inn på børsepipen. Ikke sa karene no - og ikke sa han no, og borte ble'n der han gik norover i nattemørket, men de skjønte det at jenten var en hulder.","source":"NFS Allers, nr. 70","category":"ml5060","place":"Østmarka","events":[{"id":"NO-169-E01","start":82,"end":140,"span":"fik de høre to grove bikjer som tok til å jage i Asurdalen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified sound/source","evidence":"undrest på hva det var for bikjer som jog nå svarte natta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-169-E02","start":350,"end":430,"span":"ble liggende å lye på det rare grove måle på bikjene som kom nermere og nermere.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified sound/source","evidence":"det rare grove måle","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-169-E03","start":775,"end":819,"span":"der smallt det et skudd og så ble det stilt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-169-E04","start":900,"end":938,"span":"da knakk det i no kvist borte i skauen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-169-E05","start":1006,"end":1033,"span":"de så ham vel i lysskjæret.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit visibility quality; preceding man with beard/dogs and following carried girl belong to same view.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Langås","environment":"forest","time":"Mot høgstnattes","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"There were two woodcutters who were out by an open-air fire [nying] one night south of Langås. Toward the dead of night they got to hear two deep-voiced hounds that began to hunt in Asurdalen over by the two Gråben pits [wolf pits]. The hound-cry went up into Teien and then came up north on Langås.\nThey thought it sounded so strange and uncanny and wondered what kind of hounds were hunting now in the pitch black of night. They threw more wood on the fire and lay listening to the strange, coarse baying of the hounds which came nearer and nearer. Then came a barefoot girl with loose-flowing hair running for her life right past their fire and disappeared southwards down towards the marsh which lies south on the ridge. She had a white shift and a short green skirt.\n\nBefore they could catch their breath, two large black hounds came baying after on her track and the hound-cry drew southwards towards Kloppa, then up toward the Oksrud road and towards Delet, but there a shot cracked and then it grew still.\nThey became frightened and stoked the fire again and wondered what kind of hunt this was, but then a twig snapped over in the forest and a little later a huge fellow with a large black beard came walking past, they could see him well in the light of the fire. He had the two hounds on a leash and carried a heavy blunderbuss on his shoulder, but on his back the girl hung like another shot hare by her bound-together legs which were threaded onto the gun barrel.\n\nThe fellows said nothing – and he said nothing, and away he went as he walked northwards into the dark of night, but they understood that the girl was a huldre [huldra / subterranean female spirit].","translationNotes":["\"Nying\" refers to an open-air campfire made of logs. \"Gråbengropene\" refers to wolf pits. Text is in traditional dialect/Norwegian vernacular.","Continuation of the Langås forest encounter.","\"Hulder\" is a subterranean forest spirit/creature."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.87,"lon":10.97,"label":"Østmarka","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"NO-169-E01","start":125,"end":191,"span":"got to hear two deep-voiced hounds that began to hunt in Asurdalen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified sound/source","evidence":"undrest på hva det var for bikjer som jog nå svarte natta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"fik de høre to grove bikjer som tok til å jage i Asurdalen","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-169-E02","start":463,"end":550,"span":"lay listening to the strange, coarse baying of the hounds which came nearer and nearer.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified sound/source","evidence":"det rare grove måle","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"ble liggende å lye på det rare grove måle på bikjene som kom nermere og nermere.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-169-E03","start":969,"end":1013,"span":"there a shot cracked and then it grew still.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"der smallt det et skudd og så ble det stilt.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-169-E04","start":1113,"end":1146,"span":"a twig snapped over in the forest","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"da knakk det i no kvist borte i skauen","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-169-E05","start":1224,"end":1273,"span":"they could see him well in the light of the fire.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit visibility quality; preceding man with beard/dogs and following carried girl belong to same view.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"de så ham vel i lysskjæret.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1134","id":"SIN1134","collection":"NO","title":"Ormen var takksam.","text":"Ormen var takksam.\nEin gut i Bø kom ein dag yvi ei podde og ein orm som sloss, og podda som var reint yvigangs stor og sterk, heldt på å forgange ormen. Det var reint grøteleg å sjå korleids han vreid og kunta seg for å koma unda. Guten totte synd på ormen, treiv so ein bjørkesvege og slo podda i hel, og ormen beit seg i sporen og trilla burt.\nEi tid etterpå kom guten gangande berrføtt yvi sama staden og fekk so eit poddebein i foten. So tok foten til å verkje, og hovna upp so han var fæl å sjå. Det stod um livet.\nEi nott vakna guten i at nokon stelte med såret hans. Han kjende korleis det batna og leda seg ikkje. Då det ljosna, såg han ein orm som rann bort frå foten og ut. Andre notti kom ormen att, og då kjende guten at han drog eit bein utor foten. So slikka ormen såret vel og for so ut at. Eit bil etter kom han inn att med eit lækjomblekke som han la på såret. Det gjekk ikkje mange dagane før guten var god att.","source":"NFS Allers, nr, 10","category":"ml3065","place":"Seljord","events":[{"id":"NO-170-E01","start":153,"end":230,"span":"Det var reint grøteleg å sjå korleids han vreid og kunta seg for å koma unda.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-170-E02","start":408,"end":500,"span":"fekk so eit poddebein i foten. So tok foten til å verkje, og hovna upp so han var fæl å sjå.","modalities":["touch","pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-170-E03","start":574,"end":621,"span":"Han kjende korleis det batna og leda seg ikkje.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Woke during treatment at night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-170-E04","start":622,"end":683,"span":"Då det ljosna, såg han ein orm som rann bort frå foten og ut.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-170-E05","start":714,"end":762,"span":"då kjende guten at han drog eit bein utor foten.","modalities":["touch","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-170-E06","start":763,"end":788,"span":"So slikka ormen såret vel","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"The snake was grateful.\n\nA boy in Bø came one day across a toad and a snake that were fighting, and the toad, which was unusually large and strong, was on the verge of destroying the snake. It was truly dreadful to see how it writhed and squirmed to get away. The boy felt sorry for the snake, grabbed a birch switch and struck the toad to death, and the snake bit its tail and rolled away.\n\nSome time afterwards the boy came walking barefoot across the same place and got a toad bone in his foot. Then the foot began to ache and swelled up so it was dreadful to look at. It was a matter of life and death.\n\nOne night the boy woke to someone tending his wound. He felt it getting better and remained still.\n\nWhen it dawned, he saw a snake crawl away from his foot and out. The second night the snake came again, and then the boy felt that it pulled a bone out of his foot. Then the snake licked the wound well and went out again. A short while later he came back in with a medicinal leaf which he placed on the wound. Within a few days the boy was well again.","translationNotes":["Text in Nynorsk dialect form from Bø. Restored final two sentences detailing nocturnal healing sensation.","Continuation of the snake and toad legend."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.48,"lon":8.65,"label":"Seljord","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"NO-170-E01","start":190,"end":259,"span":"It was truly dreadful to see how it writhed and squirmed to get away.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Det var reint grøteleg å sjå korleids han vreid og kunta seg for å koma unda.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-170-E02","start":469,"end":571,"span":"got a toad bone in his foot. Then the foot began to ache and swelled up so it was dreadful to look at.","modalities":["touch","pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"fekk so eit poddebein i foten. So tok foten til å verkje, og hovna upp so han var fæl å sjå.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-170-E03","start":661,"end":706,"span":"He felt it getting better and remained still.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Woke during treatment at night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Han kjende korleis det batna og leda seg ikkje.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-170-E04","start":708,"end":772,"span":"When it dawned, he saw a snake crawl away from his foot and out.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Då det ljosna, såg han ein orm som rann bort frå foten og ut.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-170-E05","start":816,"end":872,"span":"then the boy felt that it pulled a bone out of his foot.","modalities":["touch","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second night.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"då kjende guten at han drog eit bein utor foten.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-170-E06","start":873,"end":909,"span":"Then the snake licked the wound well","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"So slikka ormen såret vel","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN114","id":"SIN114","collection":"NO","title":"SIN114","text":"Dæ va ei gjente i frå Håtveit som gjekk å les i Bø. Så hadde\ndæ kome fær presten at ho konne trølle. Ho konne mjølke\nkuene te andre, ho hadde lært dæ a mor si.\nHo testo at ho konne trølle, å så ville presten sjå. Ho sette\nto sylar i veggen å te å mjølke. Ho mjølka kua te husma'en.\nHo mjølka så froa susa.\n\"Nå kan eg ikkje mjølke meir, helles så kjem dæ blo,\" sa\ngjenta. \"Bare mjølk,\" sa presten. Ho mjølka. \"Ja, nå må eg nok\nslutte helles dauar kua,\" sa ho. \"Bare mjølk,\" sa presten. Ho\nmjølka på.\nDa kom ein ongje springans å ropa på far sin, han va i preste-\ngaren å arbedde. \"Kua ligg dau i tjore!\" sa ongen å gret. Faren\ntok ut heim så fort han konne.\nSå sa presten dæ te husma'en: \"Du kan gå ne i fjose å ta\nei ku att.\" Han så gjore. Men eg veit ikkje horre den husma'en\nva i frå - anten dæ va Hegna eller Krosshaugen. Eg hørde\nSågådølen fortålde, eg.","source":"NFL 85, s.109","category":"ml3035","place":"Bø","events":[{"id":"NO-171-E01","start":282,"end":305,"span":"Ho mjølka så froa susa.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit hissing/frothing acoustic wording; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-171-E02","start":603,"end":619,"span":"sa ongen å gret.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"preste-\ngaren","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.42,"lon":9.07,"label":"Bø","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1140","id":"SIN1140","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1140","text":"Då Skeikyrkja skulde verta bygd var det mykje uvenskap milom folket, sume vilde at ho skulde vera på Fossum og andre vilde at ho skulde vera på Skei. Det vart sagt at dei begynte og bygge på Fossum. Men om natta vart ho flytta til Skei. Og for å berga timbret var det sett vakt. Det vart sagt at ein mann i frå Kålåsen som var svært sterk vilde at kyrkja skulde vera på Fossum. Og når ho ikkje vart der, vart han harm og so tok han ein stor stein og hivde frå Kålåsfjellet og til Skei. Han trudde vist han skulde råka kyrkja, men det jorde han ikkje. Og det vart sagt at steinen skal vera og sjå i Skeis-lia den dag i dag.","source":"NFS Allers, nr. 63","category":"ml7060","place":"Ogndal","events":[{"id":"NO-172-E01","start":571,"end":622,"span":"steinen skal vera og sjå i Skeis-lia den dag i dag.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic visibility of material trace.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Skeis-lia","environment":"hillside","time":"den dag i dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":64.02005,"lon":11.63129,"label":"Ogndal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1168","id":"SIN1168","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1168","text":"Man troede, at der gaves Mennesker, som kunde forvandle sig til Var-Ulv eller Huse-Bjørn, og at de, der besad denne Egenskab, enten vare blevne samme paasat af onde Mennesker, eller at de vare egentlige Troldmænd. En saadan Egenskab besad Jonas Kruse, der opholdt sig i en Hytte, der endnu siges at have været paa Pladsen Krum-Huus under Ultvedt. Jonas havde en Hustru, ved navn Ingebor. Det kom engang pludselig over ham at forvandles til Huse-Bjørn, just som han og Hustruen samlede Høe i Stak. Jonas gav sin Kone en Kjep i Haanden, kastede hende op i Stakken og bad hende Værge sig det bedste hun formaaede, hvorpaa Kruse gik en stund bort. Han vendte tilbage som en stor Bjørn, der angreb og ængstede Konen paa Livet, saa hun kun med Nød kunde værge sig paa Høstakken. Omsider forlod Bjørnen hende, og strax derpaa vendte Kruse tilbage som et Menneske.","source":"NFS Andreas Faye avskrift, s. 111","category":"ml4005","place":"Gjerstad","events":[{"id":"NO-173-E01","start":535,"end":561,"span":"kastede hende op i Stakken","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Forced bodily displacement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.88,"lon":9.02,"label":"Gjerstad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1172","id":"SIN1172","collection":"NO","title":"Russernes Grassering i Finmarken.","text":"Russernes Grassering i Finmarken.\nI gamle Dage vare Finmarken og især Nordmændene, som havde nedsat sig langs Fjordene, udsat for hyppige Overfald af Russer og Hedninger, der tvang Finnerne til at være Veivisere over Fjeldene. Da disse ubudne Gjæster ei heller fore mildt frem mod de stakkels Finner benyttede disse sig stundom af Leiligheden for at advare de Norske og bringe Fordærvelse over Voldsmændene. I Russer feiden kom saaledes engang en Hob Russere til Honningsvaag hvor de tvang en Fin til at vise sig Veien, da de agtede i Nattens Mørke, at overfalde og udplyndre Kjelvig, som dengang beboedes af Egnens Øvrighed og Andre. Finnen, som ei syntes om denne Færd, pønsede paa List. Da han kom til den bratte Fjeldtind, som hæver sig steilt over Kjelvig, kastede han Faklen ud over Skrænten i det han selv greb fat i en fremragende Fjeldknat. Russerne, som fulgte Faklens Skin styrtede i den aabne Grav. – Finnen ilte derpaa ad den almindelige Vei til Kjelvig, hvor han fandt Stedets Embedsmænd ved Spillebordet. Han traadte hastig ind i deres Midte og raabte: \"Lader Spillet fare; thi Døden er Eder nær, og fortalte med det samme, at en stor Mængde Russere vare ankomne til Honningsvaag, og at han med Nød og Næppe havde kunnet rædde dem fra den første truende Fare. De forskrækkede Embedsmænd lavede sig strax til at flye med Qvinder og Børn ind i Fjeldene. Et Kors staar endnu paa Fjeldtinden til Minde om denne Begivenhed.","source":"NFS Andreas Faye avskrift, s. 254","category":"ml8000","place":"Oppland","events":[{"id":"NO-174-E01","start":850,"end":910,"span":"Russerne, som fulgte Faklens Skin styrtede i den aabne Grav.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"deceptive visual guide","evidence":"fulgte Faklens Skin","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Route deception explicitly explained by thrown torch; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"den bratte Fjeldtind","environment":"mountain","time":"i Nattens Mørke","movement":"fulgte Faklens Skin"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.5,"lon":9.5,"label":"Oppland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1173","id":"SIN1173","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1173","text":"Om de 4 Dalføre, Kvinesdal, Undalen (egentlig \"Øudendalen\"), Mandalen og Saangdalen, fortæller Sagnet at de havde faaet sit Navn efter Begivenhederne i dem paa den sorte Død.\nI Kvinesdal var en Kvinde igjen (hun skulde blive vild, og, da man endelig fik hende fat, giftede hun sig, og fra hende skal nedstamme en Slegt, som kaldes Rypeslegten)\ni Mandalsdalen en Mand; i Saangdalen en Degn og i Øudendalen var ingen Folk tilbage – der var out (el. aut) =: tomt.","source":"NFS Andreas Faye avskrift, s. 398","category":"ml7090","place":"Vest-Agder","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.15124,"lon":7.99467,"label":"Vest-Agder","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1178","id":"SIN1178","collection":"NO","title":"Sagn om Troldkjærringer.","text":"Sagn om Troldkjærringer.\nOm dem har vi mange Historier. De holdt deres forsamlinger Natten til Paaskedag i Kirkerne. En, som var saa nysgjerrig, at han gjemte sig i Taarnet for at see blev hængt ud efter en Krog gjennem Næseborene, efter først at have lovet ikke at fortælle Noget. En Anden var heldigere. Han tog ind med sig noget indviet Jord, lagde noget under Fødderne og noget paa Hovedet, og han fik see hele deres Flok. De behøvede ikke lang Tid; thi de satte sig paa Feiekosten og raabte: Her up og her ut, her up og her ut, og afsted gjennem Skorstenspiben tog det da i strygende Fart. En Gut, som havde seet denne Ceremoni, vilde gjøre lige saa; men ham kom det dyrt at staa; han tog nemlig feil af Ordene og sagde: Her up og her ned. Op piben med ham, men da han sagde, her ned, saa gik det op og ned i Skorstenspiben. Troldkjærringerne fik mere Smør og Melk end Andre. De kunne Skade dem, de ere Uvenner med, ved at gjøre det saa at deres Kjøer melke Blod eller endog ligge sprængte paa Gulvet. -","source":"NFS Andreas Faye avskrift, s. 390","category":"ml3045","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-176-E01","start":184,"end":230,"span":"blev hængt ud efter en Krog gjennem Næseborene","modalities":["touch","pressure"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit bodily suspension; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-176-E02","start":398,"end":426,"span":"han fik see hele deres Flok.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-176-E03","start":595,"end":632,"span":"En Gut, som havde seet denne Ceremoni","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-176-E04","start":790,"end":829,"span":"saa gik det op og ned i Skorstenspiben.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Boy involuntarily transported; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"i Kirkerne","environment":"church","time":"Natten til Paaskedag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1182","id":"SIN1182","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1182","text":"Paa Oland skulde det ha vore ein som var gift med ei tussegjente. Han kom inn i tussehytta eller hoss det var. Men han kasta kniven yver henne. So sa mori hennar: Ja, no hev du 'æ, men ver no snild med 'æ. Men han var 'kje det.\nSo var det ein gong han stod i smidja, som ho kom inn til han, og so tok ho ein gloande hestesko i hendene og retta ut: So kunde eg gjere med deg dersom eg vilde, sa ho.","source":"NFS Johan Agerholt 7, s. 158","category":"ml5090","place":"Gjøvdal","events":[{"id":"NO-177-E01","start":297,"end":346,"span":"tok ho ein gloande hestesko i hendene og retta ut","modalities":["touch","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact with hot object explicit; no pain inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"smidja","environment":"smithy","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.87448,"lon":8.27741,"label":"Gjøvdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1185","id":"SIN1185","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1185","text":"Omtr. på grænsen mell. Sannikedal og Søndeled ligger nogle små tjern, af hvilke det ene heder Torvetjern. På den sydøstlige og nordvestlige side af disse strækker sig nogle skoggrodde hejer, som danner et dalføre. Op imellem fjeldene mod nordvest går igjen et par små sidedale. De er mørke og skumle, og når fuglene skriger i skråningerne, svarer dvergemålet på den andre side.\nPå gården Barlan har der i gamle dage ofte været strid mell. bønderne m. h. t. bøtterne, som den ene flyttede før den anden, de gik midt over Torvetjern. Og endnu den dag idag siger sagnet, ligger der en mand på bunden af tjernet og løfter på bøttestenen som han havde flyttet. Imellem lykkes det han at få den helt op i vandskorpen, og da ler han så det svarer i fjeldene -, men når stenen falder til bunds igjen, gråter manden så dvergemålet tager det op igjen.","source":"NFS Moltke Moe 117, 39f","category":"ml4035","place":"Søndeled","events":[{"id":"NO-178-E01","start":304,"end":377,"span":"når fuglene skriger i skråningerne, svarer dvergemålet på den andre side.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic echo; dvergemålet retained, not an inferred agent.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-178-E02","start":715,"end":750,"span":"da ler han så det svarer i fjeldene","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-178-E03","start":793,"end":841,"span":"gråter manden så dvergemålet tager det op igjen.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Torvetjern","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.76088,"lon":9.07494,"label":"Søndeled","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1188","id":"SIN1188","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1188","text":"Det hadde vært ugreie mellom gårdene Feland og Bjerge (nabo gårdene til Hesteland) tretta gjalt ei myr i skogen. Det blei lagmannsrett. Lars Bjerge kom en kveld i månelys forbi myra. Han så da 12 rev i skiftestrengen. Den siste reven grein. Det var den gamle lagretten som gikk igjen. De hadde ikke dømt rett.","source":"NFS Olav Jarl Gahre, s. 2","category":"ml4035","place":"Spangereid","events":[{"id":"NO-179-E01","start":183,"end":217,"span":"Han så da 12 rev i skiftestrengen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-179-E02","start":218,"end":240,"span":"Den siste reven grein.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Crying sound in witnessed scene; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"myra","environment":"wetland","time":"en kveld i månelys","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.04543,"lon":7.14407,"label":"Spangereid","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN120","id":"SIN120","collection":"NO","title":"SIN120","text":"Fant man en hvitorm, skulde man koke suppe på den. Spiste\nman så av den, blev man vis og kunde se inn i fremtiden. En\ngammel kone på Bøensetra fant engang en hvitorm. Hun la den\ni gryta for å koke suppe på den og gikk en tur ut i fjøset. Mens\nhun var ute, kom en liten jentunge på 6 år inn i kjøkkenet. Hun\nsyntes det lukta så godt av suppegryta, og tok litt på en skål og\nspiste. Så sprang hun ut i fjøset. Der var det e ku som skulde\nbære. Jenta gikk bort til den og klappa den: \"Se på denne kua,\ndu bestemor,\" sa hun, \"den har en rød og hvit kalv.\" Da fikk\nhun en ørefik så det sang av kona. \"Har du vært i suppegryta,\ndin stygge jentunge,\" sa hun.","source":"NFL 39, s.72","category":"ml3030","place":"Rømskog","events":[{"id":"NO-180-E01","start":303,"end":345,"span":"Hun\nsyntes det lukta så godt av suppegryta","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-180-E02","start":442,"end":479,"span":"Jenta gikk bort til den og klappa den","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later in fjøset; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-180-E03","start":552,"end":594,"span":"Da fikk\nhun en ørefik så det sang av kona.","modalities":["touch","auditory","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Blow with acoustic idiom; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kjøkkenet","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","smell"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.72,"lon":11.83,"label":"Rømskog","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1201","id":"SIN1201","collection":"NO","title":"Kinnekling","text":"Kinnekling\nDa var to kara som sloe om sommaren på ein teig. Dei haurde kor fælt dei kidna i ein haug. \"Bia no,\" sa den eine, \"so får me snart kinnekling og saup til drikka.\" Da va ei stund, so kom ei hulda. Ho hadde ei skaol med saup og ei skaol med smør. Men det var ein blodsdråpe midt i smøret og ein blodsdråpe midt i saupen. Og dette toke dei vekk og aote og drukkje litt. Da var greitt og godt da.","source":"NFS Rigmor Frimannslund 2, s. 67","category":"ml5080","place":"Eksingedalen","events":[{"id":"NO-181-E01","start":60,"end":101,"span":"Dei haurde kor fælt dei kidna i ein haug.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-181-E02","start":378,"end":403,"span":"Da var greitt og godt da.","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Evaluation of consumed butter/whey, not explicitly taste-specific; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ein haug","environment":"hill","time":"om sommaren","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","taste"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.83,"lon":5.97,"label":"Eksingedalen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1208","id":"SIN1208","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1208","text":"Presten i Rakksta' hysa'n Gamle-Erik å hølt sæi litt inne me'n. Men en gong da så skikka'n bå etter Thams i Essbær' får å få hjælp te å bli kvitt'n. Å Thams dro ivæi han i karjoln. Men da'n kåm te Lysåkerbakkæne, så var'n Gamle-Erik der å kasta tå de' ene hjule'. Men han måtte flye me' å hølle åppe helt te Rakksta'. Da stakk'n inn å sette sæi unner bole'. Å Thams kåm inn han æu. \"Er'e sånne kærær di hysær her,\" sa'n. Så tok'n på å lesa gussol, å da ville han Gamle-Erik ut gjennom pipa, men de' sa Thams at han ette fekk løv te, får da ræiv'n ne' pipa. Thams tok æi nål å stakk høl i bly i vindu', å sa at der sku'n ut. Men han Gamle-Erik ba pent om å få slæppe de', men ut mått'n, å da sto hele stua å rista.","source":"NFS Elin Holter Frøyset og Helge Frøyset 5, s. 26f","category":"ml3010","place":"Eidskog","events":[],"context":{"place":"hele stua","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.02813,"lon":12.06528,"label":"Eidskog","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1220","id":"SIN1220","collection":"NO","title":"Pokalen og Trillebroka.","text":"Pokalen og Trillebroka.\nI Statsbygden [er] en Annexkirke, der kaldes Klosteret. Did skulde en Mand reise til Ottesang i Julen. Da han kom farende forbi et Bjerg paa sine Skier kom der ud et Trold og rakte ham en stor Pokal og bad ham drikke af den. Han turde ikke andet end tage den, men slog Drikken bagover sig, og en Draabe som faldt paa Skien sved Hul i den. Manden satte afsted med Pokalen. \"Ja bi til jeg faaer paa mig Trillebroka mi, skal jeg nok tage dig igjen\" skreg Troldet. Md. lovede, at hvis han kunde frelse Pokalen og sig fra Troldet, skulde han offre den paa Alteret om Juuldagen. Troldet trillede saaledes efter ham, at det kom op paa Ryggen af ham, og det var saa tungt, at Md. syntes, han vilde synke i Jorden. Han bad til Gud, at han maatte komme vel fram. Et Stykke fra Kirken, kom Dagen. \"Nei see den vakkre røde Hest paa Aasen!\" sagde Md. Saa maatte Troldet slippe (?) Mdn. offrede Pokalen, og den skal findes der endnu og var meget prægtig, forjyldt baade udvendig og indvendig og svært tung. Fortællersken havde selv seet den.","source":"NFS Var. Fb 27, 2","category":"ml6045","place":"Stadsbygd","events":[{"id":"NO-183-E01","start":470,"end":483,"span":"skreg Troldet","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-183-E02","start":670,"end":729,"span":"det var saa tungt, at Md. syntes, han vilde synke i Jorden.","modalities":["pressure","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Felt load explicitly attributed; simile not uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-183-E03","start":1017,"end":1051,"span":"Fortællersken havde selv seet den.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Narrator's later observation of cup; time/place unstated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.51045,"lon":10.01687,"label":"Stadsbygd","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1225","id":"SIN1225","collection":"NO","title":"Huldre og ungkaren ved Sandnessjøen.","text":"Huldre og ungkaren ved Sandnessjøen.\nEingong var det ei hulder som låg so etter ein ungkar, som budde ved Sandnessjøen. Eingong var det på nippen han ikkje hadde lote vore med henne til heimen hennar. Det var nyss fyre jul ho kom og vilde ha honom med. Men ungkaren ha ein pakke onglar han kom berande med. Og den som har stål på seg kjem huldra ingen veg med. Men sint vart ho huldra. \"Det skal aldri koma til å bli nokon velstann for deg\", sa ho då ho for sin veg. Og det segjast at det vart berre smått for honom og so lenge han livde.","source":"NFS Knut Strompdal 8, s. 10","category":"ml5095","place":"Vefsn","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.85,"lon":13.18,"label":"Vefsn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1235","id":"SIN1235","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1235","text":"Ytterst i Kolbu ligg det nogen garder som heitter Dystegarda. Sagnet førtel at på dessi garda var det ei rar tromme. Dom trudde det var dei underjordiske som eigde tromma, før dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a. Men da det vart krig, kunde dom høre tromma lang veg, og dom hørde dei underjordiske tala og lo og nå krigen begynte gikk tromma ut i førvegen. Tromma er vørti kelt Dystetromma. Men det var helt sikkert, at nå dom hørde Dystetromma blev det krig.","source":"NFS Allers, nr. 23","category":"ml6040","place":"Kolbu","events":[{"id":"NO-185-E01","start":176,"end":217,"span":"dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen sound source","evidence":"dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-185-E02","start":240,"end":313,"span":"kunde dom høre tromma lang veg, og dom hørde dei underjordiske tala og lo","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen sound source","evidence":"dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic war-associated acoustic sequence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Dystegarda","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"At the outer edge of Kolbu are some farms called Dystegarda. Legend tells that on these farms there was a strange drum. They believed it was the underground people who owned the drum, for they saw neither the drum nor those who owned it. But when war broke out, people could hear the drum a long way off, and they heard the underground folk talk and laugh, and when the war began the drum went out ahead. The drum has come to be called Dystetromma [the Dyste drum]. But it was quite certain that when they heard Dystetromma, there was war.","translationNotes":["East Norwegian dialect form. Corrected perception phrasing regarding the drum and its owners. The dialectal 'før' is rendered as causal 'for', not temporal 'before'."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.55,"lon":10.73,"label":"Kolbu","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"NO-185-E01","start":188,"end":237,"span":"they saw neither the drum nor those who owned it.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen sound source","evidence":"dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-185-E02","start":262,"end":355,"span":"people could hear the drum a long way off, and they heard the underground folk talk and laugh","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen sound source","evidence":"dom såg itte tromma hel dom som eigde 'a","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic war-associated acoustic sequence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"kunde dom høre tromma lang veg, og dom hørde dei underjordiske tala og lo","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1246","id":"SIN1246","collection":"NO","title":"Brudlaupet på Vigdalsstølen.","text":"Brudlaupet på Vigdalsstølen.\nDet var eingong ei gjenta på Vigdalsstølen som vart vekke. Det var ein huldrefriar som hadde lokka henne inn i haugen til seg. Huldrekaren vilde plent at dei skulde gifta seg so snøgt som råd var, og dag og time vart fastsett då dei skulde verta vigde. Gjenta likte slett ikkje dette. Ho tigga og bad um ho ikkje kunde nett få snerta heim og snakka med faren sin, og det fekk ho endeleg mot å lova at ho skulde koma att innan ei viss tid. Ho fortalde faren alt, og so vart det avtala soleis at han skulde koma med børsa si og skjota over selet nett i den stundi ho var ferdigpynta til brur. Faren rende til å skaut, og då vart det ei fæl røra inne i selet. Alle huldrefolki rømde ut, og då faren kom inn i selet sat gjenta pynta med sylvkruna og gullarmband og mykje anna sylvstas. Då ropte det inn gjenom seldøri og bad so vent um å få att gullarmbandet, um ikkje anna. Men faren sa beint nei, og bad dei dra sin veg. Men då ropte det innatt eingong til: \"Sidan du er so ubeinig, so skal det verta eit tøle i kvart bøle til niande led.\"\nOg soleis har det vore. [------] Kruna er på Bringe i Luster. Dei braut av eit spir på henne eingong, ho har tvo gonger vore send til Bergen til vølings, men ingen der kunde greida å vøla henne.","source":"NFS Sjur Bøyum 5, s. 7","category":"ml6005","place":"Jostedal","events":[{"id":"NO-186-E01","start":811,"end":842,"span":"Då ropte det inn gjenom seldøri","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Unspecified caller; identity not necessarily uncertain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-186-E02","start":952,"end":983,"span":"då ropte det innatt eingong til","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"selet","environment":"pasture hut","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.68,"lon":7.28,"label":"Jostedal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN126","id":"SIN126","collection":"NO","title":"SIN126","text":"Før vel hundre år sea var de e kjerring i Skogbygda som\nåtte svartboka. Denne kjerringa maktstal både følk å krøtter.\nHo hadde sålt sjela si tel puken før svartboka å en grøn verkens-\nkjole. En dag ho skulle tel kremmer'n, ba ho jinta å kjinne\nsmør. \"Men ta itte mer enn tri skjeer fløte i kinna.\" Dette\nsyntes jinta vart mer enn lite, å ho hadde i sju skjeer. Men da\nfekk ho kinna full, så ho måtte øse tur i eninga. Da kjerringa\nkåm att å fekk sjå all rømmen som valt utåver gølve, så skrek\nho tel jinta: \"Men je spør høssen du fær åt je? Hå mange\nskjeer hadde du i kinna?\" \"Sju,\" svara jinta. Da riste kjerringa\npå hue å sa: \"Hau, hau jinte, du har tii rømme tur sju prest-\ngjeld i stelle før tri.\"","source":"NFL 57, s. 62","category":"ml3040","place":"Elverum","events":[{"id":"NO-187-E01","start":441,"end":482,"span":"fekk sjå all rømmen som valt utåver gølve","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gølve","environment":"domestic interior","time":"En dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.88,"lon":11.57,"label":"Elverum","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1261","id":"SIN1261","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1261","text":"De va' ein prest som reste ti kjørkja aa skulle messe, aa saa rei 'n forbi ein houg aa der hørd' 'n di tulla aa va' saa glae:\n\"Aa vi haabe, vi haabe vi salighed faa\nnaar vi her ifra verden skal gaa\",\nsa di. \"Ikkje meir bli de salige\", sa pr. \"hell der kjem grøne louv paa denni kjeppen\", sa 'n, aa skar seg ein kjepp aa størde i haugen. Men da blei de slig ønk og jammer at. Saa reste han ti kjørkja da. Men da 'n komm tibars, saa bar kjeppen 3 grøne louv, men jammeren aa graaten va' den sama. \"Jou, de fær, jou de fær!\" sa pr., aa saa blei der glæe att i hougjen.","source":"NFS Rikard Berge 76, s. 36","category":"ml5050","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-188-E01","start":87,"end":124,"span":"der hørd' 'n di tulla aa va' saa glae","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-188-E02","start":341,"end":370,"span":"da blei de slig ønk og jammer","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-188-E03","start":461,"end":494,"span":"jammeren aa graaten va' den sama.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Return encounter.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ein houg","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":"rei 'n forbi ein houg"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1263","id":"SIN1263","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1263","text":"De va' ei brur som vill' vera saa stor. Ho tok ein femdalersetel aa snørd' ikring kjelehonka, fer 'o va' fer heit. Dettan va' gjestebaasdagen henars's. Saa skull' di ti kjørkje da, aa brura satt saa lavan's av søll aa stas, d'æ va' fælt. Saa sa 'o de da: \"Me kann naa vel ikkje bli fattige, som ser saasaa ut,\" sa 'o. \"Ikkje meir bli me fattige,\" sa bruggaammen \"meir hell eg fær att den ringen,\" sa 'n, tok 'n av fingen sin aa slept 'n at vatne. Men aare etterpaa va 'n ut-paa aa fiska, aa da fekk 'n att ringen i ein fisk. Men di skull' bli saa blaafattige at de va' fælt.","source":"NFS Rikard Berge 76, s. 55f","category":"ml7050","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-189-E01","start":68,"end":114,"span":"snørd' ikring kjelehonka, fer 'o va' fer heit.","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Hot handle motivates protective action; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1267","id":"SIN1267","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1267","text":"De var tenestgutane til presten Lind som høyrde de ropa 3 vendur i Bjorhøl: \"Tii æ kommen aa ikkje ma'n\". Fortalde de med presten, som sa, at der snart vilde koma ein mann ovantil Lofthus eller Gvaale og at dei skulde hefte paa 'n og faa 'n inn til honom. M. kom, og dei so gjorde. Nei, han hadde slett ikkje stundine, men han skulde burt til Egderud eit lite erend og skulde koma att snart og inn-um daa. Nei, han skulde inn med same, og dei heldst lengi, men endeleg maatte m. inn. Vart sjuk samstundes, presten fær hente vatn fraa Bjorhøl, som han tvær panna hans med, han døyr med same.","source":"NFS Rikard Berge 94, s. 24f","category":"ml4050","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-190-E01","start":41,"end":105,"span":"høyrde de ropa 3 vendur i Bjorhøl: \"Tii æ kommen aa ikkje ma'n\".","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-190-E02","start":551,"end":570,"span":"tvær panna hans med","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Later individual contact with water; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Bjorhøl","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN129","id":"SIN129","collection":"NO","title":"Tok dygda frå ei ku og sette på ei anna","text":"Tok dygda frå ei ku og sette på ei anna.\nForeldra til bestemor forpakta sjefsgarden Berg i Sokne-\ndal i ungdomen. Bestemor var berre småjenta den gongen,\nmen ho kom vel i hug at det var ein mann på Gynnild som\nhadde sagt i eit jullag at det var inga sak å ta dygda frå ei\nku og gje ho til ei anna. Denne kroppen kunne meir enn\nandre. Det var i 1840-åra han sa dette.\nDette å ta dygda frå andre kyr er mykje omtala i dalføret.\nDet er fortald om Lisbet Nypan. Ho bad tenestjenta ta eit\nskeiblad røme da ho skulle kinna smør til helga. Lisbet sjøl\ngjekk ut ein tur og da ho kom innatt møtte ho rømefloa i\ndøra.\n- Tok du all rømen du da, eg sa du skulle ta berre ei skei,\nog du tok rømen frå sju prestegjeld.","source":"NFL 87, s.93f","category":"ml3040","place":"Gauldalen","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.96809,"lon":10.96748,"label":"Gauldalen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1295","id":"SIN1295","collection":"NO","title":"Deka Tore","text":"Deka Tore.\nDe var ein fjøllmann i Hol, som hadde gløymt dagatale til jol, og so tok han paa seg sine trugar og vilde vasse heim i bygdi og høyre. Daa han kom heimpaa broti, ropa de til Labelaist, so het mannen:\n\"Labelaist, vend ti bake.\nD'æ dagadn ai\naa netadn tvai, ti jule\",\nsa de uppi eit hovda. Og daa snudde mannen att.","source":"NFS Rikard Berge 112, s. 56","category":"ml6030","place":"Ål","events":[{"id":"NO-192-E01","start":173,"end":194,"span":"ropa de til Labelaist","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uppi eit hovda","environment":"hill","time":"til jol","movement":"vilde vasse heim i bygdi"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.63,"lon":8.57,"label":"Ål","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN132","id":"SIN132","collection":"NO","title":"Trollkjerringane utpå Øyom","text":"Trollkjerringane utpå Øyom\nDet var tre trollkjerringar utpå Øyom her ein gong i tida. Somme sei dei var\nsystrer. Ho Guri i Vågja budde på Otrøya, ho Brynill Harnes på Harøya, og ho\nRagnhill i Ortn budde i Orta. Dei besøkte kvarandre ofte, desse tre kjellene, og\ndei hjelptest åt med trollkunstom sine, når det trengdest. Dei såg ofte\nOtrøykjerringa kom siglandes utgjenom Harøyfjorden i måneskinet. Og ho Ragnhill\ni Ortn siglde ein gong frå Harøya og inn i Orta på ein dryfting.\n- Ei julnatt hadde dei sett kvarandre stemne på Hekkelfjell, dessa tre.\nMen so var det tenestguten hennar Brynill Harnes - han hadde tent 'na i sju år,\nog hadde fått greide på kvaslags makkmor han hadde. So lurte han på ho julaftan,\nog såg korleis ho tok ein sopling og smurde, og høyrde kva ho sa, før enn det\nbarst oppgjenom skorsteinen med ho. Når ho var fara då, so fann han fram att\noljekrukka og tok og smurde ein sopling, han au, og sa det same som ho. Og so\nbarst det avste oppgjenom skorsteinen med han au. Og han kom til Hekkelberg og\nforstyrra heile høgtida for dei.","source":"NFL 30, s. 45f","category":"ml3045","place":"Romsdal","events":[{"id":"NO-193-E01","start":321,"end":398,"span":"Dei såg ofte\nOtrøykjerringa kom siglandes utgjenom Harøyfjorden i måneskinet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic group observation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-193-E02","start":715,"end":776,"span":"såg korleis ho tok ein sopling og smurde, og høyrde kva ho sa","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Julaftan; individual servant.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-193-E03","start":942,"end":994,"span":"so\nbarst det avste oppgjenom skorsteinen med han au.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Involuntary bodily displacement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.5,"lon":7.8,"label":"Romsdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1320","id":"SIN1320","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1320","text":"De var einn såm sto på austre sien åt Stransjøn, å rofte åver teill Sjinnarbakken, å ville åver. Teillsluitt så vartt 'n så sinnt så 'n ba de faen skuille føre sæ åver. Å bæsst de var, så kåm 'n åver etter håri.","source":"NFS Amund B. Larsen jr. 7, s. 109","category":"ml3025","place":"Hof","events":[{"id":"NO-194-E01","start":188,"end":211,"span":"kåm 'n åver etter håri.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Carried by hair; dialect interpretation, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Stransjøn","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.52,"lon":10.17,"label":"Hof","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1331","id":"SIN1331","collection":"NO","title":"Et gammelt sagn","text":"Et gammelt sagn.\nFor mange hundrede aar siden boede der paa en stor herregaard en kone, som havde en gammel lægdekjærring hos sig. Herregaardskonen hed Marte; hun var meget grisk og gjerrig.\nDa den gamle lægdekjærring var død, saa havde hun ikke raad til at kjøbe ligklæder til hende, men hun svøbte liget ind i et gammelt hestedækken og lagde det i kisten.\nNogen tid efter var der ottesang i kirken, did vilde herregaardskonen gaa. Hun stod tidlig op og begav sig paa vei. Da hun kom nær kirken, saa hun at den var oplyst; hun traadte ind og saa allerede kirken overfyldt. Præsten stod paa prædikestolen. Hun satte sig og begyndte at stirre paa dem; hun syntes de saa blege og underlige ud; hun saa mod døren, der fik hun se lægdekonen isvøbt hesteklædet.\nDa blev hun angst og gik mod døren, men da hun kom bent for lægdekjærringen, greb denne efter hende, tog tag i kaaben og rev den af hende. Konen ilede hjem saa hurtigt hun kunde; men derefter blev hun liggende syg. Kaaben gjenfandtes ved kirkedøren i mange stykker.","source":"NFS Kl. III, s. 17","category":"ml4015","place":"Hedmark","events":[{"id":"NO-195-E01","start":497,"end":522,"span":"saa hun at den var oplyst","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-195-E02","start":543,"end":573,"span":"saa allerede kirken overfyldt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-195-E03","start":651,"end":690,"span":"hun syntes de saa blege og underlige ud","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unusual appearance","evidence":"blege og underlige","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Odd appearance alone does not establish uncertainty; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-195-E04","start":711,"end":756,"span":"der fik hun se lægdekonen isvøbt hesteklædet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-195-E05","start":858,"end":895,"span":"tog tag i kaaben og rev den af hende.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact with clothing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kirken","environment":"church","time":"tidlig","movement":"begav sig paa vei"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.0,"lon":11.5,"label":"Hedmark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1334","id":"SIN1334","collection":"NO","title":"Ungen som gret ved Grindesteine","text":"Ungen som gret ved Grindesteine.\nVed Grindesteine, som var på merket mellom Skogstad-Øydgarde og Brekke-eigne, skulde det i gamle dagar ofte ha gråte ein unge. Det var fleire som hadde høyrt han. So var det ein som høyrde nokre tala um dette. Då sa han:\n\"Denne ungin græte førdi han inkji æ kristna. Men hadde e høyrt han, e, so skulle e ha døyft 'n.\"\nEi tid etter laga det seg so at denne same mannen gjekk um Grindestein'n. Då fekk han høyre same gråten som dei hine hadde lagt mark på. Då døypte han ungen på G og sa: \"E døype de, G, i namne åt Faren, Sonen og Den Helligånd!\"\nDå han hadde sega dette, høyrde han det ropte greitt og tydeleg:\n\"Guds løn! Guds løn!\"\nHan kunde ikkje seia fulle namnet, for han kunde ikkje vita anten ungen var gut eller gjente. Sidan den dagen var det ingen som høyrde ungegråt ved Grindesteine meir.","source":"NFL 86, s. 35","category":"ml4025","place":"Vang","events":[{"id":"NO-196-E01","start":160,"end":195,"span":"Det var fleire som hadde høyrt han.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier generic group hearing child cry.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-196-E02","start":426,"end":488,"span":"Då fekk han høyre same gråten som dei hine hadde lagt mark på.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"identity indeterminacy","evidence":"han kunde ikkje vita anten ungen var gut eller gjente","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-196-E03","start":605,"end":643,"span":"høyrde han det ropte greitt og tydeleg","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Clarity explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-196-E04","start":785,"end":833,"span":"ingen som høyrde ungegråt ved Grindesteine meir.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic subsequent absence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ved Grindesteine","environment":"boundary","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.13,"lon":8.55,"label":"Vang","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN135","id":"SIN135","collection":"NO","title":"Ei trollkjerring","text":"Ei trollkjerring.\nHo Berit ved Åne - som me kan kalle henne - nedi\nVang skulde vera trollkjerring. Ho fekk alltid so ulagleg\nmykje smør. Ein dag tok han Lars Stele og måla biletet\nhennar på ei fjøl. So skaut han på det og råkte biletet i\nkjaken. Og jamen fekk ikkje ho Berit ein stor kul på\nkjaken med det same. Det sette seg til med verk, og det\nvart eit stort, rundt ær etter det.\nLars Stele fekk nok merkt ho for den ho var!","source":"NFL 70, s. 182","category":"ml3055","place":"Vang","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.13,"lon":8.55,"label":"Vang","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1351","id":"SIN1351","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1351","text":"Hr. Johan Irgens, prest i Surendalen (1700-1720) kom ei natt kjøyrande fraa Rindalskyrkja. Klokkaren sat uppi. Daa dei kom ned paa Rinbekbrui høyrde dei ei underleg læte under brutilet. Dei stansa. Lydde. Det høyrdest som eggjande felelaat og kaat dans. \"Hør, hvor de fordømte aander fryder sig!\" sa presten harm i hugen. Men daa tok det til aa graata so saart under brui. Hr. Johan mjukna i mælet. \"Er i ikke fordømte endnu, saa skal jeg ikke gjøre det\", sa han. Daa tagna graaten, og det tok so smaatt til aa klunka paa fela att.","source":"NFS Kl. XIII, s. 10","category":"ml5050","place":"Rindal","events":[{"id":"NO-198-E01","start":142,"end":185,"span":"høyrde dei ei underleg læte under brutilet.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate sound","evidence":"ei underleg læte","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-198-E02","start":205,"end":253,"span":"Det høyrdest som eggjande felelaat og kaat dans.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"sound analogy","evidence":"høyrdest som","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Tentative sound identification; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-198-E03","start":330,"end":372,"span":"tok det til aa graata so saart under brui.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-198-E04","start":468,"end":531,"span":"tagna graaten, og det tok so smaatt til aa klunka paa fela att.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Rinbekbrui","environment":"bridge","time":"ei natt","movement":"kjøyrande fraa Rindalskyrkja"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.05554,"lon":9.21156,"label":"Rindal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1354","id":"SIN1354","collection":"NO","title":"Dauengan på Røst","text":"Dauengan på Røst.\nDet var berre kjerka og kjerkegårn som låg på øya Glea på nordvestsia på Røst før i tia. Kjerkegårn låg på ei sandmo attmed sjøen, for der var ikkje djup nok jord andre stader.\nEin dag utpå hausten kom det ein stor sildstim inn i vågen tett attmed kjerka. Men det var kveld, og folk samsnakka om at dei skulle ikkje fare og fiske sild før dagen etter. Det va nokså nifst der i mørkra. Men kallen og kjerringa på Hammaren ville no likevel lure seg avstad og hente seg ein god fangst. Dei tok to stakkar som dei batt for den eine enden på, og håva opp til dei var fulle. Så tok dei heimvegen langs fjæra neafor kjerkegårn. Då hørte dei fæle ul frå havet og såg ein flokk draugar som kom etter dei. Då sprang dei inn på kjerkegårn og ropa: \"Opp alle kristne til kamp imot draugen\". Dauengan kom opp av gravene sine med bordendar i hendene. Kallen og kjerringa hadde nok med å kome seg unna, og sildposane måtte dei hive frå seg.\nMen dauengan hoppa over kjerkegårdsgjerdet og draugane kom opp frå havet, og det vart ein fæl strid der nedpå bakken. Det var dauengan som vann, og draugan vart kasta på havet.\nDå det vart lyst, kom folk og skulle fiske sild, men der fekk dei sjå eit uhyggeleg syn. Der låg likkistefjøler og tareleggar spreidd vidt utover heilt ned til flomålet. Men silda var bortkomen og var borte det året.","source":"NFL 93, s. 48","category":"ml4065","place":"Lofoten","events":[{"id":"NO-199-E01","start":639,"end":713,"span":"Då hørte dei fæle ul frå havet og såg ein flokk draugar som kom etter dei.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-199-E02","start":1174,"end":1290,"span":"der fekk dei sjå eit uhyggeleg syn. Der låg likkistefjøler og tareleggar spreidd vidt utover heilt ned til flomålet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Different group next daylight.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"langs fjæra neafor kjerkegårn","environment":"shoreline","time":"utpå hausten","movement":"tok dei heimvegen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":68.04534,"lon":13.38235,"label":"Lofoten","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1356","id":"SIN1356","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1356","text":"I Vinje Præstegjæld boede en Mand paa Gaarden Vaa. Hans Navn var Dyre. En Julekveld havde han været over paa den anden Side af et Vand, som kaldes Raulustrand. Da saa han, at der sad en død Kjærring ved Stranden, og det forekom ham, at hun raabte bestandigt: Sæt mig over! Dyre syntes at det var Synd andet end at tage den døde Kjærring med, og han styrede da hen til hende; men da han kom tæt hen til det Sted, hvor han troede, at hun sad, da var hun borte. Han roede ud igjen, men da raabte det atter, og Dyre styrede anden Gang hen til Stedet; men det var lige saa forgjæves som den første Gang. Han roede atter ud; men Raabet vedblev at gjentage sig. Da raabte Dyre ude paa Dypet: Kom da, hvem det saa er! – Det varede nu ikke længe, inden Dyre fik at vide, at han havde Selskab hos sig, hvorvel han ingen kunde se, thi Baaden var nærved at synke. Han kunde da skjønne, at det var en Jøtul, som han havde ombord, og han spurgte ham da ad, hvor han vilde sættes i Land. Jøtulen betegnede Stedet, og nu spurgte han paa sin Side, hvormeget han havde at betale for Overfarten. Dyre sagde, at det kom de nok overens om, naar de først vare paa Landjorden. \"Jeg vil skjære Tommen af min Vante, og det skal være din Løn\", sagde Jøtulen. Da de nu vare komne i Land, saa skjær Jøtulen ogsaa Tommen af sin Vante, og forærede den til Dyre. \"Det er godt\", sagde Dyre, skjøndt han vel ikke mente, at den Tomme kunde være synderligt værd. De skiltes nu ad; men om Morgenen, da Dyre vaagnede, og begyndte at Betragte Tommen nøjere, da fandt han, at den var af purt Guld, og at den kunde rumme en Skjæppe Korn. \"Det er fuldkommen god Hyre\", sagde Dyre.","source":"NFS Moltke Moe 68, 6, s. 5f","category":"ml5020","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-200-E01","start":160,"end":272,"span":"Da saa han, at der sad en død Kjærring ved Stranden, og det forekom ham, at hun raabte bestandigt: Sæt mig over!","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"qualified auditory perception","evidence":"det forekom ham","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-200-E02","start":379,"end":458,"span":"da han kom tæt hen til det Sted, hvor han troede, at hun sad, da var hun borte.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance on approach","evidence":"hvor han troede, at hun sad, da var hun borte","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-200-E03","start":483,"end":502,"span":"da raabte det atter","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-200-E04","start":551,"end":598,"span":"det var lige saa forgjæves som den første Gang.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroboration","evidence":"lige saa forgjæves som den første Gang","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Anaphoric repeat of visual absence; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-200-E05","start":623,"end":654,"span":"Raabet vedblev at gjentage sig.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified source","evidence":"hvem det saa er","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-200-E06","start":765,"end":851,"span":"han havde Selskab hos sig, hvorvel han ingen kunde se, thi Baaden var nærved at synke.","modalities":["visual","pressure","felt presence/intuition"],"groups":["vision","body","other"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen presence","evidence":"hvorvel han ingen kunde se","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Presence inferred by character from load, not analyst.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-200-E07","start":1484,"end":1557,"span":"begyndte at Betragte Tommen nøjere, da fandt han, at den var af purt Guld","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised object assessment","evidence":"da fandt han, at den var af purt Guld","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Next morning; place unstated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Raulustrand","environment":"waterside","time":"En Julekveld","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","other","vision"],"translation":"In Vinje parish lived a man on the farm Vaa. His name was Dyre. One Christmas Eve he had been over on the other side of a lake called Raulustrand. Then he saw that there sat an old dead woman by the shore, and it seemed to him that she cried constantly: 'Take me across!' Dyre thought it was only right to take the dead woman along, and he steered toward her; but when he came close to the place where he believed she sat, she was gone. He rowed out again, but then it cried out once more, and Dyre steered a second time to the place; but it was just as futile as the first time.\n\nHe rowed out again; but the cry continued to repeat itself. Then Dyre shouted out on the deep water: 'Come then, whoever it is!' – It did not take long now before Dyre learned that he had company with him, although he could see no one, for the boat was near sinking. He could then understand that it was a giant [jøtul] that he had on board, and he asked him then where he wanted to be put ashore. The giant designated the place, and now he asked on his part how much he had to pay for the crossing. Dyre said that they would surely agree on that once they were on dry land. 'I will cut the thumb off my mitten, and that shall be your reward,' said the giant.\n\nWhen they had now come ashore, the giant also cut the thumb off his mitten, and presented it to Dyre. 'That is good,' said Dyre, although he did not really think that the thumb could be worth much. They now parted ways; but in the morning when Dyre woke up and began to examine the thumb more closely, he found that it was of pure gold and that it could hold a skjæppe of grain. 'That is perfectly good pay,' said Dyre.","translationNotes":["Written in Danish-influenced Dano-Norwegian historical orthography (Vinje parish).","\"Jøtul\" is a giant.","'Skjæppe' is a historical measure of capacity, retained without assigning an unsupported conversion to an English unit."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"NO-200-E01","start":147,"end":271,"span":"Then he saw that there sat an old dead woman by the shore, and it seemed to him that she cried constantly: 'Take me across!'","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"qualified auditory perception","evidence":"det forekom ham","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Da saa han, at der sad en død Kjærring ved Stranden, og det forekom ham, at hun raabte bestandigt: Sæt mig over!","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-200-E02","start":364,"end":436,"span":"when he came close to the place where he believed she sat, she was gone.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance on approach","evidence":"hvor han troede, at hun sad, da var hun borte","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"da han kom tæt hen til det Sted, hvor han troede, at hun sad, da var hun borte.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-200-E03","start":461,"end":488,"span":"then it cried out once more","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"da raabte det atter","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-200-E04","start":539,"end":579,"span":"it was just as futile as the first time.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroboration","evidence":"lige saa forgjæves som den første Gang","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Anaphoric repeat of visual absence; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"det var lige saa forgjæves som den første Gang.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-200-E05","start":605,"end":640,"span":"the cry continued to repeat itself.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified source","evidence":"hvem det saa er","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Raabet vedblev at gjentage sig.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-200-E06","start":762,"end":847,"span":"he had company with him, although he could see no one, for the boat was near sinking.","modalities":["visual","pressure","felt presence/intuition"],"groups":["vision","body","other"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen presence","evidence":"hvorvel han ingen kunde se","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Presence inferred by character from load, not analyst.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"han havde Selskab hos sig, hvorvel han ingen kunde se, thi Baaden var nærved at synke.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-200-E07","start":1503,"end":1577,"span":"began to examine the thumb more closely, he found that it was of pure gold","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised object assessment","evidence":"da fandt han, at den var af purt Guld","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Next morning; place unstated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"begyndte at Betragte Tommen nøjere, da fandt han, at den var af purt Guld","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1357","id":"SIN1357","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1357","text":"Paa Risdal i Mykland er der et hus Mannen hadde fra gammel tid to gaarder\nHan hadde slaatt av heime, og so skulde han slaa paa Risdal. Daa han kom fram, so sadd der ei kone paa vollen og reiva barnet sitt og daa ho saa han kom, blei ho so forskrekka, at ho to barnet i bloga og løb av sted, og lista blei liggendes igjen.\nDei to upp lista med ein kjepp – dei hadde hørt at ein maatte ikkje ta i sligt som hulla og underjordiske hadde med hendene – og so hang dei ho ud i veggelaftet, stakk kjeppen inn i veggen.\nSo um ei stund var lista burte, og der hang ei sylvkanne i stedet.\nDen kanna har gaatt fra led til led der Husene er umbygt, kanna var der enno daa eg var der uppe.","source":"NFS Johan Agerholt 1, s. 6","category":"ml6020","place":"Mykland","events":[{"id":"NO-201-E01","start":208,"end":249,"span":"daa ho saa han kom, blei ho so forskrekka","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Woman is experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"vollen","environment":"field","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.63195,"lon":8.28795,"label":"Mykland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN136","id":"SIN136","collection":"NO","title":"SIN136","text":"Det er ikke paa alle Steder Ormen trives eller faar Lov at\nvære, der kan være fuldt af dem paa een Gaard, men paa Nabo-\ngaarden slet ingen. Det kommer deraf at man i gamle Dage\nhar manet dem bort. Saaledes findes der hverken Orme, Fjor-\nføtslur eller Padder paa øvre Aamot i Omersdal uagtet der\nellers er nok af dem andresteds i Bygden. De bleve engang\n\"runede\" bort derfra. \"Runarkallen\" stod paa Gaarden Øen\nog runede og runede saa at man saag Ormene komme farende\nog flyktende i store Hobe. Fra den Tid tør aldrig Ormen\nkomme der mere.","source":"NFL 15, s. 82","category":"ml3060","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-202-E01","start":437,"end":493,"span":"man saag Ormene komme farende\nog flyktende i store Hobe.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Gaarden Øen","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1367","id":"SIN1367","collection":"NO","title":"Underjordiske ved Flaaberget","text":"Underjordiske ved Flaaberget.\nTo Nabojenter jagede i Forening Kreaturene til Skogen paa Havn. Veien gik over et Flaaberg, og da de passerede over dette hørte de at der kjernedes Smør – det surrede i Kjærnen. Da raapte de: \"Kjindklening!\" men fortsatte Sankingen til de hadde faaet Kreaturene langt nok, hvorpaa de vendte Hjem. Kommen til det samme Sted hvor de raapte efter \"Kjindklening\" saa stod der to Øser med Kjærnmelk og et digert Smørebrød til hvær ved siden av. Den ene av Jenterne tok Smørebrødet og spiste med god Apetit og drak av Kjernmelken til. Den anden Jente derimot rørte ikke sin Portion, men stod og spyttede og tviede til den anden fordi hun hadde Natur til at nyte dette. Senere blev disse Jenter gift med hvær sin Gaardmandsgut og fik eget Husstell. For den som spiste av Underjordsfolkets Smørebrød og drak Kjernmelken til florerede alt saa ypperligt. Hun hadde Lykke med Kreaturene og forøvrigt alt hvad hun tok sig til, hvorimot den der forsmaaede Trakteringen bare hadde Uhepper og Vanheld med alt og maatte leve i den største Armod.","source":"NFS J. M. Ingebrigtsen 2, s. 25f","category":"ml5080","place":"Hattfjelldal","events":[{"id":"NO-203-E01","start":152,"end":207,"span":"hørte de at der kjernedes Smør – det surrede i Kjærnen.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"et Flaaberg","environment":"rock","time":"","movement":"da de passerede over dette"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.6,"lon":14.0,"label":"Hattfjelldal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1368","id":"SIN1368","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1368","text":"Det var eingong ein mann som var gift med eit huldrekvinnfolk. Han dengde henne ofte, og for kvar gong sette ho ein strek i låvadøri. Han hadde gøymt huldrehatten hennar i kista si, men meiner du ikkje ungane hadde funne lykelen ein dag og set hatten! Dei gjekk til mori og fortalde dette. Då reiste ho nedi smia til mannen, tok ein kald hestasko, rette han ut med nevane og sa: \"Tvi vøre deg, kå va du for meg erso eg vilde\". So tok ho han med åt låvadøri og viste han kor mange vendor han hadde jult henne, tok so på seg huldrehatten, og synte seg aldri meir.","source":"NFS Sjur Bøyum 4,B, s. 5","category":"ml5090","place":"Veitestrand","events":[{"id":"NO-204-E01","start":63,"end":84,"span":"Han dengde henne ofte","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated beating; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-204-E02","start":202,"end":251,"span":"ungane hadde funne lykelen ein dag og set hatten!","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group children.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-204-E03","start":325,"end":371,"span":"tok ein kald hestasko, rette han ut med nevane","modalities":["touch","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Explicit contact/temperature, no felt reaction; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-204-E04","start":460,"end":507,"span":"viste han kor mange vendor han hadde jult henne","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Showing marks; reception contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.48,"lon":7.13,"label":"Veitestrand","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1369","id":"SIN1369","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1369","text":"Det var eingong ei huldregjente som var so traa etter ein kar, aa helt seg etter honom baade titt og ofte. Men karen brydde seg ikkje noko om paahænge hennar, aa let henne forstaa at han brydde seg ikkje søfta om henne. Men likekjukt kom ho til honom aa vilde hava honom, so ho var ikkje vevøræ den tytta.\nSo ein dag staar denne karen i smidja aa vøler paa noko reidskap. Best han staar slik aa bankar aa smedar, står huldregjenta i smiedøra aa gjer seg smeikjen for honom.\nMen no vart han eitrande galen for dette paahenge av henne, tek so aa stik kalspaden i den logande eldmørja, faar ein retteleg glodunge paa spaden aa kastar den rett i glaninga paa gjenta.\nNo vart det ein annan laat i bjølla. Huldretausa vart styggeleg brend i annlete aa svei gjorde det so ho set i aa gaula rett oppøve seg.\nNo var ho ikkje blid lenger. \"Slik som annlete mit vart øydelagt av deg, slik skal og dine born verta i sine annlet\", skrik ho.\nSlik vart det og. Borna til denne mannen vart stygge aa fulle av saar aa skurve i hovude.\nSlik hemna huldregjenta seg paa mannen fordi han for so stygt med henne.","source":"NFS Mathias Ryssdal 3, s. 196f","category":"ml5095","place":"Gloppen","events":[{"id":"NO-205-E01","start":700,"end":799,"span":"Huldretausa vart styggeleg brend i annlete aa svei gjorde det so ho set i aa gaula rett oppøve seg.","modalities":["temperature","pain","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"smidja","environment":"smithy","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.75,"lon":6.15,"label":"Gloppen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1413","id":"SIN1413","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1413","text":"I Øyange skulde det i gamal tid ha vore so ubøtteleg mykje fisk. Men so ringa dei inn heile Øyangen med net og fiska so svært. Med dei dreiv med dette, høyrde dei det skreik burt i eit berg:\n\"Gje le,\nsko me fiske både me o de!\"\nMen dette ropet brydde ikkje fiskarane seg noko um, og sidan vart det radt fiskelaust i Øyange.","source":"NFL 65, s. 93","category":"ml6065","place":"Vang","events":[{"id":"NO-206-E01","start":152,"end":189,"span":"høyrde dei det skreik burt i eit berg","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Øyange","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.13,"lon":8.55,"label":"Vang","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN142","id":"SIN142","collection":"NO","title":"Ormen i Sess-marka","text":"Ormen i Sess-marka\nPå Setre i Tresfjorden gjorde dei åt for ormen ein gong\nlenge sidan. Det var ein finn som for rundt i bygdom og\nvikte vekk orm, der dei vilde ha'n te di. Men han var drjug\nå ta seg betalt for umaken. Dei høyrde etter 'nå på Daug-\nstad først, men dei syntest'n var for dyr. Men på Setre vil-\nde dei ha'n. Han skulde ha ei halvtunne smør for di. Men\nso skulde dei kavere for at det ikkje fanst lindorm der.\nOg det gjorde dei.\nSo fekk han dei te hogge ihop ved, og gjorde opp bål,\nder som saga stend no. Og so gjekk han oppå Høghjellen\nog drog ei ripe med staven sin ned på bålet. Og etter den\nripa kom all ormen rennandes på bålet.\nBest det var brast det laust oppi Høghjellen eit tur.\nOg då var det lindormen som kom setjandes og vilde ta\nfinnen. Men han hiva seg over bålet på staven sin, og lind-\normen etter. Slik for dei sju gonger over bålet. Men då\ngjekk lindormen for det. Og sidan skal det ikkje ha fun-\nnest orm millom Sesselva og Frikfonnelva. Hegren kan be-\nre hit ungar somme tider, men dei blir kortliva.","source":"NFL 30, s. 128f","category":"ml3060","place":"Tresfjord","events":[{"id":"NO-207-E01","start":662,"end":702,"span":"brast det laust oppi Høghjellen eit tur.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Dialect burst/rumble; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Høghjellen","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.52492,"lon":7.12579,"label":"Tresfjord","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1429","id":"SIN1429","collection":"NO","title":"Gro på Torgen","text":"Gro på Torgen.\nEingong i tiden budde det ei høgætta kvinna på Torgen, og ho heitte Gro. Ho var både rik og storfengjen. Det fortelst at eingong stod ho og såg på at skipan hennes segla sørover, for ho åtte mange skip. Då vart ho så ovmodig at ho kasta guldringen sin på hav, og sa at likså lite som ho fekk att den ringen, likså lite kom ho til å bli fattig. Men ei tid ette var det ein fiskar som fann att ringen hennar i ei fiskemage, så ho fekk den attende. På same tide forliste og skipan hennes i ein storstorm, så ho vart fattig. Det fortelst at i den tid var det kyrkja på Tilrem. Gro tykte det var for smått å koma roande til kyrkja. Og då Torgen er ei øy, så sette ho hestar over til fastlandet og køyrde til Tilrem kyrkja. Det var på ei slik kyrkjeferd at ho døydde og. Ho køyrde seg ned på isen på Tilremsvatne og drukna.","source":"NFS Knut Strompdal 7, s. 181f","category":"ml7050","place":"Brønnøy","events":[{"id":"NO-208-E01","start":144,"end":192,"span":"stod ho og såg på at skipan hennes segla sørover","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Torgen","environment":"island","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.47,"lon":12.21,"label":"Brønnøy","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1444","id":"SIN1444","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1444","text":"Svartedau'en for fælt at bygdanne her som andre sta. Her sill kji vere bare snau'e treeparten fokk att'e. De va tålde garar som slapp. I Moland sill de kji vere kot Brokke som plent slapp å som ingen døe. I heile Birtedalen va kji att eit menneskji.\n------\nSo for her eit kvendi mæ rau'e stakk'e å riv' å lime. Der ho raka slapp some, men der ho sopa døe adde.\nDer va engo rå for sjukdomen. Dei døe mest i de at dei naus. Sto dei yvi å njose tri vendur va dei hjelpte, men blei alli helseføre att'e mei. Dei gamle hev so ven ein skjikk'e ette den ti, dei seie: \"Hjelpe Gud!\", fyst dei nys'e.","source":"NFS Moltke Moe 54, s. 37f","category":"ml7080","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-209-E01","start":391,"end":421,"span":"Dei døe mest i de at dei naus.","modalities":["bodily sensation","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Generic sneezing symptom; sound implicit in reflex, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1462","id":"SIN1462","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1462","text":"Egeland i Hægelands Sogn skal efter Sagnet være den ældste Gaard i Sognet. Den første Mand, som boede paa den, eiede en Mængde Kreaturer; men han fik Ulykke paa det, saa han blev tilsidst Eier af kun 2 Kjør og 5 Sauer. Størstedelen fandt han \"daudt\" i Fjøset om Morgenen, naar han eller hans Folk kom inn for at \"stylle\" det. Eller ogsaa blev det stjaalet om Natten, uden at han kunde faa vide, hvem der havde gjort det. Tidlig en Morgen gik Manden selv ud i Fjøset for at undersøge, om han havde tabt noget af sine Kreaturer den Nat. Strax han var kommen indenfor døren, blev han var, at der var opgravet en Del Grus (I gamle Dage brugtes ikke ordentlig Fjøsgulv) i det ene Hjørnet af Fjøset. For at faa undersøgt, hvorledes dette havde sig, gik han hen og grov i Gruset, og strax kom han ned til en Lem, som han lukkede op. Nu saa han lige ned i et Værelse, som var lige under Fjøset, og i dette boede nogle Underjordiske. Han spurgte dem da, om det var dem, som forvoldte hans Ulykke paa Kvæget. De svarede: \"Ja; dersom du vidste, hvor stor Plage vi have af dit Kreatur, vilde du ikke undres over, at vi, som have Magt dertil, sender dig Ulykke paa Kvæget; thi hele det Gjødselvand, der kommer fra dit Fjøs, rinder lige ned paa vore Borde og Senge, og derfor maa enten vi flytte, eller maa du flytte Fjøset.\" \"Gu bære mæ,\" sagde Manden, \"jeg har ikke Raad til at flytte mit Fjøs; thi jeg er i smaa Omstændigheder, og derfor maa jeg bede Eder om at flytte.\" – Da svarede En af dem med brølende Stemme: \"Du kan nok slippe at flytte; men saa skal du aldri nyde noget Godt af dit Kreatur mere.\" Da Manden hørte dette, sagde han: \"Er det saaledes, nødes jeg sandelig til at flytte; men om jeg nu gjør det, saa kan det endnu staa eder i Veien.\" \"Nei,\" svarede den Samme, \"Naar du flytter det hen paa Haugen, bliver det ikke os mere i Veien.\" Manden maatte virkelig flytte Fjøset, og fra den Tid af havde han ingen Ulykke paa sit Kvæg.","source":"NFL 47, s. 67","category":"ml5075","place":"Hægeland","events":[{"id":"NO-210-E01","start":572,"end":617,"span":"blev han var, at der var opgravet en Del Grus","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-210-E02","start":826,"end":885,"span":"Nu saa han lige ned i et Værelse, som var lige under Fjøset","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-210-E03","start":1462,"end":1502,"span":"Da svarede En af dem med brølende Stemme","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-210-E04","start":1594,"end":1615,"span":"Da Manden hørte dette","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Fjøset","environment":"stable","time":"Tidlig en Morgen","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.35,"lon":7.72,"label":"Hægeland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN1475","id":"SIN1475","collection":"NO","title":"SIN1475","text":"I Eikisdalen var det mange som rømte opp på fjella då Svartedauen kom åt dalen. Der livnærte dei seg lenge tå jakt og fiske. Det syner gravhaugane etter dei oppå fjellom der\nendå.\nHer hev dei au den segna at ein mann som heitte Brynjulf rømde undan Svartedauen oppover Eikisdalsvatnet. Han busette seg her i dalen, og førstna budde han under ein stor stein oppi Austigardsbakken, som sidan hev vore kalla Brynjulsteinen. Han Brynjulf rodde oppover vatnet ti ei eikje, og etter den hev dalen fått namnet sitt.","source":"NFL 30, s. 133","category":"ml7090","place":"Romsdal","events":[],"context":{"place":"oppå fjellom","environment":"mountain","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.5,"lon":7.8,"label":"Romsdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN155","id":"SIN155","collection":"NO","title":"Kari Rud-låtten eller Kjørstad-drepen","text":"Kari Rud-låtten eller Kjørstad-drepen.\nDet var ein gong ei gjente som var meisterdansar. Ho sa\nseg god til å utarme alle karar med dans. Dette vilde no sume\nprøve henne i då. Når ein hadde dansa med henne til han var\nlei, skulde ein annen ta ho att og danse med henne til han og\nvart lei. Soleis for ho frå kar til kar.\nDå alle karane gav seg, dansa ho åleine på golvet og skulde\nsom vise at ho hadde vunne over dei, slik som ho hadde sagt.\nMen so kom det inn i dansarhuset ein framandkar. Han baud\nseg til å danse med gjenta. Men no vilde ikkje spelemannen\nspela lenger. Han hadde vel spelt til han var lei, han med.\nSo måtte framandkaren tralle og syngje låtten sjølv då soleis:\n\"Hei, Kari Rud!\nE ska de snu,\nso lengi du står på føto di, du,\nmæ blomute trøye,\nblomute skjørt,\nblomute tørrkle utapå snørt!\"\nMen so datt gjenta daud på golvet. Med det same smatt\nframandkaren ut att. Då dei såg han i døri, hadde han heste-\nføta.\nDenne låtten vart sidan ein slag gjævlått. Han vart soleis\nspelt på Kjørstad oppi Aurdal i den dansen då det fæle dråpet\nvar der. Det har du nok høyrt gjete. Sidan har denne låtten\nogså heitt Kjørstad-drepen.","source":"NFL 86, s. 211f","category":"ml3070","place":"Sør-Aurdal","events":[{"id":"NO-212-E01","start":627,"end":669,"span":"framandkaren tralle og syngje låtten sjølv","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-212-E02","start":883,"end":928,"span":"Då dei såg han i døri, hadde han heste-\nføta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-212-E03","start":972,"end":1017,"span":"Han vart soleis\nspelt på Kjørstad oppi Aurdal","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later music performance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"dansarhuset","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.78,"lon":9.37,"label":"Sør-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN162","id":"SIN162","collection":"NO","title":"SIN162","text":"Så va det ein gong før lang ti sia at ein finnkall rodd feske\ni lag med nokre bumenner ifrå innlandet. Høvedsmannen va\nså nefør og gjekk og grubla og gremma seg over nokka, det\nkunn all førstå. Finnkallen sport han ka det va som feila\nhan. Nei, han sjøl feila det ingenteng, men han va så førfer-\ndeli redd før kona si. Ho venta smått i denher tia, og ho va\nlitt sjukholdt i førvegen, så det va uvesst korleis det kom tel\nå gå. Han sa han vesst ikkje ka han skull ha gjett før å få ta\nein aller så liten gløtt heim. (Det var smått stell med både post-\ngang og telegraf i den tia, veit vi.)\n\"Vil du eg ska skaff deg greia på korleis det står til heime\nhos deg?\" sport finnen.\n\"Ja, det vil eg gjerna. Kan du det så e du go,\" sa mannen\n\"Men det e ein farli veg å far. Du må lov meg at eg må få\nfred. Du må før all teng pass på at ingen får rør meg.\" Ja,\ndet lova han. Og så la finnen seg på gruv i koia si.\nDet var stilt i bua, og oljelampa brent. Finnen låg i koia\nmed både kofta og huva på seg. Di anner i bua sat oppe, før\ndet va kje sengti endå. Di sat no med kver sett arbeid i hen-\nden, som di brukt å gjer om kveldan og når det va landlæg.\nDi sat just ikkje å hengt henden. Når di va ferdig med å bøt\ngarnan og elles sjå over bruket, så smia di tretofla og øksskaft\neller anner nøttie teng. Av og tel gløtta di opp i finnen si koi,\nog då såg det ut før di som han menka meir og meir ihop.\nTeslut såg det skjenbarli ut som det va berre tome kofta som\nlåg i koia. Ein gluntgap kom og vill klafs åt kofta før å sjå\nom det va nokka inni ho. Men høvedsmannen oppdaga det i\nsiste liten og huta han derifrå. Då ei god stund va gådd, såg\ndi som va inne at kofta øyvest opp igjen, så di forsto at finnen\nva inni ho. Endeli så våkna då finnen og såg seg førvilla\nomkreng. Han va bleik og utkjørt, og sveitten sila av panna\npå han.\n\"Ja, no kan eg hels deg heimanifrå,\" sa han tel høveds-\nmannen. \"Det står berre godt tel der, og i går fekk du ei fresk\nog gjæv lita dotter.\" Nokker syntes det der va mesta nifst, anner\nsat med ein halv flir, - like tel høvedsmannen så såg han\npasseli vantruen ut, som rimeli kunn vær.\n\"Du skal berre vær gla og med godt mot. Det som eg ha\nsagt, det e sant. Og vil du ikkje tru det, så kan du no sjå på\ndenner om du kjenn ho igjen.\" Så tok han fram ifrå kofte-\nbarmen ei sølvskei og viste fram.\n\"Ja, sølvskeia e mi,\" sa høvedsmannen. \"Og takk ska du\nha før bue. Korleis du ha greidd det får bli di sak.\" Han va\ngla og gild heile resten a feske. Og då han kom heim, fekk\nhan greia på at kona ho ha li på seng just dagen før at finnen\ngjor den underlie ferda si. Kona kunn berre ikkje skjønn kor\ndet va blitt a sølvskeia tel mannen, ho va komen snoft bort.\nMannen flirte og førtelt om den merkelie hendinga, men ikkje\nhadd ho og ikkje nokken i bulaget lov tel å snakk om dederre.","source":"NFL 93, s. 83f","category":"ml3080","place":"Lofoten","events":[{"id":"NO-213-E01","start":904,"end":923,"span":"Det var stilt i bua","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Ambient silence, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-213-E02","start":1339,"end":1465,"span":"då såg det ut før di som han menka meir og meir ihop.\nTeslut såg det skjenbarli ut som det va berre tome kofta som\nlåg i koia.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"qualified changing appearance","evidence":"såg det skjenbarli ut som det va berre tome kofta","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-213-E03","start":1630,"end":1674,"span":"såg\ndi som va inne at kofta øyvest opp igjen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"reappearance","evidence":"kofta øyvest opp igjen","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-213-E04","start":1721,"end":1824,"span":"våkna då finnen og såg seg førvilla\nomkreng. Han va bleik og utkjørt, og sveitten sila av panna\npå han.","modalities":["orientation","bodily sensation"],"groups":["orientation","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"post-waking disorientation","evidence":"såg seg førvilla\nomkreng","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual experiencer; fatigue and sweating explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"bua","environment":"fishing hut","time":"det va kje sengti endå","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":68.04534,"lon":13.38235,"label":"Lofoten","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN164","id":"SIN164","collection":"NO","title":"SIN164","text":"Ein Eide-mann vart vis med at kona hans ikkje drog veret\nmed nætene. Tok han då ei salmebok og la på munnen hennar.\nNoko fyre dag høyrde han slikt syrgjeleg illelæte: det var nok\nsjeli åt kona som hadde vore på vidotta og no ikkje slapp inn\natt. Mannen la då salmeboki burt. I same stundi flaug sjeli\ninn, og kona rådde or.","source":"NFL 32, s 125","category":"ml4000","place":"Granvin","events":[{"id":"NO-214-E01","start":14,"end":68,"span":"vart vis med at kona hans ikkje drog veret\nmed nætene.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Noticing absence of breathing, modality unstated; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-214-E02","start":130,"end":165,"span":"høyrde han slikt syrgjeleg illelæte","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"munnen hennar","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Noko fyre dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","other"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.55,"lon":6.72,"label":"Granvin","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN169","id":"SIN169","collection":"NO","title":"SIN169","text":"Ein gut som var mare-riden, fekk den rådi at han sku teppa\nte alle veggsprungor i stova med husmose; berre eit navarshol\nkunde stå att, og der sku han setja ein tolekniv. Næste morgon\nfann guten ei ven gjenta i sengi si. Han gifte seg med 'ne, og\ndei åtte fleire born. Men ein dag kom mannen ved ei gåløysa\nte ta kniven or holet - og der flaug fuglen og kom aldri att.","source":"NFL 32, s. 123","category":"ml4010","place":"Granvin","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.55,"lon":6.72,"label":"Granvin","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN17","id":"SIN17","collection":"NO","title":"Då den slemme laut vera karjolhjul.","text":"Då den slemme laut vera karjolhjul.\nProsten Stabel hadde vore på Bø i Aurdal og mana den slemme ut. På heimvegen\nfreista hinmannen å hemne seg. Han reiv tå eine karjolhjulet åt Stabel i\nbrattaste Juvkamskleiv'n. Men prosten stod ikkje i beit. Han mana den slemme\ntil sjølv å vera eit karjolhjul, og slik kom han køyrande åt prestegarden. Folk\nsom såg han, sa at det stod varmesputeren tå eine karjolhjulet den gongen.","source":"NFL 55, s. 206","category":"ml3010","place":"Sør-Aurdal","events":[{"id":"NO-216-E01","start":338,"end":405,"span":"Folk\nsom såg han, sa at det stod varmesputeren tå eine karjolhjulet","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sparks explicit; no felt heat inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"heimvegen","environment":"road","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.78,"lon":9.37,"label":"Sør-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN173","id":"SIN173","collection":"NO","title":"Zetlitz og beinrangele","text":"Zetlitz og beinrangele.\nEin gravar ved Brunkeberg kyrkje var so ille steld med eit\nbeinrangel, som han kom nedpaa alt som tidast, naar han\nskulde kaste upp ei ny greft, og det var kje raad aa faa det\nutor vegen.\nPresten Zetlitz var i Kvitseid daa og fekk au høyre snakke\num detta beinrangele. So bad 'n gravaren vilde bodsende honom\ndet fysste han skulde kaste upp ei ny greft.\nGravaren lova detta. So ei stund etter skulde det upp ei\nny greft, og Zetlitz vart bodsend og stod jamsides gravaren.\nHan kom snart nedpaa beinrangele att. Daa sa Zetlitz honom\ntil aa leggje det uppaa gravbakken. Gravaren gjorde so, og\npresten stod lengi og bisna paa det. So bad 'n gravaren vilde\nreise det upp innmed kyrkjeveggen. Han so gjorde, og Zetlitz\nsjav gjekk inn i kyrkja; der var 'n umlag ein time. Daa han\nkom utatt tok 'n beinrangele og la det ned paa bakken. So\ntok 'n spaden av gravaren og hoggi til yvi halskvirvilen, so\nhausen vart skild ifraa kroppen.\n\"Hot fe gjore du detta daa?\" spurde gravaren.\n\"Jou,\" sa Zetlitz, \"detta hev vore ein mordar som hev døytt\nog ikkje sanna eller sona. Men no skal han ikkje koma i\nvegen for deg meir.\"\nEtter den tid var beinrangele burte.","source":"NFL 21, s. 129f","category":"ml4020","place":"Seljord","events":[{"id":"NO-217-E01","start":614,"end":650,"span":"presten stod lengi og bisna paa det.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Brunkeberg kyrkje","environment":"cemetery","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.48,"lon":8.65,"label":"Seljord","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN180","id":"SIN180","collection":"NO","title":"SIN180","text":"I gammel tid var det en utbor i Medalen på Eiterjor-\nden. Den skreik og sutra så de hørte det tydelig, og de\nsom blei ute for dette, bare huffa seg og gikk inn. En\nmann på Navjord hørte seg lei på det, og en mørk haust-\nkveld da det skreik og jamra som verst, gikk han ned\ntil elva og ropte over: \"Vell du bi døfft?\" \"Døfft\",\nsvarte det, og så dåpte han utboren, og sia blei det stilt.","source":"NFL 72, s.103","category":"ml4025","place":"Beiarn","events":[{"id":"NO-218-E01","start":58,"end":101,"span":"Den skreik og sutra så de hørte det tydelig","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier generic group hearing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-218-E02","start":161,"end":200,"span":"En\nmann på Navjord hørte seg lei på det","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-218-E03","start":366,"end":385,"span":"sia blei det stilt.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Medalen på Eiterjor-\nden","environment":"valley","time":"en mørk haust-\nkveld","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":67.06,"lon":14.85,"label":"Beiarn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN185","id":"SIN185","collection":"NO","title":"SIN185","text":"Jørn Kolabrenner levde i min fars tid. Far var fødd 1800.\nHan for om og brente kul for folk. Han batt ikje det ene sokkabandet\nmen slepte det efter veien. Han hadde gaaet nedgangskolen i Danmark.\nKontrakten gik ut paa at den stygge mannen skulde ha den siste som gik\nut av døren. Det blev Jørn men saa bad han den onde om henstand til han\nhadde faatt bundet det ene sokkabandet. Derfor batt han det aldrig men\nslepte det efter sig.","source":"NFS H. Delgobe 20, s. 21","category":"ml3000","place":"Vats","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.49148,"lon":5.72868,"label":"Vats","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN200","id":"SIN200","collection":"NO","title":"SIN200","text":"Engang i gamle dage hendte det på gården Finnbuan i Leksvik at presten\nmåtte hentes for å drive djevelen ut. Det var drevet med kortspill og driking i\nflere dage i trækk en jul; når de hadde holdt på i noen dage så kom der også en\nfremmen mann inn å tok del i kortspillet, det var en svert trivelig og dyktig\nkortspiller; men så traff det at et spillkort datt neri gulvet, en av laget\nbøide sig ned for å ta op kortet; men da blev han opmerksom på at den fremmede\nhadde klør på den ene foten og at han hadde slått kloen fast i den ene\nbordfoten; han forstod strakst hvad forslags fremmedkar som var kommen i laget\nog varskudde de andre, å de kom sig fra bordet fortere end vanligt, da de blev\nopmerksom på at det var djevelen selv som de hadde fått til julegjest og\nspillkammerad. Djevelen slog sig til ro han og vill ikke forlate huset. Presten\nmåtte hendtes men djevelen så ikke ut til å vill avsted så snart enda. Du har\nengang stjålet et trådnøste. Sa djevelen til presten. Dette tok jeg for å bøte\nmin bukse med. Sa presten. Du har stjålet en bok engang. Sa djevelen. Denne tok\njeg for å lære å lese. Sa presten. Du har stjålet en stemnål engang. Sa\ndjevelen. Denne stjal jeg for å ha å drive dig ut med. Svarte presten, og så\nstakk presten med denne stoppenålen et hull på vindusblyet å befalte djevelen\ntil å [fare] utigjennem dette hullet, men djevelen vil ikke ut derigjennem, han\nbad om å få fare opigjennem murpipen, men det nektet presten han skulde\nutigjennem nålehullet i vindusblyet. Presten begyndte å mane og det begyndte å\nrive å slite i djevelen og det hørtes som et tordenbrak; men så begyndte\ndjevelen å gjøre sig liten og så hørtes hvor djevelen pistet å gnol en lang stun\nmens han for utigjennem nålehullet.","source":"NFS Edvard Kruken 7, s. 63f","category":"ml3015","place":"Leksvik","events":[{"id":"NO-220-E01","start":423,"end":544,"span":"da blev han opmerksom på at den fremmede\nhadde klør på den ene foten og at han hadde slått kloen fast i den ene\nbordfoten","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised agent identification","evidence":"han forstod strakst hvad forslags fremmedkar som var kommen i laget","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-220-E02","start":1526,"end":1596,"span":"det begyndte å\nrive å slite i djevelen og det hørtes som et tordenbrak","modalities":["auditory","bodily sensation"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"sound analogy","evidence":"hørtes som et tordenbrak","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Body strained is djevelen; listeners group; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-220-E03","start":1644,"end":1694,"span":"så hørtes hvor djevelen pistet å gnol en lang stun","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gården Finnbuan","environment":"domestic interior","time":"en jul","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.67,"lon":10.62,"label":"Leksvik","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN217","id":"SIN217","collection":"NO","title":"Fanden tok brura","text":"Fanden tok brura\nEn jente var forlovet med en ung gutt. Da hun viste tegn til å slå\nop med ham, beklaget han sig over dette til henne. Men hun\nsvarte da at den dagen hun giftet sig med nogen annen enn ham,\nskulde fanden få ta henne. Det blev dog slik at hun slog op med\ngutten å forlovet sig med en annen.\nPå bryllupsdagen kom en fremmed mann inn i bryllupshuset og\nsatte sig sammen med de andre gjestene. Ved bordet satte han sig\nhård imot at bordbønnen skulde leses slik som skikken var den tiden\nog slik blev det også. Da dansen begyndte, satt den fremmede først å så på,\nmen så vilde han danse med brura. Det fikk han også; men de\nvar ikke før kommet på gulvet før dørene sprang op med stort bråk,\nog brura og den fremmede for ut i en sky av ild og røk. Det var\nfanden som tok henne, ham hun svor ved.","source":"NFS Edvard Kruken 4, 1f","category":"ml3075","place":"Leksvik","events":[{"id":"NO-221-E01","start":542,"end":573,"span":"satt den fremmede først å så på","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-221-E02","start":669,"end":700,"span":"dørene sprang op med stort bråk","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"bryllupshuset","environment":"domestic interior","time":"På bryllupsdagen","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.67,"lon":10.62,"label":"Leksvik","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN222","id":"SIN222","collection":"NO","title":"I Fjærland","text":"I Fjærland\nskulde det eingong vera ein som var mannbjørn. Eingong kona hans var\nbarnaleg (med barn), sa mannen til henne: \"No ska eg raisa vekk ai stund; er\nso da kjeme nåken bjødn med'eg æ burte, so ska du kasta fyrklæ ditt i 'an,\nog so ska du røma din veg\". Og rettnok! det kom ein bjørn og søkte innåt\nhenne, og ho gjorde som mannen hadde sagt og berga seg undan. Då mannen kom\nheimatt og skulde eta, so tok han til å plukka forklæ-larkane utor tennene\nsine, og ho kjende att leivone or forklæ sitt. Sidan dette vart uppdaga, so\nvart han ikkje mannbjørn lenger.","source":"NFS Sjur Bøyum 1, s. 61","category":"ml4005","place":"Balestrand","events":[{"id":"NO-222-E01","start":465,"end":502,"span":"ho kjende att leivone or forklæ sitt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"recognition from material trace","evidence":"kjende att leivone or forklæ sitt","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual identification contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.2,"lon":6.52,"label":"Balestrand","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN229","id":"SIN229","collection":"NO","title":"SIN229","text":"Hegglandskjørka va be'ekjørke, som dei kadde dei, å i den ha so mang ein kryplengi bli' go att'e. Der låg heile haugar av krykkur i kjørka ette slike, som ha' reis' friske heim att'e.\nDei vill vite, at døenganna va der titt forsamla i kjørka å ba.\nSo va de ein kvell'e der sill vera møti i kjørka, å so va de tvo jæntur som au ville at kjørka å bee. Då dei kåm då, so dei såg ti kjørka, såg dei, de lyste; so tænkte jæntunne, dei va for seine, å so skonda dei seg, de dei konne. So gjeng'e dei enn i kjørka, å då va de pure døengar som va der. Å då dei såg jæntunne, styrmde dei ut liksom ein foss'e. Jæntunne kjænde bestemor si å ho tala ti dei å sae: \"Kot vi di her, drosinne mine? skonde dikkon ut att'e, ellå drep'e dei dikkon!\" Jentunne kann du vit' koss nøitte seg, å døenganne fygde dei heilt ti porten. Sia va de kji mange, som tor' at Hegglandskjørka om nettanne.","source":"NFS Moltke Moe 54, s. 21f","category":"ml4015","place":"Fyresdal","events":[{"id":"NO-223-E01","start":387,"end":404,"span":"såg dei, de lyste","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misinterpreted timing","evidence":"so tænkte jæntunne, dei va for seine","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-223-E02","start":546,"end":600,"span":"då dei såg jæntunne, styrmde dei ut liksom ein foss'e.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencers dead congregation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-223-E03","start":601,"end":628,"span":"Jæntunne kjænde bestemor si","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual recognition; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Hegglandskjørka","environment":"church","time":"ein kvell'e","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.18,"lon":8.08,"label":"Fyresdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN240","id":"SIN240","collection":"NO","title":"Havmannen","text":"Havmannen\nDet var eit år eg rodde fiska på Harnes på Harøya. So\nvar det ein fineversdag me var utpå havet, at det kom ein\nhavmann oppi båten åt oss. Han fraus so'n skolv - far. Og\nnaken var'n. Me syntest synd ti 'nå, og so tok me tå oss\nog ga 'nå klæde. Styrmannen tok tå seg 1angbuksa og gav\n'nå. Alle me andre hadde berre kortbuksor. Og då fjelgna'n\ntil so mykje at'n ikkje skolv. Og han blei med oss heim om\nnatta. - Han var ikkje mykje stor - far. Men stort\nbrunt skjegg ha'n, som rakk midt nedpå bringa. Men han\nhadde tunt hår.\nAndre morgonen, då me skulde ut på havet, kom hav-\nmannen utfor veggen og sa åt styrmannen vår:\n\"Hann blåna i lann\nå hann svortna i hav\nTak av du mann\nso langbokså gav\"\nJa, me tok og gjekk inn att og tok tå oss, alle på vår\nbåt. Og då det leid te middags om dagen, rauk'n opp med\nslik storm, at dei kom ikkje heim att nokon tå dei som var\nreist utpå havet den dagen.\nTrast etter di'n hadde kjølt opp, gjekk havmannen ned-\nåt sjøen, og sidan såg me ikkje meir likt te 'nå. Men me\nfann att langbuksa, ho låg nedmed naustet - so'n hadde\nnokk klædd tå seg igjen førenn han reiste.","source":"NFL 30, s. 110f","category":"ml4055","place":"Nord-Aukra (øya Gossa)","events":[{"id":"NO-224-E01","start":149,"end":169,"span":"Han fraus so'n skolv","modalities":["temperature","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer havmann.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-224-E02","start":339,"end":382,"span":"då fjelgna'n\ntil so mykje at'n ikkje skolv.","modalities":["temperature","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Warmth recovery after clothing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-224-E03","start":968,"end":1004,"span":"sidan såg me ikkje meir likt te 'nå.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group subsequent non-seeing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"utpå havet","environment":"sea","time":"ein fineversdag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.87,"lon":6.88,"label":"Nord-Aukra (øya Gossa)","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN242","id":"SIN242","collection":"NO","title":"SIN242","text":"Nokre saltværingsbåtar låg utfor Henningsvær; dei låg for\nkrabbe. Med eitt fekk dei slik overhendig til landvindsstorm. Han\nvar so grov, dei visste ikkje um dei fekk bruka segl. Og ein av\nbåtane vann seg ikkje under land.\nMen dei var varsla um denne stormen. Um morgonen, den-\ntid dei rodde ut, hadde fleire av dei vorte vis ein skapnad som\nstod å reise i sjøen.\nMen han Hans Olso i Vestvatn (Skjerstad) akta på vars-\nlinga, han.\nDet var ein morgon han rodde ut, so fekk dei sjå havman-\nnen ved holmane utfor Henningsvær.\n\"Da bi inkj tur i dag. Ro berre baker i være,\" sa han Hans.\nOg so rett dei gjor; det vart eit forrykande ver utpå dagen.\nDet var eit båtlag som låg på sjøen og drog bruk. So fekk\ndei høyra det la i å ropa. Høvesmannen tok då ein gammal\nskinnstakk og kasta over båtripa.\nEi tid deretter, dei låg utpå, kveste han i og vart noko tung-\nsjøåt. Då fekk dei høyra att dette same målet.\n\"Du mann, du mann som me sjinnstakkjen ga!\nDa dønra bott'n, da homra i hav.\nRo av! Ro av!\"\nHøvesmannen bad dei skjera over lina og set segl.\nDet bles upp til storstorm; og mange båtar kom seg ikkje\nunder land.","source":"NFL 37, s. 154","category":"ml4055","place":"Sørfold","events":[{"id":"NO-225-E01","start":295,"end":362,"span":"hadde fleire av dei vorte vis ein skapnad som\nstod å reise i sjøen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate form","evidence":"ein skapnad","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning first episode; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-225-E02","start":466,"end":521,"span":"fekk dei sjå havman-\nnen ved holmane utfor Henningsvær.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second episode, morning.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-225-E03","start":696,"end":727,"span":"fekk\ndei høyra det la i å ropa.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Third boat episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-225-E04","start":862,"end":901,"span":"Då fekk dei høyra att dette same målet.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated voice later at sea.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"utfor Henningsvær","environment":"sea","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":67.45743,"lon":15.80111,"label":"Sørfold","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN258","id":"SIN258","collection":"NO","title":"Kvisla-mannen som måtte over isen og blive","text":"Kvisla-mannen som måtte over isen og blive.\nDet var ein gong ein mann or Kvissel, som hadde sett i seg\nat han skulde over fjorden eit ærend. Men av ein eller annan\ngrunn kom han til å setja det over og drog i staden til skogs.\nUm ei tid høyrde dei heime hjå han at det ropte burtpå isen:\n\"Tie æ kåmin o mann'n inkji!\"\nDå mannen kom att or skogen, vart han so annsam tå seg,\nlaga seg til og drog over isen og - bleiv. Mannen måtte over,\nhan!","source":"NFL 86, s. 97","category":"ml4050","place":"Vestre Slidre","events":[{"id":"NO-226-E01","start":237,"end":286,"span":"høyrde dei heime hjå han at det ropte burtpå isen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"burtpå isen","environment":"frozen water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.03,"lon":8.87,"label":"Vestre Slidre","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN266","id":"SIN266","collection":"NO","title":"Havfrua på Hadeland","text":"Havfrua på Hadeland.\nOppå Hadeland var det ei havfrue, som hadde stige opp or\nRandsfjorde og tala ved ein mann. Han spurde henne kva han\nskulde ha til tustereim, so det skulde halde.\n\"Kelvehedne, du gelne mann!\" svara ho. \"Svin ha du vøre,\no svin e du, o svin ska du bli, o Svinning eite garden. Hadde\ndu endå sport me ko de vart tå lagaløge!\"\nDet totte ho det hadde vore klyktigare spurt etter.","source":"NFL 55, s. 67","category":"ml4060","place":"Etnedal","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.0,"lon":9.5,"label":"Etnedal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN276","id":"SIN276","collection":"NO","title":"Havfruao","text":"Havfruao\nDa va eingong nåki hilt pao niti stråndi å sløgde fisk, å skrapte risti ao an, å\nvaska an i sjøn. Dao stakk ei Havfrua op håve, å so ropte ho. \"Adle skrapa ao\nskrote, men injen skrapa sote\", å so blei ho vække. Skrote ska væra risti, å\nsote ska væra dinna svarta sjinnao so lijje runt pao innsiao i buken, te æta dan\nsvarta sjinnao, ska væra faorle, dei bli spilte (spedalske) ao na, å alti ha da\nvåre slik jao åss, dan sjinnao bli bortteki.","source":"NFS Jakob Bugge 1, s. 189","category":"ml4060","place":"Luster (Urnes)","events":[{"id":"NO-228-E01","start":139,"end":150,"span":"so ropte ho","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Calling explicitly marked; ordinary saying excluded elsewhere.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"niti stråndi","environment":"shoreline","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.40312,"lon":7.29793,"label":"Luster (Urnes)","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN28","id":"SIN28","collection":"NO","title":"SIN28","text":"Det var på ein gard uti bygda. Der var døm så fæle til å\nspella kort. Ein søndag gikk mann og kjæringa til alters. Om\nkvelden satt døm der og spella kort att. Både mann og kjæringa\nvar med.\nDa banka det på døra uti svala. Kjæringa gikk stad og\nskulde sjå hå det var for noko. Da var det ein fin herremann.\nHan bad om han kunde få snakke med mann hennas. Ho gikk\nda inn og snakka om det til mann sin, og han gikk ut. Denna\nherremann spurte om han kunde få vera med inn og få et slag\nkort, han og.\nJa, det skulde han så gjerne få lov til, og han vart med\nSå klemte døm til å spella att. Men, døm fekk noko anna\nå tenke på. Denna fremmenkaren vant støtt. Han spella tå\ndessan andre alle pengane døm åtte, døm banna og let ille for\ndet døm tapa så.\nDa datt det ein kort på gølvet. Mann i huset bøgde sei ned\nog skulde ta 'n oppatt. Døm satt og spella ved et slikt gammal-\ndags bord. Det var tre små bein som var festa til ein kubbe som\nbar plata. Denna kubben var skøri til så han var vridd som\nein korkeskruve.\nDa nå mann skulde ta opp denna korten, fekk'n sjå noko\nhan ikkje hadde venta. Der satt denna fine mannen og hadde\nkrøkt kløane sine om kubben under bordet. Da skjønna dom\nhåkken det var døm spella i lag med.\nDøm vilde bli kvitt'n, kan du veta. Døm både gret og bad\nat han måtte gå, men han hadde sett sei på ein krakk ved peisen,\nog vilde ikkje ut.\n\"Di har bede mei inn her sjølve, og je går ikkje,\" sa han.\nFølk prøva alle rådir. Døm var etter presten, men han hadde\ninga makt over'n. Til slutt kom døm på at døm skulde fåt fatt\ni Røkenpresten. Da han hørte at døm skulde ha fatt i han,\nsa han at mot denna Røkenbikkja kunde han ikkje stå sei. Men\nhan vart sittande likevel.\nSå kom Røkenpresten. Da vilde den vonde gå tå sei sjøl.\nMen nei, det skulde han ikkje få lov til. Han skulde gjennom\nnykelpipa i døra. Han bad så fint å få sleppe det, men presten\ngav sei ikkje. Den veigen måtte'n. Men det vart nok fælt til\nleven, det både gvein og peip om'n da han for ut.\nSia var døm kvitt'n au.","source":"NFL 27, s.55f","category":"ml3015","place":"Sigdal","events":[{"id":"NO-229-E01","start":190,"end":221,"span":"Da banka det på døra uti svala.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-229-E02","start":702,"end":723,"span":"døm banna og let ille","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-229-E03","start":1047,"end":1163,"span":"fekk'n sjå noko\nhan ikkje hadde venta. Der satt denna fine mannen og hadde\nkrøkt kløane sine om kubben under bordet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised agent identification","evidence":"Da skjønna dom\nhåkken det var døm spella i lag med","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-229-E04","start":1252,"end":1272,"span":"Døm både gret og bad","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-229-E05","start":1554,"end":1594,"span":"Da han hørte at døm skulde ha fatt i han","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer den vonde.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-229-E06","start":1932,"end":1974,"span":"det både gvein og peip om'n da han for ut.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ein gard","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Om\nkvelden","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.05,"lon":9.6,"label":"Sigdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN288","id":"SIN288","collection":"NO","title":"Borgaren paa Utrøst","text":"Borgaren paa Utrøst.\nNaar ein ser Lofoten synnante, saa ser han ut som ei lang\nRa mæ Tinda aa Odda, mest liksom Tenn paa ei Sag; saa\nbratte aa kvasse æ Fjellan te sjaa te. D' æ ein stor Fjor paa\nsøre Sia, saa di kalla Vestfjoren; han æ vikjent før dæ, at der\nbi fiska ei otruli Mengd mæ Tosk om Vinteren; men hellest æ\ndæ ein stygg Fjor te aa færas paa, før der æ stor Sjøbor aa\ntung Sjø i han, aa naar Ver'e staar inn ta Have, saa æ der\nslikt eit Brem aa Brot inn mæ Lann'e, at dæ staar som ein Foss\nupp ett' alle Bergan mæ bærre Skum aa Dræv. Va ikje dæ, at\nder æ saa mang Vaaga aa Kjeila te laup' inn i, saa hadde Lo-\nfoten vorre reint eit obørt Lann før sjøfarand Folk. Yste Øyann\nligg saa langt ifraa kverann'er, at ein ser di bærre som smaa\nSkjer ut i Hav'e; aa den Øy'a, saa ligg aller yst, d' æ den, saa\ndi kalla Røst. Men Gamle-Karann hadd' ei Tru om dæ, at der\nva eit Lann, saa laag endaa lenger ut, aa dæ kalla di Ut-Røst;\nmen den Øy'a va osynli, aa dæ va bærre Tuftefolk, saa budde\nder. D' æ ikje leng sia, dæ va ein Mann, som sa', at han ha\nvorre der, aa dæ var trøysamt aa hør', naar han tok te fortel',\nkor dæ gjekk te. Den tia, daa æg va ung, sa' han, daa foor\næg mang Gang ut paa Hav'e paa ein liten Kjeks aa sku fisk',\nsumti' mæ Garn aa sumti' mæ Lin' ell Juksong ell aenn Børn-\nskap. Eingaang hente dæ sæg, at æg va langt unna Lann, aa\nhan blees upp ein Vinn ta Hav'e; daa snudd æg heim aa vatt\nupp Segl'e aa styrte beinast aat Lann.\nMen best som detta va, saa visst' æg ikje ta, før Sjøn vart still,\naa Baaten sto fast; aa daa æg sku sjaa ette, saa sto Baaten paa Lann midt\ni ein Rugaaker. Æg sto upp aa gjekk paa Lann aa sku sjaa kring om\nmæg, aa daa saag æg ei stor Sjøbu aa ei Laan mæ Krambu aa\nalt saa te hørte. Saa vent' æg att aa skuva Baaten utu Aakren,\naa rodde saa upp aat Bryggja aa la' aat. Daa kom der ut ein\nMann, saa saag ut te væra ein Borgar ell Kjøpmann, aa han\nkom ne te mæg aa helsa aa næmte mæg mæ Namn. \"Aa saa\næ du ute aa færas i Dag,\" sa han. \"Æg æ saa, ja,\" svart' æg,\n\"men æg undras paa, at i sku kjenn' mæg; æg trur aller, at æg\nkjenne ør; æg tyks aller ha set ør før.\" Ja saa daa,\" svart'an,\naa saa sport'an ette, om æg ha Fisk. Æg sa', som sant va, at\næg ha bærr' ei Kveit; aenn Fisk ha æg ikje faatt. Saa fekk\nhan sjaa Kveita, aa saa vild' an endele' kjøp' o, aa bau mæg\nso mykkje før' o, at æg laut lat' an faa ho; aa æg tok imot Pen-\ngann, aa han tok Kveita i Toknann aa drog ho uppaa Bryggja.\nMen saa snart saa Fisken va utu Baaten, saa va dæ borte alt\nihop, baa Lann'e aa Garen aa Mannen, nett saa dæ va ne-sokkje;\næg saag aller att ein Grann, anna ville Hav'e paa alle Sia. Aa\nBøren blees, aa æg sat i Baaten aa segla beint aat Lann, lik\neins som før.","source":"NFL 1, s. 58ff","category":"ml4075","place":"Lofoten","events":[{"id":"NO-230-E01","start":21,"end":127,"span":"Naar ein ser Lofoten synnante, saa ser han ut som ei lang\nRa mæ Tinda aa Odda, mest liksom Tenn paa ei Sag","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic landscape visibility; unspecified observer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-230-E02","start":721,"end":763,"span":"ein ser di bærre som smaa\nSkjer ut i Hav'e","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic distance-limited appearance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-230-E03","start":1543,"end":1609,"span":"daa æg sku sjaa ette, saa sto Baaten paa Lann midt\ni ein Rugaaker.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unexpected location","evidence":"paa Lann midt\ni ein Rugaaker","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-230-E04","start":1668,"end":1714,"span":"daa saag æg ei stor Sjøbu aa ei Laan mæ Krambu","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-230-E05","start":2250,"end":2274,"span":"Saa fekk\nhan sjaa Kveita","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Merchant is experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-230-E06","start":2568,"end":2627,"span":"æg saag aller att ein Grann, anna ville Hav'e paa alle Sia.","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"vanished landscape","evidence":"æg saag aller att ein Grann, anna ville Hav'e paa alle Sia","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Hav'e","environment":"sea","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":68.04534,"lon":13.38235,"label":"Lofoten","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN297","id":"SIN297","collection":"NO","title":"Draugen i Henningsvær","text":"Draugen i Henningsvær\nDet var eingong eit båtlag, som rodde fiske i Henningsvær. Dei vart der ute for ein fyr, som kvar kveld dei kom på land kom inn i båten til dei og tok til å rumstera. Aldri før hadde dei gått ifrå båten før denne kroppen var der. Så ein kveld lura skottkaren seg nedover til sjøen for å sjå etter korleis dette kunde ha seg. Då han kom nedover til sjøen så la han seg på lur attmed båten, som var sett opp på land. Strakst etter kom det ein fyr opp i båten og gav seg til å greine der. Sette seg først i framromet. Nei, der høvde det ikkje. Og såleis gjekk det attover. Jau i skottromet høvde det. \"Ja høve dæ te de, så høve dæ te me og\", sa skottkaren og slog til med ein skalkjepp han hadde i handa. Men om vinteren kom skottkaren bort på sjøen.","source":"NFS Knut Strompdal 5, s. 116f","category":"ml4070","place":"Vevelstad","events":[{"id":"NO-231-E01","start":482,"end":507,"span":"gav seg til å greine der.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-231-E02","start":678,"end":723,"span":"slog til med ein skalkjepp han hadde i handa.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact action; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"båten","environment":"boat","time":"ein kveld","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.7,"lon":12.42,"label":"Vevelstad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN308","id":"SIN308","collection":"NO","title":"SIN308","text":"Vi mener at det som oftest ikke er for det gode, at Folk gaar igjen. Det kan være, for at no er ugjort eller til Straf. Men det kan også være for aa gi Oplysning om no som bare den døde vet om til Beste for de levende. En Mor gaar igjen for aa se til sine Børn. Engang hadde en Barneflok faat slem Stemor. Mora kom og sa:\nJe efterlot mei 12 Dyner blaa\nHaafor sker mine Smaabørn ligge paa bare Straa\nJe efterlot mei baade Øl aa Mat\nHaafor sker mine Smaabørn ligge med tomme Fat?\nDet hjalp.","source":"NFS August Krogh 4, s.29","category":"ml4030","place":"Søndre Høland","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.71741,"lon":11.44874,"label":"Søndre Høland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN311","id":"SIN311","collection":"NO","title":"SIN311","text":"Gamalt var det to brør som ville læra å spela. Og dei tok\nmed seg kvar si fele og kvar sitt fenalår og gjekk til Buåfallet,\nfor der heldt nykken til.\nDen eine karen var så svolten og difor så gnog han tå fena-\nlåret sitt. Da karane kom til Buåfallet, så kasta dei saulåra uti.\nIkkje så lenge etter steig nykken opp tur vatnet. Og han gjekk\nbort til karane og tok på fingrane deira. Og spelmenner vart\ndei, men han som hadde ete tå kjøttlåret vart ikkje nåme nær\nså god som broren sin.","source":"NFL 74, s. 17","category":"ml4090","place":"Eidskog","events":[{"id":"NO-233-E01","start":150,"end":179,"span":"Den eine karen var så svolten","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-233-E02","start":359,"end":381,"span":"tok på fingrane deira.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Group contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Buåfallet","environment":"waterfall","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.02813,"lon":12.06528,"label":"Eidskog","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN316","id":"SIN316","collection":"NO","title":"På korsvegen julenatta","text":"På korsvegen julenatta.\nNår ein vil læra å bli god til å spela fela, så skal ein taka\nein kjøtbog og gå ut på ein korsveg julaftan. Då vil draugen\nkoma og læra ein å spela. Det var eingong ein mann som fann\npå at han vilde prøva. Han tok ein kjøtbog med og gjekk. Men\nden som vilde læra å spela, måtte ikkje snakka eit einaste ord på\nturen. Då han kom til korsvegen, kom det ei høna ruslande med\neit stort høylass. Ho stogga attmed mannen aldri så lite, så var\ndet som ho skvatt til og sa: \"Nei, eg får vel til å gå skal eg\nnå til Rom til dags\". Då sette mannen i å flira, og sa at ho såg\nikkje nett ut til å kunna nå til Rom, ho. Men mannen hadde\nvorte lurd til å snakka, og så kom det ikkje fleire.\nNæste julekveld skulde kameraten hans i veg; han tok med\nein avgnegen kjøtbog. Han sa ikkje noko, men dreiv kjøtbogen\ntil framandkaren som kom. Den framande ha' ei fin fela med;\nmen då han fekk sjå at det ikkje var noko på kjøtbogen, då sa\nhan: \"Du gav meg kjøtbog med inkje på, du skal læra å stilla,\nmen ikkje å slå.\" Han vart ein meister til å stilla fela, men vart\naldri nokon meister til å spela.","source":"NFL 19, s. 161f","category":"ml4090","place":"Helgeland","events":[{"id":"NO-234-E01","start":546,"end":571,"span":"Då sette mannen i å flira","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-234-E02","start":883,"end":933,"span":"då han fekk sjå at det ikkje var noko på kjøtbogen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Second Christmas, visiting agent as experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"korsvegen","environment":"crossroads","time":"julaftan","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.92584,"lon":13.40033,"label":"Helgeland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN323","id":"SIN323","collection":"NO","title":"Hamar i Halle","text":"Hamar i Halle.\nBurti Mohaugja budde det ein jøtul som hitte Hamar i Halle.\nBurti Gjeresvollhaugja budde han Klinkandes Skalle. Uti Peknu-\nkja budde 'n Lars Langlår. No e det slik at Mohamran og Gje-\nresvollhamran veit midt imot einannan.\n\"Hoi, du Hamar i Halle!\"\n\"Hoi, du Klinkandes Skalle!\"\n\"Ska e få låne storkjelen din idag?\"\n\"Kva vil du med heno?\"\n\"Koke 'n Lars Langlår. Fer e veit ikkje kvellsmål korkje\nhaust ell vår!\"\n\"Ja,' fall e ska få skovon!\"\n\"Nei, fyr ell du ska få skovon,\nska e steikje'n pao glono\nog rive'n-synn med klono!\"","source":"NFL 52, s. 73","category":"ml5000","place":"Ålvundeid","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.65,"lon":8.32,"label":"Ålvundeid","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN329","id":"SIN329","collection":"NO","title":"Jutulen i Holberget","text":"Jutulen i Holberget\nDet var ein gong i jutul som bodde i Holberget i Svatsum. Men han likte ikkje\nbruset av elva, og da det vart kyrkje der, så tolde han ikkje høyra\nkyrkjeklokkene ringde. Han flytta da til Skreia utmed Mjøsa.\nEin gong ein svatsing reiste utover Mjøsa, tenkte han at han kunde høva\ntil å råka jutulen og derfor hadde han ein hestesko inn i votten sin, for\njutulen klemde så hardt når han helsa.\nOg rett nok; han møtte jutulen og han helsa upp i handa. Da sa jutulen:\n\"Det finst handfaste folk enda i Gausdal, kjenner eg\".\nMen da mannen tok hesteskoen ut att var han klemt flat.","source":"NFS O. Svare s. 4","category":"ml5010","place":"Gausdal","events":[{"id":"NO-236-E01","start":82,"end":112,"span":"han likte ikkje\nbruset av elva","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer jutul; generic.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-236-E02","start":144,"end":188,"span":"tolde han ikkje høyra\nkyrkjeklokkene ringde.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-236-E03","start":485,"end":536,"span":"Det finst handfaste folk enda i Gausdal, kjenner eg","modalities":["touch","pressure"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified contact material","evidence":"hadde han ein hestesko inn i votten sin","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Jutul feels horseshoe concealed in glove as hand strength.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.22,"lon":10.17,"label":"Gausdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN332","id":"SIN332","collection":"NO","title":"Vettlanda kyrkjespir","text":"Vettlanda kyrkjespir.\nEin gong var det ein bonde frå Skrautvøl som hadde\nvore i byen på handel. So selde han ut alt han hadde\nmed heimanfrå, ogso hesten. Han gjekk no der i byen\nog ynskte seg fylgje heim. Då kom det ein framandkar\nakande i ein fin spisslede, og han sa at han skulde til\nValdres. Det vert råd til å få fylgje, let han. Skraut-\nvøls-mannen sette seg på bak, og i vegen bar det fortare\nenn fort gjennom lause lufti!\nDå dei kom eit stykke, singla det noko for hestehøvene.\nDå spurde Skrautvøls-mannen:\n\"Nei, ko va detta?\"\nDå svara skysskaren til:\n\"Detta va Vettlanda kyrkjespir, som me subba inni!\"\nSo køyrde dei inn til Mello. Og no slapp Skrautvøls-\nmannen vera med lenger. Og det var han nok glad for.\nDet hadde gått i fortaste laget.","source":"NFL 75, s. 37f","category":"ml5005","place":"Nord-Aurdal","events":[{"id":"NO-237-E01","start":376,"end":429,"span":"i vegen bar det fortare\nenn fort gjennom lause lufti!","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Bodily high-speed transit explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-237-E02","start":453,"end":485,"span":"singla det noko for hestehøvene.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unidentified sound source","evidence":"Nei, ko va detta?","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.93,"lon":9.35,"label":"Nord-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN350","id":"SIN350","collection":"NO","title":"SIN350","text":"Bøsje (Bergsjø) er to gårdær i Høllann. Husmann'n på de' ene hadde gått å pløgd om høsten. Så kåm dåttera te jutil'n ut å tok denna plaukar'n å ælt sammen å beita i førkle sett å jikk inn te far sin me' i bærje', å tedde far sin de' ho hadde fønni ute på jorde'. Å da hadde far hennes sakt de' atte \"Nei, gå ut på jorde igjen me' de' du båne' mett, får de' er di som ske regjere verden etter åss, de',\" sa'n.\nMen de' her var vel føre'n Adam tente på Kløv, å ho Eva var husjomfru på Saksegård!","source":"NFS Elin D. Holter Frøyset og Helge Frøyset 4, s. 33","category":"ml5015","place":"Eidsberg","events":[{"id":"NO-238-E01","start":122,"end":176,"span":"tok denna plaukar'n å ælt sammen å beita i førkle sett","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Seized/carried human; dialect action ambiguous; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"jorde'","environment":"field","time":"om høsten","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.53,"lon":11.37,"label":"Eidsberg","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN359","id":"SIN359","collection":"NO","title":"SIN359","text":"Ein gong va dar ein mann som hadde bygt fjøsen sin\noppyve ei huldrestøve. Kynne hass spente so han fekk\nikkje mjelkja utu dei. Og ikkje mjelka dei stort helde. Då\nva dar ei huldre som synte seg før'ånå og sa at når kynne\nhass vatna, då rann det nedyve dei som va onde. So had-\nde dei fortrølla dei. Ja, mannen hadde'kje anna å gjere\nheld flytte fjøsen. Då fekk han god lukke.","source":"NFL 78, s. 117","category":"ml5075","place":"Hyen","events":[{"id":"NO-239-E01","start":170,"end":201,"span":"ei huldre som synte seg før'ånå","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"fjøsen","environment":"stable","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.73568,"lon":5.9148,"label":"Hyen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN373","id":"SIN373","collection":"NO","title":"Bytingar","text":"Bytingar.\nMannen min, han Karl, var fødd innpå Finnskoge inne ved\nsvenskegrensa. Bestemor hans var finsk. Ein gong gjekk det\nso underleg te med ein liten unge ho hadde fått. Han tok te med\nå liggje å nigråte alle netter. Og so vart han so rar tå seg.\nHan gret ikkje som andre ungar. Det berre kvæste i han. Un-\ngen vart mest som ein byting. At det var bytt ungar ved ho, var\ngreitt. Ei haugafolk-kjerring måtte ha gjort det. Dei vart meir\nog meir visse i trui um det. Dette laut det rådbøtast på. Ho\nkom då ihug ei gamal råd ho hadde høyrt. So tok ho, som mor\nskulde vera, ein mjuk pisk, og so piska ho denne vesle ungen.\nOg det gjorde ho tre torsdagskveldar på rad. Då ho nett var\nferdig med dette tredje torsdagskvelden, kom det brått te henne\nei kjerring med ei liten unge på armen. Denne kasta ho inn over\ngolvet og kneip att den andre ungen. Og dermed sa ho det då\nho tok ungen:\n\"Å tvy vørte de! Du ha mishandla ungin vår, du, men mø ha\nvøre snille ve din, mø.\"\nSoleis fekk ho endeleg att sin eigen unge!\nDei gamle brukte mykje det at dei tok ein sylvskilling og\nsydde inn i den eine enden på den listi som dei reiva småe ungar\nmed. Det skulde vera fordi det ikkje skulde hende dei noko\nvondt. Dette tala han Karl um ofte. Dei brukte elles denne skik-\nken her i bygdi med. Det var mykje rart for i tidi du! Å ja!","source":"NFL 45, s. 22f","category":"ml5085","place":"Nord-Aurdal","events":[{"id":"NO-240-E01","start":251,"end":306,"span":"Han gret ikkje som andre ungar. Det berre kvæste i han.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unusual sound/identity inference","evidence":"Han gret ikkje som andre ungar","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Identity inference belongs to family, acoustic difference explicit; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-240-E02","start":591,"end":621,"span":"so piska ho denne vesle ungen.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated three Thursday evenings; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"alle netter","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.93,"lon":9.35,"label":"Nord-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN379","id":"SIN379","collection":"NO","title":"SIN379","text":"På Dypedal, i et hus som lå like innunder fjellet, hadde man\nen bytting i gamle dager. Det er en fjellkløft like ved, og ut av\nden kom det engang en bergkjerring og tok med sig den lille\nungen på gården. Sin egen unge la hun igjen, men den var så\nbesværlig at kona visste ikke sin arme råd. Endelig fikk hun\nda det råd at hun skulde slå den 3 torsdagskvelder på rad. Det\ngjorde hun, og den siste kvelden kom bergkjerringa. Hun\nhadde nok hørt den forskrekkelige skrikingen og jamringen. \"Så\nslem har ikke jeg vært mot ditt barn som du er med mitt,\" sa\nhun, \"her har du ungen din.\" Så tok hun sin egen unge med\nsig igjen, og kona var sjeleglad over å få tilbake den riktige\nungen sin. Den blev døpt, men \"en raring var han alle sine\ndager\".","source":"NFL 39, s. 20","category":"ml5085","place":"Hvaler","events":[{"id":"NO-241-E01","start":322,"end":381,"span":"hun skulde slå den 3 torsdagskvelder på rad. Det\ngjorde hun","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Executed contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-241-E02","start":423,"end":485,"span":"Hun\nhadde nok hørt den forskrekkelige skrikingen og jamringen.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Hearing attributed with nok (presumably); experiencer bergkjerringa, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Dypedal","environment":"domestic interior","time":"3 torsdagskvelder på rad","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.07,"lon":10.98,"label":"Hvaler","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN383","id":"SIN383","collection":"NO","title":"Bytingen på Åram","text":"Bytingen på Åram\nPå Åram i Langfjorden hadde dei ein gong fått ein byt-\ning. No er det slik med bytingom at dei ikkje talar, og kan\nein få dei til å tale er ein kvitt dei. - Bytingen voks og\ntreivst, men tale fekk dei han ikkje til, endå dei brukte al-\nleslags råder.\nJau - so raka dei på ei skrøne: Dei sa at kongen skul-\nde kome te Åram. Og so tok dei til å bryggje øl til kongen\nkom. 0g dei ståka, og styrde og streva vekk, so overlag,\nalle saman for å få detta brygget til.\nMen då dei skulde te sjå - so hadde dei bryggja berre\nti ei kråkeskjel. Men då syntest bytingen det gjekk for\nvidt, og so sa han:\n\"So stort eit ståss å so lite eit brygg he I allder set!\"\nMen so kom han vekk au då.","source":"NFL 30, s. 74","category":"ml5085","place":"Romsdal, Vistdal","events":[{"id":"NO-242-E01","start":204,"end":231,"span":"tale fekk dei han ikkje til","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated absence of speech, not perceptual uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-242-E02","start":609,"end":664,"span":"So stort eit ståss å so lite eit brygg he I allder set!","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Quoted comparison of present view with previous experience; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Åram","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.52,"lon":8.02,"label":"Romsdal, Vistdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN408","id":"SIN408","collection":"NO","title":"SIN408","text":"Det var ei gjente oppi bygda som tussen hang så etter at\nho fekk aldri vera i fred. Ho var i lag med tussen med jamnan.\nSå var det ei ku der på stella som var så fæl til å stå og raute\npå fjøset. Mor til gjenta sa da det:\n\"Når du kjem ut for tussen att, skal du spørja hå vi\nskal gjøra med denna kua som står og garvar og rautar så\nstøtt.\"\nGjenta råka tussen, og spurte'n etter det.\n\"Du skal ta vivang og tysbast og rekkel-rakkel og brenne\nom ho med det,\" svara han.\nDa gjenta kom heimatt, var ho borti åsen og fant tysbast,\nvivangen fant ho etter jordesgardane. Så hadde ho tjiru (tjøre)\npå detta og sette varme på. Men så brente ho om sei sjøl og\nikkje om kua. Da tussen kom, kunde han ikkje komma innåt\ngjenta. Da vart han så sinna at han drog til fjøset og vridde\nhugu tå den beste kua døm åtte.","source":"NFL 27, s. 35f","category":"ml6000","place":"Sigdal","events":[{"id":"NO-243-E01","start":172,"end":194,"span":"stå og raute\npå fjøset","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"fjøset","environment":"stable","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.05,"lon":9.6,"label":"Sigdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN411","id":"SIN411","collection":"NO","title":"SIN411","text":"På ein gard var det ei gjente som var so utsett for ein hauga-\nkar. Han kom til henne - mest um nettene - og vilde inn\npå henne. Ho vilde ikkje vita tå han. Tilslutt visste ho ikkje\nsi arme råd. Men det var ei tenkt gjente, dette, skal du høyre.\nEin kveld kom haugakaren att rekande. Då sa ho:\n\"Han far har ei kvige so dei underjordiske vil fara me. Veit\ndu noko rå før de?\"\nDå svara haugakaren:\n\"Burt i Helestrøndbøkko finne du tybast o vidvank. Tybast'n\nska du binde på fot'n åt kyr'n. Vivank'n ska du røykji ikring\nho me. Gjere du so, sko dei nøkk ikkji ha makt me 'n meir!\"\nGjenta tok rådi åt seg sjølv.\nEin kveld haugakaren kom att sa han:\n\"No ha du brukt råe e ga de. Men hadde e visst at du\nhadde nytta ho sjøl, so ha e visst ikkji tala um de te de.\"\nÅ ja, det var vel som ventande var, det! Men frå den da-\ngen vart no gjenta kvitt karen, ho!","source":"NFL 55, s. 44","category":"ml6000","place":"Vang","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Smoke treatment without explicit smell or felt effects; no modality inferred.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.13,"lon":8.55,"label":"Vang","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN418","id":"SIN418","collection":"NO","title":"SIN418","text":"Det var paa ein staule i Sauherad. Gjenta paa staulen var forlova. Det sje vera tasseri paa den staulen, og guten var redd for gjenta si. So tok han byrsa og strauk oppyve. Daa han kom paa staulen, var der fullt med paasala hestar ute og fullt med folk inne. So løynde han seg inn til selet, og daa høyrde han kor dei prata med dei klædde bruri. Han høyrde dei sa med kvarandre: \"No veit eg kje me hev att anna å gjera med ho, enn aa vrengje augo\". So skaut han. Daa kom dei stormande ut og tok hestane, og han in i selet. Der sat ho so fælt paaklædd med sylv og silke at det lavde. Daa kom det att to og bad um dei maatte faa att det dei hadde klædt paa henne. Men det negta han. Dei trygla og sa: \"Me hev laant sylvet me, liksom de gjer i slike høve\". Men han negta aa skaffe det attende. Daa dei ikkje kunde faa noko, gjekk dei. Den eine snudde seg i dynni og sa: \"Um dei vert aldri so rike paa Klevar, so skal kje alle bli so vise\".\nDet hev seinare støtt vore ein tulling paa Klevar i den ætti.\nDet tusse-sylvet var lenge paa Klevar. Far saag ein gut som gjekk med halsknappar av det sylvet.","source":"NFS Lars Lid 2, s. 13","category":"ml6005","place":"Hjartdal","events":[{"id":"NO-245-E01","start":299,"end":345,"span":"høyrde han kor dei prata med dei klædde bruri.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-245-E02","start":346,"end":448,"span":"Han høyrde dei sa med kvarandre: \"No veit eg kje me hev att anna å gjera med ho, enn aa vrengje augo\".","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-245-E03","start":1038,"end":1095,"span":"Far saag ein gut som gjekk med halsknappar av det sylvet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later father's corroborative observation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ein staule i Sauherad","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.6,"lon":8.65,"label":"Hjartdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN420","id":"SIN420","collection":"NO","title":"SIN420","text":"Op i Øier i Gulbrandsdalen er en Gar, som hedder Skaai. Der hendte det engang for mange Aar att i Tia, at e Jente sad ud i Skogen en Efta med Krøttera, og Sømmen sin hadd'a me sig. Jenta va Fæsterpie til Sønnen paa Gaaren og vakker var a. Som a sat og sydde, saa kom der fire Karfolk, men alle va de smaa, og den ene var gillere end de andre og han bar Brurstads og e Brurkrone saa urimeli gild aa blank, at aller hadd' 'a sett Sligt. \"Aa leg fra dei Saxa di\", sa'han som Brurgom vilde væra. Men Jenta vilde inte lægge fra sei Saxa si. Aa dem ba' aa dem trugde, men Saxa vilde a inte sleppe. Da tog dem Jenta aa vilde klæ' paa a Brurstasen, aa Krona sætte dem paa a. men da dem skulle trække paa a Kjolen, saa kunde dem inte faa ind den ene Ærma. Fæhunden han søkte aa stridde, men dæ brydde dem sei inte om, men de trak aa di strævde like fuldt. Da rendte Fæhunden hem til Gaaren, aa gnistred aa bar sæg, aa Fæstingen han trudde det var Noe paa færde med Krøttera, aa han foer da afsted med Hunden, men Børsa tok en mæ sæg. Aa da 'n kom dit Jenta sat, saa hadde dem endda inte faatt paa den ene Ærme. Da skaut en af Givære sit over Huge paa dem, men da skullde du hørt for en Jammer aa Graat, aa borte vart dem me de samma. Men Jenta satt atte med Brurkrona. Den Krona var i lange Tider paa Skaai, aa alle Brurer paa Garen saa bar dei den. Krona var ta de fineste Søll me Sølier aa Ringer aa saa fiint var de arbedd, at Sligt kan dem inte gjøra no for Tia. Underste Ringen ta Krona fins endda paa Garen, aa brukes til Pand-Ring paa Brurene.","source":"NFS Var Fb 14,10 (P. Chr. Asbjørnsen)","category":"ml6005","place":"Gudbrandsdalen","events":[{"id":"NO-246-E01","start":366,"end":434,"span":"e Brurkrone saa urimeli gild aa blank, at aller hadd' 'a sett Sligt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-246-E02","start":813,"end":846,"span":"de trak aa di strævde like fuldt.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Clothing forced onto girl; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-246-E03","start":885,"end":904,"span":"gnistred aa bar sæg","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misinterpreted source event","evidence":"Fæstingen han trudde det var Noe paa færde med Krøttera","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-246-E04","start":1151,"end":1192,"span":"da skullde du hørt for en Jammer aa Graat","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Skogen","environment":"forest","time":"en Efta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.5,"lon":9.5,"label":"Gudbrandsdalen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN424","id":"SIN424","collection":"NO","title":"SIN424","text":"Uppi Høgesyn (eit fjell) budde han Trond i Høgesyn. Um joleaftan måtte folket på Garde (ogso kalla Åberg) fara burt, for då kom Trond og fylgjet hans og heldt gjestebod. Men ein jolaftan kom det ein fatigmann på garden og bad um hus. Då sa bonden det: \"Mø ha ikkje hus sjølve, mø, i natt,\" sa han. \"Dè è dè sama dè, får e berre liggji her lell, e\". - Det fekk han. Då kvelden kom, for folket på Garde ut. No hadde framandkaren med seg ein hund. Han låg under omnen. Sjølv la framandkaren seg uppi den øvre sengi. Då det leid utpå kvelden kom Trond i Høgesyn med fylgjet sitt, han. Då Trond kom, sa 'n: \"Uff, de lufta Kristimanns blod her!\" sa 'n og sette nasen i veret. Han Trond sette seg då i høgsætet, og det vart stort gilde med dei.\nDei som var med han Trond, ofra te han og sa: \"Dette øfra e på 'n Trond!\" Då skaut han som låg i sengen og sa: \"Ja, dette øfra e på 'n Trond!\" So sa han te hunden: \"Lea de no Kvite-Bjødn!\" Hunden fauk upp og jaga dei tå Garde.\nÅret etter kom dei utpå Høgesyn og ropte nedpå garden: \"E 'n Kvite-Bjødn der enno?\" - Då svara dei: \"Ja, no ligge 'n sjølv sjuande unde øvne\". - \"Tvi vørte då dikka! Då koma me alder te Åbjør meir.\" -","source":"NFS Knut Hermundstad 7, s. 32f","category":"ml6015","place":"Nord-Aurdal","events":[{"id":"NO-247-E01","start":603,"end":638,"span":"Uff, de lufta Kristimanns blod her!","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer Trond; label explicitly quoted.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-247-E02","start":965,"end":1018,"span":"Året etter kom dei utpå Høgesyn og ropte nedpå garden","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later group calls from mountain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Garde","environment":"domestic interior","time":"jolaftan","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","smell"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.93,"lon":9.35,"label":"Nord-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN437","id":"SIN437","collection":"NO","title":"SIN437","text":"I Nordereng (Lausgarda, S, Land) budde det nokre gamle. Dei var jamt ihop med underjordiske. Ein dag kona sat og baka, kom det inn ein liten gut og bad om ein brødleiv. Ho la ein leiv på hovudet hans. På eit vis vart guten hindra i røra seg. Og med han stod slik, tok det til å vogsa og ropa ute: \"Vått! Vått!\" sa det. Guten svara: \"Je standa bunden\".\nKor dette meir fauk av, veit eg ikkje å seia deg.\nDet er liggjande ei diger steinrøys ved husa der i Nordereng.","source":"NFS Ragnvald Mo 15, s. 27","category":"ml6010","place":"Søndre Land","events":[{"id":"NO-248-E01","start":169,"end":241,"span":"Ho la ein leiv på hovudet hans. På eit vis vart guten hindra i røra seg.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unexplained immobility","evidence":"På eit vis vart guten hindra i røra seg","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Movement obstruction explicit; mechanism unspecified.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-248-E02","start":264,"end":295,"span":"tok det til å vogsa og ropa ute","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Vogsa dialect difficulty; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Nordereng","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Ein dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.6976,"lon":10.35096,"label":"Søndre Land","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN458","id":"SIN458","collection":"NO","title":"SIN458","text":"Han Lars Knutson Kvisl skulde paa hesteleiting. Han skulde ha hestane te fløta attpaa stølen med. Daa han kom uppaa Fjellstølsletta, kom det paa han ei tyngd, so han laut leggja seg beint ned. Og han sovna med ein gong. Daa han hadde sove ei stund, høyrde han det skreik so kvelt gjenom svevnen:\n\"Hestadn dine gaar paa Bøastøle!\" sa det.\nBøastølen ligg paa vestsida aat Nøre-Synda. Han Lars spratt straks upp og gjekk beinast på Bøastølen, og der gjekk hestane hans, nett som det var sagt te han.","source":"NFS Knut Hermundstad 2, s. 161f","category":"ml6025","place":"Vestre Slidre","events":[{"id":"NO-249-E01","start":133,"end":192,"span":"kom det paa han ei tyngd, so han laut leggja seg beint ned.","modalities":["pressure","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-249-E02","start":249,"end":294,"span":"høyrde han det skreik so kvelt gjenom svevnen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sleep-state perception; source unknown but doubt not explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Fjellstølsletta","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.03,"lon":8.87,"label":"Vestre Slidre","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN461","id":"SIN461","collection":"NO","title":"SIN461","text":"Den sommarn, e hadde n Pær liten (1863), e aatte n 3 viku fyri Jønsøkk, o kristna va n før e reiste paa støln, daa rofte dæ so skjili paa me ein mørgo. Dæ va slikt skjenvær. E vilde upp tile o løyse kjydne, dei vilde kji beite længer enn te hældugurs (klukka 9), som takste støtt æ i slikt skjen. So rofte dæ so skjili: Anne! E vakna taa di o sto upp, gjikk ut o leitte ve alle hus, men følk fanst ikkji der. E hadde om kvælden førr sagt te n Guro Brenn, husmannskjæringen vaar, att sjaa dei e søv førlængji om morgon, faar væsle gjænta hænne kåma springanne o vækkji me. E sporde ette, om dæ va hona, som hadde roft, mæn ho hadde søve te innaat hældugurd, naa dæ lei te binde inn kjydne.","source":"NFS Hans Flaten 1, s. 5","category":"ml6025","place":"Hemsedal","events":[{"id":"NO-250-E01","start":297,"end":340,"span":"So rofte dæ so skjili: Anne! E vakna taa di","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"uncorroborated caller","evidence":"følk fanst ikkji der","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Waking-transition call, not necessarily dream.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-250-E02","start":352,"end":408,"span":"gjikk ut o leitte ve alle hus, men følk fanst ikkji der.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed search","evidence":"men følk fanst ikkji der","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Search reception contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"paa støln","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"ein mørgo","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"The summer when I had little Pær (1863) — I gave birth to him three weeks before Jønsøkk, and he had been christened before I went to the mountain dairy — someone called out so clearly to me one morning. It was such ‘skjenvær’ [weather term unresolved]. I wanted to get up early and let the cows out; they would not graze beyond hældugurs (nine o'clock), as was always the case in such ‘skjen’. Then someone called out so clearly: ‘Anne!’ I woke at that, got up, went out and searched around all the buildings, but there was no one there. The evening before, I had told Guro Brenn, our cotter's wife, that if I slept too long in the morning, her little girl should come running to wake me.\n\nI asked whether she had been the one who called, but she had slept until nearly nine o'clock, when it was time to bring the cows in and tie them up.","translationNotes":["REVIEW REQUIRED: the dialectal weather terms 'skjenvær/skjen' are retained; 'fine weather' was not established. The original gives nine o'clock for 'hældugurs'. 'Kjydne' refers to cows, not calves. Birth, not ownership, is meant in the opening. Unsupported regional dialect attribution removed.","The unsuccessful search is in part 1/2. This part preserves the subsequent inquiry and the girl's reported sleep until nearly nine, not exactly nine."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":60.7936,"lon":8.69202,"label":"Hemsedal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"NO-250-E01","start":395,"end":453,"span":"Then someone called out so clearly: ‘Anne!’ I woke at that","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"uncorroborated caller","evidence":"følk fanst ikkji der","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Waking-transition call, not necessarily dream.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"So rofte dæ so skjili: Anne! E vakna taa di","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"NO-250-E02","start":463,"end":538,"span":"went out and searched around all the buildings, but there was no one there.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed search","evidence":"men følk fanst ikkji der","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Search reception contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"gjikk ut o leitte ve alle hus, men følk fanst ikkji der.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN467","id":"SIN467","collection":"NO","title":"Komen ut av dagetalet","text":"Komen ut av dagetalet.\nDet er fortalt at det budde ein mann fram på Berkvam, og han visste ikkje kor langt det lei til jol. So vilde han heim til Sønnarheim og spørja tidi. Då han kom heimigjenom, datt han på ei hella, og høyrde einkvan ropa og læ: \"Reis deg uppatt, reis deg uppatt, du flatekaka, du har korkje bryggja elde baka! Det er netene tvo og dagane tri til joli!\" Han reiste heim til Sønnarheim og spurde, og det høvde nettupp som han hadde høyrt.","source":"NFS Lars Os 1, s. 63f","category":"ml6030","place":"Aurland","events":[{"id":"NO-251-E01","start":197,"end":217,"span":"datt han på ei hella","modalities":["touch","balance"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Fall/impact explicit, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-251-E02","start":222,"end":247,"span":"høyrde einkvan ropa og læ","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":"heim til Sønnarheim"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.9,"lon":7.18,"label":"Aurland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN479","id":"SIN479","collection":"NO","title":"Huldrene var med i krigen","text":"Huldrene var med i krigen.\nDei fortel, at når det var krig, var huldrene med. I Luster skulde dei høyra trumbeslåtten deira ut gjenom fjorden, når dei drog ut. Når krigen var slutt, høyrde dei trumbeslåtten kom innetter fjorden. Dei var dei fyrste som drog ut i krigen, og dei fyrste som kom att. Svenskane skulde ha sagt at nordmennene var fleire i røyndi enn i syndi.\nEingong var det dans på Langateig. Det var nett fyre ufreden i 1807. So var det nokre som gjekk ut or dansestova. Då høyrde dei trumbeslått frametter fjellbruni. Mannen i huset gjekk då innatt i dansestova og sa: \"No er det ikkje lenge fyrr det vert ufred.\" Dagen etter kom utkommanderingi.","source":"NFS Sjur Bøyum 1, s. 21","category":"ml6040","place":"Balestrand","events":[{"id":"NO-252-E01","start":87,"end":141,"span":"skulde dei høyra trumbeslåtten deira ut gjenom fjorden","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic outward sound movement.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-252-E02","start":182,"end":228,"span":"høyrde dei trumbeslåtten kom innetter fjorden.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic return sound.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-252-E03","start":484,"end":531,"span":"Då høyrde dei trumbeslått frametter fjellbruni.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Specific episode before war in 1807; Langateig.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.2,"lon":6.52,"label":"Balestrand","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN48","id":"SIN48","collection":"NO","title":"SIN48","text":"Helst synte styggen seg som ein svart hund. Han Knut\nToreson i Hagaset såg honom nok, han, i eit kortspellag\npå Smiugardo ein gong.\nKortspel var den tid ei stor synd, og så hadde dei dertil\nspelt heile natti, karane.\nPå morgonsida bøygde han Knut seg ned under bordet;\ndet var eit korteblad som hadde dotti ned, og då ser han\nein ramsvart hund, som sit og ringar klørne ikring bord-\nfoten.\nDet vart tvert slutt med kortspelet på karo, \"o de va siste\ngonge e spelte kort,\" sa han Knut, han fortalde dette.","source":"NFL 77, s.58","category":"ml3015","place":"Etnedal","events":[{"id":"NO-253-E01","start":315,"end":389,"span":"då ser han\nein ramsvart hund, som sit og ringar klørne ikring bord-\nfoten.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Smiugardo","environment":"domestic interior","time":"På morgonsida","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.0,"lon":9.5,"label":"Etnedal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN489","id":"SIN489","collection":"NO","title":"Tusshjelp i skurdonna","text":"Tusshjelp i skurdonna.\nPå ein gard i Gauldal var det så lite arbeidshjelp til skurd-\nonna. Mannen såg det heile vonlaust. Åkeren var skjerande,\nog konnet ville ta skade om han vart ståande lenger. Ein kveld\nvar mannen ute og såg på åkeren. Det mona så lite det vesle\nhan sjøl vann på. Han snakka for seg sjøl og klaga og bar seg.\nMorgonen etter da han kom ut var heile åkeren skoren, men\nbanda var ikkje bundne. Bendil-emnet låg ved sia av kvart\nband. Borti ein haug ropa eit grannt mål:\n- Det æ skjørre men itt bøtte.\nMannen gjekk da laus på å binda sjøl, og han fekk berga\nåkeren sin.\nSkurdfolket hans var av eit slag som ikkje kunne gjera\nkorsteiknet. Derfor vart dei i beit for å binda. Tussane hadde\nvori hjelpsame i eit knipetak.","source":"NFL 87, s. 79","category":"ml6035","place":"Gauldalen","events":[{"id":"NO-254-E01","start":211,"end":239,"span":"mannen ute og såg på åkeren.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-254-E02","start":452,"end":486,"span":"Borti ein haug ropa eit grannt mål","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Next morning; fine/thin voice explicitly characterised.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"åkeren","environment":"field","time":"Ein kveld","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.96809,"lon":10.96748,"label":"Gauldalen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN497","id":"SIN497","collection":"NO","title":"SIN497","text":"I Juvasfjedde budde folk, aa tileg ein moraan O. gjekk mæ børsaa ha dei slept ut ein stut. So høyrde han tvo gjentu som tala aa den eine tala ti den andra aa sa at dei laut kadde inn att stuten for der va ein som gjekk mæ eit spjut. Nei, svara den hi, den turte ho inkje fæla for, han hadde 'kje tveie seg. Dette sto O. aa høyrde paa. So tek han ne i grase å doggja aa tvo seg i anlitet aa skaut stuten. Sia høyrde han koss den eina kadda:\nRingaal, Ringaal Rysingstuten.\nOg den hi svara:\nDu tar inkje kadda\ndu tar inkje kadda\nfer Ringaal e fadden for spjute.","source":"NFS Knut Liestøl 2, s. 32f","category":"ml6060","place":"Åseral","events":[{"id":"NO-255-E01","start":94,"end":124,"span":"høyrde han tvo gjentu som tala","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-255-E02","start":338,"end":386,"span":"tek han ne i grase å doggja aa tvo seg i anlitet","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Dew contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-255-E03","start":404,"end":438,"span":"Sia høyrde han koss den eina kadda","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Juvasfjedde","environment":"mountain","time":"tileg ein moraan","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.5,"lon":7.33,"label":"Åseral","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN503","id":"SIN503","collection":"NO","title":"SIN503","text":"På Tovestul i Heddal va dæ eit berg omafe stulen og der budde huldre. So ropa ho tvo torsdagskveller i ra og spurde, um dem ville bytte bort stuten sin, ho va i bejt fe ein stut må veta. So spurde jentunne ein gamal mann, som heitte Jon, kva dei skulde svårå. \"Segj ja\" sa 'n. Og da so huldri spurde trie torsdagskvellen, so svårå dem ja. Da ble stuten borte, men da dæ leid mot kvellen og dem ha'e stellt ifrå seg, så kom dæ ei svær gild ku. So ville dem kasta stål ive hennar, men so sa' huldri dæ, att dæ tor dem ikkje, ho va væl unnt sa ho. Og av dæ slagjet æ dæ kyr enno.","source":"NFS Moltke Moe 2, s. 13f","category":"ml6055","place":"Heddal","events":[{"id":"NO-256-E01","start":73,"end":105,"span":"ropa ho tvo torsdagskveller i ra","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated call consolidated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Tovestul i Heddal","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"tvo torsdagskveller i ra","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.58081,"lon":9.10888,"label":"Heddal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN512","id":"SIN512","collection":"NO","title":"SIN512","text":"Bratten reiste ein gong til fjells og vilde fiska. Mange huldre bruka å fiska i det vatnet. Der var mykje fisk. Bratten fekk fort vekk; men fisken vart burte etter kvart. Han hadde gløymt å opna kjeften på fyrste fisken og sputta nedi og nemna Guds namn. Huldrene tok alt nett etter-kvart. Han vart so fortredige for dette her og lova at han skulde gjera dei eit prett.\nHan gjekk på kyrkjegarden og samla ein heil del med mold. So gjekk han uppatt til vatnet og strødde mold rundt heile vatnet. Då hadde ikkje huldrene makt til fiska der. Dei vart leide for dette og gjekk til han og spurde um han ikkje vilde skrapa burt eit lite stykke med mold, so det vart eit led, so dei kunde fiska der. Han skulde då få fiska fritt. Det gjorde han, og fekk sidan fiska som han vilde.","source":"NFS Kjell Bondevik 1, s. 8f","category":"ml6065","place":"Sogndal","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.23,"lon":7.1,"label":"Sogndal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN517","id":"SIN517","collection":"NO","title":"SIN517","text":"Det var eingong ein mann som skulde til Geitsdalen til stølen sin. Då han kom upp til Geitsdalsfossen, ropte det til han: \"Du skal segja det med ho Turid at han Tarald er daud\".\nDå han hadde lagt seg um kvelden, fortalde han kona det han hadde høyrt. Då sette det i å yla og gråta i selet. Um morgonen synte huldri seg, og bad kona stella og akta beisti med ho var i gravferdi til mannen sin. Då vart alt huldrestellet synleg. Det stod eit fint rosemåla koppalad millom koppane til den andre budeia, beisti var blårosute. Kona akta beisti vel, og då ho Turid kom att, gav ho rikeleg løn for arbeidet.","source":"NFS Sjur Bøyum 5, s. 5f","category":"ml6070","place":"Jostedalen","events":[{"id":"NO-258-E01","start":103,"end":177,"span":"ropte det til han: \"Du skal segja det med ho Turid at han Tarald er daud\".","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-258-E02","start":251,"end":289,"span":"Då sette det i å yla og gråta i selet.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Later evening at hut, group witnesses contextual.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-258-E03","start":290,"end":318,"span":"Um morgonen synte huldri seg","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning at hut, wife experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-258-E04","start":393,"end":426,"span":"Då vart alt huldrestellet synleg.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"visibility change","evidence":"vart alt huldrestellet synleg","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Morning wife, formerly invisible property.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Geitsdalsfossen","environment":"waterfall","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.68,"lon":7.28,"label":"Jostedalen","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN529","id":"SIN529","collection":"NO","title":"SIN529","text":"Jeg vil fortelle om en man som hadde en fjøs med mange krætur i, og han tok av høiet i høilåven og gav dem, men det minket ikke. En nat låg han på vagt for at se, jo da han har ligget en stund, kom der nogen Nisser med hver sit fanga høi, men den siste bar bare et høistrå for han var så liten, men da sa manden, når han ikke bar mere end et strå skulde han ikke ha bryd sig om det. Da sa nisserne, ja, men han er bare en nat gammel, men når du ikke er fornøid med det så skal det bli mindre her efter, og det var sant det minket fort på låven hos manden og han blei snart fri for høi.","source":"NFS Varia 1, 2, s. 12","category":"ml7005","place":"Værøy","events":[{"id":"NO-259-E01","start":194,"end":272,"span":"kom der nogen Nisser med hver sit fanga høi, men den siste bar bare et høistrå","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit preceding vigil for at se licenses scene; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"høilåven","environment":"barn","time":"En nat","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":67.67,"lon":12.67,"label":"Værøy","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN531","id":"SIN531","collection":"NO","title":"SIN531","text":"Hu bestemor fårtærte atte Lærber å Ask hadde nisse. - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -. Å så fårtærte a atte dom brukte å koke rømmegraut te nissa sine åsså bæra bort på låven søm han sku spise da, ser u. Å så fårtælte a om en, de sku væra enten på Ask eller Lærber, ei tenesjente der som var nokså spissburakti, ho hadde eti opp grauten får'n. Mæn de hadde bekåmmi a ille, får 'n hadde tii a å danse me a heile natta, så ho lå bevisstløs om mårrån. Å da hadde n søngi heile tia: \"Håffer åt du opp grauten for tomten du? Håffer - - for tomten du!\" Ja hu kåm sæ jenta ijen kven (?) ho var.","source":"NFS Amund B. Larsen jr. 25, B s. 5f","category":"ml7010","place":"Ringerike","events":[{"id":"NO-260-E01","start":398,"end":452,"span":"danse me a heile natta, så ho lå bevisstløs om mårrån.","modalities":["movement sensation","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Involuntary dance and loss of consciousness; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-260-E02","start":455,"end":481,"span":"da hadde n søngi heile tia","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"låven","environment":"barn","time":"heile natta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.29168,"lon":10.04879,"label":"Ringerike","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN535","id":"SIN535","collection":"NO","title":"SIN535","text":"En mand la klær og toplue ut til husnissen. Han tok klæa, men lua lot han ligge, den hadde han ikke bruk for.\nEn anden mand la ut klær, men glemte den store massingknappen i boksa. Nissen tok trøia men lot boksa ligge. Saa sydde manden i en svær massingknap aa la boksa ut igjen, da tok han den.\nEn mand som hadde en framifraa bra husnisse, vilde gjøre no aparta for ham, sydde klær av fint, overskøri vadmel, satte en svær massingknap i boksa og la ut.\nNissen tok klæa men gikk fra den dag sprade og tok ikke sine hænder i nogen ting i lang tid, han vilde ikke bøsse til de nye klæa. Da manden traf nissen i underlaaven og skjendte for hans efterlatenhet, bare lo han og sa: \"For fin\"! Aa, saa lik folk. Det nytter ikke aa gi nissen ekstra fine klær og helst bare et plag om gangen.","source":"NFS August Krogh 22, s.14","category":"ml7015","place":"Høland","events":[{"id":"NO-261-E01","start":657,"end":668,"span":"bare lo han","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"underlaaven","environment":"barn","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.75,"lon":11.62,"label":"Høland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN541","id":"SIN541","collection":"NO","title":"SIN541","text":"Fyste kyrkja i Vingelen skulde ha vore stavkyrkje. Det hadde\nvore sterk strid um kvar ho skulde staa. Sume vilde ha henne austi,\nmykje lenger aust enn der ho no staar, og vestbøndene vilde ha\nhenne lenger vest. Endeleg vart det til det at austgardane fekk\nsitt fram, og tømmeret vart framkøyrt og lagt austi. Men so ei natt\nfyre dei skulde til aa tømra, var alt tømmeret flutt, og so vart det\nso dei bygde kyrkje der tømmeret var. Det skulde ha vore tuft-\nkallane som hadde flutt tømmeret um natta.","source":"NFL 3, s. 28","category":"ml7060","place":"Tolga","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.40899,"lon":10.99877,"label":"Tolga","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN556","id":"SIN556","collection":"NO","title":"SIN556","text":"Ivelands Kirkeklokke er en gammel og god Kirkeklokke, hvor-\nom Sagnet siger, at det blev besluttet engang i Tiden, at den\nskulde flyttes til Evje Hovedkirke. Da de Kjørende vare komne\ntæt nedenfor Kirken til et lidet Tjærn, blev den saa tung, at den\nlaa som naglet til Stedet. Der blev spændt indtil 6 Heste for\nSlæden til ingen Nytte. Folk skjønnede da, at den ikke skulde\nflyttes. Da de vendte tilbage med den, kunde en Hest trække den.","source":"NFL 47, s. 8","category":"ml7070","place":"Oddernes","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Heavy bell and failed horse traction; no bodily perceiver or sensory predicate. Compare explicitly felt weight elsewhere.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.15,"lon":7.97,"label":"Oddernes","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN560","id":"SIN560","collection":"NO","title":"Hellig Olav og trollet","text":"Hellig Olav og trollet.\nEin gong skulle Hellig Olav byggja ei kjerke på nokre få\ndagar, og dersom han ikkje makta dette, så skulle han misse\nsonen sin.\nDa kom det eit troll til han og sa at det ville sette opp denne\nkjerka til rett tid. Men dette trollet kravde at kong Olav skulle\ngissa namnet til det, eller å gi det sol og måne - eller sonen sin.\nKongen gjekk med på dette. Arbeidet gjekk meir enn snøgt frå\nhand. Men Olav tok til å tykkja synd i sol og måne. Og enda\nverre ville det bli om han laut ut med sonen sin.\nKongen gjekk og tenkte og tenkte på dette. Åssen skulle\nhan få vita namnet på trollet?\nKvelden før kjerka skulle stå ferdig, gjekk kongen ut og\nkom til eit fjell. Inne i dette fjellet budde det ei trollkjerring,\nog kong Olav fekk høyra at ho song for den survutte ungen\nsin:\nTegj tegj, tullen min.\nI morgon kjem Arnfinn,\nfar din - -\nanten med sol og måne,\neller sonen\ntil Olav den vene.\nDa vart kong Olav meir enn glad. Næste dagen gjekk han til\ntrollet, som nå dreiv med å setja opp kjerkespiren. Da ropte\nkongen opp til byggmeisteren: - Nå er det nok, Arnfinn!\nDa ramla trollet ned og slo seg i hel med det same.","source":"NFL 98, s. 20f","category":"ml7065","place":"Eidskog","events":[{"id":"NO-264-E01","start":736,"end":790,"span":"kong Olav fekk høyra at ho song for den survutte ungen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"eit fjell","environment":"mountain","time":"Kvelden før kjerka skulle stå ferdig","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.02813,"lon":12.06528,"label":"Eidskog","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN585","id":"SIN585","collection":"NO","title":"SIN585","text":"Då Svartedauen kom til Nordfjord, såg folk han som\nein mann og ei kone. Mannen hadde rive, og kjerringa\n\"sovl\". På dei gardane der mannen brukte riva si, kom\ndet til å leve folk igjen. Men der kona brukte sopa, der\ndøydde alle. - I Stryn tok sotta livet av heile bygda. Den\neinaste som levde etter, var ei gjente på Stauri, som heit-\nte Siri. (Namnet Siri har fylgt Stauri-garden seinare.) -\nI Hornindalen var det óg berre eit einaste menneske som\nlevde att etter Svartedauen. Det skulle vere ein gut, og\nhan heitte Jon. Han tykte nok at det var uhugleg å verte\nverande i Hornindalen åleine. Og ein dag tok han ut på\nleiting, for å sjå um det ikkje skulle finnast folk i nabo-\nbygdene. Då han kom upp på fjellet Gullkoppen og kunne\nsjå ned i Stryn, såg han røyk i pipa på Stauri. Han var\nikkje sein um å kome seg ned dit. Men då han var komen\ninn på garden, kunne han ikkje skjøne kven det var som\nhadde kveikt eld: det var ikkje eit liv å sjå nokon stad.\nDet gjekk ei tid før han vart var ei ung gjente som hadde\ngøymt seg under ein bryggjeså. Det var ho Siri. Ho hadde\nvorte folkesky, avdi ho hadde vore så lenge åleine. Men\nsistpå vart dei nok vener og vel forlikte likevel. Og segna\nfortel at folket i Stryn ættar frå desse to - Siri og Jon\npå Stauri.","source":"NFL 78, s. 131f","category":"ml7090","place":"Stryn","events":[{"id":"NO-265-E01","start":34,"end":71,"span":"såg folk han som\nein mann og ei kone.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier generic group experience.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-265-E02","start":749,"end":779,"span":"såg han røyk i pipa på Stauri.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"On Gullkoppen, looking towards settlement.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-265-E03","start":916,"end":955,"span":"det var ikkje eit liv å sjå nokon stad.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed source corroboration","evidence":"kunne han ikkje skjøne kven det var som\nhadde kveikt eld","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-265-E04","start":981,"end":1044,"span":"vart var ei ung gjente som hadde\ngøymt seg under ein bryggjeså.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"hidden source located","evidence":"gøymt seg under ein bryggjeså","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.9,"lon":6.72,"label":"Stryn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN590","id":"SIN590","collection":"NO","title":"SIN590","text":"Hølersætre er ein skoggard, som ligg omlag ei halv mils\nveg sørvest for garden Ølmhus. Det er nok ein gamal gard.\nFør svartedauden budde det folk der. Den stygge sjuka tynte\nvisst kvart levande kreket. Dei fann att garden ei tid etter\nsvartedauden. Sume veit korleis det gjekk til. Ein mann fór\ngjennom skogen. Han var på veidn, er von. Rett som det var,\nråkte han inn på ein gard. Det er ikkje gjete om bygningen\nstod, eller om han var rotna ned. Men husrestar stod det i\nvissa. Då han gav seg til leite, fann han leivningar etter fleire\nbeinrangel etter folk, som var daude. Beini samla han i hop\nog fekk gravlagt dei i kristi jord.\nMannen sette no bu på heimen han hadde funne og gav han\nnamnet Hølersætre. Men det var ikkje ro å få nokon stad. Då\nfekk han ei råd. Han skulde gå stad grava opp att dei beini\nhan hadde flytt, og grava dei ned att der han hadde teke dei.\nSo vart gjort. Då vart det fred.","source":"NFL 55, s. 190","category":"ml7095","place":"Sør-Aurdal","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.78,"lon":9.37,"label":"Sør-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN591","id":"SIN591","collection":"NO","title":"Svartedauden","text":"Svartedauden.\nDå svartedauden gjekk, kom eingong ein mann til ein gard i\nØvre Vefsn, sume segjer det var Laksfors, og vilde ha skyss over\nelva. Mannen på garden skyna kva kar det var, og svara at\nskyssa honom skulde han gjera, berre han slapp fri svartedau-\nden. Framandmannen slo upp i ei stor bok han ha' med, og etter\nå ha bladd noko i henne, så sa han at det kunde han nok diverre\nikkje lova honom; men han kunde lova honom ein lett daude.\nMannen skyssa honom då over elva. Då han kom heim att,\nkjende han seg trøytt og la seg til å sova. Han sovna då for\naldri å vakna meir.\nFramandkaren som han skyssa, han fór ifrå gard til gard,\nog det segjest at han ha' ei riva og ein soplime med. På dei gardar\nder han raka framfor døra, der vart det ein og annan att;\nmen der han brukte soplimen, der døydde dei mann av huse. Og\nså vel brukte han limen, at då svartedauden var over, så rauk\ndet berre or tre murpipor i heile Vefsn.","source":"NFL 19, s. 170f","category":"ml7085","place":"Vefsn","events":[{"id":"NO-267-E01","start":499,"end":542,"span":"kjende han seg trøytt og la seg til å sova.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.85,"lon":13.18,"label":"Vefsn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN617","id":"SIN617","collection":"NO","title":"Gullringhola","text":"Gullringhola\nSet heitte han som rudde garden Setre i Tresfjord. Når\nhan gav frå seg, fekk tvo tå sonom kvar sin halvpart tå\ngarden, men tredje sonen, som heitte Sakse, rudde seg eit\nbruk i Sakselia, ovanfor Setre.\nHan Sakse var forlova, og skulde snart gifte seg. Men\nso vart han utkommandert i krigen. Og han vart so lenge\nvekk, at dei hadde syrgt han ut heime. - Når han endeleg\nkom heim att då, so var ho gift med ein annan, ho han\nskulde ha.\nDå han Sakse var heimkomen, og hadde fått høyrt om\ndette, gjekk han oppover åt Sakselia, og gjekk og såg på\nalt det han hadde gjort der. So gjekk han derifrå og bort-\nover åt Sakselifossen. Der tok han forlovelsesringen tå\nseg og kasta han nedi ei hole ti berget der, som sidan hev\nvorte heitande Gullringhola. - So bykste han sjølv på\nfossen og gjekk te der.","source":"NFL 30, s. 142f","category":"ml8005","place":"Tresfjord","events":[{"id":"NO-268-E01","start":538,"end":582,"span":"gjekk og såg på\nalt det han hadde gjort der.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Sakselia","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.52492,"lon":7.12579,"label":"Tresfjord","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN638","id":"SIN638","collection":"NO","title":"Svartaboki å guten","text":"Svartaboki å guten.\nDa va eingång ein doktar, so hadde svartaboki. Han hadde eingång launt ho kos te noki so budde eit stykje dar ifrau. Dau han vilde ha ho igjen, sendte han guten sin sta itte ho; men han skulde ikje ha lov te å læsa i ho. Men guten va inkje kommen langt mæ svartaboki, før han hadde huga te å sjau ini ho, å so tok han å opna ho å begjandte te å let inni ho, å han trefte nettop te å læsa da stykje so han løiste Sattan mæ. Sattan kom trast å spure guten, kå han skulde gjæra. Guten vidste no ikje noki annår rau, helde han måtte sæikja han te å rygja ei løift so kadlast Næsløifti. Sattan satte dau te mæ da arbeie, å guten sprang da vetla han va gote, men da va ikje længje før Sattan hadde naut guten igjen, å han spure guten pau nyt, kå han skulde gjæra. Han satte dau Sattan te, atte han skulde kasta op i røis dar tit ve, å detta va snart gjort for Sattan; å han gjik sta te guten igjen, å spure han, kå han skulde gjæra. Guten sætte han dau te, atte han skulde legja eit band au sand tvert auver fjoren. Sattan begjøndte no te å lægja bande, å guten sprang so fortaste so han orka, for at han skulde nau doktarn, førfør Sattan va ferdige mæ sit arbei. Men dau Sattan va kommen halvvæges, kom da ein storm so sleit tåge has au; han sprang dau for at nau igjen guten; men han naudde han inkje, før han sprang igjøno døri, å dau kasta guten boki bort te doktarn, so aublikkele bat han igjen.","source":"NFS Moltke Moe 39, s. 16f","category":"ml3020","place":"Sogn og Fjordane","events":[{"id":"NO-269-E01","start":340,"end":376,"span":"opna ho å begjandte te å let inni ho","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Looking into book; reading ordinary but visual predicate explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.18263,"lon":6.85258,"label":"Sogn og Fjordane","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN654","id":"SIN654","collection":"NO","title":"SIN654","text":"Ranveig Haugane har fortalt mig at det en gang var en kone paa Rabba som stod og rakte høi. Saa kom der en lop imot henne. Hun blev saa irritert herover at hun sa til loppen: \"Jeg faar vel være jormor for Dig\" og slog efter den. Efter at hun hadde sovnet om kvellen banket det paa og utenfor stod en ukjennt mann som ba hende være med til kona hans. Hun hadde jo lovet ham at være jormor for hende. Rabba-konen fulgte da med mannen. De kom igjennem mange kammers til et rum hvor det var lyst og hvor vedkommende kone laa. Efter heldig aa ha forløst hende gav mannen hende en geit i belønning. \"Men den faar Du fare vel med\".\nRanveig tilføiet at det gjeiteslaget hadde de paa Rabba endnu.","source":"NFS H. Delgobe 20, s. 69f","category":"ml5070","place":"Røldal","events":[{"id":"NO-270-E01","start":229,"end":280,"span":"Efter at hun hadde sovnet om kvellen banket det paa","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"At dwelling; sleep transition context.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.82,"lon":6.83,"label":"Røldal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN675","id":"SIN675","collection":"NO","title":"Hulder.","text":"Hulder.\nEin gut frå Ørsta var på jakt i Nupadalen. Det var seinhaustes. Leid på kvelden gjekk han inn på ei seter der. Han åt av nista og la seg so i senga.\nRett som det var kom der inn ei gamal kone. Ho bar ei full mjølkebøtte. So tok ho fram ringjer og skåler og sila mjølka i dei og sette på hyllene i selet.\nMedan gamlekona stulla med dette kom dotter hennar inn. Det var ei ung, ven gjente. Ho bar ein langeleik. So sette ho seg i benken framanfor senga der guten låg. No tok ho til å spela og syngja. Guten tykte han aldri hadde høyrt so ven song og slikt tryllande spel før. Gjenta flytte seg nærmare og nærmare senga medan ho spela. Guten låg lenge og høyrde på spelet.\nMen so vart han vill. Han treiv kniven or slira og kasta den over hovudet hennar. Gjenta vart som nåma. Men gamle-mor ropte: \"Ja, no fær du ha det som du hev gjort det til!\" So strauk ho på dør.\nMen gjenta sat att. Guten tok henne med seg heim og gifte seg med henne.\nDå brudlaupet skulde stå, sa gjenta at to rom i huset skulde stå ledige, då foreldra hennar vilde ha dei; men ingen fekk sjå dei.\nBrudlaupsmorgonen stod to blårosete kyr ute på tunet. Det var bruda si heimanfylgje. Og då bollen gjekk rundt bordet so gjestene fekk gi sine skålegåver var der komen ein hundraddalarsetel i skåla.\nElling Samuelsen Dimna i Ulstein ætta frå Ørsta. Han hadde alltid blårosete kyr. Han sa dei ætta frå huldrekyrne åt oldemor hans.","source":"NFS Martin Bjørndal 2, s. 89ff","category":"ml5090","place":"Ørsta","events":[{"id":"NO-271-E01","start":507,"end":581,"span":"Guten tykte han aldri hadde høyrt so ven song og slikt tryllande spel før.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Extended listening, moving musician, explicit aesthetic quality.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ei seter","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"seinhaustes","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.2,"lon":6.13,"label":"Ørsta","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN701","id":"SIN701","collection":"NO","title":"Svartebogen","text":"Svartebogen.\nSvartebogen skal være Forfatet paa en Skole i Vurtenberg i Tysland [sic] som kaltes for \"Nedgangs Skolen\". Medlemmerne paa denne Skole havde gjordt en Kontragt med Djævelen, for at faae Viisdom og Kunster fra han, skulde den siste som gik ud af Skolen tilhøre Djævelen. Det faldt paa en som hed Jørgen Vinter som skulde være fød paa Gaarden Vinterthun i Oddesogn i Hardanger. Da Jørgen Vinter var den siste der gik ud af Skolen og igjenem Døren kom Djævelen og vilde hente ham, ikke før jeg faar draget op Soken min (Hosen) svarte Jørgen Vinter Djævelen. Djævelen lod sig nøde der med da han tænkte det kunde ikke vare saa længe, men Jørgen Vinter lod Soken være nede.","source":"NFS P. Chr. Asbjørnsen 2, s. 12","category":"ml3000","place":"Hardanger","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.20379,"lon":6.41067,"label":"Hardanger","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN706","id":"SIN706","collection":"NO","title":"SIN706","text":"Plent som Peter Dass skal [presten] Rørdam ha gjenge på Nedgangsskulen i Wittenberg. Han åtte ogso svarteboki og kunde mana fanden. Ei helg han preikte i Odda, leitte drengen – som var heime på prestegarden – fram denne merkelege boki, segjer dei. Han var uheppen og kom til å lesa dei ordi som løyser hin-mannen. Med same stend Gamle-Eirik framfor honom, fløytande galen, og spør kva han vil. Prestedrengen er snøgg-tenkt. Han dreg vonom fyrr til rette ei tunna rug og segjer: \"No kann du telja denna kåddnonna, so fær du arbai ai stund.\" Gamlingen sette seg til. Medan gløste drengen i boki etter dei ordi som bind honom. Men han finn dæi ikkje, og best det er, stend Svarten framfyre honom og er arbeidslaus. \"Du fær ga neri præsta-fjøro å laga ait tåg tao sanden darnere,\" sa drengen. Hinmannen ned i fjøra til gjeremålet sitt. Men det vart ei heller vand vinna. Gamlingen gret, segjer dei. Medan stend Rørdam på preikestolen i Odda-kyrkja og preikar til ålmugen. Då med eitt kjenner han på seg at det er noko gale på ferde heime. Fyrst tenesta er til ende, bed han presteskjussen ro honom heim snøggast han vinn. Då båten legg til prestebryggja, har hinmannen nett fenge tog-stubben ferdig. Men no bind presten honom, og fåren er yver. Toget la dei upp på kyrkjelemen, og der vert det liggjande i mange år. So kom folk til å tenkja på at det var ikkje kristeleg å ha eit slikt djevels verk i Guds hus. So kasta dei det utfor prestebryggja, og der skal det liggja den dag i dag.","source":"NFS Halldor Opedal 1, s. 8f","category":"ml3020","place":"Hardanger","events":[{"id":"NO-273-E01","start":571,"end":646,"span":"gløste drengen i boki etter dei ordi som bind honom. Men han finn dæi ikkje","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed visual search","evidence":"Men han finn dæi ikkje","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-273-E02","start":867,"end":881,"span":"Gamlingen gret","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.20379,"lon":6.41067,"label":"Hardanger","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN707","id":"SIN707","collection":"NO","title":"SIN707","text":"Bort i Øvre-Sørflate va dæ Svartkonstbok, sa dei. \"Sørflatinge\" kalla dei Mann', so aatte den. Han va Far te Knut i Sve'e o te 'n Ola \"Aafeten\" [?], so døe i 1880 Aaro.\nEi Gong han va borte paa Støle sine, hadde dei, heime va fønne Svartkonstbokje o hadde lese i henne o løyst den vonde. Dæmæ førsto væl Sørflatinge, at dæ sto gale te o strauk heimatt. Daa 'n kom fram i Skalsbakkadn, saag 'n alle, so va utløyste. Daa laut 'n slaa ut ei Tynne mæ Rug før aa sæta dei [i] Arbei, te han fekk bønde dei. O bøndne vart dei.","source":"NFS Thomas Barth, s. 53f","category":"ml3020","place":"Sør-Aurdal","events":[{"id":"NO-274-E01","start":385,"end":414,"span":"saag 'n alle, so va utløyste.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Skalsbakkadn","environment":"other named place","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.78,"lon":9.37,"label":"Sør-Aurdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN718","id":"SIN718","collection":"NO","title":"Kvit Ormen.","text":"Kvit Ormen.\nOppe i jærvateigno [?] ret i aust før kjørkjao dar va da eit kjørr i gamle daga, so dei kadla Kvitorm-Kjørre, unde ditta kjørre laog kvitormen. Adle dei gamle so eg kan hugsa her pao Odnæs, kunde fortælja om ditta kjørre, da va lika so eit helligt tre. Kvitormen va berra framme ein gong pao aore, å da va jønsåkaftao, dan so dao kunde passa pao å fao sleika pao da slie so va itte han i grase, han vart visare elde adle. Da samma va tefedle vis ein kunde fao fat pao kvitormen å koka han, dan so smakte pao ditta så'e han vart vise, men berra ein vart vise, den so fyst smakte pao så'e, elde fyste sleikte pao slie itte an i grase. Op pao Garn (øvre Odnæs) budde dar eingong ein man, han va jifte tvo gongedn, å so hadde han ei dotte mæ kår åv kånedn sine, dinna sista kjæringi hass hilt pao mæ dotteri si å vilde fao na op te kvitormkjørre jønsåkenætna å sleika pao slie itti kvitormen, å ældste dotteri (styggdotteri) forbeu ho te komma dar, men alder vart da te da at ho fækk dotteri op.\nMen te slut hadde ho faot fat pao kvitormen so ho kokte å no skulde ho lura dotteri te drikka ov så'e, men dar kom ælsta dotteri te komma in dar ditta sådde sto å so stak ho fingen niti, å smakte da. En dag om haustn dei sat å aot te nons seie ælsta dotteri \"Aa min Far, no veit æg kå slags kalv bjødlekjyri vaor gaor mæ.\" Styggmori sjønte kå so va tiss, ho vart flugande sint, å so seie ho, \"å ha du vore dar.\" I frao dan dagen vart Styggmori so sinte å fæle mæ jentao at ho maotte reisa i frao farn.","source":"NFS Jakob Bugge, s. 68f","category":"ml3030","place":"Urnes","events":[{"id":"NO-275-E01","start":502,"end":544,"span":"dan so smakte pao ditta så'e han vart vise","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic conditional tasting, no quality given.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-275-E02","start":1170,"end":1203,"span":"stak ho fingen niti, å smakte da.","modalities":["touch","taste"],"groups":["body","taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Actual tasting episode, no flavour described.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","taste"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.43,"lon":7.47,"label":"Urnes","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN728","id":"SIN728","collection":"NO","title":"Trællkjerrengå","text":"Trællkjerrengå\nha dæ au være my tå på di kantom i gamle dågå. Om dem it nett ha bustan sin i Opdala så hendt dæ no likvel at dem drev mæ konstom sin i bøgdom ikreng. Det har sine serleæ grunna at nett Opdaln kom te å li my tå slekt fordi alle træilkjerrengån frå hele landæ samlast ved trællkjerkjån på Dovrefjell kvar jensuku (jonsok) natt for å hald kalas. Tå all trællkjerrengåm nordafjells æ dæ ingor som på nermons ner kunn mål se mæ ho Lisbet Nypom. Ho va rent måkålaus te å kårrå åt se mjølka å budråtten åt annafolk mæ allslags rare konstæ. –Dæ æ fortalt at um jensukunatta når trællkjerrengån skull oppi trællkjerkja så møttest dem føst på natten ved Vangskjerkjån i Opdala og heldt et lite fyrykalas. Dæ æ såless fortalt at ei jensukunatt ha'o Lisbet fått te å trælla grannin sin om te en bokk som ho bruka te riandhest. Da ho kom åt Opdalskjerkjån bat o bokkin sin uta dæra. Min no treft dæ så meins for hinna at nettop grannin at dissæ stakkara ho ha skåpå om kom åt kjerkjån såmmå natta og kjent at grannin sin. Han hjelpt åm da laus att.","source":"NFS Olav Hanssen, s. 4f","category":"ml3050","place":"Oppdal","events":[{"id":"NO-276-E01","start":1003,"end":1024,"span":"kjent at grannin sin.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Recognition in transformed goat form, sensory channel contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Opdalskjerkjån","environment":"church","time":"ei jensukunatt","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.59,"lon":9.68,"label":"Oppdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN8","id":"SIN8","collection":"NO","title":"Søren Schive","text":"Søren Schive.\nSøren Schive, som var prest i Bjelland, var ein trollkunstnar\npaa mange vis. Han hadde svarteboka og.\nKvar onsdagskveld var Søren i kyrkja. Kva han gjorde der,\nvisste ingen. Frua var saa overgjeven for dette, og visste ikkje\nkva ho skulde finna paa, saa ho kunde faa han til aa slutta med\ndesse kyrkjeturane.\nHo vilde daa prøva um ho ikkje skulde faa sett støkken i han,\nsaa han ikkje vaaga aa gaa til kyrkja meir um kveldane. Ho klædde\ndaa ut tenestguten i nokre skinnklæde, og stelde han til saa tygg\nog ugodsleg som ho kunde faa han, og saa skulde han staa utanfor\nkyrkjedøra saa presten saag han med same han kom ut att or kyrkja\num kvelden.\nDaa presten fekk set dette skrymtet som stod der, ropa han:\n\"Æ dæ folk, saa svar!\" Han ropa fleire gonger, men han fekk ikkje\nsvar.\nDaa tok guten til siga ned i jorda, og han sokk og sokk til\nhan stod i til under armane. Daa blei han redd og sa kven han var.\n\"Naa va dæ godt du talte, hell ha du vore i evihedaa um et lide\ngrann!\" sa presten. Og saa var det ikkje lenge, saa stod han paa\njorda att.","source":"NFL 22,s.23f","category":"ml3005","place":"Vest-Agder","events":[{"id":"NO-277-E01","start":664,"end":708,"span":"presten fekk set dette skrymtet som stod der","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"uncertain agent identity","evidence":"Æ dæ folk, saa svar!","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-277-E02","start":743,"end":791,"span":"Han ropa fleire gonger, men han fekk ikkje\nsvar.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"non-response to identity test","evidence":"han fekk ikkje\nsvar","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-277-E03","start":800,"end":880,"span":"guten til siga ned i jorda, og han sokk og sokk til\nhan stod i til under armane.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Experiencer boy; involuntary sinking; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kyrkjedøra","environment":"church threshold","time":"um kvelden","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.15124,"lon":7.99467,"label":"Vest-Agder","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN809","id":"SIN809","collection":"NO","title":"SIN809","text":"Man fortæller, at der engang ved Stavanger var saa stor en Søe-Orm, at de troede den var en 1/4 Miil. Den omringede Staden, saa at Ingen kunde seile, enten ud paa Søen, eller komme ud af Søen. Som den lenge havde plaget Folket, gjorde de om sider en Bededag i Kirken; men ingen Rædning kunde erholdes førend paa den tredie Dag, da kom Havhesten, og man siger at den hørtes 3 Mile førend den kom. Den satte paa Ormen, og der blev saadant Slag, at hele Vigen uden for Byen blev kun Blod. Om sider tabte Ormen sit Liv, og ved Forraadnelsen fragav [den] sig en heftig Stank.","source":"NFS Andreas Faye avskrift, s. 133","category":"ml4085","place":"Bygland","events":[{"id":"NO-278-E01","start":362,"end":395,"span":"den hørtes 3 Mile førend den kom.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-278-E02","start":519,"end":570,"span":"ved Forraadnelsen fragav [den] sig en heftig Stank.","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ved Stavanger","environment":"sea","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","smell"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.8285,"lon":7.79616,"label":"Bygland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN810","id":"SIN810","collection":"NO","title":"SIN810","text":"Trunaa paa store ormar, lindormen, sjøormar aa slige, va almindele. I maange fjællvatn ska ha vore store ormar, saa dæ gaar maange sægner om. Stonnaa kjæme sjøormar in i fjoradn aa lægge seg inonde store faassar for aa drikka \"sprængt\" vatn.\nEingaang for fælt lænje sia hænte dæ einsta ein sønndagskvæll, daa alt faalkje kom or kjaarkjaa, atte ein fæle, laange sjøorm hadde lagt seg tvers øve vaajen, saa dei saa sko heimte sjøveien inkje slapp ut mæ baatadn. Der laag sjøormen dag ette dag, aa ingjen vaaga seg utpaa fjor'n, aa adle va rædde aa viste kje si arme raa, kols dei sko koma heimte. Men saa tok dei seg føre aa jore bedag, aa daa va dæ kje lænje, førrhælle der kom ein svære havhæst i fult traav utante have aa tok paa sjøormen aa drap han. Daa blei alt faalkje feigne, gjækk i baatadn aa rodde heimte kvar te sett, aa daa va sjø'n aall-raue av alt blo saa hadde ronne or sjøormen.","source":"NFS Rasmus Løland 1, s. 29b","category":"ml4085","place":"Sand","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Red water and sea fight narrated without sensory experiencer; ambient colour borderline excluded.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.48,"lon":6.27,"label":"Sand","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN813","id":"SIN813","collection":"NO","title":"SIN813","text":"Eingong va det ein mann som la seg punn ein båt for å pass op draujen. So kom draujen og sett seg i et rom og vild ro. \"Her måte det me itj,\" sa'n og flytta seg i same.\nE ror E ror\nher måte det me itj\nso i rom for rom i 5 manns båt. Da han kan te rome åt mann punn båten når dem va på sjøn, sa'n.\nE ror E ror\nHer måta det me\n(han skull vert feg)\nDå reist mann seg, tok noke å ropt: \"Ja her måta det meg å\" og dermed så slo'n ihel draujen, og da vart det att ber ei kobbklys.","source":"NFS Ola Ryssdal 4, s. 89","category":"ml4070","place":"Stoksund","events":[{"id":"NO-280-E01","start":419,"end":437,"span":"slo'n ihel draujen","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Physical impact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"punn ein båt","environment":"boat","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":64.03861,"lon":10.0617,"label":"Stoksund","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN821","id":"SIN821","collection":"NO","title":"SIN821","text":"Det var en Mand, som hed Jon, han fisked i et Vand Høst og Vår. Så hørte han engang det raabte i Fjældet: \"Må eg låne Gryta di?\" \"Hot vi du mæ dæn?\" svarede det på den anden Side. \"Eg vi koke'n Jon Langumlår, som fiskar på Bekkjen Haust å Vår.\" \"Ja, må eg få Flote?\" \"Ja du sko få både Skovunne å Flote.\" Da skyndte Jon sig afsted og kom der aldrig mer.","source":"NFS Sophus Bugge 3, s. 75","category":"ml5000","place":"Telemark","events":[{"id":"NO-281-E01","start":67,"end":104,"span":"hørte han engang det raabte i Fjældet","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Fjældet","environment":"mountain","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.21609,"lon":9.61115,"label":"Telemark","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN837","id":"SIN837","collection":"NO","title":"Presten i Valle og tusepresten klokast.","text":"Presten i Valle og tusepresten klokast. (ordskiftast)\nDet var eingong ein mann her i Valle, som hadde svært mykje umgjenge med tussane. Men presten i Valle lika inkje dette, at hans sokneborn var saman med tussane. Presten gjekk då til mannen for å høyra um det var sant. Mannen sa at det var so.\n\"Hev du hug til å sjå og tala med ein tusse,\" sa mannen med presten, \"so skal du snart få sjå og tala med han; for i kveld kjem han med ei brennevinsflaske som han hev lånt av meg.\"\nDet var inkje lenge for tussen kom med flaska og takka for låni – og sette den på bordet. Då tussen ha stade der å røda ei stund – takka han for seg og vilde gå. Presten spurde um han inkje kunde venta, so dei fekk tala noko.\nPresten spurde tussen, um han hadde høyrt um Jesus. \"Nei det hev eg inkje,\" sa tussen. \"Men eg hev ein bror som er prest millom tussane og han skal eg henta so du fær tala med han.\" \"Eg hev vond tid, men det hadde vore moro,\" sa presten. \"Det tekk inkje lenger hell eit korter (kvart), for han skal vera her.\" \"Ja da vil eg vente,\" sa presten.\nDå kortere var gjenge var tussepresten der og dei helsa på kvarandre. So tok dei til å klokast og det vart både væl og lenge. Vallepresten totte at tussepresten [var] grunnklok,- men Jesus kjende han inkje til.","source":"NFS Torleiv Aakre 1, s. 20","category":"ml5055","place":"Setesdal","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Requests to see and ordinary conversation; no explicit completed sensory observation.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.41858,"lon":7.35507,"label":"Setesdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN842","id":"SIN842","collection":"NO","title":"SIN842","text":"I Aafjorden boede der en gang et par folk paa en gaard der. En aften kom der en tuss og bad konen i huset følge med sig til konen hans; hun var saa syg. Hun saa gjorde og gik med. Da hun var kommen ind i haugen, undrede hun sig paa det, at hun syntes saavist, det var hendes egen tjenestepige, som gik der og bar vand. For nu at blive sikker paa dette, tog hun og stak en stoppenaal fast i tørklædet hendes, saa hun ikke mærkede det. Da hun var færdig og skulde gaa hjem, kastede tussen noget, som næsten lignede høvelspaaner op i tørklædet hendes. Det skulde være som et slags betaling det. Tussen sagde til konen, at hun maatte holde sig tæt bagom døren, naar hun gik; for ellers kunde der træffe hende noget; men hun kom nu vel ud. Da hun kom hjem, vilde hun til at kaste høvelspaanerne væk; for hun tænkte, at det bare var noget rusk; men da hun skulde se til, var det skinnende sølvpenge. Nu skulde hun da se efter pigen, hvor det havde sig med hende, om det var saa, naalen stod der eller ei. Jo, ganske regtigt, den fandtes i tørklædet. Da skjønte konen hvoraf det kom sig, at pigen altid var saa underlig tung og søvnig af sig. Det var netop siden hun tjente baade kristenfolk og \"hitt folket\".","source":"NFS Nikka Vonen 4, s. 9","category":"ml5070","place":"Sunnfjord","events":[{"id":"NO-283-E01","start":240,"end":318,"span":"hun syntes saavist, det var hendes egen tjenestepige, som gik der og bar vand.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"identity testing","evidence":"For nu at blive sikker paa dette","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-283-E02","start":843,"end":893,"span":"da hun skulde se til, var det skinnende sølvpenge.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"revised object identity","evidence":"hun tænkte, at det bare var noget rusk","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later at home.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-283-E03","start":894,"end":1043,"span":"Nu skulde hun da se efter pigen, hvor det havde sig med hende, om det var saa, naalen stod der eller ei. Jo, ganske regtigt, den fandtes i tørklædet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"identity corroboration","evidence":"den fandtes i tørklædet","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"At home; test is realised.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ind i haugen","environment":"hill interior","time":"En aften","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.49302,"lon":5.54041,"label":"Sunnfjord","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN85","id":"SIN85","collection":"NO","title":"SIN85","text":"Mentz Rynning hadde gøymt svartboka meir enn vel i sove-\nrommet sitt. Men ein gong tenestegjenta gjorde reint der inne,\nså kom ho over denne rare boka og tok til å bla og lesa i\nho. - Med det same vart det fullt opp av sinådjevlar i rom-\nmet. Og det var så mange tå dei, så presten ikkje fekk dei ut\nmed ein gong. Han laut ta inn eit fiskenett. Og dette laut alle\nsmådjevlane løysa opp knutane på. Og innan dei vann det,\nhadde presten bunde dei.","source":"NFL 74, s.25","category":"ml3020","place":"Eidskog","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.02813,"lon":12.06528,"label":"Eidskog","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN858","id":"SIN858","collection":"NO","title":"SIN858","text":"Ein kall på Høgset hadde grindgardane sine standande på Dalane i Høgsetlia.\nPå forsumaren vart denne mannen brått klein. Og han laut halda senga ei tid. So ei natt han låg vaken, kom det åt han eit blåkledt kvinnfolk. Ho var burtåt senga; og med ho stod der, sa ho: \"Du måtte vel bi klein, du ha sett grengainn dine åver matbore våres\". Og so visste kallen kven han hadde for seg. Han fekk grindgarden flytta, og frisk vart han.","source":"NFS Ragnvald Mo 6, s. 53","category":"ml5075","place":"Skjerstad","events":[{"id":"NO-285-E01","start":179,"end":237,"span":"kom det åt han eit blåkledt kvinnfolk. Ho var burtåt senga","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Waking encounter; sensory registration contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"senga","environment":"domestic interior","time":"ei natt han låg vaken","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":67.22,"lon":15.02,"label":"Skjerstad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN862","id":"SIN862","collection":"NO","title":"SIN862","text":"Det var ein gutt som var ute for ei tussegjente. Ein kveld kom ho og vilde liggi med'n. Han vilde ikkje sleppe ho oppi senga til sei. Men ho gav sei ikkje, ho vilde endeleg oppi og liggi med'n. Så hadde han lagt sei med ho lell, da han ikkje slapp ho. Ei tid etter hadde gjenta vørti liggande.\nDa ho hadde fått denna vesle, kom ho til gutten att. Han skulde så endeleg følgje til det huset ho budde i. Han vart da med ho dit. Det skulde vøri så gildt inne i det huset fortalte han etterpå. Så sa ho det:\n«Nå skal du få sjå ein fin liten unge je har fått.»\nGutten hadde ikkje stort å sei' til det.\n«Je er så glad i denna fine ungen je har fått, je vilde at du skulde koma og sjå'n.» Så var det ikkje meir ho vilde'n. Han skulde få gå att. Men ho formana han om håssen han skulde gå ut gjennom døra.\n«Når du kjem ut gjennom døra, skal du tverrkaste dei til den venstre sida, det ligg et gloande jarn i varmen. Det kjem etter dei når du går.» Han slapp vel ifrå det. Ho vilde han ikkje noko vondt.","source":"NFL 27, s. 20f","category":"ml5095","place":"Sigdal","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Invitations to see child are not explicit completed perception; intercourse not automatically sensation-coded.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.05,"lon":9.6,"label":"Sigdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN897","id":"SIN897","collection":"NO","title":"Paa Skarpaasen","text":"Paa Skarpaasen\nvar tuftane so paasettelege so det var mest raadlaust aa liggja der ei tid. Med budeia stod i bua og silte mjølka, stod huldra jamsides med og silte si mjølk.\nEin sumar laag ei som heitte Kari paa sætra der, ei svært vakker gjente var det. Elles hadde ho kjærast, ein heitte Per. So var det ein laurdagskveld etter ho hadde stelt aav, ho sat med noko saum og var reint aaleine, ja buhunden hadde ho med seg; men gjætlguten var burte. Daa kom det ei heil skreid med raudklædde tuftfolk og slo seg ned i bua. Ein som saag ut til aa vera husbonden sjølv, tala aat henne og vilde faa henne til kjerring aat son sin. Ho sa ho hadde kjærast fyrr; men det høyrde dei ikkje paa, tok berre til aa klæda henne til brur, hengde paa henne gull og sylvstas so det berre skein. Alt ho gret og bar seg hjelpte det ikkje, dei berre trøysta henne med det ho skulde faa det so svært godt i alle maatar, ho skyna ikkje sitt eige beste, ho.\n«Aa, hadde eg berre 'n Per her no, so hadde det itte vørte naa taa detter,» klaga gjenta.\nDaa sette hunden i vegen ned i bygda aat 'n Per, reiv og sleit i bukseleggene hans og vilde faa 'n med seg. Han Per forstod det var gali paa sætra, hogg med seg børsa fraa veggen og sette uppetter Skarpaaslia so snygt han kunde. Daa han kom upp paa vollen, fekk han sjaa ein hop raudklædde folk, og midt imillom deim timde han a Kari, pynta til brur med krone og alt som var. Han la aat og skaut, og daa vart dei burte alle saman so nære som gjenta. Ho stod att med all stasen paa seg. No vaaga han ikkje lata henne vera att paa sætra lenger, men fekk henne med seg ned att. All gullstasen selde dei og kjøpte ein gard for, og so gifte dei seg med det same.\nDette fortel dei og skulde ha hendt paa Lessavangen, berre med den skilnaden der fekk ikkje tuftfolket gjenta taa stolen ho sat paa, for ho hadde ei soks i fanget og sat og sauma daa dei kom, og daa ho fekk sjaa deim, la ho soksa under seg.","source":"NFL 11, s. 219f","category":"ml6005","place":"Tynset","events":[{"id":"NO-287-E01","start":779,"end":801,"span":"Alt ho gret og bar seg","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-287-E02","start":1075,"end":1108,"span":"reiv og sleit i bukseleggene hans","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Dog pulls Per's clothing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-287-E03","start":1283,"end":1401,"span":"fekk han sjaa ein hop raudklædde folk, og midt imillom deim timde han a Kari, pynta til brur med krone og alt som var.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-287-E04","start":1426,"end":1475,"span":"daa vart dei burte alle saman so nære som gjenta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"vart dei burte alle saman","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sustained witnessed scene.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-287-E05","start":1879,"end":1924,"span":"daa ho fekk sjaa deim, la ho soksa under seg.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Alternative version Lessavangen.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Skarpaasen","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"ein laurdagskveld","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.28,"lon":10.78,"label":"Tynset","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN9","id":"SIN9","collection":"NO","title":"Presten og Tenestguten","text":"Presten og Tenestguten\nPresten Dreier i Aukra hadde det med di 'n gjekk ut på kyrkegarden\nom nætene. Folk undra seg på kva 'n vilde der, og so fann tenestguten\nhans på at han vilde venje 'n av med di. Når natta kom, drog han på\nseg ei kvit skjorte uttapå klædom, og so gjekk han ut på kyrkjegarden\nog sette seg på ei grav.\nOm ei lita rid kom presten. Han gjekk bort åt guten og spurde\netter kva'n heitte.Men guten svara ikkje. Presten spurde'n ein gong\ntil, men guten svara 'kje no hell. Tredje gongen sa presten:\n\"I spør de i Guds namn kvann du e?\"\nMen guten vilde ikkje svare. - Då ripa presten ein ring i\njorda runder ikring han. Og so begynte guten og sokk nedi jorda.\nHan prøvde å skrike, men fekk det ikkje til. Og når presten var\nkomen heilt rundt han med staven, var guten under jorda. Og ingen\nhev set likt til han sidan.","source":"NFL 30,s.42","category":"ml3005","place":"Nord-Aukra, Gossa","events":[{"id":"NO-288-E01","start":673,"end":717,"span":"Han prøvde å skrike, men fekk det ikkje til.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Failed vocalisation during sinking; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-288-E02","start":797,"end":830,"span":"ingen\nhev set likt til han sidan.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic subsequent absence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kyrkjegarden","environment":"cemetery","time":"natta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.87,"lon":6.88,"label":"Nord-Aukra, Gossa","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN915","id":"SIN915","collection":"NO","title":"SIN915","text":"I ein fjøs på ein gard her i Fauske marka dei medkvart underjordiske.\nEin morgon terna kom i fjøsen, blei ho var det låg ein klut burtmed veggen under fraugluggen. Ho tenkte det var ei lørve som var slengd dit, og var fyrstpå meint å kasta lørva på dungen i lag med frauen. Men so vart det slik ho tok hengde lørva på ein knagg på veggen.\nMorgonen etter ho sat og mjølka, kom det eit framandt kvinnfolk inni fjøsen; ho kom leiande med ei stor, pen ku.\n\"Dainna skal du ha førr du berga banreiven min\", sa kvinnfolket.\nFør gjenta fekk sopass tankane før seg ho vann segja noko, var den andre burte. Men kua stod baker; og ho blei på garden til ho var utleva. Det skulde vera so overlag til god ku.","source":"NFS Ragnvald Mo 3, s. 62","category":"ml6020","place":"Fauske","events":[{"id":"NO-289-E01","start":101,"end":163,"span":"blei ho var det låg ein klut burtmed veggen under fraugluggen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified object","evidence":"Ho tenkte det var ei lørve som var slengd dit","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later labelled banreiven; provisional cloth identification corrected.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-289-E02","start":517,"end":596,"span":"Før gjenta fekk sopass tankane før seg ho vann segja noko, var den andre burte.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"rapid disappearance","evidence":"var den andre burte","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Next morning, contextual perception; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"fjøsen","environment":"stable","time":"Ein morgon","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":67.26,"lon":15.4,"label":"Fauske","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN928","id":"SIN928","collection":"NO","title":"Bærjetraulla i Oppåsa","text":"Bærjetraulla i Oppåsa\nUffs pla væra utsætt før bærjetraulla hør jul. Så fækk n fatt i en bjønn såm n batt i murstølpen, å bærjetraulla kåm likevæl deinn jula å besøkte n. Meinn så skuille døm åt mura å værme sæ, da var deinn så sinnt, å deinn teil å klore å bite, så døm kåm itte bortteill værmen. Å da var de itte ainn rå, ainne de døm måtte ut, deinn gonga. Meinn så næste jul, så skuille døm dit atte, meinn førr sikkerheits skuill, så ville døm høre me n Uffs om de. Å så ståppe døm opp på en stor haug: \"Har du deinn store grå katten i år såm i fjol?\" spordde døm. \"Ja, deinn å fleire teill!\" svara n Uffs. \"Ja da kåmmer vi ailler teill dæ meir!\" sa døm. Å på de vise vartt n Uffs kvitt døm.","source":"NFS Amund B. Larsen jr. 2, s. 18","category":"ml6015","place":"Solør","events":[{"id":"NO-290-E01","start":237,"end":262,"span":"deinn teil å klore å bite","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Bear clawing and biting; targets group, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"mura","environment":"hearth","time":"jul","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.39213,"lon":11.90052,"label":"Solør","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN933","id":"SIN933","collection":"NO","title":"SIN933","text":"Da va eingong da kom ein fremmande Kar te noki Folk Julaftao, å ba om hus. Ja, seie man i huse, hus kunde du nok faot, men i Kveld gaor da ikkje an, me mao sjølv reisa or huse. Mao de sjøle reisa or huse i Kvæld? spore frammandkaren. Ja, seie man, for kor julekveld kjæmme her eit følje te gars, so helde te heila natti, so dæ æ urao før os te væra, å helde ikkje tore me lata dæg ligja, dei kunde kvitta dæg. Ja faor æg berra lov te ligja hær, so ska æg nok berga mæg, men æg mao fao ei børsa, seie frammande Karen. Ja, so fækk han lov te væra daa, å ei børsa fan dei fram, so han ladde. I sjømmingi ælda dei i røikobm so dei va vande te, å naor da lei pao Kvelden reiste husens folki, å frammandekarn kraup op pao røikobm å sætte sæg. Daa da lei pao, haure han ein slik dun, so da skulde komma kjøirande ein brote mæ hesta te gars, å beste da va jik døri op, in kom dar ein gammadl Kadl, han te å snusa, å snusa, fy sa han, hær æ Kristenmanslukt inne, in kom ein meingde mæ Kar å Kvinfolk. Dei te å kveikte op ljøs, duka langbore, sette mat å drikka pao da, i bidne so va so blanke at da berra sjain av dei, men han so sat pao røikobm blei dei inkje var. Naor bore va vel testelt mæ mat å drikka so sette dei sæg te bors. Gamlingen so kom in fyste sætte sæg i hågsæte, no tok man pao røikobm te å letta pao børsao si - lætt å varle, han tok godt sigte pao han so sat i hågsæte, å smelte te. Gamlingen stupte fram øve bore - dei andre sprang op å bar sæg idla. \"Å nei no skaut dei han Bestefar\", pao dør barst dar mæ dei, tok Gamlingen mæ sæg, men gløimde atte alt so sto pao bore. Han haure kor dei kjaure av garn at, men dei kom inkje atte. Om måron dao husens folki kom at, sto bore dækka mæ mat å drikka i bidne av bærra sølv, å alder kom ditta følje te gars meira.","source":"NFS Jakob Bugge 1, s. 25f","category":"ml6015","place":"Urnes","events":[{"id":"NO-291-E01","start":753,"end":832,"span":"haure han ein slik dun, so da skulde komma kjøirande ein brote mæ hesta te gars","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"sound analogy","evidence":"so da skulde komma kjøirande","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Tentative comparison, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-291-E02","start":890,"end":952,"span":"han te å snusa, å snusa, fy sa han, hær æ Kristenmanslukt inne","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Visitor as experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-291-E03","start":1583,"end":1618,"span":"Han haure kor dei kjaure av garn at","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"huse","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Julaftao","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","smell"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.43,"lon":7.47,"label":"Urnes","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN937","id":"SIN937","collection":"NO","title":"SIN937","text":"Han Børe Snesbølmoa grua at åkeren hans skulle frysa.\n«Hadde nå rugen min vøri skørin, så skulle je gji bort bæssen min,» mulla han for seg sjølv. Men det utrulege hende. Utpå natta fekk folket på garden høyre slik ståk frå gjordet. På åkeren dreiv det nokon i harde tak. Huldrekallen brukte kjeften på kjerringa si:\n«Ta bennil og bitt,\ndess før blir vi kvitt –\ndi gørrvom!»\nOm morgonen var all åkeren hans Børe skoren, men det raraste var at bessen (saubukken) hans var borte.","source":"NFL 68, s. 45","category":"ml6035","place":"Eidskog","events":[{"id":"NO-292-E01","start":182,"end":232,"span":"fekk folket på garden høyre slik ståk frå gjordet.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"gjordet","environment":"field","time":"Utpå natta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.02813,"lon":12.06528,"label":"Eidskog","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN942","id":"SIN942","collection":"NO","title":"Håvar Bø får huldrahatt.","text":"Håvar Bø får huldrahatt.\nHåvar Bø skulde tett føre jol på Jonstølhaugen etter for. Då han kom fram, la 'n seg te sova. Best det var, tok det te skrike:\n«Ko e min hatt! Ko e min hatt!»\nHan Håvar skvatt upp og skreik i halvsvevnen:\n«E me vil ha ein hatt!»\nHan hadde ikkje før sagt det, før han fekk ein huldrahatt, og burte var han, og burte vart han i tryo heile dagar. Då låg han Håvar på Jonstølhauge som før. Vidt og breidt hadde han fare; men kvar han hadde vore, kunde han ingi greie gje på.","source":"NFL 36, s. 38","category":"ml6050","place":"Vang","events":[{"id":"NO-293-E01","start":133,"end":183,"span":"tok det te skrike:\n«Ko e min hatt! Ko e min hatt!»","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Sleep-transition hearing licensed by halvsvevnen.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-293-E02","start":446,"end":495,"span":"kvar han hadde vore, kunde han ingi greie gje på.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unrecoverable travelled locations","evidence":"kvar han hadde vore, kunde han ingi greie gje på","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Retrospective spatial memory, not necessarily momentary disorientation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Jonstølhaugen","environment":"hill","time":"tett føre jol","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.13,"lon":8.55,"label":"Vang","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN958","id":"SIN958","collection":"NO","title":"Tron Hoskulson.","text":"Tron Hoskulson.\nTron hadde skyldfolk eller gode kjenningar ekkonstad paa austlandet, antan i Setisdal, hell Tilemarkæ, og av og til var han stad og vitja dei, helst i jolehelgjæ. Han for daa, um raad var, beinaste vegen yve heiane. So var det ei gong han reid heimatt og kom forbi Tilhauin i Aaseral (?). Der stod store hæve hus. Men Tron visste, der aldrig hadde budt folk. Han reid no likeve1 burtaat og stana framfor huse. Det var i myrkningi. Der var ljos i alle vindaugor og spil og dans. Men dei gaadde han likevel, og bonen og brudeparet kom ud og ba han inn. Bonen rekte han eit stort hodn og bad han drikka. Han takka og tok imot og læst som han drakk, men støyte med det sama drykken yve høræ og hesteryggen. So tok han byrsaa og skaud beint imot huse. Daa vart der ein fælsleg larm med skrik og skraal. Huset blei burte, alt vart myrkt og stilt, og Tron for sin veg fram. Daa dagen kom, fekk han sjaa, at nokre dropar av det som var i hodne, hadde kome paa lendan aat hesten og teke haari av. Hodne hadde han med seg heim. Det var fint utskore med sylvgjore baade paa kanten og midt paa og stod paa 3 sylvføda. Det var lenge i ættæ si eiga. Sian kom det til Ubursheiæ [?] (vert i matrikulen og embættesprotokollar kalla Haaland, avsides gard høgt uppe i bygdæ). Men der brann det upp i ein fælsleg brand for 50 aar siaa.","source":"NFS P. Eiesland, s. 3ff","category":"ml6045","place":"Fjotland","events":[{"id":"NO-294-E01","start":447,"end":493,"span":"Der var ljos i alle vindaugor og spil og dans.","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Ambient perceptual scene, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-294-E02","start":763,"end":813,"span":"Daa vart der ein fælsleg larm med skrik og skraal.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-294-E03","start":814,"end":855,"span":"Huset blei burte, alt vart myrkt og stilt","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"vanished scene","evidence":"Huset blei burte","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-294-E04","start":898,"end":1003,"span":"fekk han sjaa, at nokre dropar av det som var i hodne, hadde kome paa lendan aat hesten og teke haari av.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Daylight after event.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Tilhauin","environment":"other named place","time":"i myrkningi","movement":"reid heimatt"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.52643,"lon":6.99208,"label":"Fjotland","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN962","id":"SIN962","collection":"NO","title":"SIN962","text":"I Haa Sogn paa Jædderen red en gang en Mand hjem fra Byen. Det var i Julen og han havde drukket sig paa en liden Pidsk og var saaledes ganske vel tilmode. Da han just red forbi et Fjeld, hvor man sagde, der var Trold, tenkte han, han skulde ikke være bange for dem, og saa raabte han ind og spurgte dem, om de ikke vilde komme ud og skjænke en Mand i Julen. Da hørte han, det sagde inde i Fjeldvæggen: \"Slaa Edder i! slaa Edder i!\", og om lidt kom der et Trold ud med et Guldhorn og bød ham. Han tog imod Hornet, men Drikken slog han bagover sig paa Hesten, og der, hvor den traf Hesten, gik baade Hud og Haar af den. Han beholdt Hornet, og satte saa afsted det forteste han kunde, men oppaa et andet Bjerg stod der et Trold, som var i Uvenskab med det første, og det raabte til ham: \"Rid over Ageren! rid ikke over Volden den haarde!\" Det gjorde han ogsaa, og paa Ageren havde Troldet ingen Magt over ham, for den er hellig. Han kom da hjem i godt Behold med Hornet, men saalænge han havde det i Huset, var det aldrig rigtigt der: han hørte bestandig saadan underlig Støi og Larm. Saa gik han til Præsten og spurgte ham, hvad han skulde gjøre; men Præsten meente, det havde ingen Fare, og saa spurgte Manden, om han vilde tage Hornet til sig. Ja, det vilde han gjerne. Han fik da Guldhornet, men saa begyndte den samme Støi hos ham, og endelig brændte Gaarden og Guldhornet med.","source":"NFS Var. Fb 27, 4f","category":"ml6045","place":"Sokndal","events":[{"id":"NO-295-E01","start":358,"end":400,"span":"Da hørte han, det sagde inde i Fjeldvæggen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-295-E02","start":764,"end":835,"span":"det raabte til ham: \"Rid over Ageren! rid ikke over Volden den haarde!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-295-E03","start":1032,"end":1081,"span":"han hørte bestandig saadan underlig Støi og Larm.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"unexplained noise","evidence":"underlig Støi og Larm","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later at home, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-295-E04","start":1301,"end":1332,"span":"begyndte den samme Støi hos ham","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later priest's home.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"et Fjeld","environment":"mountain","time":"i Julen","movement":"red en gang en Mand hjem fra Byen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.34256,"lon":6.29427,"label":"Sokndal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN969","id":"SIN969","collection":"NO","title":"SIN969","text":"På Øvre-Helland hadde dei slik vanlukka på beisti sine ein vinter. Ein kveld dei kom i floren, stod ei fin kyr på hella og vilde inn. Dei skuva henne til sides; det var ei \"hullakyr\". Då kalla huldrene på kyri og sa at når dei ikkje vilde ta imot henne, so kalla dei henne tilbake. Men hadde dei kasta stål yver henne, hadde dei havt henne.","source":"NFS Andreas Leiro 1, s. 6","category":"ml6055","place":"Hosanger","events":[{"id":"NO-296-E01","start":134,"end":159,"span":"Dei skuva henne til sides","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Contact with cow, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-296-E02","start":184,"end":209,"span":"Då kalla huldrene på kyri","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"floren","environment":"stable","time":"ein vinter","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.57516,"lon":5.47764,"label":"Hosanger","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN97","id":"SIN97","collection":"NO","title":"I skyss med Gamlingen.","text":"I skyss med Gamlingen.\nEin gong var det ein mann som var ute og køyrde. Han trefte\nein framand kar som ville sitja på med honom. Han skulle til\nein gard litt lenger fram på vegen, sa han. Jau mannen let han\nfå sitja opp på sleden, og så køyrde dei i veg. Då dei kom til\nnæraste gard, stogga mannen hesten, det var der den framande\nskulle av. Dei høyrde det prata og molesterte så høgt der inne.\nFramandkaren stod som og lydde ei stund. Så sa han: Å nei\nvi får køyra lenger, eg skjønar det er ikkje av hjarta mora ban-\nnar barnet sitt.\nSå køyrde dei eit stykke til. Då ville den framande gå av.\nMannen stogga hesten og den framande steig av og gjekk inn\ni næraste huset. Mannen tenkte ikkje noko over hendinga med\ndet same. Men då han ei tid etter fekk høyra at i same huset\nhadde ein mann nett teke seg av dage, då skjøna han at det var\nden vonde han hadde skyssa.","source":"NFL 44, s.71f","category":"ml3025","place":"Velfjord","events":[{"id":"NO-297-E01","start":342,"end":394,"span":"Dei høyrde det prata og molesterte så høgt der inne.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-297-E02","start":395,"end":435,"span":"Framandkaren stod som og lydde ei stund.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual deliberate listening; interprets sincerity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"næraste gard","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":"køyrde dei i veg"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":65.38,"lon":13.07,"label":"Velfjord","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN975","id":"SIN975","collection":"NO","title":"SIN975","text":"Det var ein mann frå Flatåsen som låg på Ramsåsvollen ei natt. Då han vakna um morgonen, stod det ein stor elgukse på vollen utanfor huset. Mannen skunda seg, greip byrsa og skaut på elguksen. Men anten han no ikkje trefte eller korleis det kunde hanga i hop, elguksen han stod der like god som fyrr. Men burte i berget ropte det: \"Uvaska gut ska it skjøt min stut\". Då greip mannen so fort burt i graset med handa og vætte ho i doggen der. So strauk han seg over ansiktet med den våte handa og svara: \"Æ ska vis dæ gut som hi vaska sæ\". Og so skaut han atter, og då staup elguksen og var daud.","source":"NFL 25, s. 16f","category":"ml6060","place":"Verdal","events":[{"id":"NO-298-E01","start":305,"end":329,"span":"burte i berget ropte det","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"NO-298-E02","start":444,"end":491,"span":"strauk han seg over ansiktet med den våte handa","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Dew-wet contact, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ramsåsvollen","environment":"mountain pasture","time":"um morgonen","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.79,"lon":11.48,"label":"Verdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN985","id":"SIN985","collection":"NO","title":"Jo Sotnakkå å jutuln.","text":"Jo Sotnakkå å jutuln.\nHann Jo ha vore på Åram å sommarn, å slije duna, å i juln skull n ga over fjeille te Åram att å vare mæ å drekke duna. Fer de va i juln de dei samlast att å jor åv de. Nårn va på veig innåver fjeille å va kåmmin åt Storurn, haur n nåkkån ropa: \"Du Dagmann, sei nå Nattmann at n Litle-Tommas e dø.\" Hann Jo kåmm se vel åver fjeille å te Åram. Sia vart n sett te bors samen mæ dei andre dunaskarå so va der. Å mæ dei sat attmæ bora, tala n Jo om kva n ha haurt ropa oppi Storurn, at n Litle-Tommas va dø. Mæ di same kåmm der einn stor gammal kall fram onne bora å sa: \"Å e' n dø no. \" Å der mæ to n på døra å strauk sinn veig.","source":"NFS Ola Holen 1, s. 18","category":"ml6070","place":"Romsdal","events":[{"id":"NO-299-E01","start":246,"end":264,"span":"haur n nåkkån ropa","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Storurn","environment":"mountain","time":"i juln","movement":"på veig innåver fjeille"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.5,"lon":7.8,"label":"Romsdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"NO:SIN999","id":"SIN999","collection":"NO","title":"Molands Kirke (i Fyrresdal).","text":"Molands Kirke (i Fyrresdal).\nMolands Almue havde begyndt at bygge en Kirke paa Fyrresvandets vestlige Side, i en Lie, som nu kaldes Vigelien. Endnu findes en Ruin, der vidner om, at Arbeidet har været paabegyndt; thi to store Stene staar som Hjørnepillar, og meget Gruus o.s.v. ligger omspredt. - Aarsagen, hvorfor Bygningen ikke blev fuldført, skal have været, at Tømmermændene hver Morgen fandt deres Øxer og andre Redskaber flyttede over paa den anden Side af Vandet, hvor Kirken nu staar. Man besluttede endeligen for ei at opirre Viigtroldet at bygge Kirken hvor Værktøiet fandtes. - Dette Trold; der opholder sig i Vigelien ved Fyrrisvandet høres, naar nogen Ulykke nær paa skal hende.","source":"NFS Andreas Faye avskrift, s. 144","category":"ml7060","place":"Fyresdal","events":[{"id":"NO-300-E01","start":647,"end":691,"span":"høres, naar nogen Ulykke nær paa skal hende.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic hearing without acoustic specification; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Vigelien ved Fyrrisvandet","environment":"waterside","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.18,"lon":8.08,"label":"Fyresdal","precision":"source place","provenance":"Supplied NO sted coordinates; may represent a broad named area"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-1.0","id":"D1-1.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-1.0","text":"Ylöjärvellä oli piru. Ihmiset läheltä ja kaukaa kävivät sitä katsomassa. Eivät he mitään olentoa nähneet. Mutta jossain torpassa (nimen olen unohtanut) se siellä tanssitti leipiä vartaissa ja aukoi ja sulki ovia sekä helisytti astioita. Sitten se asettui johonkin kallioon ja lauloi aika ajoin sitä virttä: ”Nyt vaivoista vaan kuulla saa. Kaikki itkein parkuin valittaa tuskaansa haikeinta.”","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:14. 1961. Heikki Elomäki, pienvilj. 1870-1930","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[{"id":"FI-301-E01","start":22,"end":105,"span":"Ihmiset läheltä ja kaukaa kävivät sitä katsomassa. Eivät he mitään olentoa nähneet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen agent","evidence":"Eivät he mitään olentoa nähneet","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-301-E02","start":217,"end":236,"span":"helisytti astioita.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen source","evidence":"Eivät he mitään olentoa nähneet","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-301-E03","start":276,"end":305,"span":"lauloi aika ajoin sitä virttä","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later at rock; song lyrics themselves not coded as experienced pain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ylöjärvellä","environment":"other named place","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-10.0","id":"D1-10.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-10.0","text":"Kun Tilda Annila oli kansakoulutyttö Sääksmäen Annilassa, uskottiin voitavan kipuja j.m.s. parantaa noitumalla. Tildan toisen käden sormet ja kämmenen selkä oli täynnä ruuppia. Hänet pantiin menemään erään Huittulan kylässä olevan muijan tykö. Tämä osasi noitua. Tyttö meni ja puhui asiansa. ”Niin kyllä,” sanoi muija, ”muttei ny parane. Ei kuu o ny silälai. Tu toisen kerran!” Ja muija sanoi päivän. Tyttö meni toisteen. Akka otti villalankaa ja solmieli pätkiä ruuppien yläpuolella ja mutisi jotain. Sitten hän antoi langan pätkät tytölle ja sanoi: ”Hautaa ne ny tonne navetan taka sontaläjään. Mutta älä mennessäs katto takas.” Hoidettava teki ninkun käskettiin. Lähti sitten pois ja sanoi, ettei hän edes huomannut, milloin ruupat kädestään parani. (Sillälailla ruupat paraneekin. Niin huomaamatta ne multakin lapsena meni eikä niitä edes noiduttukaan)","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:29. 1961. Tilda Seppälä o. s. Annila, kuollut","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[{"id":"FI-302-E01","start":487,"end":501,"span":"mutisi jotain.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate utterance","evidence":"jotain","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Unspecified words need not mean unintelligible to listener; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-302-E02","start":694,"end":752,"span":"ettei hän edes huomannut, milloin ruupat kädestään parani.","modalities":["unspecified perception"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"perception with channel unspecified","note":"Explicit failure to notice recovery timing; not sensory uncertainty about an event; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","other"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-11.0","id":"D1-11.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-11.0","text":"Kahren talon tontut keskusteli. Toinen sano: ”Minä poltan taloni, poltaks sinä?” Toinen vastas: ”E minä polta. Mutta mitäs sinä sitte talos poltat?” ”Jaa, ei meillä peitetä koskaan valkeen silmiä. Nin minä näytän niille.” (Ei siunattu, kun tehtiin tuli) ”Mutta älä sitä meirän tuaksun taarua polta siältä teirän tiirun taarun korvasta.”\n\n(Oli lainattu jauhosihti ja pantu saavin korvaan eikä oltu palautettu omistajataloon.)","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:26. 1961. Amanda Elomäki o. s. Leppälä, emäntä, 1866-1959","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-14.0","id":"D1-14.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-14.0","text":"Hauhon kirkon lähellä on suuri kivi jonka jättiläiset on heittänyt Sotjalan kylästä Hiiden kalliolta mutta ei jaksanut sinne saakka vaan putosi lähelle kirkkoa Tuuloksen p. vievän tien viereen jossa nuori tyttö oli pellavia kitkemässä ja jäi kiven alle, josta se on saanut nimensä Neitsyt kivi.","source":"Hiukkanen, Tilda 4. 1938 < Amanda Estlin, s. 1856","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-15.0","id":"D1-15.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-15.0","text":"Linnaisten kalliolla on vuoren alakilla lähde. Pieni reikä sinne laelta johtaa. jos rahaa panet, parantaa vesi taudistasi.","source":"HAKS. Kirsti Aulanko 7690. 1939. < Sirkka Lehtonen, s. 1918","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-2.0","id":"D1-2.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-2.0","text":"Lapsuusajaltani muistan täältä kotikylästäni Tyrisevältä erään talon vanhan emännän joka itse uskoi ja ehkä joku naapurikin, että hän pystyy parantamaan konsteillaan. Hän osasi esim. käärmeenpuremaan lorun. Lapsille ei hän sitä opettanut. Taika kai olisi menettänyt mahtinsa, jos sitä olisi turhanpäin tehty.\n\nÄitini kädet puutuivat ja niitä särki. Kyseinen emäntä sanoi: ”Tu sinne meirän saunaan lauantaina! Minä katton sulle veden kiuluun.” Äiti meni, kun ei tahtonut pahoittaa muorin mieltä. Hän sanoi heittäneensä sen veden nurkkaan, kun ei uskonut, että veteen luetuilla loitsuilla oli voimaa.","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:46. 1961","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[{"id":"FI-306-E01","start":310,"end":348,"span":"Äitini kädet puutuivat ja niitä särki.","modalities":["bodily sensation","pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Numbness and aching; katton sulle veden is preparation idiom, not visual perception (source review note).","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"From my childhood days here in my home village of Tyrisevä, I remember an old farm mistress who believed — as perhaps a neighbour did too — that she could heal people with her methods. She knew, for example, a charm for a snake bite. She did not teach it to children. The magic would probably have lost its power if it had been used needlessly.\n\nMy mother's hands went numb and ached. The mistress in question said: 'Come to our sauna on Saturday! I will “katton sulle veden kiuluun” [healing expression unresolved].' Mother went, because she did not want to hurt the old woman's feelings. She said she threw that water into the corner, as she did not believe that spells read into water had power.","translationNotes":["REVIEW REQUIRED: 'Minä katton sulle veden kiuluun' occurs in a healing context involving water and charms. Its exact idiomatic meaning is not established. The Finnish wording is retained in the English rather than creating a possibly false visual-perception claim. 'Emäntä' is a farm mistress."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"FI-306-E01","start":346,"end":384,"span":"My mother's hands went numb and ached.","modalities":["bodily sensation","pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Numbness and aching; katton sulle veden is preparation idiom, not visual perception (source review note).","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Äitini kädet puutuivat ja niitä särki.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-3.0","id":"D1-3.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-3.0","text":"jatk. 1\n\nKottilan talon kaivosta vettä pulloonsa ja taikauskoisena heitti uhrirahan kaivoon. Hän kiiruhti juoksujalkaa kotiinsa Kylmäkoskelle eikä kertonut mistä oli vettä ottanut. Jännittynyt hän oli ”lääkkeen” vaikutuksesta. Mutta lasten suut paranivat. Kottilan kaivon vesi siis tepsi siinä kuin Linnaisten kalliolla olevan taikalähteen vesikin. Se hälvensi vaarini taikauskoa. Mutta vasta vanhana miehenä hän tämän oli rohjennut kertoa lapsilleen. (Tämä tapahtui ehkä 1830-1840)\n\nLinnaisten kallio on Sääksmäen Saarioispuolella lähellä Kuurilan asemaa.","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:44. 1961. Heikki Elomäki, pienvilj. s. 1870,k. 1930","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-4.0","id":"D1-4.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-4.0","text":"Isäni, Heikki Elomäki, on jo kuollut (1930), mutta muistan tämän tosiperäisen hänen kertomansa kaskun.\n\nIsoisäni Karl Enbäck oli 9-vuotias poika ja asui Kylmäkoskella.\n\nSääksmäen Linnaisten kalliolla on lähde, jonka vedellä uskottiin olevan lasten ”sampaita” parantava voima. Vaarini oli lähetetty hakemaan pullolla vettä e.m:sta lähteestä taskussaan lähteeseen pudotettava ”uhriraha.” Päästyään Toijalaan poika tapasi raittilla Toijalan poikia ja rupesi heidän kanssaan lyömään kiekkoa. Vasta iltapäivällä hän muisti millä asialla hän oli. Mutta Linnaisiin on Toijalasta toistakymmentä kilometriä, ja jos poika olisi sinne vielä kävellyt, olisi tullut pimeä, jota 9-vuotias pelkäsi. Neuvokas poika otti keskellä Toijalan kylää olevan jatkuu","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:44. 1961. Heikki Elomäki, pienvilj. s. 1870,k. 1930","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Fear of prospective darkness, no realised sensory event; continuation wording retained as full supplied text.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-5.0","id":"D1-5.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-5.0","text":"Parittelun synnystä olen kuullut joskus seuraavan jutun:\n\nAatami ja Eeva asuivat vielä kaksistaan maailmaa. Eeva pesi viikunanlehtensä ja valitti, ettei tiedä, mihin panisi sen kuivumaan. Aatami sanoi, että mulla olisi sellainen tanko, johon se lehti sopisi kuivumaan, mutta mihin panisin sen toisen pään. No, Eeva huomasi: ”Mulla on reikä mihin se vapaa pää sopii.” Seisoivat siinä vastakkain pyykkitelineenä. Tuli tuulenpuuska. Aatami horjahti Eevaan päin. Eeva mielistyi: ”Painas vieläkin!” Näin ihminen oppi sen konstin.","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:35. 1961","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[{"id":"FI-309-E01","start":430,"end":493,"span":"Aatami horjahti Eevaan päin. Eeva mielistyi: ”Painas vieläkin!”","modalities":["balance","touch","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Sway, contact and pleasure contextual; sexual episode without further sensation inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-6.0","id":"D1-6.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-6.0","text":"Tositapaus. Sääksmäen Annilasta varastettiin hevonen laitumelta. Isäntä meni tietäjiin kysymään, missä hevonen on. (Olen unohtanut tietäjän nimen, hän oli isäntä Pälkäneellä) Lähtiessään Annila sanoi: ”Jos mä nyt menen pilkan päiten.” (s.o. leikillään) Meni tietäjiin ja puhui asiansa. ”Pilkan päitenhän sinä tänne tulitkin”, sanoi tietäjä. ”Mutta jos ma ny sanon. Hevoses on lähellä Valkeakoskia päivät tallissa, yöt liakaköyressä mettän [illegible]oisioissa.” Tietäjä neuvo tiänkin niin tarkasti, että Annila osas sen neuvon mukaan hakee hevosensa yöllä kotio.","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:13. 1961. Tilda Seppälä o. s. Annila, emäntä k. 1957 yli 80 v. vanhana","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-7.0","id":"D1-7.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-7.0","text":"Emäntä kävi aina saunassa paran puheilla. Piika tuli uteliaaksi ja päätti ottaa selvän, mitä emäntä saunassa yksinään oikein touhusi. Hän meni saunaan illalla ja pisti itsensä lavon alle piiloon. Pian tuli emäntäkin eikä pimeässä saunassa nähnyt piikaa. Emäntä huusi kiukaan taka: ”Synny para, synny para! Ei o silmää näkemässä eikä korvaa kuulemassa.” Mutta ei para tullut, kun piika oli lavon alla. Kun emäntä ei saanut paraa näkyviin, hän ajatteli, että se on nyt jostain suuttunut. Hän meni pois. Silloin piika tuli lavon alta ja huusi: ”Synny para, synny para! Ei o silmää näkemässä eikä korvaa kuulemassa.” Silloin muurin takaa rupesi tulemaan niin kamala olento, että piika pelästyi ja lähti kiiruusti ovelle. Mennessään hän kuuli paran kysyvän: ”No, mitäs tahrot?” Piika ovesta livahtaessaan huusi hädissään: ”Paskaa!” Ja sitä tuli sauna täyteen.","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:11. 1961. Amanda Elomäki, emäntä 1866-1959","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[{"id":"FI-311-E01","start":216,"end":253,"span":"eikä pimeässä saunassa nähnyt piikaa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"occlusion/hidden observer","evidence":"pimeässä saunassa","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Mistress non-seeing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-311-E02","start":405,"end":436,"span":"emäntä ei saanut paraa näkyviin","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed evocation/visibility","evidence":"ei saanut paraa näkyviin","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-311-E03","start":621,"end":689,"span":"muurin takaa rupesi tulemaan niin kamala olento, että piika pelästyi","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual perception of emerging being; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-311-E04","start":717,"end":772,"span":"Mennessään hän kuuli paran kysyvän: ”No, mitäs tahrot?”","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"saunassa","environment":"bathhouse","time":"illalla","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-8.0","id":"D1-8.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-8.0","text":"Vaikka kuinka pahan hevosen voi kengittää, kun kiertää oikealta vasemmalle kolme kertaa hevosen ympäri ja joka kerta lyö hevosen lautasille kädellään, jonka kämmen on ylöspäin käännetty, sekä joka lyönnillä sanoo\n\nHyvä piru, anna minulle suurempi voima, kuin tuolla järjettömällä luontokappaleella on.\n\nHevosen voimat vähenevät ja se tulee säisyksi, mutta että hevonen tulisi entiselleen, kierretään se jälleen kolmeen kertaan, vaan vasemmalta oikealle ja lyödään lautasille kädellä, jonka kämmen on alaspäin käännetty sekä sanotaan\n\nHyvä puru anna tuolle hevoselle voimansa takaisin”.","source":"Aalto, K. K. b) 75. 1887","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki","events":[{"id":"FI-312-E01","start":106,"end":149,"span":"joka kerta lyö hevosen lautasille kädellään","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Generic prescribed contact; horse experiencer, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-312-E02","start":456,"end":518,"span":"lyödään lautasille kädellä, jonka kämmen on alaspäin käännetty","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reverse prescribed procedure; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:D1-9.0","id":"D1-9.0","collection":"FI","title":"D1-9.0","text":"Mateuslahren Kreeta-Liisa oli kansanparantaja, mutta noita. Maaherrattaren käsi oli kipee. Lääkärit ei saanu paraneen. Hajettiin Mateuslahren KreetaLiisa. (muistaakseni Lempäälässä) Maaherra kysyi: ””Osaakkos noitua?” ”En”. Kreeta-Liisa keitti maan aineista troppinsa ja paransi maaherrattaren. (Samoin monia kansanihmisiä.)","source":"Linda Elomäki TK 10:18. 1961. Amanda Elomäki o. s. Leppälä, emäntä, 1866-1959","category":"FL_dataset1","place":"Sääksmäki, Tyrisevä","events":[{"id":"FI-313-E01","start":60,"end":90,"span":"Maaherrattaren käsi oli kipee.","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.20166,"lon":24.06963,"label":"Sääksmäki","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13622668"}]},{"key":"FI:N001","id":"N001","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä aimalan kankaalla","text":"(Aimalan kankaalla Littunen, Kierikko, Maijala, Ha o, Vatanen, Seppälä Mikkola, Penttilä) Helkavalkea helatorst Toinen lastu meni Maskun kalliolle, mutta sinne ei kirkkoa tehty...","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Aimalan kankaalla","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N002","id":"N002","collection":"FI","title":"kirkko","text":"Aimalan kirkko lienee sijainnut Lempäälän Kuokkalan Aimalassa. Kirkko oli yhteinen lempääläläisille ja vesilahtilaisille. Mutta vesilahtilaisten kirkkomatka oli tuntuvasti pidempi kuin lempääläläisten. Tämä harmitti heitä kovasti. He yllyttivät erään vähäjärkisen miehen polttamaan kirkkoa. Mies poltti kirkkon, josta taru kertoo: Mustamekko Mankalasta, harmaatakki Hinsalasta, poltti kirkon Aimalasta. Oli keskiyö, kun kirkko sytytettiin palamaan. Mutta Tarikan talon palvelustyttö valvoi ja hän huomasi tulipalon. Hän lähti juoksemaan Kuokkalaan herättääkseen kylän väen. Kun siten väki saapui paikalle, oli kirkko jo niin palanut, ettei siitä saanut pelastetuksi muuta kuin kirkon oven ja kaksi pyhänkuvaa. Osa kirkon raunioista on vieläkin nähtävänä.","source":"Hilkka Herpiä","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Aimala / Kuokkala","events":[{"id":"FI-315-E01","start":493,"end":515,"span":"hän huomasi tulipalon.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Notice fire, visual channel contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-315-E02","start":710,"end":754,"span":"Osa kirkon raunioista on vieläkin nähtävänä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic present material visibility.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Aimalan kirkko","environment":"church","time":"keskiyö","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N003","id":"N003","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä elämän lähde","text":"Ja Elämän lähre oli Kuokkalassa siinä Sarapiston mäessä Erkkilän Sarapistossa, sitä sanottiin Elämänlähteeks. Siinä oli niin hyvää kirkasta vettä.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Elämän lähde","events":[{"id":"FI-316-E01","start":110,"end":146,"span":"Siinä oli niin hyvää kirkasta vettä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Clear water explicit; hyvää not automatically taste; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Elämänlähteeks","environment":"spring","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N004","id":"N004","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä epäselvä","text":"Hoppusekeri-niminen kivi löytyy Tiuran ja Luodon talojen välillä Lempäälän Nurmella. Vanha taru kertoo, että siihen olisi käynyt kerran kiinni iso vene, jossa oli ollut suuri hääjoukko sekä morsiuspari, jotka kaikki hukkuivat järveen.","source":"Lempäälä, Söderman, S. KRK 46:49. < K. Kannelin, 70 v. Lempäälä Jokipohja,","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Epäselvä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N005","id":"N005","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä helvetinjärvi","text":"Ja toinen lempääläinen tiätää: Kankasalan tiän viäressä mitattiin yks järvi, se oli Helvetinjärvi. Ja kun sitä mitattiin, nin siältä järvestä kuulu semmonen ääni: ”Sse on nin syvä kun pitkäkin”.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Helvetinjärvi","events":[{"id":"FI-318-E01","start":126,"end":194,"span":"siältä järvestä kuulu semmonen ääni: ”Sse on nin syvä kun pitkäkin”.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Helvetinjärvi","environment":"lake","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N007","id":"N007","collection":"FI","title":"Paikannimiä.","text":"Paikannimiä.\n\nLempäälän kirkonkylästä vähän matkaa ylöspäin vesistöä tulee esiin Hiidenvuolle sekä siitä oikealle rannalla on ”Hiidenkartano” nykyinen Rantakartano. Pikkutyttönä kun kyselin, miksi sitä sanotaan ”Hiirenkartanoksi”, niin vanhatruotiukko sanoi: ”Siinä vuolteessa on asunut hiisi, mutta on mennyt Lappiin.” Siitä vähän matkaa ylöspäin on Putkiston puolella pieni lahden poukama, jota hyvi vanhat asukkaat ovat nimittäneet ”Jotanperä”. Vielä vähän matkaa ylöspäin, niin on oikealla puolella järveä ”Päärnilä”-niminen talo ja samalla kohdalla vasemmalla puolella Putkiston jatkona ”Päärnistön” talo.","source":"Söderman","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hiidenvuolle","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N009","id":"N009","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Hirvi-Simo","text":"Sil oli nin ouronnäköset kasvokkin sillä Hirvi-Simolla. Eikä sitä annettu hauratakkan kirkkomaahan, kun sitä pirettiin nin erinomasena. Se haurattiin kolmeen paikkaan. Se kaivettiin aina ylös, kun ei sitä olis antanu kukaan maahansa, pelkäsivät että se viä koko onnen pois. Ja se on ny haurattuna Lipon selässä Simuna-saaressa. Se saari on saanu siitä nimensä, kun siihen on se Hirvi-Simuna haurattu. Kaikki vanhat siit puhuu siitä Hirvi-Simosta ja toiset sanoo Simuna Hirvis-Simuna.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hirvi-Simo","events":[{"id":"FI-320-E01","start":0,"end":55,"span":"Sil oli nin ouronnäköset kasvokkin sillä Hirvi-Simolla.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic unusual appearance; uncertainty not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N010","id":"N010","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä hirvi-simo öylätti","text":"Hirvi-Simo oli semmonen, että se aina sai lintuja kuhan mettästi, eikä se muuta mitään tehnykkään. Se oli rippikirkossa, ja se oli purottanu ottanu sen öylätin käteensä. Oli yskäsevinään vaan ja purotti sen sitte. Ja hänellä oli semmoset tierot sitten kuhan vei sen kotio sen öylätin, ja pani sen seinään ja ampus sen läpitte sitte. Ja sitte kuhan oli sen öylätin lävistäny nihän näki siinnä vapahtajan kuvan. Veri tihku siitä. Ja sitte se sai mitä hän tahto vaan sillä pyssyllä. Ja sitte se\n\nJatk. 1.\n\noli toisten kanssa menny metsään istunu kannon päähän ja kattellu puuhun vaan. Ja toiset sano, eks sinä viittikkän lähtee pirem mälle. ”Mitäs minä niitä nin kaukaa lähren haeskeleen kyllä niitä tähänkin tulee”, sano Simo. Toiset sitte tahtovat ja aattelivat, että mitä se ny hulluilee. Ja kuhe meni vähä siitä, nin pyssy präjähti. Ja menivät kattoon mikä se oli. Ja lintuja oli oikeen paljo, mettoksiakin Simon ympärillä kuus mettosta ja kolme teertä oli","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hirvi-simo öylätti","events":[{"id":"FI-321-E01","start":374,"end":408,"span":"nihän näki siinnä vapahtajan kuvan","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Original spacing retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-321-E02","start":560,"end":581,"span":"kattellu puuhun vaan.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later hunting scene.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-321-E03","start":818,"end":833,"span":"pyssy präjähti.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-321-E04","start":837,"end":893,"span":"menivät kattoon mikä se oli. Ja lintuja oli oikeen paljo","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"source investigation","evidence":"mikä se oli","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Group observers; realised look, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N011","id":"N011","collection":"FI","title":"”Hirvi-Simuna ja Simunansaari.”","text":"”Hirvi-Simuna ja Simunansaari.”\n\nNoin yli 100 vuotta sitten oli Lempäälässä etevä ja roteva metsästäjä, joka sai mitä riistaa halusi. Kerran oli hän mennyt rippikirkkoon ja pisti ”öylätin” taskuunsa suustaan. Kun pääsi kirkosta, niin asetti sen kuuseen ja rupesi ampumaan siihen ja se muuttui hänen silmissään eläväksi Vapahtajan kuvaksi. Tämän jälestä tuli hänelle se huomattava ampumataito, että kaatoi susia, karhuja ja hirviä paljon. Sitten kun hän kuoli, niin häntä pelättiin kaikkialla. Kirkkomaahan ei annettu haudata häntä, kun oli tehnyt jotain sitä vastaan eläissään, Silloin ottivat jotkut miehet ruumiskistun ja veivät Lempäälän kanavan takana olevaan Maakalan talon korpeen ja hautasivat sen sinne. Mutta Maakalan isäntäpä komensi kaivamaan pois. Miehet veivät sen sitten järveä myöden ylöspäin ja hautasi vat” Heikinsaareen”. Mutta taas saaren omistajat\n\nJatk. 1.\n\nkomensivat siitäkin pois. Silloin veivät miehet sen aina ylöspäin Liponselällä olevaan saareen, jota ei omista kukaan. Siihen se jäi, ja saarta on siitä ajasta alkaen kutsuttu ”Simunansaari.” Kuitenkin pitäisi asia olla niin, että miehet kieritti ruumiin kistusta jo Maakalan korpeen ja kuljettivat vain tyhjää kistua.","source":"Jatk. | Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:36. <Emil Peltonen, 60 v. Lempäälä Aimala.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hirvi-Simuna","events":[{"id":"FI-322-E01","start":282,"end":338,"span":"se muuttui hänen silmissään eläväksi Vapahtajan kuvaksi.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"changed appearance","evidence":"muuttui hänen silmissään","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N012","id":"N012","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Hirvi-simuna","text":"Lempäälän Sääksjärven metsissä liikkui Hirvi Simuna nimellä oleva tietäjä noita 1890. – 1925. v. välillä hän sai paljon metsänriistaa metsästä josta toiset eivät saaneet loitsuilla hän","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hirvi-simuna","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N013","id":"N013","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Hirvi-Simunan kuolema","text":"Seuravan tarinan olen kuullut Lempäälässä oli ennen mies nimeltä Hirvi Simuna. Kerrottiin Simunan saaneen vallan tavattomasti hirviä. Hän oli tehnyt kaupat paholaisen kanssa että hän antaa henkensä pahalaiselle kun hän saa hirviä kadettua jon ison määrän, summasta ei niin tarkkaan tiedetä. Kerran oli sitten Simuna hionut kaksi puukkoa ja ladannut kaksi pyssyä ja hänellä oli ollut niin kova kiire lähteä metsään aivan tuska. Luolassa Lempäälän Lipon saaressa hän oli sitten ampunut itsensä. Hänet haudattiin samaan saareen. Kerrotaan arkun nousseen kolme kertaa maanpinnalle.","source":"Lempäälä. KT 59. Vainoniemi,Kerttu 5. 1938.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hirvi-Simunan kuolema","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N014","id":"N014","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Hyssynvuori","text":"Hyvin vanha taru kertoo: kun jouluyönä kuultiin pirun huutelevan Hyssyn-vuoresta Hyssyn isännälle: ”Hyssy-hyssy, tu syömään sikas lihaa, tääll’ on kystä keitettynä, toista kystä keitetään.” Hyssyn vuori on noin 11/2 kilom. Lempäälän kirkolta Valkeakosk. päin oikealla puolella ”Ämmäristinmäkeä” ja vuoren etelärinteellä on Hyssy-niminen maatila.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:12. <Evert Jokinen, 79 v. Lempäälä Korkeamäki.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Hyssynvuori","events":[{"id":"FI-325-E01","start":39,"end":97,"span":"kuultiin pirun huutelevan Hyssyn-vuoresta Hyssyn isännälle","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Hyssyn-vuoresta","environment":"mountain","time":"jouluyönä","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N016","id":"N016","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä kerilahti","text":"Kerilahti on nimi erään kalastuslahden Lemp. Säijän ja Vesilahden välillä. Siinä tapahtui kerran, kun oli sakki kalastajia, toiset tekivät tulen rannalle ja kaksi miestä laskivat nuotan järveen, kun saivat sen lasketuksi ja rupesivat soutamaan rantaan, niin järveltä kuului ääni ”kerinkömä” 3-4 eri huutoa. Miehet vastasivat, että ”keri nyt saatana”. Siinä samassa pääsivät rantaan. Sitä ten kun paatti vedettiin rantaan, niin siihen ilmestyi itsestään kaksi suurta lankakerää paatin pohjalle. Miehet rupesivat kaikin ottamaan selkoa, onko äskenlasketut nuotat ehjinä ja huomasivatkin ihmeekseen, ettei niistä ollut jälkeäkään jäljellä. Lahtea ruvettiin kutsumaan ”kerilahti”.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:8. < Emil Peltonen, 60 v. Lempäälä Aimala.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Kerilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-326-E01","start":258,"end":306,"span":"järveltä kuului ääni ”kerinkömä” 3-4 eri huutoa.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-326-E02","start":571,"end":636,"span":"huomasivatkin ihmeekseen, ettei niistä ollut jälkeäkään jäljellä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"missing material trace","evidence":"ettei niistä ollut jälkeäkään jäljellä","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Inspection of nets; visual contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kerilahti","environment":"lake","time":"","movement":"rupesivat soutamaan rantaan"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N018","id":"N018","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä kiiliäisen ahde","text":"Ja Kiiliäisen ahteessa Kiiliäisen kaivontolpassa piiskattiin niitä pahantekijöitä. Mutta toinen kertoja sano, että ei tää Kiiliäisen kaivon tolppa ollu tavallinen piiskauspaikka. Se oli vaan keskiavari se Kiiliäinen sillon. Se oli Vesilahresta yks Eemeli Pärjus, se oli kruununvourina Ruaverellä ja siällä se kualikin. Se oli Suomelan poikia (Suomela on Vesilahressa). Se oli täällä, tän pitäjään vallasmannilla, oli virkavapautta, oli kai lukuja viälä ni hän oli sitte etulaisena ja piiskuutti sitte siinnä Kiiliäisen kaivontolpassa. Isäntä oli pelolla sillon, ette se ollu kotona, että siihen lupa käytiin sitte kysymässä. Se oli Tormi-niminen miäs, jota piiskattiin. Minä satun oleen hollissa, nin siinnä minä sitä kattelin, kaivonkannossa, tolpassa. Se pantiin ranteista sillä lailla, että se tolppa oli sen sylissä, pantiin määrly tolppaan, että se pysy. Sen piti vaan varpaat sattua asetuksen mukaan eikä koko jalka. Sil olikin ehronvalta, se olis päässy linnaankin, mutta se\n\nJatk. 1.\n\nsano, että hänellä on valta, että jos hän syö taikka ottaa vittat, mutta minä pääsen pikemmin irki, kun otan selkääni. Hän otti vittat sitte ennen. Se oli toite kertaa varastamisesta. Kaks kertaako siitä sai pennä linnaan, toisella kertaa kumminkin oli ehrovvalta, jos meni linnaan taik otti selkäänsä. Kahdeksankymmentähdeksan paria ansettiin, ne luettiin siinnä ne vittat. Sanovat, että se oli asetus, että kun neljäkymmentä paria oli tuomittu, nin kahrelle parille jätettiin antamata selkään. Mutta tälle Tornille annettiin, mitä määräkin oli, kahdeksankymmentäkahdeksan paria. Vittat oli täyty olla viis korttelia pitkiä, ne mitettiin siinnä. Ja vallesmannilla oli plakkarikello kädessä, kelloo se katteli ja viittas kärellään, kuhan kelloo katteli, nin viittas elinsä kärellään ja viisari löi sitte aina minuutin perästä ja Torni sano: Älä kylkeeni lyö.” Ei niitten pitäny saarakkan lyärä kylkeen, eikä muualle kun selkään. Paljas selkä oli, paljaaseen sel-","source":"Jatk. 1. Lempäälä. Ritva. H. PK 5:900. | Lempäälä. Ritva, H. PK 5. 900. Jatk. 2.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Kiiliäisen ahde","events":[{"id":"FI-327-E01","start":701,"end":726,"span":"siinnä minä sitä kattelin","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-327-E02","start":754,"end":819,"span":"Se pantiin ranteista sillä lailla, että se tolppa oli sen sylissä","modalities":["touch","pressure"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Bound punished person; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-327-E03","start":1495,"end":1573,"span":"tälle Tornille annettiin, mitä määräkin oli, kahdeksankymmentäkahdeksan paria.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Actual lashes in prior context, pain not inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-327-E04","start":1685,"end":1723,"span":"kelloo se katteli ja viittas kärellään","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Official watches clock.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kiiliäisen kaivontolpassa","environment":"settlement","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N019","id":"N019","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä komento-mikko","text":"Mikko-niminen miäs, sanottiin Komento-Mikoks, kun se tuppas aina nin komenteleen toisia ihmisiä, nin se puhu, että Vesilahressa yhdessä mettäänjärven ojan suussa, oja meni mettäänjärveen, oli paljo kaloja, että he saivat siitä aina kalatarpeensa ku he kopalla vaan pistelivät, toinen toisella ja toinen toisella puolella ojaa. Mutta sitte he rupes tappeleen, ne kalastajat siitä, kumpi enempi oli saanu ja kalat hävis oitis, lopettivat sillälailla sen saaliinsa, ettei tarvinnu sen talkosen takaa mennä kopalla pisteleen. Kalat loppu kaikki sitte oitis ja tää oli ihan totta. Se Komento-Mikko sitä puhu aina.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Komento-mikko","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N020","id":"N020","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä kukonkivi kanankivi","text":"Kanankivi ja Kukonkivi sijaitsevat Lempäälän pitäjässä Kuokkalan kylässä. Kanankivi on noin 11 km Tampereelta Lempäälään päin Kankaanpään lohkotilalla. Kukonkivi on noin 300 metriä Kanakivestä Lempäälään päin, Antto Koskisen lohkotilalla. Molemmat kivet Lempäälään mennessä tien oikealla puolella aivan maantien vieressä. Kanakivestä on osa maantien alueella. Iida Kankaanpää kertoi olleensa 12 vuotias, kun ensi kerran meni kahden vanhan mummon kanssa Tampereelle. Mummot sanoivat, että kun ensikertaa menee Tampereelle, pitää kumpaakin kiveä kumartaa, ja heittää penni kummallekin kivelle. Mummot kertoivat kivien nimitykset johtuvat Kuljun kartanon tulipalosta. Kuljun kartano on siitä noin 3 km päässä. Silloin kukko lensi (Kuljusta päin) lähemmälle kivelle, ja kana kauempana olevalle kivelle. Niinkuin yllä jo mainittiin, niin nimitys johtuu Kuljun kartanossa olleesta tulipalosta, mutta nuorempi polvi sanoo nimityksen johtuvan noin 1,5 km Kuljua kauempana olevasta Kukkolan kartanon pa-\n\nJatk. 1.\n\nlosta. Kukkolan kartanossa onkin ollut useita tulipaloja. Kertojan muisti-ijällä ainakin kaksi kertaa. Kanakivi on allekirjoittaneen omistamalla maalla. Kunmaastakin kivestä seuraa valokuva mukana.","source":"Lempäälä. Auramo, V. PK 5:878. Jatk 1 | Lempäälä. Auramo, V. PK 5:878. < Ida Kankaanpää, Lempäälä, Kankaanpää, s. 4/9 Pirkkalassa.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Kukonkivi kanankivi","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N021","id":"N021","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Kuokkalan koski","text":"Kuokkalan kosken juttu Meni housujaan kraatarista hakemaan, mutta rupesi pelaamaan korttia. Mutta paha henki vei hänet keskelle koskea sen alapuolelle karille. Ja housut jäi Pitkänmäen Hakkarin korkeeseen kuuseen. Kuokkalan vanha seppä, Koskinen, meni ruuhella hänet noutamaan pois.","source":"Lempäälä. Frans Kärki 3607. 1948. < mäkitupalainen Juho Eemil Peltonen, 73 v., Lempäälä Aimala.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Kuokkalan koski","events":[{"id":"FI-330-E01","start":98,"end":159,"span":"paha henki vei hänet keskelle koskea sen alapuolelle karille.","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Forced transport stated, no felt quality; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"keskelle koskea","environment":"rapids","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N022","id":"N022","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä kuokkalan piiskaustolppa","text":"Ja Kuokkalan Erkkilän vainiolla oli semmonen tolppa, jossa piiskattiin. Se oli sitävasten tehty se tolppa, jossa niitä piiskattiin. Äitevainaani oli kattellu sitä kun siinnä piiskattiin naistakin. Se oli semmonen huorra ollu, lapsensa tappanu ja se rukoili, ettei pitänyt enää lyätämän. Äitevainaani sano, että se oli verilihalla koko sen selkä pirstana ja ajetuksissa kun kakko ja mustana ja nainen poras sitte vaan.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, H. PK 5:929.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Kuokkalan piiskaustolppa","events":[{"id":"FI-331-E01","start":132,"end":196,"span":"Äitevainaani oli kattellu sitä kun siinnä piiskattiin naistakin.","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Mother visual witness; punished woman contact experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-331-E02","start":393,"end":417,"span":"nainen poras sitte vaan.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Dialect crying, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kuokkalan Erkkilän vainiolla","environment":"field","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N023","id":"N023","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä kusimäki","text":"Kuokkalan ja Lemposten välillä yhtä paikkaa sanotaan Kusimäeks. Sitävasten kun kirkkoväki poikkes siihen aina ku-lle, kun se on vähä kirkosta matkaa, niin käytiin poikettiin tiätysti mennen tullen siihen laskeen, nin sitte tuli siitä Kusimäki.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Kusimäki","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N025","id":"N025","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Lemposten sillan tonttu","text":"Lempäälä. Tappura, K.F. a 8. 1895.\n\nKyllä niitä tonttujuttuja paljon on, mutt’en minä muista niitä oikeen. Mutta oli Sotavallassakin semmonen tonttu. Se tuli kerran Viikistä, en tiedä mitähän siällä liiä tehny, mutta sieltä Viikistä se vaan tuli. Lemposten sillan päässä se poikkes yhteen ittellisämmän pirttiin, kun pojaan tuli kylmä, ja nosti poikansa kiukaalle. lämmitteleen ja sano, että: o(s) sinä tossa nin kauvan kun lähremme patruunin tykö. Sitte ne meni(vät) kotio Sotavaltaan ja siällä kävi yks hoviseppä takomassa, joka osti Hollon talon Sakoisista. Se seppä pani sitte yüks maata vaan pajan eteen kerolle, kun oli kuuma aika. Mutta tonttu, kun tuli kotio, sano sepälle, että: mitas siinä makaat; mikses me’ oikeen makuusialles? Onko se mikään työmiehen maattava? Seppä sano, että: minä katton valkeen perään. Mutta tonttu sano, että: kyllä minä valkeen katton, mutta jos toisen kerran viälä panet maata siähen, niin minä heitän sun keskelle Sotavallan järvee. Seppä ei arvannu enää panna pajan eteen maata. Se teki paljon hyvää se Sotavallan tonttu. Kerrankin se utteli itteensä, kun väki riihellä oli. Sitte väki sano, että kaas vaari meille vähän erikoista ja kun tonttu vähän aikaa ollu pois, niin se toi ja heitti ovesta riiheen liha(i)jaja olvillekkerin, niin että kyllä väen kelpas. rran taas kun oli köyhät ajaat, meni yks ämmä herralta","source":"a) 8","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Lemposten sillan tonttu","events":[{"id":"FI-333-E01","start":313,"end":334,"span":"kun pojaan tuli kylmä","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-333-E02","start":339,"end":377,"span":"nosti poikansa kiukaalle. lämmitteleen","modalities":["touch","temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Warming action; child experiencer; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N026","id":"N026","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä lintuparvi 1","text":"Kirjottajan äite muistaa, että Sohviavainaa ennen puhu että kun hän kerran tuli lauantaihtoona myähä myähään sarvittamasta siittä vaan läheltä Nurkiselta taikka Tappuralta, kumpikohan oli, kun oli lauantaiehtoo ja sauna muutonkin lämmitetty kylvöttiin. Nin kun hän tuli palas saunasta sarvittamasta nin siinnä vähä ennen kun hän pääsi kotio, siihen kuhan asu Kärppälän maalla siinnä vainiomäen syrjässä vähän matkan maantiästä, nin siinnä tuli kun nin suuria lintuja hänen ympärilleen, nin paljon ninkun variskia mustia. Ja niitä oli nin paljo ja lenteli joka taholleen hänen ympärillään, ettei hän tahtonu mihinkään päästä. Sano etteinhän kajonnu hännen, mutta joka taholaan lenteli ja perässään saattovat häntä ja hän pelkäs ni.. kovasti ja siunas ja pyysi, että Jumala antas hänen päästä kotio\n\nja aatteli ja sano, ettei hän vaan enää koskaan me lauvantaiehtona kenenkään kupparinsaunaan että hän oli nin synnillinen kun hän lauantaihtoona oli työssä. Ja pirut tuli sitte nin hönnen tiälleen häntä kiusaan. N e oli suuria mustia lintuja ja kun variksia.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Lintuparvi 1 (variant 2)","events":[{"id":"FI-334-E01","start":439,"end":520,"span":"tuli kun nin suuria lintuja hänen ympärilleen, nin paljon ninkun variskia mustia.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"approximate form","evidence":"ninkun variskia mustia","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Contextual observed flock, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-334-E02","start":589,"end":624,"span":"ettei hän tahtonu mihinkään päästä.","modalities":["orientation","movement sensation"],"groups":["orientation","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"blocked passage","evidence":"ettei hän tahtonu mihinkään päästä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kärppälän maalla","environment":"road","time":"lauantaihtoona myähä myähään","movement":"palas saunasta"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N027","id":"N027","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä lohikallio","text":"Kummituksia. Lempäälänpitäjässä Lohikallion mäellä oli Kummitus. Hevoset kuorsasivat sen kohdalla eivätkä kulkeneet täytyi siunata Jumalaa avuksi niin kummitus häipyi jos piti pahaa ääntä tai kirosi kummitus vihastui entisestään ja piti kovaa Jytinää Lohikalliossa 1800. v. puolivälillä se on ollut pahemmillaan tästä on paljon puhuttu niillä seuduin.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Lohikallio (variant 2)","events":[{"id":"FI-335-E01","start":65,"end":97,"span":"Hevoset kuorsasivat sen kohdalla","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-335-E02","start":232,"end":264,"span":"piti kovaa Jytinää Lohikalliossa","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Lohikallion mäellä","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N028","id":"N028","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Lohikallio","text":"Lohikalliolle on kumminkin piiskattu ja tapettu niitä pahantekijöitä. Sitä on paljo puhuttu, että siinnä on nähty ja kuultu kaikenmoisia. Ja Teilinmaaks sanottiin semmosta Helkolen maata, peltoo, joka oli siinnä tiänhaarassa, josta meni Hulauteen ja Näppilään tiä, semmonen kolmikulmanen maapala, nin sitä sanottiin Teilinmaaks ja siinnä vanhat ihmiset ennen sanovat olleen semmosen tolpan, jonka päässä piti olleen semmosen pyärrän, johon sitte tällättiin se semmonen pahantekijä, sen pyärrän päälle lintujen ruaaks mätäneen sinne. Olikohan sitte semmonen määrä sitte, että siinnä piti olla semmonen pyärrä, kun sitä nin sinne pantiin lintujen ruaaks ja mätneen.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Lohikallio","events":[],"context":{"place":"Lohikalliolle","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N029","id":"N029","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä lohikallio","text":"Kyllä niit on semmosia eri paikkoja piretty pyhänä, arvokkaana ennen mailmassa. Äijälän Ville-vainaakin kun minun pirttini oli siinnä likellä, nim min aina ehtoisilla piipahrin sinne, nin se oli semmonen kans, että se usko kaikkiin. Nin sekin puhu, että niit oli semmosia paikkoja, että vanhat ihmiset kävi ja pitivät semmosia rukouksia niissä. Kyllä se enempi oli kai sitä pakanuuren aikasta. Sano, että toikin Lohikalliokin että siinnäkin on oikein hartaasti rukoiltu polvillaan oikein. Kai niitten sielujen pualesta, jokka siin on mestattu. Siinnä Lohikalliolle on isonvihan aikanakin mestattu.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Lohikallio","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N030","id":"N030","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Marjamäki mestauspaikka","text":"Ja Vesilahressa Nervantiän viäressä on Marjamäki niminen maapaikka, jonka läpitte meni maantiä, semmonen mettä on siinnä kahrenpualen tiätä, nin siin oli kans semmonen suuri pitkä tolppa, jos oli ihmisiä pahantekijöitä tapettu. Kihnattiin siinnä siihen vaan ylös ja pää poikki. Ja siinnä on semmosia tapauksia tullu, että siinnä hevosenkalut päästettiin irki ja kuultiin semmosia ääniä.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Marjamäki mestauspaikka","events":[{"id":"FI-338-E01","start":362,"end":386,"span":"kuultiin semmosia ääniä.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicit hearing, unspecified sound.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Marjamäki","environment":"forest road","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N031","id":"N031","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä mäyränkenttä","text":"Piirileikeistä. Lempäälän Lastusten perällä Mayränkentällä on menty piirileikkejä Tilda ja Lyydia Ruohosenmaa lauloivat siellä Linttusen Eino ja Katri siellä myös lauloivat aina juontaa muistitietojen mukaan 1700. v. luvulta asti ympäri pitäjää kokoonnuttiin Mäyränkentälle. Monet sieltä ovat löytäneet Elämäntoverinsa sillä naapuripitäjistäkin sinne väkeä kokoontui Rehellisesti elettiin ei tapeltu oltiin tyytyväisiä.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Mäyränkenttä","events":[{"id":"FI-339-E01","start":82,"end":172,"span":"Tilda ja Lyydia Ruohosenmaa lauloivat siellä Linttusen Eino ja Katri siellä myös lauloivat","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated singing; no listener named.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Mayränkentällä","environment":"field","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N032","id":"N032","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä noita soutaa kiveä","text":"Noita soutamassa lattealla kivellä 2 kilom. matkan.\n\nKertoja oli kuullut lapsuuspäivinään tarinan, että on eräs noita-akka ilmestynyt Luodon rantaan, istunut lattealle kivelle ja kivi lähtenyt menemään järven selälle ja pysähtynyt Kaakilan rantaan Vesilahden puolelle. Välimatka on noin 2 km. Järvi on ollut laineissa.","source":"Söderman","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Noita soutaa kiveä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Travel on stone narrated; observer and felt displacement not stated.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N034","id":"N034","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Pirunkallio","text":"Haltia Nallionrinteellä. Lemp. Lahdenkylän notkossa, jossa on kaksi ahdetta, on idänpuol. ahdetta kallio, jota on etäisissä ajoissa kutsuttu ”pirunkallioksi”. Siinä on nähty yöaikoina jonkun miehen haamun tulleen saattamaan hevosella matkaavaa ja erään kerran oli Lumialan Mattilan emännän valjaat auenneet tietämättömistä syistä, kun emäntä meni Tampereelle yöllä torikaupoille. Emäntä sanoi sen pirun työksi, joka istui vahtia pitämässä kallion riteellä. Kallion seinää vasten piti olla tämän kertojankin näkemänä muka sileä kivi, jossa istunp. selän kohdalla oli kalliossa selvä hartiain ja pään kuva. Kalliosta on alettu ottaa joskus kiviä maantiehen, joten ei vielä ole enään sitä hartiain ja pään kuvaa, jota vielä elossa olevat vanhukset ovat lapsina käyneet katsomassa.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, Sandra. KRK 46:21. < Evert Jokinen. 79v. Lempääla Korke-","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Pirunkallio","events":[{"id":"FI-341-E01","start":159,"end":243,"span":"Siinä on nähty yöaikoina jonkun miehen haamun tulleen saattamaan hevosella matkaavaa","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"indeterminate figure","evidence":"jonkun miehen haamun","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic figure, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-341-E02","start":489,"end":604,"span":"tämän kertojankin näkemänä muka sileä kivi, jossa istunp. selän kohdalla oli kalliossa selvä hartiain ja pään kuva.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Narrator's material-trace observation; time not given.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-341-E03","start":735,"end":777,"span":"vanhukset ovat lapsina käyneet katsomassa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Earlier group observation of rock marks.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Nallionrinteellä","environment":"hillside","time":"yöaikoina","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N035","id":"N035","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä pyhä-nimiä","text":"Onhan Lempäälässä Pyhältä kyläntäimi ja Pyhälä talon nimi, nin pyhiä paikkoja nekumminkin on ollu.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, Hilma KRK 66:80 <Jara, Heikki 71 v.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Pyhä-nimiä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N036","id":"N036","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Teilinmäki","text":"Paikannimi. Lempäälän kirkonkylästä vähän matkaa Hulauden kylään päin valtamaantien varrella on tien ohes sa Halkolan talon vainiomäellä. Paikkaa on vanhassa ajassa kutsuttu ”Teilinmäeksi”. Saanut nimensä, kun siinä tien ohessa oli ennenmuinoin teilauspaikka, jossa oli pidetty aina teilattu ruumis muutaman päivän teilauksen jälkeen yleisön nähtävänä. Paikkaa on ennenmuinoin pelätty ja kuultu kummituksia.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:46. < Iida Tiura, 65 v. Lempäälä Tiurala.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Teilinmäki","events":[{"id":"FI-343-E01","start":292,"end":352,"span":"ruumis muutaman päivän teilauksen jälkeen yleisön nähtävänä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Public visibility, not individuated looking.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-343-E02","start":388,"end":407,"span":"kuultu kummituksia.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic hearing, no acoustic quality; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Teilinmäeksi","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N037","id":"N037","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Tervakedon aarnihaudat","text":"Tervakedon aarnitulet. Kertoja oli kuullut varmana puhutun, että eräällä paikalla, joka on Käyrän ja Luodon talojen välillä Lempäälässä, että siinä oli palanut aarnitulet joskus pimeän aikoina. Ne olivat olleet kuin sieltä täältä olevia kynttilän tulen kokoisia tulia, valo vain hiukan sinisempää ja piti tietämän mukaan ilmaiseman, että maassa löytyy malmiaarteita. Paikkaa nimitetään Tervakedoksi.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, Sandra. KRK 46:24. < V.Toivola, 70 v. Lempäälä Hahkala.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Tervakedon aarnihaudat","events":[{"id":"FI-344-E01","start":194,"end":296,"span":"Ne olivat olleet kuin sieltä täältä olevia kynttilän tulen kokoisia tulia, valo vain hiukan sinisempää","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported appearance without named observer; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Tervakedoksi","environment":"field","time":"pimeän aikoina","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N038","id":"N038","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Vannulan kallio","text":"Piirileikkikentästä. Wannulan korkealla Kalliolla on menty piirileikkejä. jo. 1700. v. alulta alkaen. Viulun soittaja oli Frans. Nääjärvi viimenen siellä vanha Saksi Oskari soitteli 2. rivistä haitaria. kuollut 1920. v. luvulla. Piirileikkien laulajia olivat Tilda ja Aune Wannula Lehtisen Eemil ja Arvo ja Kalle samoin lauloivat Wannulan Kalliolla Lempäälässä kokoonnuttiin aina Naapuripitäjiä myöden Lauantai ja Sunnuntai iltaisin.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Vannulan kallio","events":[{"id":"FI-345-E01","start":160,"end":202,"span":"Saksi Oskari soitteli 2. rivistä haitaria.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-345-E02","start":259,"end":329,"span":"Tilda ja Aune Wannula Lehtisen Eemil ja Arvo ja Kalle samoin lauloivat","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Wannulan Kalliolla","environment":"rock","time":"Lauantai ja Sunnuntai iltaisin","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N039","id":"N039","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä ämmäristi teilipaikka","text":"Ja Ämmäristin ahteellakin oli teilipaikka. Ruattin aikana oli täällä semmonen laki, että kun murhan oli tehny nin oitis henki pois. Pappi oli siinnä paikalla nuhrellu esiJa mäestä tuli sitte semmonen, joka pani pään poikki. Paino siihen tukille ja löi irveellä. Ja juaksi takasi aikaa kyytiä mettään. Siittä saivat sitte korjata.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, Hilma KRK 66:78 Jara, Heikki 71 v.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Ämmäristi teilipaikka","events":[{"id":"FI-346-E01","start":224,"end":261,"span":"Paino siihen tukille ja löi irveellä.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Execution contact explicit; no pain inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ämmäristin ahteellakin","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N040","id":"N040","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Ämmäristi","text":"Ämmäristi. Erästä paikkaa, joka on Lempäälän asemalta Valkeakoskelle päin noin 2½ kilom. kutsutaan Ämmäristinmäeksi. Saanut muka nimensä siitä, että pai kalla olisi ollut mestauspaikka, jossa on tullut ensinnä mestattavaksi nainen eli ämmä ihminen. Huomautus. Löytyy hiljattain ilmestyneessä Pirk. historiassa toinenkin nimen synty merkkaus mainit. mäelle. Kerrotaan pakanuuden ajalta asustaneen hiiden, joka kirkonkellojen äänen kuultuaan on paennut.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:47. < Viht. Toivola, 70-75 v. Lempäälä Mahkala.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Ämmäristi","events":[{"id":"FI-347-E01","start":409,"end":451,"span":"kirkonkellojen äänen kuultuaan on paennut.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Explicitly within historical-source note embedded in text; retain evidence layer as embedded scholarly account.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ämmäristinmäeksi","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N041","id":"N041","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Ämmäristin ahde","text":"Ämmäristin ahteesta on sanottu, että siinnä yks mijä lykkäs ämmäänsä kelkalla ylös ahrettaa ja sano sitte kun oli raskasta, kun se on nin pitkä ahre:”Voi mun ristiäni.”","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, H. PK 5:921.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Ämmäristin ahde","events":[{"id":"FI-348-E01","start":106,"end":148,"span":"kun oli raskasta, kun se on nin pitkä ahre","modalities":["bodily sensation","pressure"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Effort/weight wording, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ämmäristin ahteesta","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":"lykkäs ämmäänsä kelkalla ylös ahrettaa"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N042","id":"N042","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Ämmäristin ahde","text":"Mutta entisten kuulemani mukaan sen nimi olis jostakin semmosesta kun siinnä Ämmäristin ahteella taik ainakin hyvin liki sitä on mestattu ihmisiä, on vanha mestauspaikka se Ämmäristin ahre.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, H. PK 5:920.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Ämmäristin ahde","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N043","id":"N043","collection":"FI","title":"tuhnunvuoril","text":"Tuhnunvuori on nimi erään paikan Vesilahden Laukossa. Siitä on maanalainen tonttu kulkenut Laukon kellarista oltta varastamassa niin pientä luolaa myöden, josta eivät ihmiset mahtuneet kulkemaan. Kerran pis tettiin siihen vuorenluolaan koira ja se ilmestyi Laukon kellariin. Luolan suulla oli sileä luolaan päin kalteva kivi, jota nimitettiin ”pirunpöydäksi”, jossa se piti kumppaneinensa kestejä. Kivi oli pyöreä. Kerran olivat juopuneet Hinsalan kylän miehet menneet ja kaatovat kiven ja kierittivät sen vuorelta järveen. Tästä piti nostettaman syyte lais sa, vaan se jäi toteuttamatta. Syytteen nostajat olisivat sen säilyttäneet sileytenensä ynnä tarunsa vuoksi.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:42. <Kalle Nummelin, 70 v. Lempäälä Jokipohja.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Tuhnunvuoril","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N044","id":"N044","collection":"FI","title":"piruvuari","text":"Vesilahres on Pirunvuari, josta piti mennyks maan läpitte Laukon kellariin ja myllätty siällä.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, H. PK 5:901.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Piruvuari","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N045","id":"N045","collection":"FI","title":"Tuhnunvuori","text":"Tuhnunvuori\n\non nimi erään paikan Vesilahden Laukossa. Siitä on maanalainen tonttu kulkenut Laukon kellarista oltta varastamassa niin pientä luolaa myöden, josta eivät ihmiset mahtuneet kulkemaan. Kerran pis tettiin siihen vuorenluolaan koira ja se ilmestyi Laukon kellariin. Luolan suulla oli sileä luolaan päin kalteva kivi, jota nimitettiin ”pirunpöydäksi”, jossa se piti kumppaneinensa kestejä. Kivi oli pyöreä. Kerran olivat juopuneet Hinsalan kylän miehet menneet ja kaatovat kiven ja kierrittivät sen vuorelta järveen. Tästä piti nostettaman syyte lais sa, vaan se jäi toteuttamatta. Syytteen nostajat olisivat sen säilyttäneet sileytenensä ynnä tarunsa vuoksi.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman,S. KRK 46:42. <Kalle Nummelin, 70 v. Lempäälä Jokipohja.","category":"Lempäälä location-specific legends","place":"Tuhnunvuoril (variant 2)","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N048","id":"N048","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä ison talon isännäksi","text":"Isotalon isännäksi,\nIson talon emännäksi,\nMie se virvon viisahasti,\nTaputtelen taitavasti,\nRahan iest raksuttelen,\nMunan iest muksuttelen,\nLeivan iest lepsuttelen,\nKohvin iest kopsuttelen.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N049","id":"N049","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä jouluryyppy haltijalle","text":"Ja jouluna kun ryyppy annettiin jouluna miähille nin vaari heitti muurintaha ensimmäisen ryypyn talon haltialle, sillon kuhan oli ryypyn anatajana. Ja kun viaras vaan meni talliin, nin se viätiin keinolla millä hyvänsä asunhuanneeseen, ei se saanu mennä pois tallista elikkä siittä mis eläviä pirettiin, kun siittä olis kanssa menny onni.","source":"Ritva","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N050","id":"N050","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä karjataika","text":"Kun olin pikku poika oli kotipaikallani Kurussa noita, Rannan Leena. Keväällä kun lehmiä käskettiin ulos, lähti Leena saattamaan omiaan ja naapurin lehmiä metsään päästyään kolmen tien haa raan pidätti hän karjan ja leikkasi jokaiselta lehmältä keskeltä päätä karvatupon. Tien haarassa kasvoi suuri mänty, tähän oli Leena aikaisemmin tehnyt 9 reikää nyt hän tukki leikkaamansa karvat noihin reikiin, nousi korkealle kivelle, käänsi kasvonsa päin pohjosta, levitti kätensä ja huusi suurella äänellä:” Rannan Leena lehmät kotiin, Pe kan lehmät suohon ja lähteeseen.” Kun Leena oli poistunut karjoineen, kaivoivat pojat karvat pois männyn kolosta ottivat Leenan asennon ja huusivat ” Rannan Leena lehmät suohon ja lähteeseen ja Pekankaikki lehmät kotiin.” Kaikki Rannan lehmät lehmät kuolivatsinä kesänä ruostelähteeseen niin väitti kerto jamme. Juhkkaala, Elsa KRK 27:6 Lempäälä.","source":"KRK 2716","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-355-E01","start":475,"end":497,"span":"huusi suurella äänellä","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Loud voice production.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-355-E02","start":670,"end":752,"span":"huusivat ” Rannan Leena lehmät suohon ja lähteeseen ja Pekankaikki lehmät kotiin.”","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Boys' subsequent counter-call.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kolmen tien haa raan","environment":"crossroads","time":"Keväällä","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N051","id":"N051","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä karjataika","text":"Karjaa laskiessa ensi kertaa laitumelle keväällä, oli tapana vetää tervaa lehmien kuonoon, ettei käärme pistäisi lehmää. Samoin miehillä oli tapana tervata naisten jalat, ettei käärme pistä. Tämä tehtiin enemmän väkivaltaa käyttäen osittain ilman taikaa, lienee siinä taikaakin ollut.","source":"Lempäälä. Vilho Auramo KT 15:35. 1938.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-356-E01","start":61,"end":89,"span":"vetää tervaa lehmien kuonoon","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Generic animal contact, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-356-E02","start":148,"end":169,"span":"tervata naisten jalat","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Generic human contact, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"keväällä","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N053","id":"N053","collection":"FI","title":"Karhu vastassa.","text":"Karhu vastassa.\n\nNoita Kassari-Matin isä oli vanhan ajan suutari. Kerran oli pyydetty häntä Mateuslahden torppaan työhön, johon Kassari oli lupautunut, vaan jostain syystä lupausaika menikin ohi ja torppaan pyydettiin joku toinen suutarin työt tekemään. Siitä julmistui Kassarin mieli kateelliseksi ja kostoksi noitui hän, että aina kun torpan isäntä astui ulos pirtistään, niin aina oli iso karhu vähän matkaa edessään, varsinkin kun pysähtyi. Kaikkein vaikeimmaksi kävi puhteella liikkuminen, varsinkin tärkeillä ( kun ei ollut käymälätä) asioilla. Torpan isännän täytyi nöyrtyä lahjomaan viinalla Kassaria, joka saikin asiat ennalleen ja karhu katosi.","source":"Söderman","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-357-E01","start":379,"end":419,"span":"aina oli iso karhu vähän matkaa edessään","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"recurrent apparition","evidence":"aina oli iso karhu vähän matkaa edessään","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Perception contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"pirtistään","environment":"domestic threshold","time":"puhteella","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N054","id":"N054","collection":"FI","title":"Kuljun tonttu","text":"Kuljun tonttu\n\nTonttuja oli Kuljun kartanossa. Ent. torp. Lusti-Herman Ruoholan kylästä, oli renkinä Kuljussa. He olivat klo 2 riihtä alkamassa, oli varstoilla tapettu, sitten oikasivat pitkäkseen kun kallioli ahdettu. Tonttu aukaisi ovea. Silloin Herman lausui: ”Hyvä kunnian herra, tuo vähän suuruksen apua.” Ja sitten heitettiin palvattu lampaan lapa heille. He söivät ja rupesivat töihin.","source":"Lempäälä. Frans Kärki 3608. 1948. < työm. Taavetti Hietikko, s. 28/12 1864, 84 v., Lempäälää Nurkkila.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N055","id":"N055","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä käärmesanat","text":"Kun on nähty käärme, niin pannaan kaksi puuta ristiin siihen missä se käärme on nähty. Ensimäistä puuta pannessa sanotaan: ”Ei maa pirä matos”. Kun pannaan toinen puu, sanotaan: ”Eikä pyhähenki perkelettä.” Käärme tulee siihen samaan paikkaan seuraavana päivänä samaan aikaan ja sen voi tappaa.","source":"Lempäälä. Eemeli Vihervaara b) 4535. 1913 - Saimi Vuori, 14 v., kuullut Lempäälässä","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-359-E01","start":0,"end":19,"span":"Kun on nähty käärme","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic condition with explicit perception.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N056","id":"N056","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä lapsi lyö käärmettä","text":"Kerran, kun lapsi söi lattialla, tuli käärme syömään samasta kupista. Lapsi löi lusikalla sitä päähän ja sanoi: ”mitä sinä tänne tulet?” Sitten ne jatkoivat syöntiä sulassa sovussa.","source":"Sääksjärvi. Tuomela, Arvo. 8. 1937. – Lempäälä Vimpelin kylä. Tuomela, Hanna s.1878.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-360-E01","start":70,"end":101,"span":"Lapsi löi lusikalla sitä päähän","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Snake contact, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"lattialla","environment":"domestic interior","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N057","id":"N057","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä lehmän löytäminen","text":"Lehmiä etsiessä metsästä, joiden olopaikka ei ollut tiedossa, niin sylettiin käteen, lyötiin sylen päälle toisen käden etusormella ja minne suunnalle lensi isompi sylki, niin lehmien piti olla sielläpäin.","source":"Vilho Auramo","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-361-E01","start":67,"end":130,"span":"sylettiin käteen, lyötiin sylen päälle toisen käden etusormella","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Generic prescribed contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"metsästä","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N058","id":"N058","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Lemponen","text":"Mutta entisen kuulemani mukaan Lemponen olis tullu siitä, kun kristinusko tuli tälle paikalle, niin lempo meni pois sitte.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, H. PK 5:922.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N059","id":"N059","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä marjataika","text":"Kun marjaan mentiin, heitettiin marja-astia kolme kertaa ilmaan ja sanottiin: ”vittista vottista konttini täyteen!” Jos astia putosi kyljelleen, sai marjoja astiansa puolilleen. Jos se putosi kumoon, ei saanut yhtään. Jos se meni oikein päin, sai astiansa täyteen.","source":"Lempäälä. Eemeli Vihervaara b) 4537. 1913 - Saimi Vuori, 14 v., kuullut Lempäälässä","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N060","id":"N060","collection":"FI","title":"Noiduudella parant., joka oli loihdittu Sair","text":"Noiduudella parant., joka oli loihdittu Sair\n\nAikoja sitten kuollut Jokipohjan Tupalan vaari oli itse joutunut 14 vuotiaana näkemään oman isänsä tulleen yhtäkkiä kovaan taudin tuskaan, pais keli ja kiertteli itseään. Vihdoin jaksoi hän muis taa, että Vesilahden peräkulmilla on tietäjä-parantaja Tuomaalan Matti, joku torpan ukko. Käski poikansa (saman 14vuotiaan) valjastamaan hevosen ja kuskaamaan sinne. Poika valjasti ja ukko rekeen kää rittiin. Noita-parantaja oli ollut talvikalassa ja saapui siksi paikalle heidän mentyä ja sanoi: ”Minulle ilmaistiin tulostanne tuonne järvelle hengessä ja riensin heti kotiin.” Sairas rupesi jo helpottumaan tässä olossa. Sitte vietiin sairas tupaan ja torpanukko otti viinan, jota oli sairaan mukana ja meni toiseen huoneeseen porstuan perään. Kuskipoika lähti välillä hevosta hoitamaan ja kurkisti samalla porstuan peräkoppiin, kun ovi oli jäänyt Jatk.\n\nJatk. 1.\n\nrakoselleen. Näki siellä ruumiin luita ja paukoja rivissä hyllylaudalla ja noita kopeloi niitä, pani viinan pulloon. Sitten tuli sairaan luo ja kysyi, onko joku näinä aikoina riidellyt kanssasi ja näytti kuvaa, joka ilmestyi pullossa olevaan viinaan. Sairas hämmästyi ja sanoi, että juuri viime päivinä olin riidassa saman tutun miehen kanssa metsässä oleessamme (mies oli naapurikylästä). Hän oli ainainen tynnyrien tekijä ja varasteli parhaita puita ja minä ”kropsin” häntä ja hän rupesi kiroamaan ja sanoi: ”Pahat seuratkoot sinua:” Ja kotiin tultuani sain nämät tuskani ja polttoni. Noita meni vielä kammariinsa viinapullon kanssa ja sieltä tullessaan hän lausui terveyssanat potilaalle, joka samalla pääsi tuskistaan.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:32. < Kalle Nummelin, 70 v. Lempäälä Jokipohja.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-364-E01","start":124,"end":216,"span":"näkemään oman isänsä tulleen yhtäkkiä kovaan taudin tuskaan, pais keli ja kiertteli itseään.","modalities":["visual","pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Son visual witness, father bodily experiencer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-364-E03","start":619,"end":662,"span":"Sairas rupesi jo helpottumaan tässä olossa.","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Relief from preceding pain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-364-E04","start":920,"end":978,"span":"Näki siellä ruumiin luita ja paukoja rivissä hyllylaudalla","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Son peeks through partly open door.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-364-E05","start":1104,"end":1157,"span":"näytti kuvaa, joka ilmestyi pullossa olevaan viinaan.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Patient recognises image as known man; showing and reception contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-364-E06","start":1446,"end":1493,"span":"kotiin tultuani sain nämät tuskani ja polttoni.","modalities":["pain","temperature","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported burning sensation; not actual external heat.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-364-E07","start":1604,"end":1629,"span":"samalla pääsi tuskistaan.","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Relief phase.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N061","id":"N061","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä näkki","text":"Näkki otti jalkaan kiinni kun uimaan meni. Lapsiakin pelooteltiin näkellä, sanottiin kun ne tuppas ninkun ne tuppaa miälellään rantaan ongettä: ”Älä me sinne taikka näkkä tulee ja viä sun järveen.”","source":"Hilma Ritva","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-365-E01","start":0,"end":42,"span":"Näkki otti jalkaan kiinni kun uimaan meni.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic reported grip; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uimaan","environment":"water","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N062","id":"N062","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä näkkä","text":"Kuullut isoäidiltään tarinan. Kun hän lapsena ollessaan oli mennyt uimarantaa kohden toisten mukana, (hän oli nuorin) niin lapset olivat lorunneet vedenhaltialle huudellu mennessään: ”Näkki, näkki joudu jo, joka viimeks järveen jää:” Samassa ilmestyi vedenhaltia alaston nainen kivelle jolla oli hyvin suuret rinnat niin että hän heitteli ne olalleen ristiin, oikean vasemmalle ja päin vastoin. Lapset tulivat juosten pois. Kertoja-mummu oli usein muistellut, ettei hän ole milloinkaan niin kovin itkenyt kun silloin tullessa pelästyneenä kotiin.","source":"Lempäälä. KT 31. Söderman, Sandra 3. 1938. < Miina Laatiska, s. 1865. Lempäälä.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-366-E01","start":162,"end":181,"span":"huudellu mennessään","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-366-E02","start":234,"end":315,"span":"Samassa ilmestyi vedenhaltia alaston nainen kivelle jolla oli hyvin suuret rinnat","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Apparition contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-366-E03","start":460,"end":546,"span":"ettei hän ole milloinkaan niin kovin itkenyt kun silloin tullessa pelästyneenä kotiin.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Individual recalled crying.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"uimarantaa","environment":"waterside","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N064","id":"N064","collection":"FI","title":"Taikoja.","text":"Taikoja.\n\nKurun pitäjässä Karjulankylässä Huumon Äijä paransi Ihmisiä ja Eläimiä hän näki Viinapullosta katsoen mikä vaiva on kullakin avun hakijalla teki sitten omatekoiset lääkkeet Muurahaisen munia Woikukan nuppuja Ihraa Sammakon lihaa ne sekaisin laittoi ja antoi Eläimelle suuhun sen jälkeen kiersi kolmeen kertaan vastapäivään sen huoneen missä Eläin oli kolmeen kertaan kielen päästä hännänpäähän veti kädellään luki loitsua samalla pidä Wikas, ota lihas, anna Elikolle Elikon terveys – Näin loitsua Huumon Äijä luki mainittua lääkettä Elikon suuhun antaen samalla hän oli kuuluisa parantaja silloisissa oloissa vuodessaan asuen Lilius Kurussa muistaa kotoväkensä apua mainitulla tietäjältä muut kyläläiset sekä koko pitäjä apua häneltä haki vakaasti tähän todella uskottiin.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-367-E01","start":81,"end":149,"span":"hän näki Viinapullosta katsoen mikä vaiva on kullakin avun hakijalla","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic diagnostic seeing, content not inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-367-E02","start":377,"end":418,"span":"kielen päästä hännänpäähän veti kädellään","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Animal contact; generic treatment; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N065","id":"N065","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä petetty haltija","text":"Kerrankii koiteetiin yks emäntä koitti pettää haltiaa. Pani anto paskaa puurona haltiaale. Ja haltia suuttu ja pani talon palaan ja huusi: ”Heleijaa, tuli leijaa, paska puuron kartanolla”. Ja yks emäntä ruokki haltiaa taikk mikä tonttuhan oli saunaan. Ja kerran haltia poltti talon kun sen ihmiset oli pahoja. Ja jäi seula palamatta kun se oli toisen talon seula, lainnana siinnä talossa.","source":"Hilma Ritva","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-368-E01","start":132,"end":188,"span":"huusi: ”Heleijaa, tuli leijaa, paska puuron kartanolla”.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N066","id":"N066","collection":"FI","title":"Plikka ja poika ojalla.","text":"Plikka ja poika ojalla.\n\nEnnen oli yks plikka ja poika ojalla, poika pyysi plikalta pannakseen, näytä kullis sano plikka, en minä muuton anna, sano. Poika näytti sitte sen ja sen pää punotti sitte kovasti; ja plikka sano sitte, eihän se vaan polta, sano, kun se nin punanen on, sano. Ei se polta sano poika. Mes koittaan tohon ojaan sano plikka ja poika meni ja pojalta pääsi piaru ja se parahti. Plikka sano, kas sitä helvetin mullikka, olisit vielä pilluni polttanu, sano.","source":"Lempäälä. J.A. Klemola a) 48. 1888. - Hovin Jokkumi, 40 v.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-369-E01","start":175,"end":204,"span":"sen pää punotti sitte kovasti","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"inferred heat from colour","evidence":"eihän se vaan polta","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Girl's perception licensed by following question; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-369-E02","start":362,"end":396,"span":"pojalta pääsi piaru ja se parahti.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misinterpreted bodily sound","evidence":"olisit vielä pilluni polttanu","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sexual anecdote; heat only feared, not experienced.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"ojalla","environment":"ditch","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N067","id":"N067","collection":"FI","title":"naishaltija","text":"Ruoholan Annalassa nähtiin naishaltia usein liikkeellä. Ihmeteltiin pelättiin. Ja sitten riihi paloi. Haltia nähtiin samana p:nä.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Ruuhola / Aimala","events":[{"id":"FI-370-E01","start":19,"end":55,"span":"nähtiin naishaltia usein liikkeellä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-370-E02","start":102,"end":129,"span":"Haltia nähtiin samana p:nä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Specific day of barn fire.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ruoholan Annalassa","environment":"farmstead","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N068","id":"N068","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä sauna pyhä","text":"Saunassa piti olla kuin kirkossa, jossa ei saanut puhua mitään.","source":"Lempäälä, Kankaanpää. Vilho Auramo KT 15:39. 1938.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N069","id":"N069","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä Sotavallan tonttu","text":"Sotavallan tonttu teki hyvää, mutta HinssianHintsala kylä Vesilahdella 2 virstaa kirkolta. tonttu teki paljasta pahaa. Kerrankin se upotti paatin järveen sill’aikaa kun kirkkoväki oli kirkossa ja pani sen täyteen kiviä niin ett’ei se päässy nousemaan veren päälle. Toisen kerran taas se meni ja nakkas sylyyksen sammalia keskelle isännän ja emännän sänkyä, ku’ he makas yöllä sängyssänsä. Ja taas yhren kerran se nakkeli kaikki piänet maahan saunan kiukaasta, niin ett’ei jääny muuta kun terät jäljelle vaan. Sitten kun mentiin saunaa lämmitä paneen, täyty ajaa kaikki kivet ensin ylös ennen kun sopi valkeeta tehrä. – Ja paljo muuta pahaa teki, kai semmoisia metkuja ja ketkuja sillä oli, niin ett’ en minä kaikkia niitä muistakkan, vaikka ma muistuttelisin monta päivää.","source":"b. Lempäälä. Tappura, K. F. a 10. 1896.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N070","id":"N070","collection":"FI","title":"Talon haltia.","text":"Talon haltia.\n\nKun kertoja palveli nuorena 15-16 v. vanhana Luodon talossa Lempäälässä, meni hän eräänä talviyönä k.lo 1.den aikaan antamaan hevosille heiniä, syystä kun piti lähdettämän yöllä 2 den aikaan Tampereelle viemään vakanssiverojyviä 2 lla hevosella. Kun hän meni tallinparveen, ei hänellä ollut mitään lyhtyä tai valoneuvoa ja heti kun hän aukaisi ovet niin jokin näkymätöin heitti kipinöistä palavaa tuhkaa hänen silmilleen niinkuin tavallisen lapion heiton. Hän pyyhkäisi ja palasi poistsamantien, mutta tarkastellessaan naamaansa ei ollut mitään nokea eikä vikaa naamassaan. Kertoi siitä vanhalle Kustaalle, joka oli talon ikivanha palvelija. Kustaa sanoi: ”Parvessa asuu talon haltia ja jos vain menee koiran kanssa sinne, niin se estää pääsyn, oliko koira mukanasi.” Hevetillä oli talon suuri valkea koira mukanansa. Muulloin ei Evertti enää uskaltanut mennä koiran kanssa tallitöihin.","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:20.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-373-E01","start":369,"end":470,"span":"jokin näkymätöin heitti kipinöistä palavaa tuhkaa hänen silmilleen niinkuin tavallisen lapion heiton.","modalities":["visual","touch","temperature"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen source","evidence":"jokin näkymätöin","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Apparent burning ash contact; no injury inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-373-E02","start":517,"end":588,"span":"tarkastellessaan naamaansa ei ollut mitään nokea eikä vikaa naamassaan.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"absent corroborating trace","evidence":"ei ollut mitään nokea eikä vikaa naamassaan","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"tallinparveen","environment":"stable","time":"eräänä talviyönä k.lo 1.den aikaan","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"The house spirit (haltia).\n\nWhen the narrator was serving as a young 15–16-year-old at the Luodo farm in Lempäälä, he went one winter night around 1 o'clock to give hay to the horses, because they had to set off at 2 o'clock in the night to Tampere to deliver grain for the vakanssivero tax with two horses. When he went to the stable loft, he had no lantern or light source, and as soon as he opened the doors, something invisible threw burning, sparking ash into his eyes, as though thrown with an ordinary shovel. He wiped his face and immediately went back out, but upon examining his face, there was no soot or anything wrong with his face.\n\nHe told old Kustaa, a very old servant on the farm, about it. Kustaa said: 'In the loft lives the house spirit, and if you go there with a dog, it blocks your entry; was the dog with you?' Hevetti [name as transcribed] had the farm's large white dog with him. After that, Evertti no longer dared to take the dog along when doing stable chores.","translationNotes":["'Jokin näkymätöin' remains 'something invisible'. 'Vakanssivero' is retained as a historical tax name without a speculative English equivalent. Lack of a light and lack of a subsequent facial trace are both preserved.","REVIEW REQUIRED: the source has the inflected name 'Hevetillä' and later 'Evertti'. Both forms are represented rather than silently harmonised. Check the source image for a possible transcription error."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"FI-373-E01","start":412,"end":516,"span":"something invisible threw burning, sparking ash into his eyes, as though thrown with an ordinary shovel.","modalities":["visual","touch","temperature"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen source","evidence":"jokin näkymätöin","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Apparent burning ash contact; no injury inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"jokin näkymätöin heitti kipinöistä palavaa tuhkaa hänen silmilleen niinkuin tavallisen lapion heiton.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-373-E02","start":570,"end":645,"span":"upon examining his face, there was no soot or anything wrong with his face.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"absent corroborating trace","evidence":"ei ollut mitään nokea eikä vikaa naamassaan","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"tarkastellessaan naamaansa ei ollut mitään nokea eikä vikaa naamassaan.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"FI:N071","id":"N071","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä tarpeiden teko metsään","text":"Tarpeillaan käydessä metsässä tulee aina sylkeä kasan päälle, ettei saa maistaa. (Maista tarkoittaa syhyä tai jotain tarttuvaa tautia.) Tämän kuulin pikkupoikana.","source":"Lempäälä, Kankaanpää. Vilho Auramo KT 15:22. 1938","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Maista is locally glossed as itching/illness, not tasting. Proposed prevention only; no realised symptom.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N072","id":"N072","collection":"FI","title":"Kyyrön-tietäjä","text":"Kyyrön-tietäjä\n\nKyyrön-tohtorin näin, kun hän tuli kotiinsa. Hän oli veljeni kanssa ollut sotaväessä. Hän pyysi kyytiä erääseen taloon, jossa oli pyörtyväinen tytär. Kun Kyyrä meni siihen taloon, lausui hän - Antakaa minulle 20 mk. rahaa, teen tepposen, parannan tytön pyörtyväisyydestä. Jakun sai 20 mk. meni hän sen veegen.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-375-E01","start":16,"end":60,"span":"Kyyrön-tohtorin näin, kun hän tuli kotiinsa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N073","id":"N073","collection":"FI","title":"Noiduudella koitetaan parantaa isäntää.","text":"Noiduudella koitetaan parantaa isäntää.\n\nKertoja palveli eräässä talossa Miemolan kylässä. Naapuritalon isäntä sairastui eräänä syyskesänä johonkin sisälliseen tautiin. Tällä isännällä oli ollut aina pahaa kaunaa talon eläkevaarin kanssa, joka asui talon takana olevissa huoneissa. Kun tauti ei ottanut parantuakseen, niin haettiin eräs tietäjäakka (Palomäen Pörjo) tutkimaan asiaa. Akka sanoi: ”Se on vaarin loihtuma sairaaksi ja parannus on tehtävä niinkuin esitän, on haettava salaa vaarin asunnosta jotain päällä ollut vaatekāsyä.” Siihen pyydettiin tämän kertoja, joka meni salaa vaarin saunasta sieppaamaan räsyä, siitä pol tettiin sitten isännän saunanpesässä räsyntuhkaa ja juotettiin sairaalle kahvin seassa. (Tauti ei helpottanut, isäntä kuoli kuitenkin.)","source":"Lempäälä. Söderman, S. KRK 46:34. Kuoli < Manda Mattilainen, 60 v. Lemp. Aimala.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N074","id":"N074","collection":"FI","title":"Tilkan kivi","text":"Tilkan kivi\n\nPiti tehdä kivisilta Hauralasta Hahkalaan. Ja jättiläisneito, Tilkka, rupesi suurta kiveä heittämään. Mutta förkkelin nauhat pettivät ja kivi putosi Hahkalan vuolteen lahteen.","source":"Lempäälä. Frans Kärki 3605. 1948. < mäkitupalainen Juho Eemil Peltonen, 73 v., Lempääla Aimala.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N075","id":"N075","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä tonttuja","text":"Haltioita ja tonttuja niitä kumminkin on ollu. Ja se haltia piti olleen joka paikassa, joka talossa ja myllyssä, sahassa ja kaikissa missä jotakin asumista ja tekemistä oli.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, Hilma KRK 66:39 <Jara, Heikki 71 v.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N076","id":"N076","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä tyrvään tontut","text":"Tyrvään tontut tappelivat kun ajovat toisiaan pois toistensa alueelta.","source":"Lempäälä. Ritva, Hilma KRK 66:38 <Jara, Heikki 71v.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N077","id":"N077","collection":"FI","title":"Lempäälä","text":"pyytään jotakin syötävää. Mutta herra ei ollu kotona eikä prou vakan ollu. Nin tonttu kysy sitte, kun ämmä rupes itkeen sit kunei herra eikä prouva ollu kotona, että: mitä sinä siinä it ke? Niin ämmä sanoi, että: kun’en saa mitään, kun herra ei o’ kotona eikä prouva. Tonttu meni pois vähäksi ajaaksi ja ava si sitten pytinkin vintin klasin ja nakkas sieltä lampaan käpä län ja kakon ämmälle.","source":"1) Kartano 5 virstaa Lemposista Valkeakoskelle päin. 2) Kartano Pirkkalassa. 3) Lempäälän pitäjän kirkonkylä. 4) kylä Vesilahden pitäjässä.","category":"Lempäälä nonlocatable legends","place":"Lempäälä","events":[{"id":"FI-380-E01","start":102,"end":119,"span":"ämmä rupes itkeen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N079","id":"N079","collection":"FI","title":"hiittenvaha","text":"Kivilahti järven ja saastonperän välillä on niemi, jota sanotaan hiittenvaha siellä vielä minun isäisäni sano olevan kahren hiiden asunnon perustukset näkyvillä sellaisina neliön muotoisina itse en ole niitä löytänyt vaikka pikkupoikana niitä hain.","source":"Vesilahti. KT 23. Lastunen, Kalle 135. 1938.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hiittenvaha","events":[{"id":"FI-381-E01","start":117,"end":189,"span":"kahren hiiden asunnon perustukset näkyvillä sellaisina neliön muotoisina","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Grandfather's reported visibility.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-381-E02","start":190,"end":248,"span":"itse en ole niitä löytänyt vaikka pikkupoikana niitä hain.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroborative search","evidence":"en ole niitä löytänyt vaikka pikkupoikana niitä hain","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Narrator later search; visual channel contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"hiittenvaha","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N080","id":"N080","collection":"FI","title":"hiittenvaha","text":"Hiitten vaha, se on Yli-Arvelan talon metsämaa n. 15 hehtaaria Kivilahden ja Saastojärven välillä. Se on tasainen, ruohoa kasvava, hyvä metsäkappale. Mutta mistä sen kummallinen nimi on tullut?","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hiittenvaha","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N081","id":"N081","collection":"FI","title":"Hiitten vaha.","text":"Hiitten vaha.\n\nPöyhölän Yli-Arvelan metsäaluetta, joka on Kivilahden järven ja Saastojärven välillä, sanotaan Hiittenvahaksi. En tiedä, mistä se johtuu, mutta pelottava kaiku sillä on. Se on tasaista ja viljavaa maata ja kasvaa ruohoa sekä hyvää metsää. Paikkakunnan korkein vuori on Jaonmaan vuori 162 metriä korkea.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hiittenvaha","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Pelottava kaiku (frightening ring of name) figurative, not acoustic event.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N082","id":"N082","collection":"FI","title":"Hirvi-Simunasta.","text":"Hirvi-Simunasta.\n\nSiitä lienee noin 60-70 vuotta, kun HirviSimuna kuoli. Hän oli ehkä kotoisin Lempäälästä. Hän ampui öylätin läpi, ja sentähden hän kirottiin. Se on ainakin tosiasia, että lempääläiset kaivoivat hänen ruumiinsa Lempäälän hautausmaan vihkimättömästä osasta ja soutivat ruumiin Hinsalan kylän Kiermon kankaalle ja hautasivat sen sinne. Mutta sitten vesilahtilaiset kaivoivat ruumiin ja veivät sen Nurmikunnan puolelle ja hautasivat Pyhälän vuoreen. Mutta sieltä lempääläiset jälleen kaivoivat ruumiin ylös ja salaa soutivat sen Vesilahden puolelle ja hautasivat Vesilahden hautausmaalle kivihaudan lähelle ja sinne se lienee jäänyt.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hirvi-Simuna","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N083","id":"N083","collection":"FI","title":"Hirvi-Simunasta.","text":"Hirvi-Simunasta.\n\nHirvi-Simuna oli metsämies, joka näillä seuduilla ampui hirviä ynnä muita. Kun hän kuoli, niin lempääläiset eivät antaneet hänen ruumistaan haudata Lempäälän kirkkomaahan, siihen jumalattomien hautausmaan kolkkaan, johon Jumalan kieltäjät, itsemurhaajat ja erilaiset suurrikolliset haudattiin, vaan he asettivat Simunan ruumiin paattiin ja soutivat monihankaisella paatilla, vetäen ruumispaattia perässään ja he soutivat yli Lempoisten järven. Laskivat Hankalan vuolteen virtaa pitkin Toutosen selälle ja soutivat Vesilahden Hinsalan kylän Kiermon hiekkasärkille, kaivoivat siihen haudan, laskivat siihen Simunan ruumiin, peittivät sen ja riensivät sitte kotiinsa. Mutta Vesilahden miehet kaivoivat ruumiin pois ja\n\nsoutivat sen Lempäälän puolelle johonkin saareen. Mutta siitäkin Lempääläiset ottivat ruumiin ja veivät sen Vesilahden puolelle.\n\nSellaista kerrotaan, että Hirvi-Simuna sai tarkan ampumataidon noituuden kautta, koska hän oli ampunut öylätin läpi. Kun papit säilyttävät Herran pyhän ehtoollisen leipiä eli öylättejä tarkoin, niin ei Hirvi-Simunakaan voinut saada sellaista muulla tavalla kuin että hän meni ripille ja otti ehtoollisleivän suustaan ja pisti sen taskuunsa. Sitten hän meni metsään, asetti öylätin männyn oksalle. Niin oli sanottu, että jos hän nyt voisi ampua öylätin läpi, niin kaikki hänen luotinsa sattuisivat maaliin. Simuna tähtäsi, mutta hänen kätensä vapisivat; kuinka voin ampua pyhän ristin läpi. Silloin piru sanoi, että\n\nmene lähemmäksi ja aseta luotipyssyn suu aivan keskelle öylättiä ja ammu. Sillä ei ollut määräystä välimatkasta, vaan siitä, että sen läpi oli ammuttava. Simuna teki niin ja ampui öylätin läpi ja hänestä tuli kuuluisa metsästäjä. Mutta epäusko ja paha omatunto vaivasivat häntä alati.\n\nVesilahdella oli siihen aikaan rovastina Liljestrand. Hirvi-Simuna kävi hänenkin luonansa. Liljestrand oli vanha pappi, joka ei enää itse saarnannut, vaan piti hyviä apulaisia. Kun Hirvi-Simuna selitti hänelle tilaansa, sanoi Liljestrand, että room. katoliset papit juovat pyhän ehtoollisen viinin ja antavat ainoastaan leivän kansalle. Mutta te olette tehnyt päinvastoin. Sillä te olette pyhässä ehtoollisessa nauttinut viinin, mutta ehtoollisleivän eli öylätin veitte metsään ja ammuitte\n\nsen läpi, mutta ei se siellä metsässä ollut muuta, kuin tavallista leipää. Mutta kunteitte sen noituudessa, niin se oli pahasti. ”Joka pahan tekonsa kieltää, ei hän menesty, mutta joka sen tunnustaa ja hylkää, hänelle tapahtuu laupeus.”","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hirvisimuna","events":[{"id":"FI-385-E01","start":1392,"end":1415,"span":"hänen kätensä vapisivat","modalities":["bodily sensation","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"metsään","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N084","id":"N084","collection":"FI","title":"Hirvi-Simuna.","text":"Hirvi-Simuna.\n\nHirvi-Simuna, joka Lempäälän ja Vesilahden ja Pirkkalan seutuja metsästeli, oli jumalaton mies. Hänestä kerrotaan, että hän otti öylätin suustaan, vei sen kotiinsa, pani sitten sen kiinni puuhun naulalla ja kehoitti poikaansa sitä ampumaan, jotta tulisi hyväksi ampujaksi. Poika tähtäsi, mutta ei ampunut. Hän sekaantui, mutta jälkeenpäin hän selkisi siitä.\n\nKun Hirvi-Simuna kuoli, ei hän pysynyt haudassaan. Lempäälän miehet ottivat hänet haudastaan ja hautasivat hänen Hinsalankylän Kiermon Santaniemelle. Mutta Hinsalan miehet kaivoivat sen kahdesti ylös ja kahdella veneellä soutivat sen takaisin Lempäälään. Mutta lempääläiset salaa toivat sen uudestaan Kiermolle ja sinne se lienee jäänyt.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hirvisimuna","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Sekaantui can mean mental disturbance; no explicit sensory/orientational evidence.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N085","id":"N085","collection":"FI","title":"Hirvi-Simuna.","text":"Hirvi-Simuna.\n\nMuinoin puhuttiin paljon Hirvi-Simunasta, hän oli metsämies, mutta jumalankieltäjä. Hän opetti poikaansa ampumaan pyhän öylätin läpi. Mutta kun poika näki öylätissä Kristuksen ristillä riippumassa, niin hän sanoi, että minä en ammu Kristusta. Kun sitten Hirvi-Simuna kuoli, niin hän ei pysynyt haudassa. Lempääläiset soutivat hänet Vesilahden puolelle ja vesilahtelaiset taasen Lempäälään maihin. Ja lopuksi sanottiin, että hän haudattiin Hinsalan Säijän Kiermon kankaalle.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hirvisimuna","events":[{"id":"FI-387-E01","start":159,"end":211,"span":"poika näki öylätissä Kristuksen ristillä riippumassa","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N087","id":"N087","collection":"FI","title":"Jopilla naishaltija","text":"a Hän on monet kerrat nähnyt Jopilla kuljeskelevan erittäin suuren kokoisen naisen. Hän päätteli että Jopilla on naishaltia Haltia näyttäytyi enimmäkseen yöaikaan toisinaan se meni tallinparveen joskus saunaan tai riiheen Koskaan hän ei päässyt haltiaa lähelle.","source":"Elsa Junkkaala","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Jopilla naishaltija","events":[{"id":"FI-388-E01","start":2,"end":83,"span":"Hän on monet kerrat nähnyt Jopilla kuljeskelevan erittäin suuren kokoisen naisen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated view; inability to approach noted separately, no uncertainty inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Jopilla","environment":"farmstead","time":"enimmäkseen yöaikaan","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N088","id":"N088","collection":"FI","title":"Keinumäki.","text":"Keinumäki.\n\nKaskela nimisellä vuodella Narvankylässä Vesilahdella on ollut kertoja itse on soittanut Wiulua kansansoittaja Kalle Ojala oli myös 1918. v. hän on kuollut. Myös Wesilahtilainen ollut on koko elämänsä ajan hän laulanut ja soittanut Kaskelanvuodella. Wesilahdella siellä on leikitty piirileikkejä 1700. v. alulta asti viime sotiin sen jälkeen on mainitun paikan käyttö lakannut muistakin pitäjistä siellä on käyty.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Keinumäki","events":[{"id":"FI-389-E01","start":75,"end":107,"span":"kertoja itse on soittanut Wiulua","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-389-E02","start":218,"end":261,"span":"hän laulanut ja soittanut Kaskelanvuodella.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Kalle Ojala; retrospective repeated performance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kaskelanvuodella","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N089","id":"N089","collection":"FI","title":"kellosaaret","text":"Pyhäjärvessä Anian selällä on kaksi saarta nimeltä Kellosaaret. Näiden saarten rantaan on uponnut joskus vene, jossa oli Vesilahden kirkkoon aijotut kirkonkellot. Siitä nimi Kellosaaret.","source":"Vesilahti. Junkkaala, Elsa KRK 27:10 Junkkaala, Otto (kuollut v. 1928 70-vuotiaana)","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Kellosaaret","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N090","id":"N090","collection":"FI","title":"Ketunmäen kummitus","text":"Ketunmäen kummitus\n\nSynkän metsän läpi kulkee polku Vesilahden Latomaan ja Suonolan kylien välillä. Ketunmäen laidalla aivan polun vieressä on suurten kivijärkäleiden muodostama röykkiö. Tämän vieressä teki lehtikerppoja kerran eräs Latomaan kylän mies. Hänen työskennellessään tuli sammakko kiviröykkioöstä hyppäsi miehen jalalle ja taas takaisin sinne mistä oli tullutkin. Hetken päästä jälleen uudistui sama juttu. Mies hermostui ja potkaisi sammakon jo poiskin mutta sammakko jatkoi itsepäisesti. Se sai miehenkin viimein tarkastamaan mitä sammakko tarkoittaa. Tutkittuaan röykkiötä hän löysi mytyn joka osoittautui paidaksi jonka sisällä oli vastasyntyneen lapsen ruumis. Mies tietysti ilmoitti löydöstään, mut silloin kun ei vielä paljoa ollut viranomaisista apua, niin juttu ja selvittämättä. Heti tapahtuman jälkeen kuitenkin alkoi seudulla jatkuu\n\njatk. 1 Ketunmäen kummitus\n\nkummiteella. Hämärän aikana kulkijoita peloitteli milloin askelten ääni, milloin pelkät kengät seurasivat matkaajaa. Nämä ynnä muut paikasta kerrotut jutut saivat aikaan sen että polkua ei hämärän aikana uskallettu kulkea. Ja tämä kammo paikkaa kohtaan säilyi vuosikymmenet jälkeenpäin. Vielä omasta nuoruudestankin muistan, kun en hämärän aikana polulle uskaltanut mennä.","source":"Latomaa","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Ketunmäki","events":[{"id":"FI-391-E01","start":308,"end":347,"span":"hyppäsi miehen jalalle ja taas takaisin","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Repeated frog contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-391-E02","start":565,"end":676,"span":"Tutkittuaan röykkiötä hän löysi mytyn joka osoittautui paidaksi jonka sisällä oli vastasyntyneen lapsen ruumis.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"object identification","evidence":"mytyn joka osoittautui paidaksi","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Inspection contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-391-E03","start":898,"end":956,"span":"Hämärän aikana kulkijoita peloitteli milloin askelten ääni","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later repeated travellers; dusk.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-391-E04","start":958,"end":1001,"span":"milloin pelkät kengät seurasivat matkaajaa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"partial apparition","evidence":"pelkät kengät","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Ketunmäen laidalla","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N091","id":"N091","collection":"FI","title":"Pakoluola.","text":"Pakoluola.\n\nKerran metsämatkallaan löysi Silvaan Kokkovuoren maassa pakolaisluolan, joka oli ollut ihmisasuntona ja siellä oli vanha aarnakka (almanakka) ja pyhä raamattu. Warmaan se oli ollut jonkun hätääntyneen ihmisen pakopaikka ehkä Suomen sodan aikana.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Kokkovuoren pakoluola","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N092","id":"N092","collection":"FI","title":"Lapin kaivo.","text":"Lapin kaivo.\n\nLapin aiheisia muistitietoa ei minulla ole muta, kun tämä Lapinkaivo se on syvä vuoren rotko jonka pohjalla on aina vettä. Tämä rotko on Wesilahden pitäjässä, Laukon ja Totjärven kartanoite rajalla. Tähän rotkoon tarun mukaan sanotaan Klaus Kurjen ratsastaneen. Tuntonsa tuskassa. Ku oli ensin vaimonsa Eliinan ja palveliansa Uolevi ja kartanonsa Laukon polttanut. Totjärvi ja Karta no, on saanu arvattavasti nimensä Klaus Kurjen k ran nimestä. Sen nimi oli Totki.","source":"Loppi. Juho Aromäki TK 8:42. 1961.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Lapinkaivo","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N093","id":"N093","collection":"FI","title":"lemmetyn lemmenjumala","text":"Tuhatkuussataa luvun lopussa ja seitsemänsataa luvun alussa oli lemmetyllä lemmen jumala, joka silloin oli vielä erämaata, mutta sen läpi kulki erätie, jonka saman nimiseen järven rannalla oli levähdyspaikka. Sillä vuorella suuressa monihaaraisessa puussa asumapaikka, jossa se salmi erämaan asujanten avioliittoja tämän viimeinen kertoja oli kuollut nälkään v. 1867.","source":"Vesilahti. KT 23. Lastunen, Kalle 133. 1938.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Lemmetyn lemmenjumala","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N094","id":"N094","collection":"FI","title":"Linnavuori","text":"Linnavuori\n\nProfessori Väinö Voionmaa v. 1936 kävi Korkeemäessä moottoripyörällä poikansa kanssa. Sitten parin p. perästä käytiin Linnavuorella Jouko Voionmaan kanssa, joka sitä tutki, valokuvasi. Linnavuori on Vesilahden Kahnalan Höyssän talon osalla. Nyt se ala kuuluu mv. Niilo Mäkelälle eli Riitalan talolle. Hirsikankaan tieltä on siihen n. 1 km. Linnavuori. Sen lähellä on Linnalammi, nyk. Lamminjärvi, joka on kortetta kasvava. Sen lähellä on Tervasuo nyk. pelto, ja siinä on ihmeell. lähde, jossa kansantaru kertoo olevan aarteita. Tervasuon vierellä on Pöllövuori. Sen vastaisella puolella on Saapaskorpi ja lähellä on Riitaniitty vielä jatk.\n\njatk.\n\non pappien ja Öyrän saralla vanhoja Linna-huhtanimisiä viljelysmaita. Se on merkillinen varustusvuori, jonka kivivallit ovat selvät ja jonka piirissä on n 30 muinaishautaröykkiötä. Se olisi rauhoitettava, koska vallikiviä on vieritetty alas rotkoon y.m.s. pahaa on tehty. – Kävimme sitä katsomassa. Pidin esitelmänkin paikkakunnan isännille, jotka olivat kokoontuneet Korkeekosken taloon pitämään tiekokoustaan. Ja isännätkin innostuivat ja menivät mv. Juho Kosken opastuksella Linnavuorelle, jonka arvoa ja merkitystä eivät he ennen osanneet tai tienneet aavistaakaan.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Linnavuori","events":[{"id":"FI-395-E01","start":934,"end":958,"span":"Kävimme sitä katsomassa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Narrator's inspection of archaeological site; separate from folklore claims.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Linnavuorelle","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N095","id":"N095","collection":"FI","title":"”Miekka-kivi”","text":"”Miekka-kivi”\n\nKärjen talon rannassa oli laakea kivi ”Miekka-kivi” eli ”Miekahionta-kivi”. Siinä näkyi kahden pitkän miekan hiomisesta aiheutunut syvennys. Kun olin lapsena kodissa, niin isäni, August Kärki, teroitti samaan kiveen edestakaisin hiomalla työkalujaan- Se oli aina Venäjän sodan, 25- v. sodan, ajoilta asti ollut miekkakivenä; siinä oli itse-taottuja miekkoja, keihäitä y.m. teroitettu, koska Kärki oli ratsutilallinen; ja jo ennen sitä aikaa olivat Kärjen pojat sotilaina Venäjän, Puolan ja Saksan sodissa.\n\nKun isonjaontäydennyksen tähden n 1926-1941 aikana m.m. Kärjen talo siirrettiin Säijään, hävisi ”Miekkakivikin” paattivalkamalta, Kärjen rannasta, eikä ole saatu selville, kuka sen rikki-räjäytti ja pois kuljetti, tai ehkä tuntematta sen arvoa, sen siirsi ja hävitti.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hinsala","events":[{"id":"FI-396-E01","start":91,"end":155,"span":"Siinä näkyi kahden pitkän miekan hiomisesta aiheutunut syvennys.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Visible trace; causal attribution retained only as wording.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Kärjen talon rannassa","environment":"shoreline","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N096","id":"N096","collection":"FI","title":"Munkinkallio","text":"Munkinkallio\n\nVesilahden Jokioisten kylän rannalla, Alho-selän syrjällä, on matalahko, tasainen kallio, jossa ennen munkit olivat evank. saarnanneet ja kallion juurella olivat he toimittaneet kasteita. Munkinkalliolta on yli järven ja saarien hyvä katsella Laukkoa ja Hinsalan saarta, jossa on Haikulan ja Harmaan lapinrauniota.\n\nLaukossa olivat lappalaiset viihtyneet hyvin. Munkit olisivat halunneet saarnata heillekin, mutta he eivät voineet voittaa heidän myötätuntoaan. Kuitenkin mainitaan yksi lappalaisneitonen, nim. Impile olleen kristitty. Naapurikylän, Narvan, Poukan talon maalla on ylänne-vainion nimenä ”Impilen-vainio”.\n\nVielä on mainittava, että Munkinkallion lähellä on erinomaisia kuore-apajia ja muutoin kalliit ja suotuisat hauki- y.m. kalojen apajat lahdissa ja Jokioisten salmessa, joka on ruohoinen ja erinomaisen kalarikas. Ja ent. kappalaistalo, Jaanu, joka on lapin kieltä, on sen vieressä.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Munkinkallio","events":[{"id":"FI-397-E01","start":218,"end":283,"span":"on yli järven ja saarien hyvä katsella Laukkoa ja Hinsalan saarta","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic afforded view, not individual event; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Munkinkalliolta","environment":"rock","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N097","id":"N097","collection":"FI","title":"Tonttu.","text":"Tonttu.\n\nTulin kerran yöllä Vesilahden kirkolta, Naulin karilta tuli rekeeni tonttu, minä ajoin ja hevonen vaahtosi sillä kuorma painoi kuin kivi kuorma. Priijarin portin vajossa tonttu hyppäsi pois niin että portin pielet ryskähti, siitä asti on Priijarilla ollut tonttu.","source":"Elsa Junkkaala","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Naulin karin priijarin tonttu","events":[{"id":"FI-398-E01","start":122,"end":152,"span":"kuorma painoi kuin kivi kuorma","modalities":["pressure"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Load stated, bodily perceiver horse context; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-398-E02","start":209,"end":231,"span":"portin pielet ryskähti","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Naulin karilta","environment":"waterside","time":"yöllä","movement":"minä ajoin"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.3136,"lon":23.7548,"label":"Lempäälä","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/Lemp%C3%A4%C3%A4l%C3%A4"}]},{"key":"FI:N098","id":"N098","collection":"FI","title":"Veden-neitsyt rakastuneitten apuna","text":"Veden-neitsyt rakastuneitten apuna\n\nHinsalan kylä, joka on pitkä ja jo vanhoista ajoista asti viljelty kaunis niemimaa, on kuuluisa runoistaan (Eliinan surma) ja taruistaan. Kun olin lapsena, kuulin sellaisista paljon kerrottavan. Hinsalan Niemenpäässä on pieni kallio ja sen edessä järvessä on suuri nenän muotoinen kivi, jonka nimi on Neitseennenä. Sen päällä istumassa on usein nähty veden-neitsyt, Vellamoinen, kaunis ja utuinen neitonen hiuksiansa harjaamassa. Kun on menty sen lähelle, on näky kadonnut. Mutta sen ovat ihmiset huomanneet, että se on ennustanut häitä ja rakastuneille nuorille onnea.\n\nSen sijaan on vallan vastakkainen haltia, vetehinen vaaninut Neitseen-nenän vastaisen salmen puolella, lähellä Vesaniemen rantaa olevalla Morsiuskalliolla, uhaten turmiota ja kuolemaa. Eräs morsius-pari oli siihen hukkunut. Lieneekö ollut pakanallinen pajatkuu\n\njatk. 1 Veden-neitsyt rakastuneitten apuna\n\nriskunta, synnissä ja pahuudessa? Siihen he olivat hukkuneet. Se kallio on näkyvissä vähän veden aikana. Mutta runsas vetisinä kesinä ei se ulotu veden pinnalle. Sanotaan, että suuri kirkkovene olisi siihen törmännyt. Mutta väki pelastui rannalle, joka on aivan lähellä. Mutta morsiuspari oli siihen hukkunut.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Neitseennenä","events":[{"id":"FI-399-E01","start":351,"end":465,"span":"Sen päällä istumassa on usein nähty veden-neitsyt, Vellamoinen, kaunis ja utuinen neitonen hiuksiansa harjaamassa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Hazy appearance explicit.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-399-E02","start":466,"end":509,"span":"Kun on menty sen lähelle, on näky kadonnut.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance on approach","evidence":"on näky kadonnut","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-399-E03","start":975,"end":1017,"span":"Se kallio on näkyvissä vähän veden aikana.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Separate Morsiuskallio visibility conditional on water level.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Neitseennenä","environment":"waterside rock","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N100","id":"N100","collection":"FI","title":"Neitseen lahja","text":"Neitseen lahja\n\nKun ent. sot. Kuureen vaimo palasi kirkonkylästä paatilla, niin hän huomasi Neitseennokan kohdalla, että kylässä on tulipalo. Hän pelästyi ja joutui kovaan synnytyspoltteeseen 1836. Töintuskin ehti hän soutaa rannalle. Siinä oli niemen huipussa eli kärjessä vedessä suuri, ihmisnenän muotoinen kivi, jota kutsuttaan Neitseen nokaksi. Sen vieressä on mäntyjä y.m. puita kasvava metsikkö. Hän konttasi hongan alle synnytti lapsen ja kääri hänet hameeseensa sekä kiitti Jumalaa. Jonkun hetken levättyään, meni hän paattiinsa, asettaen lapsensa lepän oksien päälle ja souti Kattelian lahden lähelle sekä kantoi poikansa kotiinsa. Pojasta tuli Ville-niminen mies, kalastaja Ville Mäkinen, joka lähes 90 v. kuoli kunnon miehenä ja kristittynä. Vedenneitsyt, Vellamo, oli syntymämerkiksi painanut hänen poskeensa häviämättömän punaisen käden kuvan, jonka tähden takanapäin häntä sanottiin ”Punaposki-Villeksi”.","source":"Vesilahti, Hinsala-Niemenpää. Frans Kärki TK 52:96. 1961. - Kustaa Toivonen, itsellinen, s. 1872.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Neitseennokka","events":[{"id":"FI-400-E01","start":80,"end":141,"span":"hän huomasi Neitseennokan kohdalla, että kylässä on tulipalo.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Noticing fire; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-400-E02","start":158,"end":191,"span":"joutui kovaan synnytyspoltteeseen","modalities":["pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Neitseennokan kohdalla","environment":"waterside","time":"1836","movement":"palasi kirkonkylästä paatilla"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N101","id":"N101","collection":"FI","title":"Vedenneitsyt otti pojan","text":"Vedenneitsyt otti pojan\n\nKun ent sotilaan Kuureen vaimo Hinsalan palon 1836 aikana synnytti Neitseennenän vierellä metsikössä pojan, niin sillä syntymämerkki oli poskessa. Pojasta kasvoi kunnon mies, josta Vedenneitsyenkin sopi iloitta. Mutta Vellamoinen otti ”Puna-poski-Villen pojan”, jos näin sopii sanoa. Kun Ville Mäkinen poika, Kalle oli kalastaja ja kravustaja, niin hän katosi. Jonkun päivän perästä tyhjä vene ilmoitti, että hän ehkä oli hukkunut. Kyläläiset ja n. kymmenisen pitkää pyörenuottaa heitettiin Sakaselalle Kattelianlahden lähelle. Ei löydetty. Mutta eräs Marjaana tuli kertomaan ja näyttämään, että tuon aidanjohteen, (s.o. syvälle veteen ulottuvan aidan) suuntaan n. kivenheiton päähän heittäkää nuottanne, sieltä pojan ruumis löytyy, lausuen: - Kun olin Heikkilän poikien kanssa kravustamassa niin vaimolta kuului Villen Kallen vihellys ja kauas jatkuu\n\njatk. 1 Vedenneitsyt otti pojan\n\nviskattu kivi tuli meidän aluksemme lähelle. ”Anna tulla toinenkin! minä huusin. Ja kivi tuli samaan paikkaan. Järvi oli tyyni. Me luulimme, että kiven oli Villen Kalle heittänyt. ”Anna tulla kolmaskin”. Ja katso kivi plumpahti samaan paikkaan. Silloin minä pelästyin, että se oli aaveellista, salaperäistä. Me emme nähneet poikaa. Ja matkakin oli pitkä pikku pojan voimilla.\n\nKun Marjaana tätä kertoi kyläläisille rannalla, niin pojan äiti rupesi itkien huutamaan, että heidän poika ei ollut mikään aave-olento eikä jumalaton, vaan hyvä poika...\n\nJoku hjoukosta huuti: ”Neitseennokan vellamoinen oli avuliaana, kun pojan isä, Ville Mäkinen, syntyi, ja se painoi punamerkit Villen poskille, vaan nyt se on ottanut Villen pojan helmaansa.” Pojan äiti suutjatkuu\n\njatk. 1 Vedenneitsyt otti pojan\n\ntui. – Mutta minä seurasin Marjaanan kertomusta, aidan suoraan suuntaan n. pitkän kivenheiton päähän rannasta, ja siihen me nuotan heitimme hevosenkengän muotoon. Ja merkillistä! Siitä paikasta ruumis löytyi\n\n- Olikoon kertomus kuoleman enteestä ja ruumiin löytämisestä kuitenkin meille varoittava, että aina tulisi kristittyjen olla valveilla s.o. uskossa Vapahtajaan.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hinsala","events":[{"id":"FI-401-E01","start":831,"end":860,"span":"kuului Villen Kallen vihellys","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen/contested source","evidence":"Me emme nähneet poikaa","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-401-E02","start":1124,"end":1155,"span":"kivi plumpahti samaan paikkaan.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen source","evidence":"Me luulimme, että kiven oli Villen Kalle heittänyt","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Repeated stone landings; sound explicit, visual contextual; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-401-E03","start":1219,"end":1242,"span":"Me emme nähneet poikaa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen source","evidence":"Me emme nähneet poikaa","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-401-E04","start":1341,"end":1375,"span":"pojan äiti rupesi itkien huutamaan","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later mother on shore.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Sakaselalle Kattelianlahden lähelle","environment":"lake","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N103","id":"N103","collection":"FI","title":"Papinkivi.","text":"Papinkivi.\n\nAmeejärvessä on Papinkivi-niminen suuri kivi. Kerrotaan, että joku pappi oli Isonvihan aikana paossa Ameejärven takana. Vieläkin siellä on pakolaisten kiukaita ynnä muita y.m.s.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2725. 1947. Mv. Oskari Kankaanpää, 59 v. Vesilahti, Krääkkiö.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Papinkivi","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N104","id":"N104","collection":"FI","title":"Pirunpesä","text":"Joppi, hurskas mies, palasi kaupungista. Mutta Pirunpesän kohdalla päästettiin hänen hevosensa valjaista; hän asetti sen. Hetken perästä tapahtui samoin, yhteensä 3 kertaa. J. ei päässyt perästäkään.\n\n”Luokkani temmattiin pois.”\n\nKiersi Laukon kautta, oli poikennut takspirttiin, ja Kerttunsaaresta löydettiin luokka.\n\nPaljon puhuttiin ja ihmeteltiin...\n\n”Tervapaukurini siellä oli ja Puntheveli toisaalla häntä vastassa, koska hän on sellainen roska”, sanoi P-K puolestaan.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2652. 1947. maanvilj. August Kärki, 50 v. kuullut kalastaja Kustaa Aiermolta eli Pikku-Kustaalta Vesilahden Hinsalasta.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Pirunpesä","events":[],"context":{"place":"Pirunpesän kohdalla","environment":"road","time":"","movement":"palasi kaupungista"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N105","id":"N105","collection":"FI","title":"Rajahaltia-jutamon huuto","text":"Rajahaltia-jutamon huuto\n\nEnt. aikoina oli Laukko anastanut Vesilahden Hinsalan kylän maita; mm. Harvian suuri viljelysaukeama oli sille joutunut. Sanotaan että Hukian talo tai mikä sen nimi olikaan, oli sijainnut Kertun saaren kohdalla n.s. Teinisalossa. Siellä on sen perustuksien jäännöksiä m.m. tiilisten tulisijojen selviä jälkiä. Vieläpä myöhemminkin on Laukko pyrkinyt anastamaan hinsalaisten maita.\n\nMaanviljelijä-taata, Taavetti Priiari, Hinsalasta, synt. 1824, on näistä asioista kertonut seuraavaa:\n\n- Tämä meidän kaunis ja hallaton kotikylämme Hinsala, on ikimuistoisista ajoista alkaen paljon kärsinyt Laukon tähden. Mutta siihen ei ole vapaaehtoisesti alistuttu. Sentähden on muinoin kuultu Rajahaltijan pelottavaa huutoa.\n\nJatk. 1 Rajahaltia-jutamon huuto\n\nVesilahden Hinsalan kylässä on Laukon kartano muinoin anastanut hinsalalaisten maa-alueita ja kalavesiä. Iso-Pritkon lahdesta, joka on Säijän selän rannalla, Tiilisalinlahteen suoraan kulki ent. raja Laukon ja Hinsalan välillä, jolloin siitä itäänpäin olevat n.s. Harvian maat kuuluivat Hinsalan talonpojille Mutta Laukko valtasi ne, hävitti Teinisalossa olevan talon ja otti sen viljavat pelto- ja niittyalueet haltuunsa. (Teinisalossa, vastapäätä Kertun saarta, oli ennen ollut joku talo, jonka nimi on unohtunut. Olisiko se ollut ”Sallo”, mikä vanhoissa asiakirjoissa esiintyy, vaikka kartansa ei ole voitu osoittaa sen sijaintipaikkaa.) Silloin joutuivat kaunis Kertunsaari ja ehkä myöskin pieni Sauvasaari, jota nykyisin Rajasaareksi nimitetään, Laukolle.\n\njatk. 2 Rajahaltia-jutamon huuto\n\nRajasaari on Hinsalan selän ja Laukonseiän välillä Siinä oli ennen nuottalato ja puita. Sen äärellä oli hyvät nuotta-apajat pyörenuottaa vedettäessä. Nykyään se on hyljätty, puita kasvava pieni saarinen. Mutta siinä on rajahaltia. Rajasaaren Raja-jutamo on öisin huutanut kuin Tuhnan vuoren huuhkaimet. – Raja kulkee Pitkä-Pritkonlahdesta Harvianlahteen eli Tiilisalinlahteen ja sieltä Himon-Laakaan. Miehet hoi, hohhooi! Kirottu olkoon, joka lähimmäisensä rajan muuttaa, ja kaikki kansa sanokoon aamen, aamen!\n\nKun Hinsalan nuottamiehet muinoin öisin olivat Rajasaaren luona, kuulivat he usein rajahaltian huutavan Mutta kun kalan saanti, etenkin silloin, koska isäsenilma vallitsi, oli runsas, koettivat he voittaa pelkonsa. Kerran olivat eräs renki, Maailman-Aatu ja renki Kustaa nuotalla sillä alueella. Silloin oli\n\njatk. 3 Rajahaltia-jutamon huuto\n\nhirveä isäsenilma. Kustaa ehdotti, että mennään pois. Mutta Maailman-Aatu kiroili. Silloin huusi Rajasaaren Jutamo: ”Miehet hoi, tässä ei vielä ole rajaa, vetäkää mitään pelkäämättä, hoi hooi, mutta kirota ei saa.” Ilma oli salamista aivan kuin päivällä kirkas, ja kaloja tuli niin paljon, että vene oli vähällä upota.\n\nKun käytiin pääsiäisöinä kuuntelemassa, niin kuultiin kuinka Rajasaaren Raja-Jutamo kulki vetäen rautaisia ketjuja Hinsalanselän jäätiköiltä Laukkoon päin. Silloin ajateltiin, että tulossa on outoja tapauksia, verta ja linnaa ja rajojen siirtoja. Tämän kirjoittajakin oli niitä kuuntelemassa ja pelko täytti mielet. Kun kesä tuli, oli Rajasaari kammottava paikka. Mutta Kertun saareen poikkesin mielelläni Laukossa veneellä kulkiessani. Tätä puhtaaksi kirjoittaessani on 70 vuotta kulunut niistä ajoista, ja paljon\n\njatk. 4 Rajahaltia-jutamon huuto\n\non tapahtunut muutoksia: Laukko on menettänyt mm. Harvian maa-alueet karjalaissiirtolaistalonpojille sekä sitä ennen nim. torpparivapauslain kautta eräille torppareilleen. Vuosisataiset vääryydet tulivat näin korjatuiksi. – - ”Älä siirrä ikivanhaa rajaa jonka isäsi ovat tehneet... Älä siirrä ikivanhaa rajaa äläkä mene orpojen pellolle, sillä heidän lunastajansa on voimallinen; hän ajaa heidän asiansa sinua vastaan.” (Sananl. 22:28; 23:10, 11) ---- Rajanhaltia-Jutamon huudot ja vanhojen valittelut eivät nekään olleet turhia. (”Jutamo” hinsalankylän kielenkäytössä merkitsi vanhaa vaimoihmistä.)","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Hinsala","events":[{"id":"FI-404-E01","start":2145,"end":2183,"span":"kuulivat he usein rajahaltian huutavan","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Repeated report includes opening summary; not recounted twice.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-404-E02","start":2514,"end":2637,"span":"huusi Rajasaaren Jutamo: ”Miehet hoi, tässä ei vielä ole rajaa, vetäkää mitään pelkäämättä, hoi hooi, mutta kirota ei saa.”","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Specific fishing episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-404-E03","start":2638,"end":2683,"span":"Ilma oli salamista aivan kuin päivällä kirkas","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Lightning illumination, no confusion of actual time; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-404-E04","start":2788,"end":2898,"span":"kuultiin kuinka Rajasaaren Raja-Jutamo kulki vetäen rautaisia ketjuja Hinsalanselän jäätiköiltä Laukkoon päin.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Easter nights; narrator also listening.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Rajasaaren luona","environment":"lake","time":"öisin","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N106","id":"N106","collection":"FI","title":"Metsänneidot","text":"Metsänneidot\n\nVesilahdessa, Hinsalan kylässä on Silvon talon luona korkeahko Revonmäki, jonka huippu on täynnä koleikkoja monine luola- aukkoineen ja sakeata kuusija leppä-metsää. Siellä on ent. aikoina, vielläpä minunkin (Anselm Silvon) aikana nähty utumaisia metsänneitoja eri vuodenaikoina. Valkea on palanut, metsänneidot ovat sen äärellä olleet, ikäänkuin liikkuneet ja liehuneet. Mutta kun sitten on menty itse paikan päälle, niin siellä ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä eikä myöskään metsän-haltioita. Ja kuitenkin ovat monet ihmiset samalla kertaa sellaisia nähneet. Kuka osaa ja taitaa nämä asiat selittää?","source":"Vesilahti, Hinsala. Frans Kärki TK 52:112. 1961. Anselm Silvo mv., s. 1872 Vesilahti, Hinsala, kuullut lapsena isältään,Kalle Silvolta.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Revonmäen metsänneidot (variant 2)","events":[{"id":"FI-405-E01","start":245,"end":293,"span":"nähty utumaisia metsänneitoja eri vuodenaikoina.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"hazy/qualified appearance","evidence":"ikäänkuin liikkuneet ja liehuneet","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-405-E02","start":392,"end":509,"span":"kun sitten on menty itse paikan päälle, niin siellä ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä eikä myöskään metsän-haltioita.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroboration","evidence":"ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Revonmäki","environment":"forest hill","time":"eri vuodenaikoina","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"Forest maidens\n\nIn Vesilahti, in Hinsala village, near the Silvo farm is the rather high Revonmäki, the top of which is full of boulder fields with its many cave openings and dense spruce and alder forest. There, in former times, even in my (Anselm Silvo) time, misty forest maidens have been seen at various times of the year. A fire has burned, the forest maidens have been around it, as if moving and flickering. But when people then went to the place itself, there was no fire, not even charcoal nor forest spirits. And yet many people have seen such things at the same time. Who can and is able to explain these things?","translationNotes":["\"Metsänneidot\" refers to forest maidens/spirits."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"FI-405-E01","start":262,"end":327,"span":"misty forest maidens have been seen at various times of the year.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"hazy/qualified appearance","evidence":"ikäänkuin liikkuneet ja liehuneet","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"nähty utumaisia metsänneitoja eri vuodenaikoina.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-405-E02","start":420,"end":519,"span":"when people then went to the place itself, there was no fire, not even charcoal nor forest spirits.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroboration","evidence":"ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"kun sitten on menty itse paikan päälle, niin siellä ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä eikä myöskään metsän-haltioita.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"FI:N107","id":"N107","collection":"FI","title":"Metsänneidot","text":"Metsänneidot\n\nVesilahdessa, Hinsalan kylässä on Silvon talon luona korkeahko Revonmäki, jonka huippu on täynnä koleikkoja monine luola- aukkoineen ja sakeata kuusija leppä-metsää. Siellä on ent. aikoina, vielläpä minunkin (Anselm Silvon) aikana nähty utumaisia metsänneitoja eri vuodenaikoina. Valkea on palanut, metsänneidot ovat sen äärellä olleet, ikäänkuin liikkuneet ja liehuneet. Mutta kun sitten on menty itse paikan päälle, niin siellä ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä eikä myöskään metsän-haltioita. Ja kuitenkin ovat monet ihmiset samalla kertaa sellaisia nähneet. Kuka osaa ja taitaa nämä asiat selittää?","source":"Vesilahti, Hinsala. Frans Kärki TK 52:112. 1961. Anselm Silvo mv., s. 1872 Vesilahti, Hinsala, kuullut lapsena isältään,Kalle Silvolta.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Revonmäen metsänneidot","events":[{"id":"FI-406-E01","start":245,"end":293,"span":"nähty utumaisia metsänneitoja eri vuodenaikoina.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"hazy/qualified appearance","evidence":"ikäänkuin liikkuneet ja liehuneet","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-406-E02","start":392,"end":509,"span":"kun sitten on menty itse paikan päälle, niin siellä ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä eikä myöskään metsän-haltioita.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed corroboration","evidence":"ei ollut valkeata, ei edes hiiliä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Revonmäki","environment":"forest hill","time":"eri vuodenaikoina","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N108","id":"N108","collection":"FI","title":"Punainen neitsyt","text":"Punainen neitsyt\n\nHinsalan Revonmäen kukkulalla on usein nähty joku neitsyinen punaisessa puvussa kuin tanssien hyppelevän. Sitten se on kadonnut. Kun Silvon isäntä lähti sitä katsomaan, näkyi se ensin. Ja minäkin sen näin. Vaan kun isäntä saapui kivikkoisen mäen kukkulalle, niin ei siellä ketään nähnyt.\n\nVarmaan se oli Silvon haltia-neitsyt, joka on Jumalan hyvänä lahjana ollut Silvolla.\n\nEräänä yönä lyötiin kovin Silvon talon oven päälle Kaikki heräsivät. Emäntä sanoi pojille, että avatkaa ovi, joku pyrkii sisälle. Vaan ei keitään ollut eteisessä. Pojat menivät talliin. Siellä oli varsa selällään poikkipuolin pilttuussa. He pelastivat sen. Hurskas emäntä sanoi, että puna-neitsyt-haltia sen pelasti.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Revonmäen punainen neitsyt","events":[{"id":"FI-407-E01","start":48,"end":146,"span":"on usein nähty joku neitsyinen punaisessa puvussa kuin tanssien hyppelevän. Sitten se on kadonnut.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unstable perception","evidence":"Sitten se on kadonnut","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic observers.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-407-E02","start":203,"end":223,"span":"Ja minäkin sen näin.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Narrator corroboration of same encounter.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-407-E03","start":281,"end":305,"span":"ei siellä ketään nähnyt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance on approach","evidence":"ei siellä ketään nähnyt","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-407-E04","start":393,"end":461,"span":"Eräänä yönä lyötiin kovin Silvon talon oven päälle Kaikki heräsivät.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen caller","evidence":"ei keitään ollut eteisessä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Later house, group awakened.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Revonmäen kukkulalla","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N109","id":"N109","collection":"FI","title":"Punainen neitsyt.","text":"Punainen neitsyt.\n\nHinsalan kylässä Silvon talon lähellä on kaunis, korkea mäki, nim. Revon mäki. Siitä on kaunis näköala yltympärille. Eräänä sunnuntaina juuri kirkon aikana käveli siellä kaunis, punainen neitsyt. Mutta kun Silvon isäntä, Anselmi, meni sitä lähemmin katsomaan, niin se katosi maan alle.\n\nVanha kertomus kertoo, että Revon mäkeen on sijoitettu aarnihauta. Monasti on nähty kesäisin, kuinka aarnituli siinä palaa ja syksyisin noidan nuolet lähtevät lentoon Revon mäen kukkulalta. Ken silloin osaisi määrätyt päästöluvut lukea, niin hän saisi aarnihaudan kalleudet omakseen. Revon mäen juurella on lähde, jonka vesi on erittäin terveellistä ja parantavaa.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2644. 1947. kalastaja Heikki Silvo, 45v. Hinsala","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Revonmäki","events":[{"id":"FI-408-E01","start":98,"end":135,"span":"Siitä on kaunis näköala yltympärille.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic landscape view.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-408-E02","start":249,"end":304,"span":"meni sitä lähemmin katsomaan, niin se katosi maan alle.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance on approach","evidence":"se katosi maan alle","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Sunday during church service.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-408-E03","start":373,"end":495,"span":"Monasti on nähty kesäisin, kuinka aarnituli siinä palaa ja syksyisin noidan nuolet lähtevät lentoon Revon mäen kukkulalta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic recurrent seasonal appearances; multiple observers unspecified.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Revon mäki","environment":"hill","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N110","id":"N110","collection":"FI","title":"sarvun prunni näkyjä","text":"Olin nuotalla Sarvun prunnissa, joka on Hinsalan saaren ja Kertunsaaren välillä. Plyhrin Taavetti oli minun kanssani. Silloin näimme, että järvi nousi ihmeellisesti ja Hukian talo, joka oli vastaisella rannalla, se peittyi. Ja samanaikaisesti tapahtui eräitä merkillisiä tapauksia.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Sarvun prunni näkyjä","events":[{"id":"FI-409-E01","start":126,"end":223,"span":"näimme, että järvi nousi ihmeellisesti ja Hukian talo, joka oli vastaisella rannalla, se peittyi.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Unusual water rise does not alone establish perceptual uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Sarvun prunnissa","environment":"lake","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N111","id":"N111","collection":"FI","title":"Aarnitulesta eli noidannuolesta.","text":"Aarnitulesta eli noidannuolesta.\n\nLapsena kuulin, kuin ent. aikojen vanhat kertoi lentävistä tulista, aarnitulista tai noidannuolista, jotka yön pimeydessä kiisivät halki ilman. Minäkin näin, kuinka Teinisalon suosta tai ”Satunsuosta”, jotka ovat Vesilahden Hinsalankylän Jopin talon luona, lähti syyspimeänä yönä kuin tulinen nuoli lentämään, ja se lensi Laukon selän ylitse. Sen tuntui kammottavalta. Sellaisia peljättiin ennen.\n\nMutta on sitä ajateltu, että on maan povessa jonkinlaista kisua, eli häkää, joka syttyy palamaan ilmassa. – Suon vedestä nostettu puu säteilee omituista valoa pimeydessä. Se on tuttu asia vanhoille.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Satunsuo","events":[{"id":"FI-410-E01","start":178,"end":342,"span":"Minäkin näin, kuinka Teinisalon suosta tai ”Satunsuosta”, jotka ovat Vesilahden Hinsalankylän Jopin talon luona, lähti syyspimeänä yönä kuin tulinen nuoli lentämään","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Alternative place names retained; flame simile not identity uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-410-E02","start":540,"end":602,"span":"Suon vedestä nostettu puu säteilee omituista valoa pimeydessä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic explanatory comparison; no named observer, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Teinisalon suosta","environment":"wetland","time":"syyspimeänä yönä","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N113","id":"N113","collection":"FI","title":"Kun lapsen itkua kuultiin","text":"Kun lapsen itkua kuultiin\n\nIhmiset, jotka kulkivat Hinsalan ”Nappulatietä”, joka Kaukastensuon yli Hulpon metsän läpi johti Liettenrantaa kohden, kuulivat lähellä olevasta Silvon korvesta lapsen itkua. Monet kuulivat. Asia kerrottiin poliisillekin. Hän tuli tutkimaan. Eräs nainen oli synnyttänyt huorilapsen ja vienyt hänen ruumiinsa korpeen. Sitten kävi tutkinnoissa selville, että lapsi oli kuolleena syntynyt. Äiti oli häpeän tähden asian salannut. – Kun ruumis haudattiin lakkasi lapsen itkukin Silvon korvessa.","source":"Vesilahti, Hinsala. Frans Kärki TK 52:117. 1961. kuullut äidiltään mv.em. Vilhelmiina Kärjeltä, s. 1855.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Silvon korpi","events":[{"id":"FI-411-E01","start":146,"end":201,"span":"kuulivat lähellä olevasta Silvon korvesta lapsen itkua.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-411-E02","start":477,"end":516,"span":"lakkasi lapsen itkukin Silvon korvessa.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Subsequent cessation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Silvon korvesta","environment":"forest","time":"","movement":"kulkivat Hinsalan ”Nappulatietä”"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N114","id":"N114","collection":"FI","title":"lampi","text":"Vesilahdella on talo jonka nimi on Suomela, talos sa harrastettiin kalastusta Suomelan lähettyvillä oli pieni kalainen lampi josta juoksi puro Pyhäjärveen, puro kulki maantien yli. Puron yli maantien kohdalla oli silta Suomelassa oli kalavahti. Eräänä kauniina kevätaamuna vahti makasi sillalla, suuri hauki tuli ja nosti päällänsä pyydyksen ylös joka oli asetettu poikki puron Pieniä kaloja oli kerääntynyt paljon pyydykseen. Hauki päästi kaikki vapauteensa vahti ei voinut kuin katsella vain – vaikka vahti oli tietenkin ihmisiä varten.","source":"Elsa Junkkaala","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Suomela","events":[{"id":"FI-412-E01","start":459,"end":493,"span":"vahti ei voinut kuin katsella vain","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Watching pike release fish; complete object in preceding sentence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"sillalla","environment":"bridge","time":"Eräänä kauniina kevätaamuna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N115","id":"N115","collection":"FI","title":"Säijänselän honka","text":"Vesilahdella Pyhäjärven Säijänselän seutuilla oli järvessä kanto lujaa honkaa. Se oli ollut sukupolvesta toiseen niin kauvan, kun muistettiin. Se oli puoli kilometriä rannasta puoli metriä veten pinnan yläpuolella. Siihen liittyi taika, että joka sitä lyö, niin sen rupee pää mätäneen. Oli sitten uskalikko, joka veton päälle hakasi sen poikki veten rajasta. Hakkaaja tappoi ittensä ja kanto katosi. Se kanto oli minun aikanani noin 30 v.","source":"Vesilahti. PK 8.Helenius, Martta 1537. v. 1938.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Säijänselän honka","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N116","id":"N116","collection":"FI","title":"Tuhnu ja Tohni","text":"Tuhnu ja Tohni\n\nMuinoisin Tuhnun ja Tohni olivat kuuluisia voimamiehiä ja sankareita. Mistä he olivat kotoisin, sitä ei enää muisteta. Mutta Vesilahden ihanat järviseudut he olivat valinneet asuma-alueikseen. He asuivat sillä kannaksella, joka on Laukon ja Hinsalan kylän välillä. Tuhnun talo oli Siermonlahden Sakastissa, jonka rinteellä, tienvieressä on Sakastinlähde.\n\nTuhnun nuorin veli nimeltään, Tohni, oli rohkeaalotteinen. Se ilmeni siitä, että hän Laukon laiduinmaan ympäristössä rupesi peltoja raivaamaan. Siihen työhön hän käytti pakkovallalla hankkimiaan työläisiä Mutta siitä oli seurauksena, että koko ympäristön väestö pelkäsi häntä.\n\nKuuluisa uros, Sako-Kurki, joka oli asunut Vedilahden Sakoisten kylässä oli varallisuutensa ja voimansa johdosta joutunut riitoihin, jopa oikein sotakannalle Tohnin kanssa. Sako-Kurki puolusti rahvaan\n\njatk. 1 Tuhnu ja Tohni\n\noikeuksia ja vapautta. ”Tässä maassa ei orjuutta hyväksytä.” Tohni jäi yksinäiseksi ja köyhäksi. Lopuksi täyti Tohnin paeta kipusin-kiirein.\n\nSako-Kurki siirtyi Laukon isännäksi. Hän ryhtyi takaaajamaan Tohnia. Siihen aikaan ei Tuhnukaan voinut veljeään auttaa.\n\nTohni paetessaan hyppäsi Siermonlahden kalliolta järveen ja alkoi uida ulapalle kohti Pussin-salonsaarta. Sako-Kurki miehineen katselivat jyrkältä kalliolta Tohnin uimista ihmetellen niinkuin urheata vastustajaa ihmetellään.\n\nMutta pirukin pelkäsi Tohnia. Kun Tohni uimarina uljaasti halkoi aaltoja, lensi piru korpin muotoisena hänen kohdalleen ja sanoi:\n\n- Eppäs tiikkään tiitä.\n\n- Töysään minä töyttään, siellä minut löyttään.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Tuhnu ja tohni","events":[{"id":"FI-414-E01","start":1245,"end":1321,"span":"Sako-Kurki miehineen katselivat jyrkältä kalliolta Tohnin uimista ihmetellen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Siermonlahden","environment":"lake","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N117","id":"N117","collection":"FI","title":"Tuhnun peikko.","text":"Tuhnun peikko.\n\nTuhnunvuori, joka on Hinsalan Hukian aluetta, on Hinsalankylän korkein vuori, joka jyrkästi, kuin seinä, laskeutuu Säijän selkään. Vähää ennen veden rajaa on siellä kuuluisa Pirun pesä. Se oli ennen paljon suurempi ja se meni kovin syvälle kallion sisälle. Mutta vesi ja kevätrouta ovat sinne kasanneet paljon kiviä ja soraa, jotka ovat ikäänkuin luolan katosta pudonneet. Sanotaan, että tämä luola jatkui aina Pirunvuoreen Karkussa.\n\nTuhnunvuorella oli ennen paljon huuhkaimia, joitten huutoon kamalaa öisin; se on ikäänkuin hädässä olevan juopuneen miehen huutoa. Sitte siellä on ollut paljon kaikellaisia kotkia ja haukkoja, jotka pesivät sen jyrkänteissä. Mutta nykyisin ne ovat sieltä hävinneet ehkä sukupuuttoon. Aivan Pirunpesän edessä oli ennen suuri kivilaatta, suuri kuih huoneen ovi, tasainen ja kaunis. Sitä sanottiin perkeleen jakopöydäksi. Mutta Hinsalan nuoret miehet ylpeässä uhmassaan väänsivät sen alas järveen.\n\nKuulin ennen puhuttavan Tuhnun peikosta. Karkun kirkkoon ei saatu muinaisena aikana kelloa, sillä Tuhnun peikko rikkoi ja tuhosi ne. Mutta sitten päätettiin, että sitä ei osteta rahalla eikä sitä hankita työllä, vaan pyhillä ohrilla, joita varten koottiin. Ja niin Karkkuun kirkkoon saatiin kello, jota sitten sanottiin ”ohraperäksi”.\n\n(jatk.1.)\n\nsukupuuttoon. Aivan Pirunpesän edessä oli ennen suuri kivilaata, suuri kuin huoneen ovi, tasainen ja kaunis. Sitä sanottiin perkeleen jakopöydäksi. Mutta Hinsalan nuoret miehet ylpeässä uhmassaan väänsivät sen alas järveen. Kuulin ennen puhuttavan Tuhnun peikosta. Karkun kirkkoon ei saatu muinaisena aikana kelloa, sillä Tuhnun peikko rikkoi ja tuhosi ne. Mutta sitten päätettiin, että sitä ei osteta rahalla eikä sitä hankita työllä, vaan pyhillä ohrilla, joita varten koottiin. Ja niin Karkkuun kirkkoon saatiin kello, jota sitten sanottiin ”ohraperäksi”.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2664. 1947. mv Taavetti Priiari, 78 v. Vesilahti Hinsala, kuullut vanhoilta lapsena. | Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2664. 1947. <mv Taavetti Priiari, 78 v. Vesilahti Hinsala, kuullut vanhoilta lapsena.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Tuhnunvuori","events":[{"id":"FI-415-E01","start":503,"end":581,"span":"huutoon kamalaa öisin; se on ikäänkuin hädässä olevan juopuneen miehen huutoa.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Owl call simile; no mistaken identity claimed.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Tuhnunvuorella","environment":"mountain","time":"öisin","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N118","id":"N118","collection":"FI","title":"tunneli pirunvuorelle","text":"Vesilahden Laukon kartanosta johtaa maanalainen käytävä Pirunvuorelle. Piru täytti aina kartanon viinitynnyrit, eikäkoskaan niistä viini loppunut, sekä toi kartanoon muutakin tavaraa. Piru varas ti kerta Keson talosta mustan sian, kun isäntä kulki ohi vuoren, huusi piru hänelle, että tule syömään sikasi lihaa, toista kystä valmiina, toista keitetään. Vesilahdella oli kaksi pappia, Hilten ja Pohjola. Silloin, kun Pohjola ol saarnaamassa, niin ei piru uskaltanut mennä edes sakaristoon, mutta kun Hilten saarnasi, niin uskaldi mennä aina saarnatuolin toiselle askeleelle asti. Pirun näki viimeisen kerran kirkonkylän seppä, pojansa ahjolla mustan kissan hahmossa. Se hyppäsi ahjon savupiipusta ylös ja hävisi sille tielle.","source":"Vesilahti. Rannikko, Paavo. PK 1:86. Isäntä Anselm Nieminen s. 6.10. 1875 Vesilahden Mantereen kylässä.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Tunneli pirunvuorelle","events":[{"id":"FI-416-E01","start":260,"end":278,"span":"huusi piru hänelle","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"By mountain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-416-E02","start":579,"end":665,"span":"Pirun näki viimeisen kerran kirkonkylän seppä, pojansa ahjolla mustan kissan hahmossa.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Smith at forge; label narrator wording, not analyst identity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N119","id":"N119","collection":"FI","title":"Tuonenojan neitsyt","text":"Tuonenojan neitsyt\n\nKun Vesilahden Hinsalan kylästä kerran soudettiin Kärkölän kylässä olevaa Friiman-silta-voudin rannalla jonka luona on Tuonenoja-niminen, synkkä vuori-virtanen, niin soutajat näkivät, kuinka Sakaselän rannalla olevan Pyörökallion päällä liehui tai tanssieli valkopukuinen neitonen. He luulivat että jonkun häätalon morsian oli sinne tullut opettelemaan tanssimaan, koska Pyörökallion kumpu oli tasainen ja viehättävä kuin häätuvan lattia. He rupesivat riuskemmasti soutamaan. Neisyt tanssi kuin purppurissa ollen, kumarsi, teki täyskäännöksiä. ”Katsokaa, miten taitava tanssija hän onkaan”, he sanoivat.\n\nMutta kun he saapuivat Pyörökallion lähelle, lähti neitsyt tanssien ohi Friimannin talon ja katosi Tuonenojan metsä-laaksoon. – He poikkesivat siltavoudilta kysymään, että missä nyt on häät ja kuka se tanssiva neitokainen oli, jonka he olivat Pyörökalliolla nähneet?\n\njatk. 1 Tuonenojan neitsyt\n\nSiltavouti Friiman vastasi, että ei täälläpäin nykyisin ole häitä eikä häämorsianta. Mutta se neitsyt, jonka olette nähneet, on muinaisajan kristitty neitsyt, joka häitten asemesta poltettiin marttyyrina Pyörökalliolla ja jonka jäteluut viskattiin tähän Tuonenojaan.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Tuonenojan neitsyt","events":[{"id":"FI-417-E01","start":186,"end":301,"span":"soutajat näkivät, kuinka Sakaselän rannalla olevan Pyörökallion päällä liehui tai tanssieli valkopukuinen neitonen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"provisional identification","evidence":"He luulivat että jonkun häätalon morsian","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-417-E02","start":670,"end":750,"span":"lähti neitsyt tanssien ohi Friimannin talon ja katosi Tuonenojan metsä-laaksoon.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"loss of sight","evidence":"katosi Tuonenojan metsä-laaksoon","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Could be ordinary departure into terrain; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Pyörökallion päällä","environment":"waterside rock","time":"","movement":"soudettiin"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"The maiden of Tuonenoja\n\nWhen people from the village of Hinsala in Vesilahti were once rowing by the shore of Friiman, the bridge bailiff in Kärkölä village, near which is a dark mountain stream called Tuonenoja, the rowers saw how a white-clad maiden fluttered or danced on top of Pyörökallio rock by the shore of Sakaselkä. They thought that some wedding house's bride had come there to learn how to dance, because Pyörökallio's knoll was as flat and charming as a wedding house floor. They started rowing more briskly. The maiden danced as if taking part in a purppuri dance, bowed, made full turns. 'Look what a skillful dancer she is,' they said.\n\nBut when they arrived near Pyörökallio, the maiden set off dancing past Friiman's house and disappeared into the forest valley of Tuonenoja. – They dropped by the bridge bailiff to ask where a wedding was being held and who the dancing maiden they had seen on Pyörökallio was.\n\ncont. 1 The maiden of Tuonenoja\n\nBridge Bailiff Friiman replied that no wedding was taking place nearby and there was no bride. But that maiden you saw is a Christian maiden from long ago who, instead of being married, was burned as a martyr on Pyörökallio and whose remaining bones were tossed into this Tuonenoja stream.","translationNotes":["REVIEW REQUIRED: the opening route description is syntactically irregular in the transcription. 'Purppurissa' is contextually interpreted as the purppuri dance, not purple clothing; this contextual reading should receive Finnish-language review. Dance reference: https://www.kansantanssinyst.fi/kansantanssi/tanssit/purpuri/ . 'Siltavouti' is retained as bridge bailiff, a historical office.","Continuation of the legend of the Tuonenoja maiden."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"FI-417-E01","start":214,"end":326,"span":"the rowers saw how a white-clad maiden fluttered or danced on top of Pyörökallio rock by the shore of Sakaselkä.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"provisional identification","evidence":"He luulivat että jonkun häätalon morsian","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"soutajat näkivät, kuinka Sakaselän rannalla olevan Pyörökallion päällä liehui tai tanssieli valkopukuinen neitonen.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-417-E02","start":694,"end":794,"span":"the maiden set off dancing past Friiman's house and disappeared into the forest valley of Tuonenoja.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"loss of sight","evidence":"katosi Tuonenojan metsä-laaksoon","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Could be ordinary departure into terrain; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"lähti neitsyt tanssien ohi Friimannin talon ja katosi Tuonenojan metsä-laaksoon.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"FI:N121","id":"N121","collection":"FI","title":"viinalähde","text":"Täällä on lähde joka saanut nimen viinalähde sillä kerrottu on että joskus sodan aikana olisi kätketty viinapannu täynnä rahaa, se on nykyään Vattusen talon korpiladon maassa, ja sanotaan että siinä on juhannus ja jouluyönä kello 12 puhdasta viinaa jota vielä miespolvi takaperin käytiin säännöllisesti hakemassa.","source":"Vesilahti. KT 23. Lastunen,Kalle 7. 1936.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Viinalähde","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N122","id":"N122","collection":"FI","title":"Näky.","text":"Näky.\n\nVääristen rannan Kipparista Vastollepäin 3 veljestä oli ongella. Ladosta lähti silloin musta mies valkoiset alushousut käärittyinä ylös. Tuli rantaan puolisääreen astikka veteen, otti kalan, puristi sitä, pisti vasempaan kainaloonsa ja tuli luoksemme ja mua ylös ja katosi äkisti näkymättömäksi. Silloin kiiruusti lähdimme kotiin. Samassa ladossa Pourun trenki tappoi Kestin isännän, jota hän vihasi, koska hän piti Kestin talon emäntää. Se oli n. 100 v. sitten tapahtunut. Vangin föörari vei rengin linnaan. Siperiaan hän joutui eikä palannut sieltä.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2639. 1937. pienvilj.Hugo Mäkinen, 52 v. Vesilahti, Narva.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Vääräisten rantalato","events":[{"id":"FI-419-E01","start":273,"end":302,"span":"katosi äkisti näkymättömäksi.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"sudden invisibility","evidence":"katosi äkisti näkymättömäksi","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Vääristen rannan","environment":"waterside","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N123","id":"N123","collection":"FI","title":"uhrilähde","text":"Vesilahden Mantereen kylän takamaalla on jossakin Uhrilähde, josta on kerrottu nähdyksi Aarni valkian, joka oli kuin kynttilän liek ki. Mainittuun lähteoseon olisi muinoin kätketty aarre.","source":"Kuusjoki. KT 10. Rannikko, Paavo, Johannes 35. 1938. Leppänen, Johan , Henrik, s. 31/12-185 Vesilahden Mantereen kylässä.","category":"Vesilahti location-specific legends","place":"Uhrilähde","events":[{"id":"FI-420-E01","start":70,"end":135,"span":"kerrottu nähdyksi Aarni valkian, joka oli kuin kynttilän liek ki.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Reported visual comparison.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Uhrilähde","environment":"spring","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N125","id":"N125","collection":"FI","title":"hevosille ryyppy","text":"Hevosille lähteissä jouluaamuna annettiin viina ryyppy että ne oli ilosia kirkonmäellä.","source":"Vesilahti. Kaisa Niemelä KT 26:23. 1938. - Aino Niemelä, s. 1893.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N126","id":"N126","collection":"FI","title":"Risti kynnykselle.","text":"Risti kynnykselle.\n\nKirkkomaan väki, suuri joukko läksi kirkkomaalta. Mutta reisumies kerskuili voimistaan. Mutta sitte tuli hänelle kova hätä, kun kirkkomaanväki hyökkäsi häntä vastaan. Silloin kuului ääni: ”Mene ristiin kynnykselle.” Reisumies juoksi pellolle siihen paikkaan, johon vaot oli kynnetty ristiin rastiin, kuten ennen oli tapana ristiin kyntää, jolloin myös pelto siunattiin. Silloin reisumies pelastui, eikä hän sen perästä enää pröystäilly.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-422-E01","start":187,"end":235,"span":"Silloin kuului ääni: ”Mene ristiin kynnykselle.”","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kirkkomaalta","environment":"cemetery","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N127","id":"N127","collection":"FI","title":"Kirkkomaan väki.","text":"Kirkkomaan väki.\n\nOli kerran sellainen reisumies, joka aina pröystäili eli kerskuili, että hän ei pelkää mitään, ei aaveita, ei vainajia, eikä kirkkomaan väkeä. Mutta kun hän kerran ajoi Vesilahden kirkon vierellä olevaa maantietä pitkin, kerskaillen itsekseen, ettei mikään kykene häntä pelottamaan, niin silloin koko kirkkomaan väki karkasi hänen kimppuunsa. Hevonen pysähtyi eikä hän saanut sitä menemään eteen eikä taakse. Jo työntyi kirkkomaan väki rattaille hänen kimppuunsa. Hän huusi apua. Silloin hän kuuli äänen: - Mene ristiin kynnetylle. Mies juoksi lähellä olevalle pellolle. Pelto oli kynnetty, niinkuin vanhaan aikaan kynnettiin, nimittäin ristiin ja kyntäjä oli pel/\n\n(ja tk.1.) tonsa siunannut. Siinä rukoili reisumies isä meitänsä polvillansa ja kirkkomaan väki poistui. Hän palasi hevosensa rattaille ja hevonen totteli häntä.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-423-E01","start":361,"end":426,"span":"Hevonen pysähtyi eikä hän saanut sitä menemään eteen eikä taakse.","modalities":["orientation","movement sensation"],"groups":["orientation","body"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"blocked travel","evidence":"eikä hän saanut sitä menemään eteen eikä taakse","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Transport obstruction, not necessarily felt disorientation; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-423-E02","start":482,"end":497,"span":"Hän huusi apua.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-423-E03","start":498,"end":549,"span":"Silloin hän kuuli äänen: - Mene ristiin kynnetylle.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Vesilahden kirkon vierellä olevaa maantietä","environment":"road","time":"","movement":"ajoi"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N128","id":"N128","collection":"FI","title":"Kun kotitonttu hevosen pelasti.","text":"Kun kotitonttu hevosen pelasti.\n\nEräänä yönä Hinsalankylän Silvon talon oven päälle kovin kolkutettiin. Isäntä ja pojat heräsivät ja menivät katsomaan. Emäntä kehoitti, että avaskaa ovi, joku pyrkii sisään, mutta kun heoven avasivat, ei ollut ketään kuuluvilla. Pojat mrnivät sön jälkeen talliin ja katso, siellä makasi varsa kuolemaisillaan selällään poikkipuolin pilttuussaan. He kerkisivät apuun. Kotitonttu siten hevosen pelasti.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2646. 1947. v kalastaja Heikki Silvo, 45 v. Vesilahti, Hinsala.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-424-E01","start":72,"end":103,"span":"oven päälle kovin kolkutettiin.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unseen caller","evidence":"ei ollut ketään kuuluvilla","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-424-E02","start":234,"end":261,"span":"ei ollut ketään kuuluvilla.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"failed auditory corroboration","evidence":"ei ollut ketään kuuluvilla","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Kuuluvilla literally within hearing; not silently corrected to visible.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Silvon talon","environment":"domestic interior","time":"Eräänä yönä","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N129","id":"N129","collection":"FI","title":"Kuolleen sormi","text":"Kuolleen sormi\n\nSuurilla noidilla oli ennen aina kuolleen sormi, olivat leikanneet kuolleen kädestä. Mitä myöten sen painoivat maitopunkkaan, niin paksua tuli kerma.","source":"Vesilahti. Antti Valve b) 102. 1910. - Juho Edvin Kärävä s. Vesilahden pitäjän Järvenrannan kylässä Jutilan talossa. Oleskellut Helsingissä ja Turussa. Äitivainaansa on neuvonut useimmat taiat (samassa pitäjässä syntynyt). 50 vuotias.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N130","id":"N130","collection":"FI","title":"Poimi käärmeitä.","text":"Poimi käärmeitä.\n\nTottijärveläinen Yli-Pihnala kykeni poimimaan käärmeitä paljain käsin eikä kukaan niistä häntä pistänyt. Mutta kerran hän pisti käärmeen taskuunsa ja unhoitti sen sinne. Kun hän sitten pitkän ajan perästä etsi taskustaan jotakin, pisti käärme häntä, sillä hän ei ollut siihen varautunut.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2632. 1947. v maanviljelijä Ernest Järvinen, 60 v. Vesilahti, Krääkkiö. Kuullut isältään.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-426-E01","start":47,"end":87,"span":"kykeni poimimaan käärmeitä paljain käsin","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic explicit handling; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-426-E02","start":248,"end":266,"span":"pisti käärme häntä","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Actual bite; no pain inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N131","id":"N131","collection":"FI","title":"Kärmeenluola.","text":"Kärmeenluola.\n\nKun minin oli seipäät ottamasa, niin yht’äkkiä purota humahrin sinne sammaliin, että rojahti. Minä tosta vähän säikährin, että minkäs tästä tämmöttellä hopulla mennään. Ja nin minä putosin kumminkin seittemän kyynärää sinne maan sisään. Kun minä sitte rupesin katteleen ympärillen että missäs sitä ny ollaan, nin min olinkin puronnu kärmeen lualaan. Ja siäl oli matoja jos jotakin sorttia, suuria ja piäniä, ja oli keskunkertasiakin ja niit oli nin tuhannesti. Pohjalla makas rötkötti yks oikeen aika vota, se oli paksu kun seinähirsi ja tiäs kuinka pitkä. Mut ei ne marot must ollu tiätävänänsä siälä ne vaan lerivät pitkin seiniä. Siälä minä sitte olin koko talven; kivee imeskeltiin vaan, valkosta kivee, vaikk en min olsi leukojani siähen alas painanu mutta se isäntä, se iso vota, heitti häntänsä niskolleni ja veti mun väkiste siähen. Keväällä sitte ne pikkuset elävät lähtivät pois yks ensin, toinen sitte, ette’ jääny muuta kun se iso ja minä. Se oyti sitte muakin sualivyältä kii ja nosti mun pois. Ja täs olen ny.\n\njatk. 1. seinähirsi ja tiäs kuinka pitkä. Mut ei ne marot must ollu tiätävänänsä siälä ne vaan lerivät pitkin seiniä. Siälä minä sitte olin koko talven; kivee imeskeltiin vaan, valkosta kivee, vaikk en min olsi leukojani siähen alas painanu mutta se isäntä, se iso vota, heitti häntänsä niskolleni ja veti mun väkiste siähen. Keväällä sitte ne pikkuset elävät lähtivät pois yks ensin, toinen sitte, ette’ jääny muuta kun se iso ja minä. Se oyti sitte muakin sualivyältä kii ja nosti mun pois. Ja täs olen ny.","source":"Vesilahti, kirkonkylä. Helsingin Suomalaisen Normaalilyseon konventti (Samuli Lindroos) II a)5. 1892. - Aatolfi Ruokonen, torppari, 46 v.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-427-E01","start":62,"end":108,"span":"purota humahrin sinne sammaliin, että rojahti.","modalities":["movement sensation","auditory","balance"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-427-E02","start":267,"end":322,"span":"rupesin katteleen ympärillen että missäs sitä ny ollaan","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unfamiliar location","evidence":"missäs sitä ny ollaan","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-427-E03","start":683,"end":721,"span":"kivee imeskeltiin vaan, valkosta kivee","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Oral contact, not taste quality; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-427-E04","start":801,"end":855,"span":"heitti häntänsä niskolleni ja veti mun väkiste siähen.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Forced movement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-427-E05","start":967,"end":1022,"span":"Se oyti sitte muakin sualivyältä kii ja nosti mun pois.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Spring exit; repeated continuation text not counted twice; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"kärmeen lualaan","environment":"cave","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"Snake cave.\n\nWhen I was getting fence poles, I suddenly tumbled down into the moss with a thud. I was a little startled and wondered where I was going in such a hurry. I fell a full seven cubits down into the earth. When I started looking around, wondering where I was now, I found I had fallen into a snake cave. And there were snakes of all sorts, large and small, and medium-sized ones, and there were thousands of them. At the bottom lay sprawling one enormous creature, it was thick like a wall log and goodness knows how long. But those snakes seemed to take no notice of me, they were just slithering along the walls.\n\nThere I was then the whole winter; we only sucked a stone, a white stone, although I wouldn't have pressed my jaws down onto it, but the master, that great creature, threw its tail onto my neck and dragged me there by force. In the spring then those small creatures left, one first, the other then, so that nothing remained except the big one and me. It then grabbed me by the waist and lifted me out. And here I am now.\n\ncont. 1. wall log and goodness knows how long. But those snakes seemed to take no notice of me, they were just slithering along the walls.\n\nThere I was then the whole winter; we only sucked a stone, a white stone, although I wouldn't have pressed my jaws down onto it, but the master, that great creature, threw its tail onto my neck and dragged me there by force. In the spring then those small creatures left, one first, the other then, so that nothing remained except the big one and me. It then grabbed me by the waist and lifted me out. And here I am now.","translationNotes":["REVIEW REQUIRED: dialectal 'vota' is rendered provisionally as 'creature'; its exact lexical meaning needs review. First-person falling, the thud, seven cubits, looking around and disorientation are retained. 'Madot' refers here to the snakes already described.","REVIEW REQUIRED: 'sualivyältä' is provisionally rendered as 'by the waist', without adding a separate belt object. The continuation repeats earlier text; repetition is preserved. 'Master' preserves the narrator's designation for the large creature.","REVIEW REQUIRED: same 'sualivyältä' reading as part 2/3. This passage repeats the first paragraph of part 2/3 in the supplied source; it is retained, not counted as a new episode."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"FI-427-E01","start":45,"end":95,"span":"I suddenly tumbled down into the moss with a thud.","modalities":["movement sensation","auditory","balance"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"purota humahrin sinne sammaliin, että rojahti.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-427-E02","start":216,"end":272,"span":"When I started looking around, wondering where I was now","modalities":["visual","orientation"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"unfamiliar location","evidence":"missäs sitä ny ollaan","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"rupesin katteleen ympärillen että missäs sitä ny ollaan","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-427-E03","start":661,"end":698,"span":"we only sucked a stone, a white stone","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Oral contact, not taste quality; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"kivee imeskeltiin vaan, valkosta kivee","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-427-E04","start":792,"end":850,"span":"threw its tail onto my neck and dragged me there by force.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Forced movement; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"heitti häntänsä niskolleni ja veti mun väkiste siähen.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-427-E05","start":977,"end":1027,"span":"It then grabbed me by the waist and lifted me out.","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Spring exit; repeated continuation text not counted twice; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"Se oyti sitte muakin sualivyältä kii ja nosti mun pois.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"FI:N132","id":"N132","collection":"FI","title":"Hupainen tarina.","text":"Hupainen tarina.\n\nWanha kansa luuli että Lappalaiset kulki tuulispäässä ja veivät heidän omaisuuttaan karjaa ym. Eräs heikki suuttuneena heitti veitsen tuulispäähän mutta se olikin sattunut Lapinäijän reiteen kostoksi vei lapin äijä heikin lappiin täällä lapissa tuli heikin ikävä kotiin lapin äijä tuli ja kysyi heikiltä mitä maksat kun vien sinun kotiisi? mustan lehmän jaa sen joka on navettasi ovipielessä niin no kuinka lujaa tulet niinkö kuin koiras teeri vai niinkuin ihmisen mieli niinkuin koirasteeri ja niin sitä lähdettiin ja tultiin kotiin mutta heikki rupesi heti katumaan että oli luvannut sen lehmän ja riensi navettaan sitä estämään mutta lehmä ja lapin äijä oli mennyt jo.","source":"Vesilahti. KT 17. Helenius, Martta 1. 1938.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-428-E01","start":181,"end":208,"span":"sattunut Lapinäijän reiteen","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Knife impact; pain not inferred; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N133","id":"N133","collection":"FI","title":"mies- ja naishaltija","text":"Siinä talossa missä on mieshaltia voidaan hyvin; mutta jos on naishaltija, siinä huonosti.","source":"Vesilahti. Valve, A. 106. 1910. – Järvenrannan kylä. Kärävä, Juho Edvin, 50 v. Kuullun äiti-vainaaltain (synt. Vesilahdella).","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N134","id":"N134","collection":"FI","title":"Taikoja.","text":"Taikoja.\n\nKertojan ollessa 10.v. ikäisenä muistaa Äitivainaansa kanssa menneen Navettaan Kylmäkosken pitäjässä Mellolankylässä Palko nimisessä talossa hän näki ihmeekseen Äitinsä kanssa että navetan ikkunaan oli pistetty kirnun mäntä ja kuuli sekä näki että, sillä kirnuttiin harvaksensa sanat kuuli sulle vesi vesi sulle mulle Mulle voi voi kun katsoimme ikkunasta Äitini kanssa ihmettä katosi taikojen tekijä eikä häntä saatu kiinni Arveltiin ja tiettiinkin että kirnun männän heiluttaja oli naapurin vanha-Emäntä Josefviina Palonen tämä tapahtui 1891 v. Kylmäkoskella. todeksi kertoja tämän vakuuttaa.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-430-E01","start":151,"end":341,"span":"hän näki ihmeekseen Äitinsä kanssa että navetan ikkunaan oli pistetty kirnun mäntä ja kuuli sekä näki että, sillä kirnuttiin harvaksensa sanat kuuli sulle vesi vesi sulle mulle Mulle voi voi","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-430-E02","start":342,"end":434,"span":"kun katsoimme ikkunasta Äitini kanssa ihmettä katosi taikojen tekijä eikä häntä saatu kiinni","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"katosi taikojen tekijä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Navettaan","environment":"stable","time":"1891 v.","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"Magic.\n\nThe narrator recalls going with their late mother, at the age of ten, into the cowshed at a farm called Palko in Mellola village, Kylmäkoski parish. To their surprise, they and their mother saw that a churn dasher had been put into the cowshed window. They both heard and saw it being used to churn slowly, and heard the words: ‘For you water, water for you, for me, for me butter, butter.’ When my mother and I looked through the window at this marvel, the person working the magic disappeared and could not be caught. It was supposed, and indeed said to be known, that the person moving the dasher was the old mistress of the neighbouring household, Josefviina Palonen. This happened in 1891 in Kylmäkoski. The narrator affirms that it is true.","translationNotes":["The source shifts from third-person narration to first-person 'we'; that shift is retained. Finnish does not specify the narrator's gender. 'Kirnun mäntä' is a churn dasher. 'Harvaksensa' describes slow/infrequent churning strokes, not sparse butter. Source repetition in the spoken formula is retained."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"FI-430-E01","start":157,"end":398,"span":"To their surprise, they and their mother saw that a churn dasher had been put into the cowshed window. They both heard and saw it being used to churn slowly, and heard the words: ‘For you water, water for you, for me, for me butter, butter.’","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"hän näki ihmeekseen Äitinsä kanssa että navetan ikkunaan oli pistetty kirnun mäntä ja kuuli sekä näki että, sillä kirnuttiin harvaksensa sanat kuuli sulle vesi vesi sulle mulle Mulle voi voi","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"FI-430-E02","start":399,"end":527,"span":"When my mother and I looked through the window at this marvel, the person working the magic disappeared and could not be caught.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"disappearance","evidence":"katosi taikojen tekijä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":"","originalSpan":"kun katsoimme ikkunasta Äitini kanssa ihmettä katosi taikojen tekijä eikä häntä saatu kiinni","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"FI:N135","id":"N135","collection":"FI","title":"Saijännnoita Esteri Silvan","text":"Saijännnoita Esteri Silvan\n\noli iso noita, hänellä oli paha silmä, jos hän pääsi navettoon oli karja onni mennyt. Karjassa alkoi sairastelemiset ja kuolema – Mutta hän myöskin paransi tautia sekä ihmisestä että eläimmistä – Monet säijäläiset saivat häneltä avun hammassärkyyn – yhdeksän terotettua puutikkua oli välineenä, Jokaiseen tikkuun hän otti ikenistä verta Tikut vietiin kolmen tien haaraan kannon päähän, niin hammassärky lakkasi Esteri Silvan vaikutti viime vuosisadalla, Hän on ollut jo kuolleena ainakin 50 vuotta.","source":"Elsa Junkkaala","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-431-E01","start":242,"end":275,"span":"saivat häneltä avun hammassärkyyn","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic repeated toothache.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-431-E02","start":323,"end":364,"span":"Jokaiseen tikkuun hän otti ikenistä verta","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Treatment contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-431-E03","start":419,"end":438,"span":"hammassärky lakkasi","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Pain cessation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N136","id":"N136","collection":"FI","title":"Tietoja Kyttälän Heikistä.","text":"Tietoja Kyttälän Heikistä.\n\nVakkalankylän Kyttälässä Vesilahdella asui mies nimeltä Heikki, jolla oli verenvuodon sanat. Ihmiset menivät hänen luoksensa apua hakemaan. Kerran hän piirsi ympyrän, lumosi sanoillaan käärmeen sen sisään. Vasta syksyllä hän muisti jättäneensä käärmeen sinne. Hän palasi sitä katsomaan. Ja katso, siellä oli käärme, mutta kovin nälkiintyneenä; se oli syönyt ruohonkin piiristänsä. Sitten hän tappoi sen. Metsäpaloissa Heikki juoksi piiriin ja sanoi sanansa, ja katso, kulo lakkasi.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-432-E01","start":288,"end":370,"span":"Hän palasi sitä katsomaan. Ja katso, siellä oli käärme, mutta kovin nälkiintyneenä","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Autumn; observed snake appearance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N137","id":"N137","collection":"FI","title":"Taikuri.","text":"Taikuri.\n\nVesilahden Halkivahassa oli vanha leskivaimo Ulla Kuusisto. Hän käski kerran poikansa haravoimaan talon heinäladon edestä heiniä lehmille, mutta poika meni latoon ja varasti heiniä. Silloin omistaja meni vahtimaan latoon. Poika tuli taasen varastamaan. Isäntä nousi ylös, poika pakeni, koppa jäi. Sitten Ulla Kuusisto lähti sovittamaan. Mutta isäntä haukkui. Siitä suuttui Ulla Kuusisto ja päästi sudet irti ja ne surmasivat koko karjan. Kerran Ulla Kuusisto pyysi naapurista piimän siementä. Kun sitä ei annettu, noitui hän talon maitoon matoja.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2637. 1947. v mv. Frans Heikkilä, 62v. Vesilahti, Krääkkiö.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N138","id":"N138","collection":"FI","title":"Ruoveden noita Santala.","text":"Ruoveden noita Santala.\n\nMinun muorini hampaita ja päätä poltti kovasti. Hulpan isäntä lähti avun etsintään Santalan luo Ruovedelle ja sieltä se apu tulikin. Syttö (Sorrin piika eli joku sellainen) kirosi petturirakastajansa, joka sai kuulemattoman jäsenkolotuksen. Mutta Taavetti Lundberg, Seppä-Kalle isä, meni Ruovedelle Santalan puheille, ja mies parani. Opetuslapset luulivat hengen näkevänsä, mutta Jeesus sanoi: ”Katsokaa minun käsiäni ja jalkojani, että minä itse olen, ruvetkaa minuun ja katsokaa, sillä ei hengellä ole lihaa eikä luita, niinkuin näette minulla olevan.” Samuel profeetan herätti noita-akka kuolleista. Se on merkillinen tapaus. Näin mainitaan henkiä ja näköjä jo entiseen aikaan ol/\n\n(jatk.1.) leen. Mutta antaa niiden mennä menojaan, ei niihin tarvitse uskoa, niitä on kuitenkin ollut olemassa.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2035. 1947. (jatk.1.) | Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2635. 1947. v ent.tal.Johan Taavetti Priiari, 81 v. Vesilahti, Hinsala.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-434-E01","start":25,"end":72,"span":"Minun muorini hampaita ja päätä poltti kovasti.","modalities":["pain","temperature","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-434-E02","start":231,"end":265,"span":"sai kuulemattoman jäsenkolotuksen.","modalities":["pain","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Different patient; kuulemattoman idiomatic extraordinary, not hearing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-434-E03","start":359,"end":397,"span":"Opetuslapset luulivat hengen näkevänsä","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"misidentified appearance","evidence":"luulivat hengen näkevänsä","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Embedded biblical exemplum, group, separate evidence layer.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N139","id":"N139","collection":"FI","title":"Viitus-Karoliina Tarimaalla oli noita.","text":"Viitus-Karoliina Tarimaalla oli noita.\n\nPirtti oli Eino Tannin maalla, ja se tuli pois. Ja Viitus-Karoliina joutui kunnalliskotiin sekä odotti, että hänelle maksettaisiin korvausmaksoja, kun piti muuttaa. Se V-K. kumarteli ja taikoi sekä lausui: Mitä on tapahtunut? ”Uskokaa se, että teiltä menee hevosia sikoja ja teille tapahtuu jotakin muuta.” Hevonen kuoli. Äskettäin kuoli toinen. Ja sitten navetonrakennusta tehtiin, tulilangan pää lensi vanh. nav. katolle,ja tulipalo syttyi. On tullut monta vahinkoa. Vielä konstaapeli Laine tutki ViikusKaroliina kiljusta. - Kyllä väärään menee leukas pahemmin kuin kiljusta. Ja konstaapeli kuoli pian sen jälkeen.","source":"Vesilahti, Frans Kärki 4177. 1949. v kaupp. Jalmari Mäkinen, 64 v., Vesilahti, Tarimaa.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N140","id":"N140","collection":"FI","title":"Noitamiehiä.","text":"Noitamiehiä.\n\nKun kerran olin matkalla Tampereella, kohtasin pari matkamiestä tervan myyjiä, jotka sanoivat menevänsä Palhoon. ”Tulkaa meillekin, jotta saisin muutaman tynnörin...” No miehet tulivat muutamana lauantai-iltana. Ostin tervaa, käytiin vihtomassa, juteltiin sieltä palattua. ”Etkös nyt tahro tietää jotakin asioita?” kysyi toinen matkalainen. ”Oletko sinä tietäjä? Koeta vain.” Karoliina Mettos-Oskarin äiti ja toinen piika hääräilivät siivoamisissa. Hän käski heidän tuoda lammasraudat ja seulan. Tekivät sen. Hän löi lammasraudat seulan sivuun ja käski piikojen pidellä niitä käsissään. Sitten hän asetti vanhan virsikirjan seulaan ja aikoi hieroa tai hivellä sääriään ja reisiään. ”No, sano, vieläkö minun vanhempani elävät?” Hän koetti ja seula pyörähti itsellään. ”Ne elä/\n\n(jatk.1.) vät vielä.” ”Se on valetta.” Hän koetti uutaan ja sama uudistui. Toiset alkoivat kysellä sitten ikäänsä. Hän lateli vuosia peräkkäin ja jos seula liikahti jotain lukua mainitessa, oli se haluttu luku. Näin tapahtui. Kyläläiset kävivät aamulla ja seuraavana maanantaina ”tietoja yetelemässä”. Toinen mies nosti pöydän laattialle. Kun hän kysyi jotakin alkoi pöytä hemppua ja heilua ilman että kukaan sitä heilutti. Hänellä ei ollut virsikirjaa eikä muuta kuin tuo pöytä Edellinen selaili joskus virsikirjaansa ja Karoliina, minun palvelijani oli huomaavinaan, että parhain ja enin käytetty virsi oli virsi 157.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2631. 1947. (jatk.1.) | Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2631. 1947. v Ent.tal.Johan Taavetti Priiari, 81v Vesilahti, Hinsala.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-436-E01","start":1313,"end":1410,"span":"Karoliina, minun palvelijani oli huomaavinaan, että parhain ja enin käytetty virsi oli virsi 157.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"qualified noticing","evidence":"oli huomaavinaan","kind":"context licensed perception or channel","note":"Visual channel contextual, medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"lauantai-iltana","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N141","id":"N141","collection":"FI","title":"paimenet lukitsevat metsän","text":"Ennen kun oli paimenia niin ne osaasivat lukita metsän joka kesti mikkoon asti mutta ei eremäksi aikaa kerran kun isännät tahto että paimen olisi vienyt mikon päivänä karjan metsään mutta paimen vastasi että susi viä tänään karjan eikä vienyt karjaa vaan sitte meni paljon naisia karjan kanssa mutta susi otti heti tanhualla saaliinsa vaikkei uskottu mitä paimen sanoi.","source":"Kalle Lastunen","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N142","id":"N142","collection":"FI","title":"Loitsu.","text":"Loitsu.\n\nKertoja kertoo Wesilahdella kuulleensa. Hieroja Ämmän lapsuudessaan parantaneen Wilutaudista Ihmisiä seuraavalla Loitsulla\n\nLoitsu\n\nPoi s sinä vanha vilutauti viiksinokka vihtaparka Roimahouru Homesilmä Leukaperäitten Louksuttaja kuljit sä kylmänä kesänä maalta matkustit\n\nNäin paransi Hieroja Ämmä muuta nimeä ei kertoja tiedä hänellä olleen.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Quoted charm symptoms not independently enacted; hearing transmission excluded.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N143","id":"N143","collection":"FI","title":"Perkele ahdistaa uskovia.","text":"Perkele ahdistaa uskovia.\n\nMinun muorini Miina Lundan, kotoisin Vesilahden Mantereen kylästä Näppilän sillan luota, kertoi, että hän jo nuorena oli tullut uskoon ja oli joutunut palvelukseen Tyrvään Mustaanojaan. Silloin sanoi Röppä Mustanojan tyttärelle: ”Älä vierastele sitä ihmistä, se on uskovainen Jumalan lapsi.” Kun Miina Lundan meni Mustaanojaan, niin hänellä oli hyvä, vahva, kaunis villasaarli hartioilla. Hän laski sen pirtin penkille ja meni kamariin. Kun hän tuli kamarista, niin koko villasaarli oli revitty rikki ja siitä tulevat säikeet oli kiedottu oven venikkeeseen. Silloin Mustanojan tytär sanoi, että Röppä lausui minulle, että sinä olet uskovainen ja Jumalan lapsi ja että\n\n(jatk.1.) hän tappaa sinut, mutta saapahan se ei voi sinua, mutta hyvän villasaarliisi hän söi repeli rikki. Tämän kertoi minun hurskas ni Siina Kaunisto o.s.Lundan, joka kuuli ja oli silloin 81 vuoden vanha. Vielä hän kertoi, että Röppä oli sanonut, että kun vasti (Vegelius) tai mikä se olikaan oli saarnaamassa, niittahin istui rovastin olpäillä, mutta kun pastori saarnasi, niin hän piti väistyä pastorin taakse.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N145","id":"N145","collection":"FI","title":"Käärmeet tuleen.","text":"Käärmeet tuleen.\n\nOli iso harmaa kärme. Kun sitä ei ehditty tappaa, niin se pantiin liekaan. Tehtiin tuli Vuolessaareen. Silloin pohjalaismies kysyi: - Onko isoa harmaata käärmettä näkyny. Minä lupaan sen tappaa, ellei sitä ole kukaan nähnyt. Kun rovio tuli suureksi, niin iso käärme saapui sen luo ja ahdisti sitä miestä. Mutta mies lauloi sen tuleen ja iso käärme ja kaikki käärmeet menit sitte siihen.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-440-E01","start":329,"end":351,"span":"mies lauloi sen tuleen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"Vuolessaareen","environment":"island","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N147","id":"N147","collection":"FI","title":"Taikoja.","text":"Taikoja.\n\nKun Ihmiseen tuli syyliä tämän Parannustajan Äitivainaalle kertoja oli opettanut kulkukauppias Laukku-Ryssäksi Timosefkoksi sitä oli kutsuttu sanottu Äitivainaa taasen tyttärelleen kertonut kertojalle näin Pidettiin oikealla kädellä kiinni sairasta oltiin selin häneen parannettavaan päin luettiin Loitsua Kuu syö syylät pois mutta älä koske syylänkantajaa haljastiin oljen korsi solmun kohdalta halki ei saanut katsoa kuuhun päin siis kolmeen kertaan yllämainittua hokemaa hoettiin loitsua samalla oljenkorrella samoin 3 – meenkertaan syyliä sivaltiin.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-441-E01","start":216,"end":258,"span":"Pidettiin oikealla kädellä kiinni sairasta","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Generic prescribed treatment contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-441-E02","start":509,"end":563,"span":"oljenkorrella samoin 3 – meenkertaan syyliä sivaltiin.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit physical action; felt quality not established","note":"Generic contact; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N148","id":"N148","collection":"FI","title":"Taikoja.","text":"Taikoja.\n\nIso – Vanhemmiltaan muistaa lapsena kuulleensa näin Jos oli Perintökastemekko itsellä lapsia jolla kasteelle vietiin sitä ei saanut saman suvun ulkopuolelle viedä eikä missään nimessä lainata muillen jos lainasi tuli Itkeviä lapsia tähän vakaasti Uskottiin Punkalaitumella Tottijärvellä ja nimenomaan Wesilahdella perimätietona mennyt tämä taika jo 1700. v. aivan alusta ainakin. Kertojan vanhemmat Marjaana ja Aukusti Marjaanan Äiti oli Karoliina asuneet koko Ikänsä Vesilahdessa ja Isoäiti Karoliina kertojan piti Lapsen kastemekkoa salaisesti piilossa ettei Naapurit millään tietäisi tulla Lainamaan kun se perimätiedon Taijan mukaan tietäisi poraavia lapsia niitä ei ole Salmisen suvussa viimesessäkään Marjaanan ja Augustin perheessä 7. – lapsesta ei kukaan poraavia ole ollut näin on säilynyt tämänkin toinen Uskomus Viimeiset josta vähemmän on tiedetty onko mitään tiedetty?","source":"Vesilahti, Vilho Seppälä b) 815. 1969-71. - Alma Salminen, s. 1911. v. Vesilahti. Nyt asuu Tampere. Mp. 7.2.71.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-442-E01","start":749,"end":791,"span":"7. – lapsesta ei kukaan poraavia ole ollut","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Generic asserted absence of crying; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N149","id":"N149","collection":"FI","title":"Rudangon Eeframi","text":"Rudangon Eeframi\n\nVesilahden Vakkalassa oli ennen Rudangon Eeframi, tietomies. Kun riihikuivan sitomeen tuikattiin tuli, niin se ei päässyt leviämään lyhteen toiseen päähän, kun Eeframi sormellaan piirsi siihen viivan. Ja metsäpaloissa hän juoksi ja lausui taikasanansa, niin kulo sammui. Ja kun tulipalossa asuinrakennuksen toinen pää oli tulessa, niin hän heitti köyden toiseen päähän.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N150","id":"N150","collection":"FI","title":"Kaskuja viimeisestä suuresta tietäjästä Santalasta, Ruoveteltä kerran mies meni kysymään kuka oli hevosensa varastanu oli tietäjä juopunut ja sanoi tule huomenna ettei hän nyt ota vastaan, mies pyysi jos hän saa olla yötä talossa vaan tämä kielsi, mies lähti mutta jäikin lähellä olevaan heinälatoon yöksi sitte tietäjä tuli ja kiersi 3 kertaa ympäri ladon ja vihelteli pitkään sitte tuli piru ja esitteli tietäjälle varkaan muodon ja kaikki ja sano että se kyllä itsekin sen kuulee josta tietäjä suuttui ja käski pirun vääntää niskan nurin vaan se vastaas ettei hän voi kun se on 3 lukon takana.","text":"Kaskuja viimeisestä suuresta tietäjästä Santalasta, Ruoveteltä kerran mies meni kysymään kuka oli hevosensa varastanu oli tietäjä juopunut ja sanoi tule huomenna ettei hän nyt ota vastaan, mies pyysi jos hän saa olla yötä talossa vaan tämä kielsi, mies lähti mutta jäikin lähellä olevaan heinälatoon yöksi sitte tietäjä tuli ja kiersi 3 kertaa ympäri ladon ja vihelteli pitkään sitte tuli piru ja esitteli tietäjälle varkaan muodon ja kaikki ja sano että se kyllä itsekin sen kuulee josta tietäjä suuttui ja käski pirun vääntää niskan nurin vaan se vastaas ettei hän voi kun se on 3 lukon takana.","source":"Kallo","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-444-E01","start":360,"end":377,"span":"vihelteli pitkään","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""},{"id":"FI-444-E02","start":455,"end":482,"span":"se kyllä itsekin sen kuulee","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Character asserts hidden man's hearing; medium.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"heinälatoon","environment":"barn","time":"yöksi","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N151","id":"N151","collection":"FI","title":"Santalan sauva.","text":"Santalan sauva.\n\nSantala oli Vesilahdelta ruisolkia hakemassa. Kun hän oli sisällä, niin kiertokoululapset ottivat hänen rasansa kuorman päältä. Mutta Santala suuttui, otti kepin heidän käsistään ja keppi muuttui käärmeeksi, joka kävi poikien päälle ja pojat toivat takaisin ja käärme muuttui kepiksi jälleen. Näin minä olen sen kuullut.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 1864. 1942. < Emäntä Marjaana Loviisa Antintr. Lehtiniemi, 83 v. Vesilahden Hinsalankylän Säijälästä.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"Transformation narrated without explicit perception predicate; excluded from strict event coding.","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N152","id":"N152","collection":"FI","title":"Taneli Santala. Keppi muuttui käärmeeksi.","text":"Taneli Santala. Keppi muuttui käärmeeksi.\n\nKerran Taneli Santala tuli ostamaan olkia Vesilahden Vakkalasta hyvällä jääkelillä. Hän laski rahansa kuorman päällä, mutta kun rahat putosivat, niin pikku pojat tyrkkivät niitä kepillä pois maasta sanoen, että ne ovat noidan rahoja, että niihin ei saa koskea. Mutta sitten tapahtui, että keppi muuttui käärmeeksi ja ahdisti kovin poikia, kunnes Santala sen esti.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N153","id":"N153","collection":"FI","title":"Santalan Taneli.","text":"Santalan Taneli.\n\nKun enoni mestari oli kovin reumatistinen, niin hän lähetti Taavetti Lundperin apua etsimään Ruoveden Santalasta. Silloin Taneli Santala täytti pikarin lumella ja kaatoi siihen viinaa ja kuunteli sitä ja lausui, että kyllä minä sen tiedän, mistä se on tullut. Santalalla oli lasiton koppi, siellä hän teki loihtujansa.","source":"Frans Kärki","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[{"id":"FI-447-E01","start":205,"end":218,"span":"kuunteli sitä","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"not explicitly marked","evidence":"","kind":"explicit perception or sensory description","note":"Listening to snow/alcohol in goblet; sound content unspecified.","confidence":"high","polarity":"","gloss":""}],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N155","id":"N155","collection":"FI","title":"Tietäjästä.","text":"Tietäjästä.\n\nWesilahdenpitäjän Pöyhölän kylässä Elivät Eeva ja Emma Kuusela Pienessä Pirtissään vanhaksi henkilöksi elivät kuolleet jo vuoskymmenet takaperin. 41. v. sitten Eeva jo kuollut Taikoja tekivät tiesivät tulevia tapahtumia Ennustivat kahvinpavuista selvittivät kadonneita Eläimiä ja Warastettuja esineitä. Muuten he olivat kovin salaperäisiä eivät niin vaan tietojaan antaneet kertojan Äidille Marjaana Salmiselle he kyllä apua antoivat luottivat häneen ettei muille puhu ja hän oli nuorempi niistä sillä he pelkäsivät taikansa häviävän menettävän mahtinsa ja Nuoremmalle kertoo ei sanojen mahti menetä tarmoaan.","source":"Vilho Seppälä","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N157","id":"N157","collection":"FI","title":"Tontut toivat kotiinsa tavaroita.","text":"Tontut toivat kotiinsa tavaroita.\n\nHieraniemen tonttu ja Liuksialan tonttu joutuivat toisiaan vastaan Lemposten sillalla. Hieraniemen tontulla oli halkopino selässään. Mutta Liuksialan tontulla oli kaustion (äärettömän suuri) säkillinen jauhoja. Kumpikin tonttu vei tavaraa kotiinsa.","source":"Vesilahti. Frans Kärki 2485. 1936. < Maanvilj. August Kärki, 50v. Hinsalankylästä. Kuullut isältään Matti Kärjeltä.","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Vesilahti","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"FI:N158","id":"N158","collection":"FI","title":"Vastanteko","text":"Vastanteko\n\nKun nuori tyttö teki ensimmäisiä vastojansa niin sen kädensijan sanottiin olevan samanlaisen kuin tulevan sulhasen kalu. Jos varsi vastassa oli paksu tai vastaavasti pieni niin tyttöä kiusoiteltiin sen mukaan Samoin jos varteen jäi lehtiä niin tytön sanottiin saavan ”karvakullin” miehen.","source":"Reino Mäenpää","category":"Vesilahti non-locatable","place":"Latomaa","events":[],"context":{"place":"","environment":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.29702,"lon":23.63881,"label":"Vesilahti","precision":"approximate locality","provenance":"Locality reference added for demonstration; not an event or collection site. https://mapcarta.com/13609390"}]},{"key":"SE:1061","id":"1061","collection":"SE","title":"Lyktgubbar","text":"En kväll såg jag det kom upp en ljusstråle såpass bred som min hand. Den kom direkt ur jorden och for rätt upp i luften. Jag såg den så tydligt. Det var vid Avundsåsen. Sådant var ”feljus”.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04077 · 39","place":"Södra Finnskoga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1061-E01","start":9,"end":144,"span":"såg jag det kom upp en ljusstråle såpass bred som min hand. Den kom direkt ur jorden och for rätt upp i luften. Jag såg den så tydligt.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Repeated emphatic seeing within one continuous episode is not a new event.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I saw a ray of light rise from the earth into the air, as wide as my hand; I saw it very clearly."}],"context":{"place":"vid Avundsåsen","time":"En kväll","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.701351,"lon":12.576717,"label":"Södra Finnskoga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50338","id":"50338","collection":"SE","title":"Lyktgubbar","text":"Jag var vallpojke på Spondalen hos gamle Per. Han var ute en kväll och fick se löktegubben. \"Kom hit, Maja!\" sa han till gumman sin, \"så ska du få se på löktegubben!\" Med detsamma snudde löktegubben sej om med ett förfärligt brak. Per blev sjuk efter det och blev sen aldrig frisk så länge han levde.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh4104 · 11 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1951: Dalslandssägner. Göteborg. S.122","place":"Torps sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50338-E01","start":71,"end":90,"span":"fick se löktegubben","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He caught sight of the light figure."},{"id":"SE-50338-E03","start":206,"end":229,"span":"med ett förfärligt brak","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"With a dreadful crash."},{"id":"SE-50338-E04","start":231,"end":300,"span":"Per blev sjuk efter det och blev sen aldrig frisk så länge han levde.","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Bodily condition, not an inferred specific sensation.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Per became ill afterwards and never recovered."}],"context":{"place":"på Spondalen","time":"en kväll","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.516109,"lon":11.950556,"label":"Torps sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55524","id":"55524","collection":"SE","title":"Myling","text":"Dä va e här i Gökhult, som mörda sitt barn å grävde ner dä i en stenmur. Men sen hörde de att dä grät å skrek i stenmuren där. Dä va ett barn, som föddes här på ett ställe, det hade inte liv, å de grävde ner det utanför fönstret. Men dä grät, så de feck inte fre, utan de feck ta opp-et, å gräva ner-et i körrgårn.","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 3922 · Daniel Harbe 1950: Folkminnen från Edsbergs härad. Örebro. s.174-175","place":"Nysunds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55524-E01","start":81,"end":125,"span":"hörde de att dä grät å skrek i stenmuren där","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They heard crying and screaming in the stone wall."},{"id":"SE-55524-E02","start":234,"end":262,"span":"dä grät, så de feck inte fre","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It cried, so they had no peace."}],"context":{"place":"i en stenmur","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.11837,"lon":14.369153,"label":"Nysunds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56329","id":"56329","collection":"SE","title":"Gastar och gengångare","text":"Hemma våran märr ho va så svetter om mörna när vi kom ut i stallet, så svetten rann ur bringa på'na, alldeles som ho hadde gått i kongsskjuss. De sa di va mara, som hadde ridet'na. Men grannens han hadde bunnet två lia över si märr, så ho vart inte riden. ","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.11","place":"Stora Åby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56329-E01","start":23,"end":99,"span":"så svetter om mörna när vi kom ut i stallet, så svetten rann ur bringa på'na","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"So sweaty in the mornings that sweat ran from her chest."},{"id":"SE-56329-E02","start":155,"end":179,"span":"mara, som hadde ridet'na","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Reported bodily loading/riding, not explicit felt pressure; attribution retained without endorsement.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A mara had ridden her."}],"context":{"place":"i stallet","time":"om mörna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.239365,"lon":14.713697,"label":"Stora Åby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56538","id":"56538","collection":"SE","title":"Gasten","text":"En gubbe kom farande från Göteborg en natt och när han kom till Slätthult så kom det en fölunge och sprang över vägen. Där hade en kört ihjäl sig en gång och det var hans häst.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Rylander, Gerd 2002: Folkminnen från Mark IV: Sägner och folktro i 1800-talets Surteby-Kattunga. Rydal. s. 106","place":"Surteby sn, Upphärads sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"över vägen","time":"en natt","movement":"kom farande från Göteborg"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.443333,"lon":12.516253,"label":"Surteby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":58.163891,"lon":12.291944,"label":"Upphärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:4241","id":"4241","collection":"SE","title":"Gastar","text":"Det var en gång en bonde som var ute och körde en natt igenom en skog i Rolfstorp i Halland som heter Kleva. Bäst kör så, vägrar hästen att gå, mannen måste då gå fram för att se vad dät är, då ligger där på vägen en nykalvad kalv och slår med öronen som di brukar inan di bli torra. Han drar undan kalven och kör vidare, om en stund stannar hästen igän och nu ligger deb andra kalven på vägen och detta upprepas ännu ett par gånger, då utbrister mannen \"Nu har nog skam skitit kalvar i natt,\" Då skrattar det Kleva.","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh02275 · null","place":"Lindbergs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-4241-E01","start":160,"end":189,"span":"gå fram för att se vad dät är","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"för att se vad dät är","start_offset":168,"end_offset":189,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Inspection intention with unresolved referent; not completed seeing in this clause.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Go forward to see what it is."},{"id":"SE-4241-E02","start":284,"end":305,"span":"Han drar undan kalven","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He pulls the calf aside."},{"id":"SE-4241-E03","start":494,"end":516,"span":"Då skrattar det Kleva.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then there is laughter in Kleva."}],"context":{"place":"igenom en skog i Rolfstorp i Halland som heter Kleva","time":"en natt","movement":"kör vidare"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.16,"lon":12.311667,"label":"Lindbergs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53424","id":"53424","collection":"SE","title":"Begraven i mark och mosse","text":"I Varjelja, som går mellan Glose Nordgård och Trönnom, ligger ett stenrös. Där möttes en gång en skräddare och en skomakare, den ene kom från Glose och den andre från Trönnom. De flög ihop och slogs och slog ihjäl varandra. Folket därikring lade upp ett stenröse över dem.\n\nIgenom Varjelja har ingen velat gå nattetid. Folk, som gått där nattetid, har alltid blivit kramade eller oroade av spöken.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.173","place":"Torsby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53424-E01","start":176,"end":223,"span":"De flög ihop och slogs och slog ihjäl varandra.","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit blows/contact; pain not inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They set upon each other and fought, killing one another."},{"id":"SE-53424-E02","start":359,"end":396,"span":"blivit kramade eller oroade av spöken","modalities":["pressure","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Squeezing is explicit. The less specific alternative oroade is not independently coded.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Been squeezed or troubled by ghosts."}],"context":{"place":"Igenom Varjelja","time":"nattetid","movement":"gått där"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.84166,"lon":11.77679,"label":"Torsby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54987","id":"54987","collection":"SE","title":"Spökeri","text":"Det var en rik änka, som hade undantag i Hjältagården. Hon spökade, när hon var död. Tilda var där och hjälpte till, när de gjorde i ordning till begravningen. Hon fick inte vara i fred på natten; den döda var uppe och rev på henne. Då tänkte Tilda, att det var något hennes, som inte hade kommit med. Hon hittade en gammal lomme, en sådan de band på sej och hade under kjorteln förr. Den och hennes snusdose la' hon i kistan, och. pengar var där förut. Och sedan detta var undankommet, så hördes det aldrig något.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.103-104","place":"Rångedala sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54987-E01","start":197,"end":231,"span":"den döda var uppe och rev på henne","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The dead woman was up scratching at her."},{"id":"SE-54987-E02","start":487,"end":513,"span":"så hördes det aldrig något","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Cessation after intervention; not failed corroboration of an earlier observation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Nothing was ever heard after that."}],"context":{"place":"i Hjältagården","time":"på natten","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.792984,"lon":13.134295,"label":"Rångedala sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55666","id":"55666","collection":"SE","title":"Spöken och syner, gastar och gengångare","text":"Mycke konstit va de la förr i tin, för mi moster ho såg en syster, som va dö, en gång. Ho vakna mitt i natta ve att ho tyckte de va någen, som hadde kommi in i rummet. Å när ho titta opp, så sto systra ve hennes säng. Ho såg ut precist som när ho levde, så moster blev inte rädd. Å moster ho talte te'na. »Ä de du, Sofie», sa ho åt'na. Men i desamma så va ho borta. Å ett par daga ätteråt så vart moster så sjuker, så ho hölt på å dö. De där va la någe förbu, kan ja tro.","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.48","place":"Godegårds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55666-E01","start":119,"end":166,"span":"tyckte de va någen, som hadde kommi in i rummet","modalities":["felt presence"],"groups":["other"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"tyckte de va någen","start_offset":119,"end_offset":137,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Unspecified presence impression, not an inferred sound.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She had the impression that someone had entered the room."},{"id":"SE-55666-E02","start":170,"end":252,"span":"när ho titta opp, så sto systra ve hennes säng. Ho såg ut precist som när ho levde","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When she looked up her sister stood by the bed, looking just as in life."},{"id":"SE-55666-E03","start":336,"end":365,"span":"Men i desamma så va ho borta.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Disappearance in an established visual episode. No failed re-inspection explicitly stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"But at that moment she was gone."},{"id":"SE-55666-E04","start":392,"end":433,"span":"vart moster så sjuker, så ho hölt på å dö","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The aunt became so ill that she nearly died."}],"context":{"place":"in i rummet","time":"mitt i natta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","other","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.748112,"lon":15.168324,"label":"Godegårds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:988","id":"988","collection":"SE","title":"Mylingar","text":"Det blev ”gast” av ett foster som dödades å gömdes. Vid Nygård var ”gasten”. Där var det ett fruntimmer som var döv. Hon hade fött barn. Den sista pojken skull väl få leva, sade hon. Men de andra hade hon tagit livet av. Det var efter en bäck. Där skrek det en litennen. Men det har varit tyst på senare tiden.\n\nDet var på ett ställe som pigan hade fött ett barn å lagt i en bytta. Så var det någon som satt inne å hörde att det talade under golvet.\n”Bena ä för lång\nbytta ä för trång”.\nDå bröt de upp golvet å fick tag i en bytta med ett barnlik i. Så fraktade de det till kyrkogården. Men efter den dagen vart det tyst.","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03821 · 34","place":"Dalby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-988-E01","start":89,"end":115,"span":"ett fruntimmer som var döv","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"A woman who was deaf."},{"id":"SE-988-E02","start":244,"end":270,"span":"Där skrek det en litennen.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A little one screamed there."},{"id":"SE-988-E03","start":275,"end":309,"span":"det har varit tyst på senare tiden","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"It has been quiet lately."},{"id":"SE-988-E04","start":415,"end":448,"span":"hörde att det talade under golvet","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Location beneath floor is explicit; invisibility is not independently asserted, so no access-uncertainty code.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Heard speech beneath the floor."},{"id":"SE-988-E05","start":591,"end":620,"span":"efter den dagen vart det tyst","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"After that day it became quiet."}],"context":{"place":"efter en bäck","time":"på senare tiden","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.649166,"lon":12.994722,"label":"Dalby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1465","id":"1465","collection":"SE","title":"Spökeri","text":"En kunde inte var säker när någon hade dött än han kunde komma igen. Han kunde komma upp ur graven, för det var inte säkert förrän kroppen hade ruttnat. När det inte var något kvar av kroppen, så kunde inte den döde komma å visa sig.\n\nDen döde var så van vid hemmet, så en kunde vänta att han skulle komma tillbaka. Om en inte gjorde efter den gamla ordningen i hemmet utan en hitta på något nytt, så kunde den döde komma och ramla ock skrämma en. Borta i Röjden ville inte käringen ligg från stugan, sedan hon var död. Dä spök där så knappt int människa trodde sig dit till slut. Hon hade inte fått döingben med sig, som hon hade tagit medan hon levde. Jag ville inte ta något från kyrkogården för aldrig det, för di döda vill ha det tillbaka, å då kan en få ont av dem. Där i Röjden for grytor och allt fram och tillbaka av sig själva. Det var spöke i allt ihop som en skulle ta i.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04077 · 4344","place":"Södra Finnskoga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1465-E02","start":747,"end":770,"span":"då kan en få ont av dem","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"ont can also mean harm; broad pain candidate retained with ambiguity.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then one may suffer pain from them."}],"context":{"place":"vid hemmet","time":"","movement":"fram och tillbaka"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.701351,"lon":12.576717,"label":"Södra Finnskoga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:51182","id":"51182","collection":"SE","title":"Gastar och myringar","text":"I Hoffors lid satt en käring, som hade blivit ihjälkörd. Det var Lejons första käring, och hon var hemma i Hårred. Hon datt av en vagn vid Forslunds i Hoffors och slog ihjäl sig. Hon har dödat två personer. Först kom en dräng från Stättared, för stättingen (bonden på Stättared) höstade ett hemman i Måå i Fjärås, och drängen kom från Mäå och skulle hem till Stättared. När han korn i Hoffors lid, fick han en blodstörtning och blev liggande, men till slut fick de in honom till spelemans i Hoffors; han dog andra dagen därefter. Och något år senare kom Bengt Johans bror, en ung person, i samma lid och blev ikullslagen och dödad av henne. Han hade arbetat så illa och rivit upp jorden, och när de fann honom, var han död. Det var med natten sådant skedde.","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh3796 · 3536 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 116-117","place":"Idala sn","events":[{"id":"SE-51182-E01","start":115,"end":178,"span":"Hon datt av en vagn vid Forslunds i Hoffors och slog ihjäl sig.","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She fell from a cart and struck herself fatally."},{"id":"SE-51182-E02","start":398,"end":441,"span":"fick han en blodstörtning och blev liggande","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He suffered a haemorrhage and remained lying down."},{"id":"SE-51182-E03","start":604,"end":639,"span":"blev ikullslagen och dödad av henne","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Was knocked down and killed by her."}],"context":{"place":"I Hoffors lid","time":"med natten","movement":"skulle hem till Stättared"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.378613,"lon":12.323611,"label":"Idala sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53419","id":"53419","collection":"SE","title":"Visan om gasten","text":"1. Är det min fader, som bankar på, \nEller är det min broder Johan? \nNej, detta är Wilihem, vännen din, \nSom kommer från främmande land.\nTjolaliålej.\n\n2. Maria öppnar då sin dörr \nOch bad honom stiga in. \nMaria reder då till plats \nOch bad honom sitta ned.\nTjolaliålej.\n\n3. Nej, icke är jag trött af vandringen, \nEj heller af arbete.\nMen ge mej igen de vänskapsband,\n Som jag en gång lofvat dig. \nTjolaliålej.\n\n4. Nej, att ge dig igen de vänskapsband \nDet gör jag alleri (= aldrig),\nFörr än du kommer i min famn \nOch innerligt kysser mig.\nTjolaliålej.\n\n5. O, hur skulle jag kunna kyssa dig, \nSom ingen lefnad har, \nFör kysser jag din mun så röd, \nFörkortar jag Márias lif.\nTjolaliålej.\n\n6. Natten gick och klockan slog, \nOch dagen den skred fram. \nDå svann en gäst i mörkeret hän, \nFörkortade Márias lif.\nTjolaliålej.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Lindberg, Karl H. 1906: Sägner och visor från norra Bohuslän. Bidrag till kännedom om Göteborgs och Bohusläns forminnen och historia 8. S. 288-289.","place":"Tjärnö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53419-E01","start":3,"end":67,"span":"Är det min fader, som bankar på, \nEller är det min broder Johan?","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"Är det min fader, som bankar på, \nEller är det min broder Johan?","start_offset":3,"end_offset":67,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"sound production","note":"Question concerns the identity of an audible caller; poem retained as sampled.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Is it my father knocking, or my brother Johan?"},{"id":"SE-53419-E02","start":279,"end":332,"span":"icke är jag trött af vandringen, \nEj heller af arbete","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I am not tired from walking or work."},{"id":"SE-53419-E03","start":494,"end":537,"span":"kommer i min famn \nOch innerligt kysser mig","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Come into my arms and kiss me tenderly."},{"id":"SE-53419-E04","start":630,"end":644,"span":"din mun så röd","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Your mouth so red."},{"id":"SE-53419-E05","start":706,"end":718,"span":"klockan slog","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The clock struck."}],"context":{"place":"sin dörr","time":"Natten gick och klockan slog, \nOch dagen den skred fram.","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.876522,"lon":11.152958,"label":"Tjärnö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55228","id":"55228","collection":"SE","title":"Spöksägen","text":"Det hände i Tors, ja det hände egentligen i Horred. Där var en som hette Anna Britta i Ljungvik i Öxnevalla socken och LambogårdsHenrik i Hyltenäs fria till henne. Men hon gjorde avslag med honom och där var en i Tors som fria till henne istället. De reste till Varberg och förlova sej. När de kom tillbaks till Horred var där några karlar vid gästgivaregården och de bad den nyförlovade friaren i Tors gå med in. De ville bju honom. Anna Britta skulle sitta och hålla hästen. Men han kom aldrig tillbaka ut. Hon måste fara hem och han var försvunnen.\n \nSå var det en i Tors som hette Klockarns-Karl. En natt knacka det på dörren där. Karl gick ut. Då hängden (den försvunne) så framöver planket. Karl tog då mod till sej och fråg'ten: Var är du nu eller vad vill du här? - Jo, nu har jag legat i tre nätter under brovalvet, sa han. Om nu ingen får tag i mej så sjunker jag i ån i natt. Och på de orden gick de dit och de hitta honom, han låg där död. De hade stypt honom med en silkeduk. De trodde väl någon i Hyltenäs var med om den gärningen.\n \nDet kunde ske en uppenbarelse på sådana grunder som man riktigt skulle vilja tro på.\n \nDet skulle ha hänt en gång mellan Sund och Ödegärdet att det skulle ha blivit en ihjälslagen. Det heter Varpet där uppe - där är kastat en gruvelig stenhög. Det var en knekt som skulle ha gjort det. Han låg och somna på denne kyrkegårn en söndag. Jaha, nu kan ja siat, nu ä dä så många år sen vi nappas i den där dalgången, sa han, han låg och talte i sömnen. Och där var folk ijämten som hörde det.\n \nVar som hade hänt en sådan händelse, kastade de som gick förbi en sten i den högen, så det blev ett större stenröse. Ja, det var endast till ett tecken, när de gick förbi, att de mindes den händelsen.\n","category":"Döden och de döda","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Gunnar Ahlberger 1997: Folkminnen från Mark: Om sägner och folktro i 1800-talets Torestorp. Göteborg. S. 36.","place":"Torestorps sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55228-E01","start":609,"end":633,"span":"knacka det på dörren där","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There was a knock on the door."},{"id":"SE-55228-E03","start":952,"end":988,"span":"De hade stypt honom med en silkeduk.","modalities":["pressure","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They had strangled him with a silk cloth."},{"id":"SE-55228-E04","start":1467,"end":1493,"span":"han låg och talte i sömnen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Marked sleep speech, not ordinary dialogue.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He lay talking in his sleep."},{"id":"SE-55228-E05","start":1507,"end":1533,"span":"folk ijämten som hörde det","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"People nearby heard it."}],"context":{"place":"vid gästgivaregården","time":"En natt","movement":"gick de dit"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.382122,"lon":12.682201,"label":"Torestorps sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:431","id":"431","collection":"SE","title":"Odens jakt","text":"Odens jakt fick aldrig vila annat än då han kom till kringbyggda gårdar. Där fick han sätta sig på taket på själva svingelen i vinkeln mellan längorna","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04444 · 8","place":"Mörarps sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"kringbyggda gårdar","time":"","movement":"kom till kringbyggda gårdar"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.061756,"lon":12.882677,"label":"Mörarps sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54946","id":"54946","collection":"SE","title":"Hungerharven","text":"Det var något de kallade hungerharva. Det lät uppifrån luften som när de harvar på en stenig åker. När den gick, skulle det bli missväxt året efter. Jag såg den en gång på 1860-talet. Det var tätt med svarta fåglar, och de var tre gånger så högt uppi luften som kyrketornet","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.13","place":"Mjöbäcks sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54946-E01","start":38,"end":98,"span":"Det lät uppifrån luften som när de harvar på en stenig åker.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It sounded from above like harrowing a stony field."},{"id":"SE-54946-E02","start":149,"end":273,"span":"Jag såg den en gång på 1860-talet. Det var tätt med svarta fåglar, och de var tre gånger så högt uppi luften som kyrketornet","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I saw it once: densely packed black birds, three church-tower heights up."}],"context":{"place":"uppifrån luften","time":"på 1860-talet","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.308998,"lon":12.886392,"label":"Mjöbäcks sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56252","id":"56252","collection":"SE","title":"Hinnsjakten","text":"Den där Hinnsjakta den har ja aldri sitt, men ja har ju hört den många gånger. Då brukar en få höra hunnskall, när en ä ute i skogen på natta. De ä två hunna, som skäller, å den ene han har groft skall, å den andre har fint skall. Men sitt dom de har ja ju aldri gjort inte. ","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.71","place":"Tjällmo sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56252-E01","start":19,"end":40,"span":"den har ja aldri sitt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"den har ja aldri sitt, men ja har ju hört den många gånger","start_offset":19,"end_offset":77,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Linked to positive hearing; split to preserve polarity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I have never seen it."},{"id":"SE-56252-E02","start":46,"end":77,"span":"ja har ju hört den många gånger","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"den har ja aldri sitt, men ja har ju hört den många gånger","start_offset":19,"end_offset":77,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I have heard it many times."},{"id":"SE-56252-E03","start":143,"end":230,"span":"De ä två hunna, som skäller, å den ene han har groft skall, å den andre har fint skall.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Qualities of reported sound; not visual verification of two dogs.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Two dogs bark, one with a deep bark and the other a high one."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"på natta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"That Hinnsjakta [the Hinn hunt/spectral pack], I have never seen it, but I have heard it many times. You usually get to hear hound barking when you are out in the woods at night. There are two hounds that bark, and one of them has a deep bark, and the other has a high bark. But actually seeing them, that I have never done.","translationNotes":["Hinnsjakta is retained as the narrative's name for the hunt. Deep versus high barking and repeated hearing without seeing are preserved; the translation does not identify an unseen agent beyond the source."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.721642,"lon":15.359876,"label":"Tjällmo sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"SE-56252-E01","start":47,"end":67,"span":"I have never seen it","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"den har ja aldri sitt, men ja har ju hört den många gånger","start_offset":19,"end_offset":77,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Linked to positive hearing; split to preserve polarity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I have never seen it.","originalSpan":"den har ja aldri sitt","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-56252-E02","start":73,"end":99,"span":"I have heard it many times","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"den har ja aldri sitt, men ja har ju hört den många gånger","start_offset":19,"end_offset":77,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I have heard it many times.","originalSpan":"ja har ju hört den många gånger","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-56252-E03","start":179,"end":274,"span":"There are two hounds that bark, and one of them has a deep bark, and the other has a high bark.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Qualities of reported sound; not visual verification of two dogs.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Two dogs bark, one with a deep bark and the other a high one.","originalSpan":"De ä två hunna, som skäller, å den ene han har groft skall, å den andre har fint skall.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"SE:257","id":"257","collection":"SE","title":"Odens jakt","text":"Borta i Sibbarp stod en mjölnare och mol mettnattes. Rätt som det var hörde han ett skott, och då öppnade han dörren och sprang ut och skulle se, vad som stod på. Då höll en ryttare utanför, och han hade ett skogsrå hängande över hästryggen. Så kom det två stora hundar springande in i kvarnen, och de ställde sig till och tittade på hur mjölet rann ner. Då tog mjölnaren en skopa mjöl och slängde till dem, och det slök de genast. \"Tack ska du ha, för att du mätt mina hundar\", sa ryttaren, \"gå ned på bron imorn så ska du få betalning.\" När mjölnaren kom ut på morgonen, hittade han en hästsko av klart guld.","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03595 · 4","place":"Grimetons sn","events":[{"id":"SE-257-E01","start":70,"end":89,"span":"hörde han ett skott","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard a shot."},{"id":"SE-257-E02","start":135,"end":161,"span":"skulle se, vad som stod på","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"vad som stod på","start_offset":146,"end_offset":161,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Inspection intention, not proof of completed perception.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Intended to see what was happening."},{"id":"SE-257-E03","start":253,"end":269,"span":"två stora hundar","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Two large dogs."},{"id":"SE-257-E04","start":323,"end":353,"span":"tittade på hur mjölet rann ner","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Watched the flour run down."}],"context":{"place":"in i kvarnen","time":"mettnattes","movement":"sprang ut"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.114857,"lon":12.424218,"label":"Grimetons sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54152","id":"54152","collection":"SE","title":"Odens jakt","text":"Min morfar talade om mycket. Han hade varit med och hört Jakobs jakt på Djurskog. Han och ett par till var ute på jakt. Rätt som det var fick de höra hundar skälla. Den ene gnall fint, men de andra två hade grov skall. Så small det, och då var det som om hela skogen hade brakat ned. Det blev alldeles mol tyst. \"Nu stöp skogsråa\" var det en av morfars kamrater, som sa. \"Nu är det inte lönt att vi går på denna skogen mer i dag.\"","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 11.","place":"Holmedals sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54152-E01","start":137,"end":218,"span":"fick de höra hundar skälla. Den ene gnall fint, men de andra två hade grov skall.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They heard dogs barking: one yelped high and two barked deeply."},{"id":"SE-54152-E02","start":219,"end":283,"span":"Så small det, och då var det som om hela skogen hade brakat ned.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"som om is a sound simile, not automatically epistemic uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then a bang sounded as though the entire forest had crashed down."},{"id":"SE-54152-E03","start":284,"end":311,"span":"Det blev alldeles mol tyst.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"It became completely silent."}],"context":{"place":"på Djurskog","time":"mer i dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.474678,"lon":11.960596,"label":"Holmedals sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55346","id":"55346","collection":"SE","title":"Odens jakt","text":"Pappa berättade, att Oden hämtade sådana döda, som kom illa bort. Det var en man, som var ute och gick. Först mötte han stora hundar, som kom i vildaste fart, och elden lyste ur munnen på dem. Sedan kom en ryttare, och mannen förstod genast, vem det var. \"Sås du jakten?\" frågade han, men mannen svarade inte. Efter en liten stund hördes ett skott, och sedan kom ryttaren tillbaka och hade hundarna i koppel och en död karl hängande framför sej. \"Sås du det tog?\" sa han.\n","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.12","place":"Örsås sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55346-E01","start":120,"end":191,"span":"stora hundar, som kom i vildaste fart, och elden lyste ur munnen på dem","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Large dogs rushed past with fire shining from their mouths."},{"id":"SE-55346-E02","start":331,"end":347,"span":"hördes ett skott","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A shot was heard."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"Efter en liten stund","movement":"var ute och gick"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.442223,"lon":13.1225,"label":"Örsås sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1611","id":"1611","collection":"SE","title":"Odens jakt","text":"En sägen förtäljer, att då en person en natt var ute på vandring i skogen, mötte han en liten gubbe iklädd en röd toppluva. Gubben hade mycket bråttom och skyndade hastigt förbi men ropade i förbifarten: \"Kommer det någon efter och frågar om du mött någon, så säg att du ingen har sett!\" En stund därefter kom en ryttare och frågade: \"Har du sett någon?\" \"Ingen mer än en liten gubbe, som jag mötte här borta,\" genmälte mannen. Med detta besked gav ryttaren sig iväg i häftig ritt. Om en stund small ett skott, och etfer ytterligare några minuter var ryttaren tillbaka med lille mannen hängande över hästens länd. Då han hunnit upp vandraren, sade han: \"Det var väl för dig att du sade sanning, annars hade du fått hänga där han hänger. Men det skall du veta efter detta, att hålla dig inne mellan klockan elva och två, för det är mina timmar.\" Ryttaren sades vara Odens jakt.","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03251 · null","place":"Blidsbergs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1611-E01","start":85,"end":122,"span":"en liten gubbe iklädd en röd toppluva","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A little man wearing a red pointed cap."},{"id":"SE-1611-E02","start":182,"end":202,"span":"ropade i förbifarten","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Called out while passing."},{"id":"SE-1611-E04","start":494,"end":509,"span":"small ett skott","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A shot rang out."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"en natt","movement":"ute på vandring"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.930206,"lon":13.505621,"label":"Blidsbergs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:17","id":"17","collection":"SE","title":"Odens jakt","text":"Min morfar Jens var i Nattramshålan (en äng) och höstade gräs. Solen hade gått ner och det började bli rätt mörkt. Då fick han höra ett \"oåsande\" = (sjasande skravlande) ljud över sig. Dä va' Hoans jakt förstås. Jens \"blaj\" = (blev) rädd å sprang \"ing\" = (in) i \"ängalåan (ängslada). Men när han \"lan\" = (låg) där, dåna det än värre över taket på ladan, å takåsen böjde sig neråt så långt, att den nästan rörde vid Jens, där han låg i höet. Men takåsen rök ändå inte av. För att få fred, tog nu Jens å snodde ihop hö till band, samt vira hö om en pinne å satte sen ihop detta till ett kors, som han hängde i takåsen. Sedan blev han inte oroad av Ho'ans jakt vidare.","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04409 · 1","place":"Abilds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-17-E01","start":87,"end":113,"span":"det började bli rätt mörkt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It began to get quite dark."},{"id":"SE-17-E02","start":118,"end":183,"span":"fick han höra ett \"oåsande\" = (sjasande skravlande) ljud över sig","modalities":["auditory","spatial perception"],"groups":["hearing","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard a rushing/clattering sound overhead."},{"id":"SE-17-E03","start":315,"end":352,"span":"dåna det än värre över taket på ladan","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It roared still more loudly above the barn roof."},{"id":"SE-17-E04","start":394,"end":419,"span":"den nästan rörde vid Jens","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Near contact is explicitly not completed contact; retained as a boundary event.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"It almost touched Jens."}],"context":{"place":"i Nattramshålan (en äng)","time":"Solen hade gått ner","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.938806,"lon":12.721917,"label":"Abilds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56131","id":"56131","collection":"SE","title":"\"Hinjakta\" eller O´ns jakt","text":"I oktober 1893 hände det att en kvinna i Svinstad såg Hins jakt med jägare och allt. Hon var på väg hem från en familj, som hon hade besökt. Det var sent på kvällen och ganska mörkt. När hon var kommen ett stycke på väg, mötte hon en kvinna som flydde med stor hast framåt vägen. Strax efteråt mötte hon en ryttare, som stannade och frågade, om hon hade mött någon kvinna. Hon svarade,, att hon hade gjort det. Om en stund hördes ett skott och ett gällt skrik. Strax kom ryttaren galopperande tillbaka, och framför honom på sadeln hängde kvinnan framstupa med slängande bröst. Kvinnan som upplevde den hemska synen svimmade. Efteråt visste hon inte, hur länge hon hade legat avsvimmad och inte heller hur hon hade kommit hem.","category":"Den vilda jakten","source":"Elis Åström 1962: Folktro och folkliv i Östergötland. Uppsala. s.18","place":"S:t Lars sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56131-E01","start":29,"end":83,"span":"en kvinna i Svinstad såg Hins jakt med jägare och allt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A woman saw the hunt, hunter and all."},{"id":"SE-56131-E02","start":169,"end":181,"span":"ganska mörkt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Quite dark."},{"id":"SE-56131-E03","start":423,"end":459,"span":"hördes ett skott och ett gällt skrik","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A shot and a shrill cry were heard."},{"id":"SE-56131-E04","start":577,"end":624,"span":"Kvinnan som upplevde den hemska synen svimmade.","modalities":["visual","bodily state"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Visible episode and loss of consciousness linked explicitly; no pain inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The woman who experienced the terrible sight fainted."},{"id":"SE-56131-E05","start":625,"end":725,"span":"Efteråt visste hon inte, hur länge hon hade legat avsvimmad och inte heller hur hon hade kommit hem.","modalities":["orientation","bodily state"],"groups":["orientation","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"visste hon inte, hur länge hon hade legat avsvimmad och inte heller hur hon hade kommit hem","start_offset":633,"end_offset":724,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Retrospective bodily/spatial access gap, not evidence of becoming lost.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Afterwards she did not know how long she had been unconscious or how she got home."}],"context":{"place":"framåt vägen","time":"I oktober 1893","movement":"på väg hem"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.411392,"lon":15.624661,"label":"S:t Lars sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:387","id":"387","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsväsen","text":"En gång en kväll har han varit ett ärende i Toarp (Valinge). När han gick hem mötte han ett fruntimmer i Toarps skog. \"Gokvällen! Och vart ska du hän Nåls?\" ropade hon. Han svarte: \"Hem!\" för han visste ej vem det var. Då fick skogsrået makt över honom, så han blev riktigt förvirrter, så han tyckte sig gå i vatten till hakan hele hemvägen.","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh00804 · 7","place":"Stamnareds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-387-E01","start":157,"end":167,"span":"ropade hon","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"han visste ej vem det var","start_offset":192,"end_offset":217,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"sound production","note":"Identity uncertainty belongs to the addressee, not the caller; experiencer-role ambiguity retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She called out."},{"id":"SE-387-E02","start":257,"end":340,"span":"han blev riktigt förvirrter, så han tyckte sig gå i vatten till hakan hele hemvägen","modalities":["orientation","bodily sensation"],"groups":["orientation","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;E","evidence":[{"span":"tyckte sig gå i vatten till hakan","start_offset":293,"end_offset":326,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"},{"span":"blev riktigt förvirrter","start_offset":261,"end_offset":284,"occurrences":1,"type":"E","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Embodied impression, not confirmed actual immersion.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He became confused and felt as if he walked through chin-deep water all the way home."}],"context":{"place":"i Toarps skog","time":"en kväll","movement":"gick hem"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation"],"translation":"Once one evening he had an errand in Toarp (Valinge). When he walked home, he met a woman in Toarp's forest. 'Good evening! And where are you heading, Nåls?' she called out. He answered: 'Home!' because he did not know who it was. Then the forest spirit [skogsrået] gained power over him, so he became truly confused, so that it seemed to him he was walking in water up to his chin the entire way home.","translationNotes":["'Tyckte sig' is rendered as 'it seemed to him', preserving a qualified embodied impression rather than asserting actual immersion."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.213734,"lon":12.394417,"label":"Stamnareds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"SE-387-E01","start":158,"end":172,"span":"she called out","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"han visste ej vem det var","start_offset":192,"end_offset":217,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"sound production","note":"Identity uncertainty belongs to the addressee, not the caller; experiencer-role ambiguity retained.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She called out.","originalSpan":"ropade hon","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-387-E02","start":292,"end":401,"span":"he became truly confused, so that it seemed to him he was walking in water up to his chin the entire way home","modalities":["orientation","bodily sensation"],"groups":["orientation","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;E","evidence":[{"span":"tyckte sig gå i vatten till hakan","start_offset":293,"end_offset":326,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"},{"span":"blev riktigt förvirrter","start_offset":261,"end_offset":284,"occurrences":1,"type":"E","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Embodied impression, not confirmed actual immersion.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He became confused and felt as if he walked through chin-deep water all the way home.","originalSpan":"han blev riktigt förvirrter, så han tyckte sig gå i vatten till hakan hele hemvägen","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"SE:53348","id":"53348","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsrå","text":"Gumman mins far talte om att drängen hans varit ute på midsommarvaka. Lite på lätten var han. När han kom och gick igenom en trädlund, tyckte han, det var fästmön hans, som satt där, och hon gjorde miner, att han skulle komma till henne. Hon skiftade så många dräkter, men han gick inte, utan han sa: \"Gå Skam i våld, din rackarepacka!\" Då gjorde hon ett skratt och försvann.","category":"Skogsväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.35","place":"Spekeröds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53348-E01","start":70,"end":93,"span":"Lite på lätten var han.","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He was a little tipsy."},{"id":"SE-53348-E02","start":135,"end":236,"span":"tyckte han, det var fästmön hans, som satt där, och hon gjorde miner, att han skulle komma till henne","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"tyckte han, det var fästmön hans","start_offset":135,"end_offset":167,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He thought it was his fiancée sitting there, gesturing for him to come."},{"id":"SE-53348-E03","start":238,"end":267,"span":"Hon skiftade så många dräkter","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Appearance variation; no explicit identity revision in this clause.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She changed into many outfits."},{"id":"SE-53348-E04","start":337,"end":375,"span":"Då gjorde hon ett skratt och försvann.","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Sound and disappearance clustered; not independent corroboration failure.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then she laughed and disappeared."}],"context":{"place":"igenom en trädlund","time":"midsommarvaka","movement":"kom och gick"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.032349,"lon":11.866399,"label":"Spekeröds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54346","id":"54346","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsrå","text":"Tall-Maja rår om en del av djuren i skogen. Men hon kunde förvända synen på folk också, så att de såg djur där det inga var. Se det är så att Tall-Majas djur har de endast kunnat skjuta med ett psalmboksblad i förladdningen. Nu var det en som sköt på en tjäder och han flög och satte sig i ett annat träd, men då sköt han med en tocken laddning och tjädern föll. Men när jägaren skulle hämta den, så var det bara trasor och trästickor.","category":"Skogsväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 39.","place":"Varnums sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54346-E01","start":58,"end":123,"span":"förvända synen på folk också, så att de såg djur där det inga var","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"så att de såg djur där det inga var","start_offset":88,"end_offset":123,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Narrator-stated discrepancy, not inferred supernatural causation.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Distort people’s vision so they saw animals where there were none."},{"id":"SE-54346-E02","start":363,"end":435,"span":"Men när jägaren skulle hämta den, så var det bara trasor och trästickor.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C;D","evidence":[{"span":"så var det bara trasor och trästickor","start_offset":397,"end_offset":434,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"},{"span":"när jägaren skulle hämta den, så var det bara trasor och trästickor","start_offset":367,"end_offset":434,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Inspection contradicts the prior identification as a bird; channel context-licensed, not a seeing verb.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When the hunter went to retrieve it, there were only rags and wooden splinters."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.392933,"lon":14.200871,"label":"Varnums sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55843","id":"55843","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsrå","text":"Far han talte om, att has far såg ett tocke där skogsrå. De va unner fågeltiden. Di va la en fyra, fem styckna, som va ute, å di somna allihop utom farfar. Då kom de fram ett fruntimmer, å ho to e bössa å satte unner arselet, å den bössa ho va olik, ho. För den som ägde'na han fick inte ett enda skött.","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.65","place":"Hällestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55843-E01","start":22,"end":55,"span":"has far såg ett tocke där skogsrå","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"His father saw such a forest figure."},{"id":"SE-55843-E02","start":189,"end":224,"span":"ho to e bössa å satte unner arselet","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit body/object placement, not an inferred felt quality.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She took a gun and put it under her backside."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"unner fågeltiden","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.7425,"lon":15.574722,"label":"Hällestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:475","id":"475","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsråa","text":"En dräng låg i skogen och kolade, så en kväll får han besök av, som han trodde, sin färstmö. Då han och \"fästmön\" sällskapat i kojan en längre stund skulle hon gå hem, men då drängen såg henne gå ut i dörren, såg han till sin häpnad att hon hade svans. Han förstod då att det var \"skogsråa\". Sedan hade hon honom i sitt våld. Han gick ofta till skogen för att möta henne. Till sist gick hon fram till gården där drängen bodde. En dag såg han henne och då var hon så stor så hon stod grensle över stugubyggningen med ett ben på vardera sida. Drängen blev \"konstig\", men blev sedan botad för det. Så gifte han sig och sedan såg han aldrig mer \"skogaråa\".","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · VFF01504 · 9","place":"Nysunds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-475-E01","start":175,"end":251,"span":"drängen såg henne gå ut i dörren, såg han till sin häpnad att hon hade svans","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"som han trodde, sin färstmö","start_offset":64,"end_offset":91,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"},{"span":"Han förstod då att det var \"skogsråa\".","start_offset":253,"end_offset":291,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Identification revision supported by earlier and later exact evidence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"As he watched her leave he saw, to his astonishment, that she had a tail."},{"id":"SE-475-E02","start":427,"end":540,"span":"En dag såg han henne och då var hon så stor så hon stod grensle över stugubyggningen med ett ben på vardera sida.","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw her so large that she straddled the cottage, one leg on each side."},{"id":"SE-475-E04","start":616,"end":651,"span":"sedan såg han aldrig mer \"skogaråa\"","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Afterwards he never saw her again."}],"context":{"place":"i kojan","time":"en kväll","movement":"gå ut i dörren"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.11837,"lon":14.369153,"label":"Nysunds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52134","id":"52134","collection":"SE","title":"Bysen på Trull-tjokk","text":"Då Stainstu'-karlarna i Ala engång på senhösten hela dagen hade hållit på med att uppbryta »stumblar» till »såide», och de mot qvällen just arbetade med en stor »stumble», som var mycket svår att få upp, sade en af »folken»: »Nu göra vi afte — Bysen här på Trull-tjokk tar nog upp den för oss tills i morgon!» Och dermed så lade de alla bräckbomarna uppå »stumblen» och gingo hem. Då de kommo dit om morgonen, var »stumblen» mycket riktigt uppbruten, och mycket väl rensad och ren från all jord och bråte, färdig att huggas sönder till »såide-vid».\nHans Larsson Alfvegren, Gurfiles i Ala.","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.139-140","place":"Ala sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"på Trull-tjokk","time":"på senhösten","movement":"kommo dit om morgonen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.419004,"lon":18.635108,"label":"Ala sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52948","id":"52948","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsrå","text":"Per August i Kärr var ute om kvällen och tog vägen genom skogen. Rätt som han gick där, kom skogsfrun springandes bakefter. Hon var så grann framifrån, men bak såg hon ut som ett ihåligt \"kn6tråg\", sa han. \"Vad heter du, vad heter du?\" ropade hon efter honom. Men Per August svarade inte, för hade hon fått veta hans namn, hade hon haft makt över honom när som helst, var givet. Så han teg still. Till slut sa han till henne: \"Dra te Skam, ditt åbäke!\" Och sen såg han henne aldrig mer.","category":"Skogsväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.36","place":"Brastads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52948-E01","start":124,"end":196,"span":"Hon var så grann framifrån, men bak såg hon ut som ett ihåligt \"kn6tråg\"","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Different viewpoints/qualities; no explicit revision of identity. Preserve kn6tråg exactly.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She was beautiful in front but looked like a hollow trough from behind."},{"id":"SE-52948-E02","start":206,"end":259,"span":"\"Vad heter du, vad heter du?\" ropade hon efter honom.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"“What is your name?” she called after him."},{"id":"SE-52948-E03","start":457,"end":485,"span":"sen såg han henne aldrig mer","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Then he never saw her again."}],"context":{"place":"genom skogen","time":"om kvällen","movement":"springandes bakefter"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.378529,"lon":11.490715,"label":"Brastads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54373","id":"54373","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsrå","text":"Farfar och farmor var ute och åkte en kväll. När de korn uppemot Rävtorp, så stannade hästen och var inte god till att dra av fläcken, fast både farfar och farmor gick ur åkdonet. Farmor fick sätta sig upp, och så gick farfar fram till huvudet på hästen och tittade genom betslet. \"Såg du något?\" sade farmor. Men han talade inte om något förrän nästa dag. Då talade han om att det satt ett stort kvinnfolk på ryggen på hästen. Hon satt med framsidan åt åkdonet. I detsamma som han fick se henne, så hoppade hon av. Då blev hästen så rädd, så att han satte i för fullt sken. Det var jämt att farfar hann upp i åkdonet.\n","category":"Skogsväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 39.","place":"Ölme sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54373-E01","start":247,"end":279,"span":"hästen och tittade genom betslet","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Deliberate inspection. No assumption that the wife shares the view.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Looked through the horse’s bridle."},{"id":"SE-54373-E02","start":378,"end":426,"span":"det satt ett stort kvinnfolk på ryggen på hästen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A large woman was sitting on the horse’s back."},{"id":"SE-54373-E03","start":463,"end":515,"span":"I detsamma som han fick se henne, så hoppade hon av.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"As soon as he saw her she jumped off."}],"context":{"place":"uppemot Rävtorp","time":"en kväll","movement":"ute och åkte"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.364743,"lon":13.938199,"label":"Ölme sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1405","id":"1405","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsväsen","text":"Jag har inte sett ”Skogsråa”, men jag hörde så my, att de talade om henne. Far hade sett henne. Han höll mycket till i skogen. Det var kolning å tjärbränning i skogarna den tiden. Min farfar höll på att bli tagen av henne. Han var i skogen å brände tjära. Då kom hon å ville värma sig. Hon vände rôva till elden å skulle stek den. Mens hon stod där så frågade hon farfar vad han hette. Hon tänkte sig till att lura fram namnet. Men farfar sa att han hette sjôl. Han ville ha bort henne, så han tog en eldbrand å snudde i rôva på henne. Hon blev bränd å sprang å skrek att sjôl hade bränt henne. Hon skrek på de andra skogsråra, men de svarade: ”ha du sjôl bränt dej, så kan du ha’t så gôtt”.\n\nSå var det en inspektor som hette Wätterstrand. Han kom ut för henne på skogarna här. Han mötte en grann jänt en gång, å han slog sig i språk med henne. Men hon fick så my makt över honom, att hon höll på att ta liv av honom. Det finns en visa om detta, men den mins jag inte.\n\nFar hade henne till hjälp vid milan. Han kunde lägga sig å somna när som helst. När det var tid att han skulle upp, så kom hon å knackade på kujdörren.","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03820 · 2728","place":"Dalby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1405-E01","start":0,"end":28,"span":"Jag har inte sett ”Skogsråa”","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Hearing people talk about her is hearsay, not hearing the figure; no B code.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I have not seen the forest figure."},{"id":"SE-1405-E02","start":75,"end":95,"span":"Far hade sett henne.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Father had seen her."},{"id":"SE-1405-E03","start":286,"end":329,"span":"Hon vände rôva till elden å skulle stek den","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She turned her backside to the fire to warm/roast it."},{"id":"SE-1405-E04","start":494,"end":550,"span":"tog en eldbrand å snudde i rôva på henne. Hon blev bränd","modalities":["temperature","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Burning contact explicit; no pain inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Took a burning brand and singed her backside; she was burned."},{"id":"SE-1405-E05","start":553,"end":593,"span":"sprang å skrek att sjôl hade bränt henne","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Ran and screamed that “self” had burned her."},{"id":"SE-1405-E06","start":789,"end":802,"span":"en grann jänt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A beautiful girl."},{"id":"SE-1405-E07","start":1090,"end":1121,"span":"kom hon å knackade på kujdörren","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She came and knocked on the hut door."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"När det var tid att han skulle upp","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.649166,"lon":12.994722,"label":"Dalby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52209","id":"52209","collection":"SE","title":"Bysen vid Hejdeby-Ugn","text":"Öster ut från Wisby vid halfmilen ungefär ligger Hej deby Kalk-ugn på Slätt-flisar. När kalkugns-karlarne der en natt hade tändt ugnen och den brann med godt skick, stodo som vanligt ett par af dem och kastade ved in i ugnen och masade om elden med sina långa stänger, och de andra kamraterna lågo inne i stugan vid ugnen och sofvo. — Bäst kalkugns-karlarne stodo så och arbetade framvid ugnen, slog eldslågan så häftigt ut mot dem ur ugns-munnen och de ej kunde bärga sig der för hetta. Och då detta så fortfarit en stund, kom en af karlarne att se uppåt ugnen; och då fick han se att Bysen satt der oppe på högsta muren eller ugnens krans. Då ropade en af dem till Bysen: »Åh, sitter du der; kom heller hit ned och värm dig!» — Snart stod ock Bysen nere vid ugns-munnen och värmde sig; men han gjorde sig dervid så bred och stor att ingen mera kunde komma till ugnen. Då tog samma karl som var särdeles »modänes», brands-staken så eldande röd han var och rännde den bakifrån i Bysen, som nu med en förfärlig jemmer och låt for af till skogs; men hade ej kalkugns-karlen varit så qvick och genast släppt brand-staken, hade han ock fått följa med Bysen.\nKristen Kristensson, vid Tjeldare i Boge, omkr. 8o gammal.","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.148-149","place":"Boge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52209-E01","start":451,"end":486,"span":"de ej kunde bärga sig der för hetta","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They could not remain there because of the heat."},{"id":"SE-52209-E02","start":570,"end":640,"span":"fick han se att Bysen satt der oppe på högsta muren eller ugnens krans","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw Bysen sitting on the highest wall or rim of the kiln."},{"id":"SE-52209-E03","start":645,"end":672,"span":"ropade en af dem till Bysen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"One of them called to Bysen."},{"id":"SE-52209-E04","start":736,"end":786,"span":"stod ock Bysen nere vid ugns-munnen och värmde sig","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Bysen stood by the kiln mouth warming himself."},{"id":"SE-52209-E05","start":814,"end":868,"span":"så bred och stor att ingen mera kunde komma till ugnen","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"So broad and large that no one could get to the kiln."},{"id":"SE-52209-E06","start":916,"end":984,"span":"brands-staken så eldande röd han var och rännde den bakifrån i Bysen","modalities":["visual","touch","temperature"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Redness and hot-object exposure explicit; no felt pain inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The glowing-red poker was thrust into Bysen from behind."},{"id":"SE-52209-E07","start":993,"end":1042,"span":"med en förfärlig jemmer och låt for af till skogs","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Went off into the woods with terrible wailing and noise."}],"context":{"place":"vid ugns-munnen","time":"en natt","movement":"for af till skogs"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.686638,"lon":18.758421,"label":"Boge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55845","id":"55845","collection":"SE","title":"Skogsrå","text":"Men min morfar han har då sitt'a. Han va torpare på Valstorps äger, å han skulle lämna femti skött om vårn i skatt för torpet. En orrtupp de va bara ett halt skött, men en tjäder två skött, å e höna ett skött. Å hare va bara ett har(l)t skött, å e ann de va ett skött. Morfar han bodde hos Nisse i Dalkarshytta då när ungfågeln vart. Då lå di där i dagninga, å Nisse sa: »Än behöver vi inte ge oss iväg». Men sen såg morfar, hur de va ett grant fruntimmer, som kom å gick fram te dom. Å han tänkte: »Va ska ho nu göra mä bössera?» Då to ho Nisses bössa å sög opp sköttet. Men morfars bössa rörde ho inte ve. Å sen försvann ho. Men de börjte å knäppa i Nisses bössa, å han vakna å skrek te: »Nej, nu måste vi opp!» Å de va inte längre än mella gryninga å tess sola hadde gått ner, så hadde Nisse nie skött, å morfar hadde inte ett enda. De där fruntimret ho va så granner framifrån, men när ho vände ryggen te, så va de som en tyrrot, å svans hadde ho.","category":"Skogsväsen","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.65","place":"Hällestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55845-E01","start":413,"end":483,"span":"såg morfar, hur de va ett grant fruntimmer, som kom å gick fram te dom","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Grandfather saw a beautiful woman approaching them."},{"id":"SE-55845-E03","start":576,"end":606,"span":"morfars bössa rörde ho inte ve","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"She did not touch grandfather’s gun."},{"id":"SE-55845-E04","start":631,"end":664,"span":"de börjte å knäppa i Nisses bössa","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Clicking began in Nisse’s gun."},{"id":"SE-55845-E05","start":668,"end":688,"span":"han vakna å skrek te","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He woke and cried out."},{"id":"SE-55845-E06","start":860,"end":950,"span":"så granner framifrån, men när ho vände ryggen te, så va de som en tyrrot, å svans hadde ho","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Viewpoint-dependent description. No explicit mistaken first identification.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Beautiful from the front, but from behind like a pine root, with a tail."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"i dagninga","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.7425,"lon":15.574722,"label":"Hällestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:4536","id":"4536","collection":"SE","title":"Han i vattnet","text":"På höstarna när det lyste i bäcken sa di att det var \"Han i vattnet.\" Alltid förr när di körde om natten, så inna hästarna fick dricka skulle di spotta för \"Han i vattnet\" ej skulle få makt över dem. Om di blev tjocka trodde di att \"Han i vattnet\" varit framme och blåst dem. Di hade fått \"Han i vannet.\"","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh00937 · 6","place":"Älvsåkers sn","events":[{"id":"SE-4536-E01","start":12,"end":34,"span":"när det lyste i bäcken","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When it shone in the stream."},{"id":"SE-4536-E02","start":200,"end":217,"span":"Om di blev tjocka","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Horses’ swelling; not an inferred pressure sensation.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"If they became swollen."}],"context":{"place":"i bäcken","time":"På höstarna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.542221,"lon":12.119722,"label":"Älvsåkers sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53776","id":"53776","collection":"SE","title":"Sjörå","text":"Fiskare kastade till henne ett par vantar eller ett par strumpor. Hon sa ena vänna:\n\n\"Man, drager upp och far öster över sjön, \ndet tutar i hornet och driver i skyn!\"\n","category":"Vattenväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.29","place":"Vänersnäs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53776-E01","start":128,"end":146,"span":"det tutar i hornet","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The horn is sounding."}],"context":{"place":"öster över sjön","time":"","movement":"far öster över sjön"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.397499,"lon":12.565833,"label":"Vänersnäs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54359","id":"54359","collection":"SE","title":"Sjörå","text":"Bruntjärs-Kajsa bodde i en tjärn mellan Malsjö och Värmskog. Gubbar, som var till Karlstad, kom ut för henne där, och då var hon inte nådig ibland, särskilt om de var oregärliga å svor å väsnades, när de for förbi. Då vältade hon omkull dem mitt på landsvägen. Det var sjöråa.\n","category":"Vattenväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 33.","place":"Värmskogs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54359-E01","start":180,"end":195,"span":"svor å väsnades","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Swore and made a racket."},{"id":"SE-54359-E02","start":218,"end":259,"span":"vältade hon omkull dem mitt på landsvägen","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She toppled them over in the middle of the road."}],"context":{"place":"mitt på landsvägen","time":"","movement":"for förbi"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.455002,"lon":12.9175,"label":"Värmskogs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:932","id":"932","collection":"SE","title":"Vattenväsen","text":"En gång såg jag en lång orm i Vänern, den hade man. Skepparn som jag tjäna blev rädd för ormen, å han var rädd att vi skulle få […] på ormen. Det var en \"manorm\".","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03897 · 30","place":"Gestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-932-E01","start":8,"end":50,"span":"såg jag en lång orm i Vänern, den hade man","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I saw a long snake with a mane in Lake Vänern."}],"context":{"place":"i Vänern","time":"En gång","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.545921,"lon":12.452192,"label":"Gestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50180","id":"50180","collection":"SE","title":"Näcken - Det avgnagda köttbenet","text":"Det var en dräng på Strandås, som hette Krok-Markus. Denna var så förtjust i musik, men han kunde inte spela alls. Men nu hade han hört, att om man tog ett köttben och gick till en bäck som rann norrut och släppte benet i bäcken, skulle man lära sej spela av näcken. Han fick sej ett köttben, men det var nästan avgnagt, och gick till en nordrinnande bäck en torsdagskväll. Nästa torsdagskväll gick han tillbaka för då skulle han få lära sej, men då sa näcken: \"Du ga' mej ett ben med ingenting på. Du lärer dej stämm' men aldrig stryk på.\" Och det blev så. Han kunde stämma vilket instrument som helst men aldrig spela en ton.","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 4693 · 7 · Bengt af Klintberg 1972: Svenska folksägner. Stockholm. s. 103","place":"Dalby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50180-E01","start":88,"end":113,"span":"han kunde inte spela alls","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Unavailable sound-production skill, not deafness.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"He could not play at all."},{"id":"SE-50180-E02","start":558,"end":627,"span":"Han kunde stämma vilket instrument som helst men aldrig spela en ton.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Negative playing ability; tuning is not converted into an inferred listening event.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"He could tune any instrument but never play a note."}],"context":{"place":"en nordrinnande bäck","time":"en torsdagskväll","movement":"gick han tillbaka"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.649166,"lon":12.994722,"label":"Dalby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52309","id":"52309","collection":"SE","title":"Gossen på skepps-roret","text":"Då lotsen engång vid »Hårnet» (Lutterhorn på Fårö) lotsat ut ett fartyg till sjöss och redan i sin båt lemnat det, såg han en liten gosse sitta under fartygets ror. — Han blef förskräckt öfver denna syn och utropade: »Hvad i Jesu Christi namn skall detta betyda!» — Då svarade gossen: »Inte dig och inte dem!» — Och två dagar derefter drunknade två fåröbor på samma ställe.\nJ. Kalström.","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.289","place":"Fårö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52309-E01","start":115,"end":163,"span":"såg han en liten gosse sitta under fartygets ror","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw a little boy sitting under the ship’s rudder."},{"id":"SE-52309-E02","start":207,"end":263,"span":"utropade: »Hvad i Jesu Christi namn skall detta betyda!»","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Question about meaning, not what was perceived; no epistemic-perception uncertainty inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Exclaimed: “What in Jesus Christ’s name can this mean!”"}],"context":{"place":"vid »Hårnet» (Lutterhorn på Fårö)","time":"","movement":"i sin båt lemnat det"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.915838,"lon":19.133377,"label":"Fårö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53127","id":"53127","collection":"SE","title":"Sjörå","text":"En gång när farfar hade varit ute och fiskat, så fick han se ett sådant fint kvinnfolk, som stod på stranden. Det var mot solnedgången. Hon stod och kammade sig. Det såg ut som om hon hade silver i håret. När farfar hade kommit i land med båten, så skulle han se efter, vad det var för ett fruntimmer, men då kunde han inte se henne mer. Då förstod han, att det var havsfrun, som han hade sett. Det brukade inte slå fel utan att det blev hårt väder, när hon hade visat sig.","category":"Vattenväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.23","place":"Kungshamns sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53127-E01","start":49,"end":108,"span":"fick han se ett sådant fint kvinnfolk, som stod på stranden","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw a fine-looking woman standing on the shore."},{"id":"SE-53127-E02","start":162,"end":204,"span":"Det såg ut som om hon hade silver i håret.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"Det såg ut som om","start_offset":162,"end_offset":179,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Qualified appearance; narrow uncertainty sensitivity excludes appearance-only qualification.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It looked as though she had silver in her hair."},{"id":"SE-53127-E03","start":249,"end":336,"span":"skulle han se efter, vad det var för ett fruntimmer, men då kunde han inte se henne mer","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;D","evidence":[{"span":"vad det var för ett fruntimmer","start_offset":270,"end_offset":300,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"},{"span":"men då kunde han inte se henne mer","start_offset":302,"end_offset":336,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit re-inspection fails to regain access; later label is source wording, not analyst ontology.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He went to inspect what woman it was, but could no longer see her."}],"context":{"place":"på stranden","time":"mot solnedgången","movement":"kommit i land med båten"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"Once when grandfather had been out fishing, he caught sight of such a fine woman standing on the shore. It was towards sunset. She stood combing her hair. It looked as if she had silver in her hair. When grandfather had come ashore with the boat, he wanted to see what kind of woman it was, but then he could not see her anymore. Then he understood that it was the sea-wife [havsfrun] that he had seen. It usually did not fail to bring rough weather when she had shown herself.","translationNotes":["The identification as havsfrun is the grandfather's interpretation in the narrative. 'It looked as if' and the later inability to see her are retained."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.353558,"lon":11.266097,"label":"Kungshamns sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"SE-53127-E01","start":44,"end":102,"span":"he caught sight of such a fine woman standing on the shore","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw a fine-looking woman standing on the shore.","originalSpan":"fick han se ett sådant fint kvinnfolk, som stod på stranden","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-53127-E02","start":155,"end":198,"span":"It looked as if she had silver in her hair.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"Det såg ut som om","start_offset":162,"end_offset":179,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Qualified appearance; narrow uncertainty sensitivity excludes appearance-only qualification.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It looked as though she had silver in her hair.","originalSpan":"Det såg ut som om hon hade silver i håret.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-53127-E03","start":247,"end":328,"span":"he wanted to see what kind of woman it was, but then he could not see her anymore","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;D","evidence":[{"span":"vad det var för ett fruntimmer","start_offset":270,"end_offset":300,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"},{"span":"men då kunde han inte se henne mer","start_offset":302,"end_offset":336,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit re-inspection fails to regain access; later label is source wording, not analyst ontology.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He went to inspect what woman it was, but could no longer see her.","originalSpan":"skulle han se efter, vad det var för ett fruntimmer, men då kunde han inte se henne mer","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"SE:53775","id":"53775","collection":"SE","title":"Sjörå","text":"Kalle på Hagen talte om en historia ibland. Han var med en skeppare från Tuns socken, som seglade på Värmland. Han sålde sina spannmålslass till sjöfrua. Hon kom upp ur sjön och hade fartyg med sej och tog emot säden. Men var kväll han kom till land skulle han växla till sej andra pengar för dem, som han hade fått av henne, för på morron var de inte annat än stickeflisor.\n\nDen skepparen hade varit nere hos sjöfrua på sjöbotten. Hon hade både kreatur och allt sådant, som det finns på landmarken, sa han.","category":"Vattenväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.28","place":"Vänersnäs sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"på sjöbotten","time":"på morron","movement":"varit nere hos sjöfrua på sjöbotten"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.397499,"lon":12.565833,"label":"Vänersnäs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:190","id":"190","collection":"SE","title":"Vattenväsen","text":"Sjörå var vackra fröknar som satt på skär emellan bergen och vände och vred på sig. De voro ihåliga i ryggen och ville därför aldrig vända ryggen mot någon. De visade sig endast på natten, mot storm, men där de visade sig ljuste de ifrån sig, så att de syntes tydligt. Försökte någon komma dem nära, försvann de och visade sig sedan igen på ett annat ställe längre borta. De försökte locka folk ut, för att de skulle drunkna. Sjörå utsändes av \"Hornper\" för att han skulle få själar. Det var mest fiskare som fick se sjörå, när de sett sjörå fick de inte tala om det för någon, förrän på morgonen efter det de sovit och då skulle de först bita över en sax eller kniv, annars blev de sjuka.","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh02991 · 3","place":"Göteborgs stad","events":[{"id":"SE-190-E01","start":10,"end":24,"span":"vackra fröknar","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Beautiful young women."},{"id":"SE-190-E02","start":92,"end":108,"span":"ihåliga i ryggen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Hollow in the back."},{"id":"SE-190-E03","start":222,"end":267,"span":"ljuste de ifrån sig, så att de syntes tydligt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They emitted light so that they could be clearly seen."},{"id":"SE-190-E04","start":269,"end":371,"span":"Försökte någon komma dem nära, försvann de och visade sig sedan igen på ett annat ställe längre borta.","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"Försökte någon komma dem nära, försvann de","start_offset":269,"end_offset":311,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Approach limits visual access; reappearance is not necessarily identification revision.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When someone tried to approach they disappeared and reappeared farther away."},{"id":"SE-190-E05","start":639,"end":666,"span":"bita över en sax eller kniv","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit mouth/object contact; no taste inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Bite over a pair of scissors or a knife."},{"id":"SE-190-E06","start":668,"end":688,"span":"annars blev de sjuka","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Otherwise they became ill."}],"context":{"place":"på skär emellan bergen","time":"endast på natten","movement":"komma dem nära"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.700001,"lon":11.933333,"label":"Göteborgs stad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:51137","id":"51137","collection":"SE","title":"Sjörå","text":"Nära mitt gamla hem i Ysby ligger en liten sjö, som har det otrevliga namnet Pugasjön. Det är en obetydlig sjöhåla, nästan rund till formen, med tvärbranta kanter. Det påstås, att den skall stå i samband under jorden med andra sjöar på väldiga avstånd till och med i andra land. Och så troddes den ju vara bottenlös.\n\nEn bonde tog sig en gång före att se efter, om inte han ändå skulle kunna nå botten. Han tog ett väldigt långt rep med sig och rodde ut på sjön. Och han hivade ut famn efter famn, men ingen botten kände han. Men så hörde han en hemsk röst, som sade:\n\n\"Vill du mäta mina vägga, så ska jag mäta dina lägga, så länge du har ko i bås.\"\n\nBonden blev rädd och gav sig hem genast, men ifrån den dagen hade han en envis otur med sina kreatur. De dogo som flugor, och han blev utfattig.\n\n","category":"Vattenväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh02439 · 1516 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 34","place":"Ysby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-51137-E01","start":116,"end":162,"span":"nästan rund till formen, med tvärbranta kanter","modalities":["spatial perception","visual"],"groups":["orientation","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Almost round, with very steep edges."},{"id":"SE-51137-E02","start":502,"end":524,"span":"ingen botten kände han","modalities":["touch","spatial perception"],"groups":["body","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"ingen botten kände han","start_offset":502,"end_offset":524,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Instrument-mediated probing of depth; failure to reach bottom, not proof that no bottom exists.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He felt no bottom."},{"id":"SE-51137-E03","start":533,"end":556,"span":"hörde han en hemsk röst","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard a terrible voice."}],"context":{"place":"ut på sjön","time":"","movement":"rodde ut på sjön"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.491829,"lon":13.109118,"label":"Ysby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52267","id":"52267","collection":"SE","title":"»Wanta-vän!»","text":"På Danzigs redd såg sjöfolket om bård ur vattnet uppsträckas två händer, den ena med, den andra utan »hankle» (vante). En sjöman kastade då ett »hankle» till »sjö-rådet», som om en stund ropade:\n\n»Wanta-Vän,\nHal in i qväll!»\n\nSjömännen lydde råets varning och halade fartyget in i hamnen från redden (vid Danzig). Om natten blef en förflugen storm, då 150 fartyg förstördes på redden.\nL. O. K.\n\nUnder seglingen såg man från däcket en man, naken efter länderna, springa efter fartyget i köl-vattnet; men ingen kastade något klädesplagg åt rået, som snart »försvanst». — Bäst det var, reste sig vid »klipporna» en »vattna-stack» (hvirfvel), hög som märs-rån, hvälfde öfver fartyget och slungade det med det samma på en »grynna» (grund). — Skeppet förliste alldeles; men folket bärgades dock.\nL. O:n K.\n\nKoncept till III: 135 i R 625: 3 (V), s. 27 (1854).\n2 Händer: en m. hankle ur vattnet, en sjöman kasta ett hankle ut, Så ropte sio-rådet om en stund: »Vanta-Vän! — hal in i qväll!!» halade in i hamnen fr. ridden. 150 förstördes. = Råd, n. = (på Danzigs-redd).","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.175","place":"Fårö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52267-E01","start":16,"end":117,"span":"såg sjöfolket om bård ur vattnet uppsträckas två händer, den ena med, den andra utan »hankle» (vante)","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The sailors saw two hands extend from the water, one gloved and one bare."},{"id":"SE-52267-E02","start":175,"end":193,"span":"om en stund ropade","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Called out after a while."},{"id":"SE-52267-E03","start":411,"end":497,"span":"såg man från däcket en man, naken efter länderna, springa efter fartyget i köl-vattnet","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"From the deck a man was seen, naked below the waist, running in the wake."},{"id":"SE-52267-E04","start":639,"end":655,"span":"hög som märs-rån","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"As high as the topsail yard."},{"id":"SE-52267-E05","start":657,"end":733,"span":"hvälfde öfver fartyget och slungade det med det samma på en »grynna» (grund)","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Vessel displacement carrying occupants; no subjective motion sensation explicitly stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Overturned over the ship and hurled it onto a shoal."}],"context":{"place":"På Danzigs redd","time":"Om natten","movement":"efter fartyget i köl-vattnet"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.915838,"lon":19.133377,"label":"Fårö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56180","id":"56180","collection":"SE","title":"Sjörå och näck","text":"De va en spelman här i Skeve som hette Lindblom. Han bruka säja, att han hadde lärt sej te spela utå Näcken. Då va de en pöjke, som äntlin ville lära sej de där knepet, å han fråga Lindblom, hur han skulle bära sej åt. Lindblom han ville skoja mä pojken förståss å sa te'en, att han skulle gå ner te åna nästa torsdaskväll å sätta sej unner brona å spela. Då skulle Näcken komma. Å de gjorde pojken förståss. Men Lindblom han hadde gått ner te åna förut, han, å gömt sej bakom en buske å taji ett vitt skynke över sej. Å när pojken börja på å dra nåra tag mä stråken, då va de Lindblom, som gav te ett vrål å hoppa i åna, så vattnet skvätte om'en. Å pöjken han fick si de där vita å trodde de va Näcken, som kom å skulle ta'en, så han vart förskrämder å la i väg hem mä desamma. Men de där hadde Lindblom rolit åt sen.","category":"Vattenväsen","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.71","place":"Skedevi sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56180-E01","start":525,"end":566,"span":"pojken börja på å dra nåra tag mä stråken","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The boy began a few strokes of the bow."},{"id":"SE-56180-E02","start":591,"end":606,"span":"gav te ett vrål","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Gave a roar."},{"id":"SE-56180-E03","start":609,"end":646,"span":"hoppa i åna, så vattnet skvätte om'en","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Jumped into the river, splashing water around himself."},{"id":"SE-56180-E04","start":650,"end":702,"span":"pöjken han fick si de där vita å trodde de va Näcken","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;C","evidence":[{"span":"Lindblom, som gav te ett vrål","start_offset":577,"end_offset":606,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"},{"span":"trodde de va Näcken","start_offset":683,"end_offset":702,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Narrator identifies the trickster; the boy’s identification is explicitly discrepant, not necessarily revised by him.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The boy saw the white shape and thought it was Näcken."}],"context":{"place":"unner brona","time":"nästa torsdaskväll","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.93837,"lon":15.884715,"label":"Skedevi sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1037","id":"1037","collection":"SE","title":"Bergväsen","text":"Det var en skogvaktare som var öst i skogen. Han skulle gå hem. Å då gick han en ginväg. Så hörde de en hel hop med boskap på den andra vägen. Detta var sent på hösten, när ingen vanlig boskap var ute.\n\nDet var två karlar som stod på pass på en myr. Den ene frågade den andre vad det var för en karl som gick förbi. Men den andre såg ingenting. Det var inte annat än bergfolk han såg.","category":"Bergväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03820 · 37","place":"Dalby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1037-E01","start":92,"end":141,"span":"hörde de en hel hop med boskap på den andra vägen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Pronoun shifts from one forester to de; seasonal anomaly alone is not uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They heard a whole herd on the other road."},{"id":"SE-1037-E02","start":276,"end":314,"span":"vad det var för en karl som gick förbi","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;D","evidence":[{"span":"vad det var för en karl","start_offset":276,"end_offset":299,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"},{"span":"Men den andre såg ingenting.","start_offset":316,"end_offset":344,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Seeing is context-licensed by the explicit contrast with the second observer.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"What man it was who passed by."},{"id":"SE-1037-E03","start":316,"end":344,"span":"Men den andre såg ingenting.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"Men den andre såg ingenting.","start_offset":316,"end_offset":344,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"But the other man saw nothing."}],"context":{"place":"på en myr","time":"sent på hösten","movement":"gick förbi"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"There was a forester who was out east in the woods. He was going to walk home. And then he took a shortcut. Then they heard a whole lot of cattle on the other road. This was late in the autumn, when no ordinary cattle were out.\n\nThere were two fellows stationed at hunting posts on a bog. One asked the other what kind of fellow that was walking past. But the other saw nothing. It was nothing other than mountain folk he saw.","translationNotes":["Folk narrative. 'Stod på pass' is rendered as being stationed at hunting posts."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.649166,"lon":12.994722,"label":"Dalby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"SE-1037-E01","start":118,"end":163,"span":"heard a whole lot of cattle on the other road","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Pronoun shifts from one forester to de; seasonal anomaly alone is not uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They heard a whole herd on the other road.","originalSpan":"hörde de en hel hop med boskap på den andra vägen","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-1037-E02","start":309,"end":350,"span":"what kind of fellow that was walking past","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A;D","evidence":[{"span":"vad det var för en karl","start_offset":276,"end_offset":299,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"},{"span":"Men den andre såg ingenting.","start_offset":316,"end_offset":344,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Seeing is context-licensed by the explicit contrast with the second observer.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"What man it was who passed by.","originalSpan":"vad det var för en karl som gick förbi","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-1037-E03","start":352,"end":378,"span":"But the other saw nothing.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"Men den andre såg ingenting.","start_offset":316,"end_offset":344,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"But the other man saw nothing.","originalSpan":"Men den andre såg ingenting.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"SE:50410","id":"50410","collection":"SE","title":"Jättar och troll","text":"En käring från Basthult var ute och gick förbi Vala klint en kväll. Då kom det två Oval- fröknar, och så frågade hon, vart de skulle gå. \"Te Ramdal och bära barn\", sa de. Och när de hade gått förbi, såg hon, att de var ihåliga bak.","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03605 · 14 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 61","place":"Skällinge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50410-E01","start":199,"end":230,"span":"såg hon, att de var ihåliga bak","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw that they were hollow behind."}],"context":{"place":"förbi Vala klint","time":"en kväll","movement":"hade gått förbi"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.182636,"lon":12.465928,"label":"Skällinge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54981","id":"54981","collection":"SE","title":"Troll","text":"En morgon hade trollen trätt så väldigt, och då sa en trollkäring: \"Jag har levat sju och sjutti ekeskogar men aldrig varit med om ett sådant bus bass som i denne möre.\"\n","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.56","place":"Redslareds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54981-E01","start":15,"end":39,"span":"trollen trätt så väldigt","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Marked quarrelling, rather than ordinary dialogue; acoustic intensity is contextual.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The trolls had quarrelled so fiercely."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"En morgon","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.491985,"lon":12.998289,"label":"Redslareds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55307","id":"55307","collection":"SE","title":"Jättarnas boskap","text":"Jättarna hade kreatur, som gick ute om nätterna. De var branneta till färgen. Det är konstigt att nu kan man aldrig få se brannete kräk, som de hade förr. Bergjättens tjur betäckte korna åt folk.","category":"Bergväsen","source":"Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Våra gamla berätta - Folkminnen från västsverige. Göteborg. s.27","place":"Torps sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55307-E01","start":49,"end":77,"span":"De var branneta till färgen.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They were brindled in colour."},{"id":"SE-55307-E02","start":98,"end":135,"span":"nu kan man aldrig få se brannete kräk","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Now one never gets to see brindled cattle."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"om nätterna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.516109,"lon":11.950556,"label":"Torps sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56434","id":"56434","collection":"SE","title":"Troll och jättar","text":"Di sa att de va en drake oppe i en hage, vi hadde, som di kallte för Björnmarka. Å han hadde sölver, som han vakta, sa di. ","category":"Bergväsen","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.20","place":"Ödeshögs sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"oppe i en hage","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.232994,"lon":14.638012,"label":"Ödeshögs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50139","id":"50139","collection":"SE","title":"Utan titel","text":"En bror till mig hade dött. Det är för en 70 år sedan. En släkting var hemma hos oss, och när far skulle ta hem hästarna från betet höll han aldrig på at få fatt på dem. Till slut fick han se dem. Då gick en svart ko mitt bland dem. Han hade en trekantig vit stjärna mitt i huvudet och alldeles kritvita horn. Det var en ”bergjätteko”, sa far, som hade blivit efter de andra. Mor hade också sett sådana kor. Om en riktig ko lät betäcka sig av en sådan tjur, skulle det bli riktiga kalvar.","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03144 · 6 · Fredrik Skott 2011: Folkminnen i Karlanda. I: Boken om Karlanda. Red. Birgitta Ivansson m.fl. Karlanda. ","place":"Karlanda sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50139-E01","start":170,"end":309,"span":"Till slut fick han se dem. Då gick en svart ko mitt bland dem. Han hade en trekantig vit stjärna mitt i huvudet och alldeles kritvita horn.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"At last he saw them: a black cow with a triangular white star and chalk-white horns."},{"id":"SE-50139-E02","start":376,"end":407,"span":"Mor hade också sett sådana kor.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Mother had also seen such cows."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"för en 70 år sedan","movement":"ta hem hästarna från betet"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.525742,"lon":12.071371,"label":"Karlanda sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50416","id":"50416","collection":"SE","title":"Jättar och troll","text":"Det var en vallpojke för många år sen, som hade lagt sig att sova middag uppe i en backe ovanför Järlöv. Det var en kvalmig sommardag. När han vaknade, hade det mulnat och åskan lumrade. Då hörde han någon som ropade: \"Kasta pliten, kasta pliten!\" Det var knivskea eller slidan, som hängde vid pojkens sida, och i den hade ett troll gömt sig. Pojken kastade knivskea så fort han fick loss den, och i detsamma slog åskan ned i den och slog ihjäl trollet.","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh00862 · 14 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 77","place":"Veddige sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50416-E01","start":113,"end":133,"span":"en kvalmig sommardag","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A sultry summer day."},{"id":"SE-50416-E02","start":152,"end":167,"span":"hade det mulnat","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It had become cloudy."},{"id":"SE-50416-E03","start":172,"end":185,"span":"åskan lumrade","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Thunder rumbled."},{"id":"SE-50416-E04","start":190,"end":247,"span":"hörde han någon som ropade: \"Kasta pliten, kasta pliten!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Someone is indefinite, but source invisibility or doubt is not stated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard someone shout “Throw the sheath!”"}],"context":{"place":"uppe i en backe ovanför Järlöv","time":"en kvalmig sommardag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.264721,"lon":12.330278,"label":"Veddige sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52216","id":"52216","collection":"SE","title":"Spinnerskan vid Nyhage-klint","text":"En Bonde gick engång sent om en qväll fram genom skogen med sin yxa på nacken förbi Nyhage-klint vid Tjeldare i Boge. När han då kastade ögonen hastigt opp åt Nyhage-klint, som alltid varit beryktad för att vara ett tillhåll för allt ondt, såg Bonden till sin förskräckelse en stygg kärring sitta ute för berget och spinna, men med guld-tén: hon såg \"haplig\" ut och med långt utslaget hår. Bonden tog dock mot till sig och helsade: \"God afton i Guds namn!\" - Men som han sade det, försvann kärringen med spinnrock, guld-ten och allt i Nyhage-klint; och Bonden kom lyckligt och väl hem.","category":"Bergväsen","source":"","place":"Boge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52216-E01","start":240,"end":388,"span":"såg Bonden till sin förskräckelse en stygg kärring sitta ute för berget och spinna, men med guld-tén: hon såg \"haplig\" ut och med långt utslaget hår","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The farmer saw an ugly/frightful woman spinning with a golden spindle and long loose hair."},{"id":"SE-52216-E02","start":481,"end":547,"span":"försvann kärringen med spinnrock, guld-ten och allt i Nyhage-klint","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Disappearance is stated in a visual episode; no checking or doubt stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The woman, spinning wheel and spindle disappeared into the rock."}],"context":{"place":"fram genom skogen","time":"sent om en qväll","movement":"gick engång"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.686638,"lon":18.758421,"label":"Boge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53150","id":"53150","collection":"SE","title":"Jättar","text":"Det bodde förr en jätte i Borråsen och en i Hakåsen. Strax bredvid låg två bondgårdar. I den ena av dessa brukade moran baka på lördagen och kärna på söndagen, men aldrig räckte det till åt henne och barnen. I grannens stuga bakades och kärnades det mitt i veckan, och där räckte maten väl till. Moran på det första stället frågade, hur de bar sig åt, men hon fick inget svar.\n\nSå hände det en kväll, att hon stod ute och fick höra Haken och Borren tala med varandra. \"Vad ger du dina barn att äta, eftersom de är så feta?\" frågade den ene. — \"jag ger dem lördagsbakat bröd och söndagskärnat smör\", svarade den andre. Då förstod bondmoran, varför maten aldrig räckt till för henne.","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.46","place":"Ljungs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53150-E01","start":422,"end":466,"span":"fick höra Haken och Borren tala med varandra","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Heard Haken and Borren talking to each other."},{"id":"SE-53150-E02","start":480,"end":521,"span":"dina barn att äta, eftersom de är så feta","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Quoted bodily condition; eating is not taste.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Your children to eat, since they are so fat."}],"context":{"place":"stod ute","time":"en kväll","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.217499,"lon":11.908333,"label":"Ljungs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55159","id":"55159","collection":"SE","title":"Troll","text":"I Nervåsaberget i Lindås Yttergård i Liareds socken bodde troll. Och i Gastahagen vid Tyskan är ett berg, och där bodde det ock troll, och de brukade skaffa sej mjölk och smör och bröd ifrån Tyskan. I Nervåsaberget hade de mera smått om det. Och en gång hörde folket i Tyskan, hur trollkäringen i Nervåsaberget ropade till käringen i Gastahagsberget: \"Va ger du dina barn å äta?\" Då svarade den: \"Lördagsbakat brö' å söndagskärnat smör!\" — Se, det har aldrig varit bra att baka bröd på lördagarna och kärna smör på söndagarna, kan la veta! Och de blev så utfattiga till slut i Tyskan.","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.63-64","place":"Strängsereds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55159-E01","start":254,"end":349,"span":"hörde folket i Tyskan, hur trollkäringen i Nervåsaberget ropade till käringen i Gastahagsberget","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The people heard a woman calling from one mountain to another."}],"context":{"place":"i Tyskan","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.773945,"lon":13.676194,"label":"Strängsereds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1269","id":"1269","collection":"SE","title":"Från gruvor och smedjor","text":"Hällestads socken var fordom egen bergslag liksom också en del av de kringliggande socknarna. Men Hällestads bergslag var den förnämsta, ty här funnos över 50 gruvor med järnmalm, nära 30 hyttor eller masugnar och ett 10-tal järnbruk med hamrar, vilka utsmidde det tackjärn, som i hyttorna erhölls. Dessa bergverk drevos dock ej alla på en gång. Bergsrörelsen började här redan på 1300-talet och stod i sin flor under 16 och 1700-talen. Sedan gick det nedför, och genom ett kungl. brev av den 30 juni 1820 förlorade socknen sina bergslagsprevilegier och lades under landslag från och med år 1822. Några verk fortsatte emellertid, och ur från början ringa anläggningar utvecklade sig de stora järnbruken Borggård, Grytgöl, Ljusfallshammar och Bonstorp. De bästa gruvorna lågo på Malmstorps, Åsnebros, Ljusfalls och Sonstorps ägor. Alla ligga för länge sedan nere och stå fulla av vatten. De förnämsta hyttorna lågo vid Rämninge, Kattrum, Djurshyttan, Svartebo, Djuckerö och Österby. Hyttpiporna hava rasat ned, och blott ringa rester vittna i dag, om det som fordom satte sin prägel på livet inom Hällestads socken. \n\nMen ännu vandra sägnerna från mun till mun, om den tid då allt var liv och rörelse vid gruvorna och de små bruken i \"Hällestadhabergh\".\n\nI den s.k. Storgruvan vid Gruvbacken på Malmstorps ägor arbetade en dag ett lag på 14 man. Halva styrkan var från Sätra by, och åtminstone en del av de andra skola ha varit hemma i Vagelö. Då hördes plötsligt en röst innefrån berget, som sa: \"Ni går för nära mi sängkammardörr\". Då blevo de, som hörde hemma i Sätra högerligen förskräckta och lagade, att de kommo upp ur gruvan med det snaraste, men de andra gruvarbetarna stannade modigt kvar. Rösten hördes igen, och den ropade: \"Nu släpper ja!\" Då var gruvfogden nog fräck att svara: \"Ja, så släpp då!\" Strax rasade gruvan igen, genom att en bergvägg föll ned. Arbetarna dödades ej utan voro blott innestängda men utan möjlighet att komma upp. Alla försök att bispringa dem uppifrån misslyckades även, men genom en springa i berget nedsläpptes \"spritärter\" till de olyckliga, så att de kunde uppehålla livet. De instängda kunde meddela upp, hur fort vattnet i gruvan steg, och de levde i tre hela veckor och drunknade sedan en efter en i vattnet, som så småningom fyllde hålet i gruvan.","category":"Bergväsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 1900-03-13 04:01 · 61","place":"Hällestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1269-E01","start":1446,"end":1486,"span":"hördes plötsligt en röst innefrån berget","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A voice was suddenly heard from within the mountain."},{"id":"SE-1269-E02","start":1699,"end":1751,"span":"Rösten hördes igen, och den ropade: \"Nu släpper ja!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The voice was heard again, calling “Now I let go!”"}],"context":{"place":"I den s.k. Storgruvan vid Gruvbacken","time":"en dag","movement":"kommo upp ur gruvan"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.7425,"lon":15.574722,"label":"Hällestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53637","id":"53637","collection":"SE","title":"Troll","text":"Det var en som hette Trickare-Sven. Han hade arrenderat en gård intill Brättefors. Det var litet smått för honom, och barn blev det ock. Så var det en gång i rågbärgningen, så blev hans gumma barnsjuk och fick barn. Han hade fått folk till hjälp med rågbärgningen, men han hade ingen, som kunde laga mat åt dem. Då tänkte han att han skulle gå till Brättaforsfrua och be henne, att hon tog av rågen åt honom. Han gick till berget och uträttade ärendet. Han såg ingen, men det svarade: \"Det skall jag hjälpa dej med\".\n\nFrampå natten vaknade han och hörde, att det vasade i rågen. Då tog han på sej och gick ut, och då hörde han någon som sa: \"Nippa, Nippa, gör bånn!\" Och på morgonen var all rågen avtagen och stukad och åkern var rakad. — Nippa var ett av de två trollen.","category":"Bergväsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.50","place":"Holmestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53637-E01","start":176,"end":214,"span":"blev hans gumma barnsjuk och fick barn","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Stated bodily condition; pain is not inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"His wife went into labour and gave birth."},{"id":"SE-53637-E02","start":453,"end":466,"span":"Han såg ingen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"Han såg ingen, men det svarade","start_offset":453,"end_offset":483,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He saw nobody."},{"id":"SE-53637-E03","start":468,"end":515,"span":"men det svarade: \"Det skall jag hjälpa dej med\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"Han såg ingen, men det svarade","start_offset":453,"end_offset":483,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"But a reply came: “I shall help you with that.”"},{"id":"SE-53637-E04","start":548,"end":577,"span":"hörde, att det vasade i rågen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard rustling in the rye."},{"id":"SE-53637-E05","start":617,"end":666,"span":"hörde han någon som sa: \"Nippa, Nippa, gör bånn!\"","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard someone say “Nippa, make bands!”"}],"context":{"place":"i rågen","time":"Frampå natten","movement":"gick ut"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.5439,"lon":13.565331,"label":"Holmestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55570","id":"55570","collection":"SE","title":"Drängen och jätten i Garphytteklint","text":"En dräng från Österåker var en gång för sin husbondes räkning uppåt Bergslagen med hvetemjöl och humle, och på hemvägen mötte han sent om en qväll en stor jätte. Att drängen blef förfärad kan man väl förstå, men jätten bad honom vara lugn, ty han ville honom intet ondt, sade han. Han ville blott fråga om han ämnade fara vägen om Garphyttan? Jo drängen skulle resa der förbi. — \"War då hederlig och tag detta brefvet till min broder, som bor i Garp hytteklint, och skall han väl löna dig för besväret. Drängen svarade att den tjensten kunde han väl göra honom, men huru han skulle komma in i berget och träffa Garphytte jätten det kunde han ej begripa. \"Det går nog för sig\", sade jätten, \"du behöfver blott läsa upp de tre portarne och stiga dristeligen på, så finner du honom\". Drängen var väl litet orolig för detta uppdrag, men lofvade dock att lemna fram brefvet. Jätten tackade och så skiljdes de åt. När nu drängen kom inemot Garphyttan var det midt i natten, han hade med flit så ställt sin resa, ty om dagen kunde ingen komma in i berget det visste han — tvärstannade hästen midt uti en backe och ville ej ur stället. Nu kunde drängen förstå att det var här han hade att söka porten, steg derföre af vagnen och började se sig omkring. Han hörde ochså ett dån ur jorden, alldeles som om någon snarkat hårdt inne i berget, och som det ej var på menniskovis, ty hela marken skakade dervid, kunde han förstå att den snarkande icke var någon annan än jätten sjelf. Han gick derföre in i skogen åt det håll, hvarifrån ljudet tycktes komma, och hade ej gått långt, förr än han befann sig midt framför en stor kopparport; och som nyckeln satt uti, gjorde han sig dristig, vred om låset och steg in. Han kom nu genom en lång gång, som lyste som den klaraste kristall till en annan port, som var af bara silfver. Nyckeln satt uti här också och han steg in. Men här låg draken, och när drängen fick se honom, blef han 1 så förskräckt, att han hvarken kunde gå fram eller tillbaka. \"Hvad vill Kristen menniska här\", sade draken bistert? Och det var med största nöd drängen fick fram sitt ärende, ty hjertat satt i halsgropen och hotade att qväf va honom. Han hade bref till jätten, sade han, stammande på målet. \"Ja så\", svarade draken, har du bref till Jätten? Ja stig då på, ty då är du välkommen.\" — Och nu kom han till en port af det klaraste guld, öppnade den och kom så in till jätten, som låg på en bänk och snarkade så, att det grånade i berget. Men när drängen kom in vaknade han, började gnugga sig i ögonen och fnysa. \"Här osar kristet blod !\" röt han och grep sitt långa svärd, som låg bredvid honom på bänken. Nu trodde drängen väl att hans sista stund var kommen, men i förlitan på den andre jättens ord sade han \"Jag har bref till Kära Far\", ty hvad han skulle kalla jätten visste han ej. \"Har du bref till mig du\", sade jätten mildare, \"hvar har du fått det ?\"\n— Jo han hade fått det af Kära Fars broder uppe i bergslagen. \"Ja så\", sade jätten tog brefvet och läste. \"Jag trodde verldens sista tid var kommen\", tillade han sedan, \"eftersom man väckte mig, men det lär väl inte vara så dags ännu, kan jag märka. Tack skall du ha för bref vet i alla fall, och här har du för besväret.\" Jätten tog nu en stor silfverkanna och fyllde den med guldmynt, som låg der i stora högar, med många många tunnor i hvar hög, gaf den åt drängen och lade sig sedan ned på bänken och började snarka som förut. Drängen tackade, tog sin kanna och kom lyckligt och väl ur berget. Men då han utkommen i skogen ville se sig om efter kopparporten så var denna försvunnen. Noga räknadt kunde det väl också göra honom detsamma; han hade fått en hederlig lön för sitt besvär och kände ingen lust att förnya besöket hos jätten. När han kom hem till Österåker köpte han sig eget hemman och fick ändå penningar öfver ; men kannan skänkte han till sockenkyrkan, och der fanns hon qvar för femtio år sedan, och torde kanske finnas ännu.","category":"Bergväsen","source":"Djurklou, Gabriel 1943: Sagor och sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 5.). S. 19-20.","place":"Tysslinge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55570-E01","start":147,"end":160,"span":"en stor jätte","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A large giant."},{"id":"SE-55570-E02","start":1221,"end":1243,"span":"började se sig omkring","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Began looking around."},{"id":"SE-55570-E03","start":1245,"end":1329,"span":"Han hörde ochså ett dån ur jorden, alldeles som om någon snarkat hårdt inne i berget","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard a roar from the ground, like loud snoring in the mountain."},{"id":"SE-55570-E04","start":1369,"end":1395,"span":"hela marken skakade dervid","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Environmental vibration, not explicitly felt by the traveller.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The whole ground shook."},{"id":"SE-55570-E05","start":1512,"end":1542,"span":"hvarifrån ljudet tycktes komma","modalities":["auditory","spatial perception"],"groups":["hearing","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"ljudet tycktes komma","start_offset":1522,"end_offset":1542,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Where the sound seemed to come from."},{"id":"SE-55570-E06","start":1718,"end":1767,"span":"en lång gång, som lyste som den klaraste kristall","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A long passage shining like the clearest crystal."},{"id":"SE-55570-E07","start":1881,"end":1906,"span":"när drängen fick se honom","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When the farmhand saw him."},{"id":"SE-55570-E08","start":2097,"end":2151,"span":"hjertat satt i halsgropen och hotade att qväf va honom","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit embodied idiom of distress; not literal cardiac displacement.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"His heart was in his throat and threatened to choke him."},{"id":"SE-55570-E09","start":2190,"end":2208,"span":"stammande på målet","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Stammering in speech."},{"id":"SE-55570-E10","start":2413,"end":2450,"span":"snarkade så, att det grånade i berget","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Snored so strongly that the mountain resounded."},{"id":"SE-55570-E11","start":2496,"end":2525,"span":"gnugga sig i ögonen och fnysa","modalities":["touch","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Contact plus marked respiratory sound clustered.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Rub his eyes and snort."},{"id":"SE-55570-E12","start":2528,"end":2549,"span":"Här osar kristet blod","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit smell wording; retain attribution without endorsing identity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There is a smell of Christian blood here."},{"id":"SE-55570-E13","start":2553,"end":2560,"span":"röt han","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He roared."},{"id":"SE-55570-E14","start":3380,"end":3404,"span":"började snarka som förut","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Began snoring as before."},{"id":"SE-55570-E15","start":3502,"end":3560,"span":"ville se sig om efter kopparporten så var denna försvunnen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"ville se sig om efter kopparporten så var denna försvunnen","start_offset":3502,"end_offset":3560,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Re-inspection fails to find the earlier entrance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Looked around for the copper door, but it had disappeared."}],"context":{"place":"in i berget","time":"midt i natten","movement":"kom lyckligt och väl ur berget"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","smell","vision"],"translation":"A farmhand from Österåker was once on his master's behalf up towards Bergslagen with wheat flour and hops, and on the way home late one evening he met a large giant. That the farmhand was terrified can well be understood, but the giant asked him to be calm, for he meant him no harm, he said. He only wanted to ask if he intended to travel by way of Garphyttan? Yes, the farmhand was going to travel past there. – 'Then be so kind and take this letter to my brother who lives in Garp hytteklint, and he shall well reward you for the trouble.'\n\nThe farmhand answered that he could well do him that service, but how he was to get into the mountain and meet the Garphyttan giant he could not fathom. 'That will work out just fine,' said the giant, 'you only need to unlock the three gates and step boldly forward, then you will find him.' The farmhand was indeed a little worried about this task, but nevertheless promised to deliver the letter. The giant thanked him and then they parted ways. When the farmhand now came towards Garphyttan it was the middle of the night, having purposely arranged his travel so, for by day no one could enter the mountain, as he knew – the horse stopped dead in the middle of a slope and refused to budge.\n\nNow the farmhand could understand that it was here he had to look for the gate, therefore stepped off the wagon and began to look around. He also heard a roar from the ground, exactly as if someone was snoring loudly inside the mountain, and since it was not in human fashion, for the whole ground shook with it, he could understand that the snorer was no one other than the giant himself. He therefore walked into the forest in the direction from which the sound seemed to come, and had not walked far before he found himself right in front of a large copper gate; and since the key was in it, he made bold, turned the lock and stepped inside.\n\nHe now came through a long hallway that shone like the clearest crystal to another gate made of pure silver. The key was in here too and he stepped inside. But here lay the dragon, and when the farmhand caught sight of him, he became so terrified that he could neither walk forward nor back. 'What does a Christian person want here,' said the dragon sternly? And it was with the greatest difficulty that the farmhand got out his errand, for his heart was in his throat and threatened to choke him. He had a letter for the giant, he said, stammering in speech. 'Oh so,' answered the dragon, 'do you have a letter for the giant?'\n\n'Yes, step on in then, for then you are welcome.' – And now he came to a gate of the clearest gold, opened it and thus came in to the giant, who was lying on a bench and snoring so that it “grånade” inside the mountain [wording unresolved]. But when the farmhand entered, he woke up, began to rub his eyes and snort. 'I smell Christian blood here!' he roared and grabbed his long sword, which lay beside him on the bench. Now the farmhand truly thought his last hour had come, but in reliance on the other giant's words he said, 'I have a letter for Dear Father,' for what he should call the giant he did not know.\n\n'Do you have a letter for me, you,' said the giant more mildly, 'where did you get it?' – Well, he had gotten it from Dear Father's brother up in Bergslagen. 'Oh so,' said the giant, took the letter and read. 'I thought the end of the world had come,' he added afterwards, 'since I was awakened, but it won't be quite that soon, I can tell. Thank you for the letter anyway, and here is for your trouble.' The giant now took a large silver pitcher and filled it with gold coins, which lay there in large piles, with many, many barrels in each pile, gave it to the farmhand and then lay back down on the bench and began snoring as before.\n\nThe farmhand thanked him, took his pitcher and came safely and soundly out of the mountain. But when he came out into the forest and wanted to look around for the copper gate, it had disappeared. Strictly speaking, it hardly mattered to him; he had received a generous reward for his trouble and felt no desire to renew his visit to the giant. When he came home to Österåker he bought himself his own homestead and still had money left over; but the pitcher he donated to the parish church, and there it remained fifty years ago, and may perhaps still be there.","translationNotes":["\"Bergslagen\" is a traditional mining region in Sweden. Note: original text uses historical orthography (e.g., qväll, hvetemjöl, blef).","Historical/dialectal 'läsa' is a form of 'låsa', to lock; 'läsa upp' here means unlock, consistent with the keys in the narrative. Source: https://svenska.se/saob/?id=L_1275-0255.b8DK . No recitation or spell is added.","The ground's shaking and movement towards the apparent sound source are preserved. The source's 'ochså' spelling is left unchanged in Original text.","The heart-in-throat phrase is an embodied idiom of fear, not a literal anatomical displacement. The stray '1' in the transcription is not narrated in English.","REVIEW REQUIRED: 'så att det grånade i berget' is unusual and may contain a transcription problem. The disputed word is retained rather than inventing a visual colour change or a sound metaphor. Check the source image. The explicit snoring and smell remain translated.","'Snarka' means snore; the repeated sound is retained. End-of-world wording is rendered idiomatically.","The idiom about the gate no longer mattering is rendered naturally. 'Fifty years ago' is relative to the source account, not the present review date."],"review":true,"locations":[{"lat":59.28611,"lon":15.019444,"label":"Tysslinge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"SE-55570-E01","start":151,"end":164,"span":"a large giant","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A large giant.","originalSpan":"en stor jätte","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E02","start":1355,"end":1375,"span":"began to look around","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Began looking around.","originalSpan":"började se sig omkring","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E03","start":1377,"end":1475,"span":"He also heard a roar from the ground, exactly as if someone was snoring loudly inside the mountain","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He heard a roar from the ground, like loud snoring in the mountain.","originalSpan":"Han hörde ochså ett dån ur jorden, alldeles som om någon snarkat hårdt inne i berget","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E04","start":1520,"end":1550,"span":"the whole ground shook with it","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Environmental vibration, not explicitly felt by the traveller.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The whole ground shook.","originalSpan":"hela marken skakade dervid","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E05","start":1682,"end":1717,"span":"from which the sound seemed to come","modalities":["auditory","spatial perception"],"groups":["hearing","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"ljudet tycktes komma","start_offset":1522,"end_offset":1542,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Where the sound seemed to come from.","originalSpan":"hvarifrån ljudet tycktes komma","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E06","start":1905,"end":1956,"span":"a long hallway that shone like the clearest crystal","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A long passage shining like the clearest crystal.","originalSpan":"en lång gång, som lyste som den klaraste kristall","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E07","start":2070,"end":2107,"span":"when the farmhand caught sight of him","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When the farmhand saw him.","originalSpan":"när drängen fick se honom","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E08","start":2326,"end":2381,"span":"his heart was in his throat and threatened to choke him","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit embodied idiom of distress; not literal cardiac displacement.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"His heart was in his throat and threatened to choke him.","originalSpan":"hjertat satt i halsgropen och hotade att qväf va honom","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E09","start":2423,"end":2443,"span":"stammering in speech","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Stammering in speech.","originalSpan":"stammande på målet","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E10","start":2684,"end":2753,"span":"snoring so that it “grånade” inside the mountain [wording unresolved]","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Snored so strongly that the mountain resounded.","originalSpan":"snarkade så, att det grånade i berget","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E11","start":2807,"end":2829,"span":"rub his eyes and snort","modalities":["touch","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Contact plus marked respiratory sound clustered.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Rub his eyes and snort.","originalSpan":"gnugga sig i ögonen och fnysa","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E12","start":2832,"end":2861,"span":"I smell Christian blood here!","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit smell wording; retain attribution without endorsing identity.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There is a smell of Christian blood here.","originalSpan":"Här osar kristet blod","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E13","start":2863,"end":2872,"span":"he roared","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He roared.","originalSpan":"röt han","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E14","start":3742,"end":3765,"span":"began snoring as before","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Began snoring as before.","originalSpan":"började snarka som förut","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-55570-E15","start":3901,"end":3962,"span":"wanted to look around for the copper gate, it had disappeared","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"ville se sig om efter kopparporten så var denna försvunnen","start_offset":3502,"end_offset":3560,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Re-inspection fails to find the earlier entrance.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Looked around for the copper door, but it had disappeared.","originalSpan":"ville se sig om efter kopparporten så var denna försvunnen","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"SE:56912","id":"56912","collection":"SE","title":"Skogs-trollets Gryta","text":"En Bonde var engång gången i ko-skog och gick derunder och rökade på sin lilla pipnubb. Han gick länge och väl, och slutligen slocknade hans pipa. Men som han gick, fick han se det lysa bort i skogen: han gick då nyfiken dit åt, och fick snart till sin förundran se en gammal stygg krokryggig gubbe med långt hvitt skägg stå och röra med en lång käpp i en gryta, som stod och kokte på elden. Men i alla fall gick Bonden fram och helsade och bad skogsgubben att få tända på sin pipa vid elden. Men Skogs-Gubben svarade: »Det får du inte!» Men Bonden låt sig inte förtycka, utan framtog helt lugnt eldstål, flinta och »finnekyt» och slog sig eld, så att stålflingor och flintsmulor flögo hurtigt kring, och fick så eld på sin pipa och gick sedan sin väg.\r\n\r\nMen Bonden hade ej gått långt stycke förrän Trollet ropade åt honom: »Hör I, kom hit och tag ur min gryta det smolk som I fällde i henne!» Nå, Bonden vände om, gick dit och såg ner uti grytan och sade: »Hvad ropar I efter, jag ser ingenting som jag släppt i din gryta — det är allt väl!» och så gick Bonden sin väg. När han nu gått ett stycke, ropte Trollet om igen det samma till Bonden; men Bonden brydde sig nu ej mera om det ohjelpsamma Trollet, utan gick sin väg fram efter sina kreatur, men fick dem då ej hem med sig. — Men andra dagen gick Bonden åter ut i marken att leta efter sina kräk; men då fick han snart ögonen på skogstrollets gryta, som stod i askan, men full af silfverpengar och dukater: Bonden tog dem glad och vardt riker man för sin tid. — Slut.\r\n P. H:n Gannarfve i Dalhem. C. Lindegren.","category":"Bergväsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.320","place":"Fardhems sn, Dalhems sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56912-E01","start":165,"end":199,"span":"fick han se det lysa bort i skogen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw light shining in the forest."},{"id":"SE-56912-E02","start":233,"end":320,"span":"fick snart till sin förundran se en gammal stygg krokryggig gubbe med långt hvitt skägg","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw an old, ugly, bent-backed man with a long white beard."},{"id":"SE-56912-E03","start":800,"end":823,"span":"Trollet ropade åt honom","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The troll called to him."},{"id":"SE-56912-E04","start":929,"end":947,"span":"såg ner uti grytan","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Looked down into the pot."},{"id":"SE-56912-E05","start":979,"end":1023,"span":"jag ser ingenting som jag släppt i din gryta","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"jag ser ingenting som jag släppt i din gryta","start_offset":979,"end_offset":1023,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Inspection does not confirm the other speaker’s claimed material trace.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I see nothing that I dropped into your pot."},{"id":"SE-56912-E06","start":1100,"end":1143,"span":"ropte Trollet om igen det samma till Bonden","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The troll called the same thing again."},{"id":"SE-56912-E07","start":1361,"end":1462,"span":"fick han snart ögonen på skogstrollets gryta, som stod i askan, men full af silfverpengar och dukater","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He soon caught sight of the pot in the ashes, full of silver coins and ducats."}],"context":{"place":"bort i skogen","time":"andra dagen","movement":"Bonden vände om"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.262615,"lon":18.339327,"label":"Fardhems sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":57.552223,"lon":18.53389,"label":"Dalhems sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50690","id":"50690","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Det var på ett ställe som pigan fick se en liten fin vante i ladugården. Hon tog den med sig in. Men när hon kom till ladugården kvällen därpå, så fick hon se en tomte.\n\n\"Här har du för att du stal min vant\", sa han, och så slog han till henne. Hon lade vanten tillbaka, där hon hade tagit den, men han tog den inte.","category":"Tomtar; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03685 · 26 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1951: Dalslandssägner. Göteborg. S. 98-99.","place":"Tydje sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50690-E01","start":26,"end":71,"span":"pigan fick se en liten fin vante i ladugården","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The maid saw a small fine mitten in the cowshed."},{"id":"SE-50690-E02","start":144,"end":167,"span":"så fick hon se en tomte","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then she saw a tomte."},{"id":"SE-50690-E03","start":221,"end":243,"span":"så slog han till henne","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He struck her."}],"context":{"place":"i ladugården","time":"kvällen därpå","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.957279,"lon":12.617361,"label":"Tydje sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53832","id":"53832","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Det var en gumma här, som stod och loppa sig. Då fick hon en örfil av en tomte. De är så ömma om djuren, så de ville väl inte att lopporna skulle dö.\n","category":"Tomtar; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 90.","place":"Bjurtjärns sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53832-E01","start":26,"end":44,"span":"stod och loppa sig","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Was picking fleas from herself."},{"id":"SE-53832-E02","start":49,"end":66,"span":"fick hon en örfil","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She received a slap."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.447273,"lon":14.331034,"label":"Bjurtjärns sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56394","id":"56394","collection":"SE","title":"Gårdsrå och tomtar","text":"Ja såg en tomte en gång, å den såg ja här jämter nye vägen. Han va liten, å grön mössa hadde han. Mor mi å ja å så en syster, vi skulle gå å hälsa på en bror; han bodde nere i Gränna. Då när vi kom ve länsgränsa, så hadde syster blitt ätter, å vi stannte å vänta på'na. Då kom de en farande över vägen, så de va så de rök ätter'n. ","category":"Tomtar","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.12","place":"Ödeshögs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56394-E01","start":0,"end":97,"span":"Ja såg en tomte en gång, å den såg ja här jämter nye vägen. Han va liten, å grön mössa hadde han.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I saw a small tomte beside the new road; he had a green cap."}],"context":{"place":"jämter nye vägen","time":"","movement":"farande över vägen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.232994,"lon":14.638012,"label":"Ödeshögs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:780","id":"780","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"På ett ställe ute i Kungsäter, Gårso (Gårdshorn), hade de vesar. Och så på ett ställe i Karl-Gustaf. De drog ifrån henne, som bodde där. Hon hade en liten pojke, som var två år. Han sa till sin mamma en gång: \"Va ska Ekegårdepojk här å göra å ta mjöl i mjölbingen? \"– Ja ser ingen\", sa mora. Det var vesen pojken såg.","category":"Tomtar","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03636 · 22","place":"Kungsäters sn","events":[{"id":"SE-780-E01","start":292,"end":317,"span":"Det var vesen pojken såg.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"Ja ser ingen","start_offset":268,"end_offset":280,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Different observer access explicitly stated; no inferred identification beyond the wording.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It was the vese that the boy saw."},{"id":"SE-780-E02","start":268,"end":280,"span":"Ja ser ingen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"Det var vesen pojken såg.","start_offset":292,"end_offset":317,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I see no one."}],"context":{"place":"i mjölbingen","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.30954,"lon":12.569932,"label":"Kungsäters sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50375","id":"50375","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Det var en familj, som bodde i Vrenesdalen i Laxar-by, som var tvungen att flytta för att tomtgubbarna voro så farliga. De hade ett litet barn, som låg i vaggan. Rätt som det var kunde vaggan börja röra sig så fort, att barnet föll ur vaggan. Det var aldrig fred i huset. Det kastade och slog på vinden och inne på golvet om nätterna. Askan och kolen kastades ur spisen. Ingen kunde bo i den stugan.","category":"Tomtar; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03101 · 12 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1951: Dalslandssägner. Göteborg. S. 107.","place":"Laxarby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50375-E01","start":185,"end":241,"span":"vaggan börja röra sig så fort, att barnet föll ur vaggan","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The cradle moved so fast that the child fell out."},{"id":"SE-50375-E02","start":272,"end":334,"span":"Det kastade och slog på vinden och inne på golvet om nätterna.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Marked banging admits acoustic reading; no named listener.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There was throwing and banging in the attic and on the floor at night."}],"context":{"place":"i huset","time":"om nätterna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.032413,"lon":12.321667,"label":"Laxarby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52987","id":"52987","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Det var en bonde, som var så rik. Då han en dag var ute på sina ägor, fick han se en mycket liten tomte, som kom och drog på ett halmstrå och pustade så. Bonden skratta åt honom, men då kom en stor tomte, å han sa: \"Du kan inte begära mer å honom, för han ä född i natt. Men vänta du tills vi har fått dra från dej lika mycke som vi dra't till dig, så får du inte mycket kvar\". Och sen gick det fort utför för bonden. De skulle aldrig ofreda tomtar.\n","category":"Tomtar; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S. 77.","place":"Foss sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52987-E01","start":70,"end":152,"span":"fick han se en mycket liten tomte, som kom och drog på ett halmstrå och pustade så","modalities":["visual","auditory"],"groups":["vision","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw a very small tomte pulling a straw and puffing."},{"id":"SE-52987-E02","start":154,"end":177,"span":"Bonden skratta åt honom","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The farmer laughed at him."},{"id":"SE-52987-E03","start":190,"end":203,"span":"en stor tomte","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A large tomte."}],"context":{"place":"på sina ägor","time":"en dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.467945,"lon":11.656249,"label":"Foss sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54087","id":"54087","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Tass fanns det här i Dusserud. Det var små rö gôbber. De höll sig i fjusen och i uthusen. Det var så noga att det skulle vara tyst om kvällarna, medan de fanns. Något värre vet jag inte om dem än att farfar såg en hel svärm nere på isen en gång. De hade liksom lek för sig där. Han tyckte att de sprang som i en ring. Det var många som fått sjukdom av tôss. Det var farligt att få tôssbet. Somliga blev nästan konstiga till humöret efteråt.","category":"Tomtar; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 92.","place":"Västra Fågelviks sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54087-E01","start":39,"end":52,"span":"små rö gôbber","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Small red men."},{"id":"SE-54087-E02","start":110,"end":143,"span":"det skulle vara tyst om kvällarna","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Required quiet, not observed silence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"It should be quiet in the evenings."},{"id":"SE-54087-E03","start":200,"end":244,"span":"farfar såg en hel svärm nere på isen en gång","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Grandfather saw a whole swarm down on the ice."},{"id":"SE-54087-E04","start":278,"end":317,"span":"Han tyckte att de sprang som i en ring.","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"Han tyckte att","start_offset":278,"end_offset":292,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He thought they were running in a ring."},{"id":"SE-54087-E05","start":326,"end":356,"span":"många som fått sjukdom av tôss","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Many who became ill from tôss."},{"id":"SE-54087-E06","start":378,"end":388,"span":"få tôssbet","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Reported bite; no pain or cause inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Receive a tôss bite."}],"context":{"place":"nere på isen","time":"om kvällarna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.449444,"lon":11.8475,"label":"Västra Fågelviks sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:656","id":"656","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Det var en dräng, som fick stå på logen och tröska jämt, och det tröt aldrig i ladan, för bonden hade en tomte, som drog dit. Han talte med bonden i gården intill om det, och då sa' den bonden, att han skulle skita en liten hög i ladan, och det gjorde gjorde drängen. Då flyttade tomten över till granngården, och det gick utför för folket på det första stället.","category":"Tomtar","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03563 · 17","place":"Mulseryds sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"på logen","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.700733,"lon":13.813487,"label":"Mulseryds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:4","id":"4","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Tomtar:\nI allmänhet voro väl tomtarna godmodiga och drog till den gård där de vistades. Den vändningen tog ju alltid talet, när det var  \"språk\" om tomtar. \"Den som vore så lycklig att man hade en tomte på gården som droge till en\"  brukade man få höra sägas.\n\nAtt råda bot på elaka tomtar var svårt. Det var inte annat än att söka utfundera orsaken till att de voro besvärliga. Det kunde vara någonting i människans sätt att hantera djuren, som inte var bra. Då fick man ändra det. Tomtarna mutades med mat, tobak och allehanda saker.\n\nTomtar och älvor:\nEn kvinna var en gång ute och färdades; när hon kom på vägen som ledde förbi en äng, kom hon att kasta ögonen nedåt ängen. Då fick hon se en hop tomtar som tagit ringdans med älvor. Mellan varje tomtepar fanns en liten älva.\n\nDansen varade inte länge. Om en liten stund voro de alldeles försvunna. De dansade runt i en ring, hoppade och skuttade, men hon kunde inte höra varken musik eller sång. \n\nTomtar:\nI mitt föräldrahem brukade skogshuggare och -körare få bo om vintern. När dessa kom hem om kvällarna, så brukade de ha ved med sig, som de högg sönder. En kväll tyckte mor att man var ute och högg ved ovanligt sent så hon tittade ut genom fönstret åt vedbacken till. Då fick hon se en liten gubbe med röd luva, som högg ved värre.","category":"Tomtar","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh02415 · null","place":"Högs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-4-E01","start":678,"end":736,"span":"Då fick hon se en hop tomtar som tagit ringdans med älvor.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw a group dancing in a ring."},{"id":"SE-4-E02","start":807,"end":852,"span":"Om en liten stund voro de alldeles försvunna.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"After a short while they had completely disappeared."},{"id":"SE-4-E03","start":906,"end":949,"span":"hon kunde inte höra varken musik eller sång","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"De dansade runt i en ring, hoppade och skuttade, men hon kunde inte höra varken musik eller sång","start_offset":853,"end_offset":949,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Negative auditory access within an explicit visual dance episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"She could hear neither music nor singing."},{"id":"SE-4-E04","start":1228,"end":1291,"span":"Då fick hon se en liten gubbe med röd luva, som högg ved värre.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw a small man in a red cap chopping wood vigorously."}],"context":{"place":"nedåt ängen","time":"En kväll","movement":"ute och färdades"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":61.766388,"lon":17.040833,"label":"Högs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54215","id":"54215","collection":"SE","title":"Tomtar","text":"Morbror min tjänade dräng på ett torp under Nors prästgård. Han talade om, att de hade så många konstigheter för sig där. Om morgnarna så gick torparn alltid åt stallet först och var gång han kom dit på morgonen, så tog han mössan i handen och hälsade. När jag frågade, varför han gjorde så, talade morbror om, att han hade fått till svar, att en skall inte försmå de osynliga, för de är mer till tjänst än till skada. Morbror fick aldrig gå först till stallet på morgonen eller sist dit om kvällen. Torparn var väl rädd för att morbror skulle ofreda de små.\n","category":"Tomtar; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 91-92.","place":"Nors sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"åt stallet","time":"Om morgnarna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.407665,"lon":13.235346,"label":"Nors sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:57021","id":"57021","collection":"SE","title":"Nissen vid Österby i Fide","text":"Vid österby i Fide bodde ett mycket rikt folk. Men nu hade äldste Sonen i huset friat, och den blifvande Sonhustrun var redan i huset hos gamle-folken i Österby. När nu de gamle engång foro bort och den blifvande Sonhustrun ensam skulle bli hemma, lemnade de henne alla nyklarna; men förbjödo henne att gå in i en viss kammare, till hvilken hon äfven hade nyklen. Men, sedan den unga qvinnan beskådat alla rummen och den myckna egendomen, kunde hon ej hålla sig att ock besöka den förbjudna kammaren. Men då hon öppnade dörren för att gå in, fick hon se en liten Gubbe med brinnande ögon och röd stickmössa på hufvudet. Qvinnan blef då förskräckt, slog dörren till, och ville alldrig sen komma till det huset, så rikt det var, der de hyste slika troll.\n\nHos Österbyen arbetade Nissen alltid på Husbondens bästa: om någon af tjenstefolket talade illa om folk, försummade något eller förstörde något af Husbondens tillhörighet, så kunde de få örfilar så att de föllo omkull; men det visste alldrig hvar det kom ifrån. Det hände isynnerhet på logen, om de tröskade ovårligt. Så mycket Bonden tröskade bort om dagen kom dit igen om natten; och granfolket började redan märka att Nissen i Österby drog säd och gods ifrån dem, men alldrig ett enda »slåim-ax». En af grann-drängarna såg en qväll oförmärkt att österby-Mor bar mycken god mat uppå lad-»rinderna» till Nissen. Drängen gick sedan dit, åt upp all den goda maten och gjorde slutligen en konst i fatet. — När då Nissen kom och skulle äta, och fann sig så illa narrad, utropade han: »Jag skall taga ifrån Eder allt som jag har dragit hit och mer dertill!» och dermed så flög han sin väg och tog hela »hus-rykte» med sig. — Och derefter var det slut med all lycka och rikedom vid Österbye i Fide! — Slut.\nJ. Kahl.","category":"Tomtar","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.216-217","place":"","events":[{"id":"SE-57021-E01","start":375,"end":437,"span":"den unga qvinnan beskådat alla rummen och den myckna egendomen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The young woman had inspected all rooms and possessions."},{"id":"SE-57021-E02","start":542,"end":618,"span":"fick hon se en liten Gubbe med brinnande ögon och röd stickmössa på hufvudet","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw a small man with burning eyes and a red knitted cap."},{"id":"SE-57021-E03","start":938,"end":1014,"span":"få örfilar så att de föllo omkull; men det visste alldrig hvar det kom ifrån","modalities":["touch","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"det visste alldrig hvar det kom ifrån","start_offset":977,"end_offset":1014,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Receive slaps that knocked them down, never knowing where they came from."},{"id":"SE-57021-E04","start":1276,"end":1365,"span":"såg en qväll oförmärkt att österby-Mor bar mycken god mat uppå lad-»rinderna» till Nissen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Unseen himself, he saw the mistress carrying food to the barn beams."},{"id":"SE-57021-E05","start":1521,"end":1533,"span":"utropade han","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He exclaimed."}],"context":{"place":"en viss kammare","time":"en qväll","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"SE:287","id":"287","collection":"SE","title":"Älvor","text":"När gräset hade lagt sig i virvlar så hade det varit älvor där å dansat. De kom upp ur jorden. Det var om torsdagsnätterna de var uppe å hade dans för sig. Det hörde jag talas om.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03821 · 4","place":"Dalby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-287-E01","start":4,"end":34,"span":"gräset hade lagt sig i virvlar","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The grass lay in swirls."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"torsdagsnätterna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.649166,"lon":12.994722,"label":"Dalby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50027","id":"50027","collection":"SE","title":"Vittran hämnas","text":"En farbor till mej han föll en gång då han skulle in i porten, och han fick ett sår som aldrig läktes. Dom sökte en visgubb, och han sa att han hade trampat på en vitter, men det gick inte an bota, för han svor i detsamma han föll. Han var bara pojke då det skedde, men han fick ha såret i all sin tid.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 3571;18 · 3 · Ella Odstedt 2004: Norrländsk folktradition. Uppsala. s. 72","place":"Graninge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50027-E01","start":19,"end":61,"span":"han föll en gång då han skulle in i porten","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He fell while entering the gateway."},{"id":"SE-50027-E02","start":67,"end":101,"span":"han fick ett sår som aldrig läktes","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He received a wound that never healed."}],"context":{"place":"in i porten","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.072357,"lon":16.945862,"label":"Graninge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52441","id":"52441","collection":"SE","title":"De »Små under jorden»","text":"På ängsmark bland tufvor ha' de »Små under jorden» i ringar och stigar under sin dans trampat ner gräset. Det skall ej vara bra att gå eller trampa öfver sådana stigar, ty deraf bli folk sjuka.\nChristina Östman, f. 1838, från Garda.\n","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.69","place":"Garde sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52441-E01","start":51,"end":104,"span":"i ringar och stigar under sin dans trampat ner gräset","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Trodden down grass in rings and paths."},{"id":"SE-52441-E02","start":169,"end":192,"span":"ty deraf bli folk sjuka","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"People become ill from it."}],"context":{"place":"På ängsmark bland tufvor","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.319248,"lon":18.58386,"label":"Garde sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53156","id":"53156","collection":"SE","title":"Två nissar slåss","text":"I Gåshult i Hogdal stal två nissar hö från varandras gårdar. En gång möttes de på vejen, och de rök ihop och slogs. så stråna yrde.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Våra gamla berätta - Folkminnen från västsverige. Göteborg. s.42","place":"Lommelands sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53156-E01","start":93,"end":130,"span":"de rök ihop och slogs. så stråna yrde","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They set upon each other and fought, scattering the straw."}],"context":{"place":"på vejen","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.069942,"lon":11.326198,"label":"Lommelands sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:51311","id":"51311","collection":"SE","title":"Viterfolk under huset","text":"På Kasaåsen i Grundsunda var det ett ställe, där dom verkligen tycktes ha viterfolk som bodde under golvet. Där talades det och där skrattades och där gräts. På söndagsförmiddagarna läste gubben ur bibeln, och då var det ett sånt liv så dom blev störd. Då brukade gubben stampa i golvet och säga att dom skulle vara tyst, och då blev det lugnt en stund, men så började det igen.\nDå gumman i den gården dog, så var det en gubbe som hette Anners Jaks 'n som skjutsade ut henne, och då var det så tungt så hästen blev alldeles skummig och orkade knappt dra. Då gick gubben framom hästen och såg baköver den, och då såg han att det satt fullt med folk på, och dom var svartklädd allihop.\nOch det där är sant, för jag har själv hört honom berätta det.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 1365;24 · Ella Odstedt 2004: Norrländsk folktradition. Uppsala. s.77","place":"Grundsunda sn","events":[{"id":"SE-51311-E01","start":108,"end":157,"span":"Där talades det och där skrattades och där gräts.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"verkligen tycktes ha viterfolk","start_offset":53,"end_offset":83,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"unclear","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"sound production","note":"Qualification may concern source attribution, not perception itself; uncertainty unresolved.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There was speech, laughter and crying."},{"id":"SE-51311-E02","start":221,"end":251,"span":"ett sånt liv så dom blev störd","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Such a racket that they were disturbed."},{"id":"SE-51311-E03","start":329,"end":377,"span":"blev det lugnt en stund, men så började det igen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Alternation of acoustic activity and quiet; not corroboration failure.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It quietened for a while, then started again."},{"id":"SE-51311-E04","start":491,"end":553,"span":"så tungt så hästen blev alldeles skummig och orkade knappt dra","modalities":["pressure","bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"So heavy that the horse foamed and could hardly pull."},{"id":"SE-51311-E05","start":612,"end":682,"span":"såg han att det satt fullt med folk på, och dom var svartklädd allihop","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw it crowded with people, all dressed in black."}],"context":{"place":"under golvet","time":"På söndagsförmiddagarna","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.372391,"lon":19.197134,"label":"Grundsunda sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52242","id":"52242","collection":"SE","title":"Offer i Ringar efter de Små under Jordi","text":"I gräset på ängar synas ringar efter de »Sma undar Jårdi», som dansat der. För att få bot för vissa sjukdomar, då man ligger ute på marken, blir hastigt sjuk, får skott eller så brukar folk lägga en silfverpenning eller slant till offers midt i ringen och så gå sin väg utan att nånsin mera se efter den samma. Andra bruka slå ut mjölk eller linfrö dricka eller salt i dessa ringar, äfvenledes för att derigenom slippa allahanda sjukdomar.\nC. Lindegren.\n","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.71","place":"Fardhems sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52242-E01","start":18,"end":30,"span":"synas ringar","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Rings can be seen."},{"id":"SE-52242-E02","start":140,"end":168,"span":"blir hastigt sjuk, får skott","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"skott is retained without assigning specific pain or a projectile.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Suddenly becomes ill, receives a “shot”."},{"id":"SE-52242-E03","start":270,"end":309,"span":"utan att nånsin mera se efter den samma","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Prescribed non-inspection, not failed perception. No uncertainty inferred from prohibition alone.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Without ever looking for it again."}],"context":{"place":"på ängar","time":"","movement":"gå sin väg"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.262615,"lon":18.339327,"label":"Fardhems sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54324","id":"54324","collection":"SE","title":"Vättar","text":"Backfölke skulle en akte sig för. Kom en ivägen för dem, så blev en sjuk. Det var en som var ute en kväll och då satte han sig på en sten efter vägen, som folk bruka å sätte sig på å vila. Men han fick inte sitta lång stund, förrän det var alldeles fullt med smått folk ikring honom. Han höll på att inte kunna ta sig ifrån stenen. Det gick inte förrän han fick läsa Fader vår","category":"De underjordiska; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Trankils sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54324-E01","start":34,"end":73,"span":"Kom en ivägen för dem, så blev en sjuk.","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"If one got in their way one became ill."},{"id":"SE-54324-E02","start":240,"end":282,"span":"alldeles fullt med smått folk ikring honom","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Completely surrounded by little people."},{"id":"SE-54324-E03","start":284,"end":331,"span":"Han höll på att inte kunna ta sig ifrån stenen.","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"E","evidence":[{"span":"inte kunna ta sig ifrån stenen","start_offset":300,"end_offset":330,"occurrences":1,"type":"E","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit inability to leave; mechanism and bodily restraint are not inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He could hardly get away from the stone."}],"context":{"place":"på en sten efter vägen","time":"en kväll","movement":"ta sig ifrån stenen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.281708,"lon":11.902981,"label":"Trankils sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50811","id":"50811","collection":"SE","title":"Vittren hämnas för att de blivit störda","text":"På fäboställen får man aldrig låt om sej (föra oväsen) sen sola gått ner. Då blir vittren ofredlig.\n\nDet var på ett ställe särskilt, som det var så där, och så var det en karl som var där och slog, och han brydde sej inte om det där utan hoje och köke och låte om sej. Men på morgon var skälltacka hans död. Och dom sa åt en, att han fick det där för att han låte om sej, men han brydde sej int om det, utan han levde om och hoje och gaser värre kvällen efter. Men på morgon, då dom kom in i lagårn, hängde bäste geta död där. Hornen var stampe in i väggen, och hon hängde på det viset. Men han levde om ändå värre nästa kväll, så envis var han. Och på morgon var bästa kon hans stendöd. Men han vart tyst då. Dom trodde att annars hade hästen hans gått åt.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 1919;4 · 34 · Ella Odstedt 2004: Norrländsk folktradition. Uppsala. s.85-86","place":"Fjällsjö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50811-E01","start":15,"end":54,"span":"får man aldrig låt om sej (föra oväsen)","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Prohibition on producing sound, not deafness or failed listening.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"One must never make a noise."},{"id":"SE-50811-E02","start":238,"end":267,"span":"hoje och köke och låte om sej","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Shouted, called and made a noise."},{"id":"SE-50811-E03","start":412,"end":459,"span":"levde om och hoje och gaser värre kvällen efter","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Made an even greater racket the next evening."},{"id":"SE-50811-E04","start":591,"end":626,"span":"han levde om ändå värre nästa kväll","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He made still more noise the following evening."},{"id":"SE-50811-E05","start":692,"end":708,"span":"han vart tyst då","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He became quiet then."}],"context":{"place":"På fäboställen","time":"sen sola gått ner","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.814259,"lon":16.397129,"label":"Fjällsjö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52380","id":"52380","collection":"SE","title":"Offer till de »Undar-boniska»","text":"En Bonde på Fårö gick hem från stranden genom Austers Möirhagen, kastade sitt vatten vid en tall der och blef derefter sjuk ett helt års tid. En natt han låg, kommo fem små »undar-boniska» upp vid spisen: de voro stora som 3 års barn, ljusblå-klädda och kallade hvarandra vid namn. — Snart derefter gick Bonden till samma tall i »möirhagen» och offrade der åt de »undarboniska» en gammal kam och en silfver-sked; och derefter blef han frisk.\nL. O. K.\n\nKoncept till III: 198 i R 625: 3 (V), s. 51 (1854).\nEn tall i Austers möirhagen — B:n gick fr. strand, kaste sitt vtn — sjuk ett år. 5 små kommo ljus blå kläder upp vid spisen, de kallade hvarandra 3 års barn vid namn. f.svunno. H:n lade en silfver-penning o. en gl kam. — offer — vid trädet, då frisk.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.71","place":"Fårö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52380-E01","start":105,"end":140,"span":"blef derefter sjuk ett helt års tid","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Was then ill for a whole year."},{"id":"SE-52380-E02","start":213,"end":249,"span":"stora som 3 års barn, ljusblå-klädda","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"As large as three-year-old children, dressed in light blue."},{"id":"SE-52380-E03","start":254,"end":280,"span":"kallade hvarandra vid namn","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Called one another by name."},{"id":"SE-52380-E04","start":417,"end":440,"span":"derefter blef han frisk","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Afterwards he became well."}],"context":{"place":"upp vid spisen","time":"En natt","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.915838,"lon":19.133377,"label":"Fårö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52735","id":"52735","collection":"SE","title":"Lut-grytan och de Små under jorden","text":"En Bondhustru hade en mycket häftig näsblod så att hon trodde att hon rätt skulle förblöda. — En natt, när hon låg vaken, kom en liten grå gubbe in — sedan hon först hört en stund gå och sopa ute i köket —, gick fram till hennes säng och sade till henne: »Skall du ligga så och blöda jemt?» — »Ja», svarade Bondhustrun, »det är väl mig så beskärdt.» — »Men», sade Gubben, »kan Du ej påminna dig, att du slagit ut något varmt på jorden?» — Hon erindrade sig då att hon en gång slagit ut en gryta varm lut. — »Ja», sad' Gubben, »dermed har du skållat de Små under jorden, och derför har du fått din näsblod; men, om du lofvar att alldrig göra så mer, skall det ej ha' någon nöd för dig denna gången!» — Dermed försvann den lille Gubben, och Bondhustrun vardt fri från sin näsblod.\nJ. P. Enderberg.","category":"De underjordiska","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.73","place":"Tofta sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52735-E01","start":19,"end":43,"span":"en mycket häftig näsblod","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A very severe nosebleed."},{"id":"SE-52735-E02","start":126,"end":144,"span":"en liten grå gubbe","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A small grey man."},{"id":"SE-52735-E03","start":166,"end":203,"span":"hört en stund gå och sopa ute i köket","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Heard walking and sweeping in the kitchen for a while."},{"id":"SE-52735-E04","start":476,"end":503,"span":"slagit ut en gryta varm lut","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Poured out a pot of hot lye."},{"id":"SE-52735-E05","start":541,"end":568,"span":"skållat de Små under jorden","modalities":["temperature","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Claim in dialogue; not pain inferred from scalding.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Scalded the little ones underground."},{"id":"SE-52735-E06","start":708,"end":733,"span":"försvann den lille Gubben","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The little man disappeared."},{"id":"SE-52735-E07","start":739,"end":777,"span":"Bondhustrun vardt fri från sin näsblod","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The woman was relieved of her nosebleed."}],"context":{"place":"ute i köket","time":"En natt, när hon låg vaken","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.521389,"lon":18.168612,"label":"Tofta sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1203","id":"1203","collection":"SE","title":"Maran","text":"Om mara red kon så gick en och skaffade kvastar som hade växt ihop. Det kunde finnas sådana på träden. En tog en sådan kvast och piskade kon med och då var det inte farligt för maran sedan.\n","category":"Förvandlade","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04077 · 49","place":"Södra Finnskoga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1203-E01","start":0,"end":15,"span":"Om mara red kon","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"If the mara rode the cow."},{"id":"SE-1203-E02","start":129,"end":144,"span":"piskade kon med","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Whipped the cow with it."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.701351,"lon":12.576717,"label":"Södra Finnskoga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50731","id":"50731","collection":"SE","title":"Varulv","text":"Det var ett fruntimmer, som blev arg på en soldat och gjorde honom till varg, och de såg ofta, hur han strök omkring, och en gång kom han och satte upp tassarna mot fönstret till sitt hem. Då sa glötten, att den vargen var så lik pappa. Men en stund efteråt kom deras far in och såg ut som vanligt.","category":"Förvandlade; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04016 · 29 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 142","place":"Vessige sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50731-E01","start":82,"end":116,"span":"de såg ofta, hur han strök omkring","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They often saw him prowling around."},{"id":"SE-50731-E02","start":208,"end":235,"span":"den vargen var så lik pappa","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Resemblance is explicit, but no later correction or doubt is stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"That wolf looked so much like father."},{"id":"SE-50731-E03","start":262,"end":297,"span":"deras far in och såg ut som vanligt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Appearance sequence is not automatically a perceptual misidentification.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Their father came in looking as usual."}],"context":{"place":"mot fönstret till sitt hem","time":"","movement":"strök omkring"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.976391,"lon":12.661667,"label":"Vessige sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53044","id":"53044","collection":"SE","title":"Varulv","text":"Varulven var som en varg. En här hade smågrisar. Då kom en varulv. Han tog och gav honom en gris och sa: \"Du stackare, du har ingen mat fått\". Då blev han en riktig människa, för varulven blev frälst, när någon gav'en något godvilligt.","category":"Förvandlade; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.120","place":"Hogdals sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.027096,"lon":11.236144,"label":"Hogdals sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:300","id":"300","collection":"SE","title":"Bortbyting","text":"Dä va' en i Gråssry' i Strängsere' socken, di kalla'n för Julle. Han va' en bortbyting, sae di. Han ble allri mer än en aln höger. Han va' förståndier, å dä' va' inga fel mä'n mer än att han va' så liten. Bror hans reste mä'n i många riken å dro' ihop penga' så vällitt. Di kalla'n för Lelle Napoleon. Han feck en klänning å ena värja utå kongen – dä va' la Oscar den an're, tror ja', för länger ' dä' la ente se'n. Di do' i Strängsere bägge två. Han va' allt över femti år, när han do'.","category":"Förvandlade","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh01356 · 4","place":"Gullereds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-300-E01","start":96,"end":130,"span":"Han ble allri mer än en aln höger.","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He never grew taller than one ell."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.798904,"lon":13.591959,"label":"Gullereds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50383","id":"50383","collection":"SE","title":"Mara","text":"Det var moderns eget fel. Ville hon slippa smärtorna vid barnsängen, så kunde hon krypa genom märahammelen, som fölungen legat i, men då blev barnet mara eller marulv. Marulven gick till fruntimmer.\n\nMaran kunde komma in genom ett knaggahål. De sa, att till karlar kom det ett naket fruntimmer, och till fruntimmer kom det en naken karl. Bara det var någon, som sa namnet på den, som reds, så gick det över.","category":"Förvandlade; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04014 · 13 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 138","place":"Stafsinge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50383-E01","start":36,"end":67,"span":"slippa smärtorna vid barnsängen","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Desired avoidance, not actual absence of pain.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Avoid the pains of childbirth."},{"id":"SE-50383-E02","start":273,"end":293,"span":"ett naket fruntimmer","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A naked woman."},{"id":"SE-50383-E03","start":323,"end":336,"span":"en naken karl","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A naked man."},{"id":"SE-50383-E04","start":375,"end":388,"span":"den, som reds","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Named bodily experience of mara-riding; no pressure or pain silently added.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The person being ridden."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.919662,"lon":12.488073,"label":"Stafsinge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53302","id":"53302","collection":"SE","title":"Mara","text":"Det var en, som inte fick vara i fred för mara. Det var en grann pojk, och mara hon var som ett fint fruntimmer. Men hon kom in genom ett hål, som de borrat under fönstret, för att regnvattnet skulle gå ut. Till slut så gifte pojken sig med mara. En söndagsmorgon satt de vid fönstret och slarvade. Då sa pojken: \"Vet du var du är kommen ifrån?\" Nej, det visste hon inte. \" Jo, du är kommen in här\", sa han och visade på hålet. I detsamma tog han ut pluggen, som han satt i det. Då sade mara: \"Hör Engelands klockor!\" och så for hon i väg.","category":"Förvandlade; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.117","place":"Rödbo sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53302-E01","start":56,"end":69,"span":"en grann pojk","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A handsome boy."},{"id":"SE-53302-E02","start":88,"end":111,"span":"som ett fint fruntimmer","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Like a fine-looking woman."},{"id":"SE-53302-E03","start":494,"end":516,"span":"Hör Engelands klockor!","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Listening directive names bells, but does not verify that the addressee heard them.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Listen to England’s bells!"}],"context":{"place":"vid fönstret","time":"En söndagsmorgon","movement":"for hon i väg"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.856476,"lon":11.989855,"label":"Rödbo sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50070","id":"50070","collection":"SE","title":"Drängen band skarpslipade sliar över hästryggen","text":"Det var i Morskoga i Ramsberg, och det var före min födelse, men far tala mycke om'et, och det var sanning mä. Det var en häst där som var så illa utsatt för mara. Och drängen där på stället, han var så rädd om hästen, så han gjorde allt för te fria'en om nätterna för mara, för hästen stod svettig och fördärvad i spilta varenda möra mest. Och drängen tog skarpslipade liar och band fast dom över hästryggen på kvällen för te se om det skulle hjälpa, då inget annat ville hjälpa. Då bonden kom ner i stallet på möran låg drängen död breve hästen i spilta, alldeles sönderskuren av liarna. Så det var han själv som mara hästen, fast han inte själv visste å't. Hä var nog andra onda mänskor som tvinga drängen te gå mara, fast han inte hade reda på det själv.","category":"Förvandlade","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 7377 · 4 · Bengt af Klintberg 1972: Svenska folksägner. Stockholm. s. 244-245","place":"Skinnskattebergs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50070-E01","start":279,"end":339,"span":"hästen stod svettig och fördärvad i spilta varenda möra mest","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The horse stood sweaty and exhausted in the stall nearly every morning."},{"id":"SE-50070-E02","start":557,"end":588,"span":"alldeles sönderskuren av liarna","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Bodily damage described; no pain inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Completely cut up by the scythes."}],"context":{"place":"i spilta","time":"varenda möra","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.833195,"lon":15.706099,"label":"Skinnskattebergs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50880","id":"50880","collection":"SE","title":"Varulv","text":"En mor kunde själv ha skuld i, att ett barn blev marulv. Då hon var med barn, kunde hon passa på, när ett sto fölade, och ta fölhamnen om sig. Då fick hon lätt förlossning, men barnet blev marulv. Slog man till en marulv över munnen, så det blödde, blev han fri.\nEn man och hans hustru skulle söka skydd för åskan i skogen. Så gick mannen undan ett slag, och en stund efter kom en stor hund och gav sig på hustrun och rev kläderna av henne. Sen gick han. När mannen kom tillbaka, hade han en röd tråd mellan tänderna. \"Jaså, din förgrömmate marulv\", sa hustrun och slog till honom med bakhanden. Mannen blev glad, för sen var han fri.","category":"Förvandlade; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03850 · 38 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 143","place":"Årstads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50880-E01","start":122,"end":141,"span":"ta fölhamnen om sig","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Put the foal’s birth membrane around herself."},{"id":"SE-50880-E02","start":155,"end":171,"span":"lätt förlossning","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"An easy childbirth."},{"id":"SE-50880-E03","start":197,"end":247,"span":"Slog man till en marulv över munnen, så det blödde","modalities":["touch","bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Strike a marulv across the mouth so that it bleeds."},{"id":"SE-50880-E04","start":378,"end":439,"span":"en stor hund och gav sig på hustrun och rev kläderna av henne","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A large dog attacked the wife and tore off her clothes."},{"id":"SE-50880-E05","start":489,"end":516,"span":"en röd tråd mellan tänderna","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Trace supports a source-character inference; no earlier mistaken sensory identity explicitly stated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A red thread between his teeth."},{"id":"SE-50880-E06","start":565,"end":594,"span":"slog till honom med bakhanden","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Struck him with the back of her hand."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"","movement":"kom tillbaka"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.914944,"lon":12.685914,"label":"Årstads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:842","id":"842","collection":"SE","title":"Varulven","text":"Det var en trollgubbe som kom in på ett ställ där de firade bröllop. Han bad om litet mat. Det ville de inte ge honom utan de kastade till honom ett ben som han kunde få gnaga av. Trollgubben blev ond. Di dans och hade roligt. Men rätt som det var blev det ett helt lag med vargar av dem. Det fanns inte en som kom undan. Han öppnade dörren och hela bröllopslaget löpte ut som vargar. De blev skjutna undan för undan. Så sköts en varg en gång. Den hade ett bälte inom huden. Det var själva bruden i det bröllopslaget di sköt den gången. \n\nDet var my talt om detta. \n\nDen gubben som troll hette Tyssa. Det är på finska.\n\n","category":"Förvandlade","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04075 · 25","place":"Norra Finnskoga sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.899761,"lon":12.592799,"label":"Norra Finnskoga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:109","id":"109","collection":"SE","title":"Spiritus","text":"Min mor brukade tala om ”dragotter”. Det skulle vara något slags mystiskt väsen som kunde draga från en gård till en annan. Det var ett osynligt väsen. Den som hade lyckan att ha ett sådant väsen på sin gård, blev inte fattig.","category":"Spiritus","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh02426 · 1","place":"Själevads sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.291954,"lon":18.607246,"label":"Själevads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53641","id":"53641","collection":"SE","title":"Bodrag","text":"När Blaarn i Hackebo var död, gick likfärden förbi ett bodrag, som var på väg mot kyrkan. Så var de inne i kyrkan och jordfäste liket. Och sen, när de kom ut, då låg bodraget i botten på graven.\n","category":"Spiritus; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S. 79.","place":"Härja sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"i kyrkan","time":"","movement":"kom ut"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.072041,"lon":13.912708,"label":"Härja sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:851","id":"851","collection":"SE","title":"Spiritus","text":"En spiritus skaffade man sig genom att taga en metalldosa och i denna lägga en peng. I dosan insläpptes sedan en skalbagge med tillsägelse att göra sådana mynt, som man nedlagt i dosan. Pengar kunde sedan hämtas under var dag. Den som hade en spiritus, hade försålt sig åt djävulen.","category":"Spiritus","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03514 · 26","place":"Morups sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.986511,"lon":12.39094,"label":"Morups sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50729","id":"50729","collection":"SE","title":"Spiritus","text":"Jöns Tuvesson hade en liten spiritusdosa. Då han öppnade den, så låg där en slant, men öppnade han den för ofta, så var pengfina heta.\n\nDet gick inte att bli av med en spiritus på annat sätt än att gräva ner den under rinnande vatten, men då måste prästen vara med och läsa sina förböner samtidigt. Ägaren till en spiritus kunde inte dö, om inte en annan övertog den.","category":"Spiritus; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04014 · 29 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 92-93.","place":"Steninge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50729-E01","start":113,"end":133,"span":"så var pengfina heta","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Retain apparent spelling/OCR form pengfina; no correction.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then the coins were hot."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.782498,"lon":12.677386,"label":"Steninge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53729","id":"53729","collection":"SE","title":"Spiritus","text":"Gamle Berggren i Ljunghem hade spiritus. Tjänstefolket undrade, varför han gick till byrån och spottade var morron. Och aldrig låste han säboa eller något. Så var det en dag husbondfolket hade gått åt kyrkan, då var de förvetna och gick till byrån. Och de hittade en ask och lyfte på locket. Då flög det upp en spindel ur asken och flög hit och dit i rummet. Då blev de förskräckta och bad till Gud, och då gick han i sin ask igen.\nDen ska följa dem till tredje led, har jag hört.\n","category":"Spiritus; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S. 73.","place":"Sandhems sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"i rummet","time":"en dag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.984917,"lon":13.762345,"label":"Sandhems sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54279","id":"54279","collection":"SE","title":"Dragdocka","text":"Mormor hade sett \"e dragdocke\". Det var en kväll, när hon skulle gå till ladugården och se till en ko. Då fick hon se en liten, liten käring, som försvann bakom bodknuten. Hon var inte så stor som en tomte. På huvudet hade hon en duk och var klädd som käringarna brukade vara den tiden.\n\nMormor trodde mycket på dragdockor, att de var nyttiga. De drog till huset, så att det som var blev så drygt. Men hon trodde, att det var av ett dåligt åhang.\n","category":"Spiritus; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 108.","place":"Segerstads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54279-E01","start":103,"end":286,"span":"Då fick hon se en liten, liten käring, som försvann bakom bodknuten. Hon var inte så stor som en tomte. På huvudet hade hon en duk och var klädd som käringarna brukade vara den tiden.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Occlusion by a corner alone is not uncertainty or failed corroboration.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw a tiny woman disappear behind the shed corner, wearing a headscarf and ordinary women’s clothes."}],"context":{"place":"bakom bodknuten","time":"en kväll","movement":"gå till ladugården"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.356667,"lon":13.243333,"label":"Segerstads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1112","id":"1112","collection":"SE","title":"Puken","text":"Puken var som ett nyste, och han drog, mest grädda och smör.\n\nDen som ville skaffe sej en puke skulle göra ett nyste, som det var flere färge i, och så skulle hon gå 3 torsdagskvällar till kyrka och skrapa utav kyrklåse. Tredje torsdagsnatta då fick dom sjå nånting, och om dom stog ut med det, då blev det [så att de lyckades få en puke]. Sen skulle dom skära sej i fingre, så det kom tre droppar blo på nyste, och så skulle dom läsa:\n\n\"Jag giv dej blod. å du mej mod - - - - - - - - \"\n\nJag tror det var så där, men jag minns inte säkert, och det var nån rad till också, som jag inte minns, sen skull-n dra då.\n\nPukdynnja hon se ut som grädda, just innan det blir smör. Den ska man bränne i en korsväg, så måste hon komma som bar puken.\n\nDet var en gubbe i Ljusnedal som såg pukdynja på höibräom, och han tog höie och bar det till en korsväg och tände opp en värme, och då kom det en käring dit, en hel mil från sätren [där hon var]. Och håre hängde utefter axlan på henne, och hon var så sinnu. Hon skull opp i värmen. \n\nDom höll henne annars också för att hon skulle ha puken. Hon hette Ramborg.\n\n","category":"Spiritus","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 20428 · 43","place":"Uppsala stad","events":[{"id":"SE-1112-E01","start":107,"end":143,"span":"ett nyste, som det var flere färge i","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A ball with several colours."},{"id":"SE-1112-E02","start":242,"end":265,"span":"då fick dom sjå nånting","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then they got to see something."},{"id":"SE-1112-E03","start":355,"end":401,"span":"skära sej i fingre, så det kom tre droppar blo","modalities":["touch","bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Cut their finger so three drops of blood came."},{"id":"SE-1112-E04","start":623,"end":669,"span":"hon se ut som grädda, just innan det blir smör","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Appearance analogy, not taste.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It looks like cream just before it turns to butter."},{"id":"SE-1112-E05","start":747,"end":796,"span":"en gubbe i Ljusnedal som såg pukdynja på höibräom","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A man in Ljusnedal saw pukdynja on the hay."},{"id":"SE-1112-E06","start":939,"end":973,"span":"håre hängde utefter axlan på henne","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Her hair hung along her shoulders."},{"id":"SE-1112-E07","start":997,"end":1020,"span":"Hon skull opp i värmen.","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She was going into the fire/heat."}],"context":{"place":"i en korsväg","time":"Tredje torsdagsnatta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.858512,"lon":17.645502,"label":"Uppsala stad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:51272","id":"51272","collection":"SE","title":"Bonden som spottade snus på sin spiritus","text":"Det var en bonde i Törnagården i Östra Gerum förr, som hade en spiritus. Han låg så vackert inlagd i bomull i en knäppask, och på den var det ett hål, så att han kunde gå ut och in. Han var dubbelt så stor som en spyfluga och blank, så att han glänste. Det var en käring, som såg honom en gång. Ägaren skulle spotta på honom på fastande mage varenda morgon. Men en gång hade han lagt in snus, då han låg i sängen, och det glömde han av. När han då spottade på spiritusen, fick han två örfilar, en för vardera örat, så att han hörde inte på ett helt dygn. Han var mycket rik, gubben. Spiritusen gick till sådana ställen, trodde de, där de spelade kort om pengar, och där tog han sådana och bar till sin ägare.","category":"Spiritus","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 9872 · Bengt af Klintberg 1972: Svenska folksägner. Stockholm. s. 240-241","place":"Åsle sn","events":[{"id":"SE-51272-E01","start":190,"end":251,"span":"dubbelt så stor som en spyfluga och blank, så att han glänste","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Twice the size of a blowfly, shiny and gleaming."},{"id":"SE-51272-E02","start":261,"end":293,"span":"en käring, som såg honom en gång","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A woman saw him once."},{"id":"SE-51272-E03","start":448,"end":470,"span":"spottade på spiritusen","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit onto-target contact, not smell or taste.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Spat on the spiritus."},{"id":"SE-51272-E04","start":472,"end":513,"span":"fick han två örfilar, en för vardera örat","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Received two slaps, one on each ear."},{"id":"SE-51272-E05","start":522,"end":553,"span":"han hörde inte på ett helt dygn","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Stated hearing loss; no uncertainty about an object or source is implied.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"He could not hear for a full day."}],"context":{"place":"i sängen","time":"varenda morgon","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.177502,"lon":13.686111,"label":"Åsle sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50841","id":"50841","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"Det var en karl som var vid Angstersjön och fiskade en söndag. Han fick en väldigt stor ål och en liten. Då gick han hem med dem och var så glad. Men när han kom in i stugan, så var den store ålen borta. Det var den onde, som hade förskapat sig till en ål.\n","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03805 · 36 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 20","place":"Förlanda sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50841-E01","start":72,"end":103,"span":"en väldigt stor ål och en liten","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A very large eel and a small one."}],"context":{"place":"vid Angstersjön","time":"en söndag","movement":"gick han hem"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.422958,"lon":12.332481,"label":"Förlanda sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53164","id":"53164","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"En spelman, som hette Nätte-Kalle och var barnfött i Hogdal, spela tidigt och sent och söcken och helg. Han var ute en gång och spela en stor helgdag, kanske var det juldagen. Ungdomen rogade sig. När han satt där och spilla, såg han en karl, som hade ludna ben, som dansa allene mitt inne i ringen. Nätte-Kalle tog felan och slog i väggen, så bitarna dröste bort. Han spelade sen aldrig mer.\n","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.15","place":"Lommelands sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53164-E01","start":61,"end":102,"span":"spela tidigt och sent och söcken och helg","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Played early and late, weekdays and holidays."},{"id":"SE-53164-E02","start":226,"end":298,"span":"såg han en karl, som hade ludna ben, som dansa allene mitt inne i ringen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw a man with hairy legs dancing alone in the ring."},{"id":"SE-53164-E03","start":365,"end":392,"span":"Han spelade sen aldrig mer.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He never played again."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"en stor helgdag, kanske var det juldagen","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.069942,"lon":11.326198,"label":"Lommelands sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53893","id":"53893","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"Prästens två pigor gingo en söndag till kyrkan för att få nattvarden. Den ena av dem hade ett halsband om halsen och den andra bar med sig spegel och kam. Vid utdelningen av nattvarden gick prästen förbi pigorna utan att ge dem något. Då de kom hem, frågade de prästen, vad han menade med att inte ge dem nattvarden. Då talade han om, att han sett en orm om halsen på den ena, och den andra stod Skam och kammade så att elden stod omkring henne","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 19.","place":"Eds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53893-E01","start":339,"end":375,"span":"han sett en orm om halsen på den ena","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He had seen a snake around one woman’s neck."},{"id":"SE-53893-E02","start":396,"end":444,"span":"Skam och kammade så att elden stod omkring henne","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Combing contact and visible flame, not inferred heat or pain.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Skam combed her hair so that fire stood around her."}],"context":{"place":"till kyrkan","time":"en söndag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.291111,"lon":13.072778,"label":"Eds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54966","id":"54966","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"Snickaren Johannes i Ryen berättade, att hans far och ett par karlar till satt och spelade kort en kväll; när han var barn. Pojken såg hur en stor, svart hund kom in och gick fram till deras bord och låg under det. Pojken blev rädd, så han grät, men de andra märkte inget. När hunden legat där en stund, gick han ut samma väg han kommit.","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.19","place":"Mårdaklevs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54966-E01","start":124,"end":214,"span":"Pojken såg hur en stor, svart hund kom in och gick fram till deras bord och låg under det.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"men de andra märkte inget","start_offset":246,"end_offset":271,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"unclear","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Corroboration ambiguous: märkte inget may concern dog or crying. Retain uncertainty as unclear after review.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The boy saw a large black dog enter and lie beneath their table."},{"id":"SE-54966-E02","start":236,"end":271,"span":"han grät, men de andra märkte inget","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"D","evidence":[{"span":"men de andra märkte inget","start_offset":246,"end_offset":271,"occurrences":1,"type":"D","status":"unclear","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He cried, but the others noticed nothing."}],"context":{"place":"under det","time":"en kväll","movement":"gick han ut samma väg han kommit"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.260998,"lon":12.994395,"label":"Mårdaklevs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:4879","id":"4879","collection":"SE","title":"Ordspråk der ”skam” är huvudpersonen","text":"Skulle man göra en affär ell. annan handling och detta misslyckades heter det: der stötte han emot skams stugeknut. Var det någon, som hade en särskilld tur i sina affärer och gärningar, men förövrigt ej levde äfter Bibels lära. hette det: ”Skam” känner sej och sina! Hade denne person sedermera otur, hette det: ”Skam” ta´r sitt lån igen! Ger man ”skam” ”ett” finger ta´r han hela handen! Ingen skam ”bju te” (bjuda till) sa´ bonden spände ”oxa” för kyrka! ”Vov” sa ”skam”, när han, som hund, mötte smen. Han tyckte smeden var svart. ”Skam” har många spel, sa´ käringen när hon fick höra ”orgel-verket” första gången! Då va´ no 1 sa´ ”skam”, när han kasta länsman över gärdsgårn.  Nu är gräset ”förbannat”, sa´ gumman när hon använda ”brännäsler” som ”dasspapper”. ","category":"Djävulen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh02067 · 70","place":"Västra Tunhems sn","events":[{"id":"SE-4879-E02","start":458,"end":505,"span":"”Vov” sa ”skam”, när han, som hund, mötte smen.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"“Woof,” said Skam as a dog meeting the smith."},{"id":"SE-4879-E03","start":506,"end":534,"span":"Han tyckte smeden var svart.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Appearance/evaluation, not clear doubt.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He thought the smith was black."},{"id":"SE-4879-E04","start":575,"end":617,"span":"hon fick höra ”orgel-verket” första gången","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She heard the organ for the first time."},{"id":"SE-4879-E05","start":651,"end":679,"span":"kasta länsman över gärdsgårn","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Threw the constable over the fence."},{"id":"SE-4879-E06","start":727,"end":764,"span":"använda ”brännäsler” som ”dasspapper”","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Contact action explicit; stinging/pain not inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Used nettles as toilet paper."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.361942,"lon":12.402778,"label":"Västra Tunhems sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:49959","id":"49959","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"Det bodde en prost på Örsberg som hette Ekstedt. Han kom förbi brunnshuset på Rostock på natta en gång och såg att det ljuste. Huset stod öde då, men det var ljust i alla fall. Så sa han till kusken, att vi ska gå fram och se vad det är. Kusken var rädd, så han våga inte, men då gick prosten med och så fick drängen titta in genom fönstret. Han såg ingenting, sa'n. Men då tog prosten och satte armen i sidan. \"Se igenom min arm!\" sa'n. Och då såg drängen att di dansa med själve Skam därinne, så blodet stog ur skorna på dom. Det var några av Ekbergarna, det var några som var så svåra till att supa och slåss.\n\n","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh01516 · 1 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1951: Dalslandssägner. Göteborg. S.24-25","place":"Sundals-Ryrs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-49959-E01","start":107,"end":125,"span":"såg att det ljuste","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Saw that there was light."},{"id":"SE-49959-E02","start":211,"end":236,"span":"gå fram och se vad det är","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"vad det är","start_offset":226,"end_offset":236,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Go closer and see what it is."},{"id":"SE-49959-E03","start":342,"end":359,"span":"Han såg ingenting","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"B","evidence":[{"span":"Han såg ingenting","start_offset":342,"end_offset":359,"occurrences":1,"type":"B","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Initial failed access precedes viewing through the arm.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"He saw nothing."},{"id":"SE-49959-E04","start":442,"end":526,"span":"då såg drängen att di dansa med själve Skam därinne, så blodet stog ur skorna på dom","modalities":["visual","bodily state"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"Han såg ingenting","start_offset":342,"end_offset":359,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"},{"span":"Se igenom min arm!","start_offset":412,"end_offset":430,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Changed visual access, not an analyst supernatural identification.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then the servant saw them dancing, with blood coming from their shoes."}],"context":{"place":"brunnshuset på Rostock","time":"på natta","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.57666,"lon":12.235473,"label":"Sundals-Ryrs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54174","id":"54174","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"Det var en gammal sägen här om en skomakare, som hade det knalt. Han hittade på med att ta en papperslapp, och så skrev han på den med sitt eget blod, att han försvor sin kropp och själ åt den onde. En torsdagsnatt tog han denna lappen och gick och stack den i nyckelhålet i kyrkdörren. Sen fick han de förmåner, han ville ha. På hans verkstad gick arbetet lika natt och dag. Han fick gesäller av den onde, som kunde allt, och de höll på om natten, när mäster sov.\n","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 13.","place":"Kristinehamns stad","events":[],"context":{"place":"i kyrkdörren","time":"En torsdagsnatt","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.310615,"lon":14.116595,"label":"Kristinehamns stad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52908","id":"52908","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen spelar kort","text":"Vid Körkjaues i Vänge, hvarest Sudergutarne hvilade halfvägs, speltes ofta kort; men qvinfolken tyckte ej om det. När \"manfolken\" då engång, som bäst der spelte, söpo, dyflade och svuro, kom en främmande herre in och gaf sig att spela men dem. Men hustrun anade oråd och skickade genast efter presten. Denne kom straxt och började mana \"den Håle\", som sade: \"Du, du manar mig inte långt, för du har stulit.\" - \"Hvad då?\" frågade Presten. - \"En kringla\", sad' den Håle. - \"Det gjorde jag för min hungers skull\", svarade Presten och började åter mana. Men den Håle sade: \"Du manar mig inte, för du har stulit mer.\" - \"Hvad mer då?\" frågade Presten. - \"En bok\", svarade den Håle. - \"Ja, det har jag verkligen\", svarade Presten, \"men bara för att kunna mana dig till helvetes igen, din svarte Satan!\" Då ställde sig Presten för dörren, manade allt strängare, den Håle måste slutligen förskapa sig till en ål, bli smalare och smalare, tills han slutligen rann ut genom ett hål på fönsterblyet.","category":"Djävulen","source":"","place":"Vänge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52908-E01","start":472,"end":508,"span":"Det gjorde jag för min hungers skull","modalities":["bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I did it because of my hunger."},{"id":"SE-52908-E02","start":905,"end":928,"span":"bli smalare och smalare","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Explicit dimensional change, not uncertain perception by default.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Become narrower and narrower."}],"context":{"place":"Vid Körkjaues i Vänge","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.451942,"lon":18.511389,"label":"Vänge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53172","id":"53172","collection":"SE","title":"Satan och pojken","text":"Den gamle ( = satan) kom en gång till en, som gick och gätte (= vallade). Och han stod och läste vid en sten. Och så sade fan till honom: »Jag skall hjälpa dig till präst (troligen = att blif va präst)», sade han, »men jag vill ha dig om så och så många år», sade han. Och så skulle han möta vid stenen. Och då skulle den gamle ha honom. Men han fick honom inte, ser ni, för när han kom i kyrkan om söndag, efter det dom aftalade åren var ute, så predikade prästen om det, att han kunde rädda, om de hade gifvit sig in till (= försvurit sig till) själfva satan. Efter gudstjänsten så talade han om det för prästen. »Satan lärde mig», sade han, »och han skulle ha mig, för namnet hade jag skrifvit på en sten.» Och så sporde han, hur det skulle gå till att fria sig från satan. Jo, pastorn han tog och döpte honom om, och så skickade han honom till stenen. Och så talade han om, hvad han hette, och det namnet stod nu inte på stenen.\n","category":"Djävulen","source":"Lindberg, Karl H. 1906: Sägner och visor från norra Bohuslän. Bidrag till kännedom om Göteborgs och Bohusläns forminnen och historia 8. S. 266.","place":"Lommelands sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"i kyrkan","time":"om söndag","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.069942,"lon":11.326198,"label":"Lommelands sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54309","id":"54309","collection":"SE","title":"Djävulen","text":"Det var ofta som folk mötte fan i forna tider. På skogen mellan Tutemo och Gräs hade man sett honom; där hade han en riktig stråkväg. Jag tror att det var honom jag såg där en gång. Det föreställde en mycket lång person, och jag såg att det rasade eld ur halsen på honom. Dä brann å lyst å sprut ell å'n.\n\nSkam kom in på ett ställe i Gräs och då liknade han något slags djur, men han hade horn på knäna. Gubben på stället blev rädd och smet ut till drängstugan för att hämta sin son till hjälp, men sonen vågade inte följa med in. Då måtte han be drängen om hjälp och denne var modigare. När de kom in, så tog de fram en postilla och började läsa. Och så ropade de båda, att om själve Satan hade kommit in i huset, så skulle han i Jesu namn drivas ut. Och då fick Skam brått. Han for upp genom skorstenen och slog sönder spjället och försvann. Men det dundrade hårt i skorstenen, när han for. Efter den dagen kom han inte mer på besök till den stugan.\n","category":"Djävulen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S. 15.","place":"Sunnemo sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54309-E01","start":134,"end":181,"span":"Jag tror att det var honom jag såg där en gång.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"Jag tror att det var honom","start_offset":134,"end_offset":160,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I think it was him whom I saw there once."},{"id":"SE-54309-E02","start":198,"end":270,"span":"en mycket lång person, och jag såg att det rasade eld ur halsen på honom","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A very tall person, with fire pouring from his throat."},{"id":"SE-54309-E03","start":380,"end":402,"span":"han hade horn på knäna","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He had horns on his knees."},{"id":"SE-54309-E04","start":655,"end":669,"span":"ropade de båda","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Both of them shouted."},{"id":"SE-54309-E05","start":848,"end":878,"span":"det dundrade hårt i skorstenen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There was loud thunderous noise in the chimney."}],"context":{"place":"På skogen mellan Tutemo och Gräs","time":"","movement":"for upp genom skorstenen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.883301,"lon":13.720556,"label":"Sunnemo sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50419","id":"50419","collection":"SE","title":"Den kloke stillar värken","text":"Det fanns såna där klok-gobber förr, som kunde lite utav varje. Det fanns en sån där som hette Kämpenberg, i Rätan. Och så var det en gång en flicka här som fick en sådan förskräcklig tandvärk, och då tog en ifrån gården och for till Kämpenberg. Och då han hade talat med honom, så sa han: \"Nu tro je fäll dä ha jedd sä.\" Och vid samma tid hade värken slutat för henne.","category":"Kloka","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 11562 · 14 · Ella Odstedt 2004: Norrländsk folktradition. Uppsala. s. 150","place":"Åsarne sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50419-E01","start":157,"end":192,"span":"fick en sådan förskräcklig tandvärk","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Developed terrible toothache."},{"id":"SE-50419-E02","start":345,"end":368,"span":"värken slutat för henne","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Her pain had stopped."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":62.664165,"lon":14.344167,"label":"Åsarne sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55892","id":"55892","collection":"SE","title":"Skydd mot trolltyg","text":"Det fanns inget som trollpackor och annat trolltyg var så rädda för som tibast och vänderot. \"Tibast och vänderot, dä ä dä som gjort mej emot\" sa trollkäringarna. De kunde sätta sjukdomar på folk och dra mjölk från korna, men tibast och vänderot var det bästa som fanns mot deras konster.","category":"Kloka","source":"Elis Åström 1962: Folktro och folkliv i Östergötland. Uppsala. s.32","place":"Kisa sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55892-E01","start":172,"end":195,"span":"sätta sjukdomar på folk","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Generic attributed bodily state; causal attribution not endorsed.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Put illnesses upon people."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.989513,"lon":15.642308,"label":"Kisa sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56773","id":"56773","collection":"SE","title":"Folklig läkekonst","text":"Om någon hade fallandesjuka skulle man uppsöka en person som tagit en människas liv och få litet av hans blod på en flaska. Detta skulle den sjuke ta in.\n\nBleksot hävdes genom att den sjuke drack ett avkok på röllekor.\n","category":"Kloka; Läkekonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Rylander, Gerd 2002: Folkminnen från Mark IV: Sägner och folktro i 1800-talets Surteby-Kattunga. Rydal. s. 66","place":"Surteby sn, Upphärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56773-E01","start":9,"end":27,"span":"hade fallandesjuka","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Had falling sickness."},{"id":"SE-56773-E02","start":155,"end":169,"span":"Bleksot hävdes","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Chlorosis/pallor illness was relieved."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.443333,"lon":12.516253,"label":"Surteby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":58.163891,"lon":12.291944,"label":"Upphärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:890","id":"890","collection":"SE","title":"Svartkonst","text":"Folk ”skämde” hästarna för varandra genom trolldom. De var å skar en stump av linan som var på stegeln där vid avrättsplatsen på Ulvheden (N. Ny skn.). Så tog de några flis av pålen. Detta stacks i munnen på den häst som skulle skämmas, å då blev han svett å skämd.\n","category":"Kloka","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03887 · 28","place":"Norra Finnskoga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-890-E01","start":189,"end":216,"span":"stacks i munnen på den häst","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Was pushed into the horse’s mouth."},{"id":"SE-890-E02","start":239,"end":264,"span":"då blev han svett å skämd","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then it became sweaty and afflicted."}],"context":{"place":"vid avrättsplatsen på Ulvheden","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.899761,"lon":12.592799,"label":"Norra Finnskoga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:4178","id":"4178","collection":"SE","title":"Läkekonst","text":"Om någon hade varit ute och gått och sett något konstigt eller ramlat omkull på en sån plats och talte om det blev di sjuka. Då skulle di stöpa sig. T.o.m. minns jag att di gjorde det när jag var barn. Pappa var skomakare. En kväll då han skulle gå hem från stället där han varit och arbetat, skulle han gå förbi en tomt där det skulle vara som nåt spökaktigt. Där hade gesällen ramlat omkull. Sen hade di väl talt om det sinsemellan. På natten blev han sjuk, och då sa di att han blivit trollkramad, och så skulle di stöpa bly över honom. Di hällde smält bly i kallt vatten över den sjuke.","category":"Kloka","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh00938 · 5","place":"Älvsåkers sn","events":[{"id":"SE-4178-E01","start":37,"end":56,"span":"sett något konstigt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Seen something strange."},{"id":"SE-4178-E02","start":63,"end":92,"span":"ramlat omkull på en sån plats","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Fallen over at such a place."},{"id":"SE-4178-E03","start":110,"end":123,"span":"blev di sjuka","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They became ill."},{"id":"SE-4178-E04","start":361,"end":393,"span":"Där hade gesällen ramlat omkull.","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The journeyman had fallen over there."},{"id":"SE-4178-E05","start":435,"end":458,"span":"På natten blev han sjuk","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"During the night he became ill."},{"id":"SE-4178-E07","start":562,"end":574,"span":"kallt vatten","modalities":["temperature"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Cold water."}],"context":{"place":"förbi en tomt","time":"På natten","movement":"gå hem"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.542221,"lon":12.119722,"label":"Älvsåkers sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54021","id":"54021","collection":"SE","title":"Skydd mot förgörning \n","text":"Om jag vill skydda ett hus eller en trädgård eller vad som helst emot ont så kan jag göra det med trolldom. Och att trolla på det viset det är ju ingen synd. Då tar jag en alnslång tråd som det aldrig har varit sytt med förr och så sätter jag en nål i ändan på den och syr tre gånger igenom handen på en död. Seden tar jag och bär den tråden framför mig och går nio gånger ansyls tunt huset och säger, att allt ont skall bli utanför. Då blir det så också. \n","category":"Kloka; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Lena Calmestrand 2013: Om Ekshärad vill jag berätta. Trollhättan. s.73 [Tryckta uppteckningar ur DAGs samlingar]","place":"Ekshärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54021-E01","start":269,"end":307,"span":"syr tre gånger igenom handen på en död","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit physical contact with a body; not evidence of a deceased experiencer.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Sews three times through a dead person’s hand."}],"context":{"place":"tunt huset","time":"","movement":"går nio gånger ansyls tunt huset"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.18697,"lon":13.491487,"label":"Ekshärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55917","id":"55917","collection":"SE","title":"Bot för sjuka djur","text":"En gång när jag var liten, vart en ko sjuk hemma hos mina föräldrar. Hon svullnade upp och vart så onormalt stinn, så vi trodde, att hon skulle spricka. T.o.m. huvudet svullnade och vart nästan dubbelt så stort som ett vanligt. Nu fanns det på en gård i närheten en gammal lagårds-piga som gällde för att vara lite kunnig med sånt där, och henne skickade vi efter. Som hon kom innanför lagårdsdörren skrek hon: Dä ä trullskott, men dä ska snart va' hjälpt. Så slet hon av sig huvudklädet, och med det slog hon tre gånger på var sida av kon. Vad det kom an på, det vet jag inte, men kon vart i alla fall i ordning på en gång.","category":"Kloka","source":"Elis Åström 1962: Folktro och folkliv i Östergötland. Uppsala. s.91-92","place":"Kisa sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55917-E01","start":69,"end":227,"span":"Hon svullnade upp och vart så onormalt stinn, så vi trodde, att hon skulle spricka. T.o.m. huvudet svullnade och vart nästan dubbelt så stort som ett vanligt.","modalities":["bodily state","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Prediction of bursting is not uncertainty about whether swelling was perceived.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The cow swelled and became abnormally distended; even her head nearly doubled."},{"id":"SE-55917-E02","start":400,"end":426,"span":"skrek hon: Dä ä trullskott","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She shouted: it is trullskott."},{"id":"SE-55917-E03","start":501,"end":539,"span":"slog hon tre gånger på var sida av kon","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She struck the cow three times on each side."},{"id":"SE-55917-E04","start":582,"end":623,"span":"kon vart i alla fall i ordning på en gång","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The cow became well immediately."}],"context":{"place":"innanför lagårdsdörren","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.989513,"lon":15.642308,"label":"Kisa sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56776","id":"56776","collection":"SE","title":"Folklig läkekonst","text":"Om en havande kvinna åsåg slakt eller eljes blev skrämd, kunde barnet få fallandesjuka. Sjukdomen inträdde efter så många år som antalet veckor hon gått med barnet när händelsen inträffade. Eftersom kvinnan går med barnet i fyrtio veckor, kan en person inte få sjukdomen när han är över fyrtio år.\n\nSjukdomen botades på följande sätt. När anfallet kom, skar man upp den sjukes kläder. Därvid började man med armar och ben, precis som när man flår en ko. Sedan brändes kläderna och den sjuke fick ta in askan.\n","category":"Kloka; Läkekonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Rylander, Gerd 2002: Folkminnen från Mark IV: Sägner och folktro i 1800-talets Surteby-Kattunga. Rydal. s. 67","place":"Surteby sn, Upphärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56776-E01","start":3,"end":31,"span":"en havande kvinna åsåg slakt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A pregnant woman watched slaughter."},{"id":"SE-56776-E02","start":63,"end":86,"span":"barnet få fallandesjuka","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The child might get falling sickness."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.443333,"lon":12.516253,"label":"Surteby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":58.163891,"lon":12.291944,"label":"Upphärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1354","id":"1354","collection":"SE","title":"Läkekonst","text":"När barnen blev oroliga å inte orkade sova, så stöptes det över dem. Det gjorde de med bror min. När han låg i ”huska” så gjorde de det. Mor smälte ten eller bly i en stöpslev. Så tog hon vatten i en skål. När ongen sov i huska, så hölls skålen över honom. Så hälldes ur stöpsleven å i vattnet. Vattnet syntes sedan. Då skulle en se vad barnet blivit rädd för. Det syntes på figurerna. Men det fick jag inte lära.\n\n”Vassvetran” var en sjukdom som barnen kunde få. Det blev pletar på kroppen som var fulla i vatten. Ett slags utslag. Det kom från vattnet.\n\n”Engelska sjukan” vet jag, att det var många barn som hade. Det fanns kloka i Dalarna som kunde bota för den sjukdomen. De fick smörjä att smörja kroppen med. Den var gul och kallades för ”rismorning”. Eljest så begagnade de ”smöjträn”. Det var krokiga självvuxna trä. Sådana fanns på finnskogen. Ongen drogs genom hålet tre gånger.\n\nJag var med syster min en gång å skulle hjälpa till å få hennes barn bott. Han hade fått följa med henne på armen en gång hon var till en bäck å sköljde upp kläder. Då trodde hon att han blev sjuk där, så då skulle vi ställa så att han blev av med sjukdomen i bäcken. Vi gjorde som de brukade göra. Vi tog å klippte naglarna både på händer å fötter på honom, å så tog vi en liten hårlock från huvudet å en bit av den skjorta han hade på sig, när han var med till bäcken. Så tog vi ungen med oss å gick till bäcken på kvällen. Syster min tog detta i handen å så ställde hon sig med ryggen åt bäcken å kastade det i å sade: ”Här har du ditt, å nu får du gi mig ungens hälsa tillbaka”. Se’n gick vi därifrån å inte sa ord å inte såg oss tillbaka.\n\nVatten var farligt för barn å om en gick ut med dem om kvällen sedan solen hade gått ned. Så var det farligt att en hade kläderna deras hängande ute om natten. Det kunde komma sjukdom på ungen av detta.\n\n”Skôrv” botade en med att en smörjde huvudet med smör som en hade kokat av söt grädde. Det var lent, så det skulle ta bort skôrva.\n\nDet var många moror som trodde att de kunde skaka å bulta ungarna, så att de blev friska. Om de hade plågor i magen, så var det att vända dem åt alla håll å skaka dem.","category":"Kloka","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03822 · 1517","place":"Dalby sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1354-E01","start":4,"end":42,"span":"barnen blev oroliga å inte orkade sova","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Children became restless and could not sleep."},{"id":"SE-1354-E02","start":317,"end":385,"span":"Då skulle en se vad barnet blivit rädd för. Det syntes på figurerna.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Diagnostic interpretation instruction, not automatic sensory uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"One was to see what frightened the child; it appeared in the shapes."},{"id":"SE-1354-E03","start":473,"end":532,"span":"pletar på kroppen som var fulla i vatten. Ett slags utslag.","modalities":["bodily state","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Water-filled spots on the body, a kind of rash."},{"id":"SE-1354-E04","start":684,"end":726,"span":"smörjä att smörja kroppen med. Den var gul","modalities":["touch","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"An ointment to rub on the body; it was yellow."},{"id":"SE-1354-E05","start":853,"end":888,"span":"Ongen drogs genom hålet tre gånger.","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The child was pulled through the opening three times."},{"id":"SE-1354-E06","start":1597,"end":1608,"span":"inte sa ord","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Did not say a word."},{"id":"SE-1354-E07","start":1611,"end":1632,"span":"inte såg oss tillbaka","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Avoided inspection, not a failure to see.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Did not look back."},{"id":"SE-1354-E08","start":1926,"end":1938,"span":"Det var lent","modalities":["touch","texture"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Texture of ointment, not proof of a named person touching it.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It was soft/smooth."},{"id":"SE-1354-E09","start":2072,"end":2086,"span":"plågor i magen","modalities":["pain"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Pains in the stomach."},{"id":"SE-1354-E10","start":2103,"end":2137,"span":"vända dem åt alla håll å skaka dem","modalities":["movement sensation","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Turn them in every direction and shake them."}],"context":{"place":"till bäcken","time":"på kvällen","movement":"gick vi därifrån"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.649166,"lon":12.994722,"label":"Dalby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:51229","id":"51229","collection":"SE","title":"Dödben kan lånas till magiskt bruk","text":"Jag ska kunna sätta vad som helst ifrån mig ute, och ingen ska kunna ta det. Det är bara att lägga ett dödben i. Det benet får inte förfaras, därför kan ingen ta det. Men ett sånt där ben måste man låna, man får inte ta det. Och då man lånar det, ska man lägga en slant på graven som säkerhet tills man bär det tillbaka. Jag hittade en krona en gång på Holmsunds kyrkogård, den låg vid gången, på en grav. Och jag tänkte inte mer på, jag tog opp den och stoppade den på mej, och då jag kom hem, stack jag in den i väggen. Men jag fick ingen ro så jag kunde sova på nätterna. Det var alldeles omöjligt att sova. Dom sa hemma dom hörde hur det knäppte och lät, då jag var borta, men det vet jag inte hur det var, inte hörde jag något. Till slut tog jag och for tillbaka med kronan och lade henne på graven igen. Sen fick jag sova. Det var nog någon slant som var lagt dit så där som säkerhet.\n \n","category":"Kloka","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Uppsala (DFU) · 3245;2 · Ella Odstedt 2004: Norrländsk folktradition. Uppsala. s. 133","place":"Sävars sn","events":[{"id":"SE-51229-E01","start":575,"end":610,"span":"Det var alldeles omöjligt att sova.","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It was completely impossible to sleep."},{"id":"SE-51229-E02","start":611,"end":657,"span":"Dom sa hemma dom hörde hur det knäppte och lät","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"det vet jag inte hur det var","start_offset":681,"end_offset":709,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Narrator qualifies the reported sounds; he was away, so this is not simultaneous observer disagreement.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"People at home said they heard clicking and noises."},{"id":"SE-51229-E03","start":711,"end":731,"span":"inte hörde jag något","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"det vet jag inte hur det var","start_offset":681,"end_offset":709,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"I did not hear anything."},{"id":"SE-51229-E04","start":810,"end":828,"span":"Sen fick jag sova.","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Recovery of previously unavailable sleep; sleep itself not a modality.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then I was able to sleep."}],"context":{"place":"på Holmsunds kyrkogård","time":"på nätterna","movement":"for tillbaka"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":63.902023,"lon":20.532898,"label":"Sävars sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52375","id":"52375","collection":"SE","title":"»Trull-kärringen» på Östergarns-holm","text":"På Östergarns-holm äro sköna fisk-»lägar», och mycket folk är stundom der ute och fiskar. En tid var det såsom förgjordt: »folken» fingo ej någon fisk utom en kärring med sin dotter (som var mycket grann och högfärdig) som dagligen fick garnen fulla med fisk. Bönderna anade ej »något galet», och alldrig hvad detta skulle betyda. Men en morgon hittade en af dem en grann qvinfolks-sko med silfverspännen som satt fastnad i ett af hans nät. Nu föll genast misstanken om »trulldom» på den der kärringen och hennes högfärdiga dotter, som fiskat så lyckligt; och deras misstankar anmäldes för Presten. Denne sednare skriftade kärringen och hennes dotter så hårdt, att hon måste bekänna sin synd, att hon var en trull-kärring, som medelst onda konster och »Harfräuens» tillhjelp hade trollat all fisken till sig allena. Derpå blef både »Trull-kärringen och hennes doter dömd att mista nacken.\nJens Jak:n Båta.\n\nKoncept till I: 974 i R 625: 1, s. 169 (1849).\nTrull-kärringen i Austrgarnsholm och hennes dotter. När andra fiskare och fingo intet, så fick hon - dotterns sko med silfverspännen satt i garnet.","category":"Kloka","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.521-522","place":"Fårö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52375-E01","start":191,"end":203,"span":"mycket grann","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Very beautiful."},{"id":"SE-52375-E02","start":363,"end":404,"span":"en grann qvinfolks-sko med silfverspännen","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A fine woman’s shoe with silver buckles."}],"context":{"place":"På Östergarns-holm","time":"en morgon","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.915838,"lon":19.133377,"label":"Fårö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:57186","id":"57186","collection":"SE","title":"Tuppolja mot lungsot","text":"En av mina första patienter hade lungtuberkulos. Det var 1912, då jag nyligen hade tillträtt tjänsten som Motala sockens sjuksköterska. En kväll hade jag nyss kommit in till henne, då en klok gumma i 70-årsåldern kom dit och talade om, att hon hade ett effektivt medel mot lungsot. Det var bara att koka soppa på en tupp 24 timmar tillsammans med ett kilo socker i sju liter vatten. Soppan skulle tas in matskedsvis. Patienten, en ung fru med tuberkulos i sista stadiet, var intresserad för ordinationen. Kloka gumman kokade själv tuppen. Det blev ett avkok tjockt som olja, men tuppen blev bara som sågspån. Patienten tog sin tuppolja fyra gånger om dagen. Hon började hosta, om det nu berodde på att tuppoljan var smaksatt med mandelolja eller på något annat. Kloka gumman ordinerade dessutom, att patienten skulle smörjas på ryggen med salubrin. Det var nog bara av artighet som hon frågade, om jag ville göra det.\n\nNej, svarade jag, det är nog bäst att mor sköter smörjningen själv, för det blir nog bättre kraft i smörjan då, svarade jag. Gumman åtog sig naturligtvis gärna att smörja patienten och dela ut tuppolja till invärtes bruk. Men inget hjälpte, inte ens att patienten blint trodde på kuren. Hon dog på vårkanten året efter. Men ryktet om den undergörande kuren spred sig både vid Motala Verkstad och i staden med omnejd. Jag fick anbud från många håll att få koka tuppolja. Jag vet, att receptet på kort tid spreds åtskilliga mil från Motala. Det här hände visserligen 1912, men ännu finns det många som litar mera på kvacksalveri än på riktig medicin och riktiga läkare.","category":"Kloka","source":"Elis Åström 1962: Folktro och folkliv i Östergötland. Uppsala. s.74-75","place":"","events":[{"id":"SE-57186-E01","start":28,"end":47,"span":"hade lungtuberkulos","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Source diagnosis retained as wording, not independently confirmed.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Had pulmonary tuberculosis."},{"id":"SE-57186-E02","start":548,"end":607,"span":"ett avkok tjockt som olja, men tuppen blev bara som sågspån","modalities":["texture"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Material texture explicitly described; sensory channel unspecified, no felt contact inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A decoction thick as oil; the rooster became like sawdust."},{"id":"SE-57186-E03","start":658,"end":675,"span":"Hon började hosta","modalities":["bodily state","auditory"],"groups":["body","hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Uncertainty about cause of cough is not uncertainty about its occurrence.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She began coughing."},{"id":"SE-57186-E04","start":716,"end":739,"span":"smaksatt med mandelolja","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Explicit flavouring, not a reported tasting episode.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Flavoured with almond oil."},{"id":"SE-57186-E05","start":1083,"end":1099,"span":"smörja patienten","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Rub the patient with ointment."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"En kväll","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","taste"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"SE:50789","id":"50789","collection":"SE","title":"Häxor","text":"Påskakäringarna gav sig av på påskafton. På ett ställe var käringen alltid ute om påsknatten, och gubben hennes visste inte, hur han skulle bära sig åt för att få henne att bli hemma. Då var det en skräddare, som lärde honom, att han skulle sätta en stålsax i ändan på sängen. Fram på natten vaknade käringen och vände och vred sig. \"Den rälia stålbroa, ja kommer inte över 'a\", sa hon.","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03600 · 33 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 144-145","place":"Hunnestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50789-E01","start":313,"end":331,"span":"vände och vred sig","modalities":["bodily state","movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Bodily restlessness; no pain inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Tossed and turned."},{"id":"SE-50789-E02","start":354,"end":376,"span":"ja kommer inte över 'a","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"E","evidence":[{"span":"ja kommer inte över 'a","start_offset":354,"end_offset":376,"occurrences":1,"type":"E","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Explicit failed crossing, possibly dreamlike at awakening; sleep/dream not inferred beyond waking context.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I cannot get across it."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"Fram på natten","movement":"ja kommer inte över 'a"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.098282,"lon":12.362289,"label":"Hunnestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54766","id":"54766","collection":"SE","title":"Häxor","text":"Min mor berättade, att det var en karl, som var ute och skulle skjuta tjäder en påskdagsmorron. Han låg på lur vid en stor sten, och då kom en käring uppifrån luften och ned på stenen och ropade: \"Så lång detta ropet höres är sanket mitt.\" Då smörjade karlen till henne där bak med bösskolven och sa: \"Så långt detta slaget kännes så är det ditt!\"\n","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.117","place":"Kalvs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54766-E01","start":188,"end":239,"span":"ropade: \"Så lång detta ropet höres är sanket mitt.\"","modalities":["auditory","spatial perception"],"groups":["hearing","orientation"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Claimed acoustic reach; no measured listener range inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Called: “As far as this cry is heard, the gathering is mine.”"},{"id":"SE-54766-E02","start":243,"end":292,"span":"smörjade karlen till henne där bak med bösskolven","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The man struck her behind with the gun butt."},{"id":"SE-54766-E03","start":302,"end":346,"span":"Så långt detta slaget kännes så är det ditt!","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Quoted claim explicitly invokes felt contact; pain not specified.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"As far as this blow is felt, it is yours!"}],"context":{"place":"vid en stor sten","time":"en påskdagsmorron","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.243015,"lon":13.071114,"label":"Kalvs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55798","id":"55798","collection":"SE","title":"Häxeri och kloka","text":"Nu ska ja tala om, hur en ska sätta rännsketa på e mänska. Jo, en tar å sir ätter, när ho går å skiter. Då ska en ta lite utå avföringa å lägga i en putell, å så lägger en liten järing\" ovanpå, å då, anagga mej, får ho inte skita så rasande!","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.40","place":"Hällestads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55798-E01","start":30,"end":57,"span":"sätta rännsketa på e mänska","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Give someone diarrhoea."},{"id":"SE-55798-E02","start":63,"end":102,"span":"en tar å sir ätter, när ho går å skiter","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"One watches when she goes to defecate."},{"id":"SE-55798-E03","start":212,"end":240,"span":"får ho inte skita så rasande","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"She will not be able to defecate so wildly."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.7425,"lon":15.574722,"label":"Hällestads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56241","id":"56241","collection":"SE","title":"Häxeri och kloka","text":"Sen när Olle ble ällre, så börjte han å ångra sej ve, att han hadde hållts mä svartkonstabok å tocke där otyg, å då ville han bränna opp'na. Men de va lögn de, att de gick. Han kasta in'na i ällen tre gånger, men ho kom utrykanes igen mä samma.","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.36","place":"Tjällmo sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":"kom utrykanes igen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.721642,"lon":15.359876,"label":"Tjällmo sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53327","id":"53327","collection":"SE","title":"Trollkarlar","text":"Det var en präst på Tjörn, som hade svartkonstbok. Då han kom flyttande dit, hade han allt sitt bohag i en båt. \"Vi måste köra upp det till prästgården i kväll\", sa en, \"för här är så mycke tjuvar\". — \"Åh, kommer det någon, skall han allt få stå där\". Och nästa morgon stod där flera stycken, men de kunde inte komma ur fläcken, förrän prästen sa: \"Nu får I köra hem sakerna åt mej\". Det gjorde de ock.","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1947: Bohuslänska sägner. Göteborg. S.130-131","place":"Solberga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53327-E01","start":297,"end":327,"span":"de kunde inte komma ur fläcken","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"E","evidence":[{"span":"de kunde inte komma ur fläcken","start_offset":297,"end_offset":327,"occurrences":1,"type":"E","status":"yes","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Immobilisation versus spatial confusion is unresolved. Broad orientation limitation retained; narrow sensitivity excludes this subtype.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They could not move from the spot."}],"context":{"place":"till prästgården","time":"nästa morgon","movement":"inte komma ur fläcken"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.940556,"lon":11.818056,"label":"Solberga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54170","id":"54170","collection":"SE","title":"Trollkarlar","text":"Min morfar berättade, att han en gång fick besök av en finngubbe. Morfar beklagade sig att han hade så mycket råttor. \"De ska snart vara borta\", menade finngubben. \"Se till bara att du inte skrattar eller yttrar ett ord, när de kommer. Skrattar du, får du ha dem, det är så mycket du vet.\" Finngubben gick runt husen tre gånger och skrapade med en käpp och mumlade. Rätt som det var kom det en lång rad med råttor. Den sista råttan var halt. När morfar fick se den, kunde han inte hålla sig för skratt. Då vände alla råttorna tillbaka. Eljest hade en annan gård fått dem.\n","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Stora Kils sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54170-E01","start":182,"end":219,"span":"du inte skrattar eller yttrar ett ord","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Production prohibition, not failed hearing.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"Do not laugh or utter a word."},{"id":"SE-54170-E02","start":332,"end":364,"span":"skrapade med en käpp och mumlade","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Scraped with a stick and muttered."},{"id":"SE-54170-E03","start":415,"end":464,"span":"Den sista råttan var halt. När morfar fick se den","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The last rat was lame; when grandfather saw it."},{"id":"SE-54170-E04","start":466,"end":501,"span":"kunde han inte hålla sig för skratt","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He could not stop himself laughing."}],"context":{"place":"runt husen","time":"","movement":"vände alla råttorna tillbaka"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.527752,"lon":13.318899,"label":"Stora Kils sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:636","id":"636","collection":"SE","title":"Svartkonst","text":"Det var en gubbe i Krogsereds sn, som de kallte Ålätarn, ja, varför han hade fått det namnet, vet jag inte. Han kunde stämma blod, och han visste på förhand, vad de ville, när det kom någon och sökte honom. En gång kom det en karl och sökte denne Ålätarn, för det var en som hade huggit sig så illa, så han höll på att förblå. Och denne karlen sprang, så fort han orkade. \n\nMen när han kom så nära, så det var lönt att ropa på honom, så skrek Ålätarn, \"Du behöver inte springa så, för jag har allt hjälpt det.\"","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh01584 · 16","place":"Askome sn","events":[{"id":"SE-636-E01","start":280,"end":325,"span":"huggit sig så illa, så han höll på att förblå","modalities":["touch","bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Cut himself so badly that he was nearly bleeding to death."},{"id":"SE-636-E02","start":434,"end":450,"span":"så skrek Ålätarn","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then Ålätarn shouted."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":"sprang, så fort han orkade"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.017235,"lon":12.666604,"label":"Askome sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:979","id":"979","collection":"SE","title":"Häxor och trollkarlar","text":"Vervispen (vädervispar o virvelvind) var folk rädda för. Far höll på att räfsa hö en gång. Då kom en sådan och tog en halv höhesja med sig. Farmor varnade alltid oss barn att vi inte skulle säga något fördelaktigt om vervispar. Farmor och en tös gick på vägen. Då kom det en vervisp. Tösen kunde inte tiga utan sade: \"Blås, Kajsa och låt sjögossar segla!\" Hon blev stum i flera dagar därefter. Det var trolltyg i vervispen.","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh05202 · 33","place":"","events":[{"id":"SE-979-E01","start":356,"end":393,"span":"Hon blev stum i flera dagar därefter.","modalities":["auditory","bodily state"],"groups":["hearing","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Unavailable speech production; not inability to hear.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"She became mute for several days afterwards."}],"context":{"place":"på vägen","time":"","movement":"gick på vägen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"SE:354","id":"354","collection":"SE","title":"Trolldom   ","text":"På en gård i Stafsinge, där berätterskans mor Beata Mårtensdotter, hade tjänst som piga, gick det ofta lite underligt till. Vid ett tillfälle skulle Beata elda i bakugnen men kunde omöjligt få det att brinna, fastän hon uppbjöd hela sin förmåga. I sitt trångmål vände hon sig till matmodern, \"så skall jag försöka!\" Inkommen i stugan kunde Beata dock inte motstå sin nyfikenhet utan gläntade på dörren till köket. Hon såg då gumman stå framför spiseln och rulla en \"halvstopaflaska\", som hon höll om halsen, fram och åter i ugnsöppningen. I detsamma fick hon se Beata i dörrspringan och utbrast förtörnad: \"Vad skulle du här nu?\" Men i ugnen brann det, så det dånade.","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh00836 · 6","place":"Stafsinge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-354-E01","start":414,"end":482,"span":"Hon såg då gumman stå framför spiseln och rulla en \"halvstopaflaska\"","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw the woman before the stove rolling a bottle."},{"id":"SE-354-E02","start":550,"end":582,"span":"fick hon se Beata i dörrspringan","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Narrow aperture is stated but no inability or incompleteness is asserted; no B code.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"She saw Beata through the crack in the door."},{"id":"SE-354-E03","start":634,"end":666,"span":"i ugnen brann det, så det dånade","modalities":["auditory","visual"],"groups":["hearing","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The oven burned with a roar."}],"context":{"place":"framför spiseln","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.919662,"lon":12.488073,"label":"Stafsinge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54260","id":"54260","collection":"SE","title":"Häxor","text":"Det var på ett ställe en handlande kom in och ville ha logi. Det var om påskkvällen. \"Det kan du inte få\", sade käringen, \"för det är ju påsknatten\". Han gav sig inte. \"När sover du som bäst?\" frågade hon. \"När jag blundar som mest\", svarade han. \"Då får du väl lägga dig då\", sade hon. När det blev natt och mörkt, gick käringen upp i spisen och sade: \"I vär å i vind, i helskock ska jag in\". Så for hon ut genom skorstenen. Då smög han sig upp i spisen och sade: \"Här upp och här ned\". \"Tocken sa inte mamma\", skrek dottern. Då skrek han detsamma som hon, men då bar det iväg. När han kom till helskock, så fick han se henne. Då gick han fram och skar av henne näsan för att hon skulle vara märkt och bli igenkänd.\n","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar; Klokskap och svartkonst","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Ransäters sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54260-E01","start":287,"end":314,"span":"När det blev natt och mörkt","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"When night came and it grew dark."},{"id":"SE-54260-E02","start":488,"end":526,"span":"\"Tocken sa inte mamma\", skrek dottern.","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"“Mother did not say that,” the daughter shouted."},{"id":"SE-54260-E03","start":527,"end":556,"span":"Då skrek han detsamma som hon","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then he shouted the same as her."},{"id":"SE-54260-E04","start":562,"end":577,"span":"då bar det iväg","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then he was carried away."},{"id":"SE-54260-E05","start":606,"end":626,"span":"så fick han se henne","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Then he saw her."},{"id":"SE-54260-E06","start":649,"end":668,"span":"skar av henne näsan","modalities":["touch","bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Cut off her nose."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"påskkvällen","movement":"bar det iväg"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.769745,"lon":13.450001,"label":"Ransäters sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56101","id":"56101","collection":"SE","title":"Häxeri och kloka","text":"Ja hörde berättas, att mjölnarn där ve Holmens kvarn hadde blitt å mä flera styckna tomsäcka. Å han försto ju, att di hadde blitt stulna. Då gick han te den där gumma i Råby å frågte'na te råds. Å ho sa, vem de va, som hadde stuli säcka för'en. De va e kärng, som bodde strax inte kvarna. »Så nu vet du, var du ska få rett på säcka», sa gumma. Å sen to ho å ret opp ett ansikte på ett stycke papper å fäste opp på vägga. »Nu kan du ta å sticka mä kniven i de här ansiktet», sa ho, »så får tjuven betalt för besväret». Men de ville han inte göra på villkör förståss, utan han va gla bara att han hadde fått veta, var säcka fanns. Å när han kom hem te den där känga, så fanns allt säcka där mä!","category":"Häxor och trollkarlar","source":"Sven Rothman 1941: Östgötska folkminnen. Uppsala. s.45","place":"Risinge sn","events":[],"context":{"place":"ve Holmens kvarn","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":[],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.701473,"lon":15.850715,"label":"Risinge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52290","id":"52290","collection":"SE","title":"Bjèren., m. def.","text":"Onda menniskor kunna göra »bjeren» af särka- och skjorta-»falldar» (fållar), »kär'o-dokar» (disk-trasor), byxlinningar och knutar i början på väfven: och sedan svära de så styggt, att »bjeren» får lif och går hvart de behaga. — När man skär i smöret med en knif, som är magnet-stål uti, så ser man blodet rinna om knifven och smöret.\nL. O. K.","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.222","place":"Fårö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52290-E01","start":160,"end":178,"span":"svära de så styggt","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Marked vehement speech, not ordinary dialogue.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They swear so terribly."},{"id":"SE-52290-E02","start":287,"end":332,"span":"så ser man blodet rinna om knifven och smöret","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"One sees blood running around the knife and butter."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.915838,"lon":19.133377,"label":"Fårö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54143","id":"54143","collection":"SE","title":"Mjölkharar","text":"Det var en slags hare, som di kalla för sölvehare. Han var gjord av sölv, som begagnades i väven. Di träffa på sådana harar i skogen, och det gick inte att skjuta dem.\nDen haren hade inte mer än tre ben och ett öga. Skam hade hjälpt till att göra den, och han kunde inte göra det riktigt, som det skulle vara.\n","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Hammarö sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54143-E01","start":183,"end":214,"span":"inte mer än tre ben och ett öga","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Only three legs and one eye."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.335911,"lon":13.523158,"label":"Hammarö sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56555","id":"56555","collection":"SE","title":"Mjölkharen","text":"En mjölkhare kunde man göra sig av lite tråd och lite sölv. Där var en gumma i skogen i Berghem som inte hade någon ko. Trots detta var hon alltid välförsedd med mjölk. En gång kom en karl händelsevis på besök i stugan. Då fick han se mjölkharen spy ut mjölk åt gumman.\n","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Rylander, Gerd 2002: Folkminnen från Mark IV: Sägner och folktro i 1800-talets Surteby-Kattunga. Rydal. s. 110","place":"Surteby sn, Upphärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56555-E01","start":220,"end":269,"span":"Då fick han se mjölkharen spy ut mjölk åt gumman.","modalities":["visual","bodily state"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Visible bodily expulsion; no taste or nausea inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw the milk-hare vomit milk for the woman."}],"context":{"place":"i stugan","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.443333,"lon":12.516253,"label":"Surteby sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":58.163891,"lon":12.291944,"label":"Upphärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:52632","id":"52632","collection":"SE","title":"Jagt och Djurfång","text":"[— — —]\nInspektoren på klostret C. Fr. Björkander [...] Under en jagt i Hej de en del dag, då B. skjutit 14 skott på samma hare, gnäggade denne som ett föl och ficks icke, ty det var väl en äkta trull-hare; och derpå gick han (B.) oupphörligt vilse i skogen samt höll på att aldrig komma till bygd igen (XIII: 118).\nC. Fr. Björkander.\n[— — —]","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.209","place":"Roma sn","events":[{"id":"SE-52632-E01","start":129,"end":155,"span":"gnäggade denne som ett föl","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It neighed like a foal."},{"id":"SE-52632-E02","start":217,"end":302,"span":"gick han (B.) oupphörligt vilse i skogen samt höll på att aldrig komma till bygd igen","modalities":["orientation"],"groups":["orientation"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"E","evidence":[{"span":"oupphörligt vilse i skogen samt höll på att aldrig komma till bygd igen","start_offset":231,"end_offset":302,"occurrences":1,"type":"E","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He repeatedly became lost in the forest and nearly never reached settlement again."}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"","movement":"oupphörligt vilse"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["hearing","orientation"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.504185,"lon":18.4603,"label":"Roma sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53849","id":"53849","collection":"SE","title":"Mjölkharar","text":"Det gick inte att få en pukhare annat än med den ondes hjälp. På nyårsnatten skulle han göras. Då skulle man ha en gammal kvast eller visp med, som var stulen. Kohår och svinborst och allt sådant, som man hade stulit med sig från andra, skulle man ta med till kyrkan. Där fick man se den onde, och han gjorde liv i detta.\n\nPukharen drog hem mjölk. När han kom med mjölken, så spydde han upp den i fat, som ställts fram.\n","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Botilsäters sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53849-E01","start":268,"end":292,"span":"Där fick man se den onde","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"There one got to see the evil one."},{"id":"SE-53849-E02","start":376,"end":394,"span":"spydde han upp den","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Explicit vomiting; no taste or nausea inferred.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He vomited it up."}],"context":{"place":"till kyrkan","time":"På nyårsnatten","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.046261,"lon":13.091725,"label":"Botilsäters sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55056","id":"55056","collection":"SE","title":"Bjäran","text":"Mjölkaharar laga de till med solv och spingestickor. Det var de som kunde skjuta mjölkaharar. Men det var visst med nånting konstigt de skulle ladda då. De kunde få se dem borta i lagårdar. De gick och mjölka korna; de mjölka ingenting sen.\n\nDet sköt upp gult borta på dyngan, det blev som löe; det såg ut riktigt som smör. Det kallte de trollsmör. De trodde det var nån, som hade förtrollat det.\n","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen; Övernaturliga väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Kjell Berglund u.å.: Folkminnen från Skephult.","place":"Skephults sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55056-E01","start":153,"end":189,"span":"De kunde få se dem borta i lagårdar.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They could see them in barns."},{"id":"SE-55056-E02","start":242,"end":323,"span":"Det sköt upp gult borta på dyngan, det blev som löe; det såg ut riktigt som smör.","modalities":["visual","texture"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Material appearance and consistency; not taste. Similarity alone is not coded as doubt.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Yellow material rose on the dung heap, becoming like froth and looking like butter."}],"context":{"place":"borta i lagårdar","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.537773,"lon":12.881137,"label":"Skephults sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:53926","id":"53926","collection":"SE","title":"”Puken” \n","text":"Puken det var en som de trollkunniga hade till hjälp när de skulle mjölka andras kor så då behövde de inte gå själva utan skickade bara iväg honom. Han kunde skifta utseende och göra sig osynlig. Ibland kunde det nog hända att han mjölkade ihjäl korna. Man kunde se märken efter honom där han brukade gå fram. ”Pukedyngan” är gulvit och är tjockare än välling men tunnare än gröt. Jag har sett den många gånger vid en hop ”fygges” (ladugårdar), men nu har jag inte sett det på länge. Pukedyngan luktar eländigt så när det är någon som fiser riktigt ont så brukar de säga att det luktar som pukedynga. \nskoge","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Lena Calmestrand 2013: Om Ekshärad vill jag berätta. Trollhättan. s. 107 [Tryckta uppteckningar ur DAGs samlingar]","place":"Ekshärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-53926-E02","start":253,"end":309,"span":"Man kunde se märken efter honom där han brukade gå fram.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"One could see traces where he used to pass."},{"id":"SE-53926-E03","start":310,"end":380,"span":"”Pukedyngan” är gulvit och är tjockare än välling men tunnare än gröt.","modalities":["visual","texture"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The material is yellow-white, thicker than gruel but thinner than porridge."},{"id":"SE-53926-E04","start":381,"end":443,"span":"Jag har sett den många gånger vid en hop ”fygges” (ladugårdar)","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"I have seen it many times beside barns."},{"id":"SE-53926-E05","start":449,"end":482,"span":"nu har jag inte sett det på länge","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Absence over time; no deliberate re-inspection stated.","confidence":"high","polarity":"negative perception","gloss":"Now I have not seen it for a long time."},{"id":"SE-53926-E06","start":484,"end":600,"span":"Pukedyngan luktar eländigt så när det är någon som fiser riktigt ont så brukar de säga att det luktar som pukedynga.","modalities":["smell"],"groups":["smell"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"One generic smell-description cluster, including an explicit comparison.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It smells dreadful; especially foul flatulence is compared to it."}],"context":{"place":"vid en hop ”fygges” (ladugårdar)","time":"","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","smell","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.18697,"lon":13.491487,"label":"Ekshärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:56499","id":"56499","collection":"SE","title":"»Stajngajt» (eller Troll-hare)","text":"En gammal Bonde, som var skytt, hade många gånger under jagten försökt att komma åt en viss hare, hvilken han, i anseende till hans ovanliga gång i jagten utan de vanliga bugterna för hunden utan i rak linea milstals åstad, kallade för en trollhare eller »stajn-gajt». Som Bonden flere gånger förgäfves varit i håll med denne Trollharen och nu redan var äldre karl och ej orkade mera så raskt följa jagten — ty haren ville ju aldrig som andra harar bugta för hunden —, laddade han en gång bössan på sitt eget sätt, och bad sin son taga hunden med sig och ge sig af för att ändtligen knäppa den förargelige Jössen.\n\nNå, Sonen gaf sig till skogs, fick snart opp, och efter några bugter, kom han i håll och skjöt haren knall och fall i en hage närmast in till gården. Som det nu var så nära hemmet, brydde han sig ej om att »tar ut» haren i skogen, utan kastade honom på nacken, steg öfver hag-tunen till en åker straxt vid gården och var redan nästan i gård; då han tyckte att haren blef så tung. När han vände sig om, såg han— såsom det visade för hans ögon — att haren var blefven ofantligt stor och så lång att han räckte ända tvers öfver åkern bort till hag-tunen som han klifvit öfver. Jägaren blef då förskräckt, spottade för sig och kastade haren ifrån sig. — Då bar det af med ett förfärligt gny och dån i skogen, kan man tänka! — Bondens Son kom nu hem och berättade för Fadren hvad som händt, då Gubben svarade: »Ja, jag kunde ju tänka att det var en 'stajn-gait' — spirante marack!!» — Men Sonen blef en lång tid sjuk efter den jagten. — Slut.\nP. Ronander. Th. Fr. Budin, pastor i Kräklingbo.\n\nBonden, Mjölbjergen i Roma, hade redan i Möllbjers hagen tagit ur haren och spisat hunden, och satt benen på kors och hängt haren på bössan — — lång, tung — — Bonden spottade, kastade bort haren och sade: »Packa dig af — —!» Då trollet ropade i skogen härmande:. »Packa dig af — —!» A. Bolin, Roma.","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.207-208","place":"Rone sn, Lye sn, Roma sn","events":[{"id":"SE-56499-E01","start":369,"end":405,"span":"ej orkade mera så raskt följa jagten","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He no longer had the strength to follow the hunt so briskly."},{"id":"SE-56499-E02","start":851,"end":874,"span":"kastade honom på nacken","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He threw it onto his neck."},{"id":"SE-56499-E03","start":960,"end":993,"span":"han tyckte att haren blef så tung","modalities":["pressure","bodily sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"han tyckte att haren blef så tung","start_offset":960,"end_offset":993,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"unclear","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Tyckte may express felt appraisal rather than uncertainty.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He felt that the hare had become so heavy."},{"id":"SE-56499-E04","start":1017,"end":1187,"span":"såg han— såsom det visade för hans ögon — att haren var blefven ofantligt stor och så lång att han räckte ända tvers öfver åkern bort till hag-tunen som han klifvit öfver","modalities":["visual","spatial perception"],"groups":["vision","orientation"],"uncertainty":"unclear","uncertaintyType":"A","evidence":[{"span":"såsom det visade för hans ögon","start_offset":1026,"end_offset":1056,"occurrences":1,"type":"A","status":"unclear","confidence":"medium"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Perceptual qualification is explicit, but doubt is not unambiguous.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He saw the hare become enormous, stretching across the field to the fence."},{"id":"SE-56499-E05","start":1283,"end":1318,"span":"ett förfärligt gny och dån i skogen","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"A dreadful din and roar in the forest."},{"id":"SE-56499-E06","start":1499,"end":1526,"span":"Sonen blef en lång tid sjuk","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The son was ill for a long time."},{"id":"SE-56499-E07","start":1831,"end":1885,"span":"trollet ropade i skogen härmande:. »Packa dig af — —!»","modalities":["auditory"],"groups":["hearing"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sound production","note":"Explicit mimicking call in a separately attributed appended variant; earlier fragmentary repeated size/weight wording not counted again.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The troll called mockingly in the forest: “Be off!”"}],"context":{"place":"i skogen","time":"","movement":"vände sig om"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","hearing","orientation","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.208889,"lon":18.441111,"label":"Rone sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":57.2966,"lon":18.526648,"label":"Lye sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"},{"lat":57.504185,"lon":18.4603,"label":"Roma sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:57023","id":"57023","collection":"SE","title":"Bjär-smör","text":"Om Bjär-smör upptäckes i ett ko-stall, då äro korna skämda. För att upptäcka den som är orsaken till detta, samlar man bränsle af nio olika slags ved eller ris, lägger det på en kors-gata och Bjär-smöret derpå; och under förbränningen piskas Bjärsmöret med ris af nio olika sorters trädslag. Då kommer, fast alldeles mot sin vilja, den brottslige dit och uppdagas. — Dock bör den, som lidit skadan på sina kor, ej den dagen, då förbränningen sker, låna ut något; ty då misslyckas det. — Till förekommande af dylika förskämningar, brukar man ännu sätta tvenne stora enestörar på kors i Hus-dörren.\nJ. Wallin, Martebo. Bengt Närgren, på När. L. O. K. [m. blyerts].","category":"Tjuvmjölkande väsen","source":"Säve, P.A. 1959: Gotländska sägner. Uppsala (Svenska sagor och sägner 12.). s.223-224","place":"","events":[{"id":"SE-57023-E02","start":295,"end":350,"span":"kommer, fast alldeles mot sin vilja, den brottslige dit","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Forced displacement, not a reported felt quality.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The culprit comes there entirely against their will."}],"context":{"place":"i ett ko-stall","time":"","movement":"kommer, fast alldeles mot sin vilja"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[]},{"key":"SE:50682","id":"50682","collection":"SE","title":"Spöksvin","text":"Jag hörde en gammal gubbe tala om bassesvin och bassesuggor; det var någon sorts spökeri. Folk måste springa rätt över åkrarna för att rädda sej för dem, och när man hade kommit in och stängt dörren efter sej, då var bassesvinet efter och skrapade högt uppe på dörren med fötterna.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh03947 · 26 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 98","place":"Valinge sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50682-E01","start":239,"end":280,"span":"skrapade högt uppe på dörren med fötterna","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit bodily contact. Högt uppe describes height, not loudness; no auditory modality inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Scratched high up on the door with its feet."}],"context":{"place":"rätt över åkrarna","time":"","movement":"springa rätt över åkrarna"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":57.171665,"lon":12.382222,"label":"Valinge sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50986","id":"50986","collection":"SE","title":"Spöksvin","text":"Gloson mötte de, då de gick årsgång. Då skulle de ha en kaka bröd och kasta i gapet på henne.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04580 · 49 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1949: Hallandssägner. Göteborg. S. 99","place":"Breareds sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50986-E01","start":70,"end":92,"span":"kasta i gapet på henne","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Prescribed bodily contact, not evidence of taste.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Throw it into her mouth."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":"gick årsgång"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":56.724655,"lon":13.138185,"label":"Breareds sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54276","id":"54276","collection":"SE","title":"Spöksvin","text":"På den gamla kyrkogården här i socknen, i Seger-stadsbyn, brukade de få se en stor so om kvällar och nätter. En var det, som såg fullt med små grisar innanför staketet. Nu har jag inte hört talas om det på länge. Det skulle vara en spökso.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Segerstads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54276-E01","start":58,"end":107,"span":"brukade de få se en stor so om kvällar och nätter","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They used to see a large sow in the evenings and at night."},{"id":"SE-54276-E02","start":109,"end":168,"span":"En var det, som såg fullt med små grisar innanför staketet.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"One person saw many small pigs inside the fence."}],"context":{"place":"På den gamla kyrkogården","time":"om kvällar och nätter","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.356667,"lon":13.243333,"label":"Segerstads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55333","id":"55333","collection":"SE","title":"Ormar","text":"Den röe ormen rullade som ett hjul. Jag och Anders var på sjön och rodde. Då kom det rullande änna som ett hjul på vattnet. Anders tog en bräda, och när ormen kom på åran, slog han till och masa och slog. Ormen blev still. Han hade trissat på oss och huggit och bitit oss annars. Han var ring-slagen som ett hjul.\n","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.85","place":"Upphärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55333-E01","start":0,"end":35,"span":"Den röe ormen rullade som ett hjul.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The red snake rolled like a wheel."},{"id":"SE-55333-E02","start":172,"end":203,"span":"slog han till och masa och slog","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He struck and battered it."},{"id":"SE-55333-E03","start":251,"end":278,"span":"huggit och bitit oss annars","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit unrealised biting/contact; pain not inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Otherwise it would have struck and bitten us."}],"context":{"place":"på sjön","time":"","movement":"rodde"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.163891,"lon":12.291944,"label":"Upphärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:50723","id":"50723","collection":"SE","title":"Ormar","text":"Det fanns vita ormar. Det var en käring, som hade tagit en sådan orm. Hon lade den i grytan och skulle koka den. Medan ormen kokade, så skulle hon gå ut ett ärende. Hon sa till pojken, som var inne, att han inte skulle få lyfta på locket och se i grytan. Men när hon hade gått ut, så var pojken kvick att lyfta på locket och sticka fingret i grytan. Så slickade han av fingret för att känna, vad det smakade. När käringen kom in, sa pojken: \"Nu vet jag att kon får en vitrosig kalv\". Han hade blivit allvetande.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh05282 · 28 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1951: Dalslandssägner. Göteborg. S.117","place":"Örs sn","events":[{"id":"SE-50723-E01","start":10,"end":20,"span":"vita ormar","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"White snakes."},{"id":"SE-50723-E02","start":203,"end":253,"span":"han inte skulle få lyfta på locket och se i grytan","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Prohibition, not failed seeing or epistemic uncertainty.","confidence":"high","polarity":"unavailable perception","gloss":"He was not allowed to lift the lid and look into the pot."},{"id":"SE-50723-E03","start":325,"end":348,"span":"sticka fingret i grytan","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Contact action; no heat or pain inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Put his finger in the pot."},{"id":"SE-50723-E04","start":350,"end":408,"span":"Så slickade han av fingret för att känna, vad det smakade.","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"Realised tasting action, without an asserted taste quality.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He licked his finger to find out what it tasted like."}],"context":{"place":"i grytan","time":"när hon hade gått ut","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","taste","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.664722,"lon":12.340833,"label":"Örs sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:54098","id":"54098","collection":"SE","title":"Ormar","text":"Dä va två bröder i Gillberga, den ene ble mä tia prosten Göransson i Gillberga å den andre starke Bryngel i Svanhult. Disse bägge bröra skulle en gång köle e mile ve Gravdråga i Gillberga. Menna di söv där ve mila e natt, så drömde bägge två, att en vit orm kom frå skogen å rann över bena på döm. Ätter den natta ble den ene vis å den andre stark. Dä berättes att di geck frå mila, å den feck bränne ner te grunden, å dä ska än i dag syns ätter den kölbötten.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1948: Värmlandssägner. Göteborg. S.","place":"Gillberga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-54098-E01","start":225,"end":296,"span":"drömde bägge två, att en vit orm kom frå skogen å rann över bena på döm","modalities":["visual","touch"],"groups":["vision","body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Explicitly dream content. Dreaming is a state/context, not a modality; no waking observation claimed.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Both dreamed that a white snake came from the forest and passed over their legs."},{"id":"SE-54098-E02","start":419,"end":459,"span":"dä ska än i dag syns ätter den kölbötten","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Reported visible trace, without an actual checking episode.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Traces of that charcoal platform are said to remain visible today."}],"context":{"place":"ve mila","time":"e natt","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":59.321457,"lon":12.77825,"label":"Gillberga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:55332","id":"55332","collection":"SE","title":"Ormar","text":"Hjulormen, den trissade efter folk i största hast. Han kan aldrig svänga på sej utan att han har lagt sej först. Han är stor som ett skjuvkärrehjul. Det var en karl, som hjulormen satte efter. Karlen slängde sej te sies just som hjulormen skulle till att bita. Ormen lade sej och trissade efter honom igen. Men till slut blev han uttröttad.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1944: Västgötasägner. Göteborg. S.84-85","place":"Upphärads sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55332-E01","start":113,"end":148,"span":"Han är stor som ett skjuvkärrehjul.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It is as large as a wheelbarrow wheel."},{"id":"SE-55332-E02","start":233,"end":259,"span":"ormen skulle till att bita","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Imminent contact; completion is not stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The snake was about to bite."},{"id":"SE-55332-E03","start":307,"end":340,"span":"Men till slut blev han uttröttad.","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Pronoun may refer to man or snake; do not resolve silently.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"But in the end he/it became exhausted."}],"context":{"place":"","time":"","movement":"trissade efter honom igen"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.163891,"lon":12.291944,"label":"Upphärads sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:1435","id":"1435","collection":"SE","title":"Ormar, drakar och fiskar","text":"Det fanns vit orm. Men den var så sällsynt. Det var en gumma på ett ställe som fick se en vit orm. Hon hade en bytta med sig, och då tog hon ormen och stoppade i byttan och tog den med sig hem. Så satte hon på grytan och lade ormen i den och kokade den. Medan hon hade ett ärende ut så pass pojken på att smaka på spadet. När hon kom in så sade han: ”Kon skall kalva en vitrosig kalv, det har jag sett”. Efter den dagen såg han mer än andra.\n\nI bergen fanns det stora ormar förr. Di låg och sov över stora stenar. Det var ”rå orm”. Vanlig huggorm har det funnits gott om. Det var en gubb från Viggen som stämd möt med ormen. Gubben bad ormen att han skulle möta honom på samma ställe som de möttes första gången, så skulle di ha tvekamp där. När gubben kom dit så var ormen där. Men då hade han en större orm med sig. Gubben höll på att inte kun klar sä, men till slut fick han slag på den stora ormen och sedan så var han herre över den mindre. Men den stora ormen slog till gubben på kinden med snarten så att det blev ett blått märke. Det fick han ha i all tid.\n\nOrmen kröp ihop i en hög. Ormen hade ”ting” då. Jag vet inte vad det skulle betyda, men gamla påstod att det blev en sten där ormarna låg. Den stenen skulle en passa på att ta. Om en hade den stenen i fickan, så kunde ingen lista över en med lögn.\n","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh04077 · 3536","place":"Södra Finnskoga sn","events":[{"id":"SE-1435-E01","start":79,"end":97,"span":"fick se en vit orm","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Caught sight of a white snake."},{"id":"SE-1435-E02","start":305,"end":320,"span":"smaka på spadet","modalities":["taste"],"groups":["taste"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Taste the broth."},{"id":"SE-1435-E05","start":462,"end":473,"span":"stora ormar","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Large snakes."},{"id":"SE-1435-E06","start":869,"end":901,"span":"fick han slag på den stora ormen","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He managed to strike the large snake."},{"id":"SE-1435-E07","start":950,"end":1036,"span":"den stora ormen slog till gubben på kinden med snarten så att det blev ett blått märke","modalities":["touch","visual"],"groups":["body","vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Explicit contact and visible mark; no pain inferred.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The large snake struck his cheek with its tail, leaving a blue mark."}],"context":{"place":"I bergen","time":"Efter den dagen","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","taste","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":60.701351,"lon":12.576717,"label":"Södra Finnskoga sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]},{"key":"SE:51035","id":"51035","collection":"SE","title":"Fiskar","text":"En gång voro två fiskare ute och drog svirvel. De fick ett väldigt napp. Dessa såg snart, att det var sjöråa, som nappat. De rodde i land och tänkte, att sjöråa inte kunde göra dem något ont. Så drog de i svirvelreven och fann att sjöråa fortfarande satt fast. När de så äntligen fick upp henne på land, fick de se, vad det var. Det var en mycket stor gädda. Denna hade en örn en gång försökt ta. Han hade slagit sina klor i gäddan, men denna var för stor och tung och följden blev den, att gäddan drog örnen under vattnet. Örnen kunde inte släppa sitt tag, och så drunknade han. Nu fanns bara skelettet kvar utav örnen, och det var detta, som man trodde var sjöråas hår, vilket drog sig på ryggen, då gäddan simmade.\n","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Institutet för språk och folkminnen, Göteborg (DAG) · ifgh00877 · 67 · Carl-Martin Bergstrand 1951: Dalslandssägner. Göteborg. S.118","place":"Strömstads stad","events":[{"id":"SE-51035-E01","start":47,"end":72,"span":"De fick ett väldigt napp.","modalities":["pressure","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Load transmitted by fishing tackle, not an explicit felt descriptor.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They got a powerful bite on the line."},{"id":"SE-51035-E02","start":73,"end":121,"span":"Dessa såg snart, att det var sjöråa, som nappat.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"fick de se, vad det var. Det var en mycket stor gädda.","start_offset":304,"end_offset":358,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They soon saw that it was the lake-being that had taken the bait."},{"id":"SE-51035-E03","start":304,"end":358,"span":"fick de se, vad det var. Det var en mycket stor gädda.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"det var detta, som man trodde var sjöråas hår","start_offset":625,"end_offset":670,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Revision of the initial identification; the final explanation identifies the supposed hair as an eagle skeleton.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They saw what it was: a very large pike."},{"id":"SE-51035-E04","start":397,"end":431,"span":"Han hade slagit sina klor i gäddan","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Reconstructed earlier contact in the narrative explanation, not the fishermen’s observation.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It had sunk its claws into the pike."},{"id":"SE-51035-E05","start":491,"end":522,"span":"gäddan drog örnen under vattnet","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Reconstructed forced displacement; felt movement not stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The pike pulled the eagle underwater."}],"context":{"place":"under vattnet","time":"","movement":"De rodde i land"},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"Once two fishermen were out trolling with a fishing line. They got a massive bite. They soon saw that it was the water spirit [sjöråa] that had bitten. They rowed ashore thinking that the water spirit could not do them any harm. Then they pulled on the fishing line and found that the water spirit was still stuck. When they finally got her up on land, they got to see what it was. It was a very large pike. An eagle had once tried to take this [pike]. It had struck its talons into the pike, but this one was too big and heavy and the consequence was that the pike dragged the eagle under water. The eagle could not let go of its grip, and so it drowned.\n\nNow only the skeleton of the eagle remained, and it was this that people believed was the water spirit's hair, which trailed along its back when the pike swam.","translationNotes":["'Svirvel' is rendered as trolling with a fishing line, not a net. The original landing and subsequent identification as a pike are preserved. 'Sjöråa' remains the fishermen's initial identification; no broken line is added.","\"Sjöråa\" is the female water spirit."],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.931843,"lon":11.166631,"label":"Strömstads stad","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}],"translationEvents":[{"id":"SE-51035-E01","start":58,"end":82,"span":"They got a massive bite.","modalities":["pressure","touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Load transmitted by fishing tackle, not an explicit felt descriptor.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They got a powerful bite on the line.","originalSpan":"De fick ett väldigt napp.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-51035-E02","start":83,"end":151,"span":"They soon saw that it was the water spirit [sjöråa] that had bitten.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"fick de se, vad det var. Det var en mycket stor gädda.","start_offset":304,"end_offset":358,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They soon saw that it was the lake-being that had taken the bait.","originalSpan":"Dessa såg snart, att det var sjöråa, som nappat.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-51035-E03","start":353,"end":407,"span":"they got to see what it was. It was a very large pike.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"yes","uncertaintyType":"C","evidence":[{"span":"det var detta, som man trodde var sjöråas hår","start_offset":625,"end_offset":670,"occurrences":1,"type":"C","status":"yes","confidence":"high"}],"kind":"perception","note":"Revision of the initial identification; the final explanation identifies the supposed hair as an eagle skeleton.","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"They saw what it was: a very large pike.","originalSpan":"fick de se, vad det var. Det var en mycket stor gädda.","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-51035-E04","start":453,"end":491,"span":"It had struck its talons into the pike","modalities":["touch"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Reconstructed earlier contact in the narrative explanation, not the fishermen’s observation.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"It had sunk its claws into the pike.","originalSpan":"Han hade slagit sina klor i gäddan","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"},{"id":"SE-51035-E05","start":557,"end":595,"span":"the pike dragged the eagle under water","modalities":["movement sensation"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"physical exposure / action","note":"Reconstructed forced displacement; felt movement not stated.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"The pike pulled the eagle underwater.","originalSpan":"gäddan drog örnen under vattnet","alignment":"phrase-aligned to existing source event"}]},{"key":"SE:55431","id":"55431","collection":"SE","title":"Om skator och ormar som sjukdomsspridare","text":"Och så har vi skatorna. De är ena hämndgiriga djur, när de vänder den sidan till. Det sägs att de kan fånga en huggorm och släppa in 'en i lagårn hos den som förstör deras bon. Mor fick en gång se Karl Daniel i Forsa, när han tog ner skatbon. — Har du inte flera kor än du behöver, frågade hon? -- Du bara pratar ditt skrock, svarade Karl Daniel. — Du får väl se, sa mor. Så gick två månader eller så omkring. Och vad hände? Jo, två kor dog hos Karl Daniel. En granne talade om, att han hade sett en skata komma flygande med en orm i näbben. Den släppte skatan ner i Karl Daniels lagård. Det var sista gången jag hörde talas om att en huggorm gjorde skada på kor. Från Östgötaslätten har jag aldrig hört något liknande. Men kring Medevi och uppåt Närke hörde jag ofta, att ormarna hade ställt till med sjukdom hos djur.","category":"Övernaturliga djur","source":"Elis Åström 1962: Folktro och folkliv i Östergötland. Uppsala. s.94","place":"Hammars sn","events":[{"id":"SE-55431-E01","start":177,"end":242,"span":"Mor fick en gång se Karl Daniel i Forsa, när han tog ner skatbon.","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Mother once saw Karl Daniel taking down magpie nests."},{"id":"SE-55431-E03","start":483,"end":540,"span":"han hade sett en skata komma flygande med en orm i näbben","modalities":["visual"],"groups":["vision"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"perception","note":"","confidence":"high","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"He had seen a magpie flying with a snake in its beak."},{"id":"SE-55431-E04","start":802,"end":818,"span":"sjukdom hos djur","modalities":["bodily state"],"groups":["body"],"uncertainty":"no","uncertaintyType":"","evidence":[],"kind":"sensory description","note":"Reported generic bodily state; hearing about it is excluded as transmission.","confidence":"medium","polarity":"positive perception","gloss":"Illness among animals."}],"context":{"place":"i Karl Daniels lagård","time":"Så gick två månader eller så omkring.","movement":""},"annotationNote":"","groups":["body","vision"],"translation":"","translationNotes":[],"review":false,"locations":[{"lat":58.819168,"lon":14.960833,"label":"Hammars sn","precision":"source place","provenance":"Sagenkartan place metadata; place_collected"}]}],"version":"2026-10-01","counts":{"collections":4,"narratives":600,"translated":24,"events":1228}};
